msgctxt "textdb:descript/backgrounds.txt:air elementalist"
msgid ""
"Air Elementalists have learned the Shock spell. Their electrical magic can harm\n"
"groups of foes, while their air spells assist in fighting or fleeing enemies.\n"
msgstr "气元素使已经学会电击术。他们的电系魔法能伤害成群的敌人，气系法术则能帮助战斗或逃脱。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/backgrounds.txt:conjurer"
msgid ""
"Conjurers begin with the Magic Dart spell, and can learn other non-elemental\n"
"spells to reliably blast their foes.\n"
msgstr "塑能师起始掌握魔法飞弹，还能学习其他非元素法术，可靠地轰击敌人。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/backgrounds.txt:earth elementalist"
msgid ""
"Earth Elementalists know the Sandblast spell, and can later learn more earthen\n"
"spells suitable for subtle stabbing or brute-force blasting.\n"
msgstr "土元素使掌握沙爆术，以后还能学习更多土系法术，既可巧妙刺杀，也可强行轰击。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/backgrounds.txt:fire elementalist"
msgid ""
"Fire Elementalists have learned the Foxfire spell. Their other starting spells\n"
"are likewise focused on fiery and explosive destruction.\n"
msgstr "火元素使已经学会狐火术。他们起始的其他法术同样侧重火焰与爆炸造成的毁灭。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/backgrounds.txt:ice elementalist"
msgid ""
"Ice Elementalists begin with the Freeze spell. Their later spells provide strong\n"
"offence and defence, but may restrict their movement.\n"
msgstr "冰元素使起始掌握冰冻术。后续法术攻防兼备，但可能限制自身移动。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/backgrounds.txt:necromancer"
msgid ""
"Necromancers start out with the Soul Splinter spell. Eventually, they can turn\n"
"the dead into allies and use the life force of the living to restore themselves.\n"
msgstr "死灵法师起始掌握灵魂碎裂。最终，他们能够将死者变为盟友，并汲取生者的生命力恢复自身。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/backgrounds.txt:reaver"
msgid ""
"Reavers start with a weapon of their choice and deadly magic to supplement it\n"
"when in need. They start with the Kiss of Death spell.\n"
msgstr "掠夺者起始携带自选武器，并能在需要时用致命魔法辅助作战。他们起始掌握死亡之吻。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/backgrounds.txt:summoner"
msgid ""
"Summoners are able to cast Summon Small Mammal from the start, and begin with\n"
"spells to summon stronger and more exotic allies in their library.\n"
msgstr "召唤师一开始就能施放召唤小型哺乳动物，法术库中还有召唤更强大、更奇异盟友的法术。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/backgrounds.txt:alchemist"
msgid ""
"Alchemists start with the Poisonous Vapours spell, and their magic is very\n"
"effective against foes susceptible to poison.\n"
msgstr "炼金术士起始掌握毒气术，其魔法对易受毒素影响的敌人十分有效。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/backgrounds.txt:artificer"
msgid ""
"Artificers start with a few magic wands and a club. They'll need to find better\n"
"weapons and armour before their wands run out.\n"
msgstr "修补匠起始携带几根魔杖和一根棍棒。他们需要在魔杖耗尽之前找到更好的武器和防具。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/backgrounds.txt:cinder acolyte"
msgid ""
"Cinder Acolytes worship Ignis, drawing upon the flame of a dying god until\n"
"there is nothing left. They have both melee and fire magic capabilities.\n"
msgstr "余烬侍僧信奉伊格尼斯，不断汲取这位垂死神祇的火焰，直至其燃烧殆尽。他们兼具近战和火系魔法能力。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/backgrounds.txt:delver"
msgid ""
"Delvers start their quest five levels below the surface. A set of powerful magic\n"
"items helps them survive the dangerous journey upward.\n"
msgstr "探地者从地表下五层开始冒险。一套强力魔法物品能帮助他们在向上的危险旅途中生存。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/backgrounds.txt:hunter"
msgid "Hunters carry a shortbow, light armour and a scroll of butterflies.\n"
msgstr "猎手携带短弓、轻甲和蝴蝶卷轴。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/backgrounds.txt:hexslinger"
msgid ""
"Hexslingers carry a sling, and use hex magic to make their foes more vulnerable\n"
"to attacks from afar.\n"
msgstr "妖术射手携带投石索，利用妖术让敌人更容易受到远程攻击的伤害。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/backgrounds.txt:forgewright"
msgid ""
"Forgewrights are mages who specialise in the creation of turrets and mechanical\n"
"companions to fight alongside.\n"
msgstr "锻造师是专精于创造炮台和机械伙伴的法师，能让这些造物与自己并肩作战。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/backgrounds.txt:wanderer"
msgid "Wanderers start with random equipment and skills.\n"
msgstr "漫游者以随机的装备和技能开始冒险。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:database/help.txt:skill-menu"
msgid ""
"                        <h>Skill management</h>\n"
"\n"
"You gain experience for killing monsters (and very few other activities). This\n"
"experience is used to train skills. The skill screen allows you to select which\n"
"skills to train.\n"
"\n"
"By pressing its letter, you can cycle if and how a skill is trained:\n"
"  <darkgrey>- deselected</darkgrey>    Skill will not be trained.\n"
"  + selected      Skill will be trained.\n"
"  <w>* focused</w>       Skill will be weighted higher for training.\n"
"\n"
"Pressing a capital letter selects that skill and deselects all the others.\n"
"This shortcut is useful when you want to train only one skill.\n"
"\n"
"Training can be done in two modes, which are toggled with the <w>/</w> key.\n"
"  - automatic:    Skills are weighted based on your use of them.\n"
"  - manual:       Experience is spread evenly across all activated skills.\n"
"\n"
"In training target mode you can set skill training targets: target skill levels\n"
"at which training of the skill will be automatically disabled.\n"
"\n"
"How fast you train a skill is governed by the following factors:\n"
"  - aptitude: Shown <white>white</white> in the Apt column. Higher numbers mean that less\n"
"              experience is needed to advance a skill. Depends on species.\n"
"  - skill manuals: Rare books giving an aptitude bonus of <lightred>+4</lightred> in one skill.\n"
"\n"
"On top of that, there are some effects which directly modify a skill, for\n"
"example having trained a related skill (crosstraining), or certain god powers.\n"
"Reduced skills are shown in <magenta>magenta</magenta>, and enhanced skills in <green>green</green>.\n"
"The training percentage (in <brown>brown</brown>) shows the relative amount of experience\n"
"which will be used to train this skill.\n"
"\n"
"Apart from (de)selecting skills, you also have the following toggles:\n"
"  <w>/</w> :  Switch between automatic and manual training modes.\n"
"  <w>*</w> :  Display all skills, even those which aren't currently useful.\n"
"  <w>?</w> :  Allows you to read the descriptions of skills.\n"
"  <w>_</w> :  Show or hide skill level modifications (god powers, crosstraining).\n"
"  <w>!</w> :  Switch between displaying training percentage, skill cost, or training\n"
"       targets.\n"
msgstr ""
"                        <h>技能管理</h>\n"
"\n"
"击杀怪物（以及极少数其他活动）会获得经验，用于训练技能。\n"
"技能界面允许你选择要训练哪些技能。\n"
"\n"
"按技能对应的字母，可循环切换是否训练及训练方式：\n"
"  <darkgrey>- 未选择</darkgrey>    不训练该技能。\n"
"  + 已选择        训练该技能。\n"
"  <w>* 专注</w>          训练时该技能的权重更高。\n"
"\n"
"按大写字母会选择该技能，并取消其他所有技能的训练。\n"
"只想训练一项技能时，这个快捷方式很有用。\n"
"\n"
"训练分为两种模式，按 <w>/</w> 键切换：\n"
"  - 自动：技能权重取决于你的实际使用情况。\n"
"  - 手动：经验平均分配给所有已开启训练的技能。\n"
"\n"
"在训练目标模式下，你可以设置目标技能等级；达到目标后会自动停止训练该技能。\n"
"\n"
"技能训练速度取决于以下因素：\n"
"  - 天资：在天资栏以<white>白色</white>显示。数值越高，提升技能所需的经验越少，取决于种族。\n"
"  - 技能手册：稀有书籍，能为一项技能提供 <lightred>+4</lightred> 天资加成。\n"
"\n"
"此外，有些效果会直接改变技能等级，例如训练相关技能带来的交叉训练，或某些神赐能力。\n"
"被削弱的技能以<magenta>品红色</magenta>显示，被增强的技能以<green>绿色</green>显示。\n"
"训练百分比（<brown>棕色</brown>）表示分配给该技能的相对经验份额。\n"
"\n"
"除选择或取消技能外，还可以切换以下选项：\n"
"  <w>/</w>：在自动和手动训练模式之间切换。\n"
"  <w>*</w>：显示所有技能，包括当前无用的技能。\n"
"  <w>?</w>：阅读技能说明。\n"
"  <w>_</w>：显示或隐藏技能等级修正（神赐能力、交叉训练）。\n"
"  <w>!</w>：在训练百分比、技能消耗和训练目标之间切换。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:dexterity (dex+3) armour ego"
msgid "It increases your dexterity (Dex +3).\n"
msgstr "它提高你的敏捷（敏捷+3）。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:intelligence (int+3) armour ego"
msgid "It increases your intelligence (Int +3).\n"
msgstr "它提高你的智力（智力+3）。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:protection (ac+3) armour ego"
msgid "It protects you from most sources of damage (AC +3).\n"
msgstr "它保护你抵御大多数来源的伤害（护甲值+3）。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:protection (protect) weapon ego"
msgid "It grants you temporary protection after it strikes (+7 AC).\n"
msgstr "它击中目标后会暂时保护你（护甲值 +7）。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:rebuke (rebuke) weapon ego"
msgid ""
"It shields the wearer if their last action was a melee attack (+10 SH) and\n"
"redirects blocked melee attacks to other nearby enemies.\n"
msgstr "若穿戴者上一个动作是近战攻击，它会提供防护（格挡值 +10），并将格挡住的近战攻击转向附近其他敌人。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:repulsion (repulsion) armour ego"
msgid "It helps you evade both magical and non-magical projectiles (EV +15).\n"
msgstr "它帮助你躲避魔法和非魔法投射物（闪避值+15）。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:strength (str+3) armour ego"
msgid "It increases your strength (Str +3).\n"
msgstr "它提高你的力量（力量+3）。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/quotes.txt:staff"
msgid ""
"“Bashō Osho said to his disciples, ‘If you have a staff, I will give you a\n"
" staff. If you have no staff, I will take it from you.’\n"
"\n"
" Mumon's Comment\n"
"\n"
" It helps me wade across a river when the bridge is down. It accompanies me to\n"
" the village on a moonless night. If you call it a staff, you will enter hell\n"
" like an arrow.”\n"
"    -Mumon Ekai, _The Gateless Gate_, case 44. 1228.\n"
"     trans. Katsuki Sekida\n"
msgstr ""
"芭蕉和尚示众云：“尔有拄杖子，我与尔拄杖子；尔无拄杖子，我夺尔拄杖子。”\n"
"\n"
"无门曰：“扶过断桥水，伴归无月村。若唤作拄杖，入地狱如箭。”\n"
"    -无门慧开，《无门关》第四十四则“芭蕉拄杖”。1228年。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/quotes.txt:triple crossbow"
msgid ""
"“Energy may be likened to the bending of a crossbow;\n"
" decision, to the releasing of a trigger.”\n"
"    -Sun Tzu\n"
msgstr ""
"“势如彍弩，节如发机。”\n"
"    -孙武，《孙子兵法·兵势》\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/quotes.txt:__cap-d_suffix"
msgid ""
"“On the other hand, Confucius is made to say to his disciples, ‘I know how\n"
" birds can fly, how fishes can swim, and how animals can run. But the runner\n"
" may be snared, the swimmer may be hooked, and the flyer may be shot by the\n"
" arrow. But there is the dragon. I cannot tell how he mounts on the wind\n"
" through the clouds, and rises to heaven. Today I have seen Lao-tsze, and can\n"
" only compare him to the dragon.’”\n"
"    -Life of Confucius\n"
"\n"
"“This Dragon had Two furious Wings\n"
"   Each one upon each Shoulder;\n"
" With a Sting in his Tail as long as a Flail,\n"
"   Which made him bolder and bolder.\n"
" He had long Claws, and in his Jaws\n"
"   Four and forty Teeth of Iron;\n"
" With a Hide as tough, as any Buff,\n"
"   Which did him round environ.”\n"
"\n"
"    -“An Excellent Ballad of a most dreadful Combat, fought between Moore of\n"
"Moore-Hall, and the Dragon of Wantley”, retold by Ambrose Philips, _A\n"
"Collection of Old Ballads. Corrected from the Best and Most Ancient Copies\n"
"Extant. With Introductions Historical, Critical, Or Humorous_. 1723.\n"
msgstr ""
"孔子去，谓弟子曰：“鸟，吾知其能飞；鱼，吾知其能游；兽，吾知其能走。走者可以为罔，游者可以为纶，飞者可以为矰。至于龙，吾不能知其乘风云而上天。吾今日见老子，其犹龙邪！”\n"
"    -司马迁，《史记·老子韩非列传》\n"
"\n"
"“这龙有两只凶猛翅膀，\n"
"一肩一只。\n"
"尾刺长得像连枷，\n"
"令它愈加大胆。\n"
"爪长，口中有\n"
"四十四颗铁牙，\n"
"坚韧如厚皮的外皮，\n"
"围护全身。”\n"
"    -“An Excellent Ballad of a most dreadful Combat, fought between Moore of\n"
"Moore-Hall, and the Dragon of Wantley”, retold by Ambrose Philips, _A\n"
"Collection of Old Ballads. Corrected from the Best and Most Ancient Copies\n"
"Extant. With Introductions Historical, Critical, Or Humorous_. 1723.\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:acid (acid) weapon ego"
msgid "It splashes victims with acid (2d4 damage, Corrosion).\n"
msgstr "它向受击者泼洒强酸（2d4 伤害，并造成腐蚀）。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:antimagic (antimagic) weapon ego"
msgid ""
"It reduces your magical energy, and disrupts the spells and magical abilities of\n"
"those it strikes. Natural abilities and divine invocations are not affected.\n"
msgstr "它会减少你的魔力，并干扰受击者的法术和魔法能力。天生能力与神祇祈祷不受影响。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:chaos (chaos) weapon ego"
msgid "Each hit from it has a different, random effect.\n"
msgstr "每次命中都会产生一种随机效果。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:concussion (concuss) weapon ego"
msgid ""
"It pushes those it hits backwards, briefly stunning them in the process. If it\n"
"pushes them into a solid feature, they will instead take an additional one-third\n"
"of any damage that pierces their armour.\n"
msgstr "它会将受击者击退，并使其短暂眩晕。若将其推向坚实地形，则改为额外造成穿透护甲伤害的三分之一。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:distortion (distort) weapon ego"
msgid ""
"It warps and distorts space around it, and may blink, banish, or inflict extra\n"
"damage upon those it strikes. Unwielding it can teleport you to foes or banish\n"
"you to the Abyss.\n"
msgstr "它扭曲周围空间，可能使受击者闪烁、遭到放逐或受到额外伤害。卸下它可能会将你传送到敌人身旁，或放逐到深渊。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:devious (devious) weapon ego"
msgid ""
"It has an increased chance to perform stab attacks against vulnerable targets,\n"
"and temporarily increases the wielder's EV and slaying each time they do so.\n"
msgstr "它更容易对脆弱的目标实施刺杀，每次刺杀还会暂时提高持用者的闪避值和杀戮加成。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:draining (drain) weapon ego"
msgid ""
"It sometimes drains living victims (1/2 chance). This deals an additional\n"
"one-quarter of any damage that pierces defenders' armour as well as a flat 2-4\n"
"damage, and also weakens them slightly.\n"
msgstr "它有时会吸取活物的生命力（1/2 几率），额外造成穿透护甲伤害的四分之一，再加上固定的 2–4 点伤害，并略微削弱目标。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:electrocution (elec) weapon ego"
msgid "It sometimes electrocutes victims (1/4 chance, 8-20 damage).\n"
msgstr "它有时会电击受击者（1/4 几率，8–20 点伤害）。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:entangling (entangle) weapon ego"
msgid "It sometimes constricts those it attacks with vines. (1/2 chance, 2-4 damage).\n"
msgstr "它有时会用藤蔓缠绕攻击的目标（1/2 几率，2–4 点伤害）。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:flaming (flame) weapon ego"
msgid ""
"It burns victims, dealing an additional one-quarter of any damage that pierces\n"
"defenders' armour.\n"
msgstr "它灼烧受击者，额外造成穿透护甲伤害的四分之一。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:flaming (flame) weapon ego blade"
msgid ""
"It burns victims, dealing an additional one-quarter of any damage that pierces\n"
"defenders' armour. Big, fiery blades are also staple armaments of hydra-hunters.\n"
msgstr "它灼烧受击者，额外造成穿透护甲伤害的四分之一。巨大的烈焰刀剑也是海德拉猎手的常备武器。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:freezing (freeze) weapon ego"
msgid ""
"It freezes victims, dealing an additional one-quarter of any damage that pierces\n"
"defenders' armour. It may also slow down cold-blooded creatures.\n"
msgstr "它冻伤受击者，额外造成穿透护甲伤害的四分之一，还可能减缓冷血生物的速度。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:foul flame (foul flame) weapon ego"
msgid ""
"It has been infused with foul flame, dealing an additional three-quarters damage\n"
"to holy beings, an additional one-quarter damage to undead and demons, and an\n"
"additional half damage to all others, so long as it pierces armour. Holy beings\n"
"and good god worshippers cannot use this.\n"
msgstr "它灌注了污秽烈焰。攻击穿透护甲后，对神圣生物额外造成四分之三伤害，对亡灵和恶魔额外造成四分之一伤害，对其他目标额外造成一半伤害。神圣生物和善神信徒无法使用它。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:heavy (heavy) weapon ego"
msgid "It deals dramatically more damage, but attacks with it are much slower.\n"
msgstr "它造成的伤害大幅提高，但攻击速度也慢得多。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:heavy (heavy) weapon ego ranged"
msgid ""
"Any ammunition fired from it deals dramatically more damage, but attacks with\n"
"it are much slower.\n"
msgstr "它发射的弹药造成的伤害大幅提高，但攻击速度也慢得多。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:holy wrath (holy) weapon ego"
msgid ""
"It has been blessed by the Shining One, dealing an additional three-quarters of\n"
"any damage that pierces undead and demons' armour. Undead and demons cannot use\n"
"this.\n"
msgstr "它受到了光明神的祝福，对亡灵和恶魔额外造成穿透护甲伤害的四分之三。亡灵和恶魔无法使用它。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:pain (pain) weapon ego"
msgid ""
"It inflicts extra damage on living creatures proportional to your Necromancy\n"
"skill.{{\n"
"    if you.god() == \"Trog\" then\n"
"        return \" Trog prevents you from unleashing this effect.\";\n"
"    end\n"
"}}{{\n"
"    if you.is_useless_skill(\"necromancy\") then\n"
"        return \" Your inability to study Necromancy prevents you from drawing on the full power of this weapon.\";\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"
msgstr ""
"它对活物造成的额外伤害与你的死灵系魔法技能成正比。{{\n"
"    if you.god() == \"Trog\" then\n"
"        return \" 特洛戈不允许你释放此效果。\";\n"
"    end\n"
"}}{{\n"
"    if you.is_useless_skill(\"necromancy\") then\n"
"        return \" 你无法学习死灵系魔法，因此不能发挥这件武器的全部威力。\";\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:penetration (penet) weapon ego"
msgid ""
"Any ammunition fired by it continues flying after striking targets, potentially\n"
"hitting everything in its path until it leaves sight.\n"
msgstr "它发射的弹药击中目标后仍会继续飞行，可能击中路径上的所有目标，直到飞出视野。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:reaping (reap) weapon ego"
msgid ""
"Any living, holy, or demonic foe damaged by it may be temporarily reanimated\n"
"upon death as a friendly spectral, with an increasing chance as more damage is\n"
"dealt.\n"
msgstr "受到它伤害的活物、神圣生物或恶魔，死亡时可能暂时化为友善的幽魂。受到它造成的伤害越多，转化几率越高。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:spectralising (spect) weapon ego"
msgid ""
"When you attack with it, this weapon's spirit leaps out and launches a second,\n"
"slightly weaker strike. The spirit shares part of any damage it takes with you.\n"
msgstr "你用它攻击时，武器之灵会跃出，追加一次稍弱的攻击。武器之灵受到的部分伤害会由你承担。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:speed (speed) weapon ego"
msgid "Attacks with it are significantly faster.\n"
msgstr "使用它攻击要快得多。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:sundering (sunder) weapon ego"
msgid ""
"After you perform multiple consecutive attacks, its next attack will deal\n"
"greatly increased damage and also cleave into targets an extra space away.\n"
msgstr "连续攻击多次后，它的下一次攻击伤害会大幅提高，并能劈砍到额外一格距离的目标。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:valour (valour) weapon ego"
msgid ""
"It fires a beam of energy whenever it strikes an enemy while its wielder has\n"
"no less than 80% of their maximum hit points remaining. Unwielding it will\n"
"briefly Weaken its wielder.\n"
msgstr "持用者的剩余生命不低于最大生命的 80% 时，它每次击中敌人都会射出一道能量束。卸下它会使持用者短暂虚弱。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:vampirism (vamp) weapon ego"
msgid ""
"It occasionally heals you for a portion of the damage dealt when it wounds a\n"
"living creature.\n"
msgstr "它伤及活物时，偶尔会将部分伤害转化为对你的治疗。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:venom (venom) weapon ego"
msgid "It poisons victims.\n"
msgstr "它会使受击者中毒。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:air (air) armour ego"
msgid "It enhances your Air magic.\n"
msgstr "它增强你的气系魔法。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:archery (archery) armour ego"
msgid "It has half the normal encumbrance for the purpose of ranged combat.\n"
msgstr "进行远程战斗时，它的负重惩罚只有通常的一半。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:attunement (attunement) armour ego"
msgid ""
"When worn alongside a magical staff, it doubles the effectiveness of that\n"
"staff's primary enhancer and causes melee attacks made with it to restore a\n"
"small amount of MP.\n"
msgstr "同时装备魔法棍杖时，它会使棍杖的主要法术增强效果翻倍，并让使用该棍杖的近战攻击恢复少量魔力。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:cold resistance (rc+) armour ego"
msgid "It protects you from cold.\n"
msgstr "它保护你免受寒冷侵袭。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:command (command) armour ego"
msgid ""
"It improves the power and success of your Summoning spells in proportion to your\n"
"Armour skill.\n"
msgstr "它依照你的防具技能，提高召唤系法术的强度和成功率。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:corrosion resistance (rcorr) armour ego"
msgid "It protects you from the effects of acid and corrosion.\n"
msgstr "它保护你抵御强酸和腐蚀的效果。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:death (death) armour ego"
msgid ""
"It empowers your Necromancy spells and improves their success rate, but imposes\n"
"a health cost for other magic.\n"
msgstr "它增强死灵系法术并提高其成功率，但会让其他魔法额外消耗生命。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:earth (earth) armour ego"
msgid "It enhances your Earth magic.\n"
msgstr "它增强你的土系魔法。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:energy (energy) armour ego"
msgid ""
"It may return the magic spent to cast spells, but lowers their success rate. It\n"
"always returns the magic spent on miscasts. The spell refund chance is increased\n"
"by your Evocations skill.\n"
msgstr "它可能返还施法消耗的魔力，但会降低施法成功率。施法失败时总会返还魔力。成功施法后的返还几率随你的唤发技能提高。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:fire (fire) armour ego"
msgid "It enhances your Fire magic.\n"
msgstr "它增强你的火系魔法。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:fire resistance (rf+) armour ego"
msgid "It protects you from fire.\n"
msgstr "它保护你免受火焰侵袭。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:flying (fly) armour ego"
msgid "It grants you flight.\n"
msgstr "它使你能够飞行。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:glass (glass) armour ego"
msgid ""
"It may vitrify enemies when you injure them, making them more vulnerable to\n"
"further damage. Your Evocations skill increases the likelihood and duration of\n"
"vitrification.\n"
msgstr "你伤及敌人时，它可能使敌人玻璃化，更容易受到后续伤害。唤发技能提高玻璃化的几率和持续时间。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:guile (guile) armour ego"
msgid ""
"It weakens both your willpower and the willpower of everyone you hex, the latter\n"
"of which is increased by your Evocations skill.\n"
msgstr "它削弱你的意志，也削弱所有被你施加妖术的目标的意志。对目标的削弱程度随你的唤发技能提高。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:harm (harm) armour ego"
msgid "It increases damage dealt and taken.\n"
msgstr "它提高你造成和受到的伤害。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:hurling (hurl) armour ego"
msgid ""
"It improves your accuracy and damage with thrown weapons, such as rocks and\n"
"javelins (Slay +4).\n"
msgstr "它提高你投掷石块、标枪等武器时的命中与伤害（杀戮+4）。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:ice (ice) armour ego"
msgid "It enhances your Ice magic.\n"
msgstr "它增强你的冰系魔法。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:infusion (infuse) armour ego"
msgid "It empowers each of your melee hits with a small part of your magic.\n"
msgstr "它用你的一小部分魔力增强每次近战命中。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:invisibility (+inv) armour ego"
msgid ""
"When activated, it grants you temporary invisibility, but also drains your\n"
"maximum health.\n"
msgstr "发动后，它会暂时使你隐形，但也会吸取你的最大生命。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:light (light) armour ego"
msgid ""
"It surrounds you with a glowing halo, revealing invisible creatures, increasing\n"
"accuracy against all within it other than you, and reducing your stealth.\n"
msgstr "它让你周围笼罩光环，显露隐形生物，提高对光环内除你以外所有目标的攻击命中率，并降低你的潜行能力。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:mayhem (mayhem) armour ego"
msgid ""
"It causes witnesses of your kills to go into a frenzy, attacking everything\n"
"nearby with great strength and speed.\n"
msgstr "它使目睹你击杀的生物陷入狂乱，以极强的力量和速度攻击附近一切目标。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:mesmerism (mesmerism) armour ego"
msgid ""
"When you are struck in melee, it briefly dazes all nearby enemies, then must\n"
"recharge by standing still for a while. Its duration, radius, and recharge\n"
"speed are improved by your Evocations skill.\n"
msgstr "你遭到近战命中时，它会短暂震慑附近所有敌人，随后需要你原地停留一段时间来充能。效果的持续时间、半径和充能速度随唤发技能提高。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:parrying (parrying) armour ego"
msgid ""
"It shields you if your last action was a melee attack. The shielding is half as\n"
"effective if your offhand is occupied by an item other than a weapon.\n"
msgstr "若你上一个动作是近战攻击，它会为你提供防护。若副手被武器以外的物品占用，防护效果减半。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:poison resistance (rpois) armour ego"
msgid "It protects you from poison.\n"
msgstr "它保护你抵御毒素。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:ponderousness (ponderous) armour ego"
msgid "It is very cumbersome, slowing your movement.\n"
msgstr "它非常笨重，会减缓你的移动速度。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:positive energy (rn+) armour ego"
msgid "It protects you from the effects of negative energy.\n"
msgstr "它保护你抵御负能量的效果。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:pyromania (pyromania) armour ego"
msgid ""
"It enhances your Fire magic and may unleash a blast of flames around you\n"
"whenever you kill an enemy by any means other than an attack. The explosion\n"
"chance and damage both scale with Evocations and it may trigger no more than\n"
"once each turn.\n"
msgstr "它增强你的火系魔法。每当你用攻击以外的方式击杀敌人时，它可能在你周围引发烈焰爆炸。爆炸的几率和伤害都随唤发技能提高，每回合最多触发一次。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:rampaging (rampage) armour ego"
msgid ""
"It causes one to take an extra step when moving towards enemies, briefly\n"
"stunning them if this results in an attack.\n"
msgstr "它使你朝敌人移动时额外前进一步；若因此发动攻击，还会使敌人短暂眩晕。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:reflection (reflect) armour ego"
msgid "It reflects blocked missile attacks.\n"
msgstr "它反射被格挡的投射物攻击。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:resistance (rc+ rf+) armour ego"
msgid "It protects you from the effects of both fire and cold.\n"
msgstr "它保护你同时抵御火焰与寒冷的效果。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:resonance (resonance) armour ego"
msgid ""
"It improves the success rate of your Forgecraft spells and enhances your melee\n"
"attacks proportionally to your Forgecraft skill.\n"
msgstr "它提高锻造术法术的成功率，并按你的锻造术技能增强近战攻击。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:see invisible (sinv) armour ego"
msgid "It allows you to see invisible things.\n"
msgstr "它让你看见隐形事物。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:shadows (shadows) armour ego"
msgid "It reduces the distance you can be seen at and can see.\n"
msgstr "它同时缩短你被看见的距离和你能看见的距离。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:sniping (snipe) armour ego"
msgid ""
"It increases your damage by an additional 50% with ranged and thrown weapons\n"
"against incapacitated targets. Incapacitated targets are those that are asleep,\n"
"paralysed, petrified, confused or caught in a net.\n"
msgstr "你使用远程或投掷武器攻击无法正常行动的目标时，它会额外提高 50% 伤害。这类目标包括睡眠、麻痹、石化、混乱或被网困住的生物。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:spirit shield (spirit) armour ego"
msgid ""
"It causes incoming damage to be divided between your reserves of health and\n"
"magic.\n"
msgstr "它使你受到的伤害由生命和魔力储备共同承担。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:stardust (stardust) armour ego"
msgid ""
"It conjures a barrage of shooting stars the first time you spend MP to use a\n"
"spell or ability each battle, recharging only when your MP is restored and no\n"
"more enemies remain. Your Evocations skill increases the number and damage of\n"
"the stars and MP spent further increases damage.\n"
msgstr "每场战斗中，你首次消耗魔力使用法术或能力时，它会召来一轮流星。只有魔力恢复且已没有敌人时，它才会重新充能。唤发技能提高流星的数量和伤害，消耗的魔力还会进一步提高伤害。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:stealth (stlth+) armour ego"
msgid "It enhances your stealth.\n"
msgstr "它增强你的潜行能力。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:the archmagi (archmagi) armour ego"
msgid "It increases the power of your magical spells.\n"
msgstr "它提高你的法术强度。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:willpower (will+) armour ego"
msgid "It increases your willpower, protecting against certain magical effects.\n"
msgstr "它提高你的意志，保护你抵御某些魔法效果。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:wrath (*rage) armour ego"
msgid "It berserks you when you make melee attacks (20% chance).\n"
msgstr "你进行近战攻击时，它会使你狂暴（20% 几率）。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:atropa-tipped (atropa) missile ego"
msgid ""
"It is tipped with a substance that causes blindness and brief confusion.\n"
"\n"
"The chance of successfully applying its effect increases with your Throwing and\n"
"Stealth skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"它的尖端涂有使目标失明并短暂混乱的物质。\n"
"\n"
"成功施加效果的几率随你的投掷和潜行技能提高。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:chaos (chaos) missile ego"
msgid "When thrown, it has a random effect.\n"
msgstr "投掷它会产生随机效果。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:curare-tipped (curare) missile ego"
msgid ""
"It is tipped with a substance that causes asphyxiation, dealing direct damage as\n"
"well as poisoning and slowing those it strikes.\n"
"\n"
"It is twice as likely to be destroyed on impact as other darts.\n"
msgstr ""
"它的尖端涂有令人窒息的物质，造成直接伤害，并使受击者中毒、减速。\n"
"\n"
"它在命中时损毁的几率是其他飞镖的两倍。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:datura-tipped (datura) missile ego"
msgid ""
"It is tipped with a substance that sends those it hits into a mindless frenzy,\n"
"attacking friend and foe alike.\n"
"\n"
"The chance of successfully applying its effect increases with your Throwing and\n"
"Stealth skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"它的尖端涂有使受击者陷入无意识狂乱的物质，让其不分敌我地攻击。\n"
"\n"
"成功施加效果的几率随你的投掷和潜行技能提高。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:disjunction (disjunct) missile ego"
msgid ""
"It causes any target it hits to become temporarily untethered in space, blinking\n"
"away from you for several turns and taking minor damage each time it does so.\n"
msgstr "它使受击目标暂时失去空间锚定，在接下来数回合中不断向远离你的方向闪烁，每次闪烁都受到少量伤害。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:dispersal (disperse) missile ego"
msgid ""
"It causes any target it hits to blink, with a tendency towards blinking further\n"
"away from you.\n"
msgstr "它使受击目标闪烁，且倾向于闪烁到离你更远的位置。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:poisoned (poison) missile ego"
msgid "It is coated with poison.\n"
msgstr "它涂有毒药。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/egos.txt:silver (silver) missile ego"
msgid ""
"It deals increased damage compared to normal missiles and substantially\n"
"increased damage to chaotic and magically transformed beings. It also inflicts\n"
"extra damage against mutated beings, depending on how mutated they are.\n"
msgstr "它比普通投掷物造成更多伤害，对混沌生物和被魔法变形的生物造成的增伤尤为显著。它也会对变异生物造成额外伤害，具体取决于变异程度。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:ablaze with memories monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature has temporarily gained the ability to cast specific spells.\n"
"It will lose access to them again once sufficiently injured.\n"
msgstr "这个生物暂时获得了施放特定法术的能力。受到足够伤害后，它就会失去这些法术。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:about to teleport monstatus"
msgid ""
"After a short delay, this creature will be teleported to somewhere else on the\n"
"current floor.\n"
msgstr "短暂延迟后，这个生物会被传送到当前楼层的其他位置。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:afflicted by rimeblight monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature suffers AC-ignoring cold damage every turn, and may sometimes\n"
"explode in a burst of ice that damages nearby allies. When it dies, it may\n"
"spread rimeblight to other nearby allies.\n"
"\n"
"Natural, demonic, or holy creatures will be instantly killed once they reach\n"
"low health, and be replaced with pillars of rime.\n"
msgstr "这个生物每回合受到无视护甲值的寒冷伤害，有时还会爆发冰霜，伤害附近盟友。死亡时，它可能将霜疫传播给附近其他盟友。\n\n自然生物、恶魔或神圣生物的生命降至较低水平时，会被立即杀死，并化为霜柱。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:ally target monstatus"
msgid "This creature is being targeted by one or more of your allies.\n"
msgstr "你的一个或多个盟友正在以这个生物为目标。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:anguished monstatus"
msgid ""
"When this creature deals damage, it will suffer damage equal to the damage it\n"
"dealt.\n"
msgstr "这个生物造成伤害时，自身也会受到等量伤害。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:asleep monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature is unable to move, act, block, or dodge. Any hostile action will\n"
"awaken it, though melee attacks against it (even by other monsters) will deal\n"
"increased damage.\n"
"\n"
"[[high-tier stab monstatus]]\n"
msgstr ""
"这个生物无法移动、行动、格挡或闪避。任何敌对行动都会将其唤醒，但对它的近战攻击会造成更高伤害，即使攻击来自其他怪物也是如此。\n"
"\n"
"[[high-tier stab monstatus]]\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:berserk monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature has 50% more health, deals 50% more damage with melee attacks, and\n"
"both moves and acts 50% faster. They cannot perform any action besides moving\n"
"or attacking.\n"
"\n"
"When the berserk rage wears off, they will be slowed and unable to berserk for a\n"
"short duration.\n"
msgstr "这个生物的生命增加 50%，近战伤害提高 50%，移动和行动速度提高 50%。它只能移动或攻击，不能执行其他动作。\n\n狂暴结束后，它会短暂陷入缓慢状态，且暂时无法再次狂暴。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:blind monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature cannot see properly. Its accuracy is greatly decreased, it cannot\n"
"make attacks of opportunity, and spells it casts may sometimes be aimed at the\n"
"wrong locations.\n"
"\n"
"It may also stumble around and eventually lose track of its target, especially\n"
"if it has low intelligence.\n"
"\n"
"[[low-tier stab monstatus]]\n"
msgstr ""
"这个生物看不清东西，命中率大幅下降，无法进行借机攻击，施法时也可能瞄准错误位置。\n"
"\n"
"它还可能胡乱走动，最终失去目标的踪迹，智力较低时尤其如此。\n"
"\n"
"[[low-tier stab monstatus]]\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:bound in place monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature cannot move under its own power, but may still use translocations\n"
"or be forcibly displaced by someone else.\n"
msgstr "这个生物无法自行移动，但仍可使用位移魔法，或被其他生物强行移位。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:called by a tesseract monstatus"
msgid ""
"This monster has been called from a parallel reality. Killing it will grant no\n"
"experience points, but it will be immediately cast back to its original reality\n"
"as soon as the tesseract is destroyed.\n"
msgstr "这个怪物从平行现实中被唤来。击杀它不会获得经验；一旦超立方体被摧毁，它就会立即被送回原来的现实。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:catching its breath monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature has used a breath ability recently and cannot use it again for a\n"
"short while.\n"
msgstr "这个生物最近使用过吐息能力，短时间内无法再次使用。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:catching his breath monstatus"
msgid "[[catching its breath monstatus]]\n"
msgstr "[[catching its breath monstatus]]\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:catching her breath monstatus"
msgid "[[catching its breath monstatus]]\n"
msgstr "[[catching its breath monstatus]]\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:catching their breath monstatus"
msgid "[[catching its breath monstatus]]\n"
msgstr "[[catching its breath monstatus]]\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:chanting recall monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature is chanting a Word of Recall. This will recall intelligent allies\n"
"from elsewhere on the floor to the caster's vicinity after a short delay, but can\n"
"be interrupted by most effects which would normally prevent it from casting spells.\n"
msgstr "这个生物正在吟诵召回真言。短暂延迟后，当前楼层其他地方具有智慧的盟友会被召至施法者附近。大多数通常会阻止施法的效果都能打断吟诵。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:charmed monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature has been charmed and will fight for your cause for a short while. This\n"
"effect will wear off immediately if you attempt to harm it in any way.\n"
msgstr "这个生物受到魅惑，短时间内会为你作战。你只要尝试以任何方式伤害它，效果就会立即结束。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:concentrated venom monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature's natural venom has been intensified, giving any poison it inflicts\n"
"through attacks or breath weapons a chance to slow and asphyxiate susceptible targets.\n"
msgstr "这个生物的天然毒液得到强化，通过攻击或吐息施加的毒素有几率使会受此效果影响的目标减速并窒息。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:confused monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature is unable to block or use spells or abilities and will stumble around\n"
"at random, attacking whatever it bumps into - be they friend or foe or sometimes even\n"
"themselves.\n"
"\n"
"[[low-tier stab monstatus]]\n"
msgstr ""
"这个生物无法格挡，也无法使用法术或能力，会随机踉跄走动，攻击撞到的任何目标，不分敌我，有时甚至会攻击自己。\n"
"\n"
"[[low-tier stab monstatus]]\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:contaminated monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature has been contaminated by transmutational energy, and will suffer\n"
"significant damage every third time such energy is inflicted upon them.\n"
msgstr "这个生物受到变形能量污染，每受到三次这种能量的影响，就会受到一次可观的伤害。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:constricted by roots monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature is being constricted by tree roots, which reduces their evasion and\n"
"inflicts some damage each turn. It may also prevent them from moving, though each\n"
"attempt to do so has a chance to break this effect entirely.\n"
msgstr "这个生物被树根绞缠，闪避值降低，每回合受到一些伤害，也可能无法移动。不过，每次尝试移动都有几率彻底挣脱。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:constricted by zombie hands monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature is being constricted by clutching corpses from deep beneath the\n"
"earth, which reduces their evasion and inflicts some damage each turn. It may also\n"
"prevent them from moving, though each attempt to do so has a chance to break this\n"
"effect entirely.\n"
msgstr "这个生物被地底深处伸出的尸骸之手绞缠，闪避值降低，每回合受到一些伤害，也可能无法移动。不过，每次尝试移动都有几率彻底挣脱。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:control wrested from you monstatus"
msgid ""
"This formerly-friendly creature has been charmed by another creature to join their\n"
"side. If you slay the source of this charm, it will regain its senses.\n"
msgstr "这个原本友善的生物受到另一生物的魅惑，加入了对方阵营。杀死魅惑来源后，它会恢复神志。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:corroded monstatus"
msgid "This creature's AC is reduced by 8.\n"
msgstr "这个生物的护甲值降低 8。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:covered in liquid flames monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature has been coated in sticky flame, and will take AC-ignoring fire damage\n"
"each turn. Movement will shake off the flames, causing it to expire much more\n"
"rapidly and stepping into water will extinguish it entirely.\n"
msgstr "这个生物被黏附火焰覆盖，每回合受到无视护甲值的火焰伤害。移动能甩掉火焰，使效果更快结束；走入水中则会完全熄灭火焰。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:covered in magnetic dust monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature is unable to evade attacks or turn invisible. If it dies, it will leave\n"
"behind a cloud of magnetised fragments.\n"
"\n"
"Each time Magnavolt is cast, a beam of electricity will automatically be fired at this\n"
"creature.\n"
msgstr "这个生物无法躲避攻击或隐形。它死亡后会留下磁化碎片云。\n\n每次施放 巨磁电涌，都会自动向它射出一道闪电束。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:covered in terrible wounds monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature has been afflicted with illusory wounds by a flayed ghost. These wounds\n"
"will disappear with time or when the flayed ghost is destroyed.\n"
msgstr "剥皮鬼在这个生物身上造成了幻觉伤口。伤口会随时间消失，或在剥皮鬼被摧毁时消失。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:covering ground quickly monstatus"
msgid "This creature moves slightly faster.\n"
msgstr "这个生物的移动速度略微提高。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:covering ground slowly monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature is stuck in liquefied ground, causing it to move more slowly and also\n"
"fumble 25% of the melee attacks it makes.\n"
msgstr "这个生物陷在液化地面中，移动更慢，且有 25% 的近战攻击会失手。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:crumbling away monstatus"
msgid "This creature will be automatically destroyed in a few turns.\n"
msgstr "这个生物会在数回合后自动被摧毁。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:cursed with the promise of agony monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature is cursed, and will lose half its current health after the next time\n"
"the source of the curse hits it with a melee attack.\n"
msgstr "这个生物受到诅咒。诅咒来源下次用近战攻击命中它后，它会失去当前生命的一半。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:damage-immune at range monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature takes no damage by any means unless the original source of that\n"
"damage is adjacent to them. Non-damaging side-effects happen normally.\n"
"\n"
"(The source of damage from clouds and projectile-like monsters, such as foxfires,\n"
"is always considered whatever creature first created them.)\n"
msgstr "除非伤害的最初来源与这个生物相邻，否则任何手段都无法对它造成伤害。非伤害性的附带效果仍正常生效。\n\n（云雾，以及狐火等类似投射物的怪物，其伤害来源始终视为最初创造它们的生物。）\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:dazed monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature is temporarily unable to act, but any hostile action will cause it to\n"
"immediately regain its senses.\n"
msgstr "这个生物暂时无法行动，但任何敌对行动都会使其立即恢复神志。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:diminished spells monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature's spells are less powerful - dealing less damage, being less able to\n"
"overcome their target's willpower, and occasionally being weaker in other ways.\n"
msgstr "这个生物的法术强度降低：伤害减少，更难突破目标的意志，有时还会在其他方面减弱。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:dormant monstatus"
msgid "[[asleep monstatus]]\n"
msgstr "[[asleep monstatus]]\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:doubled in vigour monstatus"
msgid "This monster's current and maximum health are temporarily doubled.\n"
msgstr "这个怪物的当前生命与最大生命暂时翻倍。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:empowered by the touch of beogh monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature has been granted great power by Beogh to challenge you. Their melee\n"
"and ranged attacks deal 33% more damage, their health is increased, and they cast\n"
"spells more frequently. They are also able to track you, no matter where on the\n"
"current floor you flee.\n"
"\n"
"They will lose these bonuses once the challenge is concluded.\n"
msgstr ""
"比欧弗赐予这个生物强大力量，令其向你挑战。它的近战和远程伤害提高 33%，生命增加，施法更频繁。不论你逃到当前楼层的何处，它都能追踪你。\n"
"\n"
"挑战结束后，它会失去这些加成。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:encased in ice monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature has been flash-frozen and its movement speed is greatly reduced for\n"
"a short time.\n"
msgstr "这个生物被急冻，短时间内移动速度大幅降低。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:entangled in a net monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature is caught in a net, greatly reducing its evasion and preventing it\n"
"from blocking. Any attempt it makes to move or attack will instead struggle against\n"
"the net, which may eventually destroy it. Spellcasting is unimpaired.\n"
"\n"
"[[low-tier stab monstatus]]\n"
msgstr "这个生物被网困住，闪避值大幅降低且无法格挡。尝试移动或攻击时，它只会挣扎，最终可能挣破网。施法不受影响。\n\n[[low-tier stab monstatus]]\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:entangled in a web monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature is caught in a spider's web, greatly reducing its evasion and\n"
"preventing it from blocking. Any attempt it makes to move or attack will instead\n"
"struggle against the web, which may eventually destroy it. Spellcasting is\n"
"unimpaired.\n"
"\n"
"[[low-tier stab monstatus]]\n"
msgstr "这个生物被蛛网困住，闪避值大幅降低且无法格挡。尝试移动或攻击时，它只会挣扎，最终可能挣破蛛网。施法不受影响。\n\n[[low-tier stab monstatus]]\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:extremely poisoned monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature suffers poison damage every turn and cannot be poisoned any\n"
"further.\n"
msgstr "这个生物每回合受到毒素伤害，中毒程度已无法进一步加深。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:fast monstatus"
msgid "This creature moves and acts 50% faster.\n"
msgstr "这个生物的移动和行动速度提高 50%。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:feeble figment monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature is but a fragile duplicate of another creature. Its health is\n"
"reduced by 66%, it deals 33% less damage with attacks, and its spells are\n"
"significantly weakened.\n"
msgstr "这个生物只是另一生物的脆弱复制品。它的生命减少 66%，攻击伤害降低 33%，法术也显著减弱。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:flame-wreathed monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature has been empowered by the flames of Ignis. It deals additional\n"
"fire damage with its melee attacks, moves 33% more quickly, and has increased AC\n"
"and resistance to fire.\n"
msgstr "这个生物得到伊格尼斯烈焰的强化。近战攻击附带额外火焰伤害，移动速度提高 33%，护甲值和火焰抗性也提高。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:fleeing monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature is fleeing in fear and will attempt each turn to move away from\n"
"the source of this fear. Beside movement, it may only cast spells which it\n"
"thinks could help it escape, such as Blink.\n"
"\n"
"If harmed directly or cornered against terrain, it will turn around to fight\n"
"once more.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个生物正在恐惧中逃跑，每回合都会尝试远离恐惧来源。除移动外，它只能施放自认为有助逃脱的法术，例如闪烁。\n"
"\n"
"若受到直接伤害，或被地形逼入绝境，它会转身重新战斗。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:fragile as glass monstatus"
msgid "This creature receives 50% more damage from all sources.\n"
msgstr "这个生物受到的所有来源伤害提高 50%。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:frenzied and wild monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature deals 50% more damage with melee attacks and both moves and\n"
"attacks 50% faster. It cannot cast spells and will prioritise attacking the\n"
"closest other creature present each turn, whether they are friend or foe.\n"
msgstr "这个生物的近战伤害提高 50%，移动和攻击速度提高 50%。它无法施法，每回合会优先攻击最近的其他生物，不分敌我。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:fully charged monstatus"
msgid "This creature has gathered all the power it needs to cast its spells.\n"
msgstr "这个生物已经积蓄了施法所需的全部能量。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:grapneled monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature has been struck with a kinetic grapnel. The next melee attack\n"
"from the grapnel's source will always hit and deal slightly increased damage.\n"
msgstr "这个生物被动能钩索击中。抓钩来源对它的下一次近战攻击必定命中，伤害也会略微提高。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:heavily contaminated monstatus"
msgid "[[contaminated monstatus]]\n"
msgstr "[[contaminated monstatus]]\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:heavily drained monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature has been heavily drained, lowering the accuracy of their melee\n"
"attacks, the power of their spells and special attack properties, and making\n"
"them more vulnerable to many status effects.\n"
msgstr "这个生物受到严重吸能：近战命中率、法术强度和特殊攻击效果的威力降低，也更容易受到多种状态效果影响。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:idealised monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature has glows with the perfection of their best self. They deal 100%\n"
"more damage with melee attacks, have additional AC, and cast spells with\n"
"substantially more strength.\n"
msgstr "这个生物焕发出理想自我的完美光辉。近战伤害提高 100%，护甲值增加，施放的法术也强大得多。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:incited by gozag monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature has been roused into great speed by the wrath of Gozag Ym Sagoz.\n"
"Their haste or berserk state is permanent and will not wear off with time\n"
"or through deliberate magical intervention.\n"
msgstr "哥萨戈的怒火使这个生物行动神速。它的加速或狂暴状态是永久的，不会随时间消退，也无法通过魔法手段消除。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:indifferent monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature is neither hostile nor allied and may attack creatures of all\n"
"dispositions, should it wander into them.\n"
msgstr "这个生物既非敌对，也非盟友。若它游荡时撞到其他生物，可能不分阵营地发动攻击。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:infested monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature is infested with a death scarab, which will emerge from their\n"
"body once they die.\n"
msgstr "这个生物体内寄生着一只死亡圣甲虫，死亡后圣甲虫会从其体内钻出。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:inner flame monstatus"
msgid ""
"Whenever this creature suffers damage, a flame cloud will briefly appear\n"
"beneath them. When they die, they will explode in a violent burst of fire,\n"
"damaging anything nearby and leaving behind additional flame clouds.\n"
"\n"
"Giant creatures will trigger an even larger explosion when they die.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个生物每次受伤时，脚下都会短暂出现火焰云。死亡时，它会猛烈爆炸，伤害附近一切目标，并留下更多火焰云。\n"
"\n"
"巨型生物死亡时引发的爆炸范围更大。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:inspiring fear monstatus"
msgid ""
"You are currently terrified of this creature, preventing you from deliberately\n"
"moving close to them and causing 33% of the melee attacks you make again\n"
"against them fail.\n"
"\n"
"This effect will break if you ever lose sight of this creature.\n"
msgstr "你目前十分畏惧这个生物，无法主动靠近它，对它进行的近战攻击也有 33% 的几率失败。\n\n一旦看不见它，此效果就会结束。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:interlaced with chaos monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature's melee attacks may inflict additional damage of a random element\n"
"or cause various irresistible status effects.\n"
msgstr "这个生物的近战攻击可能附带随机元素的额外伤害，或施加各种无法抵抗的状态效果。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:lashing out in frustration monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature has been magically vexed and is forced to attack a random adjacent\n"
"space each turn instead of performing any other actions. It is more likely to\n"
"attack a space containing a creature than an empty one, but will attack its own\n"
"allies as readily as its enemies.\n"
msgstr "这个生物受到魔法烦扰，每回合被迫攻击随机相邻格，无法执行其他动作。它更可能攻击有生物的格子，而不是空格，但攻击盟友和敌人的意愿完全相同。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:lightly drained monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature has been lightly drained, somewhat lowering the accuracy of their\n"
"melee attacks, the power of their spells and special attack properties, and\n"
"making them slightly more vulnerable to many status effects.\n"
msgstr "这个生物受到轻度吸能：近战命中率、法术强度和特殊攻击效果的威力略微降低，也略微更容易受到多种状态效果影响。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:lost in madness monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature has been driven to madness by the power of Zin. It will never again\n"
"use spells or abilities and will stumble around at random, attacking whatever\n"
"it bumps into - be they friend or foe or sometimes even themselves.\n"
msgstr "辛的力量使这个生物陷入疯狂。它永远无法再使用法术或能力，只会随机踉跄走动，攻击撞到的任何目标，不分敌我，有时甚至攻击自己。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:magic disrupted monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature's spells and magical abilities have been disrupted and may fail when\n"
"used. The chance of failure depends on the remaining duration of this effect.\n"
msgstr "这个生物的法术与魔法能力受到干扰，使用时可能失败。失败几率取决于此效果的剩余时间。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:magic-sapped monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature has had its access to magic tainted. Whenever it casts a spell, its\n"
"magic will be severely disrupted, making it likely any subsequent spells it casts\n"
"will fail.\n"
msgstr "这个生物运用魔法的能力受到污染。每当它施法，魔法就会受到严重干扰，使后续法术很可能失败。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:marked with the sign of ruin monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature has been condemned to inexorable decay and ruin. Whenever it takes\n"
"damage from melee attacks, it will be drained heavily and either slowed, weakened,\n"
"or blinded.\n"
msgstr "这个生物注定走向无法逃避的衰败与毁灭。每次受到近战伤害，它都会遭到严重吸能，并陷入减速、虚弱或失明中的一种状态。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:mesmerising monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature has mesmerised you, making you unable to voluntarily move away\n"
"from them.\n"
"\n"
"This effect will break if you ever lose sight of this creature.\n"
msgstr "这个生物使你陷入迷魂状态，无法主动远离它。\n\n一旦看不见它，此效果就会结束。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:minion monstatus"
msgid "This creature has been created by magic and will cease to be once its creator dies.\n"
msgstr "这个生物由魔法创造，创造者死亡后，它也会随之消失。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:missing a shadow monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature's shadow has been torn away from it and cannot be affected\n"
"by Aphotic Marionette ever again.\n"
msgstr "这个生物的影子被撕去了，永远无法再次受到 无光提线偶 的影响。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:misshapen and mutated monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature's AC is reduced by 8 and its accuracy, spell power, brand damage, and\n"
"willpower are moderately reduced.\n"
msgstr "这个生物的护甲值降低 8，命中率、法术强度、印记伤害和意志也有所降低。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:more vulnerable to fire monstatus"
msgid "This creature's fire resistance is reduced by one level.\n"
msgstr "这个生物的火焰抗性降低一级。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:more vulnerable to poison monstatus"
msgid "This creature's poison resistance is reduced by one level.\n"
msgstr "这个生物的毒素抗性降低一级。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:mute monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature has been stricken permanently mute by the power of Zin. This\n"
"prevents all noise the creature could make, including the vocalisations\n"
"required for most creatures to cast spells.\n"
msgstr "辛的力量使这个生物永久失声。它无法发出任何声音，包括大多数生物施法所需的吟诵。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:not watching you monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature has been briefly distracted by something else.\n"
"\n"
"[[low-tier stab monstatus]]\n"
msgstr ""
"这个生物暂时被其他事物分散了注意力。\n"
"\n"
"[[low-tier stab monstatus]]\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:paralysed monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature is unable to move, act, block, or dodge attacks.\n"
"\n"
"[[high-tier stab monstatus]]\n"
msgstr ""
"这个生物无法移动、行动、格挡或闪避攻击。\n"
"\n"
"[[high-tier stab monstatus]]\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:paralysed with fear monstatus"
msgid "[[paralysed monstatus]]\n"
msgstr "[[paralysed monstatus]]\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:partially charged monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature has built up part of the charge it needs to cast a spell or\n"
"activate an ability.\n"
msgstr "这个生物已经积蓄了施法或发动能力所需的部分能量。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:peaceful monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature will never attack you and may attack other creatures hostile to\n"
"you, but will neither follow you nor obey any direct instructions.\n"
msgstr "这个生物永远不会攻击你，也可能攻击与你敌对的生物，但不会跟随你或听从直接命令。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:petrifying slowly monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature will soon become fully petrified. Its movement and actions are\n"
"50% slower and it is nearly unable to dodge attacks, though it also takes 33%\n"
"less damage.\n"
"\n"
"[[low-tier stab monstatus]]\n"
msgstr ""
"这个生物即将完全石化。移动和行动速度降低 50%，几乎无法闪避攻击，但受到的伤害也减少 33%。\n"
"\n"
"[[low-tier stab monstatus]]\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:petrified monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature is unable to move, act, block, or dodge attacks. By being made\n"
"of stone, it also takes 50% less damage, gains immunity to negative energy and\n"
"poison, but become vulnerable to deconstruction.\n"
"\n"
"[[high-tier stab monstatus]]\n"
msgstr ""
"这个生物无法移动、行动、格挡或闪避攻击。化为石头也使它受到的伤害减少 50%，免疫负能量和毒素，但容易受到解构的伤害。\n"
"\n"
"[[high-tier stab monstatus]]\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:poisoned monstatus"
msgid "This creature suffers poison damage every turn.\n"
msgstr "这个生物每回合受到毒素伤害。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:radiating silence monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature is surrounded by a field of unnatural silence which eliminates\n"
"all noise made within it as well as preventing the vocalisations required for\n"
"many creatures (including you) to read scrolls, cast spells, or invoke divine\n"
"aid.\n"
"\n"
"If this effect was caused by a spell, the radius of the field will shrink over\n"
"time.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个生物周围环绕着超自然的静默领域。领域内所有声音都会消失，也无法进行许多生物（包括你）阅读卷轴、施放法术或祈求神助所需的发声。\n"
"\n"
"若此效果由法术造成，领域半径会随时间缩小。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:radiating toxic energy monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature shines with Olgreb's Toxic Radiance and will continuously inflict\n"
"poison damage on all foes in sight for several turns.\n"
msgstr "这个生物散发着奥格雷布的剧毒光辉，会在数回合内持续对视野内所有敌人造成毒素伤害。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:ready to become your apostle monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature has been defeated in honourable combat and may be recruited as\n"
"one of your apostles via the ability menu.\n"
msgstr "这个生物已在光荣的战斗中被击败。你可以通过能力菜单，将它招募为使徒。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:ready to howl monstatus"
msgid "This creature has not yet inflicted you with Oblivion Howl and may attempt to do so.\n"
msgstr "这个生物尚未对你施加湮灭嚎叫，可能尝试这样做。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:ready to sunder monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature's Sundering weapon is fully charged and its next attack will be\n"
"more accurate, inflict greatly increased damage, and cleave with increased range.\n"
"This effect will be lost if it moves.\n"
msgstr "这个生物的碎裂武器已经完全充能。下一次攻击会更准确，伤害大幅提高，劈砍范围也更大。若它移动，此效果就会消失。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:reflecting blocked projectiles monstatus"
msgid "This creature reflects any projectile it blocks back to their original source.\n"
msgstr "这个生物会将格挡住的投射物反射回原来的来源。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:reflecting injuries monstatus"
msgid ""
"Whenever this creature suffers damage, it inflicts 2/3rds as much damage back upon\n"
"whatever damaged it.\n"
msgstr "这个生物每次受到伤害，都会向伤害来源反击所受伤害的 2/3。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:regenerating monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature regenerates health at a greatly increased rate, proportion to their\n"
"maximum health.\n"
msgstr "这个生物以大幅提高的速度恢复生命，恢复量与其最大生命成正比。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:repelling missiles monstatus"
msgid "This creature has +15 EV when dodging projectiles, whether physical or magical.\n"
msgstr "躲避物理或魔法投射物时，这个生物的闪避值增加 15。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:retreating monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature has been ordered to flee in a given direction, and will not attack\n"
"or return to your side until they are given new instructions or have travelled a\n"
"sufficient distance\n"
msgstr "这个生物被命令向指定方向撤退。在收到新指示或走出足够远的距离之前，它不会攻击，也不会回到你身旁。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:rolling monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature has curled into a ball, increasing its movement speed and melee\n"
"damage by 100% until the next time it attacks something (or becomes unable to move).\n"
msgstr "这个生物蜷成球状，移动速度和近战伤害提高 100%，直到下次攻击目标或变得无法移动。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:sharing its pain monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature will inflict a portion of all damage it suffers upon nearby allies,\n"
"with those closer to it receiving a greater amount.\n"
msgstr "这个生物会将所受的部分伤害施加给附近盟友，距离越近的盟友受到的伤害越多。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:sharing his pain monstatus"
msgid "[[sharing its pain monstatus]]\n"
msgstr "[[sharing its pain monstatus]]\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:sharing her pain monstatus"
msgid "[[sharing its pain monstatus]]\n"
msgstr "[[sharing its pain monstatus]]\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:sharing their pain monstatus"
msgid "[[sharing its pain monstatus]]\n"
msgstr "[[sharing its pain monstatus]]\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:sheltered from injuries monstatus"
msgid ""
"Half of the damage suffered by this creature is redirected to the ally protecting it\n"
"instead.\n"
msgstr "这个生物所受伤害的一半会转由保护它的盟友承担。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:sick monstatus"
msgid "This creature is sick and cannot naturally regenerate.\n"
msgstr "这个生物患病了，无法自然恢复生命。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:silenced monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature is engulfed in a field of unnatural silence, preventing any noise\n"
"it might make, including the vocalisations required for many creatures to cast\n"
"spells.\n"
msgstr "这个生物被超自然的静默领域笼罩，无法发出任何声音，包括许多生物施法所需的吟诵。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:skewered by barbs monstatus"
msgid "This creature will take minor damage whenever it moves.\n"
msgstr "这个生物每次移动都会受到少量伤害。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:slightly transparent monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature is normally invisible, but your magical sight allows you to see it\n"
"nonetheless. This has no effect on you, though any allies you have may not be\n"
"able to see it as you can.\n"
msgstr "这个生物通常处于隐形状态，但你的魔法视力仍能看见它。这对你没有影响，不过你的盟友可能无法像你一样看见它。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:slow monstatus"
msgid "This creature moves and acts at 66% of normal speed.\n"
msgstr "这个生物以正常速度的 66% 移动和行动。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:softly glowing monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature has been outlined with a halo of light and is easier to hit and\n"
"revealed, if invisible.\n"
msgstr "这个生物被光晕勾勒出轮廓，更容易被击中；若原本隐形，也会显露身形。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:soul bound monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature's soul has been bound in ice. When it dies, a simulacrum of its\n"
"original form will rise in its place.\n"
msgstr "这个生物的灵魂被冰封束缚。它死亡后，原地会出现一具与其原形相同的冰骸。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:soul-gripped monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature's soul will be bound in service to you once they die, though\n"
"allowing them to stray from your line of sight for more than a brief moment\n"
"will cause you to lose your grasp on it.\n"
msgstr "这个生物死后，灵魂会受你束缚并为你效力。但若让它离开你的视野稍久，你就会失去对其灵魂的掌握。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:soul-splintered monstatus"
msgid ""
"A fragment of this creature's soul has been extracted into a soul wisp,\n"
"preventing further use of this spell until the wisp reunites with them again.\n"
msgstr "这个生物的一片灵魂已被抽出，化为灵魂幽火。在幽火重新与它融合前，无法再次对它使用此法术。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:spells empowered monstatus"
msgid "This creature's spells are strengthened and it will cast them more frequently.\n"
msgstr "这个生物的法术得到强化，施法也更加频繁。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:spells diminished monstatus"
msgid "This creature's spells are significantly weakened.\n"
msgstr "这个生物的法术显著减弱。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:stilling the winds monstatus"
msgid "This creature is preventing any clouds from being created on the current floor.\n"
msgstr "这个生物正在阻止当前楼层产生任何云雾。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:strong monstatus"
msgid "This creature's melee attacks deal 50% more damage.\n"
msgstr "这个生物的近战伤害提高 50%。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:strong-willed monstatus"
msgid "This creature's willpower is increased by 2 pips.\n"
msgstr "这个生物的意志提高 2 档。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:stupefied monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature has been struck dumb by the power of Zin and cannot act.\n"
"\n"
"[[high-tier stab monstatus]]\n"
msgstr ""
"辛的力量使这个生物神志呆滞，无法行动。\n"
"\n"
"[[high-tier stab monstatus]]\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:surrounded by a freezing vortex monstatus"
msgid "This creature is the source of a devastating polar vortex.\n"
msgstr "这个生物是一场毁灭性的极地涡流的源头。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:surrounded by acidic fog monstatus"
msgid "This creature trails a ring of acidic fog clouds around itself.\n"
msgstr "这个生物在自身周围拖出一圈酸雾。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:surrounded by chaotic energy monstatus"
msgid "This creature trails a ring of seething chaos clouds around itself.\n"
msgstr "这个生物在自身周围拖出一圈翻涌混沌云。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:surrounded by flames monstatus"
msgid "This creature trails a ring of flame clouds around itself.\n"
msgstr "这个生物在自身周围拖出一圈火焰云。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:surrounded by fog monstatus"
msgid "This creature trails a ring of purple smoke around itself.\n"
msgstr "这个生物在自身周围拖出一圈紫色烟雾。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:surrounded by foul miasma monstatus"
msgid "This creature trails a ring of foul miasma around itself.\n"
msgstr "这个生物在自身周围拖出一圈污秽瘴气。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:surrounded by freezing clouds monstatus"
msgid "This creature trails a ring of freezing clouds around itself.\n"
msgstr "这个生物在自身周围拖出一圈冰冻云雾。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:surrounded by mutagenic energy monstatus"
msgid "This creature trails a ring of mutagenic fog around itself.\n"
msgstr "这个生物在自身周围拖出一圈致变异雾气。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:surrounded by negative energy monstatus"
msgid "This creature trails a ring of clouds of excruciating misery around itself.\n"
msgstr "这个生物在自身周围拖出一圈痛苦折磨之云。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:surrounded by restless winds monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature has recently cast Polar Vortex and cannot cast it again for\n"
"a short time.\n"
msgstr "这个生物最近施放过极地涡流，短时间内无法再次施放。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:surrounded by thunder monstatus"
msgid "This creature trails a ring of thunder clouds around itself.\n"
msgstr "这个生物在自身周围拖出一圈雷云。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:target of orcish vengeance monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature has contributed to the death of one of your apostles. Defeating all\n"
"targets of orcish vengeance will significantly speed up the time it takes for\n"
"Beogh to resurrect your apostles.\n"
msgstr "这个生物参与了杀害你的一位使徒。击败所有兽人复仇目标，将显著缩短比欧弗复活你的使徒所需的时间。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:targeted by your dimensional bullseye monstatus"
msgid ""
"Whenever you perform a ranged attack aimed at a different creature, a copy of\n"
"the projectile will be teleported to this creature at the end of its flight.\n"
msgstr "每当你对其他生物发动远程攻击，投射物飞行结束时，都会有一份复制品被传送到这个生物身上。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:tempered monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature's melee attacks deal 25% more damage, its accuracy is slightly\n"
"increased, and its spells and abilities have been mildly strengthened.\n"
msgstr "这个生物的近战伤害提高 25%，命中率略有提高，法术和能力也得到小幅强化。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:touched by paradox monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature has become unmoored in space, allowing it to Manifold Assault as\n"
"a natural ability. Whenever they do, there is 33% chance they will also blink\n"
"to a random nearby location.\n"
msgstr "这个生物失去了空间锚定，能够将多重突袭作为天生能力使用。每次使用时，还会有 33% 几率闪烁到附近随机位置。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:unable to see you monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature is unable to see you because you are invisible. Its accuracy\n"
"against you is greatly decreased, it cannot make attacks of opportunity, and\n"
"spells it casts may sometimes be aimed at the wrong locations.\n"
"\n"
"It may also stumble around and eventually lose track of you, especially if it\n"
"has low intelligence.\n"
"\n"
"[[low-tier stab monstatus]]\n"
msgstr ""
"由于你处于隐形状态，这个生物无法看见你。它对你的命中率大幅降低，无法进行借机攻击，施法时也可能瞄准错误位置。\n"
"\n"
"它还可能胡乱走动，最终失去你的踪迹，智力较低时尤其如此。\n"
"\n"
"[[low-tier stab monstatus]]\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:unable to translocate monstatus"
msgid "This creature cannot blink or teleport.\n"
msgstr "这个生物无法闪烁或传送。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:unaffected by silence monstatus"
msgid ""
"Despite being engulfed in unnatural silence, this creature's magic does not\n"
"require vocalisations and thus is unaffected.\n"
msgstr "虽然被超自然的静默笼罩，但这个生物的魔法无需发声，因此不受影响。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:unrewarding monstatus"
msgid "This creature provides no experience or piety when slain.\n"
msgstr "击杀这个生物不会获得经验或虔诚。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:untethered in space monstatus"
msgid ""
"Each turn, this creature blinks a short distance further away from you and\n"
"suffers a small amount of damage.\n"
msgstr "每回合，这个生物都会向远离你的方向闪烁一小段距离，并受到少量伤害。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:unusually agile monstatus"
msgid "This creature's evasion is slightly increased.\n"
msgstr "这个生物的闪避值略有提高。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:unusually resistant monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature's resistance to fire, cold, poison, electricity, and corrosion\n"
"are all increased by one level.\n"
msgstr "这个生物的火焰、寒冷、毒素、电击和腐蚀抗性都提高一级。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:very poisoned monstatus"
msgid "This creature is poisoned and will take damage every turn.\n"
msgstr "这个生物中毒了，每回合都会受到伤害。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:unable to breathe monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature is unable to breathe and cannot cast spells or invoke divine aid.\n"
"It also takes minor asphyxiation damage every turn.\n"
msgstr "这个生物无法呼吸，不能施放法术或祈求神助，每回合还会受到少量窒息伤害。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:weak monstatus"
msgid "This creature's melee attacks deal 33% less damage.\n"
msgstr "这个生物的近战伤害降低 33%。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:weak-willed monstatus"
msgid "This creature's willpower is reduced by half.\n"
msgstr "这个生物的意志减半。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:winding a clockwork bee monstatus"
msgid ""
"This creature is preparing to launch a clockwork bee and must focus on this\n"
"task for several turns. Most effects that would prevent this creature from\n"
"casting spells will also interrupt this process.\n"
msgstr "这个生物正在准备放出一只发条蜜蜂，必须专注数回合。大多数阻止其施法的效果也会打断这一过程。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:withering away monstatus"
msgid "This creature will die in a few turns.\n"
msgstr "这个生物会在数回合后死亡。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:low-tier stab monstatus"
msgid ""
"<blue>Melee attacks you make against this creature have a chance (proportional to\n"
"your stealth and weapon skill) of catching it off-guard and dealing\n"
"increased damage, especially if made with a short blade.</blue>\n"
msgstr "<blue>你对这个生物进行近战攻击时，有几率乘其不备，造成更高伤害，使用短刃时尤其如此。几率与你的潜行和武器技能成正比。</blue>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monstatus.txt:high-tier stab monstatus"
msgid ""
"<blue>Melee attacks you make against this creature will deal greatly increased damage,\n"
"especially if made with a short blade.</blue>\n"
msgstr "<blue>你对这个生物进行近战攻击会造成大幅提高的伤害，使用短刃时尤其如此。</blue>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:database/godname.txt:zin lastname"
msgid "Zin the Law-Giver\n"
msgstr "定法者辛\n"

msgctxt "textdb:database/godname.txt:yredelemnul lastname"
msgid "Yredelemnul the Fallen\n"
msgstr "堕落者伊莱德莱姆努尔\n"

msgctxt "textdb:database/godname.txt:okawaru lastname"
msgid "Warmaster Okawaru\n"
msgstr "战争之主奥格瓦如\n"

msgctxt "textdb:database/godname.txt:makhleb lastname"
msgid "Makhleb the Destroyer\n"
msgstr "毁灭者马科列布\n"

msgctxt "textdb:database/godname.txt:sif muna lastname"
msgid "Sif Muna the Loreminder\n"
msgstr "学识守护者席夫·穆纳\n"

msgctxt "textdb:database/godname.txt:trog lastname"
msgid "Trog the Wrathful\n"
msgstr "狂怒者特洛戈\n"

msgctxt "textdb:database/godname.txt:elyvilon lastname"
msgid "Elyvilon the Healer\n"
msgstr "治愈者艾利维隆\n"

msgctxt "textdb:database/godname.txt:lugonu lastname"
msgid "Lugonu the Unformed\n"
msgstr "无形者卢戈努\n"

msgctxt "textdb:database/godname.txt:beogh lastname"
msgid "Beogh the Shepherd\n"
msgstr "牧者比欧弗\n"

msgctxt "textdb:database/godname.txt:fedhas lastname"
msgid "Fedhas Madash\n"
msgstr "费德哈·玛达什\n"

msgctxt "textdb:database/godname.txt:cheibriados lastname"
msgid "Cheibriados the Contemplative\n"
msgstr "沉思者切布理亚多\n"

msgctxt "textdb:database/godname.txt:ashenzari lastname"
msgid "Ashenzari the Shackled\n"
msgstr "受缚者艾申扎利\n"

msgctxt "textdb:database/godname.txt:dithmenos lastname"
msgid "Dithmenos the Shrouded\n"
msgstr "隐匿者迪斯姆诺\n"

msgctxt "textdb:database/godname.txt:nemelex xobeh lastname"
msgid "Nemelex Xobeh the Trickster\n"
msgstr "诡术者尼姆雷斯・索布\n"

msgctxt "textdb:database/godname.txt:gozag lastname"
msgid "Gozag Ym Sagoz the Greedy\n"
msgstr "贪婪者哥萨戈·伊姆·萨戈兹\n"

msgctxt "textdb:database/godname.txt:qazlal lastname"
msgid "Qazlal Stormbringer\n"
msgstr "风暴使者卡兹拉尔\n"

msgctxt "textdb:database/godname.txt:ru lastname"
msgid "Ru the Awakened\n"
msgstr "觉醒者入\n"

msgctxt "textdb:database/godname.txt:pakellas lastname"
msgid "Pakellas the Inventive\n"
msgstr "发明者帕克拉斯\n"

msgctxt "textdb:database/godname.txt:uskayaw lastname"
msgid "Uskayaw the Reveller\n"
msgstr "狂欢者阿斯卡亚\n"

msgctxt "textdb:database/godname.txt:hepliaklqana lastname"
msgid "Hepliaklqana the Forgotten\n"
msgstr "被遗忘者惠普利亚卡纳\n"

msgctxt "textdb:database/godname.txt:ignis lastname"
msgid "Ignis, the Dying Flame\n"
msgstr "伊格尼斯，垂死之焰\n"

msgctxt "textdb:database/godname.txt:wu jian lastname"
msgid "the Wu Jian Council\n"
msgstr "武剑会\n"

