msgctxt "textdb:descript/passives.txt:no teleportation passive"
msgid "You cannot teleport or blink.\n"
msgstr "你无法传送或闪烁。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/passives.txt:no spellcasting passive"
msgid "You cannot cast spells.\n"
msgstr "你无法施放法术。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/passives.txt:random rage passive"
msgid "You have a chance of going berserk when you make a melee attack.\n"
msgstr "你进行近战攻击时有一定几率狂暴。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/passives.txt:corrode self passive"
msgid "You have a chance of being corroded when you take damage.\n"
msgstr "你受到伤害时有一定几率遭到腐蚀。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/passives.txt:slow self passive"
msgid "You have a chance of being slowed when you take damage.\n"
msgstr "你受到伤害时有一定几率被减速。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/passives.txt:harm passive"
msgid "Any damage you deal or take is increased.\n"
msgstr "你造成和受到的所有伤害都会增加。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/passives.txt:mayhem passive"
msgid ""
"You have a chance of causing visible monsters to go into a frenzy when you kill\n"
"a foe.\n"
msgstr "你击杀敌人时有一定几率让视野内的怪物陷入狂乱。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/passives.txt:repel missiles passive"
msgid "You repel missiles, improving your chance to evade them.\n"
msgstr "你能偏转投射物，提高躲开投射物的几率。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/passives.txt:reflection passive"
msgid "You reflect any successfully blocked ranged attacks back towards the attacker.\n"
msgstr "你会将成功格挡的远程攻击反射回攻击者。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/passives.txt:acrobat passive"
msgid "Your evasion is increased while moving and waiting.\n"
msgstr "你在移动和等待时的闪避值提高。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/passives.txt:clarity passive"
msgid "You are protected from involuntary confusion, rage, fear and mesmerisation.\n"
msgstr "你不会被迫陷入混乱、狂暴、恐惧或魅惑。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/passives.txt:resist mutation passive"
msgid "You are partially protected from mutation.\n"
msgstr "你受到一定程度的变异防护。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/passives.txt:guardian spirit passive"
msgid "Any damage you take is divided between your reserves of health and magic.\n"
msgstr "你受到的所有伤害由生命和魔力储备共同承担。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/passives.txt:rampage passive"
msgid "You take an additional free step when moving towards enemies.\n"
msgstr "你朝敌人移动时会额外免费前进一步。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/passives.txt:roll passive"
msgid "<rollpage mutation>\n"
msgstr "<rollpage mutation>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/passives.txt:faith passive"
msgid ""
"You gain divine favour quickly, and greater notice is taken of any religious\n"
"transgressions you make.\n"
msgstr "你能更快地获得神恩，但宗教上的过失也会受到更多关注。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/passives.txt:wizardry passive"
msgid "Your spell success rate is improved.\n"
msgstr "你的施法成功率提高。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/passives.txt:archmagi passive"
msgid "Your spell power is increased.\n"
msgstr "你的法术强度提高。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/passives.txt:channel magic passive"
msgid ""
"You have a chance of regaining the magic spent when successfully casting a\n"
"spell, and always regain the magic spent when you miscast a spell.\n"
msgstr "成功施法时，你有一定几率收回消耗的魔力；施法失败时，则总能收回消耗的魔力。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/passives.txt:infuse magic passive"
msgid "You spend magic each time you make a melee attack, empowering your blows.\n"
msgstr "你每次近战攻击都会消耗魔力，强化打击。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:singing sword"
msgid ""
"An enchanted blade which loves nothing more than to sing to its owner, whether\n"
"they want it to or not.\n"
msgstr "一把附魔剑，最喜欢给主人唱歌，不管主人想不想听。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:sulking sword"
msgid "<Singing Sword>\n"
msgstr "<Singing Sword>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:screaming sword"
msgid "<Singing Sword>\n"
msgstr "<Singing Sword>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:wrath of trog"
msgid ""
"A bloodstained axe that was the favourite weapon of the old god Trog, before it\n"
"was lost. It induces a bloodthirsty berserker rage when used in battle, although\n"
"mere mortals who wield it will find themselves temporarily overwhelmed by Trog's\n"
"power.\n"
msgstr "这把血迹斑斑的斧头在遗失之前，曾是古神特洛戈最爱的武器。在战斗中使用它会引发嗜血的狂暴，而持用它的凡人也会暂时被特洛戈的力量压倒。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:mace of variability"
msgid ""
"A large mace said to have appeared when Xom grew bored with the predictability\n"
"of more ordinary instruments of chaos.\n"
msgstr "据说，当佐姆厌倦了寻常混沌器具的可预测性时，这柄巨大的钉头锤便出现了。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:glaive of prune"
msgid ""
"The glaive of Prune carries a terrible and insidious curse. Unless its wielder\n"
"maintains firm self-control, they are doomed to undergo a horrifying (albeit\n"
"temporary) transformation. This is normally trivial to resist, but incapacitated\n"
"wielders are certain to succumb, finding themselves nightmarishly purple, squishy,\n"
"and delicious. They can take comfort in learning that it's surprisingly hard to\n"
"injure a giant prune.\n"
msgstr "普鲁恩偃月刀带有可怕而阴险的诅咒。持用者若不能保持坚定的自制力，就注定经历一场恐怖但短暂的变形。通常很容易抵抗这道诅咒，但无法正常行动的持用者必定中招，变成噩梦般紫色、软糯而美味的东西。唯一的安慰是，一颗巨型梅干竟然很难被伤到。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:staff of olgreb"
msgid "A staff which was once wielded by the great alchemist Olgreb.\n"
msgstr "强大的炼金术士奥格雷布曾用过的一把法杖。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:crystal ball of wucad mu"
msgid ""
"A sphere of flawless crystal, shaped by countless mantras. When one focuses upon\n"
"it, the boundaries between 'self' and 'other' sometimes seem to blur.\n"
"{{\n"
"    if you.race() == \"Djinni\" then\n"
"        return \"It is utterly useless to Djinn.\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"
msgstr "一颗无瑕的水晶球，由无数真言塑成。凝神注视它时，“自我”与“他者”的边界有时似乎会变得模糊。\n{{\n    if you.race() == \"Djinni\" then\n        return \"它对灯灵完全无用。\"\n    end\n}}\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:vampire's tooth"
msgid ""
"An ivory-like quick blade that looks like it could have been crafted from the\n"
"tooth of some enormous predatory creature. It is lethally vampiric.\n"
msgstr "一把象牙般的快刃，看起来像是用某种巨型掠食生物的牙齿雕成。它拥有致命的吸血力量。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:scythe of curses"
msgid ""
"A scythe surrounded by an ominous aura of dread. It carries a terrible and\n"
"ancient curse, which it busily inflicts on both the wielder and their enemies.\n"
msgstr "一把被不祥恐惧气息笼罩的镰刀。它带有可怕而古老的诅咒，不停地将诅咒施加给持用者和敌人。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:sceptre of torment"
msgid ""
"An accursed bone sceptre, created by some unknown hellish power. When used in\n"
"combat, it causes agonising pain in all those unfortunate enough to gaze upon\n"
"it, save for the wielder.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把被诅咒的骨制节杖，由某种未知的地狱力量创造。\n"
"在战斗中使用时，它会给所有注视它的不幸者带来极度痛楚，除了持用者。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:sword of cerebov"
msgid ""
"A twisted blade, covered in eerie flames. Its demonic power burns away at the\n"
"very essence of those it is wielded against.\n"
msgstr "一把被诡异烈焰覆盖的扭曲剑刃。它的恶魔之力能灼蚀受击者的本质。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:orb of dispater"
msgid ""
"An orb pulsing with unholy energies, granting the power to unleash damnation\n"
"when held — although not without draining the wielder's vitality in the\n"
"process. It carries with it some of the corrosive malice of the Iron City of\n"
"Dis.\n"
msgstr "一颗涌动着邪恶能量的宝珠。持有它便能释放天谴，但也会在过程中耗损持用者的生命力。它带着狄斯铁城那腐蚀万物的恶意。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:sceptre of asmodeus"
msgid ""
"A bright ruby sceptre, carrying some of the powers of the arch-fiend Asmodeus.\n"
"It may call forth fiery demons from their infernal home to do the wielder's\n"
"bidding.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把明亮的红宝石节杖，带有魔王阿斯蒙蒂斯的某些力量。\n"
"持有者能凭借它召唤、号令来自地狱巢穴的火系恶魔。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:faerie dragon scales"
msgid ""
"An enchanted suit of armour created from the scales of a rare breed of dragon,\n"
"now thought to be extinct. This prized relic is now one of the last proofs that\n"
"the vividly coloured faerie dragons ever existed.\n"
msgstr "一套以稀有龙种的鳞片制成的附魔防具。这个龙种如今被认为已经灭绝；这件珍贵遗物，是色彩鲜艳的仙灵龙曾经存在过的最后证据之一。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:demon blade \"bloodbane\""
msgid ""
"A blade forged in Hell by the sacrifice of countless tortured souls. It\n"
"inflicts the rage and suffering of those souls upon its wielder.\n"
msgstr ""
"通过献祭无数受难灵魂而在地狱锻造出的一把剑。\n"
"它将那些灵魂的狂怒和苦难都施加到持有者的身上。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:scimitar of flaming death"
msgid ""
"A scimitar with a mysteriously smoking blade. Occasionally its heat leaks out,\n"
"covering opponents in magical flame.\n"
msgstr "一把刀刃神秘地冒着烟的弯刀。它的热量偶尔会泄出，将敌人裹在魔法火焰之中。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:eveningstar \"brilliance\""
msgid ""
"Soon after falling, Yredelemnul attempted to twist holy energy into a dark\n"
"mockery of itself, turning it against its progenitors and weakening it against\n"
"undead and demons. It was discovered too late that such a complete perversion\n"
"was uncontrollable; the foul flame destabilised or destroyed everything it was\n"
"infused into, except for several demonic test subjects and one stolen holy\n"
"weapon. A lesser, and more stable, version of the dark energy proved more\n"
"workable, and became Yredelemnul's umbra.\n"
"\n"
"This is that weapon: an eveningstar with its light long fled, despite its name,\n"
"and a shadow that repulses those its light used to comfort...\n"
msgstr "堕落后不久，伊莱德莱姆努尔试图将神圣能量扭曲为自身的黑暗讽刺，使其反过来伤害创造它的存在，却不再擅长伤害亡灵和恶魔。等到发现这种彻底的亵渎无法控制时，已经太迟了：污秽烈焰使几乎所有灌注之物失稳或毁灭，唯有几个恶魔试验体和一件盗来的神圣武器幸免。较弱却更稳定的黑暗能量最终证明更为可用，成为伊莱德莱姆努尔的幽影。\n\n这正是那件武器：尽管名为“辉煌”，这柄昏星锤的光芒早已消逝。它的阴影排斥着那些曾受其光芒慰藉的存在……\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:demon blade \"leech\""
msgid ""
"A blade forged in Hell by the sacrifice of countless tortured souls. It fills\n"
"its wielder with the rage and suffering of those souls, and gorges itself\n"
"further on drained life force every time it strikes, leaving behind a mess of\n"
"blood and gore.\n"
msgstr ""
"通过献祭无数受难灵魂而在地狱锻造出的一把剑。\n"
"它让那些灵魂的愤怒和痛苦充斥着它的持有者，\n"
"每次攻击时，它都会吸取生命力，留下一团血污。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:dagger of chilly death"
msgid ""
"A dagger made of one huge shard of sapphire. It covers opponents in ice,\n"
"slowing down their movement somewhat.\n"
msgstr "这把匕首由一整块巨型蓝宝石制成。它将冰覆盖在敌人身上，使他们的移动有所迟缓。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:dagger \"morg\""
msgid ""
"An ugly rusty dagger. Many years ago it was the property of a powerful mage\n"
"called Boris. He got lost in the Dungeon while seeking the Orb.\n"
msgstr "一把丑陋、生锈的匕首。很多年前为一位名叫鲍里斯的强大法师所有。\n他在地下城中搜寻佐特宝珠时失踪了。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:scythe \"finisher\""
msgid ""
"A long and exceedingly sharp scythe, capable of eviscerating in a single blow.\n"
"Its extraordinary speed is the work of a mad wizard, who spent years refining\n"
"it before discarding it in a fit of rage.\n"
"\n"
"The blade looses a low keen as it cuts through the air.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把锋利的长镰刀，一击就能将内脏掏出。\n"
"它那非凡的速度是出自一个疯狂的巫师的杰作，\n"
"他花了数年时间提炼它，却一怒之下将其丢弃。\n"
"\n"
"刀刃划过空气，留下咻咻的声音。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:greatsling \"punk\""
msgid ""
"A sling made of weird green leather, oozing corrosive slime. Originally the\n"
"weapon of a notorious mischief-maker and general scamp, it's since fallen into\n"
"less savoury hands.\n"
msgstr "一条用古怪的绿色皮革制成、渗出腐蚀黏液的投石索。它原本属于一个臭名昭著、四处捣乱的恶作剧高手，后来又落入了更不堪的人手中。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:longbow \"zephyr\""
msgid ""
"This bow was woven from the air itself by Eiolaiphi the air mage as a gift for\n"
"one of the children of Uskayaw. The bow can be pulled with incredible speed,\n"
"and it launches swift and true. It is also nearly indestructible, which is\n"
"fortunate given that the original owner was ripped to pieces by jealous\n"
"celebrants.\n"
msgstr "气系法师埃奥莱菲用空气本身编织了这张弓，作为礼物送给阿斯卡亚的一位子嗣。它能以惊人的速度拉开，射出的箭又快又准。它也几乎坚不可摧，幸而如此，因为原主人已被嫉妒的狂欢者撕成碎片。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:giant club \"skullcrusher\""
msgid ""
"A massive enchanted cudgel that augments the already considerable strength of\n"
"anyone mighty enough to wield it.\n"
msgstr "一根巨大的附魔木棒。任何强壮到足以挥舞它的人，都会发现自己本就惊人的力量更上一层楼。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:glaive of the guard"
msgid ""
"A glaive commissioned several years ago by a wealthy queen fearful for the\n"
"safety of her vast treasury. No foe, the smith promised, could defeat a guard\n"
"wielding such a weapon!\n"
"\n"
"It was stolen a few months later, along with the rest of the queen's treasury;\n"
"the guard, it transpired, had been caught napping. Still, it should serve more\n"
"than adequately in the hands of a waking user.\n"
msgstr "几年前，一位富有的女王担心庞大国库的安全，委托打造了这把偃月刀。铁匠保证，没有敌人能击败手持此刀的卫兵！\n\n几个月后，它和女王金库里的其他财宝一起被盗。事后发现，卫兵当时正在打盹。不过，交给醒着的人使用，它应该仍绰绰有余。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:zealot's sword"
msgid ""
"A sword made of one huge piece of crystal. Legend says it was the Shining One's\n"
"gift to a worshipper. This blade is notorious for inducing bloodthirsty rage in\n"
"both the wielder and all of their followers.\n"
msgstr ""
"这把剑由一大块巨型水晶制成。传言是光明神赐予其信徒的。\n"
"这把剑因在持用者及其所有追随者中引起嗜血的狂暴而臭名昭著。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:arbalest \"damnation\""
msgid ""
"An unholy crossbow, forged in the fires of Gehenna. It imbues the bolts it\n"
"fires with the raw power of its namesake. Thankfully, the blasts this weapon\n"
"produces never harm the one firing.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把邪恶的弩，在欣嫩谷的火中锻造而成。它将与它同名的原力注入了弩箭。\n"
"值得庆幸的是，这把武器产生的爆炸不会对开火的人造成伤害。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:sword of the dread knight"
msgid ""
"An adamantine great sword. Its first wielder was a worshipper of Yredelemnul\n"
"who eschewed the use of magic in combat, preferring to destroy her enemies with\n"
"brute force. Unfortunately for her, not all of her opponents shared her\n"
"limitations.\n"
"\n"
"It has felled countless great warriors under her grip, and the souls of those\n"
"who had their lives taken beckon it to take even more under its new owner.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把精金巨剑。最初的持用者是一名伊莱德莱姆努尔信徒，她拒绝在战斗中使用魔法，宁愿用蛮力消灭敌人。不幸的是，并非所有对手都像她这样自我设限。\n"
"\n"
"这把剑在她手中斩杀了无数伟大战士。那些被夺去生命的灵魂仍在呼唤，催促它在新主人手中收割更多性命。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:morningstar \"eos\""
msgid ""
"A jewelled morningstar, glowing brightly with the light of the dawn. It\n"
"illuminates the dungeon's recesses, revealing the machinations of those who\n"
"would prefer to stay invisible.\n"
msgstr "一把镶有宝石的晨星锤，在曙光下熠熠生辉。\n它照亮了地下城的幽深处，令那些想要隐身的怪物的图谋无所遁形。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:spear of the botono"
msgid ""
"A dark and malign artefact. It increases the potency of hexes cast by anyone\n"
"unwise enough to risk wielding it.\n"
msgstr "一把黑暗、邪恶的神器。它能强化那些不理智的要持用它的人施放妖术。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:trident of the octopus king"
msgid ""
"A trident stolen many years ago from the Octopus King's garden. Luckily, he\n"
"seems to be in no hurry to get it back.\n"
msgstr "一把多年前从章鱼王的花园中偷来的三叉戟。幸运的是，他似乎不急于寻回。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:mithril axe \"arga\""
msgid "A beautiful mithril axe, probably lost by some dwarven hero.\n"
msgstr "一把精致的秘银斧，这大概是某个矮人英雄遗落的武器吧。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:elemental staff"
msgid ""
"A powerful staff which used to belong to the leader of the Guild of Five\n"
"Elements. It is imbued with protective and offensive enhancements from all\n"
"the elemental schools of magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"一支强大的法杖，曾经属于五行会的会长。\n"
"它注入了各种元素魔法学派的进攻和防御性增益。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:heavy crossbow \"sniper\""
msgid ""
"The sacred weapon of Toth-Mos, first apostle of the god Ashenzari. It grants\n"
"the wielder a fraction of Ashenzari's own vision, ensuring that every shot will\n"
"land true.\n"
msgstr "这是艾申扎利首位使徒托斯莫斯的神圣武器。它让持用者获得艾申扎利自身视野的一小部分，确保每一发都准确命中。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:longbow \"piercer\""
msgid "An exceptionally large metal longbow.\n"
msgstr "一张特别大的金属长弓。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:blowgun of the assassin"
msgid ""
"This blowgun seems to guide the needle to seek the most lethal point to hit\n"
"the target, packing a nasty punch.\n"
msgstr "这把吹矢枪似乎可以引导飞针寻找最薄弱的点，发出重击。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:lance \"wyrmbane\""
msgid ""
"An enchanted lance deadly to all dragonkind. It grows more powerful every time\n"
"it inflicts a killing blow on a strong dragon. The more powerful it grows, the\n"
"harder it will be to find a worthy opponent.\n"
msgstr "一把对所有龙类都极为致命的附魔骑枪。每当它给予一头强大的龙致命一击，威力就会增强。它越强，就越难找到与之相称的对手。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:spriggan's knife"
msgid ""
"A dainty little knife which was made by Spriggans, or for Spriggans, or\n"
"possibly from Spriggans. Anyway, it's in some way associated with those fey\n"
"folk.\n"
msgstr "一把精巧的小刀，可能是由斯普利根打造、为斯普利根打造，甚至用斯普利根打造。总之，它和那些精怪多少有些关系。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:plutonium sword"
msgid ""
"A triple sword made of weird glowing metal. It irradiates those it strikes,\n"
"causing a range of unpredictable effects — if they survive the impact of the\n"
"blade itself, that is.\n"
msgstr "一把由奇异发光金属制成的三重剑。它会辐照受击者，产生种种难以预料的效果——当然，前提是对方先能在剑刃的打击下活下来。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:great mace \"undeadhunter\""
msgid ""
"A weapon imbued with magic to disrupt and destroy the forces binding undead\n"
"creatures together. Legends say that, long ago, a lich lord created many\n"
"such weapons to ensure the loyalty of his undead servants. Sadly, this mace\n"
"might be the last one left.\n"
msgstr "一件灌注魔法的武器，能瓦解并摧毁维系亡灵身体的力量。传说很久以前，一位巫妖领主打造了许多这样的武器，以确保亡灵仆从忠诚。遗憾的是，这柄巨型钉头锤可能已是最后一件。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:whip \"snakebite\""
msgid ""
"A double-ended whip made from the cured hides of black mambas, and enchanted\n"
"with toxins ranging from ordinary venoms to asphyxiating curare.\n"
msgstr "一种由黑曼巴蛇的皮制成的双端鞭，附有从普通的毒液到令人窒息的箭毒碱毒素。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:knife of accuracy"
msgid "It is almost unerringly accurate.\n"
msgstr "它几乎百发百中。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:lehudib's crystal spear"
msgid ""
"Presumably this relic led to the invention of the famous spell, or maybe the\n"
"other way around.\n"
msgstr "也许这件遗物启发了那道著名法术的发明，也可能恰好相反。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:captain's cutlass"
msgid ""
"An infamous weapon, once used by a vile pirate captain to slaughter countless\n"
"innocents. He finally met his destiny when a kraken swallowed his ship, and the\n"
"cutlass was thought to be lost with him.\n"
msgstr "曾经有个邪恶的海盗船长用这件臭名昭著的武器杀了无数的无辜之人。\n当一只海妖吞下他的船时，他终于碰到了自己的劫数，\n而那把短弯刀曾被认为和他一样，不知所踪。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:storm bow"
msgid "A longbow with the colour of dark rain clouds that fires arrows like lightning.\n"
msgstr "一张阴暗的雨云色的长弓，能射出闪电般的箭。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:tower shield of ignorance"
msgid ""
"A shield unearthed from the remains of a ruined city. It bears an inscription\n"
"written in an ancient language. Scholars and wise men laboured for countless\n"
"hours to decipher it, and in time, a translation was finally settled on:\n"
"\n"
"\"With a shield like this, who needs to think?\"\n"
msgstr ""
"从城市废墟中出土的盾牌。上面有用古文书写的铭文。\n"
"学者和智者们花费了无数的时间来破译它，最终，译文敲定了：\n"
"\n"
"“有了这样的盾牌，谁需要思考？”\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:robe of augmentation"
msgid ""
"A variegated robe, woven with enchantments to enhance the wearer's physical and\n"
"mental abilities. Its creators wove in strands of hair from a hundred different\n"
"animals, each chosen for the unique strengths it could grant the robe's wearer.\n"
msgstr ""
"一件斑驳的长袍，织入了魔法，以增强穿着者的身心。\n"
"它的制造者用百种不同动物的毛发进行编织，\n"
"每种动物的毛发都能赋予穿着者独特的力量。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:cloak of the thief"
msgid ""
"A pitch-black cloak which allows its wearer to excel in the arts of thievery.\n"
"Even the clumsy will find their footsteps softer and the shouts of their\n"
"adversaries less attention-getting.\n"
msgstr "一件漆黑的披风，使穿戴者精于盗贼技艺。即使是笨手笨脚的人，也会发现自己的脚步更轻，敌人的叫喊也不那么容易引起注意。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:tower shield \"bullseye\""
msgid "Just in case you had trouble getting hit.\n"
msgstr "以防你苦于没人打得中你。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:crown of dyrovepreva"
msgid ""
"A large circlet of dull bronze, set with a dazzling array of gemstones. It was\n"
"first worn by a prince of the Titans, who sought protection from the incessant\n"
"warfare between his fellow princes. In practice, the main effect of the\n"
"artefact was to unite his rivals against him.\n"
msgstr ""
"一顶暗色青铜铸成的巨大王冠，镶嵌着许多光彩夺目的宝石。\n"
"一位泰坦族的王子曾戴过它，希望它能在王位之争中保护自己。\n"
"实际上，这件神器的主要效果是让他的对手联合起来对抗他。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:hat of the bear spirit"
msgid ""
"A fur hat once owned by Ukta, a powerful ogre shaman. It houses the spirit of\n"
"an especially mighty bear, whose rages devastated the ogres until it was slain.\n"
msgstr "一顶曾属于强大食人魔萨满乌克塔的毛皮帽。里面寄宿着一头极其强壮的熊的灵魂。这头熊生前狂怒肆虐，曾重创食人魔，直到最终被杀死。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:robe of misfortune"
msgid "A splendid flowing robe of fur and silk whose lucky colour has faded.\n"
msgstr "一件以毛皮与丝绸制成、华美飘逸的长袍，象征幸运的色彩已然褪去。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:cloak of flash"
msgid "A cloak that twitches and jerks without any intervention.\n"
msgstr "一件会自行抽动的披风。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:hood of the assassin"
msgid ""
"A soft hood, enchanted by members of the Assassin's Guild to allow the wearer\n"
"to sense potential victims nearby, and to easily spot vulnerabilities after\n"
"closing in on them.\n"
msgstr "一顶柔软的兜帽，由刺客公会成员附魔，使穿戴者能够感知附近潜在的猎物，并在接近后轻易发现其弱点。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:lear's hauberk"
msgid ""
"A well-made golden hauberk that covers all of its wearer's body parts. It\n"
"includes a chainmail coif, chausses and maille gauntlets.\n"
msgstr "一件做工精良、覆盖穿戴者全身的黄金锁子甲，包括锁子头巾、锁子腿甲和锁子护手。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:skin of zhor"
msgid ""
"The {{\n"
"    if you.can_smell() then\n"
"        return \"smelly \"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}skin of some strange animal, native to cold and distant lands. It radiates\n"
"the chill of its native habitat.\n"
msgstr ""
"一件{{\n"
"    if you.can_smell() then\n"
"        return \"难闻的\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}毛皮，源于某种在寒冷而遥远的地方生长的奇怪动物。它散发着原栖息地的寒意。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:salamander hide armour"
msgid ""
"Most salamanders' bodies are consigned to the fiery depths from which they\n"
"sprang. Rarely, though, salamanders instead preserve the skins of those that\n"
"passed. The runes and decorations on this hide suggest it once belonged to a\n"
"respected warrior or priest - perhaps even a king. The fiery spirit remains in\n"
"the skin, granting its power to the wearer.\n"
msgstr "大多数沙罗曼蛇死后，尸体都会被送回它们诞生的火焰深渊。不过，沙罗曼蛇偶尔也会保存逝者的皮。皮上的符文和装饰表明，它曾属于一位受敬重的战士或祭司，甚至可能是一位王者。炽热的灵魂仍留在皮中，将力量赋予穿戴者。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:gauntlets of war"
msgid ""
"A pair of thick steel gauntlets. They were Okawaru's reward for a mighty\n"
"warlord. The owner is destined to die in battle, but what a death it will be!\n"
msgstr "一副厚重的钢护手，是奥格瓦如赐给一位强大军阀的奖赏。它的主人注定战死，但那将是何等壮烈的死亡！\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:shield of resistance"
msgid ""
"A bronze shield, looking almost exactly like a tortoise's shell. It was built\n"
"by the adherents of an obscure minor faith, who imbued it with the power of\n"
"their god. As the god is said to, this shield protects against sword and sling,\n"
"frost and flame.\n"
msgstr "一面形状几乎与龟壳完全相同的青铜盾。一个鲜为人知的小教派打造了它，并灌注了所信神祇的力量。据说那位神能抵御刀剑与投石、寒霜与烈焰，而这面盾也能如此。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:robe of folly"
msgid ""
"A dull grey robe. It is enchanted to provide mages with immeasurable power,\n"
"and more than a little overconfidence...\n"
msgstr "一件暗灰色长袍。它为法师们带来了不可估量的力量，还有过分的自信……\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:maxwell's patent armour"
msgid ""
"A suit of armour created by the famous inventor Maxwell, providing unparalleled\n"
"protective qualities at a very affordable price. His unorthodox materials left\n"
"it with certain shortcomings, but he's yet to have anyone come back for a\n"
"refund.\n"
msgstr ""
"由著名发明家麦克斯韦制造的一套铠甲，以非常实惠的价格提供无与伦比的防护性能。\n"
"他用的非正统材料给它带来了一定的缺陷，但还没有人回来退款。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:mask of the dragon"
msgid ""
"The mask of the High Priest of ancient Erebora. In ancient times, the gods of\n"
"the Ereborans ceased to answer their prayers, and in desperation, the people\n"
"turned to the forbidden worship of dragons. Now, of their works, only this mask\n"
"remains.\n"
msgstr "古代埃瑞博拉大祭司的面具。彼时，埃瑞博拉人的诸神不再回应祈祷，绝望的人民便转向遭到禁止的龙崇拜。如今，他们的造物只剩这副面具。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:robe of night"
msgid ""
"A long black robe made of strange glossy material. It shrouds its wearer in\n"
"darkness, reducing the range of vision. According to legend, it was the gift\n"
"of Rutra, a renowned demigoddess of the night, to one of her followers.\n"
msgstr "一件由奇异光滑材料制成的黑色长袍。它将穿戴者笼罩在黑暗中，缩小视野。传说这是著名的暗夜半女神鲁特拉送给一位追随者的礼物。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:scales of the dragon king"
msgid ""
"A suit of armour created from the enchanted scales of a once-mighty king of\n"
"dragons. In his time, titans and lesser dragons struggled with him in vain —\n"
"but as with all things, even he was eventually cast down and undone. Of his\n"
"life and deeds, this is all that remains.\n"
msgstr "一套以昔日强大龙王的附魔鳞片制成的防具。它在世时，泰坦与较弱的龙都无法与之抗衡。然而，如同世间万物，它最终也遭到推翻与毁灭。关于它的一生与功业，只剩下这件遗物。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:hat of the alchemist"
msgid ""
"A dirty hat. It bears signs of surviving many weird explosions, which suggests\n"
"it may have means of protecting the head inside from the risks involved with\n"
"alchemy experiments.\n"
msgstr ""
"一顶肮脏的帽子。它似乎经过许多次奇怪的爆炸，但还是幸存下来，由此来看，\n"
"这顶帽子应该能在碰到炼金实验事故时保护下面的脑袋不受伤害。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:fencer's gloves"
msgid "A pair of gloves made of white silk.\n"
msgstr "一副用白色丝绸织成的手套。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:cloak of starlight"
msgid ""
"A phosphorescent cloak, woven of pure light beams. The ripples of its folds\n"
"as the wearer leaps and swerves in combat may dazzle those who gaze on it.\n"
msgstr "一件由纯粹光束织成、泛着磷光的披风。穿戴者在战斗中跳跃闪转时，衣褶的波动可能让注视者眼花缭乱。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:ratskin cloak"
msgid ""
"A cloak stitched from the hides of hundreds of hell rats by an enchantress with\n"
"far too much time on her hands. Many more rats remain somehow concealed within\n"
"it, and may scurry out to assist the wearer.\n"
msgstr ""
"有个女巫闲得无聊，用数百只地狱鼠的皮缝制出这件披风。\n"
"还有更多的老鼠不知怎的藏在里面，它们可能会窜出来帮助穿戴者。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:shield of the gong"
msgid ""
"A heavy bronze gong that can be worn as a shield. Locked away in a temple for\n"
"many years, its bearer is shielded by decades of accumulated prayer.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个沉重的铜锣，可当盾牌用。\n"
"它被锁在寺庙里多年，它的持用者将承载着几十年积累的祈祷的庇佑。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:amulet of the air"
msgid ""
"A sky-blue amulet, suffused with enchantments that protect the wearer and make\n"
"their Air spells more powerful. Its creator lacked just one thing: a steady\n"
"hand.\n"
msgstr "一枚天蓝色护身符，蕴含着保护佩戴者、增强其气系法术的魔力。它的创造者只缺一样东西：一双稳健的手。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:ring of shadows"
msgid "A black ring that can make its wearer one with the shadows.\n"
msgstr "一枚黑色的戒指，它能使佩戴者融入阴影。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:amulet of cekugob"
msgid ""
"A strange-looking piece of crystal on an ordinary-looking string, with an odd\n"
"selection of powers.\n"
msgstr "一块模样奇特的水晶，系在一根普通的细绳上，拥有一组古怪的能力。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:amulet of the four winds"
msgid ""
"A pendant made of purest jade. It grants its wearer immense willpower and\n"
"mental fortitude.\n"
msgstr "一枚以至纯美玉制成的吊坠，赋予佩戴者强大的意志与精神韧性。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:necklace of bloodlust"
msgid ""
"A necklace made of bloodstained human and animal teeth, and something that\n"
"appears to be a piece of spine.\n"
msgstr "一条串着沾有血迹的各种人与野兽的牙齿的项链，似乎还有一段被砍下来的脊椎骨。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:ring of the hare"
msgid ""
"An unadorned malachite ring, half of an ancient pair. Its wearer is\n"
"exceptionally difficult to catch.\n"
msgstr "一枚朴实无华的孔雀石戒指，是一对古老戒指中的一只。佩戴了它，很难被追上。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:ring of the tortoise"
msgid ""
"A rough-hewn aquamarine ring, half of an ancient pair. Its wearer is\n"
"exceptionally difficult to harm.\n"
msgstr "一枚粗糙的海蓝宝石戒指，是一对古老戒指中的一只。佩戴了它，很难受到伤害。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:ring of the mage"
msgid ""
"An enchanted sapphire, inset into a ring. It aids the spellcasting of its\n"
"wearer.\n"
msgstr "这枚戒指，镶着一颗有魔力的蓝宝石。它能强化佩戴者的施法能力。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:brooch of shielding"
msgid ""
"A brooch with an intricate inlaid design, providing a range of magical\n"
"protections. Back in the good old days, every adventurer had one of these handy\n"
"devices. That, and a pony.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个设计复杂的胸针，提供一系列魔法保护。\n"
"从前，所有的冒险者都会带一个这种称手的东西。还有一匹小马。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:robe of clouds"
msgid ""
"A robe of a material as nebulous and insubstantial as the clouds. It whips the\n"
"air around it up into a furious storm as it ripples and swirls.\n"
msgstr ""
"这件长袍的材质像是云做的一样，模糊而虚幻。\n"
"当它泛起涟漪和漩涡时，它会将周围的空气搅成一场猛烈的风暴。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:hat of pondering"
msgid ""
"The favourite hat of the slug wizard Gastronok, stained with reddish slime and\n"
"enchanted to aid in his arcane pondering. It has been specially enchanted to\n"
"protect against the desiccating effects of salt.\n"
msgstr ""
"鼻涕虫巫师加斯特罗诺克最喜欢的帽子，\n"
"沾有的红色黏液和附着的魔力有助于他那神秘的思考。\n"
"它被特地施了魔法以防盐的干燥效果。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:obsidian axe"
msgid ""
"An axe with a powerful curse placed on it by one of the lords of Pandemonium,\n"
"so that unsuspecting adventurers would unleash demons into this world. Beware,\n"
"for it has ways of taking its wielder under its command...\n"
msgstr ""
"一位魔窟领主在这把斧头上施加了一道诅咒，\n"
"为的就是让你这样莽撞的冒险者把恶魔释放到这个世界中。\n"
"当心，它能够操纵持用者的行动……\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:consecrated labrys"
msgid ""
"An axe with a delicate blessing placed on it by one of the sacred Seraphim,\n"
"so that worthy adventurers would rid this world of demons. Rejoice, for it has\n"
"ways of bringing courage to its wielder in even the darkest places...\n"
msgstr ""
"这把斧头上有着神圣的炽天使的祝福，这样受赏识的冒险者就能斩除世上的恶魔。\n"
"欢欣吧，因为即使在最黑暗的地方，它也能给持用者带来勇气……\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:lightning scales"
msgid ""
"A set of armoured plates assembled to protect a creature with a long, scaly\n"
"lower body. Faintly crackling with electricity, they supercharge their wearer's\n"
"ability to cover distance.\n"
msgstr "一套为下半身修长且覆有鳞片的生物打造的身甲。它发出轻微的电流噼啪声，使穿戴者的移动能力大幅增强。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:black knight's barding"
msgid ""
"A heavy barding made from pitch-black steel and inlaid with plates of black\n"
"diamond. It once protected the steed of the Black Knight during their reign of\n"
"terror. Those who wear it become partially undead, gaining some of the benefits\n"
"without the unfortunate downsides, although the great weight of metal and stone\n"
"slows the wearer somewhat.\n"
msgstr "一件以漆黑钢铁制成、嵌有黑钻石片的沉重身甲。黑骑士施行恐怖统治时，它曾保护其坐骑。穿戴者会部分化为亡灵，获得一些相应的好处，却不必承受那些不幸的弱点。不过，金属与石头的巨大重量会略微拖慢穿戴者。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:amulet of vitality"
msgid ""
"A jewelled amulet famed for its powers of resilience and recuperation. Its\n"
"greatest notoriety came from its use by the dread necromancer Borgnjor, who\n"
"relied upon it to maintain her slender hold on life. After her final demise,\n"
"the amulet vanished from the pages of history.\n"
msgstr "一枚以坚韧和恢复能力闻名的宝石护身符。它最出名的事迹，是曾被可怕的死灵法师博格尼尔用来维持岌岌可危的生命。她最终死去后，这枚护身符也从史书中消失了。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:autumn katana"
msgid ""
"An exquisitely crafted sword. Its blade is so sharp that it can cut through\n"
"space itself.\n"
msgstr "一把做工精致的剑。它的刀刃非常锋利，甚至可以切开空间。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:shillelagh \"devastator\""
msgid "A wooden cudgel, loaded with more than just lead.\n"
msgstr "这根木棍，灌的可不仅仅是铅。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:dragonskin cloak"
msgid ""
"An opalescent cloak gleaming with the colours of all kinds of dragons. It\n"
"imbues the wearer with draconic resistances, although somewhat unreliably.\n"
msgstr ""
"这件乳白色的披风上闪烁着各种龙的颜色。\n"
"它为穿戴者注入了龙的抗性，但效果不是很可靠。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:ring of the octopus king"
msgid ""
"One of the eight rings once worn by the Octopus King and now scattered across\n"
"the land. Each has its own unique enchantment.\n"
msgstr ""
"章鱼王曾经戴过八枚戒指，现在散布在这片土地上，这是其中的一枚。\n"
"每个都有独特的魔力。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:axe of woe"
msgid ""
"As you hold this axe your mind does not feel fully your own. Your body begins\n"
"to exhibit strength far beyond its capabilities, and your movements become\n"
"guided by Makhleb.\n"
msgstr "握住这柄斧头时，你感觉自己的心智似乎不再完全属于自己。身体开始展现远超极限的力量，动作也受马科列布引导。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:moon troll leather armour"
msgid ""
"A suit of armour rumoured to have been created by enchanting the hide of a\n"
"now-extinct species of troll. Whether the name rings true or is merely\n"
"appropriated to add mystique is something of a mystery. The armour's innate\n"
"powers of regeneration and magical protection, however, are hard to dispute.\n"
msgstr "据说，这件皮甲由一种现已灭绝的巨魔皮施法制成。其名称究竟确有其事，还是仅为增添神秘色彩，至今仍是个谜。不过，它固有的再生与魔法防护能力确凿无疑。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:macabre finger necklace"
msgid ""
"An ugly dangling finger on a string. Everything about it reeks of malign\n"
"influences... but it's hard to avoid thinking that it would look better with a\n"
"ring on it.\n"
msgstr ""
"一根丑陋的手指挂在绳子上。\n"
"它的一切都散发着邪恶的影响力……但人们不禁会想，如果它戴了戒指看起来会更好。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:boots of the spider"
msgid "A novel pair of boots invented by a suitor of Arachne.\n"
msgstr "由一个阿拉克涅的追求者发明的新奇的靴子。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:dark maul"
msgid ""
"A large, iron-shod maul specialised for dealing massively powerful blows. Such\n"
"power comes at a price: the maul's head is so heavy it takes a great length of\n"
"time to lift it up for another swing.\n"
msgstr "一把包铁的大槌，专为打出威力惊人的重击而造。力量也有代价：槌头重得惊人，每次挥击后，都要花很长时间才能再次举起。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:hat of the high council"
msgid ""
"A relic of some ancient wizarding war. Centuries later, it still crackles with\n"
"effects from the residual hexes and magical energies it was once subjected to\n"
"on a daily basis; spellcasters able to get a handle on its power, however, will\n"
"find it enhances the power of their spells.\n"
msgstr "一场古代巫师战争的遗物。数百年后，当年日复一日承受的妖术和魔法能量仍残留其上，噼啪作响。不过，能掌握其中力量的施法者，会发现自己的法术得到增强。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:arc blade"
msgid ""
"A blade somehow crafted from pure electricity. It arcs wildly between the\n"
"wielder and their foes as it strikes.\n"
msgstr ""
"这是一把用纯电制作的刀刃。\n"
"当它攻击时，它会在持用者和他们的敌人之间疯狂地释放电弧。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:demon whip \"spellbinder\""
msgid ""
"A weapon said to have once been used to keep unruly imprisoned wizards in line;\n"
"it violently disrupts the flow of magic around it.\n"
msgstr "一把据说用来管束不守法的巫师囚犯的武器；它猛烈地扰乱了周围的魔法流动。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:lajatang of order"
msgid ""
"A silver-bladed lajatang, once bestowed upon a favoured worshipper of Zin. It\n"
"became the most prized weapon of the many priests of Zin. After their order was\n"
"destroyed, it fell into disuse and vanished from history.\n"
msgstr "一把银刃月牙铲，曾赐予一位备受宠爱的辛信徒，后来成为众多辛祭司最珍爱的武器。教团遭到摧毁后，它逐渐被弃用，并从历史中消失。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:great mace \"firestarter\""
msgid ""
"A huge mace imbued with potent fire magic. It fills those it strikes with an\n"
"inner flame, and offers some protection against the resulting devastation.\n"
msgstr "一柄灌注强大火系魔法的巨型钉头锤。它使受击者充满心火，并保护持用者免受部分由此引发的破坏。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:orange crystal plate armour"
msgid ""
"A suit of armour carved from transparent orange crystal. It provides remarkable\n"
"protection for both mind and body. The wearer can even channel psychic energies\n"
"through the crystal itself, enhancing their magical abilities. However, it's\n"
"rather heavy...\n"
msgstr "一套用透明的橙色水晶雕刻而成的防具。可以为肉体和心灵提供卓越的保护能力。\n穿戴者甚至可以通过水晶引导精神力量来增强魔法能力。但是相当重……\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:majin-bo"
msgid ""
"A staff inhabited by a mighty demon, tricked and trapped in this form long ago.\n"
"To survive, she now offers great arcane power in a terrible bargain: in\n"
"exchange for a tiny portion of the caster's life essence, taken every time its\n"
"wielder casts a spell, she will redirect the life essence of creatures damaged\n"
"by the spell to the caster.\n"
msgstr "一根寄宿着强大恶魔的法杖。她很久以前遭到欺骗，被困在这副形体中。如今，为了生存，她以强大的奥术力量换取一桩可怕的交易：持用者每次施法，她都会抽取其少量生命精华，作为回报，则将被法术伤害的生物的生命精华导向施法者。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:pair of quick blades \"gyre\" and \"gimble\""
msgid ""
"Two quick blades joined by a chain. Swinging one compels the wielder to swing\n"
"the other, as if they have minds of their own.\n"
msgstr ""
"两个由链条连接的快刃。\n"
"挥动一个会迫使持有者挥动另一个，仿佛它们有自己的想法一样。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:maxwell's etheric cage"
msgid ""
"A fine mesh cage designed to capture magical energy. Experimental notes suggest\n"
"that research was abandoned when the cage began to capture magical\n"
"contamination almost as effectively. Anyone reckless enough to place it on\n"
"their head would find their magic regeneration dramatically increased, at the\n"
"cost of multiplying any magical contamination received.\n"
msgstr "一个用于捕捉魔法能量的精细网笼。实验笔记表明，当它几乎同样高效地开始捕获魔法污染时，相关研究便被放弃。胆敢把它戴在头上的人，会发现魔力恢复速度大幅提高，代价则是所受魔法污染成倍增加。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:crown of eternal torment"
msgid ""
"A gold crown set with jet-black gems. It permanently afflicts its wearer with\n"
"agonising pain, substantially reducing their resilience but rendering them\n"
"immune to further torments.\n"
msgstr "一顶镶有漆黑宝石的金冠。它使佩戴者永久遭受剧痛，大幅削弱其承受伤害的能力，却也使其免受进一步的痛苦折磨。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:robe of vines"
msgid ""
"A robe woven of living vines. The vines form a symbiotic relationship with\n"
"their wearer, greatly increasing their regeneration, but preventing them from\n"
"being healed by potions.\n"
msgstr ""
"一件用活的藤蔓编织而成的长袍。藤蔓与穿戴者形成了共生关系，\n"
"大幅增强穿戴者的恢复能力，但是无法再通过药水获得治疗。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:kryia's mail coat"
msgid ""
"A coat of armour said to have been forged for Queen Kryia in her old age. She\n"
"continued to insist on leading her armies from the front even into her dotage,\n"
"and as her aging body failed her, this coat helped to enhance the healing\n"
"draughts that kept her alive.\n"
msgstr "据说，这件链甲是为晚年的克里亚女王打造的。直到老迈昏聩，她仍坚持身先士卒。随着衰老的身体渐渐不支，这件链甲增强了维持她生命的治疗药剂。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:frozen axe \"frostbite\""
msgid ""
"A massive axe that looks like it was carved from a glacier, or possibly calved\n"
"from one. It leaves ice crystals in its wake as it swings through the air.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把巨大的斧头，像是在冰川上雕刻的，或是从冰川上崩裂下来的。\n"
"在空中挥舞它，会留下冰晶。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:armour of talos"
msgid ""
"A huge and weighty suit of bronze plate armour. Only one with a correspondingly\n"
"huge body can wear it.\n"
msgstr "一套巨大而沉重的青铜板甲，只有身躯同样巨大的人才能穿戴。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:warlock's mirror"
msgid ""
"A handheld array of hexagonal mirrors, synthesised from a truly exotic\n"
"substance and polished to a blinding sheen.\n"
msgstr "一组可手持的六角镜，由极为奇异的物质合成，抛光得耀眼夺目。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:amulet of invisibility"
msgid "An amulet that can be activated to render its wearer invisible.\n"
msgstr "一枚可以发动、使佩戴者隐形的护身符。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:maxwell's thermic engine"
msgid ""
"A strange sword, one blade blistering hot and the other icy cold. When it hits\n"
"its target the thermal gradient increases. What causes this effect is unknown\n"
"but it is rumoured that otherworldly forces are involved.\n"
msgstr ""
"一把奇怪的剑，一个刃炽热，而另一个冰冷。当它击中目标时，热梯度会增大。\n"
"造成此效果的原因尚不清楚，但有传言说它与超自然的力量有关。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:demon trident \"rift\""
msgid ""
"A small wrinkle in the very fabric of reality, magically bound to a shaft by\n"
"some mad acolyte of Lugonu. Its attacks can warp through nearby space at the\n"
"wielder's command.\n"
msgstr "现实结构中的一道微小褶皱，被卢戈努的一名疯狂侍僧用魔法束缚在长柄上。依持用者的意愿，它的攻击可以扭曲并穿越附近空间。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:sphere of battle"
msgid ""
"An orb encased in vividly coloured scales, wrought by a long-forgotten wizard.\n"
"It was the mage Iskenderun's favourite playtoy.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个外面裹着艳丽鳞片的水晶球，由一个被遗忘已久的巫师制作。\n"
"这是法师伊斯肯德伦最喜欢的玩具。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:cigotuvi's embrace"
msgid ""
"A suit of armour borne of rotten flesh and bone and gristle, held intact by the\n"
"will of a long-dead sorcerer. The dreadful energies within it call to the bodies\n"
"of the recently dead, protecting the wearer with a cocoon of carrion.\n"
msgstr "一套由腐肉、骨骼和软骨制成的防具，靠一位死去已久的巫师的意志维系完整。内藏的可怖能量会召来新死者的尸体，以腐肉之茧保护穿戴者。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:seven-league boots"
msgid ""
"An enchanted pair of boots which grant the ability to take strides of incredible\n"
"length, as long as the wearer is advancing bravely towards their foes.\n"
msgstr "一双注入了魔法的靴子，只要穿着它勇敢地朝敌人前进，就可以迈出难以置信的步伐。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:mad mage's maulers"
msgid ""
"A pair of gloves designed to carefully control and channel the flow of magic,\n"
"later misused and mangled by the lunatic murderer-mages of the Fifth Circle.\n"
"Their influence leaves the wearer utterly unable to cast spells - the wearer's\n"
"magic is redirected to far bloodier purposes.\n"
msgstr "一副原本用来精细控制并引导魔力流动的手套，后来遭到第五圈那些疯狂的杀人法师滥用和摧残。它使穿戴者完全无法施法，将其魔力转用于血腥得多的用途。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:dreamdust necklace"
msgid "A dull dusty mixture trapped within a cracked crystal on a thin silver chain.\n"
msgstr "在一条细银链上，暗淡的尘土被束缚在一颗破碎的水晶中。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:dreamshard necklace"
msgid ""
"A beautiful rainbow of colour and motion trapped within a delicate crystal on a\n"
"thin silver chain. Listening carefully, one can hear the distant echo of a\n"
"thousand dreams from all corners of reality, their melody giving a warm sense\n"
"of safety.\n"
msgstr ""
"在一条细银链上，色彩和运动的虹光被束缚在一颗精致的水晶中。\n"
"仔细聆听，你可以听到来自现实各个角落的一千个梦想的遥远回声，\n"
"它们的旋律给人一种温暖的安全感。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:delatra's gloves"
msgid ""
"A pair of long ultramarine gloves, worn by a famed experimental alchemist in an\n"
"age long past. They channel the energy of discovery, empowering their wearer with\n"
"the force created by a blind step from ignorance to certainty.\n"
msgstr "一副群青色长手套，远古时曾由一位著名的实验炼金术士佩戴。它引导探索发现的能量，将从无知盲目迈向确定的那一步所释放的力量赋予穿戴者。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:woodcutter's axe"
msgid ""
"A weapon that chops foes down as steadily and methodically as a forester cutting\n"
"wood. The unchanging rhythm of its work has settled on it with the force of\n"
"natural law, and no amount of force or skill can make it swing faster or slower.\n"
msgstr ""
"这把武器，能像伐木工砍伐树木一样有条不紊地砍倒敌人。\n"
"它的工作节奏一成不变，这是自然法则所决定的，\n"
"再强的力量或技能也无法使它挥动得更快或更慢。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:throatcutter"
msgid ""
"Taken from a paladin of the Shining One by the common cutpurse who murdered her,\n"
"Throatcutter was used for a long series of increasingly sordid deeds thereafter.\n"
"Blood, murder and betrayal stain its history and blade both, and little trace now\n"
"remains of the blade which once stood between danger and the innocent.\n"
msgstr "一个普通扒手谋杀了一位光明神的女圣骑士，并从她手中夺走了割喉者，此后用它干下了一连串愈发卑劣的勾当。鲜血、谋杀与背叛玷污了它的历史和剑刃。那把曾挡在危险与无辜者之间的利刃，如今几乎已无迹可寻。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:staff of the meek"
msgid ""
"A sacred relic of the Monks of St. Lee, followers of the renunciate archmage. Just\n"
"as St. Lee sought to atone for the destruction his spells wrought by protecting\n"
"others, so his staff protects its wielder.\n"
msgstr "隐修大法师圣李的追随者——圣李僧团——的一件圣物。圣李通过保护他人，为自己的法术造成的破坏赎罪；同样，这根棍杖也保护着持用者。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:trishula \"condemnation\""
msgid ""
"A weapon to bring forth guilt from the guilty. It was first wielded by the archangel\n"
"Lucriel, who, on seeing the suffering of the first mortals, led them as an army\n"
"against the cruelty of the gods. The ragged survivors of Lucriel's army took this\n"
"weapon with them into the wilderness, the sole remnant of an archangel's virtue.\n"
msgstr "一件令有罪者感到罪疚的武器。最初持用它的是天使长卢克利尔。目睹最早的凡人遭受苦难后，他率领凡人组成大军，对抗诸神的残酷。卢克利尔军中衣衫褴褛的幸存者将这件武器带入荒野，它成为天使长美德仅存的遗物。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:amulet of elemental vulnerability"
msgid ""
"A blue-steel amulet. Its creator, an exceedingly practical woman, designed it to\n"
"provide powerful protection against mundane jabs, stabs and bites. It's worse than\n"
"useless against fire and frost, but how often does anyone really need to worry\n"
"about that?\n"
msgstr "一枚蓝钢护身符。它的创造者是一位极为务实的女性，设计它是为了强力抵御寻常的戳击、刺击与撕咬。面对火焰与寒霜，它不但无用，反而有害——可又有多少人真需要担心这些呢？\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:mountain boots"
msgid ""
"These sturdy boots were created by an artificer who lived high up on a remote\n"
"mountain peak, as protection against the mountain's near-constant avalanches,\n"
"rockslides, and snowstorms. No force short of translocations magic will budge\n"
"the wearer from their position.\n"
msgstr "这双坚固的靴子由一位居住在偏远高峰的魔法工匠制造，用以抵御山间几乎不停的雪崩、落石与暴风雪。除了位移系魔法，任何力量都无法使穿戴者离开原位。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:lochaber axe"
msgid ""
"This brutal weapon, long thought lost to history, combines the extended reach\n"
"of a polearm with the cleaving sharpness of an axe. Ghosts of ancient warriors\n"
"linger about it, draining fickle users.\n"
msgstr "这件残暴的武器曾长期被认为已湮没于历史，兼具长柄武器的攻击距离与斧头的劈砍锋芒。古代战士的幽灵萦绕其上，会吸取反复换用武器者的生命力。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:hermit's pendant"
msgid ""
"An ascetic once took a sacred vow, forswearing use of magical tools and ownership\n"
"of everything but this pendant. Which god they made this vow to remains a point of\n"
"bitter contention among the devout, but their pendant's power - and limitations -\n"
"are irrefutable.\n"
msgstr "一位苦行者曾立下神圣誓言，弃用魔法器具，并放弃除这枚吊坠以外的一切财物。虔诚信徒至今仍为此誓言究竟献给哪位神争执不休，但隐士吊坠的力量及其局限却无可辩驳。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:slick slippers"
msgid ""
"Crafted from the tanned, smooth hide of a Western Skyshark, these slippers are\n"
"astonishingly comfortable. They lack the protective benefits of a good pair of\n"
"boots, but they can get their wearers out of almost any bind.\n"
msgstr "这双便鞋用西方天鲨鞣制后的光滑皮革制成，舒适得令人惊叹。它虽没有优质靴子提供的防护，却能让穿戴者摆脱几乎一切束缚。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:force lance"
msgid ""
"A plain iron lance, imbued with supernatural gravitas via the artifice of the\n"
"mage Gell. It strikes with a force many times stronger than that imparted by\n"
"the wielder.\n"
msgstr "一把普通的铁制骑枪，经法师盖尔的巧思赋予了超自然的威势。它击出的力量是持用者施力的许多倍。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:toga \"victory\""
msgid ""
"An ancient artefact of Okawaru, these woolen robes were lost when a former\n"
"champion failed a duel. Its enchantments increase in power when the wearer\n"
"emerges victorious from threatening combat, but resorting to the use of scrolls\n"
"or potions for assistance causes them to fade away again.\n"
msgstr "这件羊毛长袍是奥格瓦如的古老神器，一位昔日冠军在决斗落败时将它遗失。穿戴者在危险战斗中获胜后，其魔力便会增强；但若借助卷轴或药水，增强的魔力就会再次消退。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:storm queen's shield"
msgid ""
"A disc of crackling metal, created by a woman whose cunning artifice and\n"
"crafty politics once united a continent. Most of her surviving inventions are\n"
"closely guarded by various royals, ostensible proof of their claim to be her\n"
"true successor, but this early prototype slipped through their fingers.\n"
msgstr "一面噼啪作响的金属圆盘，由一位曾凭精湛工艺和高明政治手腕统一大陆的女性打造。她现存的大多数发明都被各国王室严加保管，充作自称正统继承人的凭证；不过，这件早期原型却从他们手中流失了。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:hand cannon \"mule\""
msgid ""
"Hand cannons use magical dust to launch projectiles. The alchemists who craft\n"
"them boast of their potency, but omit the smoke and noise blasted out with each\n"
"shot. Filled with powdered blastmotes, Mule packs an especially powerful kick.\n"
msgstr "手铳用魔法粉尘发射弹丸。制造它们的炼金术士大肆夸耀其威力，却对每次射击喷出的烟雾和巨响只字不提。填装了爆裂微灵粉末的“骡子”，后坐力尤其强劲。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:scarf of invisibility"
msgid "A scarf that can be activated to render its wearer invisible.\n"
msgstr "一条可以发动、使穿戴者隐形的围巾。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:gloves of the gadgeteer"
msgid ""
"A pair of suede gloves covered in a dizzying array of delicate sigils. While\n"
"originally intended to aid in the crafting of magical devices, they are\n"
"nonetheless useful for wringing every last drop of power out of someone else's\n"
"work.\n"
msgstr "一双麂皮手套，上面布满令人眼花缭乱的精巧符印。它原本用于辅助制造魔法装置，不过，用来榨出他人造物的最后一分力量也同样有效。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:charlatan's orb"
msgid ""
"This orb is the work of a master artificer, contracted to retrieve the orb, who\n"
"valued their life more than their professional integrity. While this fake\n"
"faithfully recreates the eerie glow and space-warping properties of the true\n"
"orb, the power it grants is artificial and only accessible to skilled evokers.\n"
msgstr "这颗宝球出自一位受雇寻找佐特宝珠的魔法工匠大师之手。比起职业操守，此人更珍惜自己的性命。骗子宝球忠实再现了真宝珠的诡异光芒和扭曲空间的特性，但所赋予的力量只是人造的，只有精于唤发的人才能运用。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:justicar's regalia"
msgid ""
"A gleaming breastplate with a slot in its centre for a holy symbol or bejewelled\n"
"coat of arms. Those who hear commands given by its wearer feel filled with the\n"
"power to carry them out, no matter the adversity.\n"
msgstr "一件闪亮的胸甲，中央留有凹槽，可以嵌入圣徽或镶宝石的纹章。听到穿戴者号令的人，会感到自己充满执行命令的力量，无惧任何逆境。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:skull of zonguldrok"
msgid ""
"The skull of a legendary necromancer, seemingly parted from the rest of its\n"
"body. When held, it seems disinclined to explain the precise circumstances of\n"
"its ending up in this state, but offers no objection to others siphoning what\n"
"considerable necromantic power still remains in its ancient bones.\n"
msgstr "一位传奇死灵法师的头骨，似乎已与身体其余部分分离。被人持有时，它好像不愿详述自己为何落得这般境地，却不反对别人汲取其古老骨骸中依然可观的死灵力量。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:fungal fisticloak"
msgid ""
"The handiwork of a mad mycologist who once attempted to overcome the genetic\n"
"anxiety of wandering mushrooms by cultivating a species that could be easily\n"
"transported without disturbing them. The result is as much a living organism as\n"
"it is a piece of clothing, every linen fibre twined together with fungal mycelia\n"
"that draw both nutrients and confidence from whoever wears it. And in exchange\n"
"for such trifles as blood or peptides, the colony will instinctively lash out to\n"
"defend its wearer from whatever they perceive as a threat.\n"
"\n"
"It's like wearing a thousand tiny friends at once! And the humming they fill\n"
"your mind with in the dark is actually quite lulling....\n"
"\n"
"(This item also occupies your helmet slot.)\n"
msgstr ""
"一位疯狂的真菌学家曾试图克服游荡蘑菇天生的焦虑，培育出能在搬运时不受惊扰的品种。这件披风便是他的作品。它既是衣物，也同样是活的生物：每根亚麻纤维都缠着菌丝，从穿戴者身上汲取营养和信心。只需付出血液或肽之类的微小代价，这个菌落就会本能地出击，保护穿戴者免受它认定的任何威胁。\n"
"\n"
"就像同时穿着一千位小朋友！而且，在黑暗中回荡于你脑海的嗡鸣其实还挺催眠……\n"
"\n"
"（此物品也会占用头盔栏位。）\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/unrand.txt:crown of vainglory"
msgid ""
"An extravagant crown of gold filigree and glittering jewels that even a king\n"
"could feel immodest wearing. It grants its wearer a regal aura the match of any\n"
"in heaven and also a great deal of unearned confidence.\n"
msgstr "一顶以金丝和璀璨宝石制成的奢华王冠，连国王戴着它都可能觉得过于招摇。它赋予佩戴者不逊于天界任何君王的威仪，以及大量毫无根据的自信。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a faded altar of an unknown god"
msgid ""
"An ancient altar, stripped of all identifying characteristics by the passage of\n"
"aeons. Praying at it will convert you to an unknown god, and the altar's deity\n"
"will greatly appreciate conversion at so ancient a site of worship.\n"
msgstr ""
"一座古老的祭坛，时间冲刷掉了它的全部特征。\n"
"在那里祈祷，将会皈依一个未知的神。\n"
"祭坛的神灵会非常感念于你在这样古老的礼拜场所进行皈依。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a glowing golden altar of the shining one"
msgid ""
"An altar to the Shining One, made from the purest gold and almost blinding in\n"
"its radiance.\n"
msgstr "光明神的祭坛，由纯金制成，发出几近眩目的光芒。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a broken altar of ashenzari"
msgid ""
"A crystal altar which shattered to pieces when Ashenzari was cursed. There is\n"
"still a great power remaining within it: a dark aura holds the shards in\n"
"mid-explosion, suspended in time and space much like the god they herald.\n"
msgstr ""
"当艾申扎利被诅咒的时候，这座水晶祭坛也随之破碎。\n"
"这里依然残留着强大的力量：\n"
"黑色的光环将碎片定格在爆炸中期，悬停在时间和空间上，就像它们所昭示的神。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a roughly hewn altar of beogh"
msgid "An altar to Beogh, unmistakably roughly hewn by orcish artisans.\n"
msgstr "比欧弗的祭坛，做工粗糙，一眼就能看出是出自兽人工匠之手。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a snail-covered altar of cheibriados"
msgid "A timeless altar to Cheibriados the Contemplative.\n"
msgstr "一座献给沉思者切布理亚多的祭坛，仿佛超越了时间。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a shadowy altar of dithmenos"
msgid ""
"An altar to Dithmenos the Shadowed. It seems to absorb light from its\n"
"surroundings.\n"
msgstr "隐没者迪斯姆诺的祭坛。它似乎在吸收四周的光。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a white marble altar of elyvilon"
msgid ""
"An altar to Elyvilon the Healer, made from purest white marble and topped by a\n"
"sculpture of the Chalice of Purification.\n"
msgstr "治愈者艾利维隆的祭坛，由纯白色大理石制成，顶端有净化之杯的雕像。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a blossoming altar of fedhas"
msgid "An altar to Fedhas Madash, covered in vibrant and colourful plant life.\n"
msgstr "费德哈·玛达什的祭坛，上面覆盖着生机盎然、色彩缤纷的植物。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an opulent altar of gozag"
msgid ""
"A glittering golden and bejewelled altar to Gozag Ym Sagoz the Greedy, gleaming\n"
"brightly even in the dim dungeon light.\n"
msgstr "贪婪者哥萨戈·伊姆·萨戈兹的祭坛，黄金与珠宝交相辉映，即使在昏暗的地下城中也熠熠生辉。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a hazy altar of hepliaklqana"
msgid ""
"An altar to Hepliaklqana the Forgotten, shrouded in mist and difficult to make\n"
"out clearly. Something about it seems terribly familiar, but it's impossible to\n"
"say exactly why.\n"
msgstr ""
"遗忘者惠普利亚卡纳的祭坛，被笼罩在薄雾中，难以清晰辨认。\n"
"有些东西似曾相识，但很难说清原因。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a candlelit altar of ignis"
msgid ""
"An altar to Ignis, the Dying Flame. It's completely covered in candles of all\n"
"shapes and sizes, but only one remains alight, its slender flame wavering in the\n"
"slightest breeze.\n"
msgstr "伊格尼斯——垂死之焰——的祭坛。上面摆满形状大小各异的蜡烛，却只剩一根仍亮着，纤细的火苗在最轻微的风中也会摇曳。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a viscous altar of jiyva"
msgid ""
"A slimy, ever-shifting altar to Jiyva. You're not sure what it's made from, and\n"
"you don't really want to know.\n"
msgstr ""
"吉瓦的祭坛，黏滑、在不断变形。\n"
"你不确定这祭坛到底是用什么材料制造的，而且你也不想知道。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an ancient bone altar of kikubaaqudgha"
msgid ""
"An altar created from piles of ancient bones, dedicated to the terrible\n"
"Demon-God Kikubaaqudgha.\n"
msgstr "这座用远古骸骨堆积成的祭坛供奉的是恐怖的魔神——奇库巴库哈。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a corrupted altar of lugonu"
msgid ""
"An altar to Lugonu the Unformed, possibly dedicated to some other power before\n"
"it was irrevocably corrupted.\n"
msgstr ""
"无形之神卢戈努的祭坛，\n"
"这祭坛也许曾供奉过别的神祗，但现在已经不可逆转地被腐化了。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a burning altar of makhleb"
msgid ""
"An ever-burning altar to Makhleb the Destroyer. Strange, twisting shapes are\n"
"visible in the flames.\n"
msgstr ""
"毁灭者马科列布的祭坛，上面永远燃烧着火焰。\n"
"透过火焰，可以隐约看到一些奇特而扭曲的形状。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a sparkling altar of nemelex xobeh"
msgid ""
"An altar sparkling with a lightshow brighter than any gambling den's, to\n"
"attract followers for Nemelex Xobeh.\n"
msgstr ""
"这座祭坛上的灯光比任何一个赌场都要亮，\n"
"尼姆雷斯・索布在靠这种手段来吸引信徒。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an iron altar of okawaru"
msgid ""
"An altar of iron and steel dedicated to the Warmaster Okawaru. Its edges are\n"
"surprisingly sharp.\n"
msgstr "一座供奉战争之主奥格瓦如的钢铁祭坛。祭坛的边缘出奇地锋利。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a stormy altar of qazlal"
msgid ""
"An altar dedicated to Qazlal Stormbringer, surrounded by fierce winds,\n"
"electrical discharges, puffs of fire and magma, and the occasional tremor.\n"
msgstr ""
"兴风者卡兹拉尔的祭坛，\n"
"被包裹在狂风、闪电、喷涌的烈火和岩浆之中，时而与之震颤。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a sacrificial altar of ru"
msgid ""
"An altar to Ru the Awakened in the shape of a pair of scales, with a heart in\n"
"one scale and a pictogram representing power and enlightenment in the other.\n"
msgstr ""
"觉醒者入的祭坛，\n"
"其外形是个天平，一个托盘中放有心，而另一个托盘中的符号象征力量和觉悟。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a shimmering blue altar of sif muna"
msgid ""
"An altar to Sif Muna the Loreminder, covered in intricate patterns and writings\n"
"in long forgotten scripts. Atop a deep blue pedestal hovers a shimmering\n"
"condensation of pure magic.\n"
msgstr "学识守护者席夫·穆纳的祭坛，上面布满繁复图案与早被遗忘的文字。深蓝色的基座上，悬浮着一团闪耀的纯粹魔力凝聚物。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a bloodstained altar of trog"
msgid ""
"An altar to Trog the Wrathful, crudely made by what seem to be the hands of\n"
"giants and covered with bloodstains.\n"
msgstr "狂怒者特洛戈的祭坛，它做工粗糙，像是由巨人建造的，上面溅满了鲜血。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a hide-covered altar of uskayaw"
msgid ""
"An altar to Uskayaw the Reveller. It appears to be hollow and covered in a hide,\n"
"giving it a resonant surface. Carvings on the side depict grouped figures that\n"
"could be dancing or loving or fighting.\n"
msgstr ""
"狂欢者阿斯卡亚的祭坛。\n"
"它似乎是中空的，被一层皮覆盖着，形成了能够共振的表面。\n"
"侧面的雕刻描绘着一群人，他们可能在跳舞、爱恋或战斗。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a radiant altar of vehumet"
msgid ""
"An altar, ablaze in the lights of Iskenderun and promising great destructive\n"
"powers to those who would follow Vehumet.\n"
msgstr ""
"这座祭坛闪耀在伊斯肯德伦之光中，好像在对来人许诺：\n"
"只要追随维胡梅特，他就会赐予你无比的毁灭之力。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an ornate altar of the wu jian council"
msgid ""
"A red and gold altar to the Wu Jian Council. Sharp slivers of steel drift\n"
"through the quiet air surrounding it.\n"
msgstr "一座献给武剑会的红金色祭坛。锋利的钢片在周围寂静的空气中飘浮。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a shimmering altar of xom"
msgid ""
"An altar constantly shimmering in all visible colours, and probably some\n"
"invisible ones, matching the whims of Xom the Unpredictable.\n"
msgstr ""
"这座祭坛不断闪现着各色光芒，甚至可能还有不可见光，\n"
"和这座祭坛所供奉的神祗无常之主佐姆一样，变幻莫测。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a basalt altar of yredelemnul"
msgid "An altar to Yredelemnul the Dark, worked from columnar basalt.\n"
msgstr "黑暗神伊莱德莱姆努尔的祭坛，由柱状玄武岩建成。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a glowing silver altar of zin"
msgid ""
"An altar to Zin the Law-Giver, made from silver as pristine as Zin's followers\n"
"are expected to be, and glowing gently.\n"
msgstr "定法者辛的祭坛，由纯净无瑕的白银制成，泛着柔光；辛也期望自己的信徒同样纯洁。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:the endless lava"
msgid ""
"A sea of fire and brimstone as far as the eye can see. Anyone venturing across\n"
"it would be roasted in no time.\n"
msgstr "一片火与硫磺的海洋，一望不知边际。任何冒险要穿越它的人，都会立刻被烤死。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:the floor"
msgid "The floor.\n"
msgstr "地面。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:some deep water"
msgid ""
"A pool of deep water. Only giant creatures can wade through this, and only\n"
"those well-adapted to water can swim through it; for the rest, the only way\n"
"through is to fly over.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个深水池。\n"
"只有巨型生物可以趟过去，水性好的则可以游；而其他的，就只能选择飞过去。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:some lava"
msgid ""
"An intensely hot pool of molten rock, emitting clouds of sulphurous smoke.\n"
"Nothing but the mythical salamander can cross this without flight.\n"
msgstr "一个炽热的熔岩池，喷吐着硫磺烟云。\n只有传说中的沙罗曼蛇才能不凭借飞行就能穿越它。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:some shallow water"
msgid ""
"A pool of cloudy, waist-deep water. Those well-adapted to water can swim\n"
"through it and attack normally. Non-swimmers must wade through the water slowly\n"
"and will occasionally fail to attack in melee when wading through shallow\n"
"water; although large creatures are able to keep their balance, move at a\n"
"normal speed, and avoid fumbling.\n"
msgstr "一池浑浊、深及腰部的水。适应水生环境的生物可以游泳通过并正常攻击。不会游泳的生物必须缓慢涉水，近战攻击偶尔会失手；不过，大型生物能够保持平衡，以正常速度移动，也不会失手。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a toxic bog"
msgid ""
"A filthy pool of poisonous, waist-deep sludge. Wading or swimming through the\n"
"sludge will damage and poison any creature, even those resistant to poison.\n"
"Those well-adapted to water can swim through it and attack normally.\n"
"Non-swimmers must wade through the water slowly and will occasionally fail to\n"
"attack in melee when wading through shallow water; although large creatures are\n"
"able to keep their balance, move at a normal speed, and avoid fumbling.\n"
msgstr "一池深及腰部、肮脏有毒的淤泥。涉行或游过其中会伤害并毒害任何生物，即使具有毒素抗性也不例外。适应水生环境的生物可以游泳通过并正常攻击。不会游泳的生物必须缓慢涉行，近战攻击偶尔会失手；不过，大型生物能够保持平衡，以正常速度移动，也不会失手。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:some mud"
msgid "A thick layer of gritty mud. [[liquefied]]\n"
msgstr "一层厚厚的砂质泥浆。[[liquefied]]\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:the open sea"
msgid ""
"An expanse of endless wind and waves, with not a lighthouse in sight. Anyone\n"
"venturing across it would be lost beyond all hope in short order.\n"
msgstr ""
"前方只有无尽的风浪，在你视野可及之处都没有一座灯塔。\n"
"任何冒险要穿越它的人，很快都会失去一切希望。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an unnaturally hard rock wall"
msgid "A wall imbued with magic that makes it indestructible.\n"
msgstr "这面墙被注入魔力，坚不可摧。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a wall of the weird stuff which makes up pandemonium"
msgid ""
"A wall made from the weird stuff which makes up Pandemonium. It seems to be\n"
"like rock in most other aspects.\n"
msgstr "这面墙由构筑魔窟的奇特材料制成。在其他大多数方面，似乎都和岩石一样。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a crystal wall"
msgid ""
"A wall made from polished crystal and imbued with arcane magics. They prevent\n"
"its easy destruction, and make it reflect heat and cold.\n"
msgstr ""
"这面墙由抛光水晶制成，充满了奥术魔力。\n"
"这使得墙难以被轻易破坏，并能反射热和冷。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a translucent rock wall"
msgid ""
"A rock wall made from a mineral as translucent as good quality glass. Whether\n"
"it is natural or magical, you cannot tell.\n"
msgstr ""
"这面岩墙由一种像优质玻璃那样透明的矿物制成。\n"
"你不确定它的这种性质是自然的还是被魔法改造的。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a translucent stone wall"
msgid ""
"A harder obstacle than rock walls. Only the mightiest magic can shatter stone\n"
"walls. It has been imbued with arcane magics which render it translucent.\n"
msgstr ""
"这是比岩墙更难对付的障碍。只有最强力的魔法才能打碎石墙。\n"
"这面墙壁被注入奥术魔法，因此变成了透明的。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a translucent unnaturally hard rock wall"
msgid ""
"A wall imbued with magic that not only makes it indestructible but also makes\n"
"it translucent like glass.\n"
msgstr "这面墙被注入魔力，不仅使它坚不可摧，还让它变得像玻璃一样半透明。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a stone wall"
msgid ""
"A harder obstacle than rock walls. Only the mightiest magic can shatter stone\n"
"walls.\n"
msgstr "这是比岩墙更难对付的障碍。只有最强力的魔法才能打碎石墙。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a slime covered rock wall"
msgid ""
"A rock wall coated with acidic green slime; just standing near it is enough to\n"
"cause temporary corrosion.\n"
msgstr "这面岩墙附着着亮绿色的黏液。它摸起来是酸性的；站在它附近就会被暂时腐蚀。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a metal wall"
msgid ""
"A wall of bluish-grey metal. As every dungeon electrician knows, it will ground\n"
"even magical bolts of lightning.\n"
msgstr "一面蓝灰色金属墙。地下城中的每个电工都知道，它甚至能让闪电箭接地。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a rock wall"
msgid "A wall consisting of simple rock.\n"
msgstr "这仅仅是一面岩墙。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a shop"
msgid ""
"A shop in the dungeon, beyond sight of the world above, manned by a secretive\n"
"and reclusive shopkeeper who cannot be bargained with, grants no refunds, and\n"
"is interested in nothing you may have to sell. Some shops hawk antiques of\n"
"unknown provenance, and offer little hint as to the quality or nature of their\n"
"goods.\n"
msgstr "有一位神秘、隐居的商人在不见天日的地下城中开设了一家商店，\n这里的商店不能还价，不会退款，而且也不会从你那里购买任何东西。\n一些商店会出售来源不明的古物，店主自然不会告诉你这些商品的质量和性质。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a stone staircase leading down"
msgid "A staircase leading further down.\n"
msgstr "一个通往下层的楼梯。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a stone staircase leading up"
msgid "A staircase leading back up.\n"
msgstr "一个通往上层的楼梯。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a tree"
msgid ""
"A large tree. While in most places the dim light of the dungeon is not bright\n"
"enough to sustain large plants, there are spots where, with the grace of\n"
"Fedhas, trees as big as those on the surface can grow underground.\n"
msgstr "一棵大树。在地下城的大多地方，昏暗的光线不足以维持大型植物的生长，\n但有些地方，受到费德哈的关照，在地下生长的树木也长得和地表的一样大。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a mangrove"
msgid ""
"This tree is specially adapted for growing in swampy conditions. Its vines are\n"
"too thick to see through.\n"
msgstr "这种树特别适合在沼泽环境中生长。它的藤蔓很茂密，看不到对面。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a demonic tree"
msgid ""
"A tree hideously warped by the demonic forces of chaos. Despite its bizarre\n"
"appearance and occasional, unsettling movement, it seems harmless.\n"
msgstr ""
"一棵被混乱的恶魔力量扭曲的树。\n"
"尽管外形怪异，偶尔还会有令人不安的动作，但它似乎是无害的。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an abandoned shop"
msgid "A shop that has been abandoned.\n"
msgstr "这间商店已经被废弃了。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an orcish idol"
msgid "An idol of the orc god Beogh.\n"
msgstr "一尊兽人之神比欧弗的塑像。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an iron grate"
msgid ""
"A rusted iron grate, brittle enough to be disrupted with a spell or a wand\n"
"quite easily. It is too strong to be breakable by hand, however.\n"
msgstr "一面生锈的铁栅栏，脆弱得很容易被法术或魔杖破坏，却仍坚固到无法徒手拆毁。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an escape hatch in the floor"
msgid ""
"A spring-loaded one-way escape hatch set in the dungeon floor, allowing the\n"
"adventurer beset by adversaries to exchange the perils of this level for the\n"
"perils of the next.\n"
msgstr "地下城的地面上一个单向逃生口，\n让被敌人围困的冒险者可以选择使用它逃离眼下的危险，面对下一层的危险。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an escape hatch in the ceiling"
msgid "A spring-loaded one-way escape hatch set in the ceiling.\n"
msgstr "天花板上一个装有弹簧的单向逃生口。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a shaft"
msgid "A hole in the ground, leading to a dungeon level one or more floors deeper.\n"
msgstr "地面上的一个洞，通往更深一层或多层的地下城。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a sealed passage leading down"
msgid ""
"A descending passage sealed tightly by a magical barricade. It is impossible to\n"
"climb through it so long as the magic holds.\n"
msgstr "一条下行的通道，被魔法路障牢固地封印着。只要魔力一直存在，就不可能穿过它。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a sealed passage leading up"
msgid ""
"An ascending passage sealed tightly by a magical barricade. It is impossible to\n"
"climb through it so long as the magic holds.\n"
msgstr "一条上行的通道，被魔法路障牢固地封印着。只要魔力一直存在，就不可能穿过它。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an empty arch of ancient stone"
msgid "A stone archway that seems to lead to nowhere in particular.\n"
msgstr "一个石拱门，看起来无法通往任何地方。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a detected shop or portal"
msgid "A gateway of some kind. You cannot tell where it leads without approaching it.\n"
msgstr "某种入口。你不接近它就无法知道它通往哪里。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a passage of golubria"
msgid ""
"An unstable gateway that allows instantaneous travel to another nearby passage\n"
"of Golubria, and will close behind anything passing through it.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个不稳定的传送门让你瞬间传送到附近的另一个格鲁布里亚的通道上，\n"
"只要有任何东西通过这个传送门，它就会立刻关闭。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a portal to somewhere"
msgid ""
"A gash-like tear in reality that looks into some terrifying, starry otherworld.\n"
"Thankfully, the magic that opened it also prevents its vacuum from consuming\n"
"and swallowing everything in sight.\n"
msgstr ""
"现实空间中的一道伤口般的裂缝，揭示着某个可怕的、繁星点点的另一个世界。\n"
"幸运的是，打开这道裂缝的魔法同时也会阻止它将视线中的一切东西尽数吞没。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a granite statue"
msgid "A stone statue whose features have long since withered away.\n"
msgstr "一座石像，其形象早已被时间消磨。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a gleaming silver wall"
msgid ""
"A wall made of pure silver, formed by the power of Zin to temporarily imprison\n"
"a monster within its confines.\n"
msgstr "一面纯银制成的墙，由辛的力量生成，用来将一个怪物暂时囚禁起来。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a dry fountain"
msgid "A dried-up decorative fountain that has seen better days.\n"
msgstr "一个干涸的喷泉，见证过美好的岁月。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a fountain of clear blue water"
msgid "A decorative fountain, flowing with clear water.\n"
msgstr "一个装饰性喷泉，水流清澈。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a fountain of blood"
msgid "A decorative fountain, spurting with foul-looking blood.\n"
msgstr "一个装饰性喷泉，喷着看上去肮脏的血液。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a fountain of sparkling water"
msgid "A decorative fountain, flowing with brightly sparkling, faintly magic water.\n"
msgstr "一座装饰喷泉，流淌着明亮闪烁、带有微弱魔力的水。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a runelight"
msgid ""
"An unearthly, glittering light, floating and twisting in midair. A Rune of\n"
"Zot is surely nearby, its power overspilling to cause this spectacular sight.\n"
msgstr ""
"一道超自然、闪耀的光芒，在半空中飘浮、扭曲。\n"
"附近肯定有个佐特符文，它溢出的能量生成出这一壮观的景象。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a broken pillar"
msgid "A ruined and crumbled stone pillar.\n"
msgstr "一根残破的石柱。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a one-way staircase leading down"
msgid ""
"A cursed staircase leading further down, imbued with magic to prevent any\n"
"return back up the stairs. Adventurers taking this passage will need to find a\n"
"return stairway somewhere else on the level where they arrive.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个被诅咒的通往下层的楼梯，注入着魔力，以阻止任何回返。\n"
"走这条通道的冒险者，到达所通往的楼层后，需要找到其他能够返回楼梯。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a one-way staircase leading up"
msgid ""
"A cursed staircase leading up, imbued with magic to prevent any return back\n"
"down the stairs. Adventurers taking this passage will need to find a return\n"
"stairway somewhere else on the level where they arrive.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个被诅咒的通往上层的楼梯，注入着魔力，以阻止任何回返。\n"
"走这条通道的冒险者，到达所通往的楼层后，需要找到其他能够返回楼梯。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a gate leading back out of this place"
msgid "A gate that will let you return whence you came.\n"
msgstr "这个大门，你穿过它能回到你来的地方。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a gate leading out of pandemonium"
msgid "A gate leading back to the dungeon.\n"
msgstr "一个返回地下城的大门。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a gate leading to another region of pandemonium"
msgid "A gate leading to yet another region of Pandemonium. There'll always be more.\n"
msgstr "一个通往另一个魔窟的大门。魔窟是无穷无尽的。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a one-way gate leading to the halls of pandemonium"
msgid "A gate leading to the endless halls of Pandemonium.\n"
msgstr "一个通往魔窟的无尽大厅的大门。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a staircase to the depths"
msgid "A staircase leading to the Depths.\n"
msgstr "一个通往地底的楼梯。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a gate to the realm of zot"
msgid "A gate leading to the Realm of Zot.\n"
msgstr "一个通往佐特领域的大门。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a gateway back into the dungeon"
msgid ""
"A gate which allows a feat popularly thought to be impossible: escaping Hell\n"
"alive.\n"
msgstr "这道大门能让你做到一件通常被认为不可能的事：活着逃出地狱。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a gateway leading out of the abyss"
msgid ""
"A gateway out of the Abyss, shimmering and shifting in the impermanent\n"
"landscape.\n"
msgstr "一个离开深渊的出口，在无常的景象中发光变幻。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a gateway leading deeper into the abyss"
msgid ""
"A strangely calm gateway amid the roiling landscape of the Abyss. It leads\n"
"further into the depths of the Abyss.\n"
msgstr "一个出奇平静的入口，坐落在深渊那混沌的景象中。它通向深渊的更深处。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a gateway to a ziggurat"
msgid "A portal leading to a ziggurat.\n"
msgstr "一个通往神塔的门户。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a gateway to the ashen valley of gehenna"
msgid "A gateway leading to Gehenna.\n"
msgstr "一个通往欣嫩谷的入口。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a gateway leading out of gehenna"
msgid "A gateway leading back to the Vestibule of Hell.\n"
msgstr "一个返回地狱前庭的出口。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a gateway to hell"
msgid "A gateway leading to the Vestibule of Hell. Few would go there voluntarily.\n"
msgstr "一个通往地狱前庭的入口。很少有人自愿前往那个地方。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a gateway to the iron city of dis"
msgid "A gateway leading to the Iron City of Dis.\n"
msgstr "一个通往冥府铁城的入口。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a gateway leading out of dis"
msgid "<A gateway leading out of Gehenna>\n"
msgstr "<A gateway leading out of Gehenna>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a gateway to the decaying netherworld of tartarus"
msgid "A gateway leading to Tartarus.\n"
msgstr "一个通往塔尔塔罗斯的入口。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a gateway leading out of tartarus"
msgid "<A gateway leading out of Gehenna>\n"
msgstr "<A gateway leading out of Gehenna>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a gateway to the freezing wastes of cocytus"
msgid "A gateway leading to Cocytus.\n"
msgstr "一个通往悲叹河的入口。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a gateway leading out of cocytus"
msgid "<A gateway leading out of Gehenna>\n"
msgstr "<A gateway leading out of Gehenna>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a hole to the spider nest"
msgid "A passage leading to the Spider Nest.\n"
msgstr "一个通往蜘蛛巢的通道。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a one-way gate to the infinite horrors of the abyss"
msgid "A gateway leading to the Abyss.\n"
msgstr "一个通往深渊的入口。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a crawl-hole back to the lair"
msgid "A passage leading back to the Lair of Beasts.\n"
msgstr "一个返回野兽巢穴的出口。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an exit through the horrors of the abyss"
msgid "A gateway leading back to the dungeon via the madness of the Abyss.\n"
msgstr "一个通过疯狂的深渊返回地下城的出口。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a staircase back to the dungeon"
msgid "A staircase leading back up to the familiarity of the dungeon.\n"
msgstr "一个返回你遇到过的地下城楼层的楼梯。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a staircase back to the lair"
msgid "A staircase leading back up to the Lair of Beasts.\n"
msgstr "一个返回野兽巢穴的楼梯。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a staircase back to the mines"
msgid "A staircase leading back to the Orcish Mines.\n"
msgstr "一个返回兽人矿井的楼梯。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a staircase back to the vaults"
msgid "A staircase leading back to the Vaults.\n"
msgstr "一个返回宝库的楼梯。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a staircase leading out of the dungeon"
msgid ""
"This staircase leads back out of the dungeon.\n"
"\n"
"A staircase leading out of the dungeon. Climbing these stairs will end your\n"
"quest, whether you carry the Orb with you or not.\n"
msgstr "这个楼梯，穿过它能离开地下城。\n\n这个楼梯是离开地下城的出口。爬上这些楼梯会结束你的探索，无论是否携带宝珠。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a staircase back to the crypt"
msgid "A staircase leading back to the Crypt.\n"
msgstr "一个返回墓室的楼梯。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a staircase to the crypt"
msgid "A staircase leading to the Crypt.\n"
msgstr "一个通往墓室的楼梯。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a staircase to the ecumenical temple"
msgid "A staircase leading to the Ecumenical Temple.\n"
msgstr "一个通往众神殿的楼梯。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a staircase to the elven halls"
msgid "A staircase leading to the Elven Halls.\n"
msgstr "一个通往精灵大厅的楼梯。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a staircase to the lair"
msgid "A staircase leading to the Lair of Beasts.\n"
msgstr "一个通往野兽巢穴的楼梯。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a staircase to the orcish mines"
msgid "A staircase leading to the Orcish Mines.\n"
msgstr "一个通往兽人矿井的楼梯。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a staircase to the shoals"
msgid "A staircase leading to the Shoals.\n"
msgstr "一个通往海滩的楼梯。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a staircase to the slime pits"
msgid "A staircase leading to the Slime Pits.\n"
msgstr "一个通往史莱姆巢穴的楼梯。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a staircase to the snake pit"
msgid "A staircase leading to the Snake Pit.\n"
msgstr "一个通往蛇穴的楼梯。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a staircase to the swamp"
msgid "A staircase leading to the Swamp.\n"
msgstr "一个通往沼泽的楼梯。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a staircase to the tomb"
msgid "A staircase leading to the Tomb of the Ancients.\n"
msgstr "一个通往古人灵庙的楼梯。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a gate to the vaults"
msgid "A gateway leading to the Vaults.\n"
msgstr "一个通往宝库的入口。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a transporter"
msgid ""
"A one-way portal to another place on this level. When using a transporter,\n"
"adjacent allies and monsters will travel with you to the other side.\n"
msgstr "一道通往当前楼层其他位置的单向转移装置。使用时，相邻的盟友与怪物都会与你一同前往另一端。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a transporter landing site"
msgid ""
"The destination site of a transporter. As the portal is one-way, you cannot use\n"
"this location to return back through the transporter.\n"
msgstr "转移装置的落点。转移装置是单向的，因此无法从这里返回。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an open door"
msgid ""
"An open wooden door. If closed again, all monsters that can wield equipment,\n"
"and some of them that can't, could open it again. If it is closed and reopened\n"
"by a monster that is aware of you, it has a chance of breaking.\n"
msgstr "一扇打开的木门。重新关上后，所有能使用装备的怪物，以及部分不能使用装备的怪物，都能再次打开它。若门被发现你的怪物重新打开，就有几率破裂。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a closed door"
msgid ""
"A closed wooden door. All monsters that can wield equipment, and some of them\n"
"that can't, may open it again. If it is opened by a monster while it is aware\n"
"of you, it has a chance of breaking.\n"
msgstr "一扇关闭的木门。所有能使用装备的怪物，以及部分不能使用装备的怪物，都能打开它。若开门的怪物已经发现你，门就有几率破裂。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a broken door"
msgid ""
"A disappointingly poorly maintained wooden door. It'd take nothing short of\n"
"magic to get this properly closed again.\n"
msgstr "一扇令人失望、维护不善的木门。要想恰当地关闭它，只有魔法能做到。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an open translucent door"
msgid ""
"An open door made from magically translucent wood. If closed again, all monsters\n"
"that can wield equipment, and some of them that can't, could open it again. If\n"
"it is closed and reopened by a monster that is aware of you, it has a chance of\n"
"breaking.\n"
msgstr "一扇打开的门，由经魔法处理的半透明木材制成。重新关上后，所有能使用装备的怪物，以及部分不能使用装备的怪物，都能再次打开它。若门被发现你的怪物重新打开，就有几率破裂。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a closed translucent door"
msgid ""
"A closed door made from magically translucent wood. All monsters that can wield\n"
"equipment, and some of them that can't, may open it again. If it is opened by a\n"
"monster while it is aware of you, it has a chance of breaking.\n"
msgstr "一扇关闭的门，由经魔法处理的半透明木材制成。所有能使用装备的怪物，以及部分不能使用装备的怪物，都能打开它。若开门的怪物已经发现你，门就有几率破裂。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a broken translucent door"
msgid "<A broken door>\n"
msgstr "<A broken door>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a sealed door"
msgid ""
"A door sealed tightly by arcane runes. It refuses to open for any creature not\n"
"recognised by its magic.\n"
msgstr "这扇门被奥术符文牢固地封印着。只有被这扇门上面的魔法承认的生物才能打开它。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a runed door"
msgid ""
"A door, covered in runic writing. It looks like there is something special\n"
"behind it — perhaps danger, perhaps treasure. You may break the runes by\n"
"opening it like any other door, but creatures of the dungeon will not dare\n"
"to try.\n"
msgstr "这扇门上满是符文记号。\n门的后面应该有什么特别的东西——可能是危险，也可能是宝藏。\n像打开其他门那样就能破坏符文，但地下城里的生物可不敢尝试。\n"

