msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an alarm trap"
msgid ""
"A trap that creates a loud noise to attract nearby monsters. In addition to the\n"
"noise it creates, it will apply an enchantment making monsters all over the\n"
"level aware of your location. Hostile monsters may trigger this trap themselves\n"
"to invoke its effects against you, but your allies will avoid stepping on it.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个陷阱会发出很大的噪音引来附近的怪物。\n"
"除了产生噪音外，它还会使用魔力，使当前层的所有怪物得知你的位置。\n"
"敌对的怪物可能会故意触发这个陷阱从而对你引起效果，而你的盟友会避免踩到它。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a dispersal trap"
msgid ""
"Anyone stepping on this trap will translocate themselves and anyone else in view\n"
"to a new location nearby. Hostile monsters may trigger this trap, but your\n"
"allies will avoid stepping on it.\n"
"\n"
"After triggering, it cannot be triggered again for several turns.\n"
msgstr ""
"踩上此陷阱的生物，会让自己和视野内的其他所有生物位移到附近的新位置。敌对怪物可能触发它，但你的盟友会避免踩上。\n"
"\n"
"触发后，数回合内无法再次触发。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a net trap"
msgid ""
"A large concealed net launcher hanging from the dungeon's ceiling. Enchanted by\n"
"the power of Zot, whenever an intelligent creature steps here - whether friend\n"
"or foe - the net will land only on you.\n"
msgstr "一个挂在地下城天花板上的巨大而隐蔽的网。\n它被佐特注入魔力，每当有智慧生物来到这里——无论是敌是友——网只会落你身上。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a pressure plate"
msgid ""
"A trigger of some sort. You cannot tell what kind of trap it is attached to.\n"
"Its complicated detection system will trigger the trap even when someone flies\n"
"over it.\n"
msgstr ""
"某种触发机关。你无法确定它所连接的陷阱的类型。\n"
"它有着复杂的探测系统，即便是飞过也会触发陷阱。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a teleport trap"
msgid ""
"A magical trap which will displace anyone passing over it to a random place on\n"
"the same dungeon level. It is worn with age, and will dissipate on use.\n"
msgstr "这个魔力陷阱，任何经过它的人会被传送到这层地下城的一个随机地点。\n它会被消磨，一旦被激活就会消散。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a permanent teleport trap"
msgid ""
"A magical trap which will displace anyone passing over it to a random place on\n"
"the same dungeon level.\n"
msgstr "这个魔力陷阱，任何经过它的人会被传送到这层地下城的一个随机地点。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a web"
msgid ""
"A spider's web. The spider who left it must have been huge, as it seems to be\n"
"made for trapping {{ return you.genus(true) }} rather than flies.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个蜘蛛网。留下这张网的蜘蛛肯定是个大家伙，\n"
"因为这似乎是用来诱捕{{ return you.genus(true) }}而不是苍蝇的。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a zot trap"
msgid ""
"A trap which inflicts dangerously unpredictable magical effects on those\n"
"unlucky enough to step on it. You may find yourself petrified, contaminated\n"
"with enormous amounts of wild magic, have mighty fiends summoned against you,\n"
"or the like. Hostile monsters may trigger this trap themselves to invoke its\n"
"effects against you, but your allies will avoid stepping on it.\n"
msgstr "一座会向不幸踩中者施加危险而难以预测魔法效果的陷阱。你可能遭到石化、被大量野性魔法污染，或面对召唤而来的强大魔王等。敌对怪物可能主动触发它来对付你，但你的盟友会避免踩上。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a flagged portal"
msgid ""
"A portal leading to a bailey, gradually fading away as the standard is lowered\n"
"to the ground.\n"
msgstr "一个通往堡场的门户，会随着旗帜降至地面而逐渐消失。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a gauntlet entrance"
msgid "A portal leading to a gauntlet.\n"
msgstr "一个通往竞技场的门户。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a flickering gateway to a bazaar"
msgid ""
"A portal leading to a bazaar, where itinerant merchants gather to sell their\n"
"wares. They never stay in one place for very long.\n"
msgstr "一个通往市集的门户，行商聚集在那里出售商品。\n他们永远不会在一个地方呆很长时间。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a gateway to a bazaar"
msgid ""
"A portal leading to a bazaar, where itinerant merchants gather to sell their\n"
"wares. They will wait for you, but once you get a chance to browse their\n"
"inventory, the merchants will depart in search of other customers.\n"
msgstr "一个通往市集的门户，行商聚集在那里出售商品。\n他们会等你，但一旦你浏览过他们的存货，商家将出发寻找其他客户。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a frozen archway"
msgid "A portal leading to an ice cave. The archway is gradually melting away.\n"
msgstr "一个通往冰窟的门户。拱门在渐渐融化。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a glacial archway"
msgid ""
"A portal leading to a glacial chasm, far more dangerous than the icy caverns\n"
"found in the shallower reaches of the Dungeon. The archway is gradually melting\n"
"away.\n"
msgstr "一个通往冰川裂缝的门户，比地下城浅层的冰窟危险得多。拱门在渐渐融化。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a sand-covered staircase"
msgid ""
"A staircase leading to an ossuary. Sand is continuously pouring onto it,\n"
"gradually blocking the entrance.\n"
msgstr "一个通往埋骨地的楼梯。沙子在不断倾泻，会逐渐封住入口。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a glowing drain"
msgid "A passage leading to a sewer. It is gradually rusting away.\n"
msgstr "一个通往下水道的通道。它在逐渐锈蚀。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a portal to a secret trove of treasure"
msgid ""
"A portal leading to a treasure trove. This portal is unstable and will collapse\n"
"after a single use.\n"
msgstr "一道通往秘藏的传送门。它很不稳定，使用一次后便会崩塌。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a dark tunnel"
msgid ""
"A portal leading to the heart of a volcano. Rocks are falling from the roof and\n"
"sides of the tunnel, filling the entry.\n"
msgstr "一个通往火山的门户。岩石不断从隧道顶部和侧面落下，将会堵住入口。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a crumbling gateway"
msgid ""
"A salt-encrusted arch, covered with carved entreaties to the good gods to\n"
"contain the evils sealed therein. Whatever protections this arch once offered\n"
"have finally succumbed to the ravages of time, and a bitter breeze pours forth\n"
"from the distant land beyond.\n"
msgstr "一座结着盐壳的拱门，上面刻满向善神祈求的文字，恳请祂们遏制封在里面的邪恶。拱门曾有的保护终于败给岁月摧残，刺骨寒风从另一端遥远的土地涌出。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a magical portal"
msgid "A portal leading to a wizard's laboratory. It is fading away.\n"
msgstr "一个通往巫师实验室的门户。它在逐渐消失。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a collapsed entrance"
msgid "A collapsed passage which cannot be used anymore.\n"
msgstr "这个坍塌的通道，无法继续使用。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a rock-blocked tunnel"
msgid "A tunnel which is no longer passable.\n"
msgstr "这个隧道不可继续通行。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a rocky tunnel leading out of this place"
msgid ""
"An unstable passage in the volcanic rock, admitting a draft of cool air from\n"
"beyond. It leads back to the place you came from. You will be unable to return\n"
"here once you pass through it.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个火山岩体中不稳定的通道，外面的冷空气可以从中进入。\n"
"它导向你回到原来的地方。一旦你穿过它，就再也无法回来了。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a portal leading out of this place"
msgid ""
"A shimmering magical gate leading back to the place you came from. You will be\n"
"unable to return here once you pass through it.\n"
msgstr "这个闪着微光的魔法门导向你回到原来的地方。一旦你穿过它，就再也无法回来了。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an autumnal tree"
msgid ""
"A large tree that appears to be permanently locked in an autumnal moment.\n"
"Leaves, coloured red and gold, fall from its branches and float gracefully to\n"
"the floor, but before they even reach the ground they shimmer and reappear on\n"
"the branches, ready to fall again.\n"
msgstr ""
"这棵高大的树木仿佛永远定格在秋季的一瞬间。\n"
"红色和金色的树叶从树枝上落下，优雅地飘在半空中，\n"
"但在它们碰到地面之前，它们会闪着光，重新出现在树枝上，将要再次飘落。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a crumbled stone wall"
msgid ""
"A stone wall on the brink of collapsing from disrepair but somehow remaining\n"
"standing, seemingly frozen in time.\n"
msgstr "一面因年久失修而濒临坍塌的石墙，不知何故屹立不倒，仿佛凝固在时间里。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a strange statue"
msgid ""
"A statue with strange and alien features. Is it because the statue is worn and\n"
"tarnished that it has become so unrecognisable? Or is it that the subject was\n"
"something demonic and evil?\n"
msgstr ""
"这座雕塑看起来非常奇怪诡异。雕塑是因为磨损和失去光泽，就变得如此难以辨认？\n"
"还是它的主题就是什么恶魔和邪恶的东西？\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a strange rock wall"
msgid "A wall decorated with images you might see in a tomb.\n"
msgstr "这面墙上装饰着你可能会在坟墓中看到的图像。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a highly decorated stone wall"
msgid "A wall covered with disturbing, horrifying images.\n"
msgstr "这面墙上满是令人不安、恐怖图案。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:the rough-hewn floor"
msgid "The floor. It is rough and uneven in places.\n"
msgstr "地面。有些地方粗糙不平。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:viscous fluid"
msgid ""
"A sticky fluid which seems to be secreted by the nearby walls. It looks\n"
"disgusting.\n"
msgstr "这里的墙壁似乎在分泌一种黏性液体。看起来真恶心。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a sinewy wall"
msgid "A wall that looks strangely organic, but incredibly tough and durable.\n"
msgstr "这面墙看起来像奇怪有机体，但却惊人地坚韧。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a thin membrane"
msgid "A strange membrane, thin enough to see through.\n"
msgstr "这层奇怪的膜很薄，可以透过它看东西。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:the pulsating floor"
msgid "The floor. It pulses to an unknown beat.\n"
msgstr "地面。它以未知的节奏搏动着。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:zonguldrok's gravestone"
msgid "A gravestone of the house of Zonguldrok, still dripping with brackish ichor.\n"
msgstr "宗古多克家的一块墓碑，上面还滴着微咸的灵液。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a gravestone"
msgid "A nameless grave.\n"
msgstr "一个无名的墓碑。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:the dimension's edge"
msgid ""
"The edge of this tiny, isolated plane, where space itself dissolves into\n"
"oblivion. Entering or affecting this black void is impossible.\n"
msgstr ""
"在这个孤独的微型位面边缘，就连空间本身就消失在虚无之中。\n"
"你不可能踏入这片黑色虚空，也不可能改变它。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a wall of crystal"
msgid "<A crystal wall>\n"
msgstr "<A crystal wall>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:the damp floor"
msgid ""
"The floor. It remains forever damp, perhaps due to the humidity or the constant\n"
"flow of clouds.\n"
msgstr "地面。它永远保持潮湿，这可能是因为有潮气或云在不断流动。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a wall of white crystal"
msgid "A wall made from low-grade crystal with an opalescent gleam.\n"
msgstr "这面墙由次等水晶制成，有着乳白色的光芒。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a black wall"
msgid ""
"A wall made perhaps from stone, or solid charcoal, or a substance found only in\n"
"the deepest hells.\n"
msgstr "这面墙可能是由石头或固体木炭或只有在最深处的地狱中才会有的物质制成的。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a carved rock wall"
msgid "A wall decorated with images of death and destruction.\n"
msgstr "这面墙上装饰着死亡和破坏的图案。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a dead tree"
msgid "The dry remains of a long-dead tree.\n"
msgstr "一棵死去已久的树的干枯残骸。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a dead mangrove"
msgid "The dry remains of a long-dead mangrove.\n"
msgstr "一棵死去已久的红树的干枯残骸。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a metal statue"
msgid ""
"A base type statue for other statue flavours. If you see this, file a bug\n"
"report.\n"
msgstr "一座其他风格雕塑的基本款雕塑。如果你碰到这个，请提交错误报告。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an iron statue"
msgid ""
"A statue of an ancient warrior, festooned with trophies from fallen victims.\n"
"Some dark substance oozes from the gaps in its visor; surely it must be oil..?\n"
msgstr ""
"一尊古代战士的雕像，上面饰有从手下败将那里获得的战利品。\n"
"一些深色物质从其面甲的缝隙渗出，当然，这一定是油……？\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:ashen ground"
msgid ""
"Ash and embers, littered with broken treasures and worthless coins from realms\n"
"long fallen.\n"
msgstr "灰烬和余烬，其中散落着早已陨落的王国的破碎的珍宝和毫无价值的硬币。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a tempered metal wall"
msgid ""
"Walls of brass and nickel, covered in a thin golden foil steadily peeling away\n"
"in the constant, oppressive heat. Designs depict mortals dealing with devils,\n"
"but the former rarely seem to come out ahead on the exchange.\n"
msgstr ""
"这面墙由黄铜和镍制成，上面覆盖着的一层薄薄金箔在持续的高温下不断脱落。\n"
"图案描绘着凡人与魔鬼在做交易，但前者似乎很少能在交易中占上风。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an ice-covered rock wall"
msgid ""
"A rock wall coated in a thick layer of ice. Twisted faces glower beneath the\n"
"surface, locked in perpetual grimaces of rage and betrayal.\n"
msgstr ""
"这面岩墙上有一层厚厚的冰霜。\n"
"表层下有扭曲的脸在怒目而视，这张愤怒和背叛的怪相永远被定格着。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an ice-covered stone wall"
msgid ""
"A stone wall coated in a thick layer of ice. Twisted faces glower beneath the\n"
"surface, locked in perpetual grimaces of rage and betrayal.\n"
msgstr ""
"这面石墙上有一层厚厚的冰霜。\n"
"表层下有扭曲的脸在怒目而视，这张愤怒和背叛的怪相永远被定格着。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:frost-covered floor"
msgid ""
"Earth locked within perpetual frost and cold. It seems ageless and changeless,\n"
"as though it has existed in this state for an eternity.\n"
msgstr ""
"这片地面永远被凝结在冰霜和寒冷之中。\n"
"它似乎是永驻的、不变的，仿佛这种状态已存在了永恒的时光。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a golden statue"
msgid "A solid gold statue of a saint.\n"
msgstr "一尊纯金的圣人雕像。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a silver statue"
msgid ""
"A geometric statue of solid silver, in both material and form championing\n"
"security and stasis.\n"
msgstr "一座由纯银制成的几何图形状雕塑，无论是材质还是形式，都在颂扬安全和静止。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a scintillating statue"
msgid ""
"A magically shifting statue seemingly content to glimmer and dance in place,\n"
"dedicated to the ineffable cosmic games of chaos.\n"
msgstr "一座神奇的变幻着的雕塑，似乎满足于在此为难以言喻的宇宙混乱游戏献上微光和舞蹈。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an arcane conduit"
msgid ""
"A strange but benign metal construct, analysing raw ambient magical energy. If\n"
"destroyed and disrupted by sufficiently mighty magic, its destructive mystic\n"
"energy will harmlessly disperse.\n"
msgstr "一个奇特但无害的金属构造物，正在分析周围原始的魔法能量。若被足够强大的魔法摧毁或扰乱，其中的破坏性的奥秘能量就会无害地消散。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a misfortune conduit"
msgid ""
"A strange but benign metal construct, analysing raw ambient magical energy. If\n"
"destroyed and disrupted by sufficiently mighty magic, its malevolent cursed\n"
"energy will harmlessly disperse.\n"
msgstr "一个奇特但无害的金属构造物，正在分析周围原始的魔法能量。若被足够强大的魔法摧毁或扰乱，其中的恶毒的诅咒能量就会无害地消散。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a dimensional conduit"
msgid ""
"A strange but benign metal construct, analysing raw ambient magical energy. If\n"
"destroyed and disrupted by sufficiently mighty magic, its extraplanar warp\n"
"energy will harmlessly disperse.\n"
msgstr "一个奇特但无害的金属构造物，正在分析周围原始的魔法能量。若被足够强大的魔法摧毁或扰乱，其中的异位面的扭曲能量就会无害地消散。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a soul conduit"
msgid ""
"A strange but benign metal construct, analysing raw ambient magical energy. If\n"
"destroyed and disrupted by sufficiently mighty magic, its negative energy will\n"
"harmlessly disperse.\n"
msgstr "一个奇特但无害的金属构造物，正在分析周围原始的魔法能量。若被足够强大的魔法摧毁或扰乱，其中的负能量就会无害地消散。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an alchemical conduit"
msgid ""
"A strange but benign metal construct, analysing raw ambient magical energy. If\n"
"destroyed and disrupted by sufficiently mighty magic, its venomous churning\n"
"energy will harmlessly disperse.\n"
msgstr "一个奇特但无害的金属构造物，正在分析周围原始的魔法能量。若被足够强大的魔法摧毁或扰乱，其中的翻涌的毒性能量就会无害地消散。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a fiery conduit"
msgid ""
"A strange but benign metal construct, analysing raw ambient magical energy. If\n"
"destroyed and disrupted by sufficiently mighty magic, its ever-burning energy\n"
"will harmlessly disperse.\n"
msgstr "一个奇特但无害的金属构造物，正在分析周围原始的魔法能量。若被足够强大的魔法摧毁或扰乱，其中的永燃能量就会无害地消散。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an icy conduit"
msgid ""
"A strange but benign metal construct, analysing raw ambient magical energy. If\n"
"destroyed and disrupted by sufficiently mighty magic, its chilling cold energy\n"
"will harmlessly disperse.\n"
msgstr "一个奇特但无害的金属构造物，正在分析周围原始的魔法能量。若被足够强大的魔法摧毁或扰乱，其中的凛冽的寒冷能量就会无害地消散。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an earthen conduit"
msgid ""
"A strange but benign metal construct, analysing raw ambient magical energy. If\n"
"destroyed and disrupted by sufficiently mighty magic, its seismic energy will\n"
"harmlessly disperse.\n"
msgstr "一个奇特但无害的金属构造物，正在分析周围原始的魔法能量。若被足够强大的魔法摧毁或扰乱，其中的地震能量就会无害地消散。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a storm conduit"
msgid ""
"A strange but benign metal construct, analysing raw ambient magical energy. If\n"
"destroyed and disrupted by sufficiently mighty magic, its crackling energy will\n"
"harmlessly disperse.\n"
msgstr "一个奇特但无害的金属构造物，正在分析周围原始的魔法能量。若被足够强大的魔法摧毁或扰乱，其中的噼啪作响的能量就会无害地消散。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a bedevilled crystal wall"
msgid ""
"A wall made from shimmering crystal, from which some demonic plane peers out.\n"
"While its composition both make it resist destruction plus reflect both fire and\n"
"cold, the otherworldly forces within it seem to be entirely harmless... from\n"
"this end, anyway.\n"
msgstr ""
"这面墙由散发微光的水晶制成，一些恶魔位面从中向外隐现。\n"
"虽然它的组成成分既能抵抗破坏，又能反射火和寒，\n"
"但它内部的异界力量似乎完全无害……至少是就这一端而言。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a silver wall"
msgid "A wall made of pure silver.\n"
msgstr "这面墙由纯银制成。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a rune-carved stone wall"
msgid ""
"A strangely slime-free stone wall, carved all over with countless protective\n"
"runes.\n"
msgstr "一面奇怪的没有黏液的石墙，上面刻满了无数保护符文。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a rune-carved clear stone wall"
msgid ""
"A strangely slime-free stone wall, with strange lights twinkling within its\n"
"airy confines. Mystical runes are scattered across its surface, seemingly\n"
"referring to a 'Royal Jelly'.\n"
msgstr "一面奇异地不沾黏液的石墙，通透的内部闪着怪光。表面散布的神秘符文似乎提及一只“皇家胶怪”。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a sarcophagus"
msgid "An ancient sarcophagus. It appears to be empty.\n"
msgstr "一个古代的石棺。它似乎是空的。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a heavily etched metal wall"
msgid ""
"A metal wall etched with murals depicting, in great and gruesome detail,\n"
"exactly what will be done to anyone caught stealing from the Vaults.\n"
msgstr ""
"这面金属墙上蚀刻着壁画，\n"
"以极其可怕的细节描绘着从宝库中盗窃被抓的人的悲惨下场。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a heavily etched crystal wall"
msgid ""
"A crystal wall etched with murals depicting, in great and gruesome detail,\n"
"exactly what will be done to anyone caught stealing from the Vaults.\n"
msgstr ""
"这面水晶墙上蚀刻着壁画，\n"
"以极其可怕的细节描绘着从宝库中盗窃被抓的人的悲惨下场。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an adventurer's gravestone"
msgid "The grave of an adventurer who came close to victory.\n"
msgstr "这个坟墓埋葬着一位功亏一篑的冒险者。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an ice choked empty arch of ancient stone"
msgid "An inoperative portal, nearly completely encased in a mass of ice.\n"
msgstr "一个失效的门户，几乎完全被冰块包裹。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an ice covered gate leading back out of this place"
msgid ""
"A portal leading back to the place you came from. Its magic is holding the ice\n"
"at bay, preventing it from blocking the gate. You will be unable to return here\n"
"once you pass through it.\n"
msgstr "一道返回来处的传送门。门上的魔法将冰挡在外面，使其无法封住入口。一旦穿过，就无法再回到这里。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an ice covered rock wall"
msgid "A rock wall covered by a thick layer of frost and ice.\n"
msgstr "这面岩墙上有一层厚厚的冰霜。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:some ice crusted deep water"
msgid "A pool of deep water, crusted with broken blocks of ice.\n"
msgstr "一个深水池，表面冻结成了碎冰块。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:some ice crusted shallow water"
msgid "A pool of shallow water, crusted with broken blocks of ice.\n"
msgstr "一个浅水池，表面冻结成了碎冰块。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a large window"
msgid ""
"A window embedded in the side of an enormous metal pipe, allowing observation\n"
"of the water flowing inside.\n"
msgstr "一个嵌在巨大金属管道侧面的窗户，从中可以观察到管内的水流。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a petrified tree"
msgid ""
"An ancient tree, long ago passed from biology into geology. While no longer\n"
"wooden in a material sense, it retains the spiritual qualities of a tree.\n"
msgstr ""
"一棵古树，很久以前就从生物学转入地质学意义。\n"
"虽然它在物质意义上不再是木质的，但保留了树的精神品质。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an elephant-shaped statue"
msgid "A worn granite statue depicting an elephant standing guard.\n"
msgstr "这座有些磨损的花岗岩雕塑刻画着一头大象在放哨。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a weirdly glowing ball"
msgid "A floating ball radiating with shimmering light.\n"
msgstr "这个悬在半空中的球体散发着微光。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a sealed sarcophagus"
msgid "An ancient sarcophagus. It is sealed shut.\n"
msgstr "一个古代的石棺。它密封着。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an endless expanse of salt"
msgid ""
"A seemingly endless, flat plain, wracked by blinding salt-storms. Anyone\n"
"venturing across it would be lost beyond all hope in short order.\n"
msgstr ""
"一片似乎无尽的平原被眩目的盐风暴肆虐着。\n"
"任何冒险要穿越它的人，很快都会失去一切希望。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a ruined idol"
msgid ""
"A monument to the glory of a dead god. The statue has been methodically\n"
"defaced; not a single distinguishing feature remains.\n"
msgstr ""
"一座纪念碑，用来纪念已故的神的荣光。\n"
"这座雕塑已经被有条不紊地损毁了，没剩下一个可辨识的特征。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a broken fleshy orifice"
msgid "It seems to be oozing quietly. Best not to touch it.\n"
msgstr "它似乎在静静渗出东西。最好别碰。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a spawn point"
msgid "An entrance that the opposition may appear from.\n"
msgstr "敌人可能会入场的地方。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an exit from the tutorial"
msgid "A way out of the dungeon, letting you finish this lesson.\n"
msgstr "这条路带你离开地下城，这样，这一课就结束了。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:haloed"
msgid ""
"This area is lit by a divine halo, decreasing your stealth, preventing\n"
"invisibility, and increasing the accuracy of attacks against any illuminated\n"
"creatures.\n"
msgstr "这片区域被神圣光环照亮，会削弱你的潜行能力、阻止隐形，并提高针对所有被照亮生物的攻击命中率。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:umbraed"
msgid ""
"This area is wreathed by an umbra, improving your stealth if you are attuned to\n"
"the shadows, and decreasing the accuracy of attacks by those unattuned to the\n"
"shadows.\n"
msgstr "这片区域被幽影笼罩。若你与阴影相契，潜行能力会提高；不与阴影相契者的攻击命中率则会降低。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:liquefied"
msgid ""
"The ground here is liquefied, making movement slow and causing any attempts to\n"
"attack in melee to sometimes fail.\n"
msgstr "这片地面被液化，移动会被减缓，发出任何近战攻击都有可能失手。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:disjunction haloed"
msgid ""
"This area is bathed in translocational energy, causing creatures to blink away\n"
"from the originator of the energy with an increasing chance the closer they are\n"
"to the caster.\n"
msgstr "这片区域充满位移能量，使生物向远离能量来源的方向闪烁；离施法者越近，闪烁几率越高。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:ice covered"
msgid ""
"This wall is covered in magical ice that freezes victims who wander nearby.\n"
"This damage bypasses any armour the target may have, and will slow cold-blooded\n"
"creatures. Each victim is only ever affected by one icy wall at a time.\n"
"\n"
"The creator of this icy covering and any of their allies can walk safely past\n"
"this wall.\n"
msgstr ""
"这面墙上覆盖着有魔力的冰，会冻结在附近徘徊的受害者。\n"
"这种伤害能无视目标可能拥有的任何护甲，还会暂时减缓冷血动物的速度。\n"
"每个受害者一次只能受到一堵冰墙的影响。\n"
"\n"
"墙上覆着的这种冰的创造者及其任何盟友都可以安全地经过这面墙。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:awoken"
msgid ""
"This tree has been temporarily enchanted to grant it some limited motility,\n"
"allowing it to lash out out at any adjacent enemies of the creature who awoke\n"
"it.\n"
msgstr ""
"这棵树被暂时注入魔力，从而获得一些有限的活动能力，\n"
"它会猛烈攻击任何相邻的与唤醒它的生物为敌的怪物。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:tree burning"
msgid ""
"It is susceptible to bolts of lightning and to sufficiently intense sources of\n"
"fire. The resulting blaze can flare up, spreading to areas nearby and igniting\n"
"other trees.\n"
msgstr ""
"它容易受到闪电和足够强烈的火源的影响。\n"
"由此产生的大火可能会蔓延到附近区域，引燃其他树木。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:mangrove burning"
msgid ""
"It is susceptible to bolts of lightning and to sufficiently intense sources of\n"
"fire. Mangroves do not burn as vigorously as normal trees, due to growing on\n"
"swampy terrain, and leave behind shallow water after they smoulder.\n"
msgstr ""
"它容易受到闪电和足够强烈的火源的影响。\n"
"由于生长在沼泽地带，红树燃烧起来不像普通树木那样旺盛，在闷烧后会留下浅水。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:demonic tree burning"
msgid ""
"It is susceptible to bolts of lightning and to sufficiently intense sources of\n"
"fire. Burning this tree releases a cloud of pure chaos instead of flames.\n"
msgstr ""
"它容易受到闪电和足够强烈的火源的影响。\n"
"这棵树燃烧会释放出纯粹的混乱云而不是火焰云。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a frigid wall"
msgid ""
"A wall that radiates a chill so intense it can damage enemies which stand next\n"
"to it.\n"
msgstr "一面散发强烈寒气的墙，足以伤害站在旁边的敌人。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a metal staircase leading down"
msgid ""
"A staircase leading down to the grand vaults containing the silver rune of Zot,\n"
"whose wealth attracts the most powerful champions from across the Dungeon to its\n"
"defence.\n"
msgstr "一座通往下方宏伟宝库的楼梯，里面藏有佐特银色符文。宝库的财富吸引了地下城各处最强大的勇士前来守卫。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a metal staircase leading up"
msgid ""
"A staircase leading up from the grand vaults containing the silver rune of Zot,\n"
"whose wealth attracts the most powerful champions from across the Dungeon to its\n"
"defence.\n"
msgstr "一座从宏伟宝库向上延伸的楼梯，宝库里面藏有佐特银色符文。那里的财富吸引了地下城各处最强大的勇士前来守卫。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a slimy stone staircase leading down"
msgid ""
"A stone staircase leading further down.\n"
"\n"
"{{\n"
"    if you.god() == \"Jiyva\" then\n"
"        return \"It is slick with slippery slime, but that is no obstacle for one \" ..\n"
"               \"such as yourself who has embraced the way of all slime.\"\n"
"    else\n"
"        return \"It is slick with slippery slime which will make it impossible \" ..\n"
"               \"for you to climb back up again until the power ruling this place \" ..\n"
"               \"is destroyed (or you choose to join it). However, being coated in \" ..\n"
"               \"this slime will greatly increase your HP and MP regenaration for \" ..\n"
"               \"short while afterward.\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"
msgstr ""
"一座通往更深处的石楼梯。\n"
"\n"
"{{\n"
"    if you.god() == \"Jiyva\" then\n"
"        return \"楼梯沾满滑溜的黏液，但这不会妨碍\" ..\n"
"               \"像你这样拥抱一切黏液之道的人。\"\n"
"    else\n"
"        return \"楼梯沾满滑溜的黏液，导致你\" ..\n"
"               \"无法沿原路爬回，直到统治此地的力量\" ..\n"
"               \"遭到摧毁（或你选择加入它）。不过，沾上\" ..\n"
"               \"这种黏液后，你的生命和魔力恢复速度会在\" ..\n"
"               \"随后短时间内大幅提高。\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a slimy stone staircase leading up"
msgid ""
"A stone staircase leading back up.\n"
"\n"
"{{\n"
"    if you.god() == \"Jiyva\" then\n"
"        return \"It is slick with slippery slime, but that is no obstacle for one \" ..\n"
"               \"such as yourself who has embraced the way of all slime.\"\n"
"    else\n"
"        return \"It is slick with slippery slime, making it impossible for you to \" ..\n"
"               \"climb until the power ruling this place is destroyed (or you choose \" ..\n"
"               \"to join it).\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"
msgstr ""
"一座返回上方的石楼梯。\n"
"\n"
"{{\n"
"    if you.god() == \"Jiyva\" then\n"
"        return \"楼梯沾满滑溜的黏液，但这不会妨碍\" ..\n"
"               \"像你这样拥抱一切黏液之道的人。\"\n"
"    else\n"
"        return \"楼梯沾满滑溜的黏液，使你无法\" ..\n"
"               \"攀爬，直到统治此地的力量遭到摧毁（或你选择\" ..\n"
"               \"加入它）。\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a fountain of eyes"
msgid "A decorative fountain, bubbling over with listless and unmoving eyes.\n"
msgstr "一座装饰喷泉，不断冒出呆滞不动的眼球。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a cache of baked goods"
msgid ""
"A hoard of breadstuffs, baked and fried from minor divine gifts of flour and\n"
"growth cultures, granted extended shelflife through sacred succour. You already\n"
"carry as much food as you will ever need for this journey, but a light snack\n"
"shouldn't hurt.\n"
msgstr "一堆烘烤、油炸的面食，原料是神祇小小恩赐的面粉与发酵菌种，保质期也受神圣庇护而延长。你携带的食物已经足够完成旅程，但吃点零嘴总无妨。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a cache of fruit"
msgid ""
"A pile of assorted fruit, ranging from common dungeon staples like chokos and\n"
"snozzcumbers, to rarer treats such as apples and oranges. You already carry as\n"
"much food as you will ever need for this journey, but the occasional nibble\n"
"wouldn't hurt.\n"
msgstr "一堆各色水果，既有地下城常见的佛手瓜和鼻涕瓜，也有苹果、橘子等少见的美味。你携带的食物已经足够完成旅程，但偶尔尝一口总无妨。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a cache of meat"
msgid ""
"A stash of preserved meats of varied origins and preparations: strips of jerky,\n"
"lumpy smoked sausages, and indeterminate protein rations. You already carry as\n"
"much food as you will ever need for this journey, but this could offer the rare\n"
"chance to try out yak...\n"
msgstr "一批来源和制法各异的腌制肉食：肉干条、块状熏肠，以及成分不明的蛋白口粮。你携带的食物已经足够完成旅程，但这可能是难得的品尝牦牛肉的机会……\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:the orb dais"
msgid ""
"A raised pedestal upon which rests the fabled Orb of Zot. More ancient than even\n"
"the dungeon itself, it cannot be destroyed or transformed by any means.\n"
msgstr "一座高台，传说中的佐特宝珠就安放在上面。它比地下城本身还古老，任何手段都无法将其摧毁或变形。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a statue of an orb of fire"
msgid ""
"A statue of a terrifying globe of raw primordial fire, said to dwell within the\n"
"Realm of Zot.\n"
msgstr "一尊可怕的原初烈火球体雕像，据说这种生物栖息在佐特领域。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a statue of an orb of winter"
msgid ""
"A statue of a terrifying globe of uttermost cold, said to dwell within the\n"
"Realm of Zot.\n"
msgstr "一尊可怕的极寒球体雕像，据说这种生物栖息在佐特领域。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a statue of an orb of entropy"
msgid ""
"A statue of a terrifying globe of profound nothingness, said to dwell within the\n"
"Realm of Zot.\n"
msgstr "一尊可怕的深邃虚无球体雕像，据说这种生物栖息在佐特领域。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a runed translucent door"
msgid ""
"A door, covered in runic writing, made from magically translucent wood. It has\n"
"been created to seal away great danger or glorious treasure. You may break the\n"
"runes by opening it like any other door, but creatures of the dungeon will not\n"
"dare to try.\n"
msgstr "一扇布满符文、由魔法半透明木材制成的门。它被造来封住巨大的危险或珍贵的宝藏。你可以像开普通门一样破开符文，但地下城中的生物不敢尝试。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a large runed translucent door"
msgid "<A runed translucent door>\n"
msgstr "<A runed translucent door>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a runed translucent gate"
msgid "<A runed translucent door>\n"
msgstr "<A runed translucent door>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a huge runed translucent gate"
msgid "<A runed translucent door>\n"
msgstr "<A runed translucent door>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an archmage's trap"
msgid ""
"A magical trap crafted by some avaricious master wizard. When you or a hostile\n"
"monster steps on it, you will lose a percentage of your mp, while up to three of\n"
"the strongest hostile spellcasters in sight will have their spells empowered.\n"
"Your allies will avoid stepping on it.\n"
msgstr "某位贪婪大法师制造的魔法陷阱。你或敌对怪物踩上时，你会失去一定比例的魔力，而视野内最强大的敌对施法者中，最多三个会得到法术强化。你的盟友会避免踩上它。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a devourer's trap"
msgid ""
"A magical trap linked by divine cruelty to the stomachs of some unfathomable\n"
"interdimensional predators. When you or a hostile monster steps on it, it has a\n"
"high chance it will expel digestive acid onto you, corroding you. Your allies\n"
"will avoid stepping on it.\n"
msgstr "一座以残酷神力连接着某些难以理解的跨维度掠食者胃袋的魔法陷阱。你或敌对怪物踩上时，它很可能朝你喷出消化酸液，使你受到腐蚀。你的盟友会避免踩上它。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a dispersal trap (recharging)"
msgid ""
"[[A dispersal trap]]\n"
"\n"
"It is currently recharging and will become active again in a short while.\n"
msgstr ""
"[[A dispersal trap]]\n"
"\n"
"它正在重新充能，稍后便会再次启动。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a harlequin's trap"
msgid ""
"A magical trap left behind by the ineffable, spectacular revues of chaos. When\n"
"you or a hostile monster steps on it, up to three of the strongest monsters in\n"
"sight will have their attacks temporarily interwoven with a touch of chaos. Your\n"
"allies will avoid stepping on it.\n"
msgstr "由不可言说、华丽夺目的混沌演出留下的魔法陷阱。你或敌对怪物踩上时，视野内最强大的怪物中，最多三个的攻击会暂时掺入混沌之力。你的盟友会避免踩上它。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a spike launcher"
msgid ""
"A magical contraption which skewers nearby monsters with sharp spikes. It will\n"
"disintegrate after a short length of time or if the caster strays too far away\n"
"from it.\n"
msgstr "一个用尖刺刺穿附近怪物的魔法机关。过一小段时间，或施法者离它太远时，它就会自行瓦解。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a tyrant's trap"
msgid ""
"A magical trap built to bolster the armies of some conquering despot. When you\n"
"or a hostile monster steps on it, your melee attacks will be weakened to make\n"
"up to three of the most dangerous monsters in sight become stronger. Your\n"
"allies will avoid stepping on it.\n"
msgstr "为壮大某位征服暴君的军队而建的魔法陷阱。你或敌对怪物踩上时，你的近战攻击会被削弱，而视野内最危险的怪物中，最多三个会得到强化。你的盟友会避免踩上它。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a phantasmal passage"
msgid ""
"A portal leading to one of many Necropolis repositories, where the freshly slain\n"
"and deeply resentful are sealed away. This wandering rift will eventually move\n"
"elsewhere to receive further dead.\n"
msgstr "一道通往亡者之城众多收容所之一的传送门，那里封存着新死而满怀怨恨的亡者。这道游移的裂隙最终会转往别处，接纳更多死者。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an archival metal wall"
msgid ""
"An ensorcelled metal wall coated in an inscrutable non-linear script, recording\n"
"the regrets of the interred and their visitors alike. As with all metal walls,\n"
"it is next to impossible to destroy, and will ground all varieties of bounding\n"
"lightning.\n"
msgstr "一面施了魔法的金属墙，表面布满难以解读的非线性文字，记录着葬于此地者与来访者的遗憾。如同其他金属墙，它几乎无法被摧毁，并能使各类弹射闪电接地。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a wall of orange crystal"
msgid "A wall made from orange crystal. It has a mind-boggling sheen.\n"
msgstr "一面由橙色水晶制成的墙，泛着令人心神迷乱的光泽。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an unnaturally hard bloodstone wall"
msgid ""
"An indestructible bulwark, wrought from blood and tempered in the suffering of\n"
"mortal lives beyond count.\n"
msgstr "一道坚不可摧的壁垒，由鲜血铸成，在无数凡人的苦难中淬炼。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a decorative floor"
msgid ""
"A base floor type for various decorations one can walk over. If you see this,\n"
"file a bug report.\n"
msgstr "一种用于各种可行走装饰的基础地面类型。若你看见此说明，请提交错误报告。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a tree of woe"
msgid "A half-alive tree burdened with fruits of crystallised sorrow.\n"
msgstr "一棵半死不活的树，枝头压满由悲伤结晶成的果实。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a bloodied mop and bucket"
msgid "A mop and bucket soaked with the bloody aftermath of demonic torture.\n"
msgstr "一套拖把和水桶，浸满恶魔酷刑留下的血迹。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an infernal standard"
msgid ""
"A blazing flag of cruel conquest, planted amid the ruins of many a fallen\n"
"kingdom to claim their ashes in the name of Hell.\n"
msgstr "一面象征残酷征服的燃烧旗帜，插在众多沦陷王国的废墟上，以地狱之名宣告占有它们的灰烬。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a mystic cage"
msgid ""
"A sturdy metal cage, inscribed with cryptic magics. Whatever it once held -\n"
"whether person, beast, or experiment - was evidently already freed in response\n"
"to intruders like you infiltrating the Dungeon.\n"
msgstr "一个坚固的金属笼，上面刻着晦涩的魔法。不论它原本关着人、野兽还是试验品，显然都已为应付你这样的地下城入侵者而放了出来。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an enigmatic dynamo"
msgid ""
"A harmless yet sturdy metal construct, arcane both in power-source and\n"
"purpose. Whatever it analyses, processes, powers, or produces can neither be\n"
"assessed nor accessed by intruders like you infiltrating the Dungeon.\n"
msgstr "一个无害而坚固的金属构造物，无论能源还是用途都充满奥秘。你这样的地下城入侵者既无法弄清，也无法接触它所分析、处理、供能或制造的任何东西。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a nascence circuit"
msgid ""
"A coruscating spark gap of twin electrodes of impenetrably advanced technology.\n"
"These are used to forge and power thaumaturgical constructs, though despite the\n"
"constant crackling, this one is used up and unable to do much more than\n"
"harmlessly dance with the joy of creating life.\n"
msgstr "一组由高深莫测的先进技术制成的双电极火花隙，闪耀着电光。它们用于锻造魔法构造物并为其供能。虽然不断噼啪作响，这一组却已经耗尽，除了为创造生命的喜悦无害地跃动外，再也无能为力。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a floral vase"
msgid ""
"A vibrant bouquet of flowers in a clay vessel, kept alive with ample water\n"
"and some minor magic.\n"
msgstr "一束插在陶器中的鲜艳花朵，靠充足的水和些许魔法维持生机。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a garden patch"
msgid "A small decorative plot of flowers penned in by cobblestone.\n"
msgstr "一小片被鹅卵石围住的装饰花圃。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a flower patch"
msgid "A bed of hardy wildflowers, thriving in this place despite everything.\n"
msgstr "一畦顽强的野花，不顾此地种种逆境，依然茁壮生长。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a mop and bucket"
msgid ""
"A mop and bucket, useful for keeping one's environs orderly and clean. Too bad\n"
"you're here now.\n"
msgstr "一套拖把和水桶，能保持周围整洁有序。可惜你现在来了。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a fur brush"
msgid "A grooming brush laid to rest beside a pile of tangled, matted yak fur.\n"
msgstr "一把梳毛刷，搁在一堆纠结成团的牦牛毛旁边。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a set of bottled spirits"
msgid ""
"A mix of various alcoholic drinks with worn-down labels. Unfortunately, the\n"
"preservative magic sealing each bottle makes it impossible to sample from them\n"
"without smashing their bottles open.\n"
msgstr "几瓶标签已磨损的各式烈酒。可惜，每个瓶口都由保鲜魔法封住，不打碎瓶子就无法品尝。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a djembe set"
msgid ""
"A drum ensemble whose rhythm serves as peaceful recreation here in the depths of\n"
"the earth.\n"
msgstr "一组非洲手鼓，其节奏为地底深处带来平和的消遣。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a caliginous standard"
msgid ""
"A murky flag of dark conquest shimmering with vile energies, planted in the name\n"
"of some grand despoiling crusade.\n"
msgstr "一面象征黑暗征服的阴沉旗帜，闪动着邪恶能量，为某场大肆劫掠的远征而立。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a skull pike"
msgid ""
"Bones are a common sight in the Dungeon, but skulls left impaled in a shrike's\n"
"manner on display send a more deliberate message to trespassers: the pike has\n"
"room for one more skull, and whoever set it up is happy to help relieve its\n"
"owner of theirs.\n"
msgstr "地下城里骨头很常见，但像伯劳鸟串猎物那样，把头骨刺在长枪上展示，是给闯入者更明确的警告：枪上还容得下一颗头骨，立枪者也很乐意帮它的主人摘下来。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a mourning vase"
msgid ""
"A singular flower, suffused with gloom and held in a ceramic grip. It\n"
"is difficult to tell whether it is even still alive.\n"
msgstr "一朵笼罩愁云的花，被陶制器皿握住，甚至很难判断它是否还活着。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a broken floral vase"
msgid "A delicate arrangement, smashed to pieces and consigned to slow starvation.\n"
msgstr "一组精巧的插花，被砸得粉碎，只能慢慢枯死。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:a weapon-inlaid floor"
msgid ""
"The decorative elvish inlayings of weapons mark here the Hall of Blades, where\n"
"many of the Dungeon's keenest weapons originate, magically animated to\n"
"demonstrate their own lethality on would-be thieves.\n"
msgstr "精灵风格的武器嵌饰标示着刀刃大厅。地下城许多最锋利的武器都出自这里，被魔法赋予活力，向意图偷窃者亲自展示其杀伤力。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an orcish standard"
msgid ""
"A flag of Beogh, raised to show that this fortification belongs to some arm of\n"
"the Dungeon's orcish military.\n"
msgstr "一面比欧弗旗帜，标示这座工事属于地下城兽人军队的某个分支。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/features.txt:an open sea?"
msgid ""
"Though it exists in stark defiance of every conventional rule of physics and\n"
"geometry you know to be true, there can be no denying that here, in this tiny\n"
"room, is a vast and terrible sea of impossible size.\n"
"\n"
"Either that, or it's a blue wall.\n"
msgstr ""
"尽管这公然违背你所知的所有常规物理与几何法则，却无法否认：这个小房间里，竟然有一片大得不可能、广阔而可怕的海。\n"
"\n"
"又或者，那只是一面蓝墙。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:welcome"
msgid ""
"<white>Welcome to Dungeon Crawl!</white>\n"
"\n"
"Your objective is to lead your <w>{{ return you.race() }} {{ return you.class()\n"
"}}</w> safely through the depths of the dungeon, retrieving the fabled Orb of\n"
"Zot and returning it to the surface. In the beginning, however, let discovery\n"
"be your main goal. Try to delve as deeply as possible but beware; death lurks\n"
"around every corner.\n"
"\n"
"For the moment, just remember the following keys and their functions:\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_COMMANDS]?</input> — shows the items and the commands\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_SAVE_GAME]</input>  — saves the game, to be resumed later\n"
"(but note that death is permanent)\n"
"  <input>$cmd[CMD_LOOK_AROUND]</input>  — examines something in your vicinity\n"
"\n"
"The hint mode will help you play Crawl without reading any documentation. If\n"
"you haven't yet, you might want to try out the tutorial. Also, if you feel\n"
"intrigued, there is more information available in the following files from the\n"
"docs/ directory (all of which can also be read in-game):\n"
"  <lightblue>quickstart.txt</lightblue>     — A very short guide to Crawl.\n"
"  <lightblue>crawl_manual.txt</lightblue>   — This contains all details on\n"
"species, magic, skills, etc.\n"
"  <lightblue>options_guide.txt</lightblue>  — Crawl's interface is highly\n"
"configurable. This document explains all the options.\n"
"\n"
"Happy Crawling!\n"
msgstr "<white>欢迎来到 Dungeon Crawl！</white>\n\n你的目标是带领<w>{{ return you.race() }} {{ return you.class()\n}}</w>安全深入地下城，取回传说中的佐特宝珠，再将它带回地表。不过，刚开始时不妨以探索和发现为主，尽可能深入，但要小心：死亡潜伏在每个角落。\n\n目前只需记住以下按键：\n  <input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_COMMANDS]?</input> — 查看物品符号与命令\n  <input>$cmd[CMD_SAVE_GAME]</input> — 保存游戏，稍后继续\n（但请注意，死亡是永久的）\n  <input>$cmd[CMD_LOOK_AROUND]</input> — 检查周围的事物\n\n提示模式能帮助你在不阅读文档的情况下游玩。若还没试过，也可以先玩教程。想了解更多，可阅读 docs/ 目录中的以下文件，也都能在游戏内打开：\n  <lightblue>quickstart.txt</lightblue> — 极简入门指南。\n  <lightblue>crawl_manual.txt</lightblue> — 种族、魔法、技能等的完整说明。\n  <lightblue>options_guide.txt</lightblue> — 界面高度可定制，此文档解释全部配置选项。\n\n祝探索愉快！\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:death"
msgid ""
"Condolences! Your character's premature death is a sad, but common occurrence\n"
"in Crawl. Rest assured that with diligence and playing experience your\n"
"characters will last longer.\n"
"\n"
"Perhaps the following advice can improve your playing style:\n"
msgstr ""
"很遗憾！角色英年早逝在 Crawl 中令人难过，却也十分常见。随着练习和经验积累，你的角色一定能活得更久。\n"
"\n"
"以下建议也许能帮助你改进玩法：\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:death conjurer melee"
msgid ""
"As a Conjurer your main weapon should be offensive magic. Cast spells more\n"
"often! Remember to rest when your Magic is low.\n"
msgstr "作为塑能师，你应以进攻魔法作为主要武器，多施放法术！魔力不足时记得休息。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:death berserker unberserked"
msgid ""
"Don't forget to go berserk when fighting particularly difficult foes. It's\n"
"risky, but makes you faster and beefier.\n"
msgstr "对付特别难缠的敌人时，别忘了狂暴。它有风险，却能让你更快、更强壮。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:death ranger melee"
msgid "Your bow and arrows are extremely powerful against distant monsters.\n"
msgstr "你的弓箭在对付远处怪物时极其强大。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:death random 0"
msgid ""
"Always consider using projectiles, wands or spells before engaging monsters in\n"
"close combat.\n"
msgstr "近身迎战怪物前，始终先考虑使用投射物、魔杖或法术。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:death random 1"
msgid ""
"Learn when to run away from things you can't handle — this is important! It is\n"
"often wise to skip a particularly dangerous level. But don't overdo this as\n"
"monsters will only get harder the deeper you delve.\n"
msgstr "学会何时逃离无法应付的敌人——这很重要！跳过特别危险的楼层往往很明智，但不要过度，因为越深入，怪物只会越强。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:death random 2"
msgid ""
"Rest between encounters, if possible in an area already explored and cleared of\n"
"monsters. Pressing <input>$cmd[CMD_REST]</input><localtiles>, or\n"
"<input>clicking on the 'rest' button in the command bar'</input></localtiles>\n"
"will rest for 100 turns, or until fully healed.\n"
msgstr "两次战斗之间要休息，最好在已经探索并清除怪物的区域。按 <input>$cmd[CMD_REST]</input><localtiles>，或<input>点击命令栏的“休息”按钮</input></localtiles>，即可休息 100 回合，或直到生命完全恢复。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:death random 3"
msgid ""
"Remember to use those scrolls, potions or wands you've found. Learn to\n"
"improvise: you will need to identify potions and scrolls by using them.\n"
msgstr "记得使用找到的卷轴、药水和魔杖。学会随机应变：你需要通过使用来鉴定药水和卷轴。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:death random 4"
msgid ""
"If a particular encounter feels overwhelming, don't forget to use emergency\n"
"items early on. A scroll of teleportation or a potion of haste can really save\n"
"your bacon.\n"
msgstr "若一次遭遇让你难以招架，记得尽早使用应急物品。传送卷轴或疾速药水真的能救命。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:death random 5"
msgid ""
"Never fight more than one monster, if you can help it. Always back into a\n"
"corridor so that they are forced to fight you one on one.\n"
msgstr "能避免时，就别同时与多只怪物交战。退入走廊，迫使它们与你一对一作战。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:finished"
msgid ""
"Congrats! You survived until the end of hints mode — be sure to try the\n"
"other characters as well. Note that the command help screen\n"
"(<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_COMMANDS]?</input>) will look very different from now\n"
"on. Here's a last playing hint:\n"
msgstr "恭喜！你活到了提示模式结束，别忘了也试试其他角色。此后，命令帮助界面（<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_COMMANDS]?</input>）会大不相同。最后再给你一条建议：\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:finished explored"
msgid ""
"Walking around and exploring levels gets easier by using auto-explore\n"
"(<input>$cmd[CMD_EXPLORE]</input>). Crawl will let you automatically move to\n"
"and pick up interesting items.<localtiles>\n"
"\n"
"Autoexploration can also be started by <input>Ctrl-Leftclick</input> on the\n"
"minimap.</localtiles>\n"
msgstr ""
"使用自动探索（<input>$cmd[CMD_EXPLORE]</input>），探索楼层会轻松得多。游戏会自动前往值得关注的物品并拾取。<localtiles>\n"
"\n"
"在小地图上按 <input>Ctrl-Leftclick</input> 也能开始自动探索。</localtiles>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:finished travel"
msgid ""
"There is a convenient way to travel between distant dungeon levels: press\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_INTERLEVEL_TRAVEL]</input> and enter the desired destination.\n"
"If your travel gets interrupted, issuing <input>$cmd[CMD_INTERLEVEL_TRAVEL]\n"
"Enter</input> will continue it.\n"
msgstr ""
"跨越多个楼层有个方便的方法：按 <input>$cmd[CMD_INTERLEVEL_TRAVEL]</input>，再输入目的地。若旅行中断，按 <input>$cmd[CMD_INTERLEVEL_TRAVEL]\n"
"Enter</input> 即可继续。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:finished stashes"
msgid ""
"You can search among all items existing in the dungeon with the\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_SEARCH_STASHES]</input> command. For example,\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_SEARCH_STASHES]</input> <w>“dagger”</w> will list all daggers,\n"
"and allow you to travel to them. You can even search for dungeon features, like\n"
"<w>“shop”</w> or <w>“altar”</w>.\n"
msgstr "用 <input>$cmd[CMD_SEARCH_STASHES]</input> 可以搜索地下城中已存在的物品。例如，输入 <input>$cmd[CMD_SEARCH_STASHES]</input> <w>“dagger”</w> 会列出所有匕首，并让你前往其位置。还能搜索地形设施，例如 <w>“shop”</w> 或 <w>“altar”</w>。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:finished random 0"
msgid ""
"The game keeps an automated log for your characters. Use\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_COMMANDS]:</input> to read it. Once your character\n"
"perishes, two morgue files are left in the <w>morgue/</w> directory. The one\n"
"ending in .txt contains a copy of your log. During play, you can create a dump\n"
"file with <input>$cmd[CMD_CHARACTER_DUMP]</input>.\n"
msgstr "游戏会自动记录角色经历，按 <input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_COMMANDS]:</input> 可阅读。角色死亡后，<w>morgue/</w> 目录会留下两个记录文件，.txt 文件中含有日志副本。游玩时也可按 <input>$cmd[CMD_CHARACTER_DUMP]</input> 创建角色转储文件。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:finished random 1"
msgid ""
"Crawl has a macro function built in: press <input>$cmd[CMD_MACRO_MENU]</input>\n"
"to define a macro by first specifying a trigger key (say, <input>F1</input>)\n"
"and a command sequence, for example <input>za.</input>. The latter will make\n"
"the <input>F1</input> key always zap the spell in slot a at the nearest\n"
"monster. For more information on macros, type\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_COMMANDS]~</input>.\n"
msgstr "游戏内置宏功能。按 <input>$cmd[CMD_MACRO_MENU]</input>，先指定触发键，例如 <input>F1</input>，再指定命令序列，例如 <input>za.</input>。这样，<input>F1</input> 就会总是向最近怪物施放 a 槽法术。更多宏说明见 <input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_COMMANDS]~</input>。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:finished random 2"
msgid ""
"The interface can be greatly customised. All options are explained in the file\n"
"<w>options_guide.txt</w> which can be found in the <w>docs</w> directory. The\n"
"options themselves are set in <w>init.txt</w> or <w>.crawlrc</w>. Crawl will\n"
"complain if it can't find either file.\n"
msgstr "界面可以深度定制。<w>docs</w> 目录中的 <w>options_guide.txt</w> 解释了全部选项。实际配置写在 <w>init.txt</w> 或 <w>.crawlrc</w> 中；找不到配置文件时，游戏会给出提示。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:finished random 3"
msgid ""
"You can ask other Crawl players for advice and help using any of the community\n"
"resources described at http://crawl.develz.org/\n"
msgstr "你可以通过 http://crawl.develz.org/ 上介绍的社区资源，向其他玩家寻求建议和帮助。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_convert ashenzari"
msgid ""
"You've just converted to worshipping <w>Ashenzari</w>. Unlike other gods,\n"
"Ashenzari only cares about curses. As you explore the dungeon, Ashenzari will\n"
"offer curses, locking an item onto you. The more cursed items you wear, the more\n"
"Ashenzari will enhance your skills and otherwise help you.\n"
msgstr "你刚刚皈依了<w>艾申扎利</w>。与其他神不同，艾申扎利只关心诅咒。探索地下城时，祂会提出诅咒，将一件物品锁定在你身上。你穿戴的受诅咒物品越多，祂对技能的强化和其他帮助就越多。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_convert gozag"
msgid ""
"You've just converted to worshipping <w>Gozag</w>. Unlike other gods, Gozag only\n"
"cares about gold; each divine power costs gold, and your foes turn to gold on\n"
"death.\n"
msgstr "你刚刚皈依了<w>哥萨戈</w>。与其他神不同，哥萨戈只关心金币。每项神力都需要花费金币，而敌人死亡后会化为金币。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_convert ru"
msgid ""
"You've just converted to worshipping <w>Ru</w>. Unlike other gods, Ru grants\n"
"piety (divine favour) in exchange for permanent sacrifices, like losing the\n"
"ability to train certain skills, or permanently losing a hand. The more piety\n"
"you have, the more abilities Ru will grant, and the more powerful those\n"
"abilities will become. Ru will offer more sacrifices as you explore the depths\n"
"of the dungeon.\n"
msgstr "你刚刚皈依了<w>入</w>。与其他神不同，入用虔诚换取永久牺牲，例如失去训练某些技能的能力，或永远失去一只手。虔诚越高，祂赐予的能力越多，能力也越强。随着你深入地下城，祂会提出更多牺牲。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_convert uskayaw"
msgid ""
"You've just converted to worshipping <w>Uskayaw</w>. Unlike other gods,\n"
"Uskayaw's favour cannot be gradually gained as you explore the dungeon or slay\n"
"monsters. Instead, piety with Uskayaw is gained rapidly in combat as you deal\n"
"damage. The longer you remain in combat and the more damage you deal, the\n"
"greater the powers you will be offered. Once combat ends, Uskayaw's favour will\n"
"be quickly lost, and must be regained in the next battle.\n"
msgstr "你刚刚皈依了<w>阿斯卡亚</w>。与其他神不同，阿斯卡亚的虔诚不能靠探索地下城或击杀怪物逐渐积累，而是在战斗中通过造成伤害迅速获得。战斗越久、伤害越多，获得的神力越强。战斗结束后，虔诚会迅速流失，必须在下一场战斗中重新积累。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_convert xom"
msgid ""
"You've just converted to worshipping <w>Xom</w>. As a follower of Xom, you'll\n"
"be treated like a plaything, randomly helped or harmed for Xom's own amusement.\n"
"\n"
"There is no way to guarantee Xom remains in a good mood - the best any follower\n"
"can hope for is to avoid letting Xom grow bored!\n"
msgstr ""
"你刚刚皈依了<w>佐姆</w>。作为祂的信徒，你会被当作玩具，随机得到帮助或伤害，只为让佐姆开心。\n"
"\n"
"无法保证佐姆始终心情好；信徒能做的，充其量只是别让祂觉得无聊！\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_convert yredelemnul"
msgid ""
"You've just converted to worshipping <w>Yredelemnul</w>. Unlike other gods,\n"
"Yredelemnul only cares about souls. Your enemies may rise to serve you after\n"
"death, and you can expend them to invoke Yredelemnul's aid.\n"
msgstr "你刚刚皈依了<w>伊莱德莱姆努尔</w>。与其他神不同，祂只关心灵魂。敌人死后可能起身为你效力，你也可以消耗它们，祈求伊莱德莱姆努尔的援助。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_convert"
msgid ""
"You've just converted to worshipping <w>{{ return you.god() }}</w>. Your piety\n"
"(divine favour) will increase as you do things to please your new god, and will\n"
"gradually decrease over time.\n"
"\n"
"You can check your god's likes and dislikes, as well as your current standing\n"
"and divine abilities, by typing\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_RELIGION]</input><localtiles>, or by pressing\n"
"<input>Shift-right-click</input> on your avatar</localtiles>.\n"
msgstr "你刚刚皈依了<w>{{ return you.god() }}</w>。做令新神满意的事会提高虔诚，而虔诚会随时间逐渐降低。\n\n按 <input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_RELIGION]</input><localtiles>，或在角色图像上按 <input>Shift-right-click</input></localtiles>，可查看神的喜恶、你的当前地位及神赐能力。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_seen_first_object"
msgid ""
"That <console>$1 </console>is an item. If you move there and press\n"
"<input>$cmd[CMD_PICKUP]</input><localtiles>, or <input>left-click</input> on it\n"
"in your inventory</localtiles>, you will pick it up.<console> Generally, items\n"
"are shown by non-letter symbols like <w>%?!\"=()[</w>.</console> Some\n"
"objects<tiles>, marked with a green frame,</tiles> will be picked up\n"
"automatically.\n"
"\n"
"Once it is in your inventory, you can drop it again with <localtiles>a\n"
"<input>Shift-left-click</input>. Whenever you <input>right-click</input> on an\n"
"item</localtiles><console><input>$cmd[CMD_DROP]</input>. Any time you look at an\n"
"item in your inventory (<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_INVENTORY]</input>)</console>,\n"
"you can read about its properties and its description.\n"
msgstr "那<console>个 $1 </console>是一件物品。走到那里按 <input>$cmd[CMD_PICKUP]</input><localtiles>，或在物品栏面板中对它按<input>鼠标左键</input></localtiles>，就能拾取。<console>物品通常用 <w>%?!\"=()[</w> 等非字母符号表示。</console>部分物品<tiles>带有绿色边框，</tiles>会被自动拾取。\n\n放入物品栏后，可用<localtiles><input>Shift-left-click</input> 丢弃。每当你对物品按<input>鼠标右键</input></localtiles><console><input>$cmd[CMD_DROP]</input> 丢弃。查看物品栏中的物品（<input>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_INVENTORY]</input>）时</console>，都能阅读它的属性和说明。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_seen_potion"
msgid ""
"You have picked up your first potion<console> ('<w>$item[potion]</w>')</console>.\n"
"<localtiles>Simply <w>left-click</w> on it, or press</localtiles>\n"
"<nomouse>Press</nomouse> <w>$cmd[CMD_QUAFF]</w> to quaff it.\n"
"\n"
"Once you've identified a potion, either with a scroll of identification or by\n"
"drinking it, you'll automatically recognise all other potions of the same type;\n"
"this means it's sometimes useful to drink potions just to identify them.\n"
msgstr ""
"你捡到了第一瓶药水<console>（“<w>$item[potion]</w>”）</console>。<localtiles>对它按<w>鼠标左键</w>，或按</localtiles><nomouse>按</nomouse> <w>$cmd[CMD_QUAFF]</w> 即可饮用。\n"
"\n"
"用鉴定卷轴或饮用方式鉴定一种药水后，你会自动认出所有同类药水；所以有时为了鉴定而喝药也有价值。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_seen_scroll"
msgid ""
"You have picked up your first scroll<console> ('<w>$item[scroll]</w>')</console>.\n"
"<localtiles>Simply <w>left-click</w> on it, or press</localtiles>\n"
"<nomouse>Press</nomouse> <w>$cmd[CMD_READ]</w> to read it.\n"
"\n"
"Once you've identified a scroll, either with a scroll of identification or by\n"
"reading it, you'll automatically recognise all other scrolls of the same type;\n"
"this means it's sometimes useful to read scrolls just to identify them.\n"
msgstr ""
"你捡到了第一张卷轴<console>（“<w>$item[scroll]</w>”）</console>。<localtiles>对它按<w>鼠标左键</w>，或按</localtiles><nomouse>按</nomouse> <w>$cmd[CMD_READ]</w> 即可阅读。\n"
"\n"
"用鉴定卷轴或阅读方式鉴定一种卷轴后，你会自动认出所有同类卷轴；所以有时为了鉴定而读卷轴也有价值。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_seen_wand"
msgid ""
"You have picked up your first wand<console> ('<w>$item[wand]</w>')</console>.\n"
"<localtiles>Simply <w>left-click</w> on it, or press</localtiles>\n"
"<nomouse>Press</nomouse> <w>$cmd[CMD_EVOKE]</w> to evoke it.\n"
"\n"
"If you find more wands of the same type, they'll merge into this wand and add\n"
"charges to it.\n"
msgstr ""
"你捡到了第一根魔杖<console>（“<w>$item[wand]</w>”）</console>。<localtiles>对它按<w>鼠标左键</w>，或按</localtiles><nomouse>按</nomouse> <w>$cmd[CMD_EVOKE]</w> 即可发动。\n"
"\n"
"以后找到的同类魔杖会合并进这一根，增加它的充能次数。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_seen_spbook"
msgid ""
"You have picked up a book<console> ('<w>$item[book]</w>')</console>. On pickup,\n"
"its spells are immediately added to your library. You'll be able to memorise\n"
"spells from it via <w>$cmd[CMD_MEMORISE_SPELL]</w>, and cast them with\n"
"<w>$cmd[CMD_CAST_SPELL]</w>.\n"
"{{\n"
"    if you.god() == \"Trog\" then\n"
"        return \"Trog hates it when you memorise or study magic, though!\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"
msgstr ""
"你捡到了一本书<console>（“<w>$item[book]</w>”）</console>。拾取时，其中法术立即加入法术库。按 <w>$cmd[CMD_MEMORISE_SPELL]</w> 可记忆法术，按 <w>$cmd[CMD_CAST_SPELL]</w> 可施放。\n"
"{{\n"
"    if you.god() == \"Trog\" then\n"
"        return \"但特洛戈憎恶你记忆或研习魔法！\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_seen_weapon"
msgid ""
"This is the first weapon<console> ('<w>$item[weapon]</w>')</console> you've\n"
"picked up. Use <w>$cmd[CMD_WIELD_WEAPON]</w><localtiles> or\n"
"<w>left-click</w> on it</localtiles> to wield it, but be aware that this\n"
"weapon might train a different skill from your current one. You can view the\n"
"weapon's properties from your\n"
"<w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_INVENTORY]</w>nventory<localtiles> or by\n"
"<w>right-clicking</w> on it</localtiles>.\n"
"\n"
"{{\n"
"    if crawl.hints_type() == \"berserk\" then\n"
"        return \"You should probably stick with axes. Checking other axes'\"\n"
"               .. \" enchantments can be worthwhile, though!\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"
msgstr ""
"这是你捡到的第一件武器<console>（“<w>$item[weapon]</w>”）</console>。按 <w>$cmd[CMD_WIELD_WEAPON]</w><localtiles>，或对它按<w>鼠标左键</w></localtiles>即可持用。但要注意，它可能使用与你当前武器不同的技能。在背包（<w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_INVENTORY]</w>）中选择它<localtiles>，或对它按<w>鼠标右键</w></localtiles>，可以查看属性。\n"
"\n"
"{{\n"
"    if crawl.hints_type() == \"berserk\" then\n"
"        return \"你最好继续使用斧类武器。不过，检查其他斧头的\"\n"
"               .. \"附魔加成也可能值得！\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_seen_missiles"
msgid ""
"This is the first stack of missiles<console> ('<w>$item[missile]</w>')</console>\n"
"you've picked up. Missiles like boomerangs and throwing nets can be thrown by\n"
"hand, and become more effective as you train the Throwing skill.\n"
"<localtiles><w>Right-click</w> on</localtiles><nomouse>Select</nomouse>\n"
"the item in your <w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_INVENTORY]</w>nventory to see more\n"
"information.\n"
"\n"
"{{\n"
"    if crawl.hints_type() == \"ranger\" then\n"
"        return \"As you're already trained in Ranged Weapons, you don't really \"\n"
"               .. \"need another type of ranged attack.\"\n"
"    elseif crawl.hints_type() == \"magic\" then\n"
"        return \"However, as a spellslinger, you don't really need another type\"\n"
"               .. \" of ranged attack.\"\n"
"    else\n"
"        return \"\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"
msgstr "这是你捡到的第一堆投掷物<console>（“<w>$item[missile]</w>”）</console>。回旋镖、投网等投掷物可以徒手投掷，训练投掷技能会提高效果。在背包（<w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_INVENTORY]</w>）中<localtiles><w>右键点击</w></localtiles><nomouse>选择</nomouse>物品，可查看更多信息。\n\n{{\n    if crawl.hints_type() == \"ranger\" then\n        return \"既然你已经训练远程武器，\"\n               .. \"就不太需要另一类远程攻击了。\"\n    elseif crawl.hints_type() == \"magic\" then\n        return \"不过，作为施法者，你也不太需要\"\n               .. \"另一类远程攻击。\"\n    else\n        return \"\"\n    end\n}}\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_seen_armour"
msgid ""
"This is the first piece of armour<console> ('<w>$item[armour]</w>')</console>\n"
"you've picked up. <localtiles>You can click on it to wear it, and click again\n"
"to remove it. <w>Right-clicking</w> on it will give more information.\n"
"</localtiles><nomouse>Use <w>$cmd[CMD_WEAR_ARMOUR]</w> to wear it and\n"
"<w>$cmd[CMD_REMOVE_ARMOUR]</w> to take it off again. You can view its\n"
"properties from your <w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_INVENTORY]</w>nventory.\n"
"</nomouse>\n"
"\n"
"{{\n"
"    if you.get_base_mutation_level(\"horns\") > 0 then\n"
"        return \"Note that because of your horns you will be unable to wear\"\n"
"               .. \" helmets. (Press <w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_MUTATIONS]</w> to see\"\n"
"               .. \" a list of your mutations and innate abilities.)\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"
msgstr "这是你捡到的第一件防具<console>（“<w>$item[armour]</w>”）</console>。<localtiles>点击可穿上，再点击一次可脱下；对它按<w>鼠标右键</w>可查看更多信息。</localtiles><nomouse>按 <w>$cmd[CMD_WEAR_ARMOUR]</w> 穿上，按 <w>$cmd[CMD_REMOVE_ARMOUR]</w> 脱下。在背包（<w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_INVENTORY]</w>）中可查看属性。</nomouse>\n\n{{\n    if you.get_base_mutation_level(\"horns\") > 0 then\n        return \"注意，因为你长有角，无法佩戴\"\n               .. \"头盔。（按 <w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_MUTATIONS]</w> 可查看\"\n               .. \"变异和天生能力列表。）\"\n    end\n}}\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_seen_jewellery"
msgid ""
"You have picked up a piece of jewellery, either a ring\n"
"<console>('<w>$item[jewellery]</w>') </console>or an\n"
"amulet<console> ('<w>$item[amulet]</w>')</console>.\n"
"<nomouse>Press <w>$cmd[CMD_WEAR_JEWELLERY]</w> to put it on and\n"
"<w>$cmd[CMD_REMOVE_JEWELLERY]</w> to remove it. You can view its properties\n"
"from your <w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_INVENTORY]</w>nventory.</nomouse>\n"
"<localtiles>You can click on it to put it on, and click again to remove it. By\n"
"<w>right-clicking</w> on it, you can view its properties.</localtiles>\n"
msgstr "你捡到了一件首饰，可能是戒指<console>（“<w>$item[jewellery]</w>”）</console>或护身符<console>（“<w>$item[amulet]</w>”）</console>。<nomouse>按 <w>$cmd[CMD_WEAR_JEWELLERY]</w> 戴上，按 <w>$cmd[CMD_REMOVE_JEWELLERY]</w> 摘下。在背包（<w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_INVENTORY]</w>）中可查看属性。</nomouse><localtiles>点击可戴上，再点击可摘下；按<w>鼠标右键</w>可查看属性。</localtiles>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_seen_misc"
msgid ""
"This is a curious object indeed. You can play around with it to find out what\n"
"it does by <localtiles>clicking on it to e<w>$cmd[CMD_EVOKE]</w>oke </localtiles>\n"
"<nomouse>e<w>$cmd[CMD_EVOKE]</w>oking </nomouse>it. As usual, selecting it from\n"
"your <w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_INVENTORY]</w>nventory might give you more information.\n"
msgstr "这是一件奇特的物品。你可以<localtiles>点击它，按 <w>$cmd[CMD_EVOKE]</w> 发动</localtiles><nomouse>按 <w>$cmd[CMD_EVOKE]</w> 发动</nomouse>，试试效果。如往常一样，在背包（<w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_INVENTORY]</w>）中选择它，也许能得到更多信息。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_seen_staff"
msgid ""
"You have picked up a magic staff<console> ('<w>$item[magical staff]</w>')</console>.\n"
"It must be <w>$cmd[CMD_WIELD_WEAPON]</w>ielded to be of use. Magicians use\n"
"staves to increase their power in certain spell schools. It can also be used as\n"
"a weapon.<localtiles> You can wield a staff by <w>left-clicking</w>.</localtiles>\n"
msgstr "你捡到了一根魔法棍杖<console>（“<w>$item[magical staff]</w>”）</console>。必须持用（<w>$cmd[CMD_WIELD_WEAPON]</w>）才能发挥作用。施法者用棍杖增强特定魔法学派的威力，也能将它作为武器。<localtiles>对棍杖按<w>鼠标左键</w>即可持用。</localtiles>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_seen_gold"
msgid ""
"You have picked up your first pile of gold<console>\n"
"('<yellow>$item[gold]</yellow>')</console>. Press <w>$cmd[CMD_LIST_GOLD]</w> to\n"
"see how much you have. Gold is used in shops you'll find as you explore.\n"
msgstr "你捡到了第一堆金币<console>（“<yellow>$item[gold]</yellow>”）</console>。按 <w>$cmd[CMD_LIST_GOLD]</w> 可查看数量。金币用于探索时遇到的商店。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_seen_stairs"
msgid ""
"These<console> '$1'</console> are downstairs. You can enter the next (deeper)\n"
"level by following them down (<w>$cmd[CMD_GO_DOWNSTAIRS]</w>). To return to this\n"
"level, press <w>$cmd[CMD_GO_UPSTAIRS]</w> while standing on the upstairs. When\n"
"you take stairs, you are guaranteed a opportunity to act before any monsters you\n"
"have not seen before; after that, monsters get to move first.\n"
"\n"
"<localtiles>Alternatively, you can <w>left-click</w> on stairs you're standing\n"
"on to use them.</localtiles>\n"
msgstr ""
"这<console>个“$1”</console>是下楼楼梯。按 <w>$cmd[CMD_GO_DOWNSTAIRS]</w> 可以前往更深一层。站在上楼楼梯上按 <w>$cmd[CMD_GO_UPSTAIRS]</w> 即可返回。使用楼梯后，你保证能在所有此前未见的怪物之前行动一次；之后则由怪物先移动。\n"
"\n"
"<localtiles>也可以站在楼梯上，按<w>鼠标左键</w>使用它。</localtiles>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_seen_escape_hatch"
msgid ""
"This<console> '$1'</console> is an escape hatch. You can use it to leave a\n"
"level with <w>$cmd[CMD_GO_UPSTAIRS]</w> and <w>$cmd[CMD_GO_DOWNSTAIRS]</w>\n"
"respectively<localtiles> (or by<w>left-clicking</w>)</localtiles>, like stairs;\n"
"unlike stairs, however, hatches are a one-way trip, so be careful when\n"
"descending!\n"
msgstr "这<console>个“$1”</console>是逃生口。与楼梯一样，可以分别用 <w>$cmd[CMD_GO_UPSTAIRS]</w> 或 <w>$cmd[CMD_GO_DOWNSTAIRS]</w><localtiles>（也可按<w>鼠标左键</w>）</localtiles>离开本层。但逃生口是单向的，下去时务必小心！\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_seen_branch"
msgid ""
"This<console> '$1'</console> is the entrance to a different branch of the\n"
"dungeon. Each branch has different terrain and monsters, and some contain\n"
"entrances to other branches. You can learn more by examining this\n"
"entrance<localtiles> by hovering your mouse over its tile</localtiles><nomouse\n"
"by pressing <w>$cmd[CMD_LOOK_AROUND]</w> and moving the cursor onto it.\"\n"
"\n"
"Some branches will be much safer and more rewarding than your current branch.\n"
"Others can be very dangerous, better visited when your character is more\n"
"powerful.\n"
msgstr "这<console>个“$1”</console>是另一个地下城分支的入口。各分支有不同的地形和怪物，有些还通往其他分支。查看入口可获得更多信息：<localtiles>将鼠标悬停在入口图标上</localtiles>，或按 <w>$cmd[CMD_LOOK_AROUND]</w> 并将光标移到入口。\n\n有些分支比当前分支更安全、收获更多；另一些则很危险，最好等角色更强后再去。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_seen_portal"
msgid ""
"This<console> '$1'</console> is a portal to an optional level, offering extra\n"
"loot in exchange for extra danger. There's no penalty for skipping it, but the\n"
"portal will disappear if you wait, so you have to decide now if you want to risk\n"
"it.\n"
msgstr "这<console>个“$1”</console>是通往可选楼层的传送门，以额外风险换取额外战利品。跳过没有惩罚，但等候会使入口消失，所以必须马上决定是否冒险。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_seen_bazaar_portal"
msgid ""
"This<console> '$1'</console> is a portal to an inter-dimensional bazaar filled\n"
"with shops. It will disappear if you don't enter it soon, so hurry.\n"
msgstr "这<console>个“$1”</console>是通往跨维度市集的传送门，里面有许多商店。如果不尽快进入，它就会消失，抓紧时间！\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_seen_portal_2"
msgid ""
"You can enter a portal just like a set of stairs, by standing on it and\n"
"<localtiles><w>clicking</w> or </localtiles>pressing\n"
"<w>$cmd[CMD_GO_DOWNSTAIRS]</w>. To return, find <tiles>a similar looking portal.\n"
"</tiles><console>another $1 - but NOT the ancient stone arch you'll start out\n"
"on!</console>\n"
msgstr "使用传送门和楼梯一样：站在上面，<localtiles><w>点击</w>或</localtiles>按 <w>$cmd[CMD_GO_DOWNSTAIRS]</w>。返回时，寻找<tiles>外观相似的传送门。</tiles><console>另一个 $1，而不是你进入时站着的古老石拱门！</console>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_stair_brand"
msgid ""
"<tiles>A small symbol on a stair tile signifies that there are items in that\n"
"position that you may want to check out.</tiles>\n"
"<console>If any items are covering stairs or an escape hatch, then that will\n"
"be indicated by highlighting the <w><<</w> or <w>></w> symbol, instead of hiding\n"
"the stair symbol with an item glyph.</console>\n"
msgstr "<tiles>楼梯图标上的小记号表示那里有物品，值得查看。</tiles><console>若物品盖住楼梯或逃生口，游戏会高亮 <w><<</w> 或 <w>></w> 符号，而不使用物品符号遮住它。</console>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_heap_brand"
msgid ""
"<tiles>A small symbol on an item tile signifies that there is at least one other\n"
"item in the same heap that you may want to check out.</tiles>\n"
"<console>If two or more items are on a single square, then the square will be\n"
"highlighted, and the symbol for the item on the top of the heap will be shown.\n"
"</console>\n"
msgstr "<tiles>物品图标上的小记号表示同一堆中至少还有另一件物品，值得查看。</tiles><console>同一格有两件以上物品时，格子会高亮，并显示物品堆最上面那件的符号。</console>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_trap_brand"
msgid ""
"<console>If any items are covering a trap, then that will be indicated by\n"
"highlighting the <w>^</w> symbol, instead of hiding the trap symbol with an item\n"
"glyph.</console>\n"
msgstr "<console>若物品盖住陷阱，游戏会高亮 <w>^</w> 符号，而不使用物品符号遮住陷阱。</console>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_seen_trap"
msgid ""
"You just discovered a trap. You'll occasionally find these nasty\n"
"constructions.\n"
msgstr "你发现了一座陷阱。探索中偶尔会遇到这些讨厌的机关。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_seen_altar"
msgid ""
"That<console> $1</console> is an altar.\n"
"<localtiles>By <w>right-clicking</w> on it with your mouse</localtiles>\n"
"<nomouse>If you target the altar with <w>$cmd[CMD_LOOK_AROUND]</w>, then press\n"
"<w>$cmd[CMD_TARGET_DESCRIBE]</w></nomouse> you can get a short description.\n"
"\n"
"Press <w>$cmd[CMD_GO_UPSTAIRS]</w> or <w>$cmd[CMD_GO_DOWNSTAIRS]</w> while\n"
"standing on the square to join the faith or read some information about the god\n"
"in question. Before taking up the corresponding faith you'll be asked for\n"
"confirmation.\n"
"\n"
"{{\n"
"    if you.god() == \"No God\" and crawl.hints_type() == \"magic\" then\n"
"        return \"The simplest god for an inexperienced conjurer is probably \"\n"
"               .. \"Vehumet, though many other gods, like Sif Muna, can also \"\n"
"               .. \"work well.\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"
msgstr ""
"那<console>个 $1</console>是一座祭坛。<localtiles>对它按<w>鼠标右键</w></localtiles><nomouse>按 <w>$cmd[CMD_LOOK_AROUND]</w> 指向祭坛，再按 <w>$cmd[CMD_TARGET_DESCRIBE]</w></nomouse>，可以查看简要说明。\n"
"\n"
"站在祭坛上，按 <w>$cmd[CMD_GO_UPSTAIRS]</w> 或 <w>$cmd[CMD_GO_DOWNSTAIRS]</w>，可皈依或阅读该神的信息。正式皈依前会要求确认。\n"
"\n"
"{{\n"
"    if you.god() == \"No God\" and crawl.hints_type() == \"magic\" then\n"
"        return \"对缺乏经验的塑能师而言，最容易上手的神可能是\"\n"
"               .. \"维胡梅特，不过席夫·穆纳等许多其他神\"\n"
"               .. \"也很合适。\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_seen_shop"
msgid ""
"That<console> $1</console> is a shop. You can enter it by typing\n"
"<w>$cmd[CMD_GO_UPSTAIRS]</w> or <w>$cmd[CMD_GO_DOWNSTAIRS]</w>\n"
"<tiles>, or by <w>left-clicking</w> on it<tiles>\n"
"while standing on the square.\n"
"\n"
"If there's anything you want which you can't afford yet, you can hold\n"
"<w>Shift</w> and press the corresponding letter to put it on your shopping list.\n"
"The game will then remind you when you gather enough gold to buy it.\n"
msgstr ""
"那<console>个 $1</console>是一家商店。站在上面，按 <w>$cmd[CMD_GO_UPSTAIRS]</w> 或 <w>$cmd[CMD_GO_DOWNSTAIRS]</w><tiles>，也可按<w>鼠标左键</w></tiles>即可进入。\n"
"\n"
"若想买的商品暂时买不起，可以按住 <w>Shift</w> 再按对应字母，将其加入购物清单。金币足够时，游戏会提醒你。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_seen_door"
msgid ""
"That<console> $1</console> is a closed door. You can open it by walking into it.\n"
"Sometimes it is useful to close a door. Do so by <nomouse>pressing\n"
"<w>$cmd[CMD_CLOSE_DOOR]</w> while next to it. If there are several doors, you\n"
"will then be prompted for a direction.</nomouse><localtiles>clicking on the door\n"
"while next to it.</localtiles>\n"
msgstr "那<console>个 $1</console>是一扇关闭的门，朝它走过去就能打开。有时关门很有用：<nomouse>站在旁边按 <w>$cmd[CMD_CLOSE_DOOR]</w>。若附近有多扇门，会要求选择方向。</nomouse><localtiles>站在旁边点击门即可。</localtiles>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_seen_runed_door"
msgid ""
"That<console> $1</console> is a runed door, which is probably in front of\n"
"something unusually dangerous. Monsters will never open it. If you do, the runes\n"
"will be broken, and it will become a normal door.\n"
msgstr "那<console>个 $1</console>是一扇符文门，后面很可能格外危险。怪物永远不会打开它。若你开门，符文就会破碎，它也会变成普通的门。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_killed_monster"
msgid ""
"Congratulations, your character just gained experience by killing this monster!\n"
"This will raise some of your skills, making you more deadly.\n"
"{{\n"
"    if you.god() == \"Trog\" then\n"
"        return \"Also, most kills will grant you favour in the eyes of Trog.\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"
msgstr ""
"恭喜！你的角色刚刚通过击杀这个怪物获得了经验。经验会提高部分技能，让你更强。\n"
"{{\n"
"    if you.god() == \"Trog\" then\n"
"        return \"另外，多数击杀也会为你赢得特洛戈的神恩。\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_new_level"
msgid ""
"Well done! Reaching a new experience level is always a nice event. You get more\n"
"health and magic points, and occasionally increases to your attributes:\n"
"strength, intelligence, and dexterity.\n"
"\n"
"{{\n"
"    if crawl.hints_type() == \"magic\" then\n"
"        return \"Gaining an experience level also lets you learn more difficult\"\n"
"               .. \" spells. You can memorise a second spell with\"\n"
"               .. \" <w>$cmd[CMD_MEMORISE_SPELL]</w><tiles> or by\"\n"
"               .. \" <w>clicking</w> on it in the memorisation tab</tiles>.\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"
msgstr ""
"干得好！升级总是好事，你会获得更多生命和魔力，有时还能提高力量、智力、敏捷等属性。\n"
"\n"
"{{\n"
"    if crawl.hints_type() == \"magic\" then\n"
"        return \"升级还让你能够学习更困难的\"\n"
"               .. \"法术。按\"\n"
"               .. \" <w>$cmd[CMD_MEMORISE_SPELL]</w><tiles>，或在记忆标签中\"\n"
"               .. \"<w>点击</w>法术</tiles>，即可记忆第二个法术。\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_skill_raise"
msgid ""
"One of your skills just reached a milestone. The skills you use are\n"
"automatically trained whenever you gain experience, by killing monsters. By\n"
"default, experience goes to skills you actively use. To view or manage your\n"
"skills, type <w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_SKILLS]</w><localtiles> or click on the skill\n"
"tab in the bottom-right</localtiles>.\n"
msgstr "你的一项技能刚刚达到了新的里程碑。击杀怪物获得经验时，你使用的技能会自动得到训练。默认情况下，经验分配给你正在使用的技能。按 <w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_SKILLS]</w><localtiles>，或点击右下方的技能标签</localtiles>，可查看并管理技能。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_gained_magical_skill"
msgid ""
"Being skilled in a magical \"school\" makes it easier to learn and cast spells of\n"
"that school. Many spells belong to a combination of several schools, in which\n"
"case the average skill in these schools will determine spellcasting success and\n"
"power.\n"
msgstr "熟练掌握某个魔法学派，会让你更容易学习和施放该学派的法术。许多法术属于多个学派，其施法成功率和强度取决于相关学派技能的平均值。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_gained_melee_skill"
msgid ""
"Being skilled with a particular type of weapon will make you deal slightly more\n"
"damage and attack significantly faster with all weapons of that type. It's a\n"
"good idea to focus on just one weapon type, usually one you start with, though\n"
"finding a particularly good weapon may justify a switch.\n"
msgstr "提高某类武器技能，会略微提高该类武器的伤害，并显著加快攻击速度。通常应专注一类武器，例如起始武器；但找到特别好的武器时，也可能值得转型。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_gained_ranged_skill"
msgid ""
"Being skilled with ranged weapons will let you deal slightly more damage and\n"
"attack significantly faster with them. Remember that wearing heavy armour makes\n"
"you attack more slowly with ranged weapons.\n"
msgstr "提高远程武器技能，会略微提高其伤害，并显著加快攻击速度。记住，重甲会减缓远程武器的攻击速度。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_choose_stat"
msgid ""
"Upon gaining levels 3, 9, 15, etc., you get to choose an attribute to raise:\n"
"strength, intelligence, or dexterity.\n"
"\n"
"<w>Strength</w> makes heavy armour less cumbersome and slightly increases most\n"
"weapons' damage.\n"
"\n"
"<w>Intelligence</w> makes your spells more reliable and powerful.\n"
"\n"
"<w>Dexterity</w> increases your evasion and stealth, and slightly increases the\n"
"damage of blades and ranged weapons.\n"
msgstr ""
"达到 3、9、15 等等级时，你可以选择提高力量、智力或敏捷中的一项。\n"
"\n"
"<w>力量</w>减轻重甲的负担，并略微提高大多数武器的伤害。\n"
"\n"
"<w>智力</w>让法术更可靠、更强。\n"
"\n"
"<w>敏捷</w>提高闪避和潜行，并略微提高刀剑及远程武器的伤害。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_malevolence"
msgid ""
"As you explore the dungeon and reveal new tiles, the malevolent forces of the\n"
"dungeon may randomly cause bad things to happen to you. When this happens,\n"
"pause, think carefully, and be ready to use consumables or abilities. Fight to\n"
"survive!\"\n"
msgstr "探索地下城、揭开新格子时，地下城的恶意力量可能随机让坏事发生。遇到这种情况，应停下来仔细思考，随时准备用消耗品或能力。为生存而战！\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_opportunity_attack"
msgid ""
"When you move away from an enemy, they have a small (1/3) chance of taking\n"
"advantage and launching a free attack. Repositioning and retreating is often\n"
"still good, but keep an eye out for those extra attacks.\n"
msgstr "你远离敌人时，它有较小几率（1/3）抓住机会，免费攻击一次。调整位置或撤退通常仍然有利，但要留意这些额外攻击。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_you_enchanted"
msgid ""
"Enchantments of all types can befall you temporarily.\n"
"Brief descriptions of these appear at the lower end of the stats area.\n"
"Press <w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_CHARACTER_STATUS]</w> for more details. You can search\n"
"for full enchantment descriptions by pressing <w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_COMMANDS]/T</w>.\n"
msgstr "各种魔法状态都可能暂时影响你。简要说明会出现在属性区底部。按 <w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_CHARACTER_STATUS]</w> 可查看详情，按 <w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_COMMANDS]/T</w> 可搜索完整状态说明。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_you_poison"
msgid ""
"Poison will rapidly reduce your health. You can wait it out with\n"
"<w>$cmd[CMD_REST]</w>, but if you're in combat or lethally poisoned, you'll\n"
"probably want to quaff a potion of curing.\n"
msgstr "毒素会迅速削减生命。你可以按 <w>$cmd[CMD_REST]</w> 等它消退，但若仍在战斗或已经致命中毒，最好饮用治疗药水。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_multi_pickup"
msgid ""
"There are a lot of items here. You choose what to pick up from a menu:\n"
"press <w>$cmd[CMD_PICKUP]</w><localtiles> or <w>click</w> on the player\n"
"doll</localtiles> to enter the pickup menu. To leave the menu, confirm your\n"
"selection with <w>Enter</w>.\n"
msgstr "这里有很多物品，可以通过菜单选择拾取哪些。按 <w>$cmd[CMD_PICKUP]</w><localtiles>，或<w>点击</w>角色图像</localtiles>，打开拾取菜单。按 <w>Enter</w> 确认选择并离开菜单。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_full_inventory"
msgid ""
"Sadly, your inventory is limited to 52 items, and it appears your knapsack is\n"
"full. However, this is easy enough to rectify: simply <w>$cmd[CMD_DROP]</w>rop\n"
"some of the stuff you don't need right now. In the drop menu you can then\n"
"comfortably select which items to drop by pressing their inventory\n"
"letter<localtiles>, or by clicking on them</localtiles>.\n"
msgstr "物品栏最多容纳 52 件物品，现在看来已经满了。解决很简单：按 <w>$cmd[CMD_DROP]</w> 丢弃暂时不需要的东西。在丢弃菜单中，按物品字母<localtiles>，或点击物品</localtiles>即可选择。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_shift_run"
msgid ""
"Walking around takes fewer keystrokes if you press <w>Shift-direction</w> or\n"
"<w>/ direction</w>. That will let you run until a monster comes into sight or\n"
"your character sees something interesting.\n"
msgstr "按 <w>Shift-direction</w> 或 <w>/ direction</w> 可减少走路时的按键次数，持续前进，直到看见怪物或其他值得关注的事物。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_map_view"
msgid ""
"As you explore a level, orientation can become difficult. Press\n"
"<w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_MAP]</w> to bring up the level map. Typing <w>?</w> shows\n"
"the list of level map commands. Most importantly, moving the cursor to a spot\n"
"and pressing <w>.</w> or <w>Enter</w> lets your character move there on its own.\n"
"\n"
"<localtiles>Also, clicking on the right-side minimap with your <w>right mouse\n"
"button</w> will zoom into that dungeon area. Clicking with the <w>left mouse\n"
"button</w> instead will let you move there.</localtiles>\n"
msgstr ""
"探索楼层后可能不容易辨认方向。按 <w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_MAP]</w> 打开楼层地图，按 <w>?</w> 查看地图命令。最实用的是，把光标移到某处，按 <w>.</w> 或 <w>Enter</w>，角色就会自动前往。\n"
"\n"
"<localtiles>在右侧小地图上按<w>鼠标右键</w>，会放大对应区域；按<w>鼠标左键</w>则会自动前往。</localtiles>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_auto_explore"
msgid ""
"Fully exploring a level and picking up all the interesting looking items can be\n"
"tedious. To save on this tedium you can press <w>$cmd[CMD_EXPLORE]</w> to\n"
"auto-explore, which will automatically explore unmapped regions, automatically\n"
"pick up interesting items, and stop if a monster or interesting dungeon feature\n"
"(stairs, altar, etc.) is encountered.\n"
msgstr "探索完整楼层、捡起所有值得关注的物品可能很繁琐。按 <w>$cmd[CMD_EXPLORE]</w> 自动探索，游戏会探索未测绘区域、拾取值得关注的物品，遇到怪物或楼梯、祭坛等重要地形时停止。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_done_explore"
msgid ""
"Hey, you've finished exploring the dungeon on this level! You can search for\n"
"stairs from the level map (<w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_MAP]</w>) by pressing <w>></w>.\n"
"The cursor will jump to the nearest staircase, and by pressing <w>.</w> or\n"
"<w>Enter</w> your character can move there, too. Each level of Crawl has three\n"
"<console>white </console>up and three <console>white </console>down stairs.\n"
"Unexplored parts can often be accessed via another level.\n"
msgstr "你已经探索完本层地下城了！在楼层地图（<w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_MAP]</w>）中按 <w>></w> 可寻找楼梯。光标会跳到最近的楼梯，按 <w>.</w> 或 <w>Enter</w> 即可前往。每层通常有三座<console>白色</console>上楼楼梯和三座<console>白色</console>下楼楼梯。尚未探索的区域往往能经由其他楼层到达。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_auto_exclusion"
msgid ""
"To prevent autotravel or autoexplore taking you into dangerous territory, you\n"
"can set travel exclusions by entering the map view (<w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_MAP]</w>)\n"
"and then toggling the exclusion radius on the monster position with <w>e</w>.\n"
"To make this easier, some immobile monsters listed in the <w>auto_exclude</w>\n"
"option (such as this one) are considered dangerous enough to warrant an\n"
"automatic setting of an exclusion. It will be automatically cleared if you\n"
"manage to kill the monster. You could also manually remove the exclusion with\n"
"<w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_MAP]ee</w> but unless you remove this monster from the\n"
"auto_exclude list, the exclusion will be reset the next turn.\n"
msgstr "为避免自动旅行或探索把你带进危险区域，可以在地图（<w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_MAP]</w>）中，把光标移到怪物处，按 <w>e</w> 切换旅行禁区范围。<w>auto_exclude</w> 选项列出的部分不移动怪物（例如这一只）会被自动划为禁区；击杀后禁区自动清除。也可按 <w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_MAP]ee</w> 手动移除，但若未从 auto_exclude 列表中去掉此怪物，下一回合禁区就会重设。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_healing_potions"
msgid ""
"Your health is getting dangerously low. Retreating and/or quaffing a potion of\n"
"heal wounds or curing might be a good idea.\n"
msgstr "你的生命已经低得很危险。考虑撤退，或饮用疗伤药水、治疗药水。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_need_healing"
msgid ""
"If you're low on health or magic and there's no urgent need to move, you can\n"
"rest for a bit. Ideally, you should retreat to an area you've already explored\n"
"and cleared of monsters before resting, since resting on the edge of the\n"
"explored terrain increases the risk of rest being interrupted by a wandering\n"
"monster. Press <w>$cmd[CMD_REST]</w> or <w>shift-numpad-5</w>\n"
"<localtiles>, or click on the 'rest' button,</localtiles> to do so.\n"
msgstr "生命或魔力较低、又不急着移动时，可以休息。最好先退到已探索且清除怪物的区域；在探索边缘休息更容易被游荡怪物打断。按 <w>$cmd[CMD_REST]</w> 或 <w>shift-numpad-5</w><localtiles>，也可点击“休息”按钮</localtiles>，即可休息。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_need_poison_healing"
msgid ""
"You are lethally poisoned, so now would be a good time to\n"
"<w>$cmd[CMD_QUAFF]</w>uaff a potion of heal wounds or, better yet, a potion of\n"
"curing. If you have seen neither of these so far, try unknown potions in your\n"
"inventory. Good luck!\n"
msgstr "你已致命中毒！现在应按 <w>$cmd[CMD_QUAFF]</w> 饮用愈伤药水，更好的是治疗药水。如果两种都没见过，可以试试物品栏中的未知药水。祝好运！\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_on_fire"
msgid ""
"You have been covered in sticky liquid flame. You can put this out more quickly\n"
"by spending your turns moving, or put it out entirely by walking into a nearby\n"
"pool of water. Whatever covered you in liquid flames may light you further on\n"
"fire while you run around, however.\n"
msgstr "你被黏着的液态火焰覆盖了。不断移动能让它更快熄灭，走进附近水池则能完全灭火。不过，向你泼洒火焰的敌人可能在你奔走时再次点燃你。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_invisible_danger"
msgid ""
"Fighting against a monster you cannot see is difficult. If you don't have a\n"
"source of see invisibility, you can find invisible monsters by luring them into\n"
"shallow water, opaque clouds (from a scroll of fog), or a corridor, where their\n"
"movements will be more predictable. If things go south, try teleporting out, or\n"
"leaving the level entirely!\n"
msgstr "与看不见的怪物作战很困难。若无法看见隐形，可以把怪物引入浅水、不透明云雾（如迷雾卷轴产生的云雾），或走廊，让其移动更容易预测。情况不妙时，尝试传送逃离，甚至直接离开本层！\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_need_healing_invis"
msgid ""
"You recently noticed an invisible monster, so unless you killed it or left the\n"
"scene, resting might not be safe. If you still need to replenish your health or\n"
"magic, you'll have to quaff an appropriate potion. For normal resting you will\n"
"first have to get away from the danger.\n"
msgstr "你刚发现过隐形怪物，除非已经杀死它或离开现场，否则休息可能不安全。仍需补充生命或魔力时，得喝相应药水。想正常休息，应先摆脱危险。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_can_berserk"
msgid ""
"Against particularly difficult foes, you should use your Berserk\n"
"<w>$cmd[CMD_USE_ABILITY]</w>bility. Killing monsters while berserking makes it\n"
"last longer.\n"
msgstr "对付特别难缠的敌人，可以按 <w>$cmd[CMD_USE_ABILITY]</w> 使用狂暴能力。狂暴时击杀怪物会延长持续时间。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_postberserk"
msgid ""
"Berserking is extremely exhausting! Afterwards you are slowed down, and you\n"
"won't be able to berserk again until enough time passes for your exhaustion to\n"
"fade.\n"
msgstr "狂暴极其耗费体力！结束后你会减速，在疲惫消退前无法再次狂暴。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_run_away_1"
msgid ""
"Whenever your health is very low and you're in danger of dying, check your\n"
"options carefully. Often, retreat or use of some item might be a viable\n"
"alternative to fighting on.\n"
msgstr "生命极低、面临死亡时，应仔细检查可用手段。撤退或使用某件物品，往往比继续硬拼更可行。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_last_minute_berserk"
msgid ""
"With Trog's support, you can use your Berserk ability\n"
"(<w>$cmd[CMD_USE_ABILITY]</w>) to temporarily gain more health and greater\n"
"strength. Bear in mind that berserking at the last minute is often risky,\n"
"and prevents you from using items to escape!\n"
msgstr "在特洛戈的支持下，你可使用狂暴能力（<w>$cmd[CMD_USE_ABILITY]</w>），暂时获得更多生命与更强力量。切记，最后关头才狂暴通常很冒险，还会使你无法使用物品逃命！\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_run_away_2"
msgid ""
"If retreating to another level, keep in mind that monsters may follow you if\n"
"they're standing right next to you when you start climbing or descending the\n"
"stairs. And even if you've managed to shake them off, they'll still be there\n"
"when you come back, so you might want to use a different set of stairs when you\n"
"return.\n"
msgstr "撤退到其他楼层时，注意怪物若在你开始上下楼时紧邻你，可能会跟过来。即使甩掉它们，回来时它们仍会在那里，所以返回时也许应改走另一座楼梯。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_retreat_caster"
msgid ""
"Without magical power you're unable to cast spells. While melee is a\n"
"possibility, that's not where your strengths lie, so retreat (if possible) might\n"
"be the better option.\n"
msgstr "没有魔力就无法施法。虽然还能近战，但这并非你的长处；若可行，撤退可能更好。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_advise_use_wand"
msgid "\\nOr you could e<w>$cmd[CMD_EVOKE]</w>oke a wand to harm or weaken your foes.\n"
msgstr "\\n或者，你可以按 <w>$cmd[CMD_EVOKE]</w> 发动魔杖，伤害或削弱敌人。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_you_mutated"
msgid ""
"Mutations can be good or bad. Potions of mutation are the most common way to\n"
"remove bad mutations, though they can also give you new ones. Check your\n"
"mutations with <w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_MUTATIONS]</w>.\n"
msgstr "变异有好有坏。变异药水是移除坏变异最常见的方法，但也可能带来新变异。按 <w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_MUTATIONS]</w> 查看变异。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_new_ability_god_passive"
msgid ""
"You just gained a divine ability. Press <w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_RELIGION]</w>\n"
"<localtiles> or press <w>Shift</w> and <w>right-click</w> on the player\n"
"tile</localtiles> to take a look at your abilities.\n"
msgstr "你刚获得一项神赐能力。按 <w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_RELIGION]</w><localtiles>，或按住 <w>Shift</w> 对角色图像按<w>鼠标右键</w></localtiles>，可查看能力。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_new_ability_god_active"
msgid ""
"You just gained a divine ability. Press <w>$cmd[CMD_USE_ABILITY]</w> to take a\n"
"look at your abilities or to use one of them.\n"
msgstr "你刚获得一项神赐能力。按 <w>$cmd[CMD_USE_ABILITY]</w> 可查看或使用能力。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_new_ability_item"
msgid ""
"That item you just equipped granted you a new ability. Press\n"
"<w>$cmd[CMD_USE_ABILITY]</w><localtiles> (or <w>click</w> in the <w>command\n"
"panel</w>)</localtiles> to take a look at your abilities or to use one of them.\n"
msgstr "刚装备的物品赋予你一项新能力。按 <w>$cmd[CMD_USE_ABILITY]</w><localtiles>（也可在<w>命令面板</w>中<w>点击</w>）</localtiles>，可查看或使用能力。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_item_flight"
msgid ""
"Flight will allow you to cross deep water or lava. Items that allow you to fly\n"
"will activate automatically when worn.\n"
msgstr "飞行可以越过深水或熔岩。赋予飞行的物品穿戴后会自动生效。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_item_resistances"
msgid ""
"Equipping this item affects your resistances. Check the overview screen\n"
"(<w>$cmd[CMD_RESISTS_SCREEN]</w><localtiles> or click on the <w>character\n"
"overview button</w> in the command panel</localtiles>) for details.\n"
msgstr "装备这件物品会影响你的抗性。查看概览界面（<w>$cmd[CMD_RESISTS_SCREEN]</w><localtiles>，或点击命令面板中的<w>角色概览按钮</w></localtiles>）了解详情。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_god_displeased"
msgid ""
"Uh-oh, $1 is growing displeased because your piety is running low. Possibly this\n"
"is the case because you're committing heretical acts, because $1 finds your\n"
"worship lacking, or a combination of the two. If your piety goes to zero, then\n"
"you'll be excommunicated. Better get cracking on raising your piety, and/or stop\n"
"annoying your god. In any case, you'd better reread the religious description.\n"
"To do so, press <w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_RELIGION]</w><localtiles> or press\n"
"<w>Shift</w> and <w>right-click</w> on your avatar</localtiles>.\n"
msgstr "糟了，你的虔诚太低，$1 开始不满了。可能是你做了亵渎之事，也可能是 $1 认为你的崇拜不足，或两者兼有。虔诚归零时，你会被逐出教门。赶快提高虔诚，或停止惹怒神祇。最好重新阅读宗教说明：按 <w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_RELIGION]</w><localtiles>，或按住 <w>Shift</w> 对角色图像按<w>鼠标右键</w></localtiles>。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_wield_weapon"
msgid ""
"You can easily switch back to your weapon in slot a by\n"
"pressing <w>$cmd[CMD_WEAPON_SWAP]</w>. To change the slot of an item, press\n"
"<w>$cmd[CMD_ADJUST_INVENTORY]i</w> and choose the appropriate slots.\n"
msgstr "按 <w>$cmd[CMD_WEAPON_SWAP]</w>，可以方便地换回 a 槽武器。要更改物品栏位，按 <w>$cmd[CMD_ADJUST_INVENTORY]i</w>，再选择对应栏位。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_fleeing_monster"
msgid ""
"Now that monster is scared of you! Note that you do not absolutely have to\n"
"follow it. Rather, you can let it run away. Sometimes, though, it can be useful\n"
"to attack a fleeing creature by throwing something after it. If you have any\n"
"stones in your <w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_INVENTORY]</w>nventory, you can look at one\n"
"of them to read an explanation of how to do this.\n"
msgstr "现在那只怪物怕你了！你完全不必追它，可以让它逃走。不过，有时向逃跑怪物投掷物品很有用。若背包（<w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_INVENTORY]</w>）里有石块，查看它便能了解操作方法。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_monster_unusual"
msgid ""
"That monster looks a bit unusual. You might wish to examine it a bit more\n"
"closely by <localtiles>hovering your mouse over its tile.</localtiles>\n"
"<nomouse>pressing <w>$cmd[CMD_LOOK_AROUND]</w> and moving the cursor onto its\n"
"square.</nomouse>\n"
msgstr "那只怪物有点不寻常，值得仔细检查：<localtiles>将鼠标悬停在它的图标上。</localtiles><nomouse>按 <w>$cmd[CMD_LOOK_AROUND]</w>，将光标移到它所在格。</nomouse>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_monster_friendly"
msgid ""
"That monster is friendly to you and will attack your enemies. You can command\n"
"your allies by pressing <w>$cmd[CMD_SHOUT]</w>.\n"
msgstr "那只怪物对你友善，会攻击你的敌人。按 <w>$cmd[CMD_SHOUT]</w> 可指挥盟友。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_temporarily_friendly"
msgid ""
"However, it is only <w>temporarily</w> friendly, and will become dangerous\n"
"again when this friendliness wears off.\n"
msgstr "不过，它只是<w>暂时</w>友善；效果结束后，它会再次变得危险。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_monster_shouted_unseen"
msgid ""
"Uh-oh, some monster noticed you, either one that's around a corner or one that's\n"
"invisible. Plus, the noise it made will alert other monsters in the vicinity,\n"
"who will come to check out what the commotion was about.\n"
msgstr "糟了，有只怪物注意到了你，可能在转角后，也可能处于隐形。它发出的噪音还会惊动附近其他怪物，引它们过来查看。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_monster_shouted_seen"
msgid ""
"Uh-oh, that monster noticed you! Plus, the noise it made will alert other\n"
"monsters in the vicinity, who will come to check out what the commotion\n"
"was about.\n"
msgstr "糟了，那只怪物注意到了你！它发出的噪音还会惊动附近其他怪物，引它们过来查看。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_monster_no_shout"
msgid ""
"Uh-oh, that monster noticed you! Fortunately, it didn't make any noise, but many\n"
"monsters do make noise when they notice you. That will alert other monsters in\n"
"the area, who will come to check out what the commotion was about.\n"
msgstr "糟了，那只怪物注意到了你！幸好它没发出声音。但许多怪物发现你时会叫喊，惊动附近其他怪物，引它们过来查看。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_monster_left_los"
msgid ""
"$1 didn't vanish, but merely moved onto a square which you can't currently see.\n"
"It's still nearby, unless something happens to it in the short amount of time\n"
"it's out of sight.\n"
msgstr "$1 并没有消失，只是移动到了你现在看不见的格子。除非在离开视野的短时间内发生其他事，否则它仍在附近。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_seen_zero_exp_mon"
msgid ""
"That<console> $1</console> is $2. While <w>technically</w> a monster, it's\n"
"more like dungeon furniture, since it's harmless and doesn't move. If it's in\n"
"your way you can attack and kill it like other monsters, but you won't get any\n"
"experience for doing so.\n"
msgstr "那<console>个 $1</console>是 $2。虽然<w>严格说来</w>也是怪物，但它无害且不移动，更像地下城家具。挡路时可以像其他怪物一样攻击并杀死它，但不会获得经验。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_abyss"
msgid ""
"Uh-oh, you've wound up in the Abyss! The Abyss is a special place where you\n"
"cannot remember or map where you've been; it is filled with nasty monsters, and\n"
"you're probably going to die.\n"
"\n"
"To increase your chances of survival until you can find the exit<console> (a\n"
"flickering <w>$1</w>)</console>, keep moving, don't fight any of the monsters,\n"
"and don't chase after items on the ground. If monsters are closing in, try to\n"
"use items and abilities to get away.\n"
msgstr ""
"糟了，你落入深渊了！在这个特殊地方，你无法记住或绘制走过的路线；这里遍布凶恶怪物，你很可能会死。\n"
"\n"
"为了撑到找到出口<console>（闪烁的 <w>$1</w>）</console>，应不停移动，不与怪物交战，也不要追逐地上的物品。若怪物逼近，尝试用物品和能力脱身。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_spell_miscast_effects"
msgid ""
"Miscasting a spell can have nasty consequences, particularly for the more\n"
"difficult spells. Your chance of successfully casting a spell increases with\n"
"your magic skills, and can also be improved with the help of some items. Use\n"
"the <w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_SPELLS]</w> command<localtiles> or mouse over the spell\n"
"tiles</localtiles> to check your current failure rates.\n"
msgstr "施法失败可能带来严重后果，高难度法术尤其如此。魔法技能越高，成功率越高，一些物品也有帮助。按 <w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_SPELLS]</w><localtiles>，或将鼠标悬停在法术图标上</localtiles>，可查看当前失败率。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_you_miscast"
msgid "You just miscast a spell.\n"
msgstr "你刚刚施法失败了。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_miscast_armour"
msgid ""
"Wearing heavy body armour or using a shield, especially a large one, can\n"
"severely hamper your spellcasting abilities. You can check the effect of this\n"
"by comparing the failure rates on the <w>$cmd[CMD_CAST_SPELL]\\?</w> screen with\n"
"and without the item being worn.\n"
msgstr "重型躯干防具或盾牌，尤其大盾，会严重妨碍施法。可以在穿戴前后，比较 <w>$cmd[CMD_CAST_SPELL]\\?</w> 界面中的失败率。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_miscast_contamination_and_mp"
msgid ""
"If the spellcasting success chance is high (which can be checked by entering\n"
"<w>$cmd[CMD_CAST_SPELL]\\?</w> or <w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_SPELLS]</w>) then a miscast\n"
"merely means the spell is not working, along with a harmless side effect.\n"
"However, for spells with a high failure rate, there's a chance of contaminating\n"
"yourself with magical energy, plus a chance of an additional harmful side\n"
"effect. Normally this isn't a problem, since magical contamination bleeds off\n"
"over time, but if you're repeatedly contaminated in a short amount of time\n"
"you'll mutate or suffer from other ill side effects.\n"
"\n"
"Note that a miscast spell will still consume the full amount of MP that a\n"
"successfully cast spell would.\n"
msgstr ""
"若施法成功率较高（可按 <w>$cmd[CMD_CAST_SPELL]\\?</w> 或 <w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_SPELLS]</w> 查看），失败只意味着法术没生效，并伴随无害副作用。但失败率较高的法术，可能造成魔法污染，以及额外有害副作用。污染通常会随时间消退；若短时间内反复积累，则可能造成变异或其他不良后果。\n"
"\n"
"注意，失败仍会消耗与成功施法相同的全部魔力。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_glowing"
msgid ""
"You've accumulated so much magical contamination that you're glowing! You\n"
"usually acquire magical contamination from using some powerful magics, like\n"
"invisibility, or from miscasting spells.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"你积累了太多魔法污染，已经开始发光了！强大魔法（例如隐形）或施法失败，通常会带来污染。\n"
"\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_contamination_mild"
msgid ""
"As long as the status only shows in grey nothing will actually happen as a\n"
"result of it, but as you continue suffusing yourself with magical contamination\n"
"you'll eventually start glowing for real, which can have nasty effects, such as\n"
"mutating you or dealing direct damage. In addition, glowing is going to make you\n"
"much more noticeable.\n"
msgstr "状态仍为灰色时，魔法污染不会实际造成后果。但若继续积累，最终会真正发光，并可能造成变异或直接伤害。发光也会让你更显眼。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_contamination_severe"
msgid ""
"This normally isn't a problem as contamination slowly bleeds off on its own, but\n"
"it seems that you've accumulated so much contamination over a short amount of\n"
"time that it can have nasty effects, such as mutating you or dealing direct\n"
"damage. In addition, glowing is going to make you much more noticeable.\n"
msgstr "魔法污染通常会缓慢自行消退，并不成问题。但你似乎在短时间内积累了太多，可能造成变异或直接伤害。发光也会让你更显眼。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_you_resist"
msgid ""
"Most attacks in Crawl are defended against by your AC. Some, like fire or\n"
"draining attacks, can be further reduced by specific resistances. Other magical\n"
"effects, such as Slow or Confusion hexes, are resisted by your willpower.\n"
"You'll find items that increase both kinds of resistances.\n"
"\n"
"To view your current set of resistances, <localtiles><w>right-click</w> on the\n"
"player avatar, or </localtiles>press <w>$cmd[CMD_RESISTS_SCREEN]</w>.\n"
msgstr "大多数攻击由护甲值抵御。火焰或吸能等伤害，还能由特定抗性进一步减轻。减速、混乱等妖术，则由意志抵抗。你会找到能提高这些抗性的物品。\n\n<localtiles>对角色图像按<w>鼠标右键</w>，或</localtiles>按 <w>$cmd[CMD_RESISTS_SCREEN]</w>，查看当前抗性。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_caught_in_net"
msgid ""
"While you are held in a net, you cannot move around or engage monsters in\n"
"combat. Instead, any movement you take is counted as an attempt to struggle free\n"
"from the net.\n"
"{{\n"
"    if crawl.hints_type() == \"magic\" then\n"
"        return \"Note that casting spells is still very much possible, as is\"\n"
"               .. \" using wands, scrolls and potions.\"\n"
"    else\n"
"        return \"Note that using wands, scrolls and potions is still very much\"\n"
"               .. \" possible.\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"
msgstr ""
"被网困住时，你不能移动或与怪物交战。任何移动尝试都会变成挣扎脱网。\n"
"{{\n"
"    if crawl.hints_type() == \"magic\" then\n"
"        return \"注意，你仍然可以施法，也能\"\n"
"               .. \"使用魔杖、卷轴和药水。\"\n"
"    else\n"
"        return \"注意，你仍然可以使用魔杖、卷轴和药水，\"\n"
"               .. \"这些操作不受影响。\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_you_silence"
msgid ""
"While you are silenced, you cannot cast spells, read scrolls or use divine\n"
"invocations. The same is true for any monster within the effect radius. The\n"
"field of silence (recognizable by <tiles>the special-looking frame tiles</tiles>\n"
"<console>different-coloured floor squares</console>) is always centered on you\n"
"and will move along with you. The radius will gradually shrink, eventually\n"
"making you the only one affected, before the effect fades entirely.\n"
msgstr "被静默时，你无法施法、阅读卷轴或使用神祇祈祷；效果范围内的怪物也一样。静默领域（可由<tiles>特殊边框图标</tiles><console>不同颜色的地面格</console>识别）始终以你为中心，随你移动。半径会逐渐缩小，最后只影响你，随后完全消失。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_autopickup_thrown"
msgid "When stepping on items you've thrown, they will be picked up automatically.\n"
msgstr "走到你投掷过的物品上时，会自动将其拾取。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_gained_spellcasting"
msgid ""
"As your Spellcasting skill increases, you will be able to memorise more spells,\n"
"and will have somewhat more MP. You'll also beomce lsightly better at casting\n"
"all kinds of spells.\n"
"\n"
"Press <w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_SKILLS]</w> <localtiles>(or click on the <w>skill\n"
"button </w>in the command panel)</localtiles>to have a look at your skills and\n"
"manage their training.\n"
msgstr ""
"施法技能提高后，你能记忆更多法术，魔力也会有所增加，施放各类法术的能力还会略微改善。\n"
"\n"
"按 <w>$cmd[CMD_DISPLAY_SKILLS]</w><localtiles>（或点击命令面板中的<w>技能按钮</w>）</localtiles>，可查看技能并管理训练。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_fumbling_shallow_water"
msgid ""
"Fighting in shallow water will sometimes cause you to slip and fumble your\n"
"attack. If possible, try to fight on firm ground.\n"
msgstr "在浅水中战斗，有时会滑倒而攻击失手。可以的话，尽量站在坚实地面上战斗。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_cloud_warning"
msgid ""
"Rather than step into this cloud and hurt yourself, you should either wait for a\n"
"few turns to see if it vanishes (with <w>$cmd[CMD_WAIT]</w>), or just step\n"
"around it.\n"
msgstr "与其走进云雾受伤，不如按 <w>$cmd[CMD_WAIT]</w> 等几回合，看看它是否消散，或直接绕过去。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/hints.txt:hint_found_unknown"
msgid "You've found something new (but I don't know what)!\n"
msgstr "你发现了新东西（不过我也不知道是什么）！\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:__(_suffix_examine"
msgid "It has been enchanted to dance through the air and attack under its own power.\n"
msgstr "它被施了魔法，使得它能自己在空中飞舞攻击。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:agnes"
msgid ""
"This spriggan is aged and weathered from years of travel away from the forests\n"
"and swamps that are home to her kin. Her choice of weapon and astonishing speed\n"
"both speak to the training she underwent. Underestimate her at your peril!\n"
msgstr ""
"由于多年远离她的亲人居住的森林和沼泽，这个斯普利根已苍老而饱经风霜。\n"
"她选择的武器和惊人的速度，都表明了她受过严格的训练。低估她，你就会有危险！\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:aizul"
msgid ""
"Once the primary guardian serpent of a legendary treasure hoard, she was\n"
"disgraced after thieves looted it while she slept. She seeks to make up for her\n"
"failure by protecting the only treasure the villains overlooked, a single\n"
"precious talisman.\n"
msgstr "她曾是传奇宝库的首席守卫蛇，却因睡着时被盗贼洗劫宝库而蒙羞。她如今保护着恶徒唯一遗漏的宝物——一枚珍贵的变形护符，试图弥补过失。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:amaemon"
msgid ""
"Amaemon always knew he was different, but it was still a horrific surprise when\n"
"his demonic heritage manifested. As his body twisted, Amaemon was forced to flee\n"
"far from the surface. The passage of time has only left him more obsessed with\n"
"what he has lost - consumed by poison both physical and spiritual.\n"
msgstr "阿玛埃蒙一直知道自己与众不同，但恶魔血统显现时，仍令他惊骇万分。身体开始扭曲后，他被迫逃离地表。岁月只让他愈加执着于失去的一切，肉体与心灵都被毒素吞噬。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:antaeus"
msgid ""
"Once a hero among the titans, Antaeus grew jealous of the titan queen. In\n"
"single combat he challenged and slew her, and for this crime he was exiled and\n"
"descended into the Hells. Finding the inhabitants of that place no match for his\n"
"might, Antaeus tore from its substance a fourth Hell, Cocytus, a realm born of\n"
"frozen spite.\n"
msgstr ""
"安泰俄斯曾经是泰坦中的英雄，但他嫉妒泰坦女王。\n"
"在一次战斗中，他发起挑战并杀死了她，因此随后被流放到了地狱。\n"
"安泰俄斯发现栖息在那个地方的生灵无法与他匹敌，\n"
"于是他从其实质上撕开了第四层地狱——悲叹河，一个由冰冻和怨恨而生的领域。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:arachne"
msgid ""
"Once a talented human weaver, Arachne was transformed into a monstrous\n"
"half-spider by a jealous rival's curse. Driven out of her village, she found\n"
"sanctuary for a time among the jorogumo before a bitter feud forced her to\n"
"flee once more.\n"
"\n"
"Now she wanders other corners of the dungeon with a small retinue of loyal\n"
"students in tow, seeking a new domain in which they can spin their peerless\n"
"tapestries in peace.\n"
msgstr "阿拉克涅曾是才华横溢的人类织工，被嫉妒她的对手诅咒，变成半蜘蛛怪物。被村庄赶走后，她曾在络新妇中暂得庇护，却又因一场激烈纷争被迫逃亡。\n\n如今，她带着少数忠心学生游荡于地下城其他角落，寻找新的领地，好让她们安宁地织造无与伦比的挂毯。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:asmodeus"
msgid ""
"Greatest and most cunning of the Lords of Hell, Asmodeus was born when the twin\n"
"fires of greed and treachery first sparked to life within a mortal's heart.\n"
"His hideous body is perpetually wreathed in flame.\n"
msgstr ""
"作为最伟大、最狡猾的地狱领主，\n"
"阿斯蒙蒂斯诞生于贪婪和背叛的双生之火第一次在凡人的心中燃起之时。\n"
"他那狰狞的身躯永远被火焰包围着。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:asterion"
msgid ""
"Once a king infamous for waging bloodthirsty campaigns, Asterion was exiled to\n"
"the depths of the dungeon for his crimes. Here he lurks in his tattered finery,\n"
"dreaming of a new kingdom. In his lust for power, the minotaur king turned to\n"
"the worship of Makhleb, and Makhleb has rewarded him with horrifying\n"
"destructive might.\n"
msgstr "阿斯忒里翁曾经是一个国王，因发动了残酷的战争而臭名昭著，\n后来因为他的罪行被流放地下城的地底。\n他穿着破旧的华服潜伏在这里，梦想建立新的王国。\n这个牛头人王出于对力量的渴望，转而皈依马科列布，\n而马科列布也赐予他骇人的毁灭性力量。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:azrael"
msgid "A powerful, belligerent efreet. (Is there any other kind?)\n"
msgstr "一个强大、好战的伊弗利特。（还有其他种类的吗？）\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:bai suzhen"
msgid ""
"A weary draconian with foreign and watery scales. She has come to the Dungeon\n"
"in hopes of resurrecting her mortal husband; a noble cause, for a being once\n"
"known for quarrelling with saints and flooding unfortunate temples. If pressed\n"
"to her limits, she will reveal her true form, the mere sight of which struck\n"
"her husband dead. Adventurers may wish they were so lucky!\n"
msgstr "一个疲惫的龙人，长有异样的似水的鳞片。\n她来到地下城是为了一项崇高的事情，希望能找到复活她的凡人夫君的方法，\n但她也因与和尚斗法而淹没不幸的佛寺而闻名。\n如果把她逼得走投无路，她会展现出自己的真实形态，\n她的丈夫仅仅只是看到就被吓死了。冒险者可能会希望他们也能这么幸运！\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:boris"
msgid ""
"An ancient and powerful lich. Like all true liches, Boris is immortal, and will\n"
"regenerate his desiccated skeletal remains even if completely disintegrated.\n"
"The same cannot be said for his many victims over his many centuries, from\n"
"which he collects and channels their dying woes and regrets.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个强大的远古巫妖。和所有真正的巫妖一样，\n"
"鲍里斯是不朽的，即使被完全解离得只剩骨灰也能复生。\n"
"但对于几个世纪里他的那些受害者而言却并非如此，\n"
"在这些岁月中，他收集、引导着受害者临终的痛苦和遗憾。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:cerebov"
msgid ""
"A violent and wrathful demon, Cerebov appears as a giant humanoid covered in\n"
"shining golden armour and wielding a huge twisted sword.\n"
msgstr "瑟雷波夫是一个残暴易怒的恶魔。\n他有一个巨大的人形身躯，身穿黄金铠甲，手持一把扭曲的巨剑。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:chuck"
msgid ""
"Chuck the stone giant loves rocks, the bigger the better! Over the years, he\n"
"has managed to amass quite the collection, including some rare, enchanted ones.\n"
msgstr ""
"石巨人查克喜欢石头——越大的越好！\n"
"多年来，查克已经收集了大量的石头，其中包括几块附有魔法的稀有货。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:crazy yiuf"
msgid ""
"A withered old gnoll with a long silver beard, wielding a quarterstaff and\n"
"wearing a cloak. He looks like a figure from mythology! Wait, is his beard held\n"
"on to his ears with hooks?\n"
msgstr ""
"一个干瘪的老豺狼人，长着银色的胡须，手持铁头木棒，穿着披风。\n"
"他看起来真像是神话故事里的角色！等等，他的胡子是用钩子挂在他的耳朵上的吗？\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:dispater"
msgid ""
"Greatest and most ruthless of the Lords of Hell, Dispater was born when first an\n"
"iron sword drank mortal blood. They despise mortal vanities, the pursuit of\n"
"‘reason’ and ‘beauty’ - the only art they enjoy is the art of war.\n"
msgstr ""
"作为最伟大、最残忍的地狱领主，迪斯帕特诞生于第一把铁剑饮用凡人的鲜血之时。\n"
"他鄙视凡人的虚荣心和对所谓“理性”、“美”的追求——\n"
"他唯一喜欢的艺术是战争艺术。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:dissolution"
msgid ""
"The Pits of Slime used to be a thriving civilisation, and Dissolution was the\n"
"prophet of their god. When the city was overtaken by its current residents,\n"
"only Dissolution survived, for they alone turned faithfully to the Slime God.\n"
"Dissolution became a tremendous mass of acidic ooze, yet retained their\n"
"intelligence. They are filled with hatred for anything that can hold a form.\n"
msgstr "史莱姆巢穴曾经是一座繁荣的都市，而溶解者则是居民们所信仰的神的先知。\n当这座城市被现在的居民占领的时候，只有溶解者活了下来，\n因为他们选择转而忠于黏液神。\n溶解者已经变成了一大团酸性软泥，但他依然保留着他的心智。\n他们极度憎恨一切有固定形态的东西。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:donald"
msgid ""
"{{\n"
"    local descript = \"An adventurer just like you, trying to find the Orb.\"\n"
"\n"
"    if you.race() ~= \"Merfolk\" and you.race() ~= \"Octopode\" then\n"
"        descript = descript .. \" Unlike you, and d\"\n"
"    else\n"
"        descript = descript .. \" D\"\n"
"    end\n"
"\n"
"    descript = descript .. \"espite his hatred of it, he takes to water \" ..\n"
"                           \"like a fowl.\"\n"
"\n"
"    return descript\n"
"}}\n"
msgstr ""
"{{\n"
"    local descript = \"一个和你一样寻找宝珠的冒险者。\"\n"
"\n"
"    if you.race() ~= \"Merfolk\" and you.race() ~= \"Octopode\" then\n"
"        descript = descript .. \"与你不同，尽管\"\n"
"    else\n"
"        descript = descript .. \"尽管\"\n"
"    end\n"
"\n"
"    descript = descript .. \"他厌恶水，却能在水中\" ..\n"
"                           \"像水禽一样自如。\"\n"
"\n"
"    return descript\n"
"}}\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:dowan"
msgid ""
"A beautiful but vain deep elf with an aptitude for magic and little else. His\n"
"skills are the perfect complement of his twin sister Duvessa's fighting prowess.\n"
"In search of more powerful spells, he journeys to the surface with his sister.\n"
msgstr "一个美丽但高傲的地底精灵，有着魔法天资，但除此之外，就没什么了。\n他的技能是对他的双胞胎妹妹杜维莎的格斗技能的完美补充。\n为寻求更强大的魔法，他和他的妹妹一起前往地表。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:duvessa"
msgid ""
"A plain-looking deep elven fighter who is technically brilliant in many forms of\n"
"combat, but over-confident because of it. She is complemented by the magical\n"
"skills of her twin brother, Dowan. She journeys to the surface to challenge\n"
"its greatest champions.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个外表普通的地底精灵战士，\n"
"她在多种形式的战斗中，技巧都非常精湛，但也因此过于自信。\n"
"她的双胞胎哥哥多万的法术技能对她起到了补充作用。\n"
"她前往地表以挑战最强大的斗士。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:edmund"
msgid ""
"A jealous sibling of Sigmund (indeed, the youngest of nine brothers). He has\n"
"none of Sigmund's skills in magic, but makes up for it with his skills in\n"
"fighting and a canny head for money. He is eager to prove his superiority by\n"
"killing hapless adventurers with his expensive flail and quick wit.\n"
msgstr ""
"西格蒙德的一个好嫉妒的弟弟（他是九个兄弟中最小的一个）。\n"
"他不像西格蒙德那样会施法，但他的格斗技能和精明的头脑弥补了这方面的不足。\n"
"他急着想要靠他的昂贵的连枷和诡计来杀死几个倒霉的冒险者，\n"
"以此来证明他的实力。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:enchantress"
msgid ""
"First and most fearful of her kind, the Enchantress rules over the spriggans of\n"
"the dungeon. She wears an opalescent outfit made of dragon skin that shimmers\n"
"with many colours.\n"
msgstr "魅惑女王是她的同族中的至尊，也是最令人胆寒的，统领整个的地下城的斯普利根。\n她常穿着龙皮制成的乳白色外衣，闪烁着各色光芒。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ereshkigal"
msgid ""
"Greatest and most inexorable of the Lords of Hell, Ereshkigal was born when\n"
"first a mortal breathed her last. Noiselessly she laughs at lives cut short and\n"
"loved ones separated by untimely death, enwreathed in the silence of the grave.\n"
msgstr "埃列什基伽勒是最伟大、最不可违抗的地狱领主，诞生于第一位凡人咽下最后一口气息之时。她笼罩在坟墓般的寂静中，无声嘲笑那些夭折的生命，以及因横死而永远分离的亲人。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:erica"
msgid ""
"A wild-tempered adventuress. She's quite prideful for an octopode, and brandishes\n"
"their venomous capacity and camouflage talents with cruel force.\n"
msgstr "一位脾气暴烈的女冒险者。即使在章鱼人中，她也格外骄傲，残酷地运用天生毒性和伪装本领。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:erolcha"
msgid "An especially cunning ogre-mage.\n"
msgstr "一个特别狡猾的食人魔法师。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:eustachio"
msgid ""
"An apprentice summoner with a flowing moustache. He has funny ideas about\n"
"honour.\n"
msgstr "一个留着飘逸胡子的见习召唤师。他对荣誉有着有趣的想法。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:fannar"
msgid ""
"A cold-hearted elven sorcerer, draped in robes of high office. They whisper\n"
"grimly to themself as they stalk the dungeon, trailing ice crystals through the\n"
"air behind them.\n"
msgstr "一位冷血的精灵术师，身穿高级长袍。\n他漫游地下城，时而阴冷地自言自语，身后的空气结为冰晶。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:frances"
msgid ""
"A stout warrior who once bested a powerful lord of Pandemonium in combat,\n"
"gaining control over the demon's realm and thanes. The battle left her with a\n"
"deep facial scar, one that she carries as a badge of honour rather than a\n"
"symbol of shame.\n"
msgstr "一位壮实的战士，曾在战斗中击败强大的魔窟领主，夺得其领地与部属的控制权。那场战斗在她脸上留下深深的伤疤，她将其视为荣誉勋章，而非耻辱印记。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:frederick"
msgid ""
"A svelte fighter-mage with a gold-rimmed monocle, a keen sense of tradition,\n"
"and the blood of the gods running through his veins. He's here looking for a\n"
"worthy opponent, but he's yet to find one.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个身材苗条的战斗法师，戴着金边单片眼镜，有着强烈的传统观念，\n"
"血脉中流淌着众神的血。他正在寻找一个值得重视的对手，但还没有找到一个。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:gastronok"
msgid ""
"A voracious and surprisingly intelligent slug, devoted to eating everything and\n"
"everyone he comes across, with a pointed hat perched rakishly atop his head. He\n"
"acquired the hat the same way he acquired his intelligence and his knowledge of\n"
"spells: by consuming their former owner, a powerful wizard.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条贪婪且出奇聪明的蛞蝓，它会吃掉它遇到的所有人和物，\n"
"头上放荡地顶着一个尖帽子。他获得帽子与获得智慧和法术知识的方式相同：\n"
"吃掉帽子的前主人——一个强大的巫师。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:geryon"
msgid ""
"A huge, three-headed, winged arch-demon, guardian of the four Hells. Legends\n"
"say that his silver horn can summon terrible beasts to aid him in battle.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个巨大的三头有翼大恶魔，是四个地狱的守卫者。\n"
"传说他的银色号角可以召唤可怕的野兽来助他战斗。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:gloorx vloq"
msgid "A shadowy figure clothed in profound darkness.\n"
msgstr "一个被深邃黑暗笼罩中的身影。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:grinder"
msgid ""
"An inefficient shadow imp previously employed as a torturer in one of the lower\n"
"circles of Hell. She has a tendency to complain and make inane statements.\n"
msgstr "一个无能的阴影小恶魔。她以前在地狱低层做拷问者工作。\n她总喜欢滔滔不绝地抱怨和讲废话。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:grum"
msgid "A tough-looking gnoll, wearing the pelt of one of his former war dogs.\n"
msgstr "一个外表凶狠的豺狼人，身上穿着他以前的一条战犬的毛皮。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:grunn"
msgid ""
"A brutally twisted undead gnoll in the eternal service of Ereshkigal, lord of\n"
"Tartarus. Legend has it that he sold his soul to return his most beloved hunting\n"
"dog to life. Whether that hound is a member of his current pack, none can say.\n"
msgstr "一个残忍扭曲的豺狼人亡灵，永远为塔尔塔罗斯的领主埃列什基伽勒服务。\n传说他出卖了自己的灵魂，为了让他最心爱的猎犬得以复活。\n这只猎狗是否属于他现在的群落，谁也说不准。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:harold"
msgid ""
"A middle-aged bounty hunter, anxious to retire after one final job. He hopes to\n"
"settle down somewhere and live a quiet life with his family, using the money\n"
"from his final bounty: you.\n"
msgstr "一位中年赏金猎人，急着做完最后一单便退休。他希望用最后一笔赏金——也就是你——找个地方安家，与家人过上平静生活。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ignacio"
msgid ""
"While a mortal cannot turn into a demon aside from divine intervention, this is\n"
"what happened to Ignacio after Makhleb saw his love for his job and smiled upon\n"
"him. He is now slated to continue the joy of his life for all eternity.\n"
"\n"
"Although his new form includes a number of large razor-sharp blades growing\n"
"from his demonic appendages, he kept his favourite axe and is eager to let you\n"
"test its edge.\n"
msgstr ""
"若是没有神明的介入，凡人是不可能变为恶魔的。\n"
"当马科列布看到伊格纳西欧对他的工作的热爱并对他微笑后，\n"
"伊格纳西奥身上就发生了这样的事情。现在他将永远继续他一生的乐趣了。\n"
"\n"
"尽管他的新形态有着从恶魔附肢长出的大量锋利的刀片，\n"
"但他还是保留了他最喜欢的斧头，并想用你来测试它的锋利程度。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ijyb"
msgid ""
"A small and shrewd goblin inventor, wearing blue rags coated in soot.\n"
"She claims dominion over this level of the dungeon; trespassers will find\n"
"themselves on the business end of a homemade wand.\n"
msgstr "一个小而精明的地精发明家，穿着沾满煤烟的蓝色破布。\n她自称是这层地下城的统治者；入侵者会在她自制的魔杖那里迎来终结。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ilsuiw"
msgid ""
"A deadly merfolk water-witch, who uses her dominion over the tides to draw\n"
"unwitting adventurers to their deaths.\n"
msgstr "一个致命的人鱼水系女巫，她会驾御潮水将没有察觉到危险的冒险者引向死亡。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:jeremiah"
msgid ""
"Jeremiah was a peaceful dreamer, prone to impromptu naps. They slipped into\n"
"slumber while gazing into a magical orb, and dreamed of an old and hateful\n"
"power binding them into service. Now Jeremiah stumbles through the dungeon,\n"
"searching for the precious dreamshard that will restore their master’s power,\n"
"unsure whether they wake or slumber still. Their dreams leak into reality in\n"
"the form of a constant stream of butterflies.\n"
msgstr "耶利米是一个爱好和平的神游者，时常随兴打盹。\n他们凝视着一个神秘的水晶球进入睡眠，\n梦到有一种古老而可恨的力量把他们束缚在侍奉上。\n现在耶利米跌跌撞撞地穿过地下城，寻找珍贵的、能恢复主人力量的梦碎片，\n但不确定他们是醒着还是在沉睡。他们的梦以源源不断的蝴蝶流的形式渗入现实。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:jessica"
msgid ""
"An evil apprentice sorceress. She entered the dungeon hoping to find a quiet,\n"
"secluded place where she could study the darker arts without being disturbed.\n"
msgstr "一个邪恶的见习女术师。她来地下城是想找到一个安静、与世隔绝的地方，\n这样就可以不受干扰地学习更黑暗的技艺了。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:jorgrun"
msgid ""
"A dwarven magician, particularly well-attuned to the dungeon around him. He\n"
"wields powerful earth magic in combat.\n"
msgstr "一位矮人魔法师，非常善于利用地下城的环境，他在战斗中使用强力的土系魔法。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:jory"
msgid ""
"Once a simple village peasant, Jory found himself transformed in undeath into a\n"
"powerful creature. Through the countless centuries unlived since then, he has\n"
"honed his skills in combat and magic, and amassed great wealth and many\n"
"possessions.\n"
msgstr "乔里曾只是个普通村民，却在化为亡灵后获得强大力量。此后无数个世纪里，他不断磨炼战斗和魔法技艺，也积攒了巨额财富与众多珍宝。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:joseph"
msgid "Looks like a mercenary in a stupid-looking hat.\n"
msgstr "看起来像一个戴着愚蠢帽子的雇佣兵。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:josephina"
msgid ""
"A fearsome necromancer who followed her craft beyond the limits of flesh and\n"
"life. Her pursuit of demonic knowledge left her body ruined, but the powers she\n"
"gained allowed her to rebuild her missing limbs from glittering ice.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个可怕的死灵法师，追寻着她的技艺，超越了肉体和生命的界限。\n"
"她对恶魔知识的追求摧毁了她的身体，\n"
"但她获得的力量使她能够从闪闪发光的冰上重筑失去的四肢。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:josephine"
msgid ""
"A formidable necromancer, committed to her craft even after it left her aged,\n"
"decaying, and half-undead herself.\n"
msgstr ""
"一位令人敬畏的死灵法师，\n"
"即使在她年老、腐朽、半死不活的情况下仍致力于她的技艺。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:khufu"
msgid ""
"An incredibly powerful emperor on the way to godhood. He died quite some time\n"
"ago, but he sees no reason why that should stop him.\n"
msgstr ""
"这位非常强大的皇帝，要成为神。\n"
"很早之前他就去世了，但他认为没有任何理由能阻止他。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:kirke"
msgid ""
"A master of transformation and treachery. Beware, or you may be the next swine\n"
"to join her herd!\n"
msgstr "一位精通变形与背叛的大师。小心，否则你就会变成加入她猪群的下一头猪！\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:lernaean hydra"
msgid ""
"A huge beast, mightiest of hydras, infamous in myth and legend. It flows\n"
"through the water faster than a human can run, swatting aside trees as though\n"
"they were matchsticks. Its many heads slaver and gnash constantly as it hunts\n"
"for prey to slake its bottomless appetite.\n"
msgstr ""
"这头身形庞大的野兽，是海德拉中的最强者，在传说和神话中臭名昭著。\n"
"它在水中游动的速度比人类跑得快，游动时会将树拍到一边，仿佛它们是火柴杆。\n"
"它的许多头在不断地淌着口水、磨着牙，想要捕获猎物，以满足其无尽的食欲。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:lodul"
msgid ""
"An ogre emissary of the Ironbound Order, sent to find and stop intruders before\n"
"they enter the Vaults. Fiercely charismatic, he's rallied a small army of his\n"
"kin, overawing them with the long-range lightning array he wears on his back.\n"
"(The large coin purse he took from the Vaults is also quite persuasive.)\n"
msgstr ""
"一个铁缚会的食人魔使者，被派去追踪并阻止入侵者进入宝库。\n"
"他极具个人魅力，召集了一小群由同族组成的军队，\n"
"并凭借其背上的远程闪电阵震慑住了他们。\n"
"（他从宝库里拿走的一大笔钱也很有说服力。）\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:lom lobon"
msgid ""
"Stoic and inscrutable, Lom Lobon is an ancient demon infamous for their mastery\n"
"of magic. Rumoured to be the most learned being in the halls of Pandemonium,\n"
"they are at times sought out by mortal wizards who offer their souls in\n"
"exchange for the secrets of the arcane. Lacking the terrible wrath present in\n"
"most demons, Lom Lobon's single eye instead hides a cold, impartial cruelty.\n"
msgstr ""
"洛姆·洛邦是一个以精通魔法而臭名昭著的古老恶魔，他坚忍而高深莫测。\n"
"据传他是魔窟里最博学的，有时凡人巫师会寻找到他，\n"
"要用自己的灵魂交换其奥术秘密。\n"
"洛姆·洛邦的独眼没有大多数恶魔身上那种可怕的愤怒，\n"
"反而隐现着一种冷酷、无差别的残忍。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:louise"
msgid ""
"A mighty sorceress, clad from head to toe in heavy armour. Once an adventurer\n"
"looking for the fabled Orb of Zot, she was cast into the Abyss and got\n"
"hopelessly lost there. Toyed with by some greater power, she was stuck on the\n"
"hostile plane for nearly a decade. When she finally emerged from the Abyss,\n"
"Louise had become powerful indeed, but had also gone fully insane. She now\n"
"wanders the halls of the dungeon, seeking other adventurers to share her fate.\n"
msgstr "一个强大的女术师，用重甲全副武装。\n她曾经是一个寻找传说中的佐特宝珠的冒险者，但却在途中被打入无尽深渊。\n她被某个强大的存在玩弄着，被困在那个充满敌意的位面中长达十年之久。\n在最终逃离深渊的时候，路易丝变得极为强大，但也完全失去了理智。\n现在她徘徊在地下城之中，想让其他冒险者也承受与她一样的命运。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:mara"
msgid ""
"This tall and powerful demon is Mara, Lord of Illusions, mighty among dreamers.\n"
"He is capable of creating intricately detailed illusions, so real that they are\n"
"almost as deadly as the creatures they impersonate.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个高耸、强大的恶魔，名叫玛拉，地牢的幻象领主。他能制造复杂精细的幻象，\n"
"如此真实，以至于它们几乎与他们所模仿的生物一样致命。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:maggie"
msgid ""
"In a distant time, Maggie was apprenticed to the dreaded Hell Knights - but she\n"
"grew impatient. In search of a shortcut to fame and fortune (and somewhat short\n"
"on imagination), she entered the Dungeon and set out to slay a dragon. Now\n"
"having slain one, Maggie sees no reason to stop.\n"
msgstr "在遥远的岁月里，玛姬是可怕的地狱骑士的学徒——但她变得不耐烦了。\n为了寻找成名和发财的捷径（有点缺乏想象力），\n她进入了地下城，并着手杀死了一条龙。\n现在已经杀了一个，玛姬觉得没有理由停下来。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:margery"
msgid ""
"A lithe spellcaster in service to the powers of Hell; it is her duty to ensure\n"
"that the inhabitants of the Dungeon never forget their place. She personally\n"
"slew the ancient dragon from whose hide her strange armour is crafted.\n"
msgstr "一位身手敏捷、侍奉地狱势力的施法者，职责是确保地下城居民永远记得自己的卑微地位。她亲手杀死了一条古龙，并用龙皮制成身上那件奇异防具。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:maurice"
msgid ""
"A sly, conniving thief. A self-proclaimed legend, he was one of the most skilled\n"
"and crafty of the thieves and rogues lured by the Orb. The magical parasitic\n"
"vines that have claimed his body still wish to continue his life's work, with a\n"
"back-up plan of both a vicious magic-drinking maw and potent wands.\n"
msgstr "一个狡诈、满腹算计的盗贼。他自称传奇，也是被宝珠吸引而来的盗贼和无赖中最熟练、最狡猾的一个。如今，占据其身体的魔法寄生藤蔓仍想继续他毕生的事业，并备有凶恶的噬魔巨口和强力魔杖以防万一。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:menkaure"
msgid ""
"A fair and noble ruler of an ancient and mighty kingdom, mummified after an\n"
"early death. His faithful priests subsequently infused him with great and\n"
"powerful magic, seeking to grant him eternal life. Now he is forgotten and\n"
"reduced to mouldering bandages and dry, brittle bones.\n"
msgstr ""
"他是强盛的古国中的一位公正而崇高的统治者，英年早逝后被做成了木乃伊。\n"
"他忠实的祭司们随后为他注入了强大的魔法，试图让他永生。\n"
"现在他已经被遗忘了，只剩腐烂的布条和干燥、脆弱的骸骨。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:mennas"
msgid ""
"There was once a human priest named Mennas. He travelled far and wide as a\n"
"missionary of Zin, often venturing even into Orcish lands. He beseeched the orcs\n"
"to abandon their false tribes and return to the peoples of their birth; only\n"
"Zin's light could truly cleanse the weight of sin that had twisted their bodies.\n"
"\n"
"By all accounts the orcs were not happy with Mennas. Eventually, a group of them\n"
"demanded he recant his words and when Mennas remained silent, they cut out his\n"
"tongue.\n"
"\n"
"Whether or not this angel is that same Mennas is something of a mystery, as he\n"
"seems to have difficulty speaking.\n"
msgstr "曾有一位名叫门纳斯的人类祭司，作为辛的传教士四处远行，甚至常深入兽人领地。他恳求兽人抛弃虚假的部族身份，回归出生时所属的族群；唯有辛的光芒，才能洗净扭曲了他们身体的罪孽重负。\n\n据各方所述，兽人对门纳斯很不满意。终于，一群兽人要求他收回言论；当他保持沉默时，他们便割去了他的舌头。\n\n这位天使究竟是不是同一个门纳斯，仍是个谜，因为他似乎不太能说话。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:mlioglotl"
msgid ""
"A demon prince once possessed a hunger for power that was exceptional even by\n"
"the standards of his kind. He betrayed his realm to Lugonu, and his reward was\n"
"to become this twisted mass of corruption, now known only as Mlioglotl.\n"
msgstr "这位恶魔王子曾经对力量有一种渴望，即使以他的同类标准来衡量，\n这种渴望也是超乎寻常的。他把自己的王国出卖给了卢戈努，\n而回报就是变为这个如今被称为姆利奥格洛特尔的扭曲的腐化团。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:mnoleg"
msgid "A weirdly glowing figure, dancing through the twisted air of Pandemonium.\n"
msgstr "一个诡异的发光物体，在魔窟扭曲的世界中穿行舞动。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:murray"
msgid "A demonic skull rolling along the ground.\n"
msgstr "一个恶魔般的头骨在地上滚动。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:natasha"
msgid ""
"A fast-moving magical cat. Once a powerful wizard's familiar, Natasha was\n"
"abandoned after her master was consumed by the very necromantic forces he sought\n"
"to control. Now she patrols the dungeon, taking a bloody vengeance with spell\n"
"and claw upon any adventurer who crosses her path.\n"
"\n"
"This cat doesn't have nine lives, but just one death isn't going to be enough\n"
"to put her down for good.\n"
msgstr "一只移动迅速、有魔力的猫。娜塔莎曾是一个强大的巫师的伙伴，\n但在她的主人被他试图控制的死灵力量吞噬后，她被遗弃了。\n现在她在地下城里巡游，用法术和利爪对任何经过她的路线的冒险者进行血腥的报复。\n\n这只猫没有九条命，但仅仅一死也不足以让她安息。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:nellie"
msgid ""
"A highly intelligent elephant who travelled as part of a circus. One dark\n"
"night, she slipped out of her chain and disappeared into Pandemonium, never to\n"
"be seen again.\n"
msgstr ""
"一头非常聪明的大象，曾随一个马戏团巡游。\n"
"有一天晚上，她挣脱了锁链，然后踏入了魔窟之中，从那以后就再也没有人见过她。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:nergalle"
msgid ""
"A shrewd and wizened orc who has devoted her life to chronicling the bloody\n"
"history of her people. She claims to know the names and deeds of every last orc\n"
"who lost their life in their great exodus into the Dungeon, and even if this is\n"
"a lie, she nonetheless seems to be on a first-name basis with many of them.\n"
"\n"
"More than any other orc still breathing, she knows the blood and sacrifice it\n"
"took to make this place a refuge for her kind. She will not brook it being\n"
"intruded upon by anyone - least of all you.\n"
msgstr "一位精明而苍老的兽人，毕生致力于记录族人的血腥历史。她自称记得每一位在兽人迁入地下城的大迁徙中丧生者的姓名与事迹。即使这并非实话，她与其中许多亡者也确实像是老相识。\n\n比起任何仍在呼吸的兽人，她更清楚为了使此地成为族人避难所，曾付出多少鲜血和牺牲。她不会容忍任何人入侵这里，尤其是你。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:nessos"
msgid ""
"A centaur warrior, skilled at warfare and deceit. They slew a mighty hydra, and\n"
"now its deadly blood drips, still-fuming, from their arrows.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个半人马战士，擅长作战和诈术。\n"
"他曾杀死过一只强大的海德拉，现在它的致命血液从箭上滴落，仍在冒烟。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:nikola"
msgid ""
"A brilliant scientist obsessed with electricity. In his attempts to perfect his\n"
"electric golem, he was involved in a terrible accident, and now phases in and\n"
"out of reality.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个对电异常狂热的天才科学家。他在尝试改进他的电魔像时卷入一场可怕的事故，\n"
"因此现在时不时地进入或脱离现实。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:norris"
msgid ""
"A relaxed water cultist with a healthy tan and a soothing voice. He\n"
"doesn't really care if it is you or he who dies — “both” would probably be the\n"
"best option.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个从容的水教徒，有着健康的棕褐色皮肤和舒缓的声音。\n"
"他并不在乎是你死还是他死——也许“同归于尽”才是最好的选择。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:pargi"
msgid "An unusually weak troll.\n"
msgstr "一个异常虚弱的巨魔。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:parghit"
msgid ""
"An unusually strong troll, his thick frame scarred by many against-the-odds\n"
"victories. He has been wounded so many times that his body has adapted, and now\n"
"heals almost instantly. His necklace of troll claws is a memento of those who\n"
"underestimated him.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个异常强壮的巨魔，他壮硕的身躯上有许多恶战后留下的伤痕。\n"
"他受过很多次伤，身体已经适应了，现在伤口几乎能瞬间愈合。\n"
"他的巨魔爪项链会是那些低估他的人的纪念。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:pikel"
msgid ""
"A wise kobold would fear the forces of Hell, and certainly would not set up a\n"
"highly lucrative transdimensional trade in damned souls. But Pikel is better\n"
"known for his whip than his wisdom, mercilessly tormenting his piteous charges\n"
"as he ferries them to their buyers.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个聪明的狗头人会畏惧地狱的力量，绝不会进行暴利、跨维度的该死的灵魂贸易。\n"
"但皮克尔更为人所知的是他的鞭子，而不是他的智慧，\n"
"当他把他的可怜的奴隶运送给他们的买家时，他无情地折磨着他们。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:polyphemus"
msgid ""
"A cyclops shepherd, he is very protective of his charges, whom he watches with\n"
"an undying fervor through his single massive eye. Nevertheless, he won't\n"
"hesitate to use them as projectiles in a pinch; after all, the best defence is\n"
"a good offence.\n"
msgstr "这个独眼巨人牧羊人，非常爱惜自己的牲畜，\n他用那只透露着永恒热情的巨大的眼睛注视着它们。\n尽管如此，在紧要关头，他还是会毫不犹豫地将它们当作投射物；\n毕竟，最好的防守就是好的进攻。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:prince ribbit"
msgid "A frog of unusual size, with a tiny crown perched incongruously atop his head.\n"
msgstr "一只个头不同寻常的青蛙，头上戴着个小王冠，显得很不协调。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:robin"
msgid ""
"A mountain hobgoblin, recently come in search of the legendary Orb. Not\n"
"foolhardy or reckless enough to delve into the depths of the Dungeon alone,\n"
"Robin has built a small army of minions. Potential competitors will quickly\n"
"find a stream of screaming goblins flying toward them!\n"
msgstr "一位山地大地精，最近来到地下城寻找传说中的宝珠。罗宾还没鲁莽到独自深入地下城，而是集结了一小支随从军队。潜在竞争者很快就会发现，一串尖叫着的地精正朝自己飞来！\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:roxanne"
msgid ""
"A strikingly realistic sapphire statue of a famous earth mage who disappeared\n"
"after a catastrophic mishap with a magical talisman.\n"
msgstr "一尊极其逼真的蓝宝石雕像，雕的是一位著名土系法师。她在使用魔法变形护符时遭遇灾难性事故，此后失踪。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:rupert"
msgid ""
"Rippling muscles, glistening pecs, incredible glutes - Rupert is the peak of\n"
"physical perfection. Even so, his roars seem louder than even his fantastic form\n"
"can explain. Perhaps he holds some talisman that lends supernatural force to his\n"
"bellows?\n"
msgstr ""
"起伏的肌肉、闪亮的胸肌、巨大的臀肌——鲁珀特达到了完美肉体的巅峰。\n"
"即便如此，他的咆哮似乎比以他那种奇异体形所能吼出的还要响亮。\n"
"也许，正是他持有的某个符咒，给他的吼叫带来了超自然的力量？\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:saint roka"
msgid "A mighty warlord. Some orcs even say they are the Chosen One of Beogh.\n"
msgstr "一位强大的将军。有些兽人甚至说他就是被比欧弗选中的人。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:sigmund"
msgid ""
"The elder of a pair of brothers who came for the Orb. No one knows what Sigmund\n"
"saw in the dungeon to drive him mad, but his shrewd magical tactics and wicked\n"
"scythe now leave little time for his victims to wonder. Despite his reputation\n"
"as a vicious murderer, his grandiose and dramatic ways have earned him the\n"
"admiration of many denizens of the dungeon.\n"
msgstr "他是为宝珠而来的一对兄弟中的哥哥。\n没人知道西格蒙德在地下城里看到了什么因而发疯，\n但他狡猾的魔法战术和厉害的镰刀现在可没有留给让他的受害者好奇的时间。\n尽管他有恶毒的凶手的名声，但他浮夸而戏剧化的手法赢得了许多地下城居民的赞叹。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:snorg"
msgid ""
"A particularly corpulent troll with a short temper and a sizable gut.\n"
"Uninterested in the Orb, Snorg delights in the endless parade of adventurers –\n"
"that is, easy meals — it attracts.\n"
msgstr "一只格外肥胖、脾气暴躁、肚腹巨大的巨魔。斯诺格对宝珠本身不感兴趣，却很喜欢它不断引来的冒险者——也就是唾手可得的美餐。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:sojobo"
msgid ""
"Queen of the tengu, with legendary skill in swordsmanship, tactics, and magic.\n"
"Storytellers claim she once trapped a raging tempest in a bottle and kept it\n"
"as a talisman.\n"
msgstr ""
"天狗女王，其剑术、谋略和魔法出神入化。\n"
"讲故事的人说，她曾把一场强烈的风暴捕获在一个瓶子里，并把它当作符咒保存着。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:sonja"
msgid ""
"A graceful kobold assassin. Admire her graceful pirouettes, thrill at her\n"
"daring leaps! But watch out for her knives!\n"
msgstr ""
"一位优雅的狗头人刺客。欣赏她优雅的旋转吧，因她那大胆的跳跃而震颤吧！\n"
"但要小心她的刀！\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:terence"
msgid ""
"A veteran of a war against the armataurs' elephant-riders. He has recently\n"
"retired to make a new home in the dungeon.\n"
msgstr "一位曾与犰狳人象骑兵交战的老兵。最近退休，来到地下城安置新家。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:tiamat"
msgid ""
"The earthly avatar of Tiamat, deity of dragonkind, here incarnated as a mighty\n"
"draconian warrior. Her scales seem to shimmer and change colour as you watch.\n"
msgstr ""
"提亚玛特的现世化身，龙族的神，在这里具现为强大的龙人战士。\n"
"当你观察她时，她的鳞片似乎会闪耀并变幻颜色。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:urug"
msgid ""
"A coarse and lanky orc. Urug lost her eye in a fight with a harpy, and has\n"
"sworn to slay every last one of them. Unfortunately, the vision in her\n"
"remaining eye is not very good, and she has mistaken you for one.\n"
"{{\n"
"    if you.can_smell() then\n"
"        return \"She smells terrible.\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"
msgstr "一个身形粗犷、瘦长的兽人。\n乌鲁格在与哈耳庇厄的战斗中失去了一只眼睛，因此发誓要把世上的哈耳庇厄全部杀光。\n不幸的是，由于她剩下的一只眼视力不太好，她把你当成了哈耳庇厄。\n{{\n    if you.can_smell() then\n        return \"她很难闻。\"\n    end\n}}\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:vashnia"
msgid ""
"An elite marksnaga who leads a skilled team of sharpshooters. She is\n"
"particularly skilled in translocation magic.\n"
msgstr "一个领导着神射手团队的精英射手纳迦。她特别擅长移位魔法。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:vv"
msgid ""
"One of the Stoneborn, formed untold aeons ago with supreme command over rock.\n"
"Her people shelter deep within the living earth, so whatever has forced Vv\n"
"into the oppressive openness of the Dungeon must be dire indeed. But whatever\n"
"it is, she's not talking...\n"
msgstr "石裔之一，形成于不可计数的远古岁月，对岩石拥有至高掌控力。她的族人栖居于活体大地深处；能把薇薇逼到地下城这片令人压抑的空旷地带的事，必定极其可怕。不过，无论是什么，她都不肯说……\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:xtahua"
msgid "An ancient and mighty dragon.\n"
msgstr "一条强大的古龙。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:zenata"
msgid ""
"A master weaponsmith, her flesh melding into steel so smoothly that it's hard to\n"
"tell where one ends and the other begins. She entered the Dungeon to search for\n"
"the secrets of an ancient, long-suppressed cult, said to have exalted metal over\n"
"flesh. The price of knowledge was her humanity - a price she paid eagerly.\n"
msgstr "一位武器锻造大师，她的身体与钢铁融为一体，\n以至于很难分清哪块是肉，哪块是钢铁。\n她进入地下城是为了探寻一个古老的、长期被压制的邪教的秘密，\n据说这个邪教推崇金属胜于肉体。知识的代价是她的人性——这是她热切付出的代价。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:serpent of hell gehenna"
msgid ""
"A huge, red-glowing, three-headed dragon, shrouded in damnation. It is\n"
"possessed by the very essence of Gehenna and its eternal fire.\n"
msgstr "一条巨大的、发出红光的三头龙，笼罩在天谴之中。\n它被欣嫩谷的实质及其永恒之火所缠绕。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:serpent of hell cocytus"
msgid ""
"A massive white three-headed dragon, covered with shards of gleaming ice,\n"
"wholly possessed by the nightmarish cold of Cocytus.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条巨大的白色三头龙，覆有锃亮的冰块碎片，\n"
"完全被悲叹河那噩梦般的寒冷所附着。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:serpent of hell dis"
msgid ""
"A towering three-headed beast with an army's worth of swords for teeth. Each of\n"
"its scales is a shield with a razored edge.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个极高大的三头野兽，有着军队的利剑一般的牙齿。\n"
"它的每个鳞片都是边缘锋利的盾牌。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:serpent of hell tartarus"
msgid ""
"Seemingly three pairs of lurid magenta eyes hanging in the darkness, the\n"
"outline of a vast, sinuous dragon is just barely perceptible behind. Its malice\n"
"is palpable.\n"
msgstr ""
"黑暗中似乎悬着三双可怕的洋红色眼睛，后面一条蜿蜒的巨龙轮廓隐约可见。\n"
"其恶意昭然若揭。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:acid blob"
msgid "A lump of sickly pustulent flesh, dripping with lethal acid.\n"
msgstr "一坨长满肉瘤的恶心肉块，上面不断有致命的强酸滴落下来。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:acid dragon"
msgid ""
"A small dragon with brilliant yellow scales, its mouth dripping with\n"
"corrosive slime.\n"
msgstr "一条具有亮黄色鳞甲的小型龙，嘴上滴着腐蚀性的黏液。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:adder"
msgid ""
"A common dungeon snake, a species of troglodytic reptile commonly found in\n"
"subterranean spaces.\n"
msgstr "一条普通的地下城蛇，它是一种在地下常见的穴居爬行类动物。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:air elemental"
msgid ""
"A spirit drawn from the elemental plane of air. It exists in this world as a\n"
"lightning-spitting spirit, stunning foes with its crackling bursts.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个来自气元素位面的灵体。它以爆出闪电的灵体的形态存在于这个世界上，\n"
"以噼啪的爆裂声震慑敌人。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:alligator"
msgid "An aggressive crocodilian with great crunching jaws full of sharp teeth.\n"
msgstr "一条攻击性很强的鳄鱼，有着巨大、嘎吱作声的嘴，上面长满了锋利的牙齿。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:alligator snapping turtle"
msgid ""
"A particularly large and nasty snapping turtle. Like its smaller relative, it\n"
"can reach out and bite from afar.\n"
msgstr "一个特别巨大、危险的鳄龟。和它较小的亲缘物种一样，它也能从远处伸过来咬。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:anaconda"
msgid ""
"A very large snake that moves with startling swiftness. It kills not by poison\n"
"but by constricting its prey.\n"
msgstr "一条非常大的蛇，移动速度惊人。它不是通过毒液而是通过束缚猎物进行猎杀。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ancestor"
msgid ""
"A humanoid construct of insubstantial memory, floating through the air. Though\n"
"perhaps somewhat changed in shape and bearing few discernable features, still\n"
"they seem somehow to resemble a warrior from the distantly remembered past.\n"
"The memory and the memorialist fight in concert, each able to fire past the\n"
"other.\n"
msgstr "一个由无实体记忆构成的人形造物，漂浮在空中。虽然外形或许有些改变，且少有可辨特征，仍依稀像一位来自遥远记忆的战士。记忆与追忆者并肩作战，双方都能让投射物穿过彼此。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ancient champion"
msgid ""
"An unfathomably ancient skeleton. It has hundreds of golden sigils etched onto\n"
"its bones, and pulses with terrible, unholy power.\n"
msgstr ""
"一具不可名状的远古骷髅。\n"
"它的骨头上刻有数百个金色印记，脉动着可怕的邪恶力量。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ancient lich"
msgid ""
"A lich who, having existed for countless centuries, has grown almost\n"
"unimaginably powerful through the study of dark magic.\n"
msgstr "一个存在了无数个世纪的巫妖，通过研究黑魔法，强大得难以想象。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ancient zyme"
msgid ""
"A nexus of sentient cancer and disease, borne aloft perhaps by malice alone.\n"
"Its nature inflicts withering illness on all living beings in its presence.\n"
msgstr "一个有意识的肿瘤与疾病的汇聚体，也许仅凭恶意便悬浮空中。它的本质会使周围所有活物染上衰竭的疾病。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:angel"
msgid ""
"A divine warrior of the Shining One. It is a towering winged figure of\n"
"unnatural beauty surrounded by an aura of brilliant white light.\n"
msgstr "光明神的神圣战士。它身形高大、背生双翼，拥有超凡之美，周围环绕着明亮白光。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:armour echo"
msgid ""
"The sweat and toil of the armourer working leather and steel infuses an\n"
"intention into their creation, a unique spark within every cuirass, pauldron and\n"
"vambrace. A skilled forgewright can manifest these intentions in physical form,\n"
"allowing their armour to protect its wearer in a more aggressive fashion than\n"
"armour customarily does.\n"
msgstr "制甲匠加工皮革与钢铁时付出的汗水和辛劳，会在造物中留下意念，每件胸甲、护肩和臂甲中都有一簇独特火花。熟练的锻造师能将这些意念化为实体，让防具以比通常更主动的方式保护穿戴者。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:apis"
msgid ""
"A placid, sacred bull of Elyvilon. Its status as an exalted envoy of the Healer\n"
"lets its very presence double the health of its allies.\n"
msgstr "艾利维隆的一头温顺圣牛。作为治愈者的尊贵使者，它仅仅在场，就能使盟友的生命翻倍。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:apocalypse crab"
msgid ""
"An opalescent crab with jet black eyes, and chaotic mists effusing from its\n"
"mandibles. Rumours claim that this species is waiting for the end of time.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个乳白色的螃蟹，长有黑玉般的眼睛，口器散发着迷雾。\n"
"传言称，这个物种在等待着时间的终结。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:arcanist"
msgid ""
"A wizard fond of spectacle and destruction. They scorn the cowardice of other\n"
"magicians, who hide from their foes rather than simply blasting them out of\n"
"existence.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个喜欢精彩场面和破坏的巫师。\n"
"他们蔑视那些躲着敌人、而不是随手将其炸飞的懦弱的魔法师。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:aspiring flesh"
msgid ""
"The divided and churning remains of a protean progenitor, striving desperately\n"
"for form. Whatever they become, the last of their progenitor's power ensure it\n"
"will be stronger and swifter than any such creature found elsewhere in the\n"
"dungeon.\n"
msgstr "一个万变始祖的分裂、搅动的遗骸，竭力变化着形态。无论它们变成什么，\n它们祖先的最后力量将确保它比任何在地下城其他地方碰到的那种生物更强、更快。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:azure jelly"
msgid ""
"An extremely cold blob of bright blue cytoplasm, forming bits of frost in the\n"
"air around it.\n"
msgstr "一团极冷的亮蓝色细胞质，它周围的空气都结成了冰霜。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ball lightning"
msgid ""
"A swift sphere of coruscating electrical energy. It will explode at the\n"
"slightest disturbance.\n"
msgstr "一个迅捷、发光的电能球体。即使是最轻微的扰动也会使它爆炸。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ball python"
msgid "A small snake that can augment its bite by constricting small creatures.\n"
msgstr "一条小蛇，除了咬击，还能缠绕小型生物。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ballistomycete"
msgid ""
"A lumpy reddish fungus covered in knobbly rhizome growths, growing well in the\n"
"dank underground dungeon. When it senses a threat, the ballistomycete may\n"
"release a deadly floating spore that explodes on its victims.\n"
msgstr "一种块状淡红色真菌，覆有多节的根瘤，在阴湿的地下城中生长良好。\n当它受到威胁时，可能会产生飘浮着的致命孢子，这会在受害者身上爆炸。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ballistomycete spore"
msgid ""
"A fast, gas-filled floating spore released by a ballistomycete when it senses a\n"
"threat. After seeking out its foe, the spore will explode, damaging anything\n"
"caught in the blast and further confusing living creatures.\n"
msgstr "弹道真菌感到威胁时放出的快速、充满气体的漂浮孢子。找到敌人后，孢子便会爆炸，伤害波及的一切，并进一步使活物混乱。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:balrug"
msgid "A huge and very powerful demon, wreathed in fire and shadows.\n"
msgstr "一个巨大且强力的恶魔，身体被环绕在火焰与阴影之中。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:barachi"
msgid "An amphibious humanoid with a very ugly attitude.\n"
msgstr "一种两栖人形生物，态度十分恶劣。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:basilisk"
msgid "A crested lizard of middling size with a terrible petrifying gaze.\n"
msgstr "一个中等大小、有羽冠的蜥蜴，有着可怕的石化凝视。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:bat"
msgid ""
"A large grey bat that, despite being herbivorous, is quite aggressive. It is\n"
"myopic and uses echolocation to navigate.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只大型灰色蝙蝠，虽然是食草动物，但攻击性却很强。\n"
"它的视力很差，要靠回声来定位。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:battlemage"
msgid ""
"A humanoid construct of insubstantial memory, floating through the air. Though\n"
"perhaps somewhat changed in shape and bearing few discernable features, still\n"
"it seems somehow to resemble a warrior from the distantly remembered past,\n"
"skilled with both conjurations and melee combat.\n"
msgstr "一个由无实体记忆构成的人形造物，漂浮在空中。虽然外形或许有些改变，且少有可辨特征，仍依稀像一位来自遥远记忆、兼擅塑能系魔法与近战的战士。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:battlesphere"
msgid ""
"A small globe of destructive energy. Each time its creator casts an offensive\n"
"spell, it will launch a magical barrage at the most injured nearby foe it can\n"
"reach.\n"
msgstr "一个由破坏能量构成的小球。创造者每次施放进攻法术时，它都会向附近可攻击到、受伤最重的敌人发起魔法弹幕。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:bennu"
msgid ""
"A sacred, self-created sunbird, representative of rebirth. It has ascended\n"
"past the cycles of life and death, and calls upon aspects of both, rising forth\n"
"from death in a burst of unholy flame.\n"
msgstr "一只神圣、自我诞生的太阳鸟，象征重生。它超越了生死轮回，能同时调用生与死的力量，在污秽烈焰的爆发中死而复生。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:black bear"
msgid "A small black bear. Like all ursines, it will become enraged if badly hurt.\n"
msgstr "一头小型黑熊。和所有其他熊类一样，它会在受重伤时会变得狂暴。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:black draconian"
msgid "A muscular black-scaled humanoid with a reptilian tail and powerful wings.\n"
msgstr "一个肌肉发达、长有黑色鳞片的人形生物，有着爬行动物的尾巴和有力的翅膀。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:black mamba"
msgid "An astonishingly fast tropical snake whose bite bears a deadly venom.\n"
msgstr "一条疾速的热带蛇，它的咬带有致命的毒液。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:blazeheart core"
msgid ""
"The exposed elemental core of a blazeheart golem. Far too unstable to remain\n"
"without its shell, it is in the process of violently exploding.\n"
msgstr "焰心魔像裸露的元素核心。离开外壳后，它极不稳定，正在猛烈爆炸。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:blazeheart golem"
msgid ""
"A volatile elemental spark encased in a shell of slag iron. If destroyed while\n"
"its fires still blaze, the exposed core will violently detonate a moment later.\n"
msgstr ""
"它的渣铁外壳包裹着不稳定的元素火花。\n"
"如果它在其火焰仍在燃烧时被摧毁，暴露的核心将在片刻后剧烈爆炸。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:blink frog"
msgid ""
"A species of frog that possesses the ability to blink at will. It can blink\n"
"itself close to its intended prey, or blink away to escape harm. It is commonly\n"
"found in packs.\n"
msgstr ""
"一种能自行闪现的大型蛙。\n"
"它既可以通过闪现来接近猎物，也可以利用闪现来逃脱伤害。这种蛙经常成群行动。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:blizzard demon"
msgid "A greater demon formed from wistful snow and bitter lightning.\n"
msgstr "一只由惆怅的雪与酷烈闪电凝成的高阶恶魔。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:bloated husk"
msgid ""
"A decaying undead corpse. When it reaches a victim (or if it's destroyed first),\n"
"the gases trapped inside it are released and create a large, violent\n"
"concussive blast.\n"
msgstr ""
"一具腐烂的亡灵尸体。当它靠近受害者（或者如果它在此之前就被摧毁）时，\n"
"里面的气体被释放，并产生巨大、猛烈的冲击波。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:block of ice"
msgid "A block of ice shaped like a statue, but worked by no living hands.\n"
msgstr "这块冰像个雕塑，但并非人工所造。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:bog body"
msgid ""
"An undead figure preserved by the brackish waters of a bog, and reanimated by\n"
"some unknown magic.\n"
msgstr "一个亡灵生物，被沼泽的咸水所保存，并被某种未知的魔法复活。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:boggart"
msgid ""
"A malevolent and dangerous little sprite. The shadowy illusions it summons may\n"
"not be real, but are deadly all the same.\n"
msgstr "一个邪恶又危险的小妖精。它能够召唤阴影幻象，虽然并非真实，但同样致命。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:bombardier beetle"
msgid ""
"An unassuming beetle filled with an incredible amount of hypergolic fluid. The\n"
"sticky spray it fires is capable of igniting predators and unwary adventurers\n"
"alike, though more experienced ones know to keep moving if they wish to avoid\n"
"a fiery grave.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只不起眼的甲虫，它的体内充满了大量的自燃液体。\n"
"它喷出的粘性喷雾能点燃捕食者和粗心的冒险者，\n"
"而更有经验的人知道，如果想要逃离这个火焰坟墓，最好继续前进。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:bone dragon"
msgid ""
"A mighty undead abomination, pieced together from the broken bones of many\n"
"dragons by powerful necromantic magic. The collective despair of such\n"
"desecrated dragons gives this horror its own undying breath weapon, in\n"
"billowing clouds of excruciating misery.\n"
msgstr "一个由强大死灵魔法将众多龙的碎骨拼成的强大亡灵怪物。被亵渎之龙共同的绝望，赋予它不朽的吐息武器：翻滚的云雾，带来难以忍受的痛苦。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:gnoll bouda"
msgid ""
"A gnoll witch possessed by a spirit of spite which flashes out from behind\n"
"their eyes. Its strange chants and ululations send other gnolls into a wild\n"
"frenzy.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个被怨灵附身的豺狼人女巫，怨灵在其眼后闪现。\n"
"它那奇怪的吟唱和呼喊能让其他豺狼人陷入疯狂。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:boulder"
msgid "A mass of fast-rolling stone, crushing everything in its path.\n"
msgstr "一个快速滚动的石头，碾碎沿途的一切。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:boulder beetle"
msgid ""
"A grey beetle with an almost impenetrable rocky carapace. When at some distance\n"
"from its foe, a boulder beetle is capable of rolling at high speed, attempting\n"
"to crash into its target for heavy damage.\n"
msgstr "一个灰色甲虫，有着几乎无法穿透的岩石外壳。\n当与敌人有一定距离时，巨石甲虫会高速滚动，试图撞向目标以造成严重伤害。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:bound soul"
msgid ""
"The soul of a living, holy, or demonic creature, captured by a dark sacrifice\n"
"to Yredelemnul. The bound soul will follow its captor through stairs and come\n"
"when recalled from a different level.\n"
msgstr "一个活物、神圣生物或恶魔的灵魂，被献给伊莱德莱姆努尔的黑暗祭仪俘获。受缚灵魂会随捕获者上下楼，也能从其他楼层应召而来。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:brain worm"
msgid ""
"A slimy fluorescent worm with a greatly distended head. This creature feeds on\n"
"others' intellect as it squirms through unworldly grime.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条黏滑的荧光蠕虫，长有极度膨胀的头部。\n"
"这个生物在超凡的尘垢中蠕动，以他人的智力为食。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:briar patch"
msgid ""
"A tangled cluster of thorny briars, sharp enough to pierce thick hide and\n"
"armour. Although stationary, its branches are possessed with a will of their\n"
"own. They move to allow magic and missiles fired by those friendly to this\n"
"plant to pass through unaffected.\n"
msgstr "一丛缠绕的带刺荆棘，锋利得足以刺穿厚皮和防具。\n它尽管静止不动，但却有着自己的意志。\n他们会进行摆动，让那些对这种植物友好的人所发射的魔法和投射物不受影响地穿过。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:brimstone fiend"
msgid ""
"A huge and powerful demon wreathed in damnation, with great scaly wings. It is\n"
"one of the most fearsome denizens of any of the Hells.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个巨大且强力的恶魔，身体被环绕在天谴之中，还长有巨大的鳞翼。\n"
"这是地狱中最可怕的物种之一。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:broodmother"
msgid ""
"A giant spider swollen with eggs. Its innumerable offspring are always at its\n"
"call.\n"
msgstr "一只鼓满卵的巨型蜘蛛。它的无数孩子会永远听从其召唤。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:burial acolyte"
msgid ""
"A masked priest in the service of Kikubaaqudgha, well-versed in choral rituals\n"
"to both rouse the dead and send them to eternal rest.\n"
msgstr "一位服侍奇库巴库哈的蒙面祭司，精通唤醒死者和使其永远安息的合唱仪式。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:bush"
msgid ""
"A woody plant. It looks dry enough to be easily set on fire, and its foliage is\n"
"not very dense, permitting both magic and missiles to pass through unaffected.\n"
"However, it is firmly rooted, and requires significant effort to destroy.\n"
msgstr "一株木本植物。它看起来并不潮湿，可以轻易被火点燃，它的枝叶也并不茂密，\n魔法和投射物也能不受影响地穿过。但它的根基却非常扎实，破坏它可得费一番力气。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:bullfrog"
msgid ""
"An unusually aggressive amphibian that pursues its prey with rapid hops.\n"
"Its croak is loud and distinctive, but unlike its smaller counterparts above\n"
"ground, the dungeon bullfrog is as large as it sounds.\n"
msgstr "一个攻击性极强的两栖动物，快速跳跃，追捕猎物。它的叫声响亮而独特，\n但与地面上较小的的亲缘特种不同，地下城牛蛙的体形与其声音一样大。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:bunyip"
msgid ""
"A flesh-eating beast that uses its limbs and tail interchangeably. It moves\n"
"with alarming speed, but must pause to reorganise itself after each attack.\n"
"Its distinctive screams carry far and wide.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个食肉动物，交替使用肢体和尾巴。它能以惊人的速度移动，\n"
"但每次攻击后都必须停下来重新调整自己。它独特的尖叫声能传得很远很远。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:butterfly"
msgid ""
"A large, brightly coloured butterfly with beautifully patterned wings,\n"
"fluttering incongruously through the darkness of the cave.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只亮丽的大蝴蝶，翅膀上有着漂亮的图案，\n"
"它飞舞的身影在这黑暗的洞窟中显得很不协调。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:cactus giant"
msgid ""
"A green-skinned, spiny colossus, with a hearty barrel chest and a thirst for\n"
"battle. Any foe that strikes it in melee will be lucky to live to regret it.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个绿色皮肤、多刺的巨人，有着健壮的桶状胸脯，对战斗充满了渴望。\n"
"任何在近战中攻击他的敌人都会庆幸还能活着后悔。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:cacodemon"
msgid ""
"A maniacal demon, brimming with accursed power. Its gleeful laughter rarely\n"
"ceases, even in the heat of battle.\n"
msgstr "一只疯癫的恶魔，体内充满诅咒之力。即使激战正酣，它欢快的笑声也很少停歇。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:cane toad"
msgid ""
"A hideous toad whose thick, warty hide is covered in poison glands. Unlike its\n"
"smaller above-ground relatives, this dungeon-dweller is the size of a wolf.\n"
msgstr "一个丑陋的蟾蜍，其厚而多疣的皮上长满了毒腺。\n与地面上较小的亲缘特种不同，这只地下城物种有狼那么大。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:catoblepas"
msgid ""
"A sluggish black buffalo, its hide encrusted with dull scales. It carries its\n"
"hog-like head just above the ground, protected by a stiff mane of bristles.\n"
"Its fearsome breath turns flesh into stone.\n"
msgstr ""
"一头行动迟缓的黑色野牛，它的皮上覆有一层暗色的鳞片。\n"
"它那像猪一样的头刚刚高出地面，被坚硬的鬃毛保护着。\n"
"它那可怕的吐息会把肉体变成石头。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:caustic shrike"
msgid ""
"A swift, nightmarish bird whose razor-sharp metallic feathers drip with\n"
"corrosive acid.\n"
msgstr "一个轻盈、噩梦般的⻦。它那锋利的金属般的羽毛滴着腐蚀性的酸。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:centaur"
msgid ""
"A hybrid with the torso of a human atop the body of a horse. It is highly\n"
"skilled in archery.\n"
msgstr "一个混种生物，在马的身体上有着人的躯干。其箭术很高超。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:centaur warrior"
msgid ""
"A muscular centaur, veteran of numerous battles, armed with well-made weapons\n"
"and able to use them skilfully.\n"
msgstr "一个肌肉发达的半人马，身经百战，装备着精良的武器，能够熟练地使用它们。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:cerulean imp"
msgid ""
"A small, wilful minor demon. Its wings, far larger than its scrawny body, were\n"
"made to soar, and it lands only rarely and with the greatest reluctance.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个矮小、任性的低阶恶魔。它的翅膀比它那瘦骨嶙峋的身体要大得多，\n"
"生来就是为了飞翔。它也很少、很不情愿着陆。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:chaos spawn"
msgid ""
"A being of pure chaos, its form is constantly shifting, growing and then losing\n"
"eyes, mouths, claws and tentacles. It corrupts everything it touches.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个由纯粹的混沌构成的存在，其形态在不断变化，\n"
"眼睛、嘴巴、爪子和触手不断在它的身体上长出来，随后又会消失。\n"
"被它碰到的东西都会遭到腐蚀。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:cherub"
msgid ""
"A throne-bearer of the gods, whose head is beset by four faces: one of a man,\n"
"one of an ox, one of a lion, one of an eagle. It is one of the angelic beings\n"
"who stand before the good gods, singing eternal hymns of praise to their glory\n"
"and greatness.\n"
msgstr "诸神的宝座承载者，头上生有四张面孔：人、牛、狮、鹰各一。它是侍立于善神面前的天使之一，永恒地吟唱赞颂祂们荣耀与伟大的圣歌。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:creeping inferno"
msgid ""
"A formless mass of ancient fire, bound by heat and malevolence. It longs to\n"
"unleash itself as a wild fire storm, yet must first patiently burn towards its\n"
"victims with implaceable inevitability.\n"
msgstr "一团由热量和恶意束成的无形古火。它渴望化为狂烈的火焰风暴，却必须先耐心地、不可阻挡地向受害者一路焚烧前进。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:crimson imp"
msgid ""
"A small, ugly minor demon. Its fanged maw seems locked in a permanent malign\n"
"grin, and its horns protrude obscenely from its scaly pate.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个矮小、丑陋的低阶恶魔。它那长满尖牙的嘴似乎永远保持着一副恶意的咧嘴笑，\n"
"它的角从有鳞的脑袋里可憎地突出来。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:crocodile"
msgid "A crocodilian with powerful jaws.\n"
msgstr "一条有着强力嘴巴的鳄鱼。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:crystal echidna"
msgid ""
"A spiny, long snouted rodent grown out of pure living crystal. It is\n"
"immune to most forms of magic and hurls both crystallising shots and painful\n"
"barbs.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个由纯净的活性水晶生成的多刺、长鼻啮齿动物。\n"
"它对大多数形式的魔法免疫，并且会投掷水晶箭和令人疼痛的倒钩。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:crystal guardian"
msgid ""
"An intricate animated statue made of heavily ensorcelled crystal that is\n"
"immune to most forms of magic. The spells which created it are so powerful\n"
"that even flesh may start to crystallise around any fragments that become\n"
"embedded in it - leaving its foes brittle and vulnerable.\n"
msgstr "一尊精巧的活动雕像，由强力附魔水晶制成，免疫大多数魔法。塑造它的法术极其强大，连血肉都会在嵌入的水晶碎片周围开始结晶，使敌人脆弱易伤。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:culicivora"
msgid ""
"A small spider with rudimentary healing abilities. Though not undead, it packs\n"
"a nasty vampiric bite.\n"
msgstr "一个有着基础治疗能力的小蜘蛛。虽然不是亡灵，但它会造成吸血鬼那样的咬伤。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:curse skull"
msgid ""
"A charred skull floating in the air and rotating slowly. Mystic symbols are\n"
"carved into its blackened surface.\n"
msgstr "一个烧焦的头骨，浮在空中慢慢旋转着。神秘的符号刻在它焦黑的表面上。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:curse toe"
msgid ""
"A disembodied toe, hanging in the air and radiating an intense field of\n"
"negative energy.\n"
msgstr "一个脱离躯体的脚趾浮在空中，在周围形成了一个致密的负能量场。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:cyclops"
msgid ""
"A giant with one eye in the centre of its forehead. Despite its lack of\n"
"binocular vision, it is able to throw boulders with fearsome accuracy.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个巨人的额头正中长着一只眼睛。\n"
"虽然独眼巨人只有一只眼视物，但他投出的石块命中率却很高。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:daeva"
msgid ""
"A towering winged figure radiating an aura of brilliant golden light. It is a\n"
"divine agent of the Shining One.\n"
msgstr "一个高大、背生双翼的身影，散发着璀璨金色光环。它是光明神的神圣使者。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:dancing weapon"
msgid "A weapon enchanted to dance through the air and attack under its own power.\n"
msgstr "这把武器被施了魔法，使得它能自己在空中飞舞攻击。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:dart slug"
msgid ""
"A small invertebrate. It hunts prey considerably larger than itself by firing\n"
"chitinous darts, using a concealed air bladder to launch them with remarkable\n"
"range and power.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个小型无脊椎生物。\n"
"它能通过隐藏的气囊射出有着惊人射程和威力的壳质飞镖来猎杀比它大得多的生物。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:deathcap"
msgid ""
"A noxious and deadly fungus suffused with negative energy. While parasitic in\n"
"life, undeath has granted it the ability to absorb its nutrients directly from\n"
"the life force of others.\n"
msgstr "一种充满负能量的剧毒真菌。生前依靠寄生，化为亡灵后，则能直接从其他生物的生命力中汲取营养。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:death cob"
msgid ""
"A dreadful undead cob of maize. Look, this one was probably a mistake. We're\n"
"sorry.\n"
msgstr "一块可怕的亡灵玉米棒。瞧，这可能是个错误。我们很抱歉。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:death drake"
msgid ""
"A dark and baleful minor dragon. It breathes a lethally potent miasma from its\n"
"pestilential maw.\n"
msgstr "一条阴暗邪恶的亚龙，能从散播瘟疫的巨口中吐出致命的浓烈瘴气。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:death knight"
msgid "A warrior-priest of Yredelemnul, chanting fearful supplications to its dark god.\n"
msgstr "一个伊莱德莱姆努尔的战斗祭司，向黑暗之神吟诵着可怕的祈求。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:death scarab"
msgid ""
"A hideous swarming undead insect, exuding death and decay and feeding on the\n"
"life energies of those unfortunate enough to encounter it.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个成群涌现的可怕的亡灵昆虫，散布着死亡和腐化，\n"
"以它所遇到的不幸生物的生命能量为食。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:death yak"
msgid ""
"A larger and beefier relative of the common dungeon yak. Its little red eyes\n"
"gleam with hunger for living flesh.\n"
msgstr "这头牦牛比常见的亲缘物种地下城牦牛更大、更强。\n它红色的双眼闪烁着，仿佛在诉说对鲜肉的渴望。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:deep elf annihilator"
msgid ""
"A deep elf who exults in conjured mayhem and destruction. It is widely hated\n"
"and feared, both for the power and for the precision of its destructive magics.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个以唤起伤害和破坏为乐的地底精灵。\n"
"其毁灭魔法强大而精准，许多人对他又恨又怕。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:deep elf archer"
msgid "An experienced deep elf fighter with a penchant for ranged combat.\n"
msgstr "一个经验丰富的地底精灵战士，喜欢远程战斗。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:deep elf blademaster"
msgid ""
"A champion of the deep elves, who scorns magic and is devoted to the study of\n"
"the sword. It wields two weapons with astonishing dexterity and speed.\n"
msgstr ""
"地底精灵的勇士之一，他蔑视魔法，毕生致力于剑术。\n"
"他能以难以置信的敏捷和速度持两把武器作战。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:deep elf death mage"
msgid ""
"A deep elf surrounded by a shimmering aura of negative energy, as a result of\n"
"its practice of necromancy and life-sapping magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个地底精灵，被闪烁的负能量光环所环绕，\n"
"这是他练习死灵术和衰竭生命力的魔法的结果。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:deep elf demonologist"
msgid ""
"A deep elf who is marked heavily by long years of contact with unnatural\n"
"demonic forces and the creatures of the Abyss.\n"
msgstr "一个地底精灵，多年与违背自然的恶魔力量及深渊生物接触，已在其身上留下深刻痕迹。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:deep elf elementalist"
msgid ""
"A deep elf commanding the primal forces of the universe. It is renowned for its\n"
"ability to pin down even the most elusive foes with powerful, unavoidable magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个支配宇宙原始力量的地底精灵。即使再难以捉摸的敌人，\n"
"他也能用强大的、不可回避的魔法进行牵制和锁定，他也因此而闻名。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:deep elf high priest"
msgid ""
"An exalted servant of the ancient dark god of the deep elves, basking in\n"
"hellish death magic.\n"
msgstr "地底精灵的远古黑暗之神的一个显赫的仆从，沉浸在地狱般的死亡魔法中。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:deep elf knight"
msgid "A battle-hardened deep elf fighter.\n"
msgstr "一个身经百战的地底精灵战士。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:deep elf master archer"
msgid ""
"A deep elf archer who has devoted a lifetime to the mastery of archery,\n"
"dismissing magic as a frivolous distraction.\n"
msgstr "一个地底精灵射手，毕生致力于精通箭术，将魔法视为一种无聊的消遣。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:deep elf pyromancer"
msgid ""
"A deep elf learned in the ways of fiery magic. It is capable of casting a\n"
"wide array of scorching spells.\n"
msgstr "一个地底精灵，掌握了火系魔法。它可以施放各种灼热法术。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:deep elf sorcerer"
msgid ""
"A mighty spellcaster who draws power from the very Hells, and possesses lethal\n"
"arcane abilities.\n"
msgstr "一个强大的施法者，他从地狱中汲取力量，并有着致命的奥术能力。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:deep elf zephyrmancer"
msgid ""
"An elf with a singular focus on the magic of the air, leaving little time to\n"
"study anything else.\n"
msgstr "一个专注气系魔法的精灵，几乎无暇学习其他知识。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:deep troll"
msgid "A stooped troll with dark skin. It often travels in packs.\n"
msgstr "一个驼背的黑皮巨魔。他们经常成群出没。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:deep troll earth mage"
msgid ""
"A particularly intelligent deep troll. It uses its magic to tunnel through the\n"
"earth and ambush foes.\n"
msgstr "一个极其聪明的地底巨魔。他会运用他的魔法穿过大地伏击敌人。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:deep troll shaman"
msgid "A deep troll blessed with divine power to strengthen and hasten its kin.\n"
msgstr "一个有着圣洁法力的地底巨魔，能够强化、加速他的同类。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:demigod"
msgid "A human-like figure with an aura of power betraying its divine ancestry.\n"
msgstr "一个近似人类的身影，散发的力量气息暴露了其神圣血统。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:demonic crawler"
msgid ""
"A hellish insectoid creature, fueled by some infernal power that constantly\n"
"regrows its chitinous segments. Nothing short of a lethal blow will stop it\n"
"for long.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个地狱的昆虫类生物，由某种地狱般的力量刺激着，不断代谢着它的壳节。\n"
"除非是致命的一击，否则没有什么能长久地阻挡它。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:demonspawn"
msgid ""
"A half-mortal, half-demonic creature, with its hellish heritage asserting\n"
"itself through a certain devilish cast to its features.\n"
msgstr "一个半人半魔的生物，能从身上一些恶魔的特征看出他有来自地狱的血统。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:demonspawn blood saint"
msgid ""
"A half-mortal, half-demonic creature, radiating an intense heat. It weaves\n"
"powerful and unpredictable spells of devastation.\n"
msgstr "一个半人半魔的生物，散发着强烈的热量。他编织着强大而不可预测的毁灭咒语。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:demonspawn corrupter"
msgid ""
"A half-mortal, half-demonic creature, oozing with dark energies. It twists\n"
"space around itself, and can corrupt weapons, armour and even the very flesh of\n"
"its opponents.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个半人半魔的生物，散发着黑暗能量。\n"
"他扭曲了自身周围的空间，可以腐蚀武器、盔甲甚至对方的血肉。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:demonspawn soul scholar"
msgid ""
"A half-mortal, half-demonic creature, covered in icy blue scales. Its devotion\n"
"to the deities of death grants it great insight into the vulnerabilities and\n"
"applications of mortal souls.\n"
msgstr "一个半凡人、半恶魔的生物，覆有冰蓝色鳞片。它对死亡诸神的奉献，使其深谙凡人灵魂的弱点及用途。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:demonspawn warmonger"
msgid ""
"A half-mortal, half-demonic creature, now more beast than whatever species it\n"
"is descended from. It is devoted to martial combat, disrupting the magic of its\n"
"foes as it feasts off of endless conflict.\n"
msgstr "一个半凡人、半恶魔的生物，如今比起原本所属的种族，更像野兽。它专注武斗，以无休止的冲突为食，并干扰敌人的魔法。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:diamond obelisk"
msgid "A towering obelisk surrounded by a powerful storm.\n"
msgstr "一个高耸的方尖塔，被强大的风暴所环绕。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:dire elephant"
msgid ""
"A huge pachyderm, wilder and fiercer than normal elephants, with a very thick\n"
"hide, powerful legs, and a memory to die for.\n"
msgstr ""
"一种巨大的厚皮动物，比普通大象更加狂野和凶猛，\n"
"有着厚实的皮、有力的腿，还有可以铭记到死的记忆力。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:djinni"
msgid "An elemental spirit formed from smokeless fire.\n"
msgstr "一个由无烟火形成的元素之灵。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:oblivion hound"
msgid ""
"A demon lapdog of the queen of Tartarus, bound to hunt her enemies. The first\n"
"time a foe hears its howl, it will echo in their mind, calling nightmarish\n"
"creatures to hunt them. Those who survive have the small consolation of being\n"
"inoculated against that particular hound's howl.\n"
msgstr "塔尔塔罗斯女王豢养的恶魔猎犬，被束缚着追猎她的敌人。敌人第一次听到它的嚎叫后，声音便会在脑海回响，召来噩梦生物追杀。幸存者唯一的小小安慰，是此后不再受这同一只猎犬的嚎叫影响。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:draconian"
msgid ""
"A brown-scaled humanoid with a reptilian tail and small wings. It is yet to\n"
"develop the distinct colouring and powerful breath attack of its mature form.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个长有棕色鳞片的人形生物，有着爬行动物的尾巴和小翅膀。\n"
"他还尚未发育出成熟形态的独特色彩和强大的吐息攻击。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:draconian annihilator"
msgid ""
"A draconian that uses powerful conjurations to destroy anyone who dares to\n"
"stand in its way.\n"
msgstr "一个龙人，以强大的塑能系魔法摧毁胆敢挡路的任何敌人。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:draconian knight"
msgid ""
"A draconian protected by thick scales, skilful weapon use, and complementary\n"
"magic.\n"
msgstr "一个身上长有厚鳞片的龙人，擅长使用武器和辅助性的魔法。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:draconian monk"
msgid ""
"A draconian who has eschewed the study of weaponry and magic in order to train\n"
"in the art of unarmed combat. Its scaly fists, well-thewed legs, and mighty\n"
"tail rain down blows upon its opponents.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个龙人，为了专心修炼徒手格斗技艺，而放弃了学习武器和魔法。\n"
"他那覆有鳞片的拳头、肌肉发达的腿、有力的尾巴，如雨点般密集地砸向敌人。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:draconian scorcher"
msgid ""
"A cunning draconian who has mastered the inner secrets of the element of fire.\n"
"Its scales are sooty from years of magical pyrotechnics.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个狡猾的龙人，掌握着火元素的独特奥秘。\n"
"他的鳞片因多年的魔法烟火的施放而被熏黑。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:draconian shifter"
msgid ""
"A draconian master of the warp, who can translocate both itself and anyone else\n"
"to any place, either on this world or outside of it.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个精通空间扭曲的龙人，\n"
"他有能力将自己或是其他任何人传送到任何一个地方，包括这个世界之外。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:draconian stormcaller"
msgid ""
"A draconian deriving its thunderous powers and draconic allies from the worship\n"
"of Qazlal.\n"
msgstr "这个龙人从对卡兹拉尔的崇拜中获得雷霆般的力量和龙族盟友的协助。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:dread lich"
msgid ""
"A lich who has made terrible pacts with demonic forces to augment its dark\n"
"magic.\n"
msgstr "一个巫妖，为了增强其黑暗魔法，与恶魔力量签订了可怕的契约。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:dream sheep"
msgid ""
"A drowsy, fluffy ovine whose coat sparkles with motes of dream dust. It gathers\n"
"in herds and fills the air with dream dust, overwhelming its victims and\n"
"putting them to sleep.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只睡意朦胧、毛绒绒的绵羊，毛上闪耀着梦尘。\n"
"它们成群聚在一起，让空气中充满了梦尘。梦尘覆盖在受害者身上，使之陷入沉睡。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:drowned soul"
msgid ""
"A cold and hollow apparition of the drowned dead, chained by some lingering\n"
"attachment to the depths in which it perished. It rushes to embrace the living,\n"
"sharing the last moments of its watery fate with whatever it touches.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个冰冷、空洞的溺死者的亡灵，被某种挥之不去的情感束缚在它死去的深渊中。\n"
"它冲过去抱住生者，\n"
"要让接触到的任何人也品尝到它生命的最后一刻淹在水里的滋味。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:dryad"
msgid ""
"A spirit of nature, bound to the forest in which it resides. It is capable of\n"
"calling upon the trees to defend against incursions.\n"
msgstr "一个自然之灵，与栖息的森林紧密相连。她能够召唤树木以抵御入侵。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:dwarf"
msgid "A member of a short, sturdy mountain-dwelling folk.\n"
msgstr "一个矮小结实的山地居民。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:earth elemental"
msgid ""
"A spirit drawn from the elemental plane of earth. It exists in this world as a\n"
"sinuous stream of silt and stone, capable of smoothly flowing through solid\n"
"rock.\n"
msgstr "一个来自土元素位面的灵体，在此世界中化为蜿蜒的泥砂与石流，能够顺畅穿过坚实岩石。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:efreet"
msgid "An imposing, muscular figure engulfed in a cloud of searing flame.\n"
msgstr "一个威严而强壮的生物，全身被一团灼热的火焰裹挟着。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:eidolon"
msgid ""
"An ancient skeletal apparition, sheathed in a cloud of mist. Its form glows\n"
"white-hot with debilitating energy.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个远古的骷髅幻影，隐没于一团云雾之中。\n"
"它的身体发出白热的光，散发着衰弱能量。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:eldritch tentacle"
msgid ""
"An immense, squamous appendage of some unseen creature, dripping with ichor and\n"
"tipped with a single, terrible-looking claw.\n"
msgstr ""
"这条巨大、多鳞的肢体属于某个看不见的生物，败液从上面滴落，\n"
"在肢体的末端还长有一个骇人的爪子。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:eldritch tentacle segment"
msgid ""
"A part of an immense, squamous appendage. It thrashes and pulsates like no\n"
"other living thing.\n"
msgstr "某条巨大、多鳞的肢体的一部分。你从未见过其他活物像它这样抽打、悸动。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:electric golem"
msgid ""
"An animated figure made completely of electricity, created in some demented\n"
"wizard's experiment.\n"
msgstr "一个完全由电形成的造物，它是在某个疯狂巫师的实验中被创造出来的。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:electric eel"
msgid "A type of fish capable of generating a powerful electric field.\n"
msgstr "一种能产生强大电场的鱼。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:eleionoma"
msgid ""
"Spirits of marshes and bogs. From the cypresses and willows of the fens stems the\n"
"power of these fierce protective spirits. With the boughs and branches they flow,\n"
"emerging from trees near their foes to strike.\n"
msgstr ""
"湿地和沼泽之灵。沼地的柏树和柳树孕育出这些凶猛的守护之灵。\n"
"随枝条摆动，他们从敌人附近的树上冒出来进行攻击。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:elemental wellspring"
msgid ""
"A swirling conflux of elemental water streaming from the elemental plane into\n"
"this one, with powerful spirits and mighty floods flowing from it.\n"
msgstr "一股元素水漩流，从元素位面流到这个位面，倾泻着强大的灵体和洪流。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:elephant"
msgid ""
"A large, thick-hided pachyderm. It crushes its foes and then thrashes them with\n"
"its trunk.\n"
msgstr "一个巨大的厚皮动物。它会踩扁它的敌人，然后再用鼻子进行抽打。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:elf"
msgid "An elf, a member of an ancient fey race.\n"
msgstr "一个精灵——一个古代精类种族中的一员。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:emperor scorpion"
msgid ""
"A giant scorpion with a massive barb on its tail dripping deadly venom. It is\n"
"one of the largest arachnids known.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只巨大的蝎子，尾巴上有一个巨大的倒刺，滴着致命的毒液。\n"
"它是已知的最大的蛛形纲动物之一。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:endoplasm"
msgid ""
"A glob of grey sludge that has somehow developed a rudimentary awareness and\n"
"limited motility. It periodically draws heat from its surroundings to sustain\n"
"itself, freezing enemies unfortunate enough to be adjacent at the time.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团灰色污泥，不知何故已具备了初步的意识，有着有限的运动能力。\n"
"它周期性地从周围吸取热量，以维持自身的生存，同时冰冻附近不幸的敌人。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:entropy weaver"
msgid ""
"A gaunt humanoid with flaking, pale chitin. Its spindly limbs are capable of\n"
"startlingly quick movement and end in razor-sharp talons.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个瘦削的人形怪物，有一身苍白、蜕皮的甲壳。\n"
"其瘦长的四肢的行动极为迅速，并长有锋利的爪子。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ettin"
msgid ""
"A two-headed giant, stronger than most, and able to land devastating blows left\n"
"and right with its two huge weapons.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个长有双头的巨人，比大多数巨人都要强壮，\n"
"能够用两支巨型武器左右开弓，发动毁灭性的打击。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:executioner"
msgid ""
"A horribly powerful and swift demon, its shape obscured by a cloud of swirling\n"
"scythe-like blades.\n"
msgstr "一个极其强大、敏捷的恶魔，一团旋转的镰刀形的刀刃遮蔽了其身形。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:eye of devastation"
msgid "A huge eyeball, encased in a levitating globe of incandescent energy.\n"
msgstr "一个巨型眼球，被裹在一个飘浮、炽热的能量球之中。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:faun"
msgid ""
"A hybrid with the torso of a human atop the forelegs of a goat. It is fabled\n"
"for its ability to play with the minds of those who intrude into its domain.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个混种生物，在山羊的前腿上有着人的躯干。\n"
"传说中，他能够玩弄闯入其领地的生物的心灵。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:felid"
msgid ""
"A feline creature that has been granted sentience by magical means. It uses the\n"
"gift of speech to demand milk, treats and catnip.\n"
msgstr "这只猫科动物被魔法赋予了心智。它会利用它的语言能力索要牛奶、零食和猫薄荷。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:fenstrider witch"
msgid ""
"Followers of the ancient swamp ways, these witches rise above the muck and mire\n"
"on a pair of stilt-like chicken legs. They are masters of pain and poison.\n"
msgstr ""
"这些女巫践行着古代的沼泽道路，她们踩着一双高跷状的鸡腿越过淤泥和泥沼。\n"
"她们是痛楚和毒药大师。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:fire bat"
msgid "A bat whose leathery body burns with a hot flame.\n"
msgstr "这只蝙蝠的毛皮上燃烧着一团炽热的火焰。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:fire crab"
msgid ""
"A variety of crab prized for its brilliantly jewelled shell. The rarity of the\n"
"shells is only enhanced by its almost supernatural ability to wade through\n"
"molten lava and expel massive quantities of flames.\n"
msgstr "一种因璀璨宝石外壳而备受珍视的螃蟹。它近乎超自然地能够跋涉熔岩、喷出大量火焰，这让能取得的甲壳更加稀少。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:fire dragon"
msgid ""
"A great reptilian beast with powerful claws on its limbs, covered in thick\n"
"red scales and with two huge bat-like wings. Little trails of smoke spill\n"
"from its toothy maw.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条巨大的爬行类野兽，四肢上有强力的爪子，覆盖着厚厚的红色鳞片，\n"
"长有两只巨大的蝠翼形翅膀。它那长满利牙的口中冒出几缕烟雾。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:fire elemental"
msgid ""
"A spirit drawn from the elemental plane of fire, which exists in this world as\n"
"a brilliant column of raging flames.\n"
msgstr "一个来自火元素位面的灵体，它以一柱熊熊的火焰的形态存在于这个世界上。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:fire giant"
msgid ""
"A giant with obsidian skin and a wild mane of glowing red hair, holding aloft a\n"
"fiery sword. Fire giants believe that they are destined to unite and burn the\n"
"entire world to cinders.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个巨人，有着黑曜石皮肤和狂野、浓密的炽红色头发，高举着一把燃烧着的剑。\n"
"火巨人相信他们终将联合起来，要把整个世界烧成灰烬。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:fire vortex"
msgid "A swirling cloud of flame. After striking a foe, it disintegrates.\n"
msgstr "一团旋转的火焰云。击中敌人后，它会解体。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:flayed ghost"
msgid ""
"A hideous floating undead creature, the anguished spirit of a tortured victim,\n"
"with torn skin hanging from an emaciated body. It restlessly stalks the\n"
"dungeon, inflicting the anguish it felt in life upon those still living.\n"
msgstr "一个丑陋、飘浮着的亡灵。\n它是饱受折磨的受害者的苦痛灵魂，瘦骨嶙峋的身体上垂着撕裂的皮肤。\n它不停在地下城中搜寻着，想把它受到痛苦强加给那些还活着的人。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:frilled lizard"
msgid ""
"A lizard with a giant and colourful fringe folded around its neck. It flares\n"
"its impressive frill at its victims while hissing angrily.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只蜥蜴，脖子上有着巨大、五颜六色的褶边。\n"
"它一边愤怒地嘶叫，一边向敌人展示它那令人印象深刻的褶边。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:formicid"
msgid "A sentient ant that walks upright and is competent at digging.\n"
msgstr "一个有意识的蚂蚁，能够直立行走，善于挖掘。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:formless jellyfish"
msgid ""
"A gelatinous assemblage of tentacles and venom, leaving a glistening trail\n"
"as it slides along. Surely such a mockery of life could not be natural..?\n"
msgstr ""
"一团触手和毒液的凝胶状混合物，在滑动时会留下闪闪发光的痕迹。\n"
"当然，这种玩笑般的生命可能并非来自自然……？\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:foxfire"
msgid ""
"A thin wisp of flaming swamp gas. It will burn the first hostile thing it\n"
"touches and then dissipate.\n"
msgstr "一缕燃烧的稀薄沼气，烧伤接触到的第一个敌对目标后便会消散。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:freezing wraith"
msgid ""
"An incorporeal skeletal form surrounded by a cloud of freezing air, likely the\n"
"remains of some unfortunate adventurer. It now floats slowly through the\n"
"dungeon, seeking to share its fate with others.\n"
msgstr "这个虚体的骷髅周身环绕着一团冷气。可能是某个不幸冒险者的遗骸。\n现在它在地下城中缓慢飘动，想让别人也遭到和它一样的命运。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:frost giant"
msgid ""
"A giant with blue skin and hair like ice and snow. Its eyes are as bleak as\n"
"winter skies. It marches grimly into battle with a great, frosty axe and\n"
"howling blasts of cold.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个巨人，有着蓝色皮肤，长有冰雪般的头发。他的眼睛像冬季的天空一样阴郁。\n"
"他带着一把冰霜巨斧，裹挟着呼啸的寒流，冷酷地投入战斗。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:fulminant prism"
msgid ""
"A slender prism of unstable, soft gold that crackles with barely-contained\n"
"destructive energy. Any blow which cracks its fragile surface is likely to\n"
"result in a violent explosion.\n"
msgstr "一个由不稳定的柔软黄金构成的细长棱晶，勉强束缚的破坏能量噼啪作响。任何使脆弱表面开裂的打击，都可能引发猛烈爆炸。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:fungus"
msgid "A lumpy grey fungus, growing well in the dank underground dungeon.\n"
msgstr "一种块状的灰色真菌，在潮湿的地下城里生长良好。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:gargoyle"
msgid "A granite statue of a hideous winged monster, somehow brought to life.\n"
msgstr "一个可怕的有翼怪物的花岗岩雕像，不知怎么活过来了。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ghost crab"
msgid ""
"A crab twisted by proximity to negative energy. Apparitions of the dead swirl\n"
"around it, only barely visible.\n"
msgstr "一只因接近负能量而扭曲的螃蟹。周围盘旋着几乎看不见的鬼魂。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ghost moth"
msgid ""
"A vile interdimensional predator that feeds on the life force of living beings.\n"
"It resembles an enormous, spiny moth.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只穿梭在次元间的邪恶捕食者，以活物的生命力为食。\n"
"它看起来像是一只巨大的、长刺的飞蛾。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ghoul"
msgid ""
"A decayed cadaver, reanimated and accursed with a terrible hunger. It desires\n"
"nothing but to feed on the flesh of the living, and will fell its victims with\n"
"its vicious claws.\n"
msgstr ""
"一具活过来的腐烂的尸体，被极度的饥饿所诅咒。\n"
"它只想以活人的肉为食，并会用其恶毒的爪子击倒受害者。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:glass eye"
msgid ""
"A floating eyeball formed from living glass. Only the divine Jiyva could form\n"
"such a curious servitor.\n"
msgstr "一个由活性玻璃形成的浮眼。只有神圣的吉瓦才能生成这么奇异的侍从。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:glowing orange brain"
msgid ""
"A huge pulsating brain, floating just off the floor and glowing with mutagenic\n"
"energies. It radiates a constant psychic influence upon nearby allies, using its\n"
"vast intellect to empower their spellcasting abilities.\n"
msgstr "一个巨大的搏动大脑，悬浮在离地不远处，闪耀着致变异能量。它持续向附近盟友施加精神影响，用广博智慧增强它们的施法能力。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:glowing shapeshifter"
msgid ""
"A shapeshifter which has lost control over its transformations, and is\n"
"constantly changing form.\n"
msgstr "这个变形者已经失去了对变形的控制能力，在不断地变换形态。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:gnoll"
msgid ""
"A taller and better-equipped relative of goblins, and ally of orcs. It is\n"
"somewhat doglike in appearance.\n"
msgstr "地精的一种近亲，身形更高、装备更好，也是兽人的盟友，外貌有些像狗。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:gnoll sergeant"
msgid ""
"A commander of a pack of gnolls. Scars on its stout body give evidence of how\n"
"it earned its rank.\n"
msgstr "一群豺狼人的首领。他壮硕的身躯上满是伤痕，这足以证明他是怎么赢得今天的地位的。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:goblin"
msgid ""
"A short, impatient and unfriendly humanoid. Goblins first appeared only a few\n"
"years ago, but are now remarkably numerous. Sadly, no number of raucous goblin\n"
"parties will put them in a welcoming mood toward adventurers.\n"
msgstr "一种矮小、急躁而不友善的人形生物。地精几年前才首次出现，如今却已数量惊人。遗憾的是，无论举办多少喧闹派对，它们都不会因此欢迎冒险者。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:golden dragon"
msgid ""
"A great winged dragon covered in shining golden scales. Legends say that its\n"
"blood runs both hot and cold, and is venomous to boot.\n"
msgstr "一条有翼巨龙，身上覆盖着闪耀的金鳞。传说它的血滚烫而又寒冷，并有着毒性。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:golden eye"
msgid ""
"A tiny and shimmering floating eye, swift as the wind and glistening like gold.\n"
"It has a peculiarly hypnotic look.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个微小、发出微光的浮眼。它和风一样迅捷，并会像金子一样闪闪发光。\n"
"它的外表很特别，似乎能将人催眠。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:goliath frog"
msgid ""
"A frog of exceptional size, for a frog. It lashes its prey with its tongue\n"
"from a distance to coat them in its acidic stomach juices.\n"
msgstr "即使以蛙类标准，它的体型也大得惊人。它从远处用舌头抽打猎物，将酸性胃液涂到对方身上。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:great orb of eyes"
msgid ""
"A levitating ball, covered in malignant eyes and humming with eldritch\n"
"energies. Many is the adventurer ripped limb from limb by its dreadful\n"
"eyeteeth.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个飘浮的球，上面满是恶毒的眼睛，怪异的能量在嗡嗡作响。\n"
"许多冒险者被它那可怕的眼牙肢解了。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:green death"
msgid "A bloated form covered in oozing sores and exhaling clouds of lethal poison.\n"
msgstr "这团肿胀的东西上面满是渗出的疮，它不断排放出致命的毒云。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:green draconian"
msgid "A muscular green-scaled humanoid with a reptilian tail and small wings.\n"
msgstr "一个肌肉发达、长有绿色鳞片的人形生物，有着爬行动物的尾巴和小翅膀。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:grey draconian"
msgid "A muscular grey-scaled humanoid with a reptilian tail and small wings.\n"
msgstr "一个肌肉发达、长有灰色鳞片的人形生物，有着爬行动物的尾巴和小翅膀。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:guardian mummy"
msgid "An ancient warrior, embalmed and cursed to walk in undeath for eternity.\n"
msgstr "一个远古的战士，其尸体被防腐处理，被诅咒永远以死者之躯行走在世上。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:guardian serpent"
msgid ""
"A rare and distinct member of scaly society, light and swift like a snake, yet\n"
"also intelligent like a naga. It is said that a guardian serpent would rather\n"
"die in battle than leave anything to an intruder.\n"
msgstr "它是有鳞生物中稀有而独特成员，既像蛇一样轻快，又有与娜迦一样的智力。\n据说，守卫蛇宁可战死也不会让入侵者拿走任何东西。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:halazid warlock"
msgid ""
"An ancient undead sorcerer, exhumed by the living divines Sheza and Sargol and\n"
"forced to labour night and day to anchor them to the world. Even after the fall\n"
"of the divine twins, it works to resurrect its fallen masters.\n"
msgstr "一个古代的亡灵术师，被还在世的神西泽和赛格尔发掘出来，\n被迫昼夜不停工作让他们弥留在世上。\n即使在这对神倒下后，它仍在努力复活它那陨落的主人。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:harpy"
msgid ""
"A bird-like creature with a human face that roams the coasts endlessly, feared\n"
"for its sharp claws and harrying strikes.\n"
msgstr "一个长有人脸的鸟状生物，无休止地在海岸上飞荡，要当心她的利爪和扑打。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:sin beast"
msgid ""
"A ravenous brute of a demon - as much animal as person. Born from the residue\n"
"of mortal depravity, it gorges itself on malice and magic alike.\n"
msgstr "一头贪婪凶暴的恶魔，既像兽也像人。它从凡人堕落的残渣中诞生，以恶意和魔法为食。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:hell hog"
msgid ""
"An extremely large and aggressive swine, bred in Hell, whose breath burns its\n"
"foes to ash.\n"
msgstr "一头在地狱中被养大、攻击性极强的巨型猪，其吐息能将敌人烧成灰烬。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:hell hound"
msgid ""
"A huge black dog with glowing red eyes, and smoke pouring from its fanged\n"
"mouth.\n"
msgstr "这条黑色的大狗长着炽红色眼睛，它那长满利齿的口中不断有烟雾喷出。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:hell knight"
msgid ""
"A heavily armoured warrior, in league with the powers of Hell, and usually\n"
"accompanied by other unsavoury beings of its ilk.\n"
msgstr "一名身着重甲的战士，与地狱力量结盟，经常与其他令人作呕的家伙集群行动。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:hell rat"
msgid ""
"A unusually large rat. Its weird, knobbly orange skin glows with the infernal\n"
"energies that spawned it.\n"
msgstr "一只特别大的老鼠。它那怪异的、长满疙瘩的橙色表皮散发着孕育它的地狱能量。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:hell sentinel"
msgid ""
"A towering monolith constructed and possessed by demonic forces. A thousand\n"
"eyes leer through slits in its jagged, spiked armour.\n"
msgstr ""
"一块巨大的雕像，由恶魔力量构造和控制。\n"
"千只眼睛透过它那凹凸不平、长满尖刺的铠甲的缝隙窥视着。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:hellephant"
msgid ""
"An abhorrent pachyderm, descendant of demons, burning from within with the\n"
"fires of Hell.\n"
msgstr "一头令人憎恶的厚皮动物，它是恶魔的后裔，体内燃烧着地狱之火。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:hellion"
msgid "A hateful demon, desirous to see all life destroyed by its damnation.\n"
msgstr "一个充满仇恨的恶魔，渴望以天谴消灭所有生命。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:hellwing"
msgid ""
"A hideous skeletal demon. It swoops through the air on powerful wings of\n"
"ancient withered skin, taking sadistic joy from harrying those who would try to\n"
"flee its grasp.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个丑陋的骷髅恶魔。它用强大的、表皮老而干瘪的翅膀在空中掠过，\n"
"从袭扰那些试图逃离它掌控的人中获得虐待狂的快乐。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:hexer"
msgid ""
"A humanoid construct of insubstantial memory, floating through the air. Though\n"
"perhaps somewhat changed in shape and bearing few discernable features, still\n"
"it seems somehow to resemble a warrior from the distantly remembered past,\n"
"ready with debilitating spells and deadly knifework.\n"
msgstr "一个由无实体记忆构成的人形造物，漂浮在空中。虽然外形或许有些改变，且少有可辨特征，仍依稀像一位来自遥远记忆的战士，随时准备用衰弱法术与致命刀法作战。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:hippogriff"
msgid ""
"A large creature with the hindquarters of a horse and the wings, head and\n"
"talons of a great eagle. As popular heraldric creatures, some fortresses may\n"
"keep them as symbols and defenders alike, where they in turn launch intruders\n"
"into the waiting blades of their masters.\n"
msgstr "一种大型生物，后躯如马，翅膀、头和利爪则如巨鹰。它们是流行的纹章形象，一些堡垒将其作为象征和守卫饲养。它们会把入侵者抛向主人等候的刀刃。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:hobgoblin"
msgid ""
"A larger and even ruder goblin. Hobgoblins are perfectly capable of wielding\n"
"weapons, but most prefer to beat their opponents to death with their bare hands.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个体形更大，甚至更粗暴的地精。\n"
"大地精完全有能力持用武器，但大多数更喜欢徒手把他们的敌人打死。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:hog"
msgid ""
"A large even-toed ungulate. Like human beings, it is omnivorous, intelligent,\n"
"and nearly hairless.\n"
msgstr "一头大型偶蹄类动物。像人类一样，杂食、聪明，而且几乎不长毛。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:holy swine"
msgid ""
"A rare celestial version of a usually filthy animal, said to be an angelic\n"
"being who succumbed to hostile magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"在通常肮脏的动物之中罕见地出现了一个神圣品种，\n"
"据说，它是被敌对魔法击败的天使变成的。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:hound"
msgid "A fearsome hunting dog, lithe and alert.\n"
msgstr "一条骇人的猎狗，灵巧而又机警。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:howler monkey"
msgid ""
"An aggressively territorial primate, known for the astonishing variety and\n"
"volume of noise it can produce.\n"
msgstr "一个好斗的灵长类动物，因所发出的噪音出奇地种样多、音量大而闻名。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:human"
msgid ""
"An uppity sort of surface-dwelling, hairless ape. Dwarves think of them as\n"
"fragile, elves think of them as clumsy, and monsters think of them as tasty.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个傲慢的、生活在地表的无毛猿猴。\n"
"矮人认为他们太脆弱，精灵认为他们太笨拙，怪物们则觉得他们很好吃。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:hydra"
msgid ""
"A great and nightmarish lacertilian beast. It has many heads, and the potential\n"
"to grow many more!\n"
"\n"
"Hitting it with any bladed weapon bigger than a short blade risks lopping a\n"
"head off and causing two more to grow in its place. Very large claws, such as\n"
"trolls', are long enough to do the same. Only a weapon branded with flame will\n"
"cauterise the wound and prevent more heads from growing.\n"
msgstr ""
"一头噩梦般的巨型蜥蜴类怪兽。它有很多个头，而且可能还会长出更多！\n"
"\n"
"用任何比短刃更大的有刃武器击打它，有可能会砍掉一个头部，\n"
"但却会导致其位置上长出另外两个头。\n"
"用巨大的爪子进行攻击，比如巨魔的爪子，也会因足够长，导致产生同样的情况。\n"
"只有用带有火焰印记的武器才能灼烧伤口并防止长出更多的头。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ice beast"
msgid ""
"A terrible creature, formed of snow and crystalline ice. Its feet leave puddles\n"
"of icy water on the floor.\n"
msgstr "一个由雪和冰晶构成的可怕生物。它所踏及的地面上会留下一滩冰水坑。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ice devil"
msgid "A man-sized demon covered in glittering ice.\n"
msgstr "一个人类大小的恶魔，身上覆盖着闪光的寒冰。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ice dragon"
msgid "A white, frost-coated dragon. Snowflakes trickle from its nostrils.\n"
msgstr "一条满身冰霜的白龙。雪花从它的鼻孔上落下。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ice fiend"
msgid ""
"A huge frigid demon covered in frost and wreathed in freezing air. It is one of\n"
"the most terrible denizens of the many Hells.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个巨大而寒冷的魔鬼，身上覆满冰霜，被冰冷的空气环绕着。\n"
"这是地狱中最可怕的魔物之一。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ice statue"
msgid ""
"An imposing idol of some nameless arctic god, carved in glistening deep blue\n"
"ice. Freezing vapours swirl about it, and a chill pervades the air.\n"
msgstr ""
"某个无名的极地神祗的壮观神像，用发光的深蓝色冰雕刻而成。\n"
"冰汽在它身边盘旋，空气中弥漫着寒意。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ironbound frostheart"
msgid ""
"An emaciated warrior-mage, bound to guard long-coveted treasures. It calls\n"
"forth deadly frost from its surrounds, freezing foes that are next to walls.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个憔悴的战斗法师，致力于守护渴望已久的宝藏。\n"
"他会从周围召唤出致命的冰霜，冻结靠近墙边的敌人。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:iguana"
msgid "A green lizard with strong jaws and sharp teeth, prized for its flesh.\n"
msgstr "这条绿色蜥蜴长有强壮的颚和尖锐的牙齿，它的肉价值很高。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:imperial myrmidon"
msgid ""
"A warrior initiated in the mysteries of a dying cult, dedicated to serve\n"
"thrones long-fallen. Its blows strip away magical defences, leaving its foes\n"
"vulnerable to even the simplest hexes.\n"
msgstr "一个受教于衰亡教派奥秘的战士，仍侍奉早已倾覆的王座。其攻击能剥去魔法防御，让敌人连最简单的妖术都难以抵挡。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:inugami"
msgid ""
"A mystical canine, frequently bound into the service of wizards and sorcerers.\n"
"Its eyes flicker with remarkable intelligence, but its bite is no less sharp\n"
"than its wilder cousins.\n"
"\n"
"They are difficult to truly kill - when gravely wounded, they instead return to\n"
"spiritual form to lick their wounds until ready to be summoned again.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只神秘的犬科动物，经常为巫师和术师服务。\n"
"它的眼睛闪烁着非凡的智慧，它的咬伤也不比它更狂野的表亲逊色。\n"
"\n"
"它们很难被真正杀死——\n"
"当受到重伤时，它们会回到灵体形态舔舐伤口，直到准备好再次响应召唤。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:iron dragon"
msgid ""
"A very heavy, slow and apparently flightless dragon. It is named for its\n"
"scales, which are so tough they might be iron. Small flakes of metal trail from\n"
"its nostrils.\n"
msgstr ""
"这条龙非常沉重、迟缓，而且似乎不会飞。\n"
"它因其鳞片而得名，鳞片坚韧得像铁一样。铁屑从它的鼻孔中飞出。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:iron elemental"
msgid ""
"A rare and powerful spirit from the elemental plane of earth, it exists in this\n"
"world by inhabiting a hulking mass of iron.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个来自土元素位面的罕见而强大灵体，\n"
"凭借占据着一个巨大的铁块而存在于这个世界上。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:iron giant"
msgid ""
"A huge, rusting monolith, larger than any other species of giant. It packs\n"
"an incredible punch.\n"
msgstr "一个生锈的巨像，比其他任何各类的巨人都要大。他有着惊人的冲击力。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:iron golem"
msgid ""
"A large, ponderous and very solid statue of metal, given the power of\n"
"locomotion through some esoteric means.\n"
msgstr "一尊巨大、笨重而且极其坚固的金属雕像，某种深奥的法术赐予了它行动能力。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:iron imp"
msgid "An ugly, twisted little minor demon with metal skin.\n"
msgstr "一个丑陋、扭曲的低阶恶魔，长有钢铁皮肤。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:iron troll"
msgid ""
"A great troll, mighty of limb and plated with thick scales that resemble\n"
"lightly rusted iron, especially in their hardness.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个强大的巨魔，四肢强壮，身上厚重的鳞片不仅看起来像生锈的铁，\n"
"而且硬度也和铁差不多。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ironbound thunderhulk"
msgid ""
"A brutish figure, hastily armoured in scraps of leather and metal to combat\n"
"a fearsome intruder. On its back is an antique, arcane 'lightning rod', which\n"
"calls down thunder on distant foes, although it cannot hit nearby targets.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个粗野的生物，匆忙披上皮革和金属碎片，以抵抗可怕的入侵者。\n"
"他的背上有一根古老、神秘的“引雷针”，可以向远处的敌人发出雷霆，\n"
"尽管它无法击中附近的目标。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ironbound convoker"
msgid ""
"A guardian mage clad in pattern-etched armour. It can recite words of power\n"
"to summon distant allies and imbue them with unnatural might.\n"
msgstr "一个身披蚀纹防具的守卫法师，能吟诵真言，将远处盟友召来，并赋予它们超自然的力量。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ironbound preserver"
msgid ""
"A towering, muscular figure, capable of safeguarding its allies by selflessly\n"
"accepting a portion of the injuries inflicted upon them.\n"
msgstr "一个高耸、肌肉发达的人，会无私地抗下友方受到的部分伤害来保护他们。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:jackal"
msgid ""
"A small canine scavenger. Packs of jackals roam the underworld, searching for\n"
"carrion to devour.\n"
msgstr "一个小型的犬科食腐动物。成群结队的豺狼游荡在地下世界中寻找腐肉来果腹。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:jelly"
msgid "A pulsating mass of acidic protoplasm.\n"
msgstr "一团悸动的酸性原生质。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:jiangshi"
msgid ""
"A vampiric thrall bound into servitude by esoteric rituals. Though its rigid\n"
"limbs give it an awkward gait, it moves with surprising speed, leaping upon its\n"
"victims and leeching away their life essence with its vicious claws.\n"
msgstr ""
"被神秘的仪式束缚为吸血的奴隶。尽管其僵硬的四肢使它步态笨拙，\n"
"但却有着惊人速度，它扑向受害者，用恶毒的爪子吸取他们的生命精华。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:jorogumo"
msgid ""
"A spider spirit that takes the appearance of a human. It weaves deadly magics to\n"
"incapacitate and kill its prey.\n"
msgstr "一个化身为人类的蜘蛛精。她编织着致命的法术，使猎物丧失行动能力并进行捕杀。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:juggernaut"
msgid ""
"A gigantic humanoid with thick iron plates welded to its skin. It moves with\n"
"alarming speed and deals incredible damage with its immense fists, but must\n"
"rest between blows.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个巨大的人形怪，皮上烙着厚铁板，却移速极快。他能以惊人的速度移动，\n"
"用巨大的拳头造成难以置信的伤害，但必须在打击之间进行休整。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:jumping spider"
msgid ""
"A spider which weaves webs between its front legs and leaps at its prey,\n"
"ensnaring them. The speed with which it leaps is almost supernatural.\n"
msgstr ""
"这只蜘蛛会在它的两条前腿间织网，然后扑向猎物，将其捕捉。\n"
"它跳跃的速度几乎是超自然的。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:killer bee"
msgid "A giant bee, bearing a deadly barb which can sting repeatedly.\n"
msgstr "一只巨型的蜂，长着致命的倒刺，可以反复刺叮。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:killer klown"
msgid ""
"A comical figure full of life and laughter. It looks very happy to see you...\n"
"but is there a slightly malicious cast to its features? Is that red face paint\n"
"or something altogether less pleasant?\n"
msgstr ""
"一个满是活力和欢笑的丑角。他见到你似乎非常开心……\n"
"不过，他的脸上似乎透露出些微恶意？\n"
"那块红色的东西真的只是脸上的涂料吗，还是其他什么令人不快的东西？\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:knight"
msgid ""
"A humanoid construct of insubstantial memory, floating through the air. Though\n"
"perhaps somewhat changed in shape and bearing few discernable features, still\n"
"it seems somehow to resemble a warrior from the distantly remembered past,\n"
"well equipped with arms and armour both.\n"
msgstr "一个由无实体记忆构成的人形造物，漂浮在空中。虽然外形或许有些改变，且少有可辨特征，仍依稀像一位来自遥远记忆的战士，武器和防具都装备精良。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:kobold"
msgid ""
"A small, greyish creature with the look and temperament of a feral dog. No one\n"
"knows for sure where kobolds come from, but ancient demon-gods, evil spirits,\n"
"and meddling wizards have all been suggested as culprits.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个灰色的小型动物，其外表和性格都很像疯狗。\n"
"没人确切知道狗头人到底是从哪来的，\n"
"不过远古的魔神、邪灵和不安分的巫师都经常被指控为元凶。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:kobold brigand"
msgid ""
"A kobold that is bigger and tougher than the ordinary kobold, with a penchant\n"
"for underhanded tactics.\n"
msgstr "这个狗头人比普通的狗头人更大、更强壮，并且喜欢卑鄙的战术。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:kobold blastminer"
msgid ""
"A kobold, ready with multiple armaments to defend itself from the many\n"
"dangers of the depths. The blastmote-packed cannon on its shoulder bears its\n"
"maker's mark, and is fiercely loyal; it will fire for none other.\n"
msgstr "一个备有多种武器、抵御地底诸多危险的狗头人。肩上填装爆裂微灵的火炮带有制造者印记，而且忠心耿耿，不会为其他任何人开火。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:kobold demonologist"
msgid ""
"A kobold in league with demonic powers, able to call forth beings from the\n"
"depths of Hell.\n"
msgstr "一个与恶魔力量结盟的狗头人，能召唤来自地狱深处的生物。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:komodo dragon"
msgid "An enormous monitor lizard more than capable of preying on large animals.\n"
msgstr "一条超巨型的蜥蜴，能够捕食大型动物。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:kraken"
msgid ""
"A gargantuan sea monster, capable of devouring entire ships. Its many tentacles\n"
"reach towards the shore and crush any who draw near.\n"
msgstr "一只巨大的海怪，能吞噬整艘船。它的许多触手伸向岸边，会把任何靠近的人击碎。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:large abomination"
msgid ""
"A hideous conglomeration of mangled body parts, possessed and altered in ways\n"
"that challenge sanity. Each varies in speed, strength, or resilience by\n"
"the nature of whatever unfortunates were used to make it.\n"
msgstr "一团由残破肢体拼成的可怕聚合物，以挑战理智的方式被附身和改造。根据用于制造它的不幸者的本性，每一只的速度、力量或耐受力都不同。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:laughing skull"
msgid ""
"A blazing swift skull that cackles with the bleak malice of the dead. Fond of\n"
"swarming, its laughter grows more spiteful and powerful for each nearby member\n"
"of its own kind.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个燃烧的、迅捷的头骨，带着死者冷酷的恶意咯咯地笑着。\n"
"它喜欢成群结队，一旦附近有同类成员，笑声将变得更恶毒、更强大。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:lava snake"
msgid ""
"A burning red snake which dwells in pools of lava. It spits gobs of molten rock\n"
"at passers-by.\n"
msgstr "一条火红色的蛇，栖息在岩浆池之中。它会向路过的人喷射一团熔岩。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:lemure"
msgid ""
"An accursed soul magically bound to hellish servitude for the highest bidder.\n"
"If its master is slain, it will be freed, departing this realm with gratitude.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个被诅咒的灵魂，被魔法束缚在地狱般的奴役之下，会为最高出价者而战。\n"
"如果它的主人被杀，它将得到自由，带着感激离开这个世界。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:lich"
msgid ""
"A powerful wizard who has learned to cheat death itself, now existing as a\n"
"skeletal, desiccated corpse kept intact by a mighty exercise of dark magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"有些强大的巫师甚至能骗过死亡本身，\n"
"而现在它只剩一具骷髅、干燥的尸体，通过强大的黑暗魔法维系着存在。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:lightning spire"
msgid ""
"A buzzing contraption made from a coil and a rod. It irregularly zaps\n"
"electricity at the most distant enemy in its range.\n"
msgstr "一个由线圈与长杆制成、嗡嗡作响的机关，不定时向射程内最远的敌人释放电击。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:lindwurm"
msgid ""
"A small serpentine dragon with a pair of strong forelimbs. Its thick scales\n"
"give off an eerie red glow.\n"
msgstr "一条小型蛇形龙，长有一对强壮的前肢。它坚厚的鳞片发出诡异的红光。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:living spell"
msgid ""
"A spell, waiting to cast itself at the first foe that enters its range. Once\n"
"it does, it'll dissipate into the ether.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个法术，在等待着时机，向第一个进入其射程的敌人施放。\n"
"一旦发生，它便会消散到以太中。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:lost soul"
msgid ""
"The echo of an unmourned soul. Though the memories of its living self are\n"
"long-faded, it is drawn to the moment of death by some lingering instinct. It\n"
"seizes upon the passage of other souls, losing the last vestiges of its being\n"
"in the memories of another's life.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个无人哀悼的灵魂的回音。尽管它自己生前的记忆已经褪去很久了，\n"
"但还是被某种弥留的本能拉到了死亡的那一刻。\n"
"它夺取他人灵魂的旅程，在别人生命的记忆中失去了自己存在的最后一丝痕迹。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:lurking horror"
msgid ""
"A formless mass of negative energy, bound to bring terrible torment once the\n"
"forces holding it together dissolve. The alien presence of intruders to the\n"
"Abyss is sure to unravel it, yet it seems perversely drawn toward them; still,\n"
"it seems somehow reluctant to move while being observed.\n"
msgstr "一团无形负能量，一旦维系它的力量瓦解，就会带来可怕折磨。深渊入侵者的异质存在必然使它解体，它却反常地被他们吸引。不过，被注视时，它似乎又不愿移动。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:mana viper"
msgid ""
"A violet-scaled serpent with faintly glowing eyes. It thirsts for magic as well\n"
"as flesh, and its bite can drink dry the magical reservoirs of even a powerful\n"
"mage in no time.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条长有紫色鳞片和微微发光的眼睛的巨蛇。它对魔法的渴望如同对肉的渴望一样，\n"
"哪怕是一个强大的法师被它咬一口，魔力库也会瞬间被吸干。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:manticore"
msgid ""
"A hideous cross-breed, bearing the features of a human and a lion, with great\n"
"bat-like wings. Its tail bristles with spikes that can be loosed at potential\n"
"prey.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个狰狞的混种动物：它身上既有人的特征也有狮子的特征，\n"
"还长着一对巨大的蝠翼形翅膀。它的尾巴上长满的尖刺，会射向潜在的猎物。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:martyred shade"
msgid ""
"The wandering shade of a long-dead soul who died for a forgotten cause. Though\n"
"their memories have turned to mist, something deep within still compels them to\n"
"serve and sacrifice - no matter the cost.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个早已死去、为某个被遗忘的事业而献身的灵魂的游荡阴影。\n"
"尽管它们的记忆已经变得模糊，但内心深处的某种东西仍然驱使它们去服侍和牺牲——\n"
"无论付出什么代价。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:meliai"
msgid ""
"A nymphal hybrid, with a winged torso of a human atop the stinging abdomen\n"
"of a bee. The meliai serve under many roles: priestesses of nature, nurses to\n"
"the divine, and warrior-champions for their hives.\n"
msgstr "一个仙女的混种，上方是带有翅膀的人类躯体，下方是长有蜂刺的腹部。\n墨利亚扮演着众多角色：自然的祭司、神圣的看护者和蜂巢的战士。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:merfolk"
msgid ""
"A hybrid with the torso of a human and the tail of a fish. It is capable of\n"
"dwelling both in water and on land, and fiercely defends its domain.\n"
msgstr "一个人身鱼尾的混种生物。他能在水中和陆地上栖居，并会激烈地捍卫其领地。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:merfolk aquamancer"
msgid ""
"A slender merfolk mystic with unusually webby hands. Its form shifts and\n"
"glistens as if seen through ocean spray.\n"
msgstr "一个纤细的人鱼秘术师，有着不同寻常的蹼状手。\n他的形态变幻、发光，仿佛是透过海浪所看到的。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:merfolk avatar"
msgid ""
"A beguiling merfolk whose voice mesmerises listeners. It carries no weapon,\n"
"but its song summons drowned souls to defend the sea against intruders.\n"
msgstr "一个迷人的人鱼，她的声音令听众陶醉其中。\n她虽然没有持任何武器，但她的歌声能召唤溺魂，抵抗入侵者，保卫海洋。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:merfolk impaler"
msgid "A powerfully muscled merfolk warrior, bearing a deadly weapon.\n"
msgstr "一个强壮的人鱼战士，手持一把致命的武器。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:merfolk javelineer"
msgid ""
"A fearsome merfolk champion with a piercing gaze and a large bundle of\n"
"javelins.\n"
msgstr "一名值得敬畏的人鱼勇士，目光锐利，还携有一大捆标枪。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:merfolk siren"
msgid "A beguiling merfolk whose voice can mesmerise listeners.\n"
msgstr "一个迷人的人鱼，她的声音会迷住听众。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:minotaur"
msgid ""
"A large muscular human with the head of a bull. It makes its home in a\n"
"gauntlet where it awaits worthy challengers.\n"
msgstr "一个高大、壮硕的人形生物，长着一颗牛头。他居住在竞技场，等待值得较量的挑战者。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:molten gargoyle"
msgid ""
"A hideous molten stone statue come to life, with flames licking across its\n"
"body.\n"
msgstr "一个可怕的熔岩雕像活了过来，火舌缠绕着它的身体。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:moth of wrath"
msgid ""
"A moth known for its ability to inspire rage by touching its foes, or merely\n"
"gazing at its friends. For some inexplicable reason, it was eradicated from\n"
"the surface centuries ago.\n"
msgstr ""
"一种飞蛾，以其通过触碰它的敌人或仅仅凝视它的友方就能激发狂暴的能力而闻名。\n"
"由于某些莫名其妙的原因，几个世纪前它就从地表消失了。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:mummy"
msgid ""
"An undead figure covered in bandages and embalming fluids, compelled to walk by\n"
"an ancient curse. It radiates a malign aura.\n"
msgstr "一个裹着绷带和防腐液的亡灵，被古老的诅咒驱使着行走。它散发出邪恶的气息。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:mummy priest"
msgid ""
"An ancient servant of a long forgotten god, embalmed and cursed to walk in\n"
"undeath for all eternity.\n"
msgstr "一位被遗忘已久的神明的远古仆人，经过防腐处理并被诅咒永生不死。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:mutant beast"
msgid ""
"A bizarre creature, twisted and warped by overexposure to magical radiation.\n"
"Each has a different set of traits.\n"
msgstr "一个奇异的生物，由于过度暴露于魔力辐射而扭曲变形。每个都有不同的特征。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:naga"
msgid ""
"A hybrid that is human from the waist up; below is a scaly, muscular snakelike\n"
"tail. Its mouth drips with venomous saliva.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个人和蛇的混种，他的腰部以上是人类，下面却是一条健壮的、长着鳞片的蛇尾。\n"
"他的嘴边滴着毒性唾液。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:naga mage"
msgid ""
"A naga that has trained in the use of magic, trailed by an eldritch nimbus. It\n"
"is especially skilled in spells dealing with poison and venom.\n"
msgstr "这个娜迦进行过施法训练，所到之处都会留下神秘的灵气。\n他特别擅长施放和毒有关的法术。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:naga ritualist"
msgid ""
"An esoteric mystic draped in talismans. It venerates poison as a sacred gift\n"
"and means of spiritual purification.\n"
msgstr "一个高深莫测的秘术师，佩戴着护身符。他将毒药尊崇为神圣的礼物和净化精神的手段。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:naga sharpshooter"
msgid ""
"A naga with exceptionally keen eyesight, adept in the use of ranged weaponry\n"
"and simple magics which allows it to snipe at targets across nearly any\n"
"obstruction.\n"
msgstr "一个视力极其敏锐的娜迦，善于使用远程武器和简单魔法，\n使得他几乎可以跨越任何阻碍狙击目标。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:naga warrior"
msgid "A fearsome naga warrior clad in sturdy armour and wielding a mighty weapon.\n"
msgstr "一个令人敬畏的娜迦战士，身穿坚甲，手拿利器。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:nagaraja"
msgid ""
"A magnificent example of the naga. It is an expert at both martial and magical\n"
"arts.\n"
msgstr "一个在娜迦中受到尊崇的模范。他精通武术和魔法。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:nameless horror"
msgid ""
"A malign force from the space between planes. It is hostile to the magic forces\n"
"that removed it from its home. These horrors are often the result of mistaken\n"
"summoning spells and have slain many aspiring wizards.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个来自位面之间的邪恶力量。它对把它带离家园的魔法力量充满敌意。\n"
"这个恐怖通常是召唤魔法出错的结果，并杀死了许多有抱负的巫师。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:nargun"
msgid ""
"An ancient stone creature that has lived among these frozen caves since before\n"
"Antaeus rent Cocytus into being. It tolerates its new neighbors begrudgingly,\n"
"preferring the company of its petrified enemies. Veins of ice permeate its\n"
"frozen stone flesh.\n"
msgstr "一种古老石质生物，早在安泰俄斯撕出悲叹河之前，就已栖居于这些冰洞。它勉强容忍新邻居，更愿与被自己石化的敌人为伴。冰脉遍布它冻结的石质血肉。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:necromancer"
msgid ""
"An evil wizard who is devoted to the practice of death magic, the mastery of\n"
"unholy energies, and the raising of corpses into a parody of life.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个邪恶的巫师毕生钻研死亡魔法的奥秘，\n"
"掌握邪恶的能量，以及给予尸体虚假的生命。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:necrophage"
msgid ""
"A vile undead creation of the most unholy necromancy, made from the decaying\n"
"corpses of humanoid creatures. It exists to spread disease and decay.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个被最邪恶的死灵法术创造出来的亡灵造物，其身体由人形生物的腐尸拼凑而成。\n"
"它的存在的就是为了散布疾病与腐化。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:neqoxec"
msgid ""
"A weirdly shaped demon, pulsing and shifting with mutagenic energies, its belly\n"
"distended with the devoured brains of its victims.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个奇形怪状的恶魔。它的身体受变异能量的影响，不断搏动变化着，\n"
"它的肚子因吞食太多受害者的脑子而发胀。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:obsidian statue"
msgid ""
"A beautiful statue of an unknown creature, jet-black like a tear in reality.\n"
"Its eyes glow with an otherworldly, malignant radiance.\n"
msgstr "一尊未知生物的美丽雕像，漆黑得仿佛现实上的裂口。双眼闪耀着异世的邪恶光芒。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:occultist"
msgid ""
"A wizard fond of illusion and treachery. They scorn the crudeness of other\n"
"magicians, who hurl wild conjurations toward their foes rather than cunningly\n"
"exploiting their greatest weaknesses.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个喜欢幻象和背叛的巫师。\n"
"他们蔑视那些向敌人疯狂施展魔法、而不是巧妙利用其最大的弱点的粗鲁的魔法师。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:octopode"
msgid ""
"A more intelligent cousin of the mighty kraken, capable of using tools and\n"
"spells. It is fully amphibious, but most of its species choose to stay beneath\n"
"the waves and serve their King.\n"
msgstr "强大的海妖的一个近亲，但比海妖更聪明，能够使用工具和魔法。\n它是完全两栖的，但它们大多数物种还是选择留在波涛之下，服侍它们的王。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ogre"
msgid ""
"A large, ugly, and fat creature, distantly related to goblins. It is\n"
"tremendously strong, and likes fighting alongside its orc friends.\n"
msgstr "一种又大又丑又胖的生物，与地精有远亲关系。它力大无穷，喜欢与兽人朋友并肩战斗。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ogre mage"
msgid ""
"A rare breed of ogre, skilled in the use of magic. It usually becomes a\n"
"chieftain among its kin.\n"
msgstr "一个罕见的食人魔，擅长使用魔法。他通常是一群食人魔的酋长。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:oklob plant"
msgid ""
"A very dangerous plant which fends off predators by spraying corrosive vitriol\n"
"at them. Even experienced adventurers give oklob plants a wide berth.\n"
msgstr ""
"这株危险的植物能靠喷吐腐蚀性强酸来击退捕食者。\n"
"即使是有经验的冒险者也会尽量远离酸箭草。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:oklob sapling"
msgid ""
"A young oklob plant. It is more fragile than the mature specimen, but the acid\n"
"it sprays is just as deadly.\n"
msgstr "一株奥克罗布植物幼苗。它比成熟的更脆弱，但喷出的酸同样致命。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:oni"
msgid ""
"A large, rowdy, and drink-loving creature. When they're not busy with their\n"
"duties serving any number of gods, oni mostly love a good fight.\n"
msgstr "一个体形巨大、吵闹、爱喝酒的生物。\n当鬼人不忙于侍奉神明的职责时，他们通常会喜欢痛快地打上一架。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ophan"
msgid ""
"A creature from the heavenly realms. It consists of a wheel within a wheel, and\n"
"both of these are covered in eyes; strange flames of holy fire flicker all over\n"
"it. To be seen by its countless eyes is to be highlighted and branded as both\n"
"dissident and quarry for its allies to hunt down.\n"
msgstr "一个来自天界的生物，由轮中套轮构成，两个轮上都满是眼睛，周身闪烁着奇异圣火。被无数眼睛看见，就会显露形迹，并被标为异端和猎物，供其盟友追猎。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:orange crystal statue"
msgid ""
"An intricately carved idol of some nameless godling, hewn of translucent orange\n"
"crystal. Its lifeless eyes seem to glitter uncannily with a wicked\n"
"intelligence. It is capable of unleashing a powerful psychic assault upon the\n"
"minds of any who approach it.\n"
msgstr ""
"某个无名神祗的神像，用透明橙色水晶细致地雕刻而成。\n"
"它那无生命的眼睛似乎闪烁着邪恶的智慧。\n"
"它会对任何接近它的人的心灵发动强大的精神攻击。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:orange demon"
msgid "An amber-coloured demon with a barbed tail not unlike that of a scorpion.\n"
msgstr "一个琥珀色的恶魔，尾巴上的倒刺，与蝎子无异。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:orb guardian"
msgid ""
"A huge, glowing, four-limbed purple creature with heightened senses, created by\n"
"the Orb itself. It guards the Orb with enormous punctiliousness and violence,\n"
"and its death will alert any Boundless Tesseracts on the level to begin creating\n"
"reinforcements.\n"
"\n"
"Unless the Orb has already been disturbed, it will refuse to abandon its duty\n"
"by leaving the floor.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个巨大、发光、拥有四肢的紫色生物，感官敏锐，由宝珠本身创造。它以极端严谨和暴力守卫宝珠；死亡会惊动本层所有无垠超立方体，使其开始制造援军。\n"
"\n"
"除非宝珠已经被惊动，否则它绝不离开本层，放弃职责。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:orb of destruction"
msgid ""
"A conjured globe of pure magic that homes onto a designated target, albeit with\n"
"massive inertia. A smart and agile person may move out of its path, causing it\n"
"to miss its target. It cannot be avoided by Dodging skill, and is able to make\n"
"sharp turns to hit adjacent targets.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个变出的纯魔法球，能够锁定指定目标，尽管具有巨大的惯性。\n"
"一个聪明而敏捷的人可能会选择偏离它的路径，会让它错过目标。\n"
"但仅凭闪避技能无法避免它，并且它能够急转弯以击中相邻目标。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:orb of fire"
msgid ""
"A globe of raw primordial fire, capable of impressive pyrotechnics and of\n"
"twisting the very flesh of creatures who come into its ken.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个由最原始的火焰构成的球体，能够发出壮观的烟火，\n"
"并能扭曲进入其视野的生物的肉体。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:orb spider"
msgid ""
"An eerily glowing spider with strands of pure energy emerging from its\n"
"spinnerets. It seems to want to keep its distance.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只发着奇异光芒的蜘蛛，纯粹的魔法能量从它的喷丝头上涌出。\n"
"它似乎在竭力和你保持距离。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:orc"
msgid ""
"A subterranean tribe whose forebearers were once scattered across every corner\n"
"of the surface world. Eons of persecution have taught them the necessity of\n"
"violence and the importance of having your brethren at your side.\n"
msgstr "一个地下部族，其祖先曾散居地表世界各处。漫长的迫害教会了它们暴力的必要，也教会了与同胞并肩的重要。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:orc high priest"
msgid ""
"An exalted servant of the orc god Beogh and a master of many foul rites, to\n"
"whose aid Beogh will even send beings from the netherworld.\n"
msgstr ""
"这名兽人是兽人之神比欧弗的高级仆从之一，主管多种污秽仪式，\n"
"比欧弗甚至会派遣地狱生物来支援他。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:orc knight"
msgid ""
"A heavily armoured orc, covered in scars from many past battles. It commands\n"
"its brethren in battle, rousing them to greater, more violent efforts with\n"
"bloodcurdling shouts.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个重甲兽人，身上布满过去战斗留下的疤痕。\n"
"他在战斗中指挥着他的兄弟，用恐怖的吼声激发他们投入更大、更暴力的力量。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:orc priest"
msgid ""
"A servant of Beogh, the ancient god of the orcs. Beogh rewards its devoted\n"
"prayers by striking down its enemies.\n"
msgstr "兽人古神比欧弗的仆从。比欧弗会击倒它的敌人，作为对虔诚祈祷的回应。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:orc sorcerer"
msgid ""
"An exceptionally competent orcish wizard, in league with hellish and chthonic\n"
"forces and motivated by the purest imaginable strain of malevolence.\n"
msgstr "一个高超的兽人巫师，与地狱和黑暗力量为盟，被设想到的最阴暗的恶意驱使着。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:orc warlord"
msgid "A supreme commander of an orc host, skilled at both melee and ranged combat.\n"
msgstr "兽人大军的最高指挥官，擅长近战和远程战斗。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:orc warrior"
msgid ""
"An experienced, armoured and well-armed orc soldier, able to command a small\n"
"mob of its fellows.\n"
msgstr "一名装备精良、战斗经验丰富的兽人士兵。他是一个小型战团的首领。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:orc wizard"
msgid ""
"An orc who has gained proficiency in the occult arts, using them for martial\n"
"purposes.\n"
msgstr "一个精通神秘技艺的兽人，会将其用于战斗。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:pale draconian"
msgid "A muscular humanoid with pale scales, a reptilian tail and small wings.\n"
msgstr "一个肌肉发达、长有苍白色鳞片的人形生物，有着爬行动物的尾巴和小翅膀。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:pandemonium lord"
msgid ""
"A formidable demon lord inhabiting the endless halls of Pandemonium. Each one\n"
"is different, with its own set of strengths and weaknesses.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个可怕的恶魔领主居住在无尽魔窟之中。\n"
"每个魔窟领主都是独一无二的存在，拥有不同的能力和弱点。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:peacekeeper"
msgid ""
"A four-legged humanoid construct, tasked with recapturing escaped prisoners and\n"
"punishing heretics. Long after the fall of the empire it once served, it\n"
"continues to enforce imperial law, knowing no jurisdiction.\n"
msgstr "一个四足人形构造物，负责缉拿逃犯、惩罚异端。即使侍奉的帝国早已覆灭，它仍继续执行帝国法律，毫不理会管辖界限。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:pearl dragon"
msgid ""
"A dragon consecrated to the holy divine powers. Its breath is blessed fire, and\n"
"its claws sear its victims with divine wrath.\n"
msgstr "一条侍奉于神圣力量的龙。它的吐息是神圣的火，利爪会带着神怒灼伤受害者。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:phantasmal warrior"
msgid ""
"A hideous translucent green spirit of a warrior fallen in battle but recalled\n"
"to this plane by unholy magic. The blade it wields is ethereal, rendering those\n"
"it strikes weak-willed and vulnerable to dark magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个可怕的、幽绿色的战败战士的灵魂，被邪恶魔法召回到这个层面。\n"
"它所持的利刃是虚无的，被它伤到的会更易受魔法影响。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:phantom"
msgid ""
"A nearly-transparent undead spirit, suspected by some sages to be a degenerate\n"
"form of ghost, with no memories of its former life. It rarely stays in one\n"
"place for long.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个几乎全身透明的亡灵幽魂，有些贤者怀疑它是一种退化的鬼魂，\n"
"因为它完全没有生前的记忆。它很少会在一个地方停留很长时间。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:pharaoh ant"
msgid ""
"A royal ant returned to unlife through strange, probably horrifying means. It\n"
"binds the souls of its allies when slain, allowing them to fight on after death\n"
"as simulacra.\n"
msgstr "一只通过奇异、想必十分可怕的手段化为亡灵的皇家蚂蚁。它被杀死时，会束缚盟友的灵魂，让它们在死后化为冰骸继续战斗。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:pillar of salt"
msgid "A pillar of salt shaped like a statue, but worked by no living hands.\n"
msgstr "一根像是雕像的盐柱，但并非由手工打造。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:plant"
msgid ""
"A plant that has adapted to grow in the unpleasant dungeon environment,\n"
"somehow thriving even underground in the absence of the sun.\n"
msgstr "一株已经适应在恶劣的地下城环境中生长的植物，\n不知何故在没有太阳的地下也能茁壮成长。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:player ghost"
msgid ""
"The apparition of an unfortunate adventurer, retaining many of the skills and\n"
"abilities the adventurer had in life. It is condemned to haunt this particular\n"
"level of the dungeons, lashing out violently at the next adventurer to cross\n"
"its path.\n"
msgstr ""
"这是某个不幸冒险者的鬼魂，它依然保有着许多生前拥有的技能和能力。\n"
"它被诅咒，徘徊在这一层地牢，向碰见它的下一个冒险者发起猛烈的攻击。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:polar bear"
msgid ""
"A bear covered in glistening white fur, habituated to cold conditions. Like all\n"
"ursines, it will become enraged if badly hurt.\n"
msgstr ""
"这头熊身上披着发光的白色皮毛，能在寒冷环境中生存。\n"
"和所有其他熊类一样，它会在受重伤时会变得狂暴。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:profane servitor"
msgid ""
"A blasphemous being that was once an angel of the Shining One. It now stands as\n"
"unliving proof that not even the holiest of beings are beyond Yredelemnul's\n"
"grasp.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个渎神之物曾经是光明神的天使之一。然而，现在它的存在只能证明一件事：\n"
"即使是世间最圣洁的存在也无法逃出伊莱德莱姆努尔的魔掌。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:program bug"
msgid ""
"A ravenous and incredibly buggy monster. Please report its existence to the\n"
"DevTeam.\n"
msgstr "一个贪婪、令人难以置信的臭虫怪物。请向开发者团队报告它的存在。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:protean progenitor"
msgid ""
"A gargantuan humanoid of fractured shape from the aeons when the seas were but\n"
"primordial soup. The many shapeshifters of the dungeon once sloughed off from\n"
"these unfathomably ancient beings, and when they themselves finally cease, even\n"
"their remains will give birth one last time to furious monsters.\n"
msgstr "一个巨大的、身形破碎的人形生物，当海洋还是原始汤的洪荒时代，他就已经出现了。\n地下城中许多变形人就是从这些深不可测的古代生物身上脱落的，\n当这些远古生物最终终结时，他们的遗体甚至还会在这最后一次生成愤怒的怪物。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:putrid mouth"
msgid ""
"A starved spirit whose mouth is a pit of rot, emitting vile fumes. Its putrid\n"
"maw cannot eat the food it finds, so it moans with rage and desparate hunger.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个饥饿的灵魂，它的嘴是个腐烂的坑，散发着恶臭。\n"
"它那腐烂的嘴无法吃它找到的食物，愤怒地呻吟着，绝望地饿着。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:purple draconian"
msgid "A muscular purple-scaled humanoid with a reptilian tail and small wings.\n"
msgstr "一个肌肉发达、长有紫色鳞片的人形生物，有着爬行动物的尾巴和小翅膀。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:queen bee"
msgid ""
"A ruler of a swarm of bees, even larger and more dangerous than its many\n"
"offspring.\n"
msgstr "一个蜂群的统治者，她比她的后代更大、更危险。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:quicksilver dragon"
msgid ""
"A long and sinuous dragon, seemingly more neck and tail than anything else. Its\n"
"skin shines like molten mercury, magical energies arc from its pointed snout,\n"
"and it moves with terrifying swiftness.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条长而蜷曲着的龙，看起来几乎完全是颈和尾巴。\n"
"它的皮肤像熔铸的水银一样发着光，口鼻喷射着魔法能量，而且它的动作迅捷得吓人。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:quicksilver elemental"
msgid ""
"A mercurial spirit drawn from the elemental plane of earth. It exists in\n"
"this world by inhabiting a shimmering body of liquid metal.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个来自土元素位面的灵体。\n"
"它凭借占据着一个闪闪发光的液态金属体而存在于这个世界上。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:quokka"
msgid "A pesky little marsupial that is a bit like a rat, but not quite.\n"
msgstr "这个烦人的小型有袋动物外形有点像老鼠，但只是有点像而已。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:radroach"
msgid ""
"A giant cockroach that has been exposed to high amounts of mutagenic energy. It\n"
"is horrifyingly mutated, but this has only made it stronger.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个暴露于大量诱变能量的巨型蟑螂。\n"
"它发生了可怕的变异，但这只会让它变得更强大。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ragged hierophant"
msgid ""
"A bedraggled priest, once-fine robes now lined with salt and dust. Forsaken by\n"
"the gods, it now relies on constructs to protect itself.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个邋遢的祭司，曾经华丽的长袍现已沾满了盐和灰尘。\n"
"他被诸神抛弃，现在依赖造物保护自己。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:rakshasa"
msgid ""
"A maneater demon, bestial and misshapen, in search of hidden power and\n"
"knowledge. It is an expert in the art of illusion, and is exceptionally\n"
"intelligent and cruel.\n"
msgstr "一个兽形扭曲、以人为食的恶魔，寻求隐秘力量与知识。它精通幻术，极其聪明而残忍。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:rat"
msgid "A dirty rodent that has grown large and aggressive in the dungeon environment.\n"
msgstr "这个肮脏的啮齿动物在地下城的环境下长得又大又凶猛。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:raiju"
msgid ""
"A profoundly unnatural hound, crackling with electricity. It travels in packs,\n"
"and covers great distances by bursting into living lightning.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条很反常的猎犬，身上的电流噼啪作响。\n"
"它们成群行动，并能以爆出活体闪电的方式行进很远的距离。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:reaper"
msgid ""
"A haunting form wielding a giant scythe, ceaselessly harvesting the souls of\n"
"the living.\n"
msgstr "一个挥舞巨镰的幽影，不停收割活人的灵魂。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:red devil"
msgid ""
"A larger cousin of the common imp, with a fiendish grin and two short wings\n"
"sprouting from its shoulders. It favours tridents and loves to skewer its\n"
"victims with painful barbs.\n"
msgstr ""
"常见的小恶魔的一个体形更大的近亲，咧着邪恶的笑容，肩上生有两个短小的翅膀。\n"
"它喜欢三叉戟，爱用令人痛苦的倒刺串起它的受害者。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:red draconian"
msgid "A muscular red-scaled humanoid with a reptilian tail and small wings.\n"
msgstr "一个肌肉发达、长有红色鳞片的人形生物，有着爬行动物的尾巴和小翅膀。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:hornet"
msgid "A buzzing hornet with a vicious stinger dripping with paralytic poison.\n"
msgstr "一只嗡嗡作响的大黄蜂身上有一根毒刺，上面滴着麻痹性毒液。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:redback"
msgid ""
"A vicious black spider with a splash of red on its swollen abdomen. Its\n"
"mandibles drip with lethal poison.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只凶狠的黑色蜘蛛，它肿胀的腹部上有一大块红斑。\n"
"致命毒液正从它的虫颚上滴落下来。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:revenant"
msgid ""
"The skeletal remains of someone who died unmourned and forgotten. It burns with\n"
"an unquenchable hunger to be remembered.\n"
msgstr "一个死后无人哀悼、被人遗忘者的骨骸，燃烧着无法熄灭的渴望，想要被世人记住。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ribbon worm"
msgid ""
"A giant annelid, glistening with slime, with unusually large teeth. It expels\n"
"fragments of its own innards to ensnare unsuspecting prey.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条巨大的环节动物，身上的黏液闪烁着，牙齿大得出奇。\n"
"它排出自己内脏的碎片来诱捕毫无戒心的猎物。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:rime drake"
msgid "A small but dangerous dragon. Its breath is visible even on the warmest days.\n"
msgstr "一个小而危险的龙。即使在最炎热的天气里，也能看到它的吐息。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:river rat"
msgid ""
"A rodent with hair of a most peculiar green colour, and a powerful bite. It\n"
"tends to form great swarms with its kin.\n"
msgstr "一个长有奇异绿毛的啮齿动物，咬合力很强。它往往和它的同类成群生活。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:rockslime"
msgid ""
"An oozing avalanche, scouring the ground beneath it as it rumbles forward.\n"
"It consumes only the metal and bone from its victims, using them to reinforce\n"
"itself even further.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个涌出的山崩，它隆隆前进时冲刷着下方的地面。\n"
"它只吞食受害者的金属和骨头，用它们来进一步增强自身。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:royal jelly"
msgid ""
"A particularly rich and golden gelatinous thing. Smaller jellies swim and pulse\n"
"just below its surface, ready to burst forth at the slightest touch.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个特别浓郁的金色凝胶状物质。\n"
"更小的胶冻在它的表面下游泳、搏动，只要稍加触碰就会爆发。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:royal mummy"
msgid ""
"An ancient pharaoh, embalmed and cursed to undeath, now capable of great and\n"
"terrifying feats of magic.\n"
msgstr "一位古代法老，被防腐并诅咒为不死之人，现在能够完成伟大而可怕的魔法技艺。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:rust devil"
msgid ""
"A hideous humanoid figure with rust-spotted metal skin, spreading corrosion\n"
"and decay to all it touches.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个丑陋的人形人物，有着锈迹斑斑的金属皮肤，\n"
"要把腐蚀和腐烂蔓延到所有接触到的地方。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:salamander"
msgid ""
"A red, flaming half-human half-snake creature with a legendary affinity for\n"
"fire.\n"
msgstr "一个红色的、燃烧的半人半蛇的生物，传说和火的关系很密切。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:salamander mystic"
msgid ""
"A member of the salamander's scholarly caste, possessed of lesser size and\n"
"strength, but wise in the ways of magic.\n"
msgstr "沙罗曼蛇学者阶级中的一员，虽然体形和力量都比较小，但精通魔法。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:salamander tyrant"
msgid ""
"An intimidating volcano lord. It commands the magma of its realm as an\n"
"extension of its body, and the majesty of its gaze can weaken even the proudest\n"
"challenger.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个令人生畏的火山领主。他能控制自己领域内的岩浆，仿佛是身体的延伸。\n"
"再骄傲的挑战者也会因他那威严的目光而畏缩。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:saltling"
msgid ""
"A small, human-shaped agglomeration of salt. It was created by the last\n"
"fugitive loyalists of the fallen eastern empire, forced in desperation to\n"
"construct golems from local resources to defend themselves.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个小型的人形盐块。它是由最后一批忠于没落的东方帝国的逃亡者创建的，\n"
"他们在绝望中被迫用当地资源建造魔像来保护自己。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:satyr"
msgid ""
"A more intelligent relative of the faun, often found in their company, and far\n"
"more unforgiving of — and dangerous to — interlopers.\n"
msgstr "法翁羊人更聪明的近亲，经常与它们同行，对入侵者也无情得多、危险得多。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:scorpion"
msgid ""
"A loathsome arachnid, armed to the teeth. Its body is covered in a thick\n"
"carapace, its tail is tipped by a venomous sting, and its forelimbs are\n"
"equipped with a pair of sharp grasping claws.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只讨厌的蛛形纲动物，武装到了牙齿。\n"
"它的躯体上覆着一层厚厚的甲壳，尾巴末端有一根毒刺，前肢上还长有一对利爪。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:sea snake"
msgid ""
"A brightly coloured snake, very comfortable in the water. It has a highly\n"
"potent venomous bite.\n"
msgstr "一条颜色鲜艳的蛇，水性很好。它的咬伤有很强的毒性。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:searing wretch"
msgid ""
"An animated corpse alight with terrible fire. The flames are fueled by its\n"
"regenerating flesh, which bubbles and melts as it grows.\n"
msgstr "一具燃烧着可怕烈火的活动尸体。不断再生的血肉为火焰供能，刚长出来便冒泡、熔化。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:seraph"
msgid ""
"A six-winged servant of the good gods, of the highest rank of the angelic\n"
"hosts. Its eyes burn with divine fire.\n"
msgstr "一个善神的仆人，生有六翼，是最高级别的天使。他的眼睛燃烧着圣焰。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:servant of whispers"
msgid ""
"A member of an order of monks who abandoned their former faith. It now serves\n"
"a minor god of wind and whispers, who allows it to calm the air and, when\n"
"in great need, to break the stillness with divine thunder.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个放弃原先信仰的僧侣。\n"
"现在他侍奉掌管风和低语的低阶的神，这使得他能让空气平静下来，\n"
"或是非常需要的时候，用神圣的雷声打破寂静。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:shadowghast"
msgid ""
"A skulking apparition that disguises itself as a harmless shadow. Attuned to the\n"
"dim light of the dungeon, it can slip in and out of sight at will, moving\n"
"swiftly from one pool of shade to the next before striking unerringly at the\n"
"blind spots of those who cannot see it.\n"
msgstr "一个潜行的幽魂，伪装成无害影子。它适应地下城昏暗的光线，能随意显隐，迅速从一片阴影移向另一片，然后精准袭击看不见它的目标的盲点。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:shadow demon"
msgid ""
"A mysterious demonic figure, difficult to distinguish from the darkness around\n"
"it. It weaves the shadows into powerful minions.\n"
msgstr "一个神秘的魔鬼，很难把它从周围的黑暗中分辨出来。它把阴影编成强大的仆从。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:shadow dragon"
msgid "A great umbral dragon, radiating evil and death. Its breath reeks of the grave.\n"
msgstr "一条巨大的暗影龙，散发着邪恶和死亡。它的吐息弥漫着坟墓的气味。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:shadow imp"
msgid "A shadowy minor demon, with an affinity for the necromantic arts.\n"
msgstr "一个影状低阶恶魔，擅长死灵技艺。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:shadow wraith"
msgid ""
"A mist-wreathed skeletal shadow, hanging in mid-air. It drains away the\n"
"life force of living beings.\n"
msgstr "烟雾缭绕的骸骨之影，在半空中游荡。它以活物的生命力为食。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:shambling mangrove"
msgid ""
"A gnarled mangrove, possessed of sapience and a cantankerous disposition. Its\n"
"roots run deep through the water and soil of its marshy home and can make\n"
"footing very difficult for those who provoke its ire. Marsh fauna are often\n"
"found nesting within its branches, and may not take kindly to being disturbed.\n"
msgstr "一棵盘根错节、具有智慧且脾气暴躁的红树。树根深入沼泽家园的水土，使惹怒它的人难以立足。枝间常栖居着沼泽动物，被打扰时也不会客气。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:shapeshifter"
msgid ""
"A disturbing creature with the power to change its form. It is very rarely\n"
"observed alive in its natural state.\n"
msgstr "这个诡异的怪物拥有变换自己形态的能力。它原本形态的存在很少被观察到。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:shard shrike"
msgid ""
"An incredibly fast-moving bird, known for impaling its prey on shards of ice\n"
"before tearing them to pieces. It has acclimated to the desolate wastes of\n"
"Cocytus, and is enveloped with an accursed chill.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个移动速度极快的⻦，因为会在撕碎猎物前用冰碎片将其刺穿而闻名。\n"
"它已适应悲叹河那荒凉的废墟，被严酷的寒意裹挟着。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:shining eye"
msgid "A strangely deformed floating eyeball, pulsating with flesh-twisting energy.\n"
msgstr "一个诡异变形了的浮眼，悸动着扭曲血肉的能量。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:shock serpent"
msgid ""
"A sinuous serpent whose body crackles with volatile electricity. Its electric\n"
"shroud can discharge when struck, inflicting a painful shock on any nearby\n"
"foes.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条蜿蜒的巨蛇，身上不稳定的电流噼啪作响。\n"
"它的电罩被攻击时会放电，对附近的敌人造成痛苦的电击。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:silent spectre"
msgid ""
"A terrible spirit which brings an unearthly silence to the area around it,\n"
"making it impossible to recite the magical incantations involved with casting\n"
"spells or reading scrolls.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个可怕的幽魂给周围区域带来超乎寻常的寂静，\n"
"身处结界中的时候无法吟诵魔法咒语，也就不能施放魔法或是阅读卷轴。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:simulacrum"
msgid "An icy replica of a monster, animated by heretical magics.\n"
msgstr "一个怪物的冰制复制品，由异端魔法所激活。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:sixfirhy"
msgid ""
"A small vile creature that moves in bursts, stopping then darting with\n"
"lightning speed. It sprays sparks as it goes.\n"
msgstr "这个邪恶的小东西会突然停下，然后又以闪电般的速度突进。它边走边迸出电火花。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:skeletal warrior"
msgid "A vicious and heavily armed humanoid skeleton, animated by unholy power.\n"
msgstr "一具被不洁之力复活的人形骷髅，性情凶暴，装备精良。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:skeleton"
msgid "A skeleton compelled to unlife by the exercise of necromancy.\n"
msgstr "一具被死灵法术复活的骷髅。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:sky beast"
msgid ""
"A strange aerial creature formed of fleshy clouds and electric feathers. It\n"
"commands the faint wind currents of the Dungeon with every strike, which will\n"
"buffet its victims in dramatic correlation to the amount of open air around\n"
"said prey.\n"
msgstr "一种由血肉般云朵和电羽构成的奇异空中生物。它每次攻击都会驱使地下城中微弱的气流冲击目标，威力强烈取决于猎物周围有多少开阔空间。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:skyshark"
msgid ""
"Skysharks cut through the air with a thoughtless ease. Just a taste of blood\n"
"gives them an enraged strength, and further morsels drive them into a frenzy.\n"
msgstr ""
"天鲨自在地划过天空。\n"
"哪怕只有一丝血也能激起它们愤怒的力量，要是有更多的鲜血会使其陷入疯狂。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:sleepcap"
msgid ""
"A surprisingly ambulatory mushroom. It wafts its spores over prey to send them\n"
"into a deep sleep, making it simple for the fungus to kill and devour them.\n"
"It can take months for its mycelia to fully infiltrate and digest victims.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个令人惊奇的会走动的蘑菇。它能将孢子飘散到猎物身上，\n"
"使猎物进入深度睡眠，这样真菌就能轻易杀死并吞噬它们。\n"
"菌丝可能需要数月时间才能完全侵入并消化受害者。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:slime creature"
msgid ""
"An icky glob of slime that slithers along the ground. It can merge with other\n"
"slime creatures to become dramatically more dangerous, and is especially likely\n"
"to do so in confined spaces.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团黏稠的软泥在地上蠕动着。\n"
"它可以与其他黏液生物融合，会变得更加危险，尤其是在密闭空间中。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:small abomination"
msgid ""
"A hideous mass of body parts. Each varies in speed, strength, or resilience by\n"
"the nature of whatever unfortunates were used to make it.\n"
msgstr "一团可怕的肢体。根据用于制造它的不幸者的本性，每一只的速度、力量或耐受力都不同。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:smoke demon"
msgid ""
"An infernal demon that manifests itself as a writhing cloud of smoke. Having\n"
"considerable pyrokinetic powers, it can very effectively attack its enemies\n"
"from afar.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个地狱恶魔化身为一团翻腾的烟雾。\n"
"它拥有强大的火焰异能，可以在远处给予它的敌人巨大打击。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:snaplasher vine"
msgid ""
"A swift and sinuous vine brought alive by a dryad's magic. It can quickly bind\n"
"and entangle the dryad's foes, dragging them back to the forest from which it\n"
"surges.\n"
msgstr "一个迅捷而蜿蜒的藤蔓，被德律阿得斯用魔法赋予生命。\n它能快速将德律阿得斯的敌人束缚、缠绕住，将他们拖回它所涌现的森林。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:snaplasher vine segment"
msgid ""
"Part of a swift and sinuous vine brought alive by a dryad's magic. It can\n"
"quickly bind and entangle the dryad's foes, dragging them back to the forest\n"
"from which it surges.\n"
msgstr "一节迅捷而蜿蜒的藤蔓，被德律阿得斯用魔法赋予生命。\n它能快速将德律阿得斯的敌人束缚、缠绕住，将他们拖回它所涌现的森林。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:snapping turtle"
msgid ""
"A belligerent testudine with an armoured carapace. Its neck is surprisingly\n"
"extensible and can reach out and bite from afar.\n"
msgstr "一只长着坚硬甲壳的凶猛乌龟。它的脖子有惊人的延展性，可以从远处伸过来咬。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:soul eater"
msgid ""
"A demon that manifests as a malignantly shifting shadow gliding through the\n"
"air. It radiates an intense aura of negative force.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个恶魔看起来就像是一团恶意翻腾的阴影，在空气中滑过。\n"
"它散发着强烈的负能量力场。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:spark wasp"
msgid ""
"A profoundly unnatural insect covered in vaguely metallic plates. Its stinger\n"
"crackles with electricity, capable of delivering a powerful shock to unwary\n"
"victims, and is capable of closing the distance with them at shockingly\n"
"lethal speed.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个完全非自然的昆虫，身上像是覆盖着金属板。它的毒刺噼啪带着电，\n"
"能给那些不小心的受害者强大的电击，它也能以惊人的致命速度拉近与他们的距离。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:spatial maelstrom"
msgid ""
"A malevolent rift in reality, dissolving all terrain it passes by into swirling\n"
"vortices.\n"
msgstr "现实空间中的一个狂暴的裂口，能把它经过的所有地形溶解成旋涡。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:spatial vortex"
msgid "A crazily shifting twist in the fabric of reality.\n"
msgstr "一个在现实空间中的螺旋，疯狂地移动、变化着。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:spectral thing"
msgid "A hideous glowing apparition.\n"
msgstr "一个可怕的发着光的幽灵。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:spectral weapon"
msgid ""
"A spirit drawn from a weapon — it never strikes on its own. Damage done to it\n"
"will be partially mirrored onto the caster.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个从武器中汲取的灵魂——它永远不会自行攻击。\n"
"对它造成的损伤会部分反馈到施法者身上。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:spellspark servitor"
msgid ""
"A magical construct forged around a spark of its creator's own arcane power,\n"
"allowing it to wield some of their destructive magics directly.\n"
msgstr "一个围绕创造者自身奥术力量的一点火花锻造的魔法构造物，因此能够直接运用创造者的部分毁灭魔法。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:spriggan"
msgid ""
"A small humanoid, resembling a human or elf except for the size. It moves at a\n"
"great speed, and loves playing dirty tricks on people.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个小型人形生物，除了体形小了点之外和人类或精灵没什么区别。\n"
"他能快速移动，喜欢对人们搞点恶作剧。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:spriggan air mage"
msgid "A magically adept spriggan blessed with the secrets of the winds.\n"
msgstr "一个擅长魔法的斯普利根，通晓风的奥秘。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:spriggan berserker"
msgid "A relatively mighty spriggan that plunges recklessly into combat.\n"
msgstr "这个相对而言比较强壮的斯普利根总是一马当先冲入战斗之中。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:spriggan defender"
msgid ""
"An elite, well-equipped spriggan warrior, renowned for its unbelievable agility\n"
"and its prowess with advanced weaponry.\n"
msgstr ""
"一名装备精良的斯普利根战士，\n"
"他靠他精湛的武器技能和难以置信的灵巧赢得了同胞的尊敬。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:spriggan druid"
msgid ""
"A spriggan whose connection with the birds and the beasts is exceptionally\n"
"strong. If it dies, its sacrifice will heal and temporarily strengthen nearby\n"
"animals.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个斯普利根和飞鸟、野兽有着特别密切的联系。\n"
"如果它死了，它的牺牲会治愈并暂时增强附近的动物。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:spriggan rider"
msgid ""
"A spriggan that has tamed a hornet as its mount, and is tasked with protecting\n"
"the spriggan fens and cairns from intruders.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个以驯服了的大黄蜂作为座骑的斯普利根，\n"
"其使命是保护斯普利根沼泽和石冢免受入侵者的袭击。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:starcursed mass"
msgid ""
"A mass of stellar detritus that glows with the sickly putrescence of a dying\n"
"star, forever shrieking soundlessly in a voice beyond mortal grasp. Its form\n"
"undulates constantly, dividing spontaneously and then withdrawing when\n"
"threatened. When divided, its deafening chorus of screams can overwhelm the\n"
"minds of even the bravest warriors, leaving them stunned and helpless.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团星星的碎片，散发着垂死星星的病态腐化的光芒，永远无声地尖叫着，\n"
"发出凡人无法理解的声音。其形态常常在波动，自发地分裂，受到威胁时又缩回去。\n"
"当分裂时，它那震耳欲聋的齐声尖叫能压垮哪怕最勇敢的战士的理智，\n"
"使他们感到震惊和无助。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:starflower"
msgid ""
"A mass of lashing vines and tentacles growing out of the husk of a dead star.\n"
"Space itself runs through the xylem and phloem of its branches, which appear to\n"
"be in many places at once.\n"
msgstr ""
"从死星的外壳中长出的一团藤蔓和触须。\n"
"空间贯通着它的分支的木质部和韧皮部，它们似乎同时存在于许多地方。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:starspawn tentacle"
msgid ""
"The writhing appendage of a tentacled starspawn, capable of grasping nearly any\n"
"prey and dragging it back to be devoured. Any damage dealt to it hurts the\n"
"whole creature.\n"
msgstr ""
"星之眷族扭动的附肢，几乎能捕获任何猎物，并把它们拖回去吞食。\n"
"对它造成的任何伤害都能伤及整体。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:starspawn tentacle segment"
msgid ""
"A sinuous length of an extended starspawn tentacle. Any damage dealt to it\n"
"hurts the whole creature.\n"
msgstr "一段延伸而出的、弯曲的星之眷族触手。对它造成的任何伤害都能伤及整体。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:statue"
msgid ""
"A piece of sculpted granite with glowing red eyes. Although it is rooted to its\n"
"base, it can still move parts of itself.\n"
msgstr ""
"一块雕刻了的花岗岩，有着发光的红眼。\n"
"尽管它固定于底座，但身体的一部分仍能活动。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:steam dragon"
msgid ""
"A relatively small grey dragon, with a resilient-looking scaly hide and steam\n"
"pouring from its mouth.\n"
msgstr "一条相对较小的灰色龙，身上的鳞皮看起来很坚韧，口中不时喷出蒸汽。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:steelbarb worm"
msgid ""
"A large worm covered with hard, spiky metal plates. Despite the apparent\n"
"heaviness of its outer armour, it is rather fast.\n"
msgstr "一条覆有硬而多刺的金属板的大蠕虫。尽管它的外甲看起来很重，但速度相当快。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:stoker"
msgid ""
"A mortal who made an unholy pact in life, now chained to tend the fires of\n"
"hell in undeath as payment.\n"
msgstr "一个生前订下邪恶契约的凡人，如今化为亡灵，戴着锁链照看地狱烈火，以偿付代价。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:stone giant"
msgid ""
"A gigantic humanoid with grey skin almost as hard as rock. It carries several\n"
"boulders, and is perfectly capable of flinging them a great distance.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个巨大的人形生物，他的灰色表皮几乎和石头一样硬。\n"
"他携带着好几块巨石，而且完全有能力将巨石抛出很远。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:storm dragon"
msgid ""
"A powerful dragon with a hide of thick matte scales almost like blue rubber,\n"
"and enormous scaly wings crackling with sparks.\n"
msgstr ""
"一条非常强大的龙，它身上厚厚的、粗糙的鳞甲简直像是蓝色橡胶，\n"
"巨大无比的鳞翼，上面不时迸出电火花。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:strange machine"
msgid ""
"A strange mechanical contraption, all hisses and pops. Shadows seem to dance\n"
"across its reflective surface.\n"
msgstr "一个奇怪的机械装置，发出嘶嘶和砰砰声。 阴影似乎在其反射面上跃动着。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:sun demon"
msgid "A demonic figure shining with the heat and fury of a fallen star.\n"
msgstr "一个恶魔，身体散发着陨星的炽热和愤怒。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:sun moth"
msgid ""
"A moth of transcendent beauty, coated in pyrophoric scales. Tiny cinders dance\n"
"and twirl in its wake and whenever it beats its wings, they ignite in such\n"
"spectacular displays of incandescence that one could almost forget how far away\n"
"the sun is from this place.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只美丽绝伦的飞蛾，身上覆盖着发光鳞片。\n"
"微小的余烬在它的尾迹上飞舞盘旋，每当它扇动翅膀，\n"
"余烬就会燃烧出炽热的壮观景象，以至于人们几乎会忘记太阳离这里有多远。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:swamp dragon"
msgid ""
"A slimy dragon, its gnarly hide covered in swamp muck. Noxious gases dribble\n"
"from its snout.\n"
msgstr ""
"这条大型龙的身上满是黏液，它粗糙的表皮包裹在沼泽的污泥之中。\n"
"它的鼻孔不时喷出毒气。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:swamp drake"
msgid ""
"A small and slimy dragon, covered in swamp muck and giving off a terrible\n"
"stench.\n"
msgstr "这条小龙浑身上下都是黏液和污泥，散发着可怕的恶臭。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:swamp worm"
msgid "A large slimy worm, adept at traversing swamps and marshes.\n"
msgstr "一条满身黏液的蠕虫，擅长在沼泽的污泥中穿行。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:tarantella"
msgid ""
"A small but greatly-feared spider. Its touch alone causes victims to break into\n"
"a frenzied dance.\n"
msgstr "一种体型不大却令人极为畏惧的蜘蛛，仅仅触碰就能让受害者陷入狂舞。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:tainted leviathan"
msgid ""
"Before even the oldest of ancient liches mastered life and death, a group of\n"
"titans attempted to pull themselves free of mortality through brute strength.\n"
"They almost succeeded before rot dragged them to Ereshkigal. A glimmer of their\n"
"former beauty remains, alluring despite the stench.\n"
msgstr ""
"在最早的远古巫妖掌握生死之前，就曾有一群泰坦试图通过蛮力摆脱死亡。\n"
"在腐烂将他们拖到埃列什基伽勒那里之前，他们几乎要成功了。\n"
"尽管留有恶臭，但仍保留着他们昔日美丽的微光。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:tengu"
msgid ""
"A humanoid figure with the head and talons of a bird. Its ferociously combative\n"
"nature belies its fragile appearance.\n"
msgstr "一个人形生物，却长着鸟的头和爪子。他看似脆弱，其实十分好战。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:tengu conjurer"
msgid "A tengu with a talent for the destructive magical arts.\n"
msgstr "一个擅长破坏性魔法的天狗。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:tengu reaver"
msgid "An elite, ferocious tengu highly skilled with both steel and spells.\n"
msgstr "一个凶恶的天狗精英，擅长兵器和法术。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:tengu warrior"
msgid ""
"A particularly bloodthirsty tengu who has opted to hone its skill in airborne\n"
"fighting and weaponry instead of spellcasting.\n"
msgstr "一个极其嗜血的天狗，他选择磨炼自己的空中格斗和武器技能，而非施法。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:tentacle"
msgid ""
"The mighty tentacle of a kraken. Any damage dealt to it hurts the whole\n"
"creature.\n"
msgstr "这条健壮的触手是某个海妖的身体的一部分。对它造成的任何伤害都能伤及整体。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:tentacle segment"
msgid ""
"A part of the mighty tentacle of a kraken. Any damage dealt to it hurts the\n"
"whole creature.\n"
msgstr "某个海妖的健壮的触手的一部分。对它造成的任何伤害都能伤及整体。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:tentacled monstrosity"
msgid "A writhing mass of tentacles, all covered in putrid mucus.\n"
msgstr "一团翻腾蠕动的触手，上面粘满了腐臭的黏液。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:tentacled starspawn"
msgid ""
"A lumbering maw shrouded in a mass of sinuous tentacles. On spotting prey, its\n"
"tentacles lunge outward, dragging victims directly to its waiting gullet.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个迟缓的胃被大量弯曲的触手包裹着。\n"
"一旦发现猎物，它的触手就会向外冲去，把受害者直接拖入等待着的食管之中。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:thrashing horror"
msgid ""
"A seething mass of yellow flesh. It thrashes erratically, staggering foes\n"
"beneath the weight of its impacts.\n"
msgstr "一团翻滚的黄色肉团。它不规律地扭动着，在其冲撞的力量下，敌人摇摇晃晃。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:titan"
msgid ""
"A huge, bolt-hurling, lightning-limned humanoid. It is unusually large and\n"
"powerful, even among giants.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个巨大的人形生物，能投掷闪电束，身形被闪电所勾勒。\n"
"即使在巨人之中，他也是最大、最强的。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:thorn hunter"
msgid ""
"A predatory marsh plant, possessed of motility and a rudimentary intelligence.\n"
"It ensnares its prey with protrusions of spiny brambles and then skewers the\n"
"trapped creatures with its razor-sharp thorns.\n"
msgstr ""
"一种食肉的沼泽植物，有行动力和一定智力。\n"
"它会伸出荆棘捕捉猎物，然后用锋利的刺刺穿被困的生物。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:toadstool"
msgid ""
"A short-lived species of fungus typically found on or around decaying organic\n"
"matter.\n"
msgstr "这个短命的真菌通常只在腐烂的有机物附近出现。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:toenail golem"
msgid ""
"A huge animated statue made entirely from toenail clippings. Some people just\n"
"have too much time on their hands.\n"
msgstr "这尊巨大的会动的雕像完全由剪下的脚趾甲制成。某些人真是闲得没事做啊。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:tormentor"
msgid ""
"A malign devil covered in all manner of claws, spines, and cruel hooks. It is\n"
"able to inflict torturous agony on those foolish enough to gaze upon it.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个凶悍的恶魔身上全是爪子、骨刺、倒钩之类的东西。\n"
"它能让蠢到敢于直视它的人体验极端的痛苦。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:torpor snail"
msgid ""
"A ponderous gastropod with a rock-hard shell. It is said to be in some way\n"
"connected with the god Cheibriados; its very presence slows the movements of\n"
"unwary adventurers, leaving them easy prey for its terrifying, ever-gnashing\n"
"radulae.\n"
msgstr "一种行动迟缓、壳硬如岩石的腹足动物。据说与切布理亚多有某种联系；它仅仅在场，就会减缓冒失冒险者的行动，让他们轻易成为骇人、不断啃咬的齿舌下的猎物。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:training dummy"
msgid "A mannequin used for battle practice.\n"
msgstr "一个用于战斗训练的人偶。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:troll"
msgid ""
"A huge and physically powerful humanoid creature. Short on intelligence but\n"
"long on brawn, its thick knobbly hide heals rapidly from most wounds.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个体形巨大、身体强壮的人形生物。\n"
"他头脑简单，但肌肉发达，而且他那结节状的厚皮能迅速愈合大多数伤口。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:twister"
msgid "A whirling vortex of frost.\n"
msgstr "一个冰霜旋涡。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:two-headed ogre"
msgid ""
"A huge ogre with two heads on top of its bloated body. It is capable of holding\n"
"a weapon in each giant hand.\n"
msgstr "一个肥胖的食人魔，顶上长着两个脑袋。他的两只巨手能各持一件武器。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:tyrant leech"
msgid ""
"An exceptionally aggressive blood-sucking annelid that thrives in swamps and\n"
"marshlands.\n"
msgstr "一个极具攻击性的吸血的环节动物，它们在沼泽和湿地中兴旺地繁衍。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:tzitzimitl"
msgid ""
"A horrific fallen divinity, possessing jaws of gnashing stone and a necklace of\n"
"starry organs. It spreads disease and despair, and patiently awaits the end of\n"
"days when it will devour the sun.\n"
msgstr "一个可怕的堕落神灵，拥有啮合石块般的双颚，佩戴星光脏器串成的项链。它传播疾病与绝望，耐心等待末日，到那时便会吞噬太阳。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ufetubus"
msgid ""
"A chattering and shrieking minor demon. They delight in sneaking past and\n"
"backstabbing their prey.\n"
msgstr "这个低阶恶魔总爱发出啁啾声和尖啸声。他们喜欢溜过猎物，然后对其发动背刺。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ugly thing"
msgid ""
"An ugly thing. According to legend, it is the otherworldly spawn of a wizard's\n"
"breeding experiment. Yuck.\n"
msgstr "一个丑陋之物。传说，这种恐怖的变异生物是某个巫师的杂交实验的超自然产物。\n呕。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:unseen horror"
msgid ""
"A creature rarely seen by anyone; those few who have seen one would rather they\n"
"hadn't. It moves erratically.\n"
msgstr "这个生物很少被看到，那些看到过的少数人宁愿自己没看到过。它的运动没有规律。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ushabti"
msgid ""
"A funerary stone figurine kept in tombs to serve the deceased as they pass\n"
"through the afterlife. It is inscribed with spells to protect the interred for\n"
"eternity.\n"
msgstr "一种放在坟墓中的陪葬石偶，在死者通行来世时为其服务。上面的咒语会永远保护墓中人。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:vampire"
msgid ""
"A human cursed with vampirism, drifting in a state between life and undeath,\n"
"perpetually hungry for the blood of the living.\n"
msgstr "一个受到吸血鬼化诅咒的人类，游走在生与死之间，永远渴望着生者的鲜血。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:vampire bat"
msgid ""
"A large black bat with vicious fangs that feeds on blood. It is the preferred\n"
"form for vampires in disguise.\n"
msgstr "一只大型黑蝙蝠，长着獠牙，以血为食。吸血鬼喜欢伪装成这个形态。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:vampire knight"
msgid "A powerful vampire noble who complements its combat prowess with dark magic.\n"
msgstr "一个强大的吸血鬼贵族，用黑魔法完善他的战斗技能。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:vampire mage"
msgid ""
"A sorcerer who, by accident or design, has been afflicted with the curse of the\n"
"vampire. Regardless, through undeath, it has finally mastered the art of dark\n"
"magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"不管是自愿的还是被迫的，这名术士是受到了吸血的诅咒。\n"
"但不管怎么说，在不死之力的帮助下，这名法师终于完全掌握了黑暗魔法的奥秘。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:vampire mosquito"
msgid ""
"A mosquito that has fed upon tainted blood and been transformed into a\n"
"revolting and pestilent undead insect, seeking to drain its victims to the last\n"
"drop.\n"
msgstr ""
"这只蚊子以受污染的血液为食，变成了一只令人作呕、散播疾病的亡灵昆虫。\n"
"它的目的是将它的猎物吸干——一滴不留。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:vault guard"
msgid "A heavily armed and armoured guardian of the Vaults.\n"
msgstr "宝库的卫兵之一，武器、盔甲装备精良。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:vault sentinel"
msgid ""
"A vigilant scout, quick to alert its fellows to the presence of intruders. It\n"
"marks such intruders with powerful magic, making them unable to hide from\n"
"pursuit no matter where they flee.\n"
msgstr "一名警觉的斥候，发现入侵者后会迅速警告同伴，并以强大魔法标记入侵者，使其不论逃到哪里都无法躲避追捕。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:vault warden"
msgid ""
"A veteran commander, able to seal nearby doorways and staircases to prevent\n"
"intruders from either trespassing further or escaping alive.\n"
msgstr ""
"一名经验丰富的指挥官，能封锁附近的门廊和楼梯，\n"
"以免入侵者继续侵入或逃之夭夭。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:very ugly thing"
msgid ""
"A very ugly thing. According to legend, it is the otherworldly spawn of a\n"
"wizard's breeding experiment. Double yuck!\n"
msgstr "一个极丑陋之物。\n传说，这种恐怖的变异生物是某个巫师的杂交实验的超自然产物。呕，呕！\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:vine stalker"
msgid ""
"A bizarre symbiotic creature, made up of a carnivorous vine magically combined\n"
"with a humanoid.\n"
msgstr "一个奇异的共生生物，由食肉藤蔓与人形生物神奇地结合而成。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:void ooze"
msgid ""
"The viscous detritus of a thousand failed spells, surging forward with unnerving\n"
"speed. Its very substance is a hole in the fabric of magic; enchantments find no\n"
"purchase there and even momentary contact with it can leave one's spells greatly\n"
"diminished.\n"
msgstr "千次失败法术留下的黏稠残渣，以令人不安的速度向前涌动。它的本质就是魔法织构上的孔洞，附魔无法在其中驻留，即使短暂接触也会使人的法术大幅减弱。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:walking earthen tome"
msgid ""
"A spellbook that has gone too long without being read. It overflows with magic,\n"
"forming thick armour from its binding, legs from its pages, and periodically\n"
"erupting in flurries of free-floating, self-casting spells.\n"
"\n"
"It is coated with impossibly ancient dust.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本很久没有读过的魔法书。它充满魔力，它的封皮形成了厚厚的盔甲，\n"
"书页长出了腿，并周期性地爆出自由飘浮的自行施放的法术。\n"
"\n"
"它被一层不可思议的古老灰尘覆盖着。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:walking crystal tome"
msgid ""
"A spellbook that has gone too long without being read. It overflows with magic,\n"
"forming thick armour from its binding, legs from its pages, and periodically\n"
"erupting in flurries of free-floating, self-casting spells.\n"
"\n"
"It is encrusted with long, sharp, deadly-looking crystals.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本很久没有读过的魔法书。它充满魔力，它的封皮形成了厚厚的盔甲，\n"
"书页长出了腿，并周期性地爆出自由飘浮的自行施放的法术。\n"
"\n"
"它镶嵌着长而锋利的致命水晶。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:walking divine tome"
msgid ""
"A spellbook that has gone too long without being read. It overflows with magic,\n"
"forming thick armour from its binding, legs from its pages, and periodically\n"
"erupting in flurries of free-floating, self-casting spells.\n"
"\n"
"Its cover bears the icon of a long-forgotten god, still fully possessed of wrath.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本很久没有读过的魔法书。它充满魔力，它的封皮形成了厚厚的盔甲，\n"
"书页长出了腿，并周期性地爆出自由飘浮的自行施放的法术。\n"
"\n"
"它的封面上有一个被遗忘已久的神像，仍然充满着愤怒。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:walking frostbound tome"
msgid ""
"A spellbook that has gone too long without being read. It overflows with magic,\n"
"forming thick armour from its binding, legs from its pages, and periodically\n"
"erupting in flurries of free-floating, self-casting spells.\n"
"\n"
"It glistens with a thick layer of unmelting ice.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本很久没有读过的魔法书。它充满魔力，它的封皮形成了厚厚的盔甲，\n"
"书页长出了腿，并周期性地爆出自由飘浮的自行施放的法术。\n"
"\n"
"它那层未融化的坚冰在闪烁着。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:walking tome"
msgid ""
"A spellbook that has gone too long without being read. It overflows with magic,\n"
"forming thick armour from its binding, legs from its pages, and periodically\n"
"erupting in flurries of free-floating, self-casting spells.\n"
msgstr ""
"一本很久没有读过的魔法书。它充满魔力，它的封皮形成了厚厚的盔甲，\n"
"书页长出了腿，并周期性地爆出自由飘浮的自行施放的法术。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:wandering mushroom"
msgid ""
"A large, fleshy mushroom that wanders slowly around the dungeon. It is both\n"
"innately curious and incredibly shy, pursuing the objects of its curiosity only\n"
"when out of sight. Noxious spores drift around its cap.\n"
msgstr "一个在地下城中慢慢游走的大型肉质蘑菇。它有与生俱来的好奇心，而且又非常害羞，\n只有在没有人看着的时候才会去追寻引起它好奇心的东西。\n它的菌帽旁有毒性孢子在飘动。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:warg"
msgid "A particularly evil-looking wolf, usually found in the company of orcs.\n"
msgstr "一条体形巨大、面目狰狞的狼，通常和兽人一起出现。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:war gargoyle"
msgid ""
"A rare type of gargoyle, constructed from a solid steel statue and imbued with\n"
"vicious strength, speed, and weaponised breath.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个罕见的石像鬼，由坚固的钢铁雕像幻化而成，\n"
"浸入了邪恶的力量、速度和能造成伤害的吐息。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:water elemental"
msgid ""
"A spirit drawn from the elemental plane of water. It exists on this world as\n"
"part of a body of water and can engulf other beings in its form, depriving them\n"
"of breath and voice.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个来自水元素位面的灵体。它作为水体的一部分存在于这个世界上，\n"
"在这个形态下可以吞没其他生物，让他们无法呼吸、发出声音。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:water moccasin"
msgid ""
"A largish venomous brown snake. It usually lives near water, and is an able\n"
"swimmer.\n"
msgstr "一条体形较大的棕色毒蛇。它通常生活在水边，擅长游泳。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:water nymph"
msgid ""
"A capricious nature spirit, deeply bonded with the waters in which it lives.\n"
"Wherever they flow, so may it, and ponds and rivers surge and leap at its\n"
"whim.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个反复无常自然之灵，与她所栖息的水域紧密相连。\n"
"它们流到哪里，她就会到哪里，池塘和河流也会因为她的兴起而汹涌澎湃。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:weeping skull"
msgid ""
"An undead skull kept aloft by unholy clouds of collective misery, which slowly\n"
"drift out in its wake. It mourns without end for the living, the dead, and its\n"
"own former life all alike.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个被聚集的邪恶愁云托起的亡灵头骨，云层在它的身后慢慢飘出。\n"
"它为生者、死者和它自己的前世无休止地哀悼着。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:wendigo"
msgid ""
"A gaunt spirit of frozen hunger, so ravenous it will consume friend and foe\n"
"alike. According to legend, if one cuts off its legs, it will feast upon its own\n"
"marrow. It stalks those lost wandering in the cold and hunts with the force of\n"
"blizzards.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个冰冷饥饿、枯槁的灵魂，如此贪婪，以至于无论敌人还是朋友，它都要吞噬。\n"
"传说，如果砍掉它的腿，它甚至会朵颐自己的骨髓。\n"
"在寒冷的地方它会跟踪那些徘徊着的迷路的人，并会用暴风雪的力量进行猎杀。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:white draconian"
msgid "A muscular white-scaled humanoid with a reptilian tail and small wings.\n"
msgstr "一个肌肉发达、长有白色鳞片的人形生物，有着爬行动物的尾巴和小翅膀。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:white imp"
msgid "A small and mischievous minor demon covered in frost.\n"
msgstr "一个小而调皮的低阶恶魔，浑身都是冰霜。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:wight"
msgid ""
"An ancient warrior, kept in a state of perpetual undeath by its desire to die\n"
"with honour in battle.\n"
msgstr "一位古代战士，怀着在战斗中光荣地死去的执念而永远保持着不死状态。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:will-o-the-wisp"
msgid ""
"A green-glowing gaseous entity, flickering and pulsing irregularly as it hovers\n"
"through the air. Travelers have been known to confuse these for distant lanterns -\n"
"a mistake rarely made twice.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个绿色发光的气态实体，悬在空中，时时不规则地闪烁、悸动。\n"
"众所周知，旅行者会将这些与远方的灯笼相混淆——这种错误很少有机会犯两次。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:wind drake"
msgid ""
"A small but powerful dragon, particularly adept amongst its kin at manipulating\n"
"the currents of air that surround it. It can exhale powerful blasts of wind.\n"
msgstr "一条小而强大的龙，在它的同类中它尤为善于操控周围的气流。它能呼出强烈的风。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:wolf"
msgid "A strong wild canine, with sharp teeth and a healthy appetite.\n"
msgstr "一条强壮的犬科动物，拥有尖利的牙齿和旺盛的食欲。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:wolf spider"
msgid ""
"A hairy fast-moving hunting spider with vicious mandibles, the size of a wolf.\n"
"It roams the dungeon in search of prey, which it kills with its deadly venom.\n"
msgstr "一个多毛的、行动快速的猎蛛，有凶恶的下颚，体形像狼那么大。\n它在地下城中漫游以寻找猎物，并用致命的毒液将其杀死。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:worldbinder"
msgid ""
"A cloud of thick fog, with faint, feeble claws constantly reaching out and then\n"
"fading back into the fog. When threatened, it calls forth creatures banished to\n"
"the void between realities, using them to defend itself.\n"
msgstr "一团浓雾，朦胧无力的爪子不断伸出，又消失回雾中。受到威胁时，它会唤出被放逐到现实之间虚空的生物，用它们保护自己。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:wraith"
msgid ""
"A cloud of black mist surrounding an insubstantial skeletal form. Its eyes burn\n"
"bright with unholy malevolence and hunger for life essence, on which it feeds.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团黑色的薄雾裹挟着一具虚无的骷髅。\n"
"它的眼中闪烁着不洁的恶意，以及对吞食生命精华的渴望。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:wretched star"
msgid ""
"A conflux of unearthly light and energy, awash in unnatural colours and strange\n"
"forms no normal being was meant to perceive. It fills all those in its presence\n"
"with the disorder of the Abyss.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个诡异的光线和能量的聚合物，充斥着不自然的色彩和奇怪的形态，\n"
"非正常人所能理解。他会让所有在它面前的人充满深渊的混乱。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:wyvern"
msgid ""
"A dragon-like creature with a long, sharply pointed tail. Although smaller and\n"
"less formidable than true dragons, it is nonetheless a foe to be reckoned with.\n"
msgstr ""
"这条类龙生物长有一条长长的尖尾巴。虽然双足飞龙体形比真龙小，\n"
"而且也没有真龙那么可怕，但它仍然是一个不容小觑的敌人。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:yak"
msgid ""
"A common dungeon yak, covered in shaggy yak hair and bearing a nasty pair of\n"
"yak horns.\n"
msgstr "一头普通的地下城牦牛，身上长满蓬松的牛毛，头上长着一对尖锐的牛角。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:yaktaur"
msgid ""
"A hybrid with the torso of a robust human atop the body of a yak. It excels in\n"
"ranged combat, and is also a formidable foe in close quarters.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个混种生物，在牦牛的身体上有着人的躯干。\n"
"他不但擅长远程战斗，近战方面也是个强大的敌人。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:yaktaur captain"
msgid ""
"An exceptionally strong and brutish yaktaur, able to order its weaker brethren\n"
"around to do its bidding.\n"
msgstr "一个异常强壮、野蛮的半人牛，能够让他较弱的兄弟服从他的命令。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:yellow draconian"
msgid "A muscular yellow-scaled humanoid with a reptilian tail and small wings.\n"
msgstr "一个肌肉发达、长有黄色鳞片的人形生物，有着爬行动物的尾巴和小翅膀。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ynoxinul"
msgid ""
"A winged demon covered in shiny metallic scales. It has a legion of minor\n"
"demons under its command.\n"
msgstr "一个有翼的恶魔，身上覆有闪耀的金属鳞片。它指挥着一个低阶恶魔军团。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:zombie"
msgid "A corpse raised to undeath by necromancy.\n"
msgstr "一具被死灵法术复活的尸体。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:test spawner"
msgid ""
"(If you see this outside wizmode or the arena, this is a bug.)\n"
"\n"
"Whatever it is, it is capable of spawning countless monsters by casting Shadow\n"
"Creatures, and is virtually undestructible itself.\n"
"\n"
"To destroy it, lower the central elevator pillar, then pump rockets into the\n"
"hole in its exposed brain when the pillar rises to an appropriate height. You\n"
"can add another rocket while jumping down.\n"
"\n"
"Oh wait, wrong game.\n"
msgstr ""
"（若在巫师模式或竞技场之外见到它，便是程序错误。）\n"
"\n"
"不管它是什么，都能施放阴影生物，产生无数怪物，而自身几乎坚不可摧。\n"
"\n"
"要摧毁它，先降下中央升降柱，等柱子升到适当高度时，向它暴露脑部的洞口发射火箭。跳下时还能再补一发。\n"
"\n"
"哦，等等，串游戏了。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ghost"
msgid ""
"The remains of a monster that existed in an older version, but has since been\n"
"removed.\n"
msgstr "旧版中怪物的残骸，但已经被移除。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:sensed monster"
msgid "A hostile monster whose presence has been detected.\n"
msgstr "一个敌对怪物，其存在已被察觉。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:trivial sensed monster"
msgid ""
"A trivially weak monster whose presence has been revealed by the power of\n"
"Ashenzari.\n"
msgstr "一个微不足道的弱小怪物，其存在已被艾申扎利的力量所揭示。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:easy sensed monster"
msgid "A weak monster whose presence has been revealed by the power of Ashenzari.\n"
msgstr "一个弱小怪物，其存在已被艾申扎利的力量所揭示。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:tough sensed monster"
msgid ""
"A somewhat dangerous monster whose presence has been revealed by the power of\n"
"Ashenzari.\n"
msgstr "一个有一定危险性的怪物，其存在已被艾申扎利的力量所揭示。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:nasty sensed monster"
msgid ""
"A very dangerous monster whose presence has been revealed by the power of\n"
"Ashenzari.\n"
msgstr "一个非常危险的怪物，其存在已被艾申扎利的力量所揭示。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:friendly sensed monster"
msgid ""
"A friendly monster whose presence has been {{\n"
"    if you.god() == \"Ashenzari\" then\n"
"        return \"revealed by the power of Ashenzari\"\n"
"    else\n"
"        return \"detected\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个友好的怪物，其存在已被{{\n"
"    if you.god() == \"Ashenzari\" then\n"
"        return \"艾申扎利的力量所揭示\"\n"
"    else\n"
"        return \"察觉\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:cloud mage"
msgid ""
"A strange wizard who has attained mastery over clouds, making deft and\n"
"foreboding mystic gestures.\n"
msgstr ""
"这位奇怪的法师已经掌握了云雾的奥秘，\n"
"他的施法的神秘手势不仅娴熟而且还给人一种威压感。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:head instructor"
msgid ""
"A powerful warrior-mage who instructs aspiring students in physical, magical,\n"
"and anti-magical combat.\n"
msgstr "一位强大的战斗法师，指导有抱负的学生进行物理、魔法和反魔法战斗。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:hellbinder"
msgid ""
"A mighty spellcaster wreathed in arcane energies, muttering profane\n"
"incantations.\n"
msgstr "一位强大的施法者，全身被包裹在奥术能量中，呢喃着肮脏、亵渎的咒语。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:master blaster"
msgid ""
"A mighty old lich, notorious for blasting people with powerful conjurations at\n"
"the slightest provocation, or just on a whim.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个强大的老巫妖，它臭名昭著，因为它只要受到一点挑拨\n"
"（甚至有时只是心情不好）就会用强大的塑能法术轰杀别人。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:statue of wucad mu"
msgid ""
"A statue made of a fine glassy orange crystal. It depicts a mystic known as\n"
"Wucad Mu, who mastered the matters of the mind, and is imbued with Wucad Mu's\n"
"powers of mental combat.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个由精细的橙色玻璃水晶制成的雕像。\n"
"它所刻画的是一位掌握了心灵奥秘的的秘术师——乌卡德·穆，\n"
"而这尊雕像也充满了乌卡德·穆的精神战斗能力。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:moon troll"
msgid ""
"A bizarre breed of intelligent troll, glowing with mysterious power from beyond\n"
"this world which shields it from damage except at close range.\n"
msgstr "一种奇异的智慧巨魔，闪耀着来自世外的神秘力量，保护它免受远距离伤害。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:lunar statue"
msgid "<zot statue>\n"
msgstr "<zot statue>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:air elementalist statue"
msgid ""
"A delicate statue of a tengu gliding through the air. It looks quite\n"
"insubstantial.\n"
msgstr "一尊精美的雕像，雕的是一个在空中滑翔的天狗。它看起来虚无缥缈。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:antique champion"
msgid ""
"An unfathomably expensive skeleton. It has countless sigils engraved into its\n"
"bones, and pulses with a ghostly presence.\n"
msgstr "一具贵得不可理喻的骷髅。它的骨头上刻有无数的印记，脉动着幽灵的存在。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:archer statue"
msgid ""
"A statue of a beautiful elven archer, sculpted in finest marble. It holds a\n"
"bow aloft, and appears to be magically animated, letting it use the bow to\n"
"riddle intruders with arrows.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个美丽的精灵射手雕像，由最好的大理石雕刻而成。\n"
"它高举着弓，似乎有了魔力，能用弓箭把入侵者射得满是窟窿。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:bog mummy"
msgid ""
"An undead figure preserved by the brackish waters of a bog. It has begun to\n"
"decay heavily, and looks fragile.\n"
msgstr ""
"这个亡灵生物的身体被沼泽的咸水保存起来。\n"
"它已经腐朽得很严重了，看起来很脆弱。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:captured wizard"
msgid ""
"A wild-eyed wizard whose tongue has been cut out, frantically mumbling and\n"
"waving its arms but unable to cast a single spell.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个怒目而视的巫师。\n"
"他的舌头已被割下，疯狂地咕哝着，挥舞着手臂，但就是连一个法术也施展不了。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:charred statue"
msgid ""
"A statue that has been imbued with flame, allowing it to make use of simple\n"
"fire-based conjurations.\n"
msgstr "看起来，这尊雕像被灌入了火焰魔法，赋予它使用一些简单的火系塑能术的能力。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:cigotuvi's monster"
msgid ""
"A terrifying creation that appears to have been constructed from the body parts\n"
"of every monstrous creature imaginable, with writhing tentacles sprouting from\n"
"its form.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个可怕的造物，由各种所能想像到的各种怪物的身体部件拼凑而成，\n"
"扭曲的触手从它的身体中蠕动出来。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:conjurer statue"
msgid ""
"A statue able to harness the mightiest of pure conjurations ever devised by\n"
"Iskenderun.\n"
msgstr "一尊能驾驭伊斯肯德伦所发明的最强大纯粹塑能系法术的雕像。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:deformed humanoid"
msgid "A poor creature that looks hideously deformed.\n"
msgstr "这个可怜的生物外表严重畸形。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:demonic plant"
msgid ""
"A demonic mockery of a plant, covered with mysterious appendages and writhing\n"
"tentacles. It appears to be harmless.\n"
msgstr "一个恶魔般恶劣的植物，满是神秘的附肢和蠕动的触手。它似乎是无害的。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:dimme"
msgid ""
"A terrible creature with demonic ancestry. Its presence is horrifying, but\n"
"supernaturally compelling.\n"
msgstr "有着恶魔血统的可怕生物。它的存在是令人畏惧的、超出寻常、难以抗拒的。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:drunken dwarf"
msgid ""
"A dwarf who seems to be working as an ale quality tester, and is enjoying the\n"
"job a little too much.\n"
msgstr "这个矮人的工作是检验酒的质量。他似乎有点太享受他的工作了。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:earth elementalist statue"
msgid "A plain statue of a dwarf wielding a pickaxe. It looks incredibly heavy.\n"
msgstr "一尊普通的矮人雕像，雕像的手中拿着一把鹤嘴锄。它看起来重得要命。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:fire elementalist statue"
msgid ""
"An ornately worked statue of an orc holding a torch aloft, hewn from black\n"
"basalt. The air around it shimmers.\n"
msgstr "一尊由黑色玄武岩雕成的华丽兽人像，高举着火炬。周围空气微微晃动。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:flesh golem"
msgid "An animated mound of misshapen flesh, sculpted over an iron skeleton.\n"
msgstr "一团会动的畸形肉堆，在铁骨架上塑成。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:frost-covered statue"
msgid "A statue of a mage, with frost constantly forming across its surface.\n"
msgstr "一尊法师雕像，其表面不断生成冰霜。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ghost-faced bat"
msgid "A bat with a spectral visage.\n"
msgstr "一只有着幽灵般面孔的蝙蝠。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:giga bat"
msgid "An enormous, bloated bat.\n"
msgstr "一只膨胀的巨型蝙蝠。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:greater air elemental"
msgid ""
"A mighty spirit drawn from the elemental plane of air, surrounded by a\n"
"deadly vortex of frost.\n"
msgstr "一个来自气元素位面的强大灵体，周围环绕着致命的冰霜旋涡。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ice bat"
msgid "An undead creature in the shape of a bat, made of ice.\n"
msgstr "一个蝙蝠形的亡灵生物，它的身体是由冰构成的。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:flame-cult kobold"
msgid "A kobold that has been enchanted to explode in a blaze of fire.\n"
msgstr "一个受到附魔、会爆为一团烈焰的狗头人。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:mad acolyte of lugonu"
msgid "A devoted follower of Lugonu, driven mad by years of living in the Abyss.\n"
msgstr "一个卢戈努的忠实追随者，被多年的深渊里的生活逼疯了。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:malarious merfolk avatar"
msgid ""
"A young merfolk that looks deeply ill, but is still capable of bespelling its\n"
"audience.\n"
msgstr "一个年轻的人鱼，看起来病得很重，但仍能吸引听众。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:master elementalist"
msgid "A demented wizard commanding the primal forces of the universe.\n"
msgstr "一个控制着宇宙原始力量的疯狂巫师。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:megabat"
msgid "A huge black bat.\n"
msgstr "一个巨大的黑色蝙蝠。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:microbat"
msgid "A bat that, despite its name, is not any smaller than a megabat.\n"
msgstr "虽然这只蝙蝠的名字里没有“大”字，但其实它并不比大蝙蝠要小。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:spectator"
msgid "A follower of Okawaru, granted the honour of spectating a duel to the death.\n"
msgstr "一个奥格瓦如的追随者，被赐予观看生死决斗的殊荣。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:oklob plant annihilator"
msgid ""
"A mere plant that has somehow attained sentience and the use of magic, by some\n"
"inconceivable sorcery.\n"
msgstr "它虽然只是个植物，却通过某种不可思议的魔力，获得了知觉和使用魔法的能力。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:oklob plant conjurer"
msgid "<oklob plant annihilator>\n"
msgstr "<oklob plant annihilator>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:oklob plant demonologist"
msgid "<oklob plant annihilator>\n"
msgstr "<oklob plant annihilator>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:oklob plant meteorologist"
msgid "<oklob plant annihilator>\n"
msgstr "<oklob plant annihilator>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:oklob plant shifter"
msgid "<oklob plant annihilator>\n"
msgstr "<oklob plant annihilator>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:oklob plant summoner"
msgid "<oklob plant annihilator>\n"
msgstr "<oklob plant annihilator>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:oklob sapling priest"
msgid "An immature oklob plant that seems to be mumbling some orisons... er, what?!?\n"
msgstr "这株幼年奥克罗布植物似乎在咕哝某种咒语……呃，啥鬼？！\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:oklob sapling wizard"
msgid "<oklob plant annihilator>\n"
msgstr "<oklob plant annihilator>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:orb golem"
msgid ""
"A metal golem crackling with magical energies. It must have been created by\n"
"a truly devious wizard, or possibly someone who misheard what monsters could\n"
"be found in the Realm of Zot.\n"
msgstr ""
"一尊金属魔像，身上的魔法能量噼啪作响。它一定是由一位非常狡猾的巫师创造的，\n"
"或者是有人听错了能在佐特领域发现哪些怪物。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:phase bat"
msgid ""
"A strange, glowing bat that flutters through more dimensions than the average\n"
"bat.\n"
msgstr "这只奇怪的发光蝙蝠似乎同时在多个次元中飞行着。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:phase spider"
msgid ""
"An otherworldly spider that can move short and medium distances by briefly\n"
"shifting between the planes of reality, in order to better ensnare its prey.\n"
msgstr ""
"这只奇异的蜘蛛通过在多个现实位面中相位来快速进行中短距离移动，\n"
"以便更轻松地捕住它的猎物。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:pristine statue"
msgid ""
"An immaculately sculpted porphyry statue of an archer poised to release a bolt,\n"
"with a full quiver at the hip.\n"
msgstr ""
"一尊雕刻得很完美的斑岩雕像，其形象是一名正要放箭的弓箭手，\n"
"他的臀部有一个装满了的箭筒。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:rotten bat"
msgid "A bat that is well past its sell-by date.\n"
msgstr "一个早已过了保质期的蝙蝠。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:sickly merfolk siren"
msgid ""
"A young merfolk that looks quite sick, but still has the power to mesmerise its\n"
"victims.\n"
msgstr "一个年轻的人鱼，看样子病得不轻，但仍有迷惑其受害者的能力。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:skeletal bat"
msgid ""
"A bat skeleton without the decency to lie unmoving like dead bats are supposed\n"
"to.\n"
msgstr "这只骷髅蝙蝠就是不肯像正常的死蝙蝠一样趴在地上一动不动。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:water elementalist statue"
msgid ""
"A smooth statue of a beautiful merfolk bathing in a fountain, sculpted from\n"
"creamy, faintly pinkish travertine. It glistens softly in the light.\n"
msgstr "一尊光滑的在泉中沐浴的人鱼雕像，由奶油色、略带浅粉色的钙华雕刻而成。\n它在光线下中柔和地闪耀着。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:witch"
msgid ""
"An old and unnaturally ugly human, wearing robes stained with what appears to\n"
"be swamp ooze, cauldron soot and brew ingredients.\n"
msgstr "一个年老而异常丑陋的人，所穿的长袍上沾染着沼泽淤泥、大锅的烟灰和酿造原料。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:withered plant"
msgid ""
"A plant whose life has been drained away, but with its physical form still\n"
"intact. It looks like it died many {{ if you.branch() == \"Crypt\" or\n"
"you.branch() == \"Tomb\" or you.branch() == \"Zot\" then return \"centuries\";\n"
"else return \"years\"; end }} ago.\n"
msgstr ""
"这株植物的生命已被吸干，但躯体仍然完整。看起来已死去许多{{ if you.branch() == \"Crypt\" or\n"
"you.branch() == \"Tomb\" or you.branch() == \"Zot\" then return \"个世纪\";\n"
"else return \"年\"; end }}。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:worm"
msgid "A giant annelid, glistening with slime, with unusually large teeth.\n"
msgstr "一条巨大的环节动物，身上的黏液闪烁着，牙齿大得出奇。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:zin angel"
msgid ""
"A divine agent of Zin. It is a towering winged figure with an aura of brilliant\n"
"white light. Its face is marked by a scowl, as if its zeal against any real or\n"
"perceived vice overshadows its goodness.\n"
msgstr "辛的神圣使者，身形高大、背生双翼，环绕明亮白光。它面带怒容，仿佛对真实或自以为存在的罪恶的狂热，已盖过本身的善意。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:zot statue"
msgid ""
"A profoundly disturbing statue, hewn from a single piece of dark gabbro\n"
"scintillating with tiny crystals. It is impossible to tell whether it is\n"
"intended to represent some creature or personage, or to be completely abstract.\n"
msgstr ""
"一尊令人深感不安的雕像，只用一块黑色辉长岩雕刻而成，\n"
"上面的小水晶块还闪着微光。很难说它是在表现某种动物或人物，还是完全抽象。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:dire wolf spider"
msgid "<wolf spider>\n"
msgstr "<wolf spider>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:giant anaconda"
msgid "<anaconda>\n"
msgstr "<anaconda>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:greater orb of eyes"
msgid "<great orb of eyes>\n"
msgstr "<great orb of eyes>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:naga warlord"
msgid "<naga warrior>\n"
msgstr "<naga warrior>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:sulphuric acid blob"
msgid "<acid blob>\n"
msgstr "<acid blob>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:vault guard captain"
msgid "<vault guard>\n"
msgstr "<vault guard>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:bag of meat"
msgid ""
"One of the legions of abominations created by the sculptors of flesh. It is a\n"
"horrendous imitation of the human form, consisting of an unrecognisable mass of\n"
"meat stitched together with limbs sewn on seemingly at random. Its skin hangs\n"
"off loosely in some places and bulges repulsively in others. Each one bears a\n"
"large symbol carved into its flesh, a mark of pride from its twisted creator.\n"
msgstr ""
"由肉雕师制造的憎恶军团中的一员。\n"
"这是一件可怕的人形仿制品，由一大堆无法辨认的肉连在一起，\n"
"肢体似乎随意缝在上面。在有些地方它的皮肤松弛下垂，有些地方则臃肿地隆起。\n"
"每个都有着一个刻在其肉里的巨大符号，这是其性格扭曲的创造者的骄傲的象征。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:large bag of meat"
msgid ""
"One of the legions of abominations created by the sculptors of flesh. Its\n"
"bloated hulk pulsates and throbs constantly with accursed fires. It looks as if\n"
"it could explode into a torrent of viscera at any moment.\n"
msgstr ""
"由肉雕师制造的憎恶军团中的一员。它那肿胀的身躯随着诅咒的火焰不停悸动着。\n"
"它似乎随时都有可能爆成内脏的洪流。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:meat berserker"
msgid ""
"One of the legions of abominations created by the sculptors of flesh. Its form\n"
"is large and muscular. It moves swiftly and with impetuous fury, the sole\n"
"thought within its being to rend you apart with great fervour. As it rages, it\n"
"creates a cacophonous din.\n"
msgstr ""
"由肉雕师制造的憎恶军团中的一员。它的体形很壮硕。\n"
"它移动迅速而狂暴，唯一的念头就是激情地把你撕碎。\n"
"当它狂怒时，会发出刺耳的噪音。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:meat hydra"
msgid ""
"One of the legions of abominations created by the sculptors of flesh. Each of\n"
"its eight necks is distended and elongated, connected to a colossal body\n"
"crumpled and dripping with ichor. Its many heads spew blood while writhing and\n"
"convulsing in agony, as it brings torment to itself and anything else that\n"
"beholds its foul visage.\n"
msgstr ""
"由肉雕师制造的憎恶军团中的一员。\n"
"它的八个脖子都被伸展拉长，与一个起皱的、滴着腐液的巨大身体相连。\n"
"它的许多头痛苦地翻滚、痉挛着，并吐出鲜血，\n"
"它给它自己和任何见到它那污秽容貌的人带来了痛苦。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:meat beast"
msgid ""
"One of the legions of abominations created by the sculptors of flesh. Ablaze\n"
"with demonic frenzy, it gores and tramples with ferocity unmatched. Its skin is\n"
"flayed, exposing the glistening tendons and sinew underneath, and the teeth\n"
"inside its cavernous maw are stained with blood.\n"
msgstr "血肉领主的肉雕师制造的憎恶军团之一。它燃烧着恶魔狂乱，凶猛无比地顶撞、践踏。皮肤被剥开，露出闪亮的筋腱，洞穴般巨口内的牙齿沾满鲜血。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:sculptor of flesh"
msgid ""
"An artisan of unlife, the sculptor appears as a grim skeletal form. It has six\n"
"long arms ending in mangled hands with broken fingers, upon which it crawls\n"
"like a spider. Its skull is abnormally large and full of holes. Its bones are\n"
"reddened and fractured, inscribed with the unholy spells it weaves to assemble\n"
"its puppets.\n"
msgstr ""
"这位雕工是亡灵的工匠，外形是阴冷的骨架。\n"
"它有六支长臂，末端是残缺的手掌和断了的手指，利用这些它像一只蜘蛛一样爬行。\n"
"它的头骨异常的大而且布满了洞。\n"
"它的骨头发红并断裂，上面刻有它用来装配傀儡的邪恶咒语。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:destroyer"
msgid ""
"The destroyers begin to descend upon you. They come in numbers and with wrath,\n"
"maws gaping like abaddon, bottomless and abyssal. They bring your doom and will\n"
"feast on your remains.\n"
msgstr "毁灭者开始向你降临。它们成群而来，满怀怒火，巨口张开如毁灭之渊，深不见底。它们带来你的末日，并将饱食你的遗骸。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:accursed"
msgid ""
"The accursed are the ones who came before. They have come to ensure you share\n"
"their fate.\n"
msgstr "被诅咒者是先前亡故的人。他们想让你也陷入他们的命运。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:tyrant"
msgid ""
"A colossal mass of bones and skulls, a walking tomb. You hear shrieks and\n"
"screams as it approaches, shattering off bones with each crushing step,\n"
"reassembling itself in eternal unrest.\n"
msgstr ""
"大堆骨头和头骨，它简直是个行走的坟墓。当它接近时，你会听到尖叫和呼啸，\n"
"每个步伐都是毁灭性的，骨头在碎裂，同时又无休止地进行重组。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:dread"
msgid ""
"An affront to existence, a void in which there is only torment and damnation.\n"
"Its unearthly form is torn and twisted, black and hollow. It is bereft of\n"
"rational thought, knowing only hatred and the desire to desecrate your soul.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个对存在冒犯的虚无，徒留折磨和诅咒。它那怪异的形态被撕裂扭曲，漆黑空洞。\n"
"它失去了理智，只怀有仇恨和亵渎你灵魂的欲望。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:scourge"
msgid ""
"A vast serpentine form with raw and diseased skin, seeping bile and pus,\n"
"spouting venom and blight.\n"
msgstr "一个巨大的蛇形生物，皮肤粗糙、病态，渗着胆汁和脓液，喷着毒液和枯萎病。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:observer"
msgid ""
"You see the unseen, you stare and they stare back. They whisper and laugh, they\n"
"grin and cry, they leer at you with contempt and gaze at you in adoration. They\n"
"are the observers, they are the judge of your worth and will decide your end.\n"
msgstr ""
"你看着看不见的，你凝视着他们，他们也凝视着你。\n"
"他们低语着，笑着，他们又笑又哭，他们轻蔑地睨视着你，崇敬地凝望着你。\n"
"他们是观察者，他们是你的价值的仲裁，并决定着你的结局。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:wretched soul"
msgid ""
"A spectre, struggling to leave the mortal world it is incarcerated in. It\n"
"drains life and unlife from all those it comes into contact with.\n"
msgstr "一个鬼魂，挣扎着离开囚禁它的尘世。它从接触过的身上吸取生命和非生命。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:fleshlord"
msgid ""
"One of the greatest servants of the Meatlord. It is muscular, agile and full of\n"
"malevolence.\n"
msgstr "血肉领主最强大的随从之一。它强健敏捷，充满了怨恨。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:vile"
msgid ""
"An emaciated figure brimming with damnation and plague. Its appearance\n"
"signifies the end of days.\n"
msgstr "一个消瘦的身形，充满了天谴和瘟疫。它的出现意味着世界末日。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:the servant"
msgid "His glaive is alight with the flames of hell.\n"
msgstr "他的大刀燃烧着地狱的火焰。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:the captor"
msgid "Those who enter will not escape.\n"
msgstr "进入的人无法再逃脱。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:the defiler"
msgid "His shield is emblazoned with images of infernal flames.\n"
msgstr "他的盾上饰有地狱火的图案。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:the meatlord"
msgid ""
"You behold the embodiment of filth, corruption and depravity: the Meatlord. His\n"
"foul body is bloated to the extreme, leaking viscous fluid and the stench of\n"
"death. His head is that of a boar with bulging eyes and tusks split in two, his\n"
"snout flares and oozes as he snorts and squeals at the sight of you, and his\n"
"mouth is a toothless rift which drools pools of blood and vomits forth\n"
"disgusting remains. His neck is stretched and lops forward, its skin sagging\n"
"downward. His immense gut writhes and distorts as the larvae within await their\n"
"repugnant release. His legs are unrecognisable masses of flesh, covered in\n"
"protrusions and throbbing boils. Your mind reels at the sight of this hideous\n"
"form, and your senses begin to shut down in an attempt to preserve your sanity\n"
"as you choke on the oppressive stench.\n"
msgstr "你看到了污秽、腐化与堕落的化身：血肉领主。他的肮脏躯体肿胀到极限，渗出黏液与死亡恶臭。头如野猪，双眼突出，獠牙一分为二；看见你时，他喷着鼻息、尖叫着，鼻孔张开并渗出污物。嘴是没有牙齿的裂口，流出成池鲜血，呕出恶心残渣。脖子伸长、向前耷拉，皮肤下垂。巨腹不断蠕动扭曲，里面的幼虫等着令人作呕的释放。双腿已是无法辨认的肉团，布满突起与搏动的疖疮。眼前丑恶形体使你心神眩晕；在令人窒息的浓重恶臭中，感官开始关闭，试图守住最后的理智。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:the unspeakable"
msgid ""
"You hear the echoes of planets behind the deafening roar of stars as it\n"
"approaches. It is the jaws of the abyss. It brings forth crawling chaos from\n"
"within. It is the last sight you will ever see.\n"
msgstr "它靠近时，你在恒星震耳欲聋的咆哮之后，听到行星的回声。它是深渊的巨颚，从内部释放蠕行的混沌。这将是你此生最后看到的景象。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:blorkula the orcula"
msgid ""
"Once a gangly and bedraggled vampire with a strange obsession with colour,\n"
"Blorkula was offered succour by a missionary of Beogh and became a portly and\n"
"vigorous orc with a strange obsession with colour instead.\n"
"\n"
"He wields magic tinged with every hue of the rainbow, and has mastered the art\n"
"of dividing his own form among its many colours to avoid killing blows - though\n"
"even he must rest a while before doing so a second time.\n"
msgstr ""
"布洛库拉原本是个瘦高邋遢、对颜色有着奇怪执念的吸血鬼，受到比欧弗传教士援助后，变成了一个圆胖健壮、仍对颜色有着奇怪执念的兽人。\n"
"\n"
"他运用带有虹彩各色的魔法，还掌握了将身体分散为诸多颜色以躲避致命一击的技艺。不过，即使是他，再次使用前也必须休息一阵。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:cassandra"
msgid ""
"As a young woman, Cassandra bound herself in service to Ashenzari and was\n"
"blessed and cursed in equal measure - granted the ability to foresee disasters,\n"
"but only those she was powerless to prevent.\n"
"\n"
"Eventually driven from her homeland as a harbinger of the very plagues she'd\n"
"spent a lifetime warning against, she has come to the dungeon in her final days\n"
"in hope of averting one last catastrophe.\n"
msgstr "卡珊德拉年轻时便立誓侍奉艾申扎利，所得祝福与诅咒同样深重：她能预见灾难，却只能预见自己无力阻止的灾难。\n\n她一生都在警告世人提防瘟疫，最终却被当作瘟疫的先兆逐出故乡。在生命最后的日子里，她来到地下城，希望能阻止最后一场浩劫。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:nobody"
msgid ""
"A time-lost revenant, risen not from the death of a single individual but of\n"
"many - its bones fused together from the young and the elderly and different\n"
"species altogether. Whether they were all the victims of a single massacre or\n"
"a thousand souls discarded over a thousand years is impossible to say now;\n"
"history does not remember them.\n"
"\n"
"But one thing is clear: they will fight to change that until every last memory\n"
"they have left burns away.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个迷失于时间的还魂者，并非来自某一个人的死亡，而是众多死者汇成：年轻人、老人，乃至不同种族的骨骸融合在一起。它们是同一场屠杀的受害者，还是千年间被抛弃的千条灵魂，如今已无从知晓；历史没有记住它们。\n"
"\n"
"但有一点十分清楚：它们会为改变这一切而战，直到最后一点残存记忆燃烧殆尽。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:sprozz"
msgid ""
"A former beekeeper's apprentice with an ambitious dream: to modernise the whole\n"
"world's beekeeping industry with the smooth certainty of disease-proof metal.\n"
"His methods may be questionable and his goals dubious, but his prototype's\n"
"stinger still looks awfully sharp...\n"
msgstr "一位曾做过养蜂人学徒的发明家，怀着宏大梦想：用光滑可靠、不会染病的金属，将全世界养蜂业现代化。方法或许可疑，目标也未必可信，但他原型机的螫针仍显得尖锐得可怕……\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:wiglaf"
msgid ""
"A cantankerous dwarf wearing a stupid-looking hat. He eyes you sourly, as if\n"
"deciding exactly how much offence he should take to the way you're staring at\n"
"it.\n"
msgstr "一个脾气暴躁、戴着滑稽帽子的矮人。他不悦地打量你，仿佛在盘算你盯着帽子看的样子究竟有多冒犯。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:xak'krixis"
msgid ""
"It has been centuries since outsiders were last allowed access to the cavernous\n"
"libraries of the formicids, but their emissaries are still seen from time to\n"
"time - surveying other lands for resources or scientific discoveries that might\n"
"aid the colony.\n"
"\n"
"This one's study of the magical fibres excreted by orb spiders has already led\n"
"to an alchemical breakthrough, allowing them to shape fulminant prisms such that\n"
"their explosions are directed at enemies alone. Alas, their enthusiasm to\n"
"conduct a field test bodes poorly for your health.\n"
msgstr ""
"蚁族洞窟中的庞大图书馆已有数百年不对外人开放，但偶尔仍能见到它们的使者，前往其他土地勘察可能帮助蚁群的资源或科学发现。\n"
"\n"
"这一位对宝珠蜘蛛分泌的魔法纤维的研究，已带来炼金突破：它能塑造只将爆炸导向敌人的爆炸棱镜。可惜，它急于进行实地试验，这对你的健康绝非好兆头。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:alderking"
msgid ""
"A self-styled monarch of a shambling black alder, half respected and half\n"
"ridiculed by other fae. It backs up its aspirations to sovereignty with\n"
"unearthly vile magic quite close to a touch of death.\n"
msgstr "一株蹒跚黑桤木，自封君王，受到其他精怪半是尊重、半是嘲笑。为了支撑自己的王权野心，它运用几乎如死亡之触般邪恶的异世魔法。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:armataur"
msgid "A curious quadraped, resembling a cross between an armadillo and a yaktaur.\n"
msgstr "一种奇特的四足生物，像犰狳与半人牛的结合。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:bes kemwar"
msgid ""
"A minor hairy maggot spirit, phasing in and out of this plane. Each regional\n"
"variant inflicts different minor ailments: the ones found in the Dungeon\n"
"cause one's magic to grow weak.\n"
msgstr "一只毛茸茸的微小蛆虫精灵，在此位面中时隐时现。不同地区的变种会引发不同小病；地下城中的这一种会削弱人的魔法。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:bomblet"
msgid ""
"A small metal sphere surrounding a core of dormant fire magic. When given the\n"
"proper command, it will detonate in a blast of metal and flame that is only\n"
"partially affected by fire resistance.\n"
msgstr "一个包裹着休眠火系魔法核心的金属小球。接到适当命令后，它会爆出金属与烈焰，火焰抗性只能抵御其中部分伤害。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:boundless tesseract"
msgid ""
"An impossible shape that scintillates with unearthly colour. The power of Zot\n"
"flows heavily through it, overlaying this reality with countless others where\n"
"its domain remains pristine.\n"
"\n"
"Each tesseract is inextricably linked to the other, and destroying one will\n"
"destroy both (and expel all the creatures they have beckoned to this reality,\n"
"as well as dazing even those which they have not). But so long as they are\n"
"allowed to exist, there will be no end to the forces which seek to keep you from\n"
"the Orb.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个不可能存在的形体，闪耀着异世色彩。佐特之力在其中奔涌，将当前现实与无数个佐特领域仍完好无损的现实叠合。\n"
"\n"
"每个超立方体都与另一个紧密相连，摧毁其中一个便会将两者一同摧毁，驱逐它们召来此现实的所有生物，还会震慑那些并非由它们召来的生物。只要它们继续存在，阻止你取得宝珠的敌军便永无止境。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:burstshroom"
msgid ""
"A rapidly-growing mushroom whose life-cycle culminates in an explosive release\n"
"of spores. These spores have a mild psychoactive effect and can sometimes daze\n"
"creatures who breathe them in.\n"
msgstr "一种快速生长的蘑菇，生命历程以爆炸释放孢子告终。孢子有轻微精神活性，有时会震慑吸入它们的生物。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:caustic sporangium"
msgid ""
"A balloon-like sac of slime mold spores, suspended in a nutrient slurry to\n"
"sustain them on their search for a new home. To the great misfortune of any\n"
"adventurers in the vicinity, this slurry is also a highly potent acid.\n"
msgstr "一个气球般的黏菌孢子囊，孢子悬浮在营养浆液中，靠它维持寻找新家的旅程。附近冒险者的不幸在于，这种浆液也是极强的酸。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:chonchon"
msgid ""
"Some sorcerers care little for unholy realms or undead forms, seeking power\n"
"instead in the whims of cruel chaos. This ominous owl-winged head is all that\n"
"remains of a former archmage: it delights in spreading misfortune and drinking\n"
"blood in its new airborne form.\n"
msgstr "有些术士不在乎邪恶领域或亡灵形态，而向残酷混沌的反复无常寻求力量。这颗长着猫头鹰翅膀的不祥头颅，便是一位昔日大法师仅存的部分。它乐于以新的飞行形态传播厄运、吸饮鲜血。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:clockroach"
msgid ""
"A common dungeon pest that combines the worst features of a scavenging insect\n"
"and a looming deadline.\n"
"\n"
"Time flows strangely around it, rewinding any injuries inflicted upon it unless\n"
"the source of them is near enough to be caught up in its timestream.\n"
msgstr "一种常见的地下城害虫，将食腐昆虫和迫近的期限最糟糕的特性结合在一起。\n\n它周围的时间流动异常，会倒转所受的任何伤势；只有伤害来源靠得足够近、被卷入其时间流时，伤势才不会复原。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:cognitogaunt"
msgid ""
"A wizened, headless corpse, animated not by conventional necromancy but by the\n"
"mournful malice of dead stars. Its psychic eyes, floating disjointedly from its\n"
"body's movements, relentlessly burrow through its victims' minds.\n"
msgstr "一具干瘪无头的尸体，并非由通常的死灵魔法驱动，而是由死去恒星悲哀的恶意驱动。它的灵能眼睛独立于身体动作漂浮，执拗地钻入受害者心智。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:clockwork bee"
msgid ""
"A mechanical insect powered by an intricate array of gears and springs. It is\n"
"vicious and resilient to damage, but its clockwork naturally winds down as it\n"
"attacks, eventually leaving it unable to move until its creator winds it again.\n"
msgstr "一只由复杂齿轮与发条驱动的机械昆虫。它凶猛且耐打，但攻击时发条自然会逐渐松弛，最终无法移动，直到创造者重新上紧发条。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:colossal amoeba"
msgid ""
"An unfathomably massive pile of mystic pulsating protoplasm. The slightest\n"
"threat will cause it to undergo rapid weaponised mitosis, rapidly overwhelming\n"
"potential meals in a cytoplasmic tidal wave.\n"
msgstr "一团大得难以想象、神秘搏动的原生质。最轻微的威胁都会使它迅速进行武器化有丝分裂，以细胞质浪潮淹没潜在的食物。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:crawling flesh cage"
msgid ""
"A modern breakthrough in arcane experimentation, this mobile prison cell\n"
"weaponises the living fragments of once-escaped ugly things, extending the reach\n"
"of their tendrils to thrash multiple foes at once from a distance.\n"
msgstr "奥术试验的现代突破：这间移动牢房将曾经逃脱的丑怪活体碎片武器化，延长其触须，使其能同时远距离抽打多个敌人。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:creeping plasmodium"
msgid ""
"An enormous and unnervingly motile slime mold colony. It creeps along the\n"
"crevices of the walls in search of nutrients and can spread itself to new\n"
"locations by launching enormous sporangia.\n"
msgstr "一个庞大且活动能力令人不安的黏菌群落。它沿墙缝爬行觅食，也能发射巨大的孢子囊，将自己传播到新位置。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:diamond sawblade"
msgid ""
"A serrated disc forged of razor-sharp material. It spins in place at high\n"
"velocity, shredding through flesh and metal alike.\n"
msgstr "一片由剃刀般锋利材料锻成的锯齿圆盘，原地高速旋转，能撕碎血肉与金属。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:dormant clockwork bee"
msgid ""
"A mechanical insect powered by an intricate array of gears and springs. It has\n"
"run out of power and can only be rewound by its creator moving into it.\n"
msgstr "一只由复杂齿轮与发条驱动的机械昆虫。它已耗尽动力，只能由创造者走向它，重新上紧发条。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:draugr"
msgid ""
"A territorial gnarl of driftwood and shattered bones. Its resentment of the\n"
"living has slowly twisted its remains into a monstrous form, capable of\n"
"brandishing weapons and spreading terrible curses.\n"
msgstr "一团护地盘的浮木与碎骨。对活物的怨恨逐渐将遗骸扭成怪物，能够挥舞武器、传播可怕诅咒。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:drude"
msgid ""
"A conniving demon born from the nightmares of sleeping mages. It delights in\n"
"coaxing the imagined fears of mortals into reality.\n"
msgstr "一个诡计多端的恶魔，诞生于沉睡法师的噩梦，乐于将凡人想象中的恐惧诱入现实。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:erythrospite"
msgid ""
"A churning mass of flowing blood that throbs to the beat of an absent heart.\n"
"\n"
"Does it wish to bury itself in your arteries because it recognises, on some\n"
"primordial level, that this is where it belongs? Alas, all it is capable of in\n"
"this fleeing moment of sentience is violence.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团翻涌的流血，随着一颗并不存在的心脏搏动。\n"
"\n"
"它想钻进你的动脉，是因为在某种原始层面认出那里才是归宿吗？可惜，在这转瞬即逝的意识中，它唯一能做的只有暴力。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:eye of draining"
msgid ""
"A hovering horror, rare and unnatural even amongst servitor eyes, radiating\n"
"baleful energies. They monitor the flow of chaotic life and ever-present death\n"
"for the divine Jiyva.\n"
msgstr "一个悬浮的恐怖存在，即使在侍从魔眼中也罕见而违背自然，散发着邪恶能量。它们为神圣的吉瓦监视混沌生命与无处不在的死亡的流动。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:fravashi"
msgid ""
"A beneficent remnant of the countless mortal knights who serve the Shining One.\n"
"Their hosts' role in the divine hierarchy is to guide and direct their legions\n"
"in righteous moral warfare, though they may also call upon those mortals to\n"
"defend themselves.\n"
msgstr "无数侍奉光明神的凡人骑士留下的仁善残灵。它们在神圣序列中的职责，是指引各自的军团投身正义之战；需要时，也能召来这些凡人保护自己。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:globe of annihilation"
msgid ""
"A roiling sphere of intense destructive energies, drawn from the fabric of the\n"
"Hells themselves. It pursues a designated target inexorably, growing in size as\n"
"it travels. If it collides with either a creature or wall, it will explode\n"
"violently - though its creator is protected from the wild destruction unleashed\n"
"as it does so.\n"
msgstr "一颗翻滚的强烈毁灭能量球，能量直接取自地狱本质。它会不懈追逐指定目标，沿途不断变大，碰到生物或墙壁就会猛烈爆炸。不过，创造者不会受到爆炸释放的狂暴破坏伤害。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:goblin rider"
msgid ""
"Goblin clans fractured over the advent of steel exoskeletons long ago, prompting\n"
"an experimental arms race for goblin hegemony. Some volunteered to join forces\n"
"with other species, an alliance that has enabled capturing and taming wyverns.\n"
"From uptop their majestic dragon-like mounts, these goblins swiftly soar about\n"
"and skewer those who intrude upon their allies' domain.\n"
msgstr "很久以前，钢铁外骨骼的出现使地精氏族分裂，引发争夺地精霸权的试验性军备竞赛。有些地精自愿与其他种族结盟，从而学会捕捉并驯服双足飞龙。它们骑在威风凛凛的龙形坐骑上迅速翱翔，刺穿闯入盟友领地者。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:guardian sphinx"
msgid ""
"A fearsome aged hybrid with a woman's head, a lion's body, and the wings of\n"
"an eagle. It solemnly guards the temples and treasures of the Dungeon with a\n"
"multitude of mind-clouding maledictions.\n"
msgstr "一个令人畏惧的古老混种，拥有女人的头、狮子的身体和鹰的翅膀。它以诸多迷乱心智的恶咒，庄严地守护地下城中的神殿与宝藏。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:haunted armour"
msgid ""
"An ordinary piece of armour, held in your haunting grip. It can attack nearby\n"
"enemies, but must return to your side if you ever stray too far from it.\n"
msgstr "一件被你的幽魂之力控制的普通防具。它能攻击附近敌人，但你若离得太远，它就必须返回你身旁。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:hellfire mortar"
msgid ""
"A terrifying weapon hewn from molten rock. It rains fiery destruction down upon\n"
"its creators' enemies.\n"
msgstr "一件由熔岩凿成的可怕武器，向创造者的敌人倾泻烈焰毁灭。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:hoarfrost cannon"
msgid ""
"An elegant siege weapon, magically sculpted from crystalline ice. As ephemeral\n"
"as a summer snowstorm, every salvo it fires consumes a portion of itself until\n"
"nothing is left behind but water.\n"
msgstr "一件由魔法塑造的冰晶精巧攻城兵器。它像夏日雪暴般短暂，每次齐射都消耗一部分自身，直到最终只剩下水。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ironbound beastmaster"
msgid ""
"A cruel and unruly brute who growls in the language of the untamed. Its very\n"
"presence provokes and overworks non-sapient, living beasts and slimes alike into\n"
"a rapid fervour.\n"
msgstr "一个残酷桀骜的蛮汉，以野兽的语言低吼。它仅仅在场，就能刺激并过度驱使没有智慧的活体野兽和黏液生物，使它们迅速陷入狂热。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:ironbound mechanist"
msgid ""
"A well-armoured coglin whose talents with machinery have been harnessed by the\n"
"Ironbound order to repair and augment the many constructs that help guard the\n"
"Vaults.\n"
msgstr "一个装备精良的机甲哥布林，铁缚会利用其机械天赋，修复并强化帮助守卫宝库的众多构造物。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:kobold fleshcrafter"
msgid ""
"A skull-masked kobold, its body mutated by forbidden magics. It conducts vile\n"
"experiments in the service of demonic powers, formulating ever more terrible\n"
"monstrosities as vessels for devilish minds.\n"
msgstr "一个戴着头骨面具、身体被禁忌魔法改变的狗头人。它为恶魔势力进行邪恶试验，制造越来越可怕的怪物，作为恶魔心智的容器。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:kobold geomancer"
msgid ""
"A wily kobold who has learned to weaponise every crack and crevice that lines\n"
"the walls of its domain.\n"
msgstr "一个狡猾的狗头人，学会了将领地墙壁上的每道裂缝和孔隙化为武器。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:marrowcuda"
msgid ""
"The flame-wreathed skeleton of a carnivorous fish, darting through air as easily\n"
"as it once parted water. It burns with a hunger it could not satisfy in life and\n"
"is singularly driven by in death.\n"
"\n"
"While a single one may be only a nuisance, the swarm is never far behind, and\n"
"every bite it lands will summon more and more of them until every scrap of flesh\n"
"on its prey has been devoured.\n"
msgstr ""
"一具被火焰缠绕的食肉鱼骨架，在空气中穿梭如生前在水中游动。它燃烧着生前无法满足、死后成为唯一驱动力的饥饿。\n"
"\n"
"单独一只或许只是麻烦，但鱼群从不遥远。每次咬中，都会召来更多同类，直到猎物的每一片血肉都被吞尽。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:monarch bomb"
msgid ""
"A flying munitions factory, held aloft on jets of fiery exhaust and packed to\n"
"the brim with explosives. It can rapidly fill an area with bomblets, and when\n"
"commanded by its creator, will explode them all (and itself) to devastating\n"
"effect.\n"
msgstr "一座靠烈焰尾喷悬空、塞满炸药的飞行军火工厂。它能迅速在一片区域布满小炸弹，并依创造者的命令，将所有炸弹连同自己一起引爆，造成毁灭性效果。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:morphogenic ooze"
msgid ""
"A multihued mire of roiling flesh and fluctuating sludge, striving and failing\n"
"for more coherence than any other slime. As a fresh carrier of the ruinous\n"
"contagion that overtook the Slime Pits, it can impart unto others the same\n"
"horrible fate. While it may not be a permanent transformation for you, the\n"
"melding of weapons and armour, as well as the severe weakening of spells, may\n"
"make it a lethal one regardless.\n"
msgstr "一片由翻涌血肉与变幻污泥构成的多彩泥沼，比其他黏液更竭力追求完整形态，却总是失败。它新近携带着席卷史莱姆巢穴的毁灭性传染病，也能让其他生物遭遇相同命运。对你而言，变形或许并非永久，但武器与防具融化、法术严重削弱，仍足以致命。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:mountainshell"
msgid ""
"An enormous land tortoise whose shell is so thick and rock-encrusted that\n"
"sleeping ones are frequently mistaken for geological formations. And like a\n"
"mountain, its exterior is nearly impervious to any destructive force; only at\n"
"close range can one properly aim for the narrow gaps between its plates to\n"
"strike the tender flesh within.\n"
msgstr "一只巨大的陆龟，龟壳极厚且结满岩石，睡着时经常被误认为地质构造。如同山岳，它的外壳几乎能抵御任何破坏力量；只有近距离，才能准确瞄准甲片间的狭缝，攻击内部柔软的血肉。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:nascent plasmodium"
msgid ""
"A slime mold colony in an early phase of its life cycle. Not yet mature enough\n"
"to reproduce, it can still defend itself by firing globs of potent acid.\n"
msgstr "一个处于生命周期早期的黏菌群落，尚未成熟到能够繁殖，但仍会发射强酸团自卫。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:nekomata"
msgid ""
"An upright feliform trickster of an elderly demon, with a forked tail ablaze\n"
"with a shimmering haze. It holds a deep disdain for mortal humanoids, a\n"
"patronising pity for mortal cats, and enough mystic might to subjugate both.\n"
msgstr "一个直立猫形的年老妖魔，分叉尾巴燃着闪烁光雾，擅长捉弄。它深深鄙视凡人的人形生物，居高临下地怜悯凡猫，也有足够的神秘力量制服两者。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:obsidian bat"
msgid ""
"A faceless stone bat unearthed from infernal chasms. Devilish beasts hunt in its\n"
"wake.\n"
msgstr "一只从地狱深渊中发掘出的无面石蝙蝠。恶魔野兽尾随它追猎。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:oni incarcerator"
msgid ""
"An infamous, dutiful retainer of Gehenna. These immense and indomitable oni\n"
"weave their weapons through reality itself to reach and capture the innumerable\n"
"damned souls owed to the hells upon their deaths.\n"
msgstr "欣嫩谷一位臭名昭著、尽忠职守的家臣。这些巨大且不屈的鬼人让武器穿梭现实，触及并捕获无数死后归地狱所有的受诅灵魂。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:orb of entropy"
msgid ""
"A globe of profound nothingness and the oblivion that awaits all things - flesh,\n"
"souls, and even time itself. When the universe ends, only these will remain.\n"
msgstr "一个由深邃虚无，以及等待血肉、灵魂乃至时间本身的湮灭构成的球体。宇宙终结时，唯有它们仍将存在。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:orb of winter"
msgid ""
"A globe of deepest cold, still lingering from a time before the stars lit the\n"
"heavens. It can shroud the soul in a chill so intense that even the gods cannot\n"
"reach it.\n"
msgstr "一个来自星辰尚未点亮天穹之前、至今仍留存的极寒球体。它能以寒冷笼罩灵魂，强烈得连诸神也无法触及。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:orc apostle"
msgid ""
"An orcish wayfarer who has been touched by the hand of Beogh. Whether out of\n"
"religious devotion or personal jealousy, they have come to bar your path.\n"
"\n"
"Hold nothing back - for neither they nor their followers will do so.\n"
"\n"
"Glory to Beogh!\n"
msgstr ""
"一个受到比欧弗亲手眷顾的兽人行者。不论是出于虔诚信仰还是个人嫉妒，它都来到此地挡住你的去路。\n"
"\n"
"全力以赴吧，它和追随者也绝不会留手。\n"
"\n"
"荣耀归于比欧弗！\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:orc apostle follower"
msgid ""
"A favoured child of Beogh, once not so unlike yourself.\n"
"\n"
"Now that you have proven yourself to them, they will fight and die for both you\n"
"and the cause. Shepherd them well.\n"
msgstr ""
"比欧弗宠爱的孩子，曾经与你并没有太大不同。\n"
"\n"
"如今你已向它证明自己，它便会为你与共同的事业战斗、赴死。好好引领它。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:petrified flower"
msgid ""
"A sizeable and statuesque flower, fossilised either by bitter grief or the cruel\n"
"grace of divinity, standing in its own eternal vigil.\n"
msgstr "一朵硕大、宛如雕像的花，被深切悲恸或神祇残酷的恩典化为化石，独自永恒守望。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:phalanx beetle"
msgid ""
"An intricate mechanical beetle covered in reinforced metal plates that resemble\n"
"a shield. It projects a kinetic barrier around its creator while adjacent to\n"
"them, increasing their armour class.\n"
"\n"
"It will never voluntarily leave its creator's side, and if forcibly seperated,\n"
"will prioritise returning to them over any other concerns.\n"
msgstr ""
"一只精巧的机械甲虫，覆盖着盾牌般的强化金属甲片。与创造者相邻时，它会在对方周围投射动能屏障，提高护甲值。\n"
"\n"
"它永远不会主动离开创造者身旁；若被强行分开，会优先返回，顾不上其他事情。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:pile of debris"
msgid "A heavily ruptured stonework, surrounded by rubble.\n"
msgstr "一片严重破损的石制结构，周围遍布碎石。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:pile of flesh"
msgid ""
"A leftover mess of broken bones, inert grasping organs, and scattered skin.\n"
"While some highly-specialised sorcerers might be capable of bringing it to life,\n"
"it is otherwise harmless - the possible leftovers of some departed or\n"
"absent-minded magus.\n"
msgstr "一堆剩下的碎骨、已不活动的抓握器官与散落皮肤。除非由某些专精此道的术士赋予生命，否则完全无害，或许是某位离去或心不在焉的法师留下的东西。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:pillar of rime"
msgid ""
"A spire of strangely tenebrous ice, its brittle tendrils reaching skyward like\n"
"the fingers of an outstretched hand. {{\n"
"    if spells.memorised(\"rimeblight\") then\n"
"        return \"If only the dying breath of every soul could create such art.\"\n"
"    else\n"
"        return \"It might even be beautiful if you didn't know the gruesome \" ..\n"
"               \"way it formed.\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"
msgstr ""
"一根阴暗得古怪的冰柱，脆弱的冰须像张开的手指般伸向天空。{{\n"
"    if spells.memorised(\"rimeblight\") then\n"
"        return \"但愿每个灵魂临终的气息，都能创造这样的艺术。\"\n"
"    else\n"
"        return \"若不知道它的形成过程多么可怕，\" ..\n"
"               \"它或许称得上美丽。\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:platinum paragon"
msgid ""
"A gleaming warrior, wrought from precious metals and the very pinnacle of\n"
"forgecraft techniques. Its every motion flows with a deadly, fluid grace that\n"
"belies its artifical nature.\n"
msgstr "一位闪亮的战士，由贵金属与锻造术的巅峰技艺铸成。每个动作都流露出致命而流畅的优雅，令人难以相信它是人造之物。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:poltergeist"
msgid ""
"A ghostly trickster that is fond of possessing small objects and making them\n"
"fly noisily through the air.\n"
msgstr "一个鬼魂般的捣蛋者，喜欢附身于小物件，让它们喧闹地在空中乱飞。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:polterguardian"
msgid ""
"Many poltergeists are fiercely territorial over the domains they choose to\n"
"haunt, but these have extended that protection even to the people who share\n"
"their domain with them. Some say they must be the lingering souls of those who\n"
"guarded the Vaults in life; others suggest the Ironbound Order simply recruited\n"
"them in common cause. Whichever is true, their very presence shelters other\n"
"creatures from missiles, causing sling and spell alike to veer off-course at the\n"
"last moment.\n"
msgstr "许多骚灵会凶猛捍卫自己选择作祟的领地，而这些骚灵则把保护范围扩展到与自己共居的人。有的说，它们是生前守卫宝库者留下的灵魂；也有人说，铁缚会只是因共同目标将它们招募。不论真相如何，它们仅仅在场，就能保护其他生物免受投射物侵袭，使投石和法术都在最后一刻偏离方向。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:raven"
msgid ""
"A jet-black corvid with a nasty beak and a reputation for heralding bad luck.\n"
"Most ornithologists consider this a baseless stereotype; the rest are still\n"
"recovering from a series of staggeringly unlikely accidents.\n"
msgstr "一只漆黑鸦科鸟，喙凶利，以预示厄运闻名。多数鸟类学家认为这只是毫无根据的成见；其余学者则还在从一连串概率低得惊人的事故中恢复。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:rending blade"
msgid ""
"A crackling weapon formed of condensed magical energy. It can cut through entire\n"
"rows of adversaries whenever its creator lands a melee attack.\n"
msgstr "一把由凝缩魔法能量构成、噼啪作响的武器。创造者近战命中时，它能斩穿整排敌人。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:revenant soulmonger"
msgid ""
"A timeworn revenant whose flames dance with the silhouettes of long-forgotten\n"
"atrocities. Cursed with a hunger they can never satisfy, they unleash these\n"
"long-dead echoes to reenact violence upon any soul they deem worthy of adding to\n"
"their eternal collection.\n"
msgstr "一个久经岁月的还魂者，火焰中跃动着早被遗忘的暴行剪影。它受永远无法满足的饥渴诅咒，释放这些久已死去的回响，再演昔日暴力，将自认值得收藏的灵魂添入永恒藏品。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:rock fish"
msgid ""
"A strange stone-scaled fish that swims through solid rock with the same ease\n"
"that most fish do through water.\n"
msgstr "一种奇异的石鳞鱼，在坚实岩石中游动，就像普通鱼在水中游动一样轻松。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:sacred lotus"
msgid ""
"A large and vivid bloom drifting placidly upon the surface of the water. The\n"
"cradle of the lotus's petals shine with eternity and elegance - while it is\n"
"entirely harmless, it would take immense effort to destroy it.\n"
msgstr "一朵硕大鲜艳的莲花，安然漂浮水面。层层花瓣中闪耀着永恒与优雅。虽然完全无害，要摧毁它却极其费力。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:screaming refraction"
msgid ""
"A deeply unfortunate soul mostly processed into crystal by some malevolent tear\n"
"in reality. Ethereal reflections of its past and future suffering are cast upon\n"
"nearby surfaces and foes.\n"
msgstr "一个极其不幸的灵魂，已被现实中某道邪恶裂口大半加工成水晶。它过去和未来所受痛苦的虚幻映像，被投射在附近表面及敌人身上。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:scrub nettle"
msgid ""
"An irritable, bristling shrub. It fends off anything that might graze upon it by\n"
"launching some of its innumerable toxic stinging hairs.\n"
msgstr "一株易怒、满是硬毛的灌木，会发射无数有毒螫毛中的一部分，驱赶可能啃食它的生物。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:seismosaurus"
msgid ""
"A stubborn and fiercely territorial lizard with the strength of a mountain. Its\n"
"thunderous footfalls herald violent tremors.\n"
msgstr "一只倔强、地盘意识极强的蜥蜴，拥有山岳般力量。雷鸣般的脚步预示着猛烈震颤。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:seismosaurus egg"
msgid ""
"A lizard egg the size of a small boulder and nearly as hard. Perhaps as a\n"
"defence mechanism, they hatch rapidly in the presence of predators and even a\n"
"newborn can give all but the most ambitious of monsters a reason to consider an\n"
"easier meal.\n"
msgstr "一枚小巨石般大小、也几乎同样坚硬的蜥蜴卵。也许出于防御机制，捕食者在场时它会迅速孵化。即使刚出生的幼体，也足以让除了最野心勃勃的怪物之外的捕食者，考虑换顿更轻松的饭。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:shadow"
msgid ""
"A featureless silhouette of your own body, moving independently through the\n"
"divine power of Dithmenos. No matter how many times it is struck down, it will\n"
"reform itself, for a shadow is inextinguishable so long as whatever cast it\n"
"remains.\n"
msgstr "一个与你身体相同、没有细节的轮廓，凭迪斯姆诺神力独立行动。不论被击倒多少次，它都会重聚，因为只要投下影子的存在仍在，影子就不会熄灭。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:shadow prism"
msgid ""
"A prism-like silhouette which wavers with barely-contained destructive energy.\n"
"Any blow which disrupts its form will result in a violent blast of shadow.\n"
msgstr "一个棱晶般的剪影，在勉强束缚的破坏能量中摇曳。任何扰乱其形态的打击，都会引发猛烈的阴影爆发。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:shadow puppet"
msgid ""
"A minor servant of living shadow whose form wavers perpetually on the edge of\n"
"recognition - as if an unseen light were flickering behind something almost\n"
"familiar.\n"
"\n"
"The strength of its attacks increases in proportion with the power of the spell\n"
"which summoned it.\n"
msgstr ""
"一个活体阴影构成的小仆从，其形态永远徘徊在似曾相识的边缘，仿佛某种看不见的光，正从几乎熟悉的事物后闪烁。\n"
"\n"
"其攻击强度与召来它的法术强度成正比。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:shadow turret"
msgid ""
"A strangely static silhouette whose form suggests a large cannon. Though it uses\n"
"no gunpowder, the depths of its bore flickers angrily with every shot, as if\n"
"remembering the fiery light of its ignition.\n"
msgstr "一个奇异静止的剪影，外形像一门大炮。虽然不用火药，每次射击时，炮膛深处仍会愤怒闪动，仿佛记得点火时的烈光。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:shooting star"
msgid ""
"A glimmering spark of magical energy. It seeks out nearby enemies to expend\n"
"itself upon, dealing damage and pushing them backwards.\n"
"\n"
"It does not block its allies' line of fire.\n"
msgstr ""
"一簇闪烁的魔法火花，会寻找附近敌人，将自身耗尽，造成伤害并把目标向后推。\n"
"\n"
"它不会阻挡盟友的射击路线。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:slymdra"
msgid ""
"A quivering amalgam of viscous slime, its many pseudopods gnashing at the air\n"
"like a throng of reptilian maws. It rapidly absorbs nearby slime creatures into\n"
"itself, growing a new 'head' for each one and becoming even more resilient.\n"
"\n"
"Whether through convergent evolution or genetic memory, it also shares the\n"
"hydra's most infamous trait: lopping off a head with a bladed weapon will just\n"
"make it grow two more unless the wound is cauterised by a flaming weapon.\n"
"\n"
"When not stalking prey, its constituent slimes may separate from it again,\n"
"perhaps to seek new food sources on their own.\n"
msgstr ""
"一团颤抖的黏液聚合物，众多伪足如一群爬虫的巨口般向空气啃咬。它迅速吸收附近黏液生物，每吸收一只就长出一个新“头”，也变得更耐打。\n"
"\n"
"不论源于趋同进化还是遗传记忆，它还拥有海德拉最著名的特征：用有刃武器砍下一头，会再长出两头，除非用火焰武器灼封伤口。\n"
"\n"
"不追猎时，构成它的黏液生物可能再次分离，也许是各自寻找新的食物来源。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:solar ember"
msgid ""
"A mote of intense light and heat manifested by a sun scarab. It is linked to\n"
"their essence and will never leave their side, being reconstituted time and time\n"
"again whenever it is extinguished.\n"
"\n"
"Some myths even claim that the sun which shines down upon the outside world was\n"
"once carried around by such a scarab.\n"
msgstr ""
"一簇由太阳圣甲虫显化的强光与高热，与其本质相连，永远不会离开身旁。每次熄灭后，都会一次次重新构成。\n"
"\n"
"有些神话甚至声称，照耀外界的太阳，最初也是由这样一只圣甲虫携带。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:soul wisp"
msgid ""
"A tiny fragment of a living soul, splintered from the body in which it belongs.\n"
"Too mindless to be fully controlled, it seeks nothing but to reunite with its\n"
"greater self once more - unfortunately, this process tends to be more violent\n"
"than the magic which created it.\n"
msgstr "一片从所属躯体中分离出来的活体灵魂碎片。它太过无智，无法完全控制，只想与更完整的自身重新融合；不幸的是，这一过程往往比创造它的魔法更加暴烈。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:sphinx marauder"
msgid ""
"A wicked youthful hybrid with a woman's head, a lion's body, and the wings of\n"
"an eagle. It gleefully wreaks havoc with both the violent turbulence of\n"
"high winds and the frustration of bewildering magics.\n"
msgstr "一个邪恶而年轻的混种，拥有女人的头、狮子的身体和鹰的翅膀。它喜悦地以狂风的猛烈乱流，以及令人困扰的迷乱魔法大肆破坏。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:splinterfrost barricade"
msgid ""
"A durable barricade made of ice reinforced with forgecraft magic. A lattice of\n"
"precise hairline cracks are visible just beneath its surface which allow it to\n"
"fracture into a barrage of razor-sharp projectiles whenever it sustains critical\n"
"damage.\n"
msgstr "一道以锻造术加固的耐久冰障。表面下可见精密的发丝裂纹网，使其遭受重创时能碎裂为一轮剃刀般锋利的投射物。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:star jelly"
msgid ""
"A white gelatinous mound that pulses with a strange iridescence. Its body\n"
"absorbs magical energy like a sponge, and when sufficiently injured, will\n"
"unleash this energy as a flurry of shooting stars.\n"
msgstr "一团白色胶质丘体，搏动着奇异虹彩。它像海绵般吸收魔法能量，伤势足够严重时，会将能量释放为一阵流星。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:thermic dynamo"
msgid ""
"A clashing tempest of boundless energy, channelling into capacitor jewels. Its\n"
"whirls of fire and ice occasionally escape and ricochet wildly off of walls.\n"
msgstr "一场无穷能量相互冲撞的风暴，将能量导入电容宝石。火与冰的旋流偶尔会逸出，在墙壁之间猛烈弹射。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:undying armoury"
msgid ""
"A swirling tempest of souls and steel: knights and blacksmiths and\n"
"weaponmasters, all bound to weapons they once held in life. To fight one is like\n"
"fighting an entire army.\n"
msgstr "一场灵魂与钢铁的旋风：骑士、铁匠与武器大师，全都被束缚在生前持用的武器上。与其交战，就像对抗整支军队。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:undertaker"
msgid ""
"The Dungeon's vast repositories of the dead and the unholy realms thereafter\n"
"both require regular restocking and reorganisation, far beyond the coordination\n"
"of the restless dead. These corpse-collecting constructs burrow through the\n"
"earth and command divisions of zombified hands to assist them in stealing away\n"
"carrion, and may also violently create new corpses for such purposes.\n"
msgstr "地下城庞大的亡者库藏，以及往后的邪恶领域，都需要定期补充与整理，这远非躁动死者能协调完成。这些收尸构造物在地下钻行，指挥成群丧尸之手协助偷运腐尸，也可能通过暴力制造新尸体来完成工作。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:vampire bloodprince"
msgid ""
"A scornful scion to whom even other vampires bend the knee. Their command over\n"
"blood magic allows them to feed upon the lifeforce of entire armies at once.\n"
msgstr "一位傲慢的血族贵胄，连其他吸血鬼也向其屈膝。对血魔法的掌控，使其能同时吸食整支军队的生命力。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:walking alembic"
msgid ""
"A mobile and combat-capable alchemical manufactory that uses the friction of\n"
"melee combat to brew a variety of useful potions. When it has built up enough\n"
"heat to complete its synthesis, it will automatically dispense the finished\n"
"potions to nearby allies and fall apart.\n"
msgstr "一座能移动、能战斗的炼金工厂，用近战摩擦产生的热量酿造各种有用药水。积累足够热量完成合成后，它会自动将成品分发给附近盟友，随后散架。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:wyrmhole"
msgid ""
"A small and strangely serpentine fold in space and time. Scholars once\n"
"theorised the Dungeon's easy access to manifold unholy realms is due to the\n"
"tunneling of yet-undiscovered translocations dragons. Whether or not this is\n"
"true, distant stars mottle this drake's endless lengths, and dimensions bend to\n"
"its writhing whim.\n"
msgstr "时空中一道小巧、奇异蛇形的褶皱。学者曾推测，地下城之所以能方便地通往许多邪恶领域，是因为尚未发现的位移巨龙在那里掘洞。不论真相如何，遥远星辰斑驳地映在这条龙无尽的身躯上，维度也随它扭动的心意弯折。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:zykzyl"
msgid ""
"A demon born of mortal envy, its flesh undulating with a sickening wetness\n"
"whenever it moves. It is driven by a singular desire to reduce all beauty to a\n"
"form as hideous as its own.\n"
msgstr "一个由凡人嫉妒诞生的恶魔，每次移动，血肉都带着令人恶心的湿意起伏。它唯一的愿望，就是将所有美丽之物毁成和自己一样丑陋。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:goblin sharper"
msgid ""
"A goblin newly converted to Nemelex Xobeh. It's still learning about all the\n"
"cards and, thankfully, isn't inclined to use them against you.\n"
msgstr "一个新近皈依尼姆雷斯・索布的地精。它还在学习各种卡牌的用途，幸好暂时没打算用来对付你。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:spriggan baker"
msgid "A spriggan that has mastered the culinary arts.\n"
msgstr "一个精通烹饪技艺的斯普利根。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:still boulder"
msgid "A gargantuan mass of stone at rest.\n"
msgstr "一块静止不动的巨大岩石。\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/monsters.txt:grandmaster elementalist"
msgid "<master elementalist>\n"
msgstr "<master elementalist>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/quotes.txt:an opulent altar of gozag"
msgid ""
"“Mother, I kneel before gold,\n"
" my lover and beloved;\n"
" and knowing I adore him,\n"
" he turns melancholic yellow.\n"
" Because he follows his every lust\n"
" whether doubloon or dust,\n"
" a mighty knight\n"
" is Don Dinero.”\n"
"    -Francisco de Quevedo, _Poderoso caballero es don Dinero_. 1603.\n"
"     trans. Christopher Johnson, 2009.\n"
msgstr ""
"“母亲，我跪在黄金面前，\n"
"他是我的情人，也是我的挚爱；\n"
"知道我如此崇拜他，\n"
"他便泛出忧郁的黄色。\n"
"因为不论金币还是尘土，\n"
"他都随每个欲望而行，\n"
"金钱先生，\n"
"真是一位强大的骑士。”\n"
"    -Francisco de Quevedo, _Poderoso caballero es don Dinero_. 1603.\n"
"     trans. Christopher Johnson, 2009.\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/quotes.txt:a broken pillar"
msgid ""
"“Now Absalom in his lifetime had taken and reared up for himself a pillar,\n"
" which is in the king's dale: for he said, I have no son to keep my name in\n"
" remembrance...”\n"
"    -KJV Bible, 2 Samuel 18:18.\n"
msgstr ""
"“押沙龙活着的时候，在王谷为自己立了一根柱子，因为他说：我没有儿子，可以使我的名字流传……”\n"
"    -KJV Bible, 2 Samuel 18:18.\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/quotes.txt:calcifying dust cloud"
msgid ""
"“There is shadow under this red rock,\n"
" (Come in under the shadow of this red rock),\n"
" And I will show you something different from either\n"
" Your shadow at morning striding behind you\n"
" Or your shadow at evening rising to meet you;\n"
" I will show you fear in a handful of dust.”\n"
"    -T.S. Eliot, “The Waste Land”. 1922\n"
msgstr ""
"“这红岩下有阴影，\n"
"（来，到这红岩的阴影下），\n"
"我要给你看的，既不是\n"
"清晨在你身后阔步的影子，\n"
"也不是黄昏起身迎你的影子；\n"
"我要让你看见，一把尘土里的恐惧。”\n"
"    -T.S. Eliot, “The Waste Land”. 1922\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/quotes.txt:a crumbling gateway"
msgid "<Desolation>\n"
msgstr "<Desolation>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/quotes.txt:a faded altar of an unknown god"
msgid ""
"“Then Paul stood in the midst of Mars' hill, and said, Ye men of Athens, I\n"
" perceive that in all things ye are too superstitious. For as I passed by, and\n"
" beheld your devotions, I found an altar with this inscription, TO THE UNKNOWN\n"
" GOD.”\n"
"    -KJV Bible, Acts 17:22-23.\n"
msgstr ""
"“保罗站在亚略巴古当中，说：雅典人哪，我看你们凡事很敬畏鬼神。我经过时，看见你们所敬拜的，甚至有一座坛，上面写着：献给未知之神。”\n"
"    -KJV Bible, Acts 17:22-23.\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/quotes.txt:a flagged portal"
msgid ""
"“We made an expedition;\n"
" We met a host and quelled it;\n"
" We forced a strong position,\n"
" And killed the men who held it.\n"
" ...\n"
"“Fierce warriors rushed to meet us;\n"
" We met them, and o’erthrew them:\n"
" They struggled hard to beat us;\n"
" But we conquered them, and slew them.”\n"
"    -Thomas Love Peacock, “The War Song of Dinas Vawr”. 1829.\n"
msgstr ""
"“我们出征；\n"
"遇见大军，将其镇压；\n"
"攻破坚固阵地，\n"
"杀死守卫的人。\n"
"……\n"
"凶猛战士向我们冲来；\n"
"我们迎战，将他们击溃。\n"
"他们拼命想打败我们；\n"
"我们却征服他们，将他们杀死。”\n"
"    -Thomas Love Peacock, “The War Song of Dinas Vawr”. 1829.\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/quotes.txt:a gateway back into the dungeon"
msgid ""
"“O Progeny of Heaven! Empyreal Thrones!\n"
" With reason hath deep silence and demur\n"
" Seized us, though undismayed. Long is the way\n"
" And hard, that out of Hell leads up to light.”\n"
"    -John Milton, _Paradise Lost_. 1674 (2nd Ed.).\n"
msgstr ""
"“天国的后裔啊！苍穹的宝座！\n"
"深深的沉默与疑虑控制我们，\n"
"虽未使我们惊惶，却也合乎情理。\n"
"从地狱走向光明，道路漫长而艰难。”\n"
"    -John Milton, _Paradise Lost_. 1674 (2nd Ed.).\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/quotes.txt:a gateway leading deeper into the abyss."
msgid "<Abyss>\n"
msgstr "<Abyss>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/quotes.txt:a gateway to hell"
msgid ""
"“I am the way into the city of woe.\n"
" I am the way to a forsaken people.\n"
" I am the way into eternal sorrow.\n"
"\n"
" Sacred justice moved my architect.\n"
" I was raised here by divine omnipotence,\n"
" Primordial love and ultimate intellect.\n"
"\n"
" Only those elements time cannot wear\n"
" Were made before me, and beyond time I stand.\n"
" Abandon all hope, ye who enter here.”\n"
"    -Dante Alighieri, _The Divine Comedy_, “Inferno”, Canto III. ca. 1315.\n"
"     trans. John Ciardi, 1954.\n"
msgstr ""
"“由我进入痛苦之城，\n"
"由我进入被遗弃的人群，\n"
"由我进入永恒的悲伤。\n"
"\n"
"神圣正义感动了我的建筑者。\n"
"神之全能、原初之爱与至高智慧，\n"
"共同将我建立在此。\n"
"\n"
"在我之前，只有时间无法磨损之物，\n"
"而我立于时间之外。\n"
"进来的人们，抛弃一切希望。”\n"
"    -Dante Alighieri, _The Divine Comedy_, “Inferno”, Canto III. ca. 1315.\n"
"     trans. John Ciardi, 1954.\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/quotes.txt:a gateway to a ziggurat"
msgid ""
"“Captain: Take off every ‘zig’!!\n"
" Captain: For great justice.”\n"
"    -_Zero Wing_. 1990.\n"
msgstr ""
"“舰长：让所有‘zig’出击！！\n"
"舰长：为了伟大的正义。”\n"
"    -_Zero Wing_. 1990.\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/quotes.txt:a gateway to the decaying netherworld of tartarus"
msgid "<Tartarus>\n"
msgstr "<Tartarus>\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/quotes.txt:a granite statue"
msgid ""
"“I met a traveller from an antique land\n"
" Who said: Two vast and trunkless legs of stone\n"
" Stand in the desert. Near them on the sand,\n"
" Half sunk, a shatter'd visage lies, whose frown\n"
" And wrinkled lip and sneer of cold command\n"
" Tell that its sculptor well those passions read\n"
" Which yet survive, stamp'd on these lifeless things,\n"
" The hand that mock'd them and the heart that fed.\n"
" And on the pedestal these words appear:\n"
" ‘My name is Ozymandias, king of kings:\n"
" Look on my works, ye Mighty, and despair!’\n"
" Nothing beside remains: round the decay\n"
" Of that colossal wreck, boundless and bare,\n"
" The lone and level sands stretch far away.”\n"
"    -Percy Bysshe Shelley, “Ozymandias”. 1818.\n"
msgstr ""
"“我遇见来自古老国度的旅人，\n"
"他说：两条没有躯干的巨大石腿\n"
"立在沙漠中。附近的沙上，\n"
"半埋着一张破碎面孔；紧锁的眉，\n"
"皱起的唇，冷酷发令的讥笑，\n"
"表明雕刻者深谙那些激情，\n"
"将其刻在无生命之物上，使它们\n"
"胜过摹刻的手与滋养它们的心而留存。\n"
"基座上刻着这些话：\n"
"‘我名奥西曼迪亚斯，万王之王：\n"
"强者啊，看我的功业，绝望吧！’\n"
"除此之外，一无所存。巨像残骸四周，\n"
"空旷而无边，孤寂平坦的沙漠\n"
"一直伸向远方。”\n"
"    -Percy Bysshe Shelley, “Ozymandias”. 1818.\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/quotes.txt:a one-way gate to the infinite horrors of the abyss"
msgid ""
"“And if you gaze for long into an abyss, the abyss gazes also into you.”\n"
"    -Friedrich Nietzsche, _Beyond Good and Evil_ , Aphorism 146. 1886.\n"
"\n"
"“Well, in our country,” said Alice, still panting a little, “you'd generally\n"
" get to somewhere else — if you ran very fast for a long time, as we've been\n"
" doing.” “A slow sort of country!” said the Queen. “Now here, you see, it takes\n"
" all the running you can do, to keep in the same place. If you want to get\n"
" somewhere else, you must run at least twice as fast as that!”\n"
"    -Lewis Carroll, _Through the Looking-Glass, and What Alice Found There_,\n"
"ch. 2 “The Garden of Live Flowers”. 1871.\n"
msgstr ""
"“当你长久凝视深渊，深渊也在凝视你。”\n"
"    -Friedrich Nietzsche, _Beyond Good and Evil_ , Aphorism 146. 1886.\n"
"\n"
"“可是在我们那儿，”爱丽丝仍微微喘着气说，“像我们这样跑得很快、跑上很久，通常就会到别的地方去。”\n"
"“多慢的国度！”王后说，“在这里，你得拼命跑，才能留在原地。想去别的地方，至少得跑得比这再快一倍！”\n"
"    -Lewis Carroll, _Through the Looking-Glass, and What Alice Found There_,\n"
"ch. 2 “The Garden of Live Flowers”. 1871.\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/quotes.txt:the open sea"
msgid ""
"“I mused upon the mystery of fish, their strange and mindless beauty, how—\n"
" innocently evil—they prey upon each other, devouring the weaker and smaller\n"
" without rage or shout or change of countenance. There, in the realm of water,\n"
" which is also earth and air to them, the great fish passed up and down,\n"
" growing old without aging and enjoying eternal growth without the softness of\n"
" obesity. It was a world without morality, a world without choices, a world of\n"
" eating and spawning and growing great. I envied the great fish, and (in other,\n"
" smaller ponds) the lesser fish, darting and flashing and sparkling gold.\n"
"\n"
" They speak of ‘the beast in man,’ and of ‘the law of the jungle.’ Might they\n"
" not (so I reflected, strolling underneath a sky of clouds as blue and as white\n"
" as the tiles and marble of the Altar of Heaven), might they not better speak\n"
" of ‘the fish in man’? And of ‘the law of the sea’? The sea, from which they\n"
" say we came...?”\n"
"    -Avram Davidson, “Dagon”, 1959.\n"
msgstr ""
"“我沉思鱼的奥秘：奇异而无心的美，天真地邪恶。它们互相捕食，吞掉弱小者，没有愤怒、叫喊或表情改变。在那片水域——对它们也是大地与空气——大鱼来回游动，变老却不显衰老，永恒生长却没有肥胖的松软。那是没有道德、没有选择的世界，只有进食、繁殖与长大。我羡慕大鱼，也羡慕别的小池塘中那些穿梭、闪动、泛着金光的小鱼。\n"
"\n"
"人们说‘人心中的野兽’与‘丛林法则’。我漫步在蓝白云天之下，颜色如天坛的琉璃与大理石，不禁想：他们何不说‘人心中的鱼’与‘海洋法则’？毕竟，据说我们来自大海……”\n"
"    -Avram Davidson, “Dagon”, 1959.\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/quotes.txt:a portal to a secret trove of treasure"
msgid ""
"“He saw a large cavern and a vaulted [roof], in height equalling the stature\n"
" of a full-grown man and it was hewn in the live stone and lighted up with\n"
" light that came through air-holes and bullseyes in the upper surface of the\n"
" rock which formed the roof. He had expected to find naught save outer gloom in\n"
" this robbers' den, and he was surprised to see the whole room filled with\n"
" bales of all manner stuffs, and heaped up from sole to ceiling with\n"
" camel-loads of silks and brocades and embroidered cloths and mounds on mounds\n"
" of vari-colored carpetings; besides which he espied coins golden and silvern\n"
" without measure or account, some piled upon the ground and others bound in\n"
" leathern bags and sacks. Seeing these goods and moneys in such abundance, Ali\n"
" Baba determined in his mind that not during a few years only but for many\n"
" generations thieves must have stored their gains and spoils in this place.”\n"
"    -_The Arabian Nights_. trans. Sir Richard F. Burton, 1885.\n"
msgstr ""
"“他看见一个大洞窟，拱顶约有成年人的身高，直接凿入岩石，光线从顶上岩面的通气孔和圆窗射入。他原以为盗窟只会一片漆黑，却惊见满屋各种货包，从地面到天花板堆满驼载的丝绸、锦缎、绣布，还有层层彩毯。他又看见数不清的金银钱币，有的堆在地上，有的装在皮袋中。面对如此丰富的货物与钱财，阿里巴巴断定，盗贼在此积存所得与赃物，绝非几年，而是已有许多代。”\n"
"    -_The Arabian Nights_. trans. Sir Richard F. Burton, 1885.\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/quotes.txt:a portal to somewhere"
msgid ""
"“The hole now stood some three meters in diameter beginning from the dais -\n"
" though its outline shrank and dilated slightly like a pulsing, living thing.\n"
" Through it we could see shapes seething and changing constantly with the\n"
" colors and the light. Purple trees grew upside down from a pink sky, changing\n"
" into black flowers and the flowers into feathery tongues of giant yellow worms\n"
" lumbering over a shaking, exploding desert. It was as if the world couldn't\n"
" make up its mind what to be yet. Looking at the scene for even a moment gave\n"
" me a headache, and anyone looking at it for long would surely go mad.”\n"
"    -Laurence Yep, _Dragon War_. 1992.\n"
msgstr ""
"“洞口从高台延伸，直径已有约三米，但边缘像活物脉动般微微收缩膨胀。透过洞口，能看见形状不断随色彩和光线翻涌变换。紫树倒长在粉红天空中，变成黑花，花又变成巨大黄虫羽毛般的舌头，虫子爬过颤动爆裂的沙漠。仿佛世界尚未决定自己要成为什么样子。只看一瞬便令我头痛，长久凝视的人肯定会发疯。”\n"
"    -Laurence Yep, _Dragon War_. 1992.\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/quotes.txt:a rock wall"
msgid ""
"“I know not whether Laws be right,\n"
"   Or whether Laws be wrong;\n"
" All that we know who lie in gaol\n"
"   Is that the wall is strong;\n"
" And that each day is like a year,\n"
"   A year whose days are long.”\n"
"    -Oscar Wilde, “The Ballad of Reading Gaol”. 1898.\n"
msgstr ""
"“我不知法律对不对，\n"
"也不知法律错不错；\n"
"我们这些身陷牢狱的人\n"
"只知道墙壁很牢固；\n"
"每一天仿佛一年，\n"
"一年里的每天都漫长。”\n"
"    -Oscar Wilde, “The Ballad of Reading Gaol”. 1898.\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/quotes.txt:a sacrificial altar of ru"
msgid ""
"“Then I began taking off my hands. I put them in the top drawer. I removed my\n"
" feet and put them into the closet, along with my legs. I put my head in a box\n"
" and hung my torso up on a hanger. Then I walked out of the apartment, climbed\n"
" up the stairs to the roof. I opened the door and stepped out into a beautiful\n"
" green meadow.”\n"
"    -Celestial Navigations, “The Sniper”. 1995.\n"
msgstr ""
"“接着，我开始卸下双手，放进最上层抽屉。又卸下双脚，与腿一起放进壁橱。我将头装入盒子，把躯干挂在衣架上。然后走出公寓，爬上通往屋顶的楼梯。我推门走出，来到一片美丽的绿色草甸。”\n"
"    -Celestial Navigations, “The Sniper”. 1995.\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/quotes.txt:a shaft"
msgid ""
"“Gravity, a mere nuisance to Christian, was a terror to Pope, Pagan, and\n"
" Despair. To the mouse and any smaller animal it presents practically no\n"
" dangers. You can drop a mouse down a thousand-yard mine shaft; and, on\n"
" arriving at the bottom it gets a slight shock and walks away, provided\n"
" that the ground is fairly soft. A rat is killed, a man is broken, a\n"
" horse splashes.”\n"
"    -J.B.S. Haldane, “On Being The Right Size”. March 1926.\n"
msgstr ""
"“重力对基督徒不过是小小麻烦，对教皇、异教徒和绝望者却是恐怖。对鼠及更小动物而言，它几乎没有危险。把小鼠扔下一千码深的矿井，只要地面够软，它到底后稍稍一震，便能走开。大鼠会死，人会摔碎，马会溅开。”\n"
"    -J.B.S. Haldane, “On Being The Right Size”. March 1926.\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/quotes.txt:a shimmering altar of xom"
msgid ""
"the wise man bowed his head solemnly and spoke:\n"
" “theres actually zero difference between good & bad things.\n"
" you imbecile. you fucking moron”\n"
"    -wint, @dril Twitter. June 1, 2014\n"
msgstr ""
"智者庄严地低下头，说：\n"
"“好事跟坏事其实根本没差。\n"
"你这白痴。你他妈的蠢货。”\n"
"    -wint, @dril Twitter. June 1, 2014\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/quotes.txt:a staircase leading out of the dungeon"
msgid ""
"“We shall not cease from exploration\n"
" And the end of all our exploring\n"
" Will be to arrive where we started\n"
" And know the place for the first time.”\n"
"    -T.S. Eliot, “Little Gidding”, _Four Quartets_. 1943.\n"
msgstr ""
"“我们不会停止探索，\n"
"而一切探索的终点，\n"
"将是回到出发之处，\n"
"第一次认识那个地方。”\n"
"    -T.S. Eliot, “Little Gidding”, _Four Quartets_. 1943.\n"

msgctxt "textdb:descript/quotes.txt:a staircase to the ecumenical temple"
msgid "<Temple>\n"
msgstr "<Temple>\n"

