#. Reviewed database-04; preserve canonical keys, Lua and full English fallback.
msgctxt "textdb:database/miscname.txt:welcome_spam"
msgid "Will you prevail where others failed? Will you find the Orb of Zot?\n\nThe heart of this dungeon contains the @_great_adj_@ artefact, the Orb of Zot.\n\nWill you be the one to retrieve the @_great_adj_@ Orb of Zot from the depths?\n\nIt is said that the Orb of Zot exists deep within this dungeon.\n\nAre you destined to find the @_great_adj_@ Orb of Zot, or to die trying?\n\nEveryone else who sought the Orb of Zot has failed. Will you be different?\n\nThey say the Orb of Zot lies within this dungeon, but they say a lot of things.\n\nThe @_great_adj_@ Orb of Zot lies far below, as if waiting for you to find it.\n\nBelow lies the Orb of Zot, rumoured to be powerful enough to resurrect a god...\n\nThe Orb of Zot is coveted for many reasons. Will you seize it for your own?\n\nA smirking vizier told you that the Orb of Zot is just within this dungeon.\n\nIf you return without finding the Orb of Zot, so far below, it's all over!\n\nIt's a long way down to the Orb of Zot, but that shouldn't be any trouble.\n"
msgstr "你能在他人失败之处获胜吗？你能找到佐特宝珠吗？\n\n这座地下城的深处藏着@_great_adj_@神器——佐特宝珠。\n\n你会成为那个从深处取回@_great_adj_@佐特宝珠的人吗？\n\n据说佐特宝珠藏在这座地下城深处。\n\n你的命运是找到@_great_adj_@佐特宝珠，还是在追寻它的途中死去？\n\n其他寻找佐特宝珠的人都失败了。你会有所不同吗？\n\n他们说佐特宝珠藏在这座地下城里，不过，他们还说过不少别的事。\n\n@_great_adj_@佐特宝珠就在遥远的下方，仿佛在等待你去发现它。\n\n佐特宝珠就在下方，据说它的力量足以复活一位神……\n\n人们觊觎佐特宝珠的理由各不相同。你会将它据为己有吗？\n\n一位面带狡黠笑容的宰相告诉你，佐特宝珠就在这座地下城里。\n\n如果你空手而归，没能找到藏在深处的佐特宝珠，那就全完了！\n\n佐特宝珠离这里还深得很，不过这应该不成问题。\n"

#. Reviewed database-04; preserve canonical keys, Lua and full English fallback.
msgctxt "textdb:database/miscname.txt:welcome_spam dungeon descent"
msgid "Will you descend where others failed? Will you find the Orb of Zot?\n\nWill you be the one to descend and find the @_great_adj_@ Orb of Zot?\n\nAre you destined to descend to the @_great_adj_@ Orb of Zot, or to die trying?\n\nYou feel drawn to descend into the unfathomable depths for the Orb of Zot...\n\nThe @_great_adj_@ Orb of Zot lies below, waiting for you to descend and find it.\n\nIf you descend without finding the Orb of Zot, so far below, it's all over!\n"
msgstr "你能深入他人未能抵达之处吗？你能找到佐特宝珠吗？\n\n你会成为那个深入地下、找到@_great_adj_@佐特宝珠的人吗？\n\n你的命运是深入地下找到@_great_adj_@佐特宝珠，还是在途中死去？\n\n你感到一种引力，催促你深入莫测的地下，寻找佐特宝珠……\n\n@_great_adj_@佐特宝珠就在下方，等着你深入地下找到它。\n\n如果你一路深入，却没能找到深处的佐特宝珠，那就全完了！\n"

