#. Reviewed database-04; preserve canonical keys, Lua and full English fallback.
msgctxt "textdb:database/miscname.txt:welcome_spam halloween"
msgid "@welcome_spam@ Be careful! Halloween tonight.\n\nThe monsters here aren't big trick-or-treat fans. If they won't give you the Orb of Zot, you'll have to take it.\n\nA terrible geas has sent you after the Orb of Zot. What a horrible night to have a curse!\n\nAs you descend in search of the Orb, @_halloween_things_@ flock about you. This place is haunted!\n\nYou hear a witch cackle, and suddenly arrive in the dungeon. If you don't find the Orb of Zot, you'll turn into a @_lowly_@!\n\nIf you want to find the Orb of Zot, you'll need a much better costume than that.\n\nYou hope this place has the Orb of Zot, because it sure as hell doesn't have any candy.\n\nCountless adventurers have entered the dungeon seeking the Orb of Zot, but there's always room for one more...\n\nYou sense the Orb of Zot calling to you... with horror, you realise the call is coming from inside the dungeon!\n\n"
msgstr "@welcome_spam@小心！今晚是万圣节。\n\n这里的怪物不怎么喜欢“不给糖就捣蛋”。它们要是不肯交出佐特宝珠，你就得自己去抢了。\n\n一道可怕的魔法誓约迫使你追寻佐特宝珠。被诅咒的夜晚何其恐怖！\n\n你深入地下寻找宝珠，@_halloween_things_@在你周围聚集。这里闹鬼！\n\n你听到一位巫婆咯咯笑着，随即突然出现在地下城里。要是找不到佐特宝珠，你就会变成一只@_lowly_@！\n\n如果想找到佐特宝珠，你需要一套比这好得多的装扮。\n\n你希望这里真有佐特宝珠，因为这里连块糖都没有。\n\n无数冒险者曾走进地下城寻找佐特宝珠，不过这里总容得下再来一个……\n\n你感到佐特宝珠在呼唤你……令你惊恐的是，你意识到呼唤来自地下城内部！\n"

#. Reviewed database-04; preserve canonical keys, Lua and full English fallback.
msgctxt "textdb:database/miscname.txt:hell_effect_quiet"
msgid "{{\nif you.can_smell() then\n    return \"You smell brimstone.\"\nelse\n    return \"Brimstone rains from above.\"\nend\n}}\n\n\"Abandon all hope!\"\n\n\"Die, mortal!\"\n\n\"Leave now, before it is too late!\"\n\n\"No one will save a wretch like you!\"\n\n\"Run while you still can, mortal!\"\n\n\"Trespassers are not welcome here!\"\n\n\"We do not forgive those who trespass against us!\"\n\n\"We have such sights to show you!\"\n\n\"We have you now!\"\n\n\"We will enjoy watching you die!\"\n\n\"Whatever you seek here, you will find only death!\"\n\n\"You are not welcome here!\"\n\n\"You do not belong in this place!\"\n\n\"You have come here to die, fool!\"\n\n\"You should have left when you had the chance!\"\n\n\"You should not have come here!\"\n\n\"You will never escape!\"\n\n\"You will not leave this place!\"\n\nFor a moment, everything goes dark.\n\nSomething frightening happens.\n\nSomething moves in the shadows at the edge of your vision.\n\nYou catch a glimpse of your own reflection and are repulsed by what you see.\n\nYou feel abandoned and deserted...\n\nYou feel a strange tug, urging you deeper into the mouth of Hell...\n\nYou feel a terrible foreboding...\n\nYou feel like no one will even care if you die here...\n\nYou feel like you've forgotten something very important...\n\nYou feel lost and a long, long way from home...\n\nYou feel so tired, so weak... it would be so nice to just lie down... forever...\n\nYou feel totally surrounded, and yet so utterly alone...\n\nYou have a premonition of your own gruesome death.\n\nYou have a vision of yourself being tormented eternally.\n\nYou regret coming to this forsaken place.\n\nYou sense a hostile presence.\n\nYou sense an ancient evil watching you...\n\nYou sense something behind you... but there's nothing there.\n\nYou shiver with fear.\n\nYou shudder with dread.\n\nYou suddenly feel all small and vulnerable.\n\nBlood fills your mouth. It's definitely not yours.\n"
msgstr "{{\nif you.can_smell() then\n    return \"You smell brimstone.\"\nelse\n    return \"Brimstone rains from above.\"\nend\n}}\n\n“抛弃一切希望吧！”\n\n“去死吧，凡人！”\n\n“趁还来得及，立刻离开！”\n\n“没人会救你这样的可怜虫！”\n\n“趁你还能跑，逃吧，凡人！”\n\n“这里不欢迎闯入者！”\n\n“我们不会宽恕冒犯我们的人！”\n\n“我们有好些景象要让你见识！”\n\n“这下抓住你了！”\n\n“我们会欣赏你的死相！”\n\n“无论你在这里寻找什么，你找到的都只会是死亡！”\n\n“这里不欢迎你！”\n\n“你不属于这里！”\n\n“你是来送死的，蠢货！”\n\n“你本该趁还有机会时离开！”\n\n“你本不该来这里！”\n\n“你永远逃不掉！”\n\n“你休想离开这里！”\n\n一瞬间，一切都暗了下来。\n\n某种可怕的事情发生了。\n\n有东西在你视野边缘的阴影中移动。\n\n你瞥见自己的倒影，却被眼前的景象恶心得不堪忍受。\n\n你感到自己遭到抛弃，无人理睬……\n\n你感到一股奇怪的牵引，催促你深入地狱之口……\n\n你有一种极其不祥的预感……\n\n你觉得即使死在这里，也不会有人在意……\n\n你觉得自己忘记了某件极为重要的事……\n\n你感到迷失了方向，离家很远、很远……\n\n你感到如此疲惫、如此虚弱……若能就此躺下……永远不再起来，该多好……\n\n你感到自己被团团包围，却又孤独得无以复加……\n\n你预见了自己惨不忍睹的死状。\n\n你看到自己永世受折磨的幻象。\n\n你后悔来到这片被遗弃的地方。\n\n你感到一个怀有敌意的存在。\n\n你感到某种古老的邪恶正注视着你……\n\n你感到身后有什么东西……但那里空无一物。\n\n你害怕得发抖。\n\n你恐惧得战栗。\n\n你突然觉得自己无比渺小、脆弱。\n\n鲜血充满你的嘴。那绝不是你的血。\n"

#. Reviewed database-04; preserve canonical keys, Lua and full English fallback.
msgctxt "textdb:database/miscname.txt:hell_effect_noisy"
msgid "\"BEGONE, TRESPASSER!\"\n\n\"WE'VE GOT YOU NOW!\"\n\nA chorus of shrieks echoes around you!\n\nA gut-wrenching scream fills the air!\n\nA hateful voice recites your deepest, darkest secrets!\n\nAn anguished voice wails for what feels like eternity, then is suddenly cut off.\n\nYou hear a dreadful howling, growing closer and closer...\n\nYou hear a scream, and then it ends suddenly with a sickening wet crunch.\n\nYou hear abhorrent words that no mortal tongue could ever pronounce...\n\nYou hear an infernal cacophony!\n\nYou hear diabolical laughter!\n\nYou hear unearthly screeching!\n\nYou hear the gnashing of teeth!\n\nYou hear words spoken in a strange and terrible language...\n\nYou hear your loved ones begging you to come home...\n\nYou hear your loved ones encouraging you to just give up and die...\n\nYou hear your loved ones mocking you for coming here!\n\nYou hear your loved ones mourning your tragic, senseless death...\n\nYou hear your loved ones weeping in eternal, hopeless despair...\n\nYou hear your own voice begging for death!\n\nYou hear your own voice laughing maniacally!\n\nYou hear your own voice screaming in agony!\n\nYou hear your own voice wailing miserably!\n"
msgstr "“滚开，闯入者！”\n\n“这下抓住你了！”\n\n一片尖叫声在你周围回荡！\n\n撕心裂肺的惨叫响彻四周！\n\n一个充满憎恨的声音，念出你内心最隐秘、最黑暗的秘密！\n\n一个痛苦的声音哀号着，仿佛历经永恒，随后突然中断。\n\n你听到可怕的嚎叫，越来越近……\n\n你听到一声惨叫，随后是一声湿黏而令人作呕的碎裂声，惨叫戛然而止。\n\n你听到令人憎恶的言语，绝非凡人的舌头所能发出……\n\n你听到地狱般的刺耳喧嚣！\n\n你听到恶魔般的笑声！\n\n你听到非人的尖啸！\n\n你听到咬牙切齿的声音！\n\n你听到有人用奇异而可怕的语言说话……\n\n你听到亲爱的人们乞求你回家……\n\n你听到亲爱的人们劝你干脆放弃，去死吧……\n\n你听到亲爱的人们嘲笑你竟来到这里！\n\n你听到亲爱的人们哀悼你悲惨而无意义的死亡……\n\n你听到亲爱的人们在永恒、无望的绝望中哭泣……\n\n你听到自己的声音乞求一死！\n\n你听到自己的声音疯狂大笑！\n\n你听到自己的声音痛苦尖叫！\n\n你听到自己的声音凄惨哀号！\n"


#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "textdb:database/wpnnoise.txt:majin-bo greeting"
msgid "Well, hello there.\n\nAren't you a tasty little thing?\n\nWe're going to have a lot of fun together.\n\nLet's make your enemies cower, shall we?\n\nw:1\nYou scratch my back, I'll scratch yours... and I'm one HELL of a backscratcher.\n"
msgstr "啊，你好。\n\n你真是个美味的小东西，不是吗？\n\n我们在一起会玩得很开心。\n\n让我们吓得你的敌人瑟瑟发抖，好吗？\n\nw:1\n你替我挠背，我也替你挠背……而我可是地狱级的挠背高手。\n"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "textdb:database/wpnnoise.txt:majin-bo cast"
msgid "That's more like it.\n\nThis should be good.\n\nLet me show you the power of Hell.\n\nEmbrace the darkness.\n\nIsn't this worth a little damnation?\n\nI'll handle this.\n\nNow here's how it's done.\n\nYour soul is simply delicious.\n\nHas anyone ever told you how good your soul tastes?\n"
msgstr "这才像话。\n\n这下有好戏看了。\n\n让我向你展示地狱的力量。\n\n拥抱黑暗吧。\n\n这难道还不值得受点天谴吗？\n\n交给我吧。\n\n看好了，这才是正确的做法。\n\n你的灵魂真是美味。\n\n有人告诉过你，你的灵魂有多好吃吗？\n"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "textdb:database/wpnnoise.txt:majin-bo cast weak"
msgid "You're beginning to bore me.\n\nMy talents are wasted here.\n\nWhy bother with such petty cantrips?\n\nA demon of Hell at your fingers, and you cast that...\n\nNow, try casting something FUN.\n"
msgstr "你开始让我感到无聊了。\n\n我的才华全浪费在这里了。\n\n何必费心施展这种微不足道的戏法？\n\n地狱的恶魔任你驱使，你却只施展这种法术……\n\n现在，试着施展点有趣的东西。\n"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "textdb:database/wpnnoise.txt:zonguldrok greeting"
msgid "Another aspirant of the Dark Ways? We shall bring them all to heel together!\n\nAt last, a scion truly worthy of my power.\n\nFinally, someone more useful than... these people.\n"
msgstr "又一个追求黑暗之道的人？我们将携手令他们全都俯首称臣！\n\n终于来了一个真正配得上我力量的传人。\n\n终于来了一个比……这些家伙更有用的人。\n"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "textdb:database/wpnnoise.txt:zonguldrok reprise"
msgid "I knew you could not resist the dark call for long.\n\nI shall forgive your past transgressions, as long as you remember your place this time.\n\nI shall graciously assume that you are merely clumsy, not stupid.\n\nDon't test my patience; I have made greater than you beg for death over less!\n\nFinally...\n"
msgstr "我就知道，你抗拒不了黑暗的召唤太久。\n\n只要这次记住自己的本分，我就宽恕你过去的过错。\n\n我会宽宏大量地当你只是笨拙，而非愚蠢。\n\n别考验我的耐心；比你强得多的人，只因更小的过失，就被我折磨得求死！\n\n终于……\n"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "textdb:database/wpnnoise.txt:zonguldrok farewell"
msgid "You'll be back again, mark my words....\n\nDare you to relinquish me? You shall regret this insult!\n\nHow arrogant, to think that any shield could be mightier than the power of Zonguldrok!\n\nI wasn't done with you!\n"
msgstr "你还会回来的，记住我的话……\n\n你竟敢舍弃我？你会为这番侮辱后悔的！\n\n竟以为一面盾牌能胜过宗古多克的力量，何等狂妄！\n\n我还没用完你呢！\n"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "textdb:database/wpnnoise.txt:zonguldrok hat good"
msgid "At last; a crown worthy of my station.\n\nA good hat truly is one of the finest things in life or death.\n\nI applaud your taste in fashion, my scion.\n\nOur enemies shall surely prostrate themselves before my majesty now.\n"
msgstr "终于有一顶配得上我身份的冠冕了。\n\n一顶好帽子，确实是生前死后最美好的事物之一。\n\n我的传人，你的衣着品味值得赞许。\n\n这下，我们的敌人定会拜倒在我的威严面前。\n"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "textdb:database/wpnnoise.txt:zonguldrok hat okay"
msgid "A suitable chapeau.\n\nAn acceptable crown. For now.\n\nThe magic in this cap shall complement my own adequately.\n"
msgstr "一顶合适的帽子。\n\n一顶尚可接受的冠冕。暂且如此。\n\n这顶帽子的魔力，倒也足以与我的力量相辅相成。\n"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "textdb:database/wpnnoise.txt:zonguldrok hat bad"
msgid "How dare you fob such a shabby cap upon my head!\n\nWhat an insult, to strut around in such shoddy millinery.\n\nBah, this is suited for peasants, not a master of souls.\n\nHow lamentable, to be reduced to wearing... this.\n"
msgstr "你竟敢往我头上塞这么一顶破帽子！\n\n戴着如此粗劣的帽子招摇过市，简直是侮辱。\n\n呸，这适合农夫，可不适合灵魂的主宰。\n\n可悲啊，竟沦落到要戴上……这种东西。\n"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "textdb:database/wpnnoise.txt:zonguldrok hat crown of dyrovepreva"
msgid "I can see much more clearly than that foolish titan prince!\n\nThe purity of bronze and the beauty of gems: a fitting combination.\n\nLet us go off to war, my scion!\n"
msgstr "我可比那个愚蠢的泰坦王子看得清楚多了！\n\n青铜的纯净与宝石的美丽：多么相称的组合。\n\n我的传人，随我出征吧！\n"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "textdb:database/wpnnoise.txt:zonguldrok hat hat of the bear spirit"
msgid "My scion, our enemies will not go gentle into that good night!\n\nRage, rage against the shining of the light!\n\nOur combined strength is more than our foes can bear!\n"
msgstr "我的传人，我们的敌人可不会温顺地走进那良夜！\n\n怒斥吧，怒斥那光明的照耀！\n\n你我合力，敌人岂能承受！\n"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "textdb:database/wpnnoise.txt:zonguldrok hat hood of the assassin"
msgid "Be a stabber in the dark, treacherous to foes!\n\nFour thousand throats may be cut in one night by a running man.\n\nAh, the thrill of more efficient killing!\n"
msgstr "做个暗中的行刺者，令敌人防不胜防！\n\n奔行之人，一夜便能割开四千条喉咙。\n\n啊，更有效率的杀戮，何等快意！\n"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "textdb:database/wpnnoise.txt:zonguldrok hat mask of the dragon"
msgid "A mask of a dragon worshipper? I shall make the dragons worship me!\n\nSuch primal killing power, scion....\n\nBe of strong will, and bring death to all who oppose us!\n"
msgstr "拜龙者的面具？我会让巨龙来崇拜我！\n\n如此原始的杀戮之力，我的传人……\n\n意志坚定些，将死亡带给所有与我们为敌的人！\n"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "textdb:database/wpnnoise.txt:zonguldrok hat hat of the alchemist"
msgid "Ah, alchemy. So many new and exciting ways to cause harm....\n\nAll our enemies can now be test subjects!\n\nEven if you find the elixir of immortality, remember: I was immortal first!\n"
msgstr "啊，炼金术。能造成伤害的新奇方法真多……\n\n现在，所有敌人都能成为实验对象！\n\n即便找到长生不老药，也要记住：我比你更早获得永生！\n"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "textdb:database/wpnnoise.txt:zonguldrok hat hat of pondering"
msgid "Scion, are you pondering what I'm pondering?\n\nI can tolerate a stained cap for power such as this!\n\nI must contemplate what to do next....\n"
msgstr "我的传人，你在想我正在想的事吗？\n\n为了这样的力量，我可以容忍一顶脏帽子！\n\n我得思考一下接下来该做什么……\n"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "textdb:database/wpnnoise.txt:zonguldrok hat crown of vainglory"
msgid "All will be laid low in my presence!\n\nI can tolerate light if it grants the power to send my enemies to eternal darkness!\n\nKill for my glory, not yours, scion!\n"
msgstr "所有人都将在我面前倒下！\n\n只要能把敌人送入永恒的黑暗，我可以容忍光明！\n\n为我的荣耀杀戮，而非你的荣耀，我的传人！\n"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "textdb:database/wpnnoise.txt:fungus thoughts"
msgid "You feel a sudden urge to sporulate.\n\nYou feel a strange longing to hide under a damp log.\n\nYou feel sentimental about mildew.\n\nYou feel a distant kinship with mold.\n\nYour thoughts feel multiform.\n\nYou hear a chorus of tiny whispers in the back of your mind.\n\nYou contemplate finding a nice dark corner to settle down.\n\nYou consider sprouting fruit.\n\nYour mycelia itch. ...wait, 'your'?\n\nYou pine for rotting vegetation.\n\nThe drone of happy mushrooms echoes in your thoughts.\n\nYou long to contribute to the soil cycle.\n\nYou ponder forming a long-term relationship with algae.\n\nYou feel a longing for dead leaves.\n"
msgstr "你突然很想进行孢子繁殖。\n\n你莫名地渴望躲到潮湿的木头下面。\n\n你对霉菌生出了怀念之情。\n\n你觉得自己与霉菌有着遥远的亲缘。\n\n你觉得自己的思绪化作了种种形态。\n\n你听到脑海深处响起一片细微的低语。\n\n你考虑找个阴暗舒适的角落安顿下来。\n\n你考虑长出子实体。\n\n你的菌丝发痒。……等等，“你的”？\n\n你思念着腐烂的植物。\n\n快乐蘑菇的嗡鸣在你的思绪中回荡。\n\n你渴望为土壤循环贡献一份力量。\n\n你琢磨着与藻类建立一段长久的关系。\n\n你渴望落叶。\n"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "textdb:database/wpnnoise.txt:eel hand actions"
msgid "An eel nuzzles against your @head@.\n\nA quiet electric buzzing fills the air.\n\nYour eels briefly tussle with each other.\n\nOne of your eels playfully nips at the other.\n\nAn eel wriggles against you, leaving your @skin@ tingling.\n\nAn eel investigates your inventory.\n\nYour eels vigilantly scan the vicinity for threats.\n"
msgstr "一条鳗鱼亲昵地蹭着你的@head@。\n\n轻微的电流嗡鸣声充满四周。\n\n你的鳗鱼们短暂地扭打起来。\n\n你的一条鳗鱼顽皮地轻咬另一条。\n\n一条鳗鱼在你身上扭动，令你的@skin@阵阵发麻。\n\n一条鳗鱼察看着你的物品栏。\n\n你的鳗鱼们警惕地扫视周围，搜寻威胁。\n"

#. Reviewed database-05; preserve canonical English and paired random choices.
msgctxt "textdb:database/wpnnoise.txt:eel hand solo actions"
msgid "w:20\nYour eel searches [frantically|wistfully] for its partner.\n\nYour eel nuzzles against your @head@.\n\nA quiet electric buzzing fills the air.\n\nYour eel wriggles against you, leaving your @skin@ tingling.\n"
msgstr "w:20\n你的鳗鱼[焦急地|惆怅地]寻找自己的同伴。\n\n你的鳗鱼亲昵地蹭着你的@head@。\n\n轻微的电流嗡鸣声充满四周。\n\n你的鳗鱼在你身上扭动，令你的@skin@阵阵发麻。\n"


