#. Reviewed database-06; keep canonical random order.
msgctxt "textdb:database/wpnnoise.txt:frozen axe \"frostbite\""
msgid "You hear the [roaring|howling|raging|gusting] winds of a [blizzard|squall|snowstorm].\n\nw:5\nYou hear ice [creaking|groaning|grinding|cracking].\n\nw:1\nYou hear shards of ice [tinkling|chiming].\n\nw:1\nYou hear the [rumble|boom|crash] of [a glacier calving|icebergs colliding].\n\n\n"
msgstr "你听到[咆哮|呼啸|肆虐|阵阵劲吹]的风声，来自一场[暴风雪|飑|雪暴]。\n\nw:5\n你听到冰块[吱呀作响|低沉呻吟|相互碾磨|咔嚓开裂]。\n\nw:1\n你听到碎冰[叮当作响|清脆鸣响]。\n\nw:1\n你听到[隆隆巨响|轰然巨响|震天巨响]，那是[冰川崩解|冰山碰撞]的声音。\n\n\n"

#. Reviewed database-06; keep canonical random order.
msgctxt "textdb:database/wpnnoise.txt:trishula \"condemnation\""
msgid "@Your_weapon@ lets out a [divine|blessed|sacred|holy] [chiming|tinkling|ringing|pealing|tintinnabulation].\n\n@Your_weapon@ sings the [divine|blessed|sacred|holy] song of the [angels|Heavens|Barachim].\n\nw:5\n@Your_weapon@ [chants|recites|intones] a [divine|blessed|sacred|holy] warrior-psalm.\n\nw:1\n@Your_weapon@ [calls|cries for|demands] [evildoers|demons|the wicked] to come forth and be judged!\n\nw:1\n@Your_weapon@ [wails|laments|cries out] at the [injustice|cruelty|suffering] of the world.\n\nw:1\n@Your_weapon@ [croaks|ribbits] in the tongue of ancient peoples.\n\n"
msgstr "@Your_weapon@发出[神授的|蒙福的|神圣的|圣洁的][钟鸣|叮当声|铃声|洪亮钟声|清脆铃声]。\n\n@Your_weapon@唱起[神授的|蒙福的|神圣的|圣洁的]颂歌，歌颂[天使|天界|蛙人]。\n\nw:5\n@Your_weapon@[吟唱|诵读|庄严吟诵]一首[神授的|蒙福的|神圣的|圣洁的]战士赞美诗。\n\nw:1\n@Your_weapon@[呼唤|高声呼唤|勒令][作恶者|恶魔|邪恶之徒]上前接受审判！\n\nw:1\n@Your_weapon@[哀号|悲叹|疾呼]，为这世间的[不公|残酷|苦难]。\n\nw:1\n@Your_weapon@用远古民族的语言[呱呱叫|发出蛙鸣]。\n\n"


