#. Reviewed database-15 graffiti and verified colour dependencies.
msgctxt "textdb:database/graffiti.txt:_graffiti_class_master_"
msgid "a master class on excavation taught by formicids\n\na master class on insults taught by [demons|imps]\n\na master class on the many uses of giant clubs taught by [ogres|oni]\n\na master class on Unarmed Combat taught by felids\n\nw:1\na master class on [art|calligraphy] taught by anonymous graffiti authors\n"
msgstr "蚁族教授的挖掘大师课\n\n[恶魔|小鬼]教授的辱骂大师课\n\n[食人魔|鬼人]教授的巨型木棒多用途大师课\n\n猫族教授的徒手格斗大师课\n\nw:1\n匿名涂鸦作者教授的[艺术|书法]大师课\n"

