#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom general effect"
msgid "Xom snickers.\n\n\"How about this?\"\n\n\"Let's try an experiment, hmmm?\"\n\nw:1\n\"I wonder... What does this button do?\"\n"
msgstr "佐姆窃笑着。\n\n“这个怎么样？”\n\n“我们来做个实验吧，嗯？”\n\nw:1\n“我想知道……这个按钮是做什么的？”\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom general gift"
msgid "Xom grants you a gift!\n\n\"Here.\"\n\nXom's generous nature manifests itself.\n\nXom grants you an implement of some kind.\n\n\"Take this instrument of something!\"\n\n\"Take this token of my esteem.\"\n\nXom smiles on you.\n\n\"Catch!\"\n"
msgstr "佐姆赐予你一件礼物！\n\n“给你。”\n\n佐姆显现着祂慷慨的本性。\n\n佐姆赐予你某种工具。\n\n“拿着这件不知用途的工具！”\n\n“收下这份聊表我心意的礼物。”\n\n佐姆对你微笑。\n\n“接住！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom orb gift"
msgid "\"Is this the Orb you wanted?\"\n\n\"Many adventurers have sought this Orb.\"\n\nw:3\n\"Ponder my incredible Orb!\"\n"
msgstr "“这就是你想要的宝珠吗？”\n\n“许多冒险者都在寻找这个宝珠。”\n\nw:3\n“想想我那不可思议的宝珠！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom single summon"
msgid "\"Serve the mortal, my child!\"\n\n\"Serve the toy, my child!\"\n\nXom opens a gate.\n"
msgstr "“侍奉这个凡人，我的孩子！”\n\n“侍奉这个玩具，我的孩子！”\n\n佐姆打开了一扇门。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom multiple summons"
msgid "\"Serve the mortal, my children!\"\n\nXom grants you some temporary aid.\n\nXom momentarily opens a gate.\n"
msgstr "“侍奉这个凡人，我的孩子们！”\n\n佐姆给了你一些临时援助。\n\n佐姆瞬间打开了一扇门。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom animate monster weapon"
msgid "\"Time to have some fun!\"\n\nYou hear Xom's maniacal laughter.\n\nXom grants you a minor favour.\n\nXom smiles on you.\n"
msgstr "“是时候找点乐子了！”\n\n你听到佐姆疯狂的笑声。\n\n佐姆帮了你一个小忙。\n\n佐姆对你微笑。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom flora ring"
msgid "Xom shows off a fistful of green thumbs.\n\nXom spreads life in this Dungeon full of death.\n\nXom incites some dramatic evolution in the adjacent floor mould.\n\n\"It's alive! It's alive!\"\n\nw:5\nXom adds fresh vegetables to this Dungeon dish.\n\nw:5\nXom plants some magic beans in the ground.\n"
msgstr "佐姆炫耀着自己高超的园艺本领。\n\n佐姆在这充满死亡的地下城中播撒生机。\n\n佐姆让附近地面上的霉菌经历了一场剧烈的进化。\n\n“它活了！它活了！”\n\nw:5\n佐姆给这道地下城大餐添了些新鲜蔬菜。\n\nw:5\n佐姆把几颗魔豆种进地里。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom scenery generic"
msgid "Xom briefly touches your surroundings.\n\nXom complains about the scenery.\n\nXom alters the dungeon around you.\n"
msgstr "佐姆轻触了一下你周围的环境。\n\n佐姆抱怨起这里的景致。\n\n佐姆改变了你周围的地下城。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom scenery open_door"
msgid "@Xom scenery generic@\n"
msgstr "@Xom scenery generic@\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom scenery closed_door"
msgid "@Xom scenery generic@\n"
msgstr "@Xom scenery generic@\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom scenery altar_xom"
msgid "Xom adds some personal touches to your environment.\n\n\"There, this looks better.\"\n\n\"Just a minor improvement...\"\n\n@Xom scenery generic@\n"
msgstr "佐姆给你周围的环境加了些自己的风格。\n\n“这下看着好多了。”\n\n“只是一点小小的改进……”\n\n@Xom scenery generic@\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom scenery cache_of_fruit"
msgid "Xom accidentally drops some snacks.\n\nXom prepares the finest cultivars of fruit found anywhere, then drops them.\n"
msgstr "佐姆不小心掉下了些零食。\n\n佐姆备好了世间最优良的水果品种，然后把它们掉在了地上。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom scenery cache_of_meat"
msgid "Xom [offers|fetches] you some snacks.\n\nXom prepares a banquet formed from your trail of carnage through the Dungeon.\n"
msgstr "佐姆[送给|取来给]你一些零食。\n\n佐姆用你在地下城中一路杀戮的成果准备了一场盛宴。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom scenery cache_of_baked_goods"
msgid "Xom offers some snacks, fresh out of the oven.\n"
msgstr "佐姆送来了一些刚出炉的零食。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom scenery enter_abyss"
msgid "Xom suggests a refreshing change of pace.\n\nXom tears open a few small holes in reality.\n\nXom bends space into knots.\n"
msgstr "佐姆提议换换节奏，图个新鲜。\n\n佐姆在现实中撕开了几个小洞。\n\n佐姆把空间扭成了结。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom scenery trap_teleport"
msgid "@Xom scenery enter_abyss@\n"
msgstr "@Xom scenery enter_abyss@\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom kind door ring"
msgid "A short distance around you seems to assume a strange safe solidity.\n\nXom creates a safe adventurer enclosure.\n\n\"Would you like some space to yourself, mortal?\"\n"
msgstr "你周围不远处似乎形成了一片奇异而安稳的空间。\n\n佐姆造了一个安全的冒险者围栏。\n\n“想要一点属于自己的空间吗，凡人？”\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom mean door ring"
msgid "Xom raises up and pulls in a makeshift [warmonger|duelist]'s arena.\n\nXom locks you up as an exhibit to study.\n\nw:5\nXom constructs another @player_genus@ Petting Zoo.\n"
msgstr "佐姆竖起一座临时的[战狂|决斗者]竞技场，并将它收拢。\n\n佐姆把你关起来，当作展品研究。\n\nw:5\n佐姆又建了一座@player_genus@宠物动物园。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom bazaar trip"
msgid "Xom whisks you away into a realm of unfathomable savings!\n\nXom casts you into... a shopping extravaganza?\n\nXom offers you everything you could ever need (to amuse Xom).\n\nw:5\nXom offers you everything you could ever need (in Xom's infallible divine judgment).\n\nThe world spins wildly as Xom's jovial laughter rings.\n\nw:2\n\"Your coin purse has grown too comfortable in its little world, mortal!\"\n"
msgstr "佐姆把你卷入了一个优惠深不可测的领域！\n\n佐姆把你扔进了……一场购物狂欢？\n\n佐姆为你提供了所有你可能需要的东西（用来逗佐姆开心）。\n\nw:5\n佐姆为你提供了所有你可能需要的东西（据佐姆绝不会出错的神圣判断）。\n\n随着佐姆欢快的笑声响起，世界疯狂地旋转起来。\n\nw:2\n“你的钱袋在它的小世界里过得太舒服了，凡人！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom zero miscast effect"
msgid "Xom almost notices you.\n\nXom's attention almost turns to you for a moment.\n\nXom's power almost touches on you for a moment.\n\nYou almost hear Xom's maniacal laughter.\n"
msgstr "佐姆几乎察觉到了你。\n\n有那么一会儿，佐姆几乎留意到了你。\n\n有那么一会儿，佐姆的力量几乎触动到了你。\n\n你几乎听到佐姆疯狂的笑声。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:_xom_number_"
msgid "two\n\nthree\n\nfour\n\nfive\n\nsix\n"
msgstr "两\n\n三\n\n四\n\n五\n\n六\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom feature lava"
msgid "@The_feature@ spits out sparks!\n\n@The_feature@ briefly solidifies.\n"
msgstr "@The_feature@喷出了火星！\n\n@The_feature@短暂地凝固了。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom feature shallow water"
msgid "@The_feature@ briefly bubbles.\n\n@The_feature@ briefly swirls.\n\n@The_feature@ briefly glows.\n\n@The_feature@ briefly glows @any_glowing_colour@.\n\n@The_feature@ briefly flashes @any_colour@.\n\n@The_feature@ briefly boils.\n\n@The_feature@ briefly freezes.\n"
msgstr "@The_feature@短暂地冒起气泡。\n\n@The_feature@短暂地打起旋来。\n\n@The_feature@短暂地发出光芒。\n\n@The_feature@短暂地发出@any_glowing_colour@的光芒。\n\n@The_feature@短暂地闪现出@any_colour@。\n\n@The_feature@短暂地沸腾了。\n\n@The_feature@短暂地结冰了。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom feature deep water"
msgid "@Xom feature shallow water@\n\nOff to the side, you spot something lurking in @the_feature@.\n"
msgstr "@Xom feature shallow water@\n\n你瞥见一旁的@the_feature@中潜伏着什么。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom feature blood"
msgid "@Xom feature shallow water@\n\n@The_feature@ briefly coagulates.\n"
msgstr "@Xom feature shallow water@\n\n@The_feature@短暂地凝结了。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom feature eyes"
msgid "@The_feature@ looks at you curiously.\n\n@The_feature@ looks right through you.\n"
msgstr "@The_feature@好奇地看着你。\n\n@The_feature@的目光直直穿透了你。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom feature dry"
msgid "Water briefly sprays from @the_feature@.\n\nSparkling water briefly sprays from @the_feature@.\n\nBlood briefly sprays from @the_feature@.\n\nDust puffs up from @the_feature@.\n"
msgstr "水从@the_feature@中短暂地喷涌而出。\n\n闪亮的水从@the_feature@中短暂地喷涌而出。\n\n鲜血从@the_feature@中短暂地喷涌而出。\n\n尘土从@the_feature@中扬起。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom feature statuelike"
msgid "@The_feature@ turns to glare at you.\n\n@The_feature@ turns to stare at you.\n\n@The_feature@ turns away from you.\n\n@The_feature@ spins in place.\n"
msgstr "@The_feature@转过来怒视着你。\n\n@The_feature@转过来盯着你。\n\n@The_feature@转过身去，背对着你。\n\n@The_feature@原地旋转起来。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom feature tree"
msgid "@The_feature@ bends towards you.\n\n@The_feature@ bends away from you.\n\n@The_feature@ sways in place.\n"
msgstr "@The_feature@朝你弯了过来。\n\n@The_feature@向远离你的方向弯去。\n\n@The_feature@原地摇摆起来。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom feature translucent wall"
msgid "Dim shapes swim through @the_feature@.\n\nFaint @any_colour@ flames crawl over @the_feature@.\n\n@The_feature@ is briefly covered in @any_colour_pattern@.\n\n@The_feature@ is briefly covered in @any_glowing_colour_pattern@.\n\n@The_feature@ is briefly covered in @any_graffiti@.\n"
msgstr "模糊的形影在@the_feature@中游动。\n\n微弱的@any_colour@火焰在@the_feature@上蔓延。\n\n@The_feature@短暂地布满了@any_colour_pattern@。\n\n@The_feature@短暂地布满了@any_glowing_colour_pattern@。\n\n@The_feature@短暂地布满了@any_graffiti@。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom feature metal wall"
msgid "Tendrils of electricity crawl over @the_feature@.\n\n@The_feature@ briefly appears tarnished.\n"
msgstr "电流的细丝在@the_feature@上蔓延。\n\n@The_feature@短暂地失去了光泽。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom feature stone arch"
msgid "@The_feature@ briefly shows a sunny meadow on the other side.\n\n@The_feature@ briefly shows a lifeless wasteland on the other side.\n\n@The_feature@ briefly shows strange @glowing_adj@ figures on the other side.\n\n@The_feature@ briefly shows bizarre @glowing_adj@ buildings on the other side.\n\n@The_feature@ briefly shows a translucent wall covered in @any_colour_pattern@ on the other side.\n\n@The_feature@ briefly shows a translucent wall covered in @any_glowing_colour_pattern@ on the other side.\n\n@The_feature@ briefly shows a translucent wall covered in @any_graffiti@ on the other side.\n"
msgstr "@The_feature@的另一侧短暂地显现出一片阳光明媚的草地。\n\n@The_feature@的另一侧短暂地显现出一片毫无生机的荒原。\n\n@The_feature@的另一侧短暂地显现出奇异的@glowing_adj@身影。\n\n@The_feature@的另一侧短暂地显现出古怪的@glowing_adj@建筑。\n\n@The_feature@的另一侧短暂地显现出一面布满@any_colour_pattern@的透明墙。\n\n@The_feature@的另一侧短暂地显现出一面布满@any_glowing_colour_pattern@的透明墙。\n\n@The_feature@的另一侧短暂地显现出一面布满@any_graffiti@的透明墙。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom underfoot general"
msgid "@The_feature@ briefly shifts under you.\n\nAn imperceptible spirit brushes against @the_feature@ beside you.\n"
msgstr "@The_feature@在你脚下短暂地移动了。\n\n一个无法察觉的精魂轻拂过你身旁的@the_feature@。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom underfoot water"
msgid "@The_feature@ briefly recedes away from you.\n\nAn imperceptible spirit sends ripples through @the_feature@ beside you.\n"
msgstr "@The_feature@短暂地从你身边退开。\n\n一个无法察觉的精魂在你身旁的@the_feature@中激起涟漪。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom underfoot airborne general"
msgid "@The_feature@ seems to fall away from under you!\n\n@The_feature@ seems to rush up at you!\n"
msgstr "@The_feature@似乎在从你身下坠落！\n\n@The_feature@似乎在向你迎面冲来！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom underfoot airborne water"
msgid "@Xom underfoot airborne general@\n\nAn imperceptible spirit flows into @the_feature@ beneath you.\n"
msgstr "@Xom underfoot airborne general@\n\n一个无法察觉的精魂流入了你身下的@the_feature@。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom inventory singular"
msgid "@Your_item@ briefly glows.\n\n@Your_item@ briefly glows @any_glowing_colour@.\n\n@Your_item@ briefly vibrates.\n\n@Your_item@ briefly flashes @any_colour@.\n"
msgstr "@Your_item@短暂地发出光芒。\n\n@Your_item@短暂地发出@any_glowing_colour@的光芒。\n\n@Your_item@短暂地振动起来。\n\n@Your_item@短暂地闪现出@any_colour@。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom inventory plural"
msgid "One of @your_item@ briefly glows.\n\nOne of @your_item@ briefly glows @any_glowing_colour@.\n\nOne of @your_item@ briefly vibrates.\n\nOne of @your_item@ briefly flashes @any_colour@.\n\n@Your_item@ briefly glow.\n\n@Your_item@ briefly glow @any_glowing_colour@.\n\n@Your_item@ briefly vibrate.\n\n@Your_item@ briefly flash @any_colour@.\n"
msgstr "@your_item@中的一件短暂地发出光芒。\n\n@your_item@中的一件短暂地发出@any_glowing_colour@的光芒。\n\n@your_item@中的一件短暂地振动起来。\n\n@your_item@中的一件短暂地闪现出@any_colour@。\n\n@Your_item@短暂地发出光芒。\n\n@Your_item@短暂地发出@any_glowing_colour@的光芒。\n\n@Your_item@短暂地振动起来。\n\n@Your_item@短暂地闪现出@any_colour@。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom floor inventory singular"
msgid "@Xom inventory singular@\n\n@Your_item@ falls out of your pack, then immediately jumps back in!\n"
msgstr "@Xom inventory singular@\n\n@Your_item@从背包里掉了出来，然后立刻跳了回去！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom floor inventory plural"
msgid "@Xom inventory plural@\n\nOne of @your_item@ falls out of your pack, then immediately jumps back in!\n\n@Your_item@ fall out of your pack, then immediately jump back in!\n"
msgstr "@Xom inventory plural@\n\n@your_item@中的一件从背包里掉了出来，然后立刻跳了回去！\n\n@Your_item@从背包里掉了出来，然后立刻跳了回去！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom bandages"
msgid "You briefly get tangled in your bandages.\n"
msgstr "你短暂地被自己的绷带缠住了。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom floor bandages"
msgid "@Xom bandages@\n\nYou trip over your bandages.\n"
msgstr "@Xom bandages@\n\n你被自己的绷带绊了一下。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom one eye"
msgid "A monocle briefly appears over your eye.\n\nAn eyepatch briefly covers your eye.\n\nA burst of @any_colour@ light briefly shoots from your eye!\n"
msgstr "你的眼前短暂地出现了一片单片眼镜。\n\n一只眼罩短暂地盖住了你的眼睛。\n\n一束@any_colour@的光短暂地从你的眼中射出！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom eyes"
msgid "A monocle briefly appears over one of your eyes.\n\nAn eyepatch briefly covers one of your eyes.\n\nBursts of @any_colour@ light briefly shoot from your eyes!\n"
msgstr "你的一只眼前短暂地出现了一片单片眼镜。\n\n一只眼罩短暂地盖住了你的一只眼睛。\n\n一道道@any_colour@的光短暂地从你的双眼中射出！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom ears"
msgid "Your ears flap wildly.\n\nYour ears wiggle.\n\n[Smoke|Steam] briefly shoots from your ears!\n"
msgstr "你的耳朵疯狂地扇动起来。\n\n你的耳朵动了动。\n\n[烟|蒸汽]短暂地从你的耳朵里喷出！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom mouth"
msgid "Your mouth briefly shrinks away entirely.\n\nYour mouth briefly widens across your entire face.\n\nYou briefly grow another mouth.\n\n[Smoke|Steam] briefly pours from your mouth!\n"
msgstr "你的嘴短暂地缩得完全消失了。\n\n你的嘴短暂地张大，横贯了整张脸。\n\n你短暂地长出了另一张嘴。\n\n[烟|蒸汽]短暂地从你的嘴里涌出！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom hair"
msgid "Your eyebrows briefly feel incredibly bushy.\n\nYour eyebrows wriggle.\n\nYou briefly grow a large moustache and beard.\n"
msgstr "你短暂地感觉自己的眉毛浓密得不可思议。\n\n你的眉毛扭动起来。\n\n你短暂地长出了浓密的胡子。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom impromptu dance"
msgid "You perform an impromptu @dance_name@.\n\nYou do an impromptu @acrobatic_move_name@.\n\nYou compulsively click your heels together @_xom_number_@ times.\n\nYou compulsively stomp your @feet@ @_xom_number_@ times.\n"
msgstr "你即兴跳起了@dance_name@。\n\n你即兴做了个@acrobatic_move_name@。\n\n你不由自主地把脚跟相碰了@_xom_number_@次。\n\n你不由自主地跺了@_xom_number_@次@feet@。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:dance_name"
msgid "ballet\n\ncha-cha\n\nfandango\n\njig\n\nline dance\n\nmacarena\n\ntango\n\ntapdance\n\nwaltz\n"
msgstr "芭蕾舞\n\n恰恰舞\n\n方丹戈舞\n\n吉格舞\n\n排舞\n\n玛卡莲娜舞\n\n探戈\n\n踢踏舞\n\n华尔兹\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:acrobatic_move_name"
msgid "@hand@stand\n\ncartwheel\n\npirouette\n\nsomersault\n"
msgstr "用@hand@倒立\n\n侧手翻\n\n单脚旋转\n\n空翻\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom tail"
msgid "Your tail briefly retracts into your body.\n\nYour tail briefly grows to an incredible length.\n\nYou briefly grow another tail.\n"
msgstr "你的尾巴短暂地缩进了体内。\n\n你的尾巴短暂地长到了不可思议的长度。\n\n你短暂地长出了另一条尾巴。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom random body part singular"
msgid "Your @random_body_part_internal_singular@ briefly wanders out of your body, then fuses itself back in!\n\nYour @random_body_part_external_singular@ briefly jumps off your body, then reattaches itself!\n"
msgstr "你的@random_body_part_internal_singular@短暂地游出体外，然后又融回了体内！\n\n你的@random_body_part_external_singular@短暂地从身上跳了下来，然后又接了回去！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom random body part plural"
msgid "Your @random_body_part_internal_plural@ briefly wander out of your body, then fuse themselves back in!\n\nYour @random_body_part_external_plural@ briefly jump off your body, then reattach themselves!\n"
msgstr "你的@random_body_part_internal_plural@短暂地游出体外，然后又融回了体内！\n\n你的@random_body_part_external_plural@短暂地从身上跳了下来，然后又接了回去！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom unarmed one hand"
msgid "A fancy cane briefly appears in your @hand@.\n\nYou compulsively punch the air.\n"
msgstr "一根精美的手杖短暂地出现在你的@hand@中。\n\n你不由自主地朝空气挥了一拳。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom unarmed two hands"
msgid "@Xom unarmed one hand@\n\nTwo fancy canes briefly appear in your @hands@.\n\nYou compulsively clap your @hands@ @_xom_number_@ times.\n"
msgstr "@Xom unarmed one hand@\n\n两根精美的手杖短暂地出现在你的@hands@中。\n\n你不由自主地拍了@_xom_number_@次@hands@。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom cloak slot"
msgid "@Your_item@ billows in an unfelt wind.\n\n@Your_item@ briefly wraps itself around your @head@!\n\n@Your_item@ is briefly covered in @any_glowing_colour_pattern@!\n"
msgstr "@Your_item@在感觉不到的风中鼓动。\n\n@Your_item@短暂地裹住了你的@head@！\n\n@Your_item@短暂地布满了@any_glowing_colour_pattern@！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom helmet slot"
msgid "@Your_item@ leaps into the air, briefly spins, then lands back on your @head@!\n"
msgstr "@Your_item@跃到空中，短暂地转了几圈，然后落回你的@head@上！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom offhand slot"
msgid "@Your_item@ spins!\n\n@Your_item@ briefly flashes @any_glowing_colour@!\n"
msgstr "@Your_item@旋转起来！\n\n@Your_item@短暂地闪现出@any_glowing_colour@！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom gloves slot"
msgid "@Your_item@ briefly grows @_xom_number_@ extra fingers!\n"
msgstr "@Your_item@短暂地多长出了@_xom_number_@根手指！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom boots slot"
msgid "@Your_item@ grows to a huge size, then shrinks back down!\n"
msgstr "@Your_item@膨胀得巨大无比，然后又缩回了原样！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom amulet slot"
msgid "@Your_item@ pulsates!\n\n@Your_item@ flares @any_glowing_colour@, then returns to normal.\n\n@Your_item@ briefly flies off and hovers over your @head@!\n"
msgstr "@Your_item@搏动起来！\n\n@Your_item@迸发出@any_glowing_colour@的光芒，然后恢复了原样。\n\n@Your_item@短暂地飞了起来，悬在你的@head@上方！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom gizmo slot"
msgid "@Your_item@ jiggles!\n\n@Your_item@ leaks @rainbow_colour@ smoke!\n"
msgstr "@Your_item@晃动起来！\n\n@Your_item@冒出了@rainbow_colour@的烟！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom ring slot"
msgid "@Your_item@ twitches!\n\n@Your_item@ briefly dulls, then brightens again!\n\n@Your_item@ briefly brightens, then dulls again!\n"
msgstr "@Your_item@抽动了一下！\n\n@Your_item@短暂地变得黯淡，然后又亮了起来！\n\n@Your_item@短暂地变亮，然后又黯淡下来！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom dragon armour"
msgid "The scales on @your_item@ wiggle briefly.\n"
msgstr "@your_item@上的鳞片短暂地扭动起来。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom animal skin"
msgid "The fur on @your_item@ grows longer at an alarming rate, then retracts back to normal.\n"
msgstr "@your_item@上的毛皮以惊人的速度变长，然后又缩回原样。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom leather armour"
msgid "@Your_item@ briefly grows fur, then returns to normal.\n"
msgstr "@Your_item@短暂地长出了毛皮，然后恢复了原样。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom robe"
msgid "You briefly become tangled in @your_item@.\n"
msgstr "你短暂地被@your_item@缠住了。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom metal armour"
msgid "@Your_item@ briefly appears rusty.\n"
msgstr "@Your_item@短暂地显得锈迹斑斑。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom rearrange the pieces"
msgid "Xom decides to rearrange the pieces.\n\n\"First here, now there.\"\n\n\"This might be better!\"\n\n\"This is how I like it!\"\n"
msgstr "佐姆决定重新排列这些棋子。\n\n“先到这儿，再到那儿。”\n\n“这可能会更好！”\n\n“这就是我喜欢的！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom teleportation journey"
msgid "\"Whee!\"\n\n\"Let's go for a ride!\"\n\n\"Where it stops, nobody knows!\"\n\nXom twists space around you.\n"
msgstr "“哟！”\n\n“我们去兜风吧！”\n\n“停在哪里，没人知道！”\n\n佐姆扭曲了你周围的空间。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom confusion"
msgid "\"Heh heh heh...\"\n\nXom's power touches on your mind for a moment.\n\nXom titters.\n"
msgstr "“呵呵……”\n\n有那么一会儿，佐姆的力量触动到了你的心灵。\n\n佐姆咯咯地笑着。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom drinkless confusion"
msgid "\"Stumble well, my pet!\"\n\nXom's power touches upon your body and mind for a moment.\n"
msgstr "“好好踉跄吧，我的宠物！”\n\n佐姆的力量短暂地触及了你的身心。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom suffering"
msgid "\"You have displeased me, mortal.\"\n\n\"You have grown too confident for your meagre worth.\"\n\nXom's power touches on you for a moment.\n\nYou hear Xom's maniacal laughter.\n\n\"Suffer!\"\n\nXom's malign attention turns to you for a moment.\n"
msgstr "“你让我不高兴了，凡人。”\n\n“你这点可怜的本事，却变得如此自信。”\n\n佐姆的力量短暂地触及了你。\n\n你听到佐姆疯狂的笑声。\n\n“受苦吧！”\n\n佐姆恶意的目光短暂地转向了你。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom torment all"
msgid "Xom torments the living!\n\nXom spreads torment and darkness!\n\nXom unleashes waves of agony!\n\nXom's malign attention turns towards your situation for a moment.\n\nw:5\nThe hand of Xom pokes all present souls.\n"
msgstr "佐姆折磨着活物！\n\n佐姆散播着折磨与黑暗！\n\n佐姆释放出一波波苦痛！\n\n佐姆恶意的目光短暂地转向了你眼下的处境。\n\nw:5\n佐姆之手戳了戳在场的所有灵魂。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom hostile monster"
msgid "\"Time to have some fun!\"\n\n\"Fight to survive, mortal.\"\n\n\"Let's see if it's strong enough to survive yet.\"\n\nYou hear Xom's maniacal laughter.\n"
msgstr "“是时候找点乐子了！”\n\n“为生存而战，凡人。”\n\n“我们看看它现在是否强大到足以活下来了。”\n\n你听到佐姆疯狂的笑声。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom send in the clones"
msgid "Xom feels like there should be more of you to share with the Dungeon.\n\nXom gently smashes a mirror over your [@random_body_part_external_singular@|@random_body_part_external_plural@].\n\n\"Multiply and go forth!\"\n"
msgstr "佐姆觉得地下城里应该多几个你，好让大家分享。\n\n佐姆轻轻地把一面镜子砸碎在你的[@random_body_part_external_singular@|@random_body_part_external_plural@]上。\n\n“繁衍吧，然后出发！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom brain drain"
msgid "w:20\nXom displaces most of your magic for a moment.\n\nw:20\nXom reveals to you one of the great and terrible secrets of magic.\n\nw:20\nXom curiously channels energy out of your body.\n\nXom picks up your mind and accidentally drops it.\n\nXom gives you a terrible headache.\n\n\"You don't need this, do you?\"\n"
msgstr "w:20\n佐姆短暂地移走了你大部分的魔力。\n\nw:20\n佐姆向你揭示了魔法中一个伟大而可怕的秘密。\n\nw:20\n佐姆好奇地从你体内引出了能量。\n\n佐姆捧起你的心智，又不小心把它摔了下来。\n\n佐姆让你头痛欲裂。\n\n“这个你用不着，对吧？”\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom drained brain"
msgid "w:20\nYour magic slithers out of your reeling mind!\n\nYour power and thoughts are overwhelmed by magic-eaters manifest!\n\nYour magic wrenches itself out of your [@random_body_part_internal_singular@|@random_body_part_internal_plural@]!\n\nYour magic flows out through your [@random_body_part_external_singular@|@random_body_part_external_plural@]!\n\nYour magic rips itself out through your [@random_body_part_any_singular@|@random_body_part_any_plural@]!\n"
msgstr "w:20\n你的魔力从晕眩的心智中蜿蜒而出！\n\n显现的噬魔者淹没了你的力量和思绪！\n\n你的魔力从[@random_body_part_internal_singular@|@random_body_part_internal_plural@]中挣脱而出！\n\n你的魔力从[@random_body_part_external_singular@|@random_body_part_external_plural@]中流出！\n\n你的魔力从[@random_body_part_any_singular@|@random_body_part_any_plural@]中撕裂而出！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom banishment"
msgid "\"You have grown too comfortable in your little world, mortal!\"\n\nXom casts you into the Abyss!\n\nThe world seems to spin as Xom's maniacal laughter rings.\n"
msgstr "“你在你的小世界里过得太舒服了，凡人！”\n\n佐姆把你放逐到了深渊！\n\n随着佐姆疯狂的笑声响起，世界似乎旋转起来。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom revert own banishment"
msgid "w:30\n\"Kidding!\"\n\n\"On second thoughts, though...\"\n\n\"No, I've changed my mind.\"\n\nXom pulls you back into the comparable quietude of the dungeon.\n"
msgstr "w:30\n“开玩笑的！”\n\n“不过，转念一想……”\n\n“不，我改主意了。”\n\n佐姆把你拉回了相对安静的地下城。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom revert other banishment"
msgid "\"Get back here!\"\n\n\"No you don't!\"\n\nXom pulls you back into the comparable quietude of the dungeon.\n"
msgstr "“给我回来！”\n\n“想得美！”\n\n佐姆把你拉回了相对安静的地下城。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom chaos upgrade"
msgid "Xom's power touches on a nearby weapon.\n\n\"Have a taste of chaos, mortal.\"\n\nXom chortles.\n"
msgstr "佐姆的力量触及了附近的一件武器。\n\n“尝尝混沌的滋味吧，凡人。”\n\n佐姆咯咯地笑着。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom noise"
msgid "Xom makes a sudden noise! You hear @weapon_noise@\n\nw:1\n\"Boo!\"\n\nw:1\nXom does a drum roll.\n"
msgstr "佐姆突然弄出了声响！你听到@weapon_noise@\n\nw:1\n“哇！”\n\nw:1\n佐姆敲起了滚奏。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom fake shatter"
msgid "w:30\n\"Ka-crash!\"\n\n\"Let the forces of chaos tear it all down!\"\n\nXom reshapes the earth.\n\nw:1\nXom reveals the great annihilating truth to the Dungeon's walls!\n"
msgstr "w:30\n“咔——轰！”\n\n“让混沌之力把一切都拆掉吧！”\n\n佐姆重塑了大地。\n\nw:1\n佐姆向地下城的墙壁揭示了那毁灭一切的伟大真理！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom blink monsters"
msgid "\"Over there now!\"\n\n\"Get over here!\"\n\nXom decides to shift things around a little.\n"
msgstr "“快到那边去！”\n\n“快过来！”\n\n佐姆决定对周围的东西做一些改变。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom fast forward"
msgid "Xom speeds up the battle.\n\nXom demands a faster pace.\n\n\"Hurry it up!\"\n"
msgstr "佐姆加快了战斗的速度。\n\n佐姆要求加快节奏。\n\n“快一点！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom slow motion"
msgid "Xom feels like nobody present is taking it easy enough.\n\nXom bends time into knots.\n\n\"Don't be so hasty!\"\n"
msgstr "佐姆觉得在场的人都不够悠闲。\n\n佐姆把时间扭成了结。\n\n“别这么急！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom pause"
msgid "Xom stops everything to savour the moment.\n\nXom stomps on time for a few moments.\n\nw:1\nXom prepares the audience for the floor's solo!\n"
msgstr "佐姆让一切停下，细细品味这一刻。\n\n佐姆把时间踩住了片刻。\n\nw:1\n佐姆让观众准备欣赏地板的独奏！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom grant word of recall"
msgid "Xom feels like this meagre party needs more guests.\n\nXom sends out highly concerning invitations.\n"
msgstr "佐姆觉得这场寒酸的聚会需要更多客人。\n\n佐姆发出了一些令人极其不安的邀请。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom grant voiceless word of recall"
msgid "Xom demands a dramatic dialogue!\n\nXom grants a terrible voice to the voiceless.\n"
msgstr "佐姆要求来一段戏剧性的对话！\n\n佐姆赐予无声者可怕的嗓音。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom potion effect"
msgid "\"Go forth and destroy!\"\n\n\"Go forth and cause havoc, mortal!\"\n\nXom grants you a minor favour.\n\nXom smiles on you.\n"
msgstr "“去毁灭吧！”\n\n“去制造浩劫吧，凡人！”\n\n佐姆帮了你一个小忙。\n\n佐姆对你微笑。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom cleaving"
msgid "@Xom potion effect@\n"
msgstr "@Xom potion effect@\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom divination"
msgid "\"See what I see, my child!\"\n\nXom grants you insight.\n\nXom smirks.\n"
msgstr "“看见我所见的一切，我的孩子！”\n\n佐姆赐予你洞察力。\n\n佐姆得意地笑着。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom spell effect"
msgid "Xom's power flows through you!\n\nXom plays with reality for a moment.\n\nXom guffaws.\n"
msgstr "佐姆的力量在你身上流动！\n\n有那么一会儿，佐姆玩弄了一下现实。\n\n佐姆狂笑着。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom cloud trail"
msgid "\"Go forth and redecorate, my child!\"\n\n\"This place needs a little more atmosphere.\"\n"
msgstr "“去重新装点周围环境吧，我的孩子！”\n\n“这个地方需要营造一点儿氛围。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom good monster polymorph"
msgid "\"This might be better!\"\n\n\"Hum-dee-hum-dee-hum...\"\n\nXom's power touches your surroundings.\n\nYou hear Xom's avuncular chuckle.\n"
msgstr "“这样也许更好！”\n\n“哼哼哼，哼哼哼……”\n\n佐姆的力量触及了你周围的环境。\n\n你听到佐姆慈爱的轻笑声。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom bad monster polymorph"
msgid "@Xom good monster polymorph@\n"
msgstr "@Xom good monster polymorph@\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom wave of despair"
msgid "Xom recounts a horror story in an instant.\n\nw:2\nXom joyfully recalls the collapse of multiple Dungeon civilisations.\n"
msgstr "佐姆在一瞬间讲完了一个恐怖故事。\n\nw:2\n佐姆欢快地回忆起多个地下城文明的崩溃。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom good mutations"
msgid "\"You need some minor adjustments, mortal!\"\n\n\"Let me alter your pitiful body.\"\n\nXom's power touches on you for a moment.\n\nYou hear Xom's maniacal cackling.\n\nWith a gout of [@rainbow_colour@|@misc_colour@] light, Xom rebuilds you.\n"
msgstr "“你需要稍微调整一下，凡人！”\n\n“让我改变你那可怜的身体吧。”\n\n佐姆的力量短暂地触及了你。\n\n你听到佐姆疯狂地咯咯笑着。\n\n一团[@rainbow_colour@|@misc_colour@]的光喷涌而出，佐姆重塑了你。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom random mutations"
msgid "\"You need some minor improvements, mortal!\"\n\n\"Let me alter your body.\"\n\nXom's power brushes against you for a moment.\n\nYou hear Xom's avuncular chuckle.\n\nWith a flash of [@rainbow_colour@|@misc_colour@] light, Xom rebuilds you.\n"
msgstr "“你需要一点小小的改进，凡人！”\n\n“让我改变你的身体吧。”\n\n佐姆的力量短暂地拂过了你。\n\n你听到佐姆慈爱的轻笑声。\n\n一道[@rainbow_colour@|@misc_colour@]的光闪过，佐姆重塑了你。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom divine lightning"
msgid "The area is suffused with divine lightning!\n\nXom hurls blasts of lightning!\n\n\"Ready, aim, fire!\"\n"
msgstr "神圣的闪电充斥了这片区域！\n\n佐姆掷出一道道闪电！\n\n“准备，瞄准，开火！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom snakes to sticks"
msgid "Xom transforms those around you.\n\n\"I like them better like this.\"\n\n\"Never liked these squiggly things.\"\n\nXom touches your surroundings.\n\n@Xom good monster polymorph@\n"
msgstr "佐姆改变了你周围的怪物。\n\n“我更喜欢他们这样。”\n\n“我从来不喜欢这些扭曲的东西。”\n\n佐姆接触你周围的环境。\n\n@Xom good monster polymorph@\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom lights up webs"
msgid "Xom [gleefully|mirthfully] wrecks local arachnid artwork.\n\nThe light of Xom [brushes upon|sweeps through] your surroundings.\n\nw:1\n@Xom fake destruction@\n"
msgstr "佐姆[兴高采烈|乐不可支]地破坏了当地蜘蛛的艺术品。\n\n佐姆之光[拂过|扫过]了你周围的环境。\n\nw:1\n@Xom fake destruction@\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom destruction"
msgid "\"Burn, baby, burn!\"\n\n\"Ka-boom!\"\n\nXom calls forth mighty explosions.\n\nXom rains down devastation!\n\nw:5\nXom sneezes violently.\n\n@Xom fake destruction@\n"
msgstr "“烧吧，宝贝，烧吧！”\n\n“轰！”\n\n佐姆召来强烈的爆炸。\n\n佐姆降下毁灭之雨！\n\nw:5\n佐姆猛烈地打了个喷嚏。\n\n@Xom fake destruction@\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom fake destruction"
msgid "\"Feel my power!\"\n\nXom gives a demonstration of destructive might.\n\nw:1\n\"Let it end in hellfire!\"\n"
msgstr "“感受我的力量！”\n\n佐姆展示了毁灭性的力量。\n\nw:1\n“让一切在地狱之火中终结吧！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom force lance fleet"
msgid "Xom drops down a force battalion!\n\nXom calls in the force cavalry!\n\nXom lights up the force fireworks!\n\nw:1\nXom launches an entire fire-cart's barrage!\n\nw:1\nXom manifests dramatic pipe organ chords!\n"
msgstr "佐姆空投了一支力场营！\n\n佐姆召来了力场骑兵！\n\n佐姆点燃了力场烟花！\n\nw:1\n佐姆让一整辆火箭车齐射！\n\nw:1\n佐姆奏响了戏剧性的管风琴和弦！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom accidental homicide"
msgid "\"Oops, I didn't mean to do that!\"\n"
msgstr "“哎呀，我不是故意的！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom weird death"
msgid "\"How'd that happen? Weird.\"\n"
msgstr "“那是怎么回事？奇怪。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom resurrection"
msgid "\"Let me repair your body.\"\n\nXom tricks Death into leaving you alone.\n\nXom's maniacal laughter scares Death away.\n\nXom's power revives you.\n\nXom brings you back to life.\n\nXom smiles on you.\n\n\"Toy, don't you die on me yet!\"\n\nXom saves you before everything goes @mono_colour@.\n\nw:1\n\"One more [life|try|go].\"\n"
msgstr "“让我修复你的身体。”\n\n佐姆骗得死神放过了你。\n\n佐姆疯狂的笑声吓跑了死神。\n\n佐姆的力量让你复活了。\n\n佐姆让你起死回生。\n\n佐姆对你微笑。\n\n“玩具，你可别现在就给我死了！”\n\n在一切都变成@mono_colour@之前，佐姆救下了你。\n\nw:1\n“再[活一次|试一次|来一次]。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom repel stairs"
msgid "Xom changes the scenery.\n\nXom pokes at a nearby @staircase@.\n\nXom pushes on a nearby @staircase@.\n\nXom pulls on a nearby @staircase@.\n\n\"Tag, you're it!\"\n\nXom alters the dungeon around you.\n"
msgstr "佐姆改变了这里的景致。\n\n佐姆戳了戳附近的@staircase@。\n\n佐姆推了推附近的@staircase@。\n\n佐姆拉了拉附近的@staircase@。\n\n“抓到你了，轮到你了！”\n\n佐姆改变了你周围的地下城。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom good enchant monster"
msgid "@Xom good monster polymorph@\n"
msgstr "@Xom good monster polymorph@\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom bad enchant monster"
msgid "@Xom good enchant monster@\n"
msgstr "@Xom good enchant monster@\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom good hyper enchant monster"
msgid "\"Witness the rise of a true [hero|champion]!\"\n\nXom demands grand glory in combat!\n\nXom's power very briefly touches upon your surroundings.\n\nYou hear Xom's avuncular cackling.\n"
msgstr "“见证一位真正的[英雄|勇士]崛起吧！”\n\n佐姆要求一场荣耀无比的战斗！\n\n佐姆的力量极短暂地触及了你周围的环境。\n\n你听到佐姆慈爱地咯咯笑着。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom mass charm"
msgid "Xom readies the chaos crusade!\n\nXom seizes a variety of puppet strings.\n\n\"Would you like more friends, my child?\"\n\nw:5\nXom bribes nearby enemies with the offer of @_trout_species_@ trout.\n\nw:5\nThe hand of Xom pokes present minds.\n"
msgstr "佐姆准备好了混沌圣战！\n\n佐姆抓住了各种提线木偶的线。\n\n“想要更多朋友吗，我的孩子？”\n\nw:5\n佐姆许诺送出@_trout_species_@鳟鱼，贿赂附近的敌人。\n\nw:5\n佐姆之手戳了戳在场者的心智。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom stealth player"
msgid "Xom shushes you conspicuously.\n\nXom whispers: Shhh!\n"
msgstr "佐姆大张旗鼓地示意你安静。\n\n佐姆低声说：嘘！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom cloud"
msgid "\"The weather's been a little too boring around here.\"\n\nXom asks Qazlal to spice things up a little.\n\n\"Forecast: mostly cloudy.\"\n"
msgstr "“这里的天气有点太无聊了。”\n\n佐姆请卡兹拉尔添点花样。\n\n“天气预报：多云。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom life saving general"
msgid "\"What? Wait, NO!\"\n\n\"Hey, things were just getting interesting!\"\n\n\"NOOOOOOO, not my @_xom_plaything_@!\"\n\n\"Not here, not now.\"\n\n\"Just one more try.\"\n\nXom is feeling generous.\n"
msgstr "“什么？等等，不！”\n\n“嘿，事情才刚变得有趣呢！”\n\n“不——我的@_xom_plaything_@啊！”\n\n“不能在这里，不能是现在。”\n\n“再试一次就好。”\n\n佐姆感觉自己很慷慨。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom life saving actor"
msgid "w:20\n@Xom life saving general@\n\n\"Hey, that's my @_xom_plaything_@!\"\n\n\"Oh, no, you don't!\"\n\n\"That's my @_xom_plaything_@, go get your own!\"\n\n\"Leave my @_xom_plaything_@ alone!\"\n"
msgstr "w:20\n@Xom life saving general@\n\n“嘿，那是我的@_xom_plaything_@！”\n\n“噢，不，别那样！”\n\n“那是我的@_xom_plaything_@，去拿你自己的吧！”\n\n“别碰我的@_xom_plaything_@！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom boring death"
msgid "Xom yawns loudly!\n\n\"Boring in life, boring in death...\"\n\n\"What!? That's it?\"\n\n\"I guess I need a new plaything now.\"\n\n\"Huh? Did I miss anything?\"\n\n\"It was about time.\"\n\n\"This toy is broken.\"\n\n\"It's all fun and games until someone loses an eye.\"\n\nw:1\n\"It's not fun and games unless someone loses an eye.\"\n"
msgstr "佐姆大声打着哈欠！\n\n“生也无趣，死也无趣……”\n\n“什么！？就这？”\n\n“我想，我现在需要一个新玩物了。”\n\n“嗯？我错过什么了吗？”\n\n“是时候了。”\n\n“这个玩具坏了。”\n\n“在有人丢掉一只眼睛之前，这一切都只是玩乐。”\n\nw:1\n“非得有人丢掉一只眼睛，才算得上好玩。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom laughter"
msgid "Xom guffaws!\n\nXom roars with laughter!\n\nXom thinks this is hilarious!\n\nXom is highly amused!\n\nXom cackles wildly!\n\nXom snickers!\n\nXom laughs nastily!\n\nXom howls with laughter!\n\nXom bursts into laughter!\n\nXom giggles madly!\n\nXom titters!\n\nXom chuckles heartily!\n\nXom chortles!\n"
msgstr "佐姆狂笑起来！\n\n佐姆放声大笑！\n\n佐姆觉得这太滑稽了！\n\n佐姆乐坏了！\n\n佐姆放肆地咯咯大笑！\n\n佐姆窃笑起来！\n\n佐姆恶狠狠地笑起来！\n\n佐姆笑得嗷嗷直叫！\n\n佐姆爆发出一阵大笑！\n\n佐姆疯狂地咯咯笑着！\n\n佐姆吃吃地笑着！\n\n佐姆由衷地轻笑起来！\n\n佐姆咯咯地笑着！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:_xom_plaything_"
msgid "{{\nif you.piety_rank() > 4 then\n    return \"teddy bear\"\nelseif you.piety_rank() > 2 then\n    return \"toy\"\nelse\n    return \"plaything\"\nend\n}}\n"
msgstr "{{\nif you.piety_rank() > 4 then\n    return \"teddy bear\"\nelseif you.piety_rank() > 2 then\n    return \"toy\"\nelse\n    return \"plaything\"\nend\n}}\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:recite_closure"
msgid "\"Amen!\"\n\n\"Glory to Zin!\"\n\n\"And thus was it written.\"\n\n\"So sayeth Zin.\"\n\n\"Purity be upon you all.\"\n\n\"Written in blood; sealed by your death.\"\n\n\"From Zin's mouth, by Zin's hand.\"\n\nw:5\n\"Thus shall it ever be.\"\n\nw:3\n\"In fire! In pain!\"\n"
msgstr "“阿门！”\n\n“荣耀归于辛！”\n\n“经文如此记载。”\n\n“辛如是说。”\n\n“愿纯洁与你们所有人同在。”\n\n“以血书写；以你的死亡封缄。”\n\n“出自辛之口，成于辛之手。”\n\nw:5\n“永世皆当如此。”\n\nw:3\n“在烈火中！在痛苦中！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:ignis elemental wrath"
msgid "\"Attack, my last stalwart servants!\"\n\nIgnis wails with rage, and rains down burning fury!\n\nIgnis calls forth spirits of fire to unmake you!\n\n\"Burn! Burn until nothing is left!\"\n\n\"These will know how to inflict the punishment due to you!\"\n\n\"Betrayer! Apostate! Perish!\"\n\nw:5\n\"With a thousand fires I burned cities, but these will suffice for you!\"\n\nw:5\n\"My hands, my teeth, my burning tears: these will never betray me!\"\n"
msgstr "“进攻，我最后的忠勇仆从！”\n\n伊格尼斯愤怒地哀号，降下炽烈的怒火！\n\n伊格尼斯召来火焰之灵，要将你毁灭！\n\n“燃烧吧！烧到什么都不剩！”\n\n“它们知道如何施加你应得的惩罚！”\n\n“叛徒！变节者！灭亡吧！”\n\nw:5\n“我曾用千道烈火焚毁城市，但这些就足够对付你了！”\n\nw:5\n“我的双手、我的利齿、我燃烧的泪水：这些永远不会背叛我！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:makhleb executioner chatter"
msgid "w:40\n\"Kill. Kill. Kill!\"\n\n\"More. More. More!\"\n\n\"Another! And another! And another!\"\n\n\"Slaughter. Them. All!\"\n\nw:5\n\"Everything deserves to die!\"\n"
msgstr "w:40\n“杀。杀。杀！”\n\n“更多。更多。更多！”\n\n“再来一个！再来一个！再来一个！”\n\n“把。他们。杀光！”\n\nw:5\n“一切都该死！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:ashenzari welcome"
msgid "Ashenzari says: Partake of my vision. Partake of my curse.\n"
msgstr "艾申扎利说：共享我的视野。共担我的诅咒。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:beogh penance"
msgid "Beogh says: Do not betray your orcish brethren!\n"
msgstr "比欧弗说：不要背叛你的兽人同胞！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:beogh welcome"
msgid "Beogh says: Show the world what it means to be an orc!\n"
msgstr "比欧弗说：向世界展示何为兽人！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:beogh apostle challenge"
msgid "Beware that a challenger has come seeking you in battle. Prove your devotion to me! Unite all my children beneath one banner!\n\nThe time has come, seeker, to test your mettle in combat. Prove yourself an orc! Join your true people!\n\nScrew your courage to the sticking place, and face a challenge. Fight to survive! In the great war, all will be orcs!\n"
msgstr "当心，有个挑战者前来找你决战。证明你对我的虔诚！将我所有的孩子团结在同一面旗帜之下！\n\n求索者，在战斗中检验你勇气的时刻到了。证明你是个兽人！加入你真正的同胞！\n\n鼓足勇气，迎接挑战。为生存而战！在这场大战中，众生皆为兽人！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:cheibriados penance"
msgid "Cheibriados says: Don't be so hasty!\n"
msgstr "切布理亚多说：别这么急！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:cheibriados welcome"
msgid "Cheibriados says: Take it easy.\n"
msgstr "切布理亚多说：慢慢来。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:cheibriados death"
msgid "Cheibriados appreciates the motionlessness of death.\n"
msgstr "切布理亚多欣赏死亡带来的静止。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:dithmenos welcome"
msgid "Dithmenos says: Walk in the dark places.\n"
msgstr "迪斯姆诺说：行于黑暗之地。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:elyvilon penance"
msgid "Elyvilon says: Be more diligent in your ministrations.\n"
msgstr "艾利维隆说：照料他人时要更加尽心。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:elyvilon welcome"
msgid "Elyvilon says: Go forth and aid the weak!\n"
msgstr "艾利维隆说：去救助弱者吧！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:fedhas penance"
msgid "Fedhas protests your encroaching upon nature.\n"
msgstr "费德哈抗议你对自然的侵扰。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:fedhas welcome"
msgid "Fedhas says: Spread life and death.\n"
msgstr "费德哈说：播撒生命与死亡。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:fedhas death"
msgid "Fedhas appreciates your contribution to the ecosystem.\n"
msgstr "费德哈感谢你对生态系统的贡献。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:gozag welcome"
msgid "Gozag says: Greed is good.\n"
msgstr "哥萨戈说：贪婪是美德。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:hepliaklqana welcome"
msgid "Hepliaklqana says: Your past becomes your present!\n"
msgstr "惠普利亚卡纳说：你的过去化为现在！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:hepliaklqana death"
msgid "Hepliaklqana delivers you to your ancestors.\n"
msgstr "惠普利亚卡纳将你送往先祖身边。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:ignis welcome"
msgid "The flames of Ignis gently warm you.\n"
msgstr "伊格尼斯的火焰轻柔地温暖着你。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:ignis death"
msgid "Ignis goes out, and joins you in death.\n"
msgstr "伊格尼斯熄灭了，与你一同死去。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:jiyva welcome"
msgid "Slime for the Slime God!\n\nw:1\nLong live the new flesh!\n"
msgstr "黏液献给黏液之神！\n\nw:1\n新血肉万岁！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:jiyva death corpse"
msgid "Jiyva sends a jelly to digest your remains.\n"
msgstr "吉瓦派来一只胶怪消化你的遗骸。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:jiyva death corpse undead"
msgid "@Jiyva death corpse@\n"
msgstr "@Jiyva death corpse@\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:jiyva death corpse nonliving"
msgid "Jiyva sends a jelly to digest your equipment.\n"
msgstr "吉瓦派来一只胶怪消化你的装备。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:kikubaaqudgha welcome"
msgid "Kikubaaqudgha says: Spread unending ruin and despair!\n"
msgstr "奇库巴库哈说：散播无尽的毁灭与绝望！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:kikubaaqudgha death"
msgid "Kikubaaqudgha rasps: You have failed me! Welcome... death!\n"
msgstr "奇库巴库哈嘶哑地说：你让我失望了！迎接……死亡吧！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:kikubaaqudgha death corpse undead"
msgid "Kikubaaqudgha rasps: You have failed me! Welcome... oblivion!\n"
msgstr "奇库巴库哈嘶哑地说：你让我失望了！迎接……湮灭吧！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:kikubaaqudgha death corpse nonliving"
msgid "@Kikubaaqudgha death corpse undead@\n"
msgstr "@Kikubaaqudgha death corpse undead@\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:kikubaaqudgha death undead"
msgid "@Kikubaaqudgha death corpse undead@\n"
msgstr "@Kikubaaqudgha death corpse undead@\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:kikubaaqudgha death nonliving"
msgid "@Kikubaaqudgha death corpse undead@\n"
msgstr "@Kikubaaqudgha death corpse undead@\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:lugonu welcome"
msgid "Lugonu says: Spread carnage and corruption!\n"
msgstr "卢戈努说：散播屠戮与腐化！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:lugonu newgame"
msgid "Lugonu says: Depart the Abyss and spread corruption, my servant!\n<lightgrey>(use the <w>a</w>bility menu to exit the Abyss)</lightgrey>\n"
msgstr "卢戈努说：离开深渊，散播腐化吧，我的仆人！\n<lightgrey>（使用能力（<w>a</w>）菜单离开深渊）</lightgrey>\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:makhleb welcome"
msgid "Blood and souls for Makhleb!\n"
msgstr "鲜血与灵魂，献给马科列布！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:nemelex xobeh welcome"
msgid "Nemelex Xobeh says: It's all in the cards!\n"
msgstr "尼姆雷斯・索布说：一切尽在牌中！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:okawaru penance"
msgid "Okawaru says: Regain your honour in battle!\n"
msgstr "奥格瓦如说：在战斗中夺回你的荣誉！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:okawaru welcome"
msgid "Okawaru says: Bring me glory in combat!\n"
msgstr "奥格瓦如说：在战斗中为我赢得荣耀！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:pakellas penance"
msgid "Pakellas says: That's one approach which won't work here.\n\nPakellas says: Disappointing results so far.\n\nPakellas says: We may have to discontinue the experiment at this rate.\n\nPakellas says: Do not stand in the way of progress!\n"
msgstr "帕克拉斯说：这种方法在这里行不通。\n\n帕克拉斯说：目前的结果令人失望。\n\n帕克拉斯说：照这样下去，我们可能不得不中止实验。\n\n帕克拉斯说：不要阻碍进步！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:pakellas welcome"
msgid "Pakellas says: Time to continue the experiment.\n\nPakellas says: Time to find some more test subjects.\n\nPakellas says: Ready to try out some more devices?\n\nPakellas says: This is producing some very interesting results.\n\nPakellas says: What solutions will you come up with next?\n\nPakellas says: Progress or perish!\n\nw:5\nPakellas says: No one tells a god not to play god!\n\nw:1\nPakellas says: They called me mad... well, we'll show them!\n"
msgstr "帕克拉斯说：该继续实验了。\n\n帕克拉斯说：该找些新的实验对象了。\n\n帕克拉斯说：准备好再试些装置了吗？\n\n帕克拉斯说：这产生了一些非常有趣的结果。\n\n帕克拉斯说：你接下来又会想出什么解决办法？\n\n帕克拉斯说：要么进步，要么灭亡！\n\nw:5\n帕克拉斯说：谁也别想叫神不要扮演神！\n\nw:1\n帕克拉斯说：他们说我疯了……好吧，我们会让他们见识见识！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:pakellas death"
msgid "Pakellas says: Back to the drawing board!\n\nPakellas says: Good help is so hard to find these days!\n\nPakellas says: Time to find a new assistant...\n\nPakellas says: That's one more possible approach eliminated.\n\nPakellas says: Time to start the next experiment...\n"
msgstr "帕克拉斯说：得重新设计了！\n\n帕克拉斯说：如今真难找个好帮手！\n\n帕克拉斯说：该找个新助手了……\n\n帕克拉斯说：又排除了一种可能的方法。\n\n帕克拉斯说：该开始下一个实验了……\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:qazlal penance"
msgid "Qazlal thunders: Do not interfere with the natural order!\n"
msgstr "卡兹拉尔雷鸣般喝道：不要干涉自然秩序！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:qazlal welcome"
msgid "Qazlal says: Let the forces of nature tear it all down!\n"
msgstr "卡兹拉尔说：让自然之力摧毁一切！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:ru welcome"
msgid "Ru says: Cut away your false body!\n"
msgstr "入说：割舍你虚妄的肉体！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:ru death"
msgid "Ru respects your ultimate sacrifice.\n"
msgstr "入敬重你最终的牺牲。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:sif muna penance"
msgid "Sif Muna says: Seek out more knowledge and wisdom.\n"
msgstr "席夫·穆纳说：去寻求更多知识与智慧。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:sif muna welcome"
msgid "Sif Muna whispers: I know many secrets...\n"
msgstr "席夫·穆纳低语道：我知晓许多秘密……\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:the shining one penance"
msgid "The Shining One says: Being a martyr may wash away your sin!\n"
msgstr "光明神说：殉道或许能洗去你的罪孽！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:the shining one welcome"
msgid "The Shining One says: Lead the forces of light to victory!\n"
msgstr "光明神说：率领光明之军走向胜利！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:trog penance"
msgid "Trog rages: Kill them all!\n"
msgstr "特洛戈怒吼道：杀光他们！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:trog welcome"
msgid "Trog says: Kill them all!\n"
msgstr "特洛戈说：杀光他们！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:uskayaw welcome"
msgid "Uskayaw says: Surrender yourself to the rhythm!\n"
msgstr "阿斯卡亚说：将自己交给节奏！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:uskayaw death corpse"
msgid "Your body falls in perfect tune with the rhythm.\n"
msgstr "你的身体应着节奏完美地倒下。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:uskayaw death corpse undead"
msgid "@Uskayaw death corpse@\n"
msgstr "@Uskayaw death corpse@\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:uskayaw death corpse nonliving"
msgid "@Uskayaw death corpse@\n"
msgstr "@Uskayaw death corpse@\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:vehumet welcome"
msgid "Vehumet says: Let it end in hellfire!\n"
msgstr "维胡梅特说：让一切在地狱之火中终结吧！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:wu jian welcome"
msgid "The Council says: Follow the path of wisdom and battle!\n"
msgstr "武剑会说：遵循智慧与战斗之道！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom bored"
msgid "Xom yawns.\n\n\"I wonder what else is on...\"\n\n@Xom welcome@\n"
msgstr "佐姆打着哈欠。\n\n“我想知道，还有什么新花样……”\n\n@Xom welcome@\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom newgame"
msgid "Xom says: A new plaything!\n"
msgstr "佐姆说：一个新玩物！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:xom welcome"
msgid "Xom snickers.\n\nXom titters.\n\nw:3\n@_xom_welcome_rare_@\n"
msgstr "佐姆窃笑着。\n\n佐姆咯咯地笑着。\n\nw:3\n@_xom_welcome_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:_xom_welcome_rare_"
msgid "Xom says: I'm watching you, my @_xom_child_@ child.\n\nXom slaps you with @_trout_species_@ trout!\n"
msgstr "佐姆说：我在看着你呢，我的@_xom_child_@。\n\n佐姆拿@_trout_species_@鳟鱼扇你耳光！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:_xom_child_"
msgid "misbegotten\n\nbastard\n\nugly\n\nred-headed step\n\nsilly\n\nworthless\n\nprodigal\n\ninsane\n\nnaughty\n"
msgstr "命苦的孩子\n\n私生子\n\n丑孩子\n\n红头发的继子\n\n傻孩子\n\n一无是处的孩子\n\n浪子\n\n疯孩子\n\n淘气孩子\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:_trout_species_"
msgid "a rainbow\n\na flathead\n\na cutthroat\n\na bull\n\na silver\n\nw:3\n@_trout_species_rare_@\n"
msgstr "一条虹\n\n一条平头\n\n一条割喉\n\n一条牛\n\n一条银\n\nw:3\n@_trout_species_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:_trout_species_rare_"
msgid "a complex\n\na polygonal\n\nan imaginary\n\nan inverse\n\nan unlikely\n\na used\n\na second-hand\n\na prohibited\n\na challenging\n\na delicious\n\na mouldy\n\na fake\n\na moist\n\nw:2\na kilgore\n"
msgstr "一条复杂的\n\n一条多边形的\n\n一条虚构的\n\n一条反向的\n\n一条不可思议的\n\n一条用过的\n\n一条二手的\n\n一条被禁止的\n\n一条充满挑战的\n\n一条美味的\n\n一条发霉的\n\n一条假的\n\n一条湿润的\n\nw:2\n一条基尔戈\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:yredelemnul penance"
msgid "Yredelemnul says: All are equal in death! Holy martyrdom means nothing!\n"
msgstr "伊莱德莱姆努尔说：死亡面前，众生平等！神圣的殉道毫无意义！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:yredelemnul welcome"
msgid "Yredelemnul says: Carry the black torch! Rouse the idle dead!\n"
msgstr "伊莱德莱姆努尔说：高举黑色火炬！唤醒游手好闲的亡者！\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:yredelemnul death corpse"
msgid "Your body rises from the dead as a mindless zombie.\n"
msgstr "你的身体死而复起，化为一具没有心智的丧尸。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:yredelemnul death corpse undead"
msgid "You join the legions of the undead harvest.\n"
msgstr "你加入了收割而来的亡灵大军。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:yredelemnul death corpse nonliving"
msgid "Your body vanishes in a gout of umbral fire.\n"
msgstr "你的身体消失在一股暗影烈焰中。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:yredelemnul death undead"
msgid "@Yredelemnul death corpse undead@\n"
msgstr "@Yredelemnul death corpse undead@\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:zin penance"
msgid "Zin castigates you for your disobedience of the Law.\n\nZin sternly explains the importance of @_important_subject_@\n"
msgstr "辛因你违背律法而严厉斥责你。\n\n辛严肃地讲解@_important_subject_@的重要性。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:zin welcome"
msgid "Zin says: Spread the light, my child.\n"
msgstr "辛说：传播光明吧，我的孩子。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/godspeak.txt:zot death"
msgid "Zot has found you!\n\nZot unmakes you!\n\nZot excises you from existence.\n\nZot touches you for a single instant, and you cease to be.\n\nw:5\nZot's tendrils burst from within you!\n\nw:3\nZot's will forges a new reality, without you in it.\n\nw:3\nZot snuffs you out like a light.\n\nw:3\nZot's power takes hold, and you dissolve into a dark mist.\n"
msgstr "佐特找到你了！\n\n佐特将你化为乌有！\n\n佐特将你从存在中抹去。\n\n佐特只触碰了你一瞬间，你便不复存在。\n\nw:5\n佐特的触须从你体内破体而出！\n\nw:3\n佐特的意志铸就了一个没有你的新现实。\n\nw:3\n佐特像熄灭一盏灯一样将你抹杀。\n\nw:3\n佐特的力量笼罩着你，你消散成了一团黑雾。\n"

#. Reviewed database-17; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monflee.txt:dream sheep flee"
msgid "w:30\n@The_monster@ bleats in terror.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ is struck with panic!\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ panics and turns to flee.\n\nVISUAL:A frightened @monster@ leaps away.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ stampedes away.\n"
msgstr "w:30\n@The_monster@惊恐地咩叫。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@陷入了恐慌！\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@惊慌失措，转身逃跑。\n\nVISUAL:一只受惊的@monster@跳开了。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@狂奔而逃。\n"


#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_shouts_"
msgid "shouts\n\nyells\n\nroars\n"
msgstr "大喊\n\n高喊\n\n怒吼\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_yells_"
msgid "yells\n\nwails\n\ncries\n\nscreams\n\nhowls\n"
msgstr "高喊\n\n哀号\n\n哭喊\n\n尖叫\n\n嚎叫\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_wails_"
msgid "wails\n\nshouts\n\nsays\n\nscreams\n\nshrieks\n"
msgstr "哀号\n\n大喊\n\n说道\n\n尖叫\n\n凄叫\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_begs_"
msgid "begs\n\npleads\n\nw:3\nsupplicates\n\nw:1\nsupplicates abjectly\n"
msgstr "乞求\n\n恳求\n\nw:3\n祈求\n\nw:1\n卑微地哀求\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_mutters_"
msgid "mutters\n\nmumbles\n\nw:2\nsusurrates\n"
msgstr "低声咕哝\n\n含糊地嘟囔\n\nw:2\n窃窃低语\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_pointless_"
msgid "pointless\n\nsenseless\n\nuseless\n"
msgstr "毫无意义\n\n毫无道理\n\n毫无用处\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_high_priest_"
msgid "@_high_priest_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_high_priest_medium_@\n\nw:1\n@_high_priest_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_high_priest_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_high_priest_medium_@\n\nw:1\n@_high_priest_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_high_priest_common_"
msgid "@The_monster@ prays.\n\n@The_monster@ mumbles some strange prayers.\n\n@The_monster@ intones a terrible prayer.\n\n@The_monster@ starts to sing a prayer.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@祈祷着。\n\n@The_monster@含糊地念着奇怪的祷词。\n\n@The_monster@吟诵起可怕的祷词。\n\n@The_monster@开始吟唱祷文。\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_high_priest_medium_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ performs a strange gesture.\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"You are a heretic and must be destroyed!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You will make a fine sacrifice.\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"You must be punished!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"All sinners must die.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Oblivion to the unbeliever.\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@做了个奇怪的手势。\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@喊道：“你是异端，必须被消灭！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“你会是个很好的祭品。”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@喊道：“你必须受到惩罚！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“所有罪人都得死。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“让不信者归于湮灭。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_high_priest_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Right in the middle of my sermon, too.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"The wages of sin are death, you know.\"\n\n@The_monster@ whispers @to_foe@, \"I'll spare you if you take my job.\"\n\n@The_monster@ whispers @to_foe@, \"Deep inside, it's sometimes so empty.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"The wrath of @my_God@ will be yours.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Taste sacred energy, fool.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Your suffering will cleanse you of your heresy.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“偏偏还赶在我布道的中途。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“要知道，罪的工价乃是死。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@低语道：“你肯接我的差事，我就饶了你。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@低语道：“内心深处，有时竟如此空虚。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“@my_God@的怒火将降临在你身上。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“尝尝神圣能量的滋味，蠢货。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“苦难将洗净你的异端之罪。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_mercenary_guard_"
msgid "@_mercenary_guard_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_mercenary_guard_medium_@\n\nw:1\n@_mercenary_guard_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_mercenary_guard_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_mercenary_guard_medium_@\n\nw:1\n@_mercenary_guard_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_mercenary_guard_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ looks very unfriendly.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ grins evilly.\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"One false step and I'll kill you.\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"I'm going to kill you! Now!\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts, \"You will never get the ORB!\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"No trespassing is allowed here.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Drop everything you've found here and return home.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Return every stolen item!\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"Intruder!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"You must be punished!\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@看起来很不友善。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@邪恶地咧嘴一笑。\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“敢走错一步，我就杀了你。”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“我要杀了你！现在就杀！”\n\n@The_monster@喊道：“你永远也得不到宝珠！”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“这里不准擅闯。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“放下你在这里找到的一切，回家去。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“把偷来的东西全部交出来！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@喊道：“入侵者！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“你必须受到惩罚！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_mercenary_guard_medium_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Now you've reached the end of your journey.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"It's nothing personal.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Coming here was your last mistake.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"The best offence is a good offence.\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"Return immediately or I'll kill you!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“你的旅程到此为止了。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“这不是私人恩怨。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“来到这里，是你犯下的最后一个错误。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“最好的进攻就是好好进攻。”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@喊道：“立刻回去，不然我就杀了你！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_mercenary_guard_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"A dead adventurer is a good adventurer.\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"It's the end of the party!\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"Surrender and die!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“死掉的冒险者才是好冒险者。”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@喊道：“聚会结束了！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@喊道：“投降，然后受死！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_wizard_"
msgid "@_wizard_common_spell_@\n@_fake_spell_effect_@\n\nw:8\n@_wizard_medium_@\n\nw:1\n@_wizard_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_wizard_common_spell_@\n@_fake_spell_effect_@\n\nw:8\n@_wizard_medium_@\n\nw:1\n@_wizard_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_wizard_common_spell_"
msgid "@The_monster@ wildly gestures.\n\n@The_monster@ mumbles some strange words.\n\n@The_monster@ howls an incantation.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@疯狂地比划着。\n\n@The_monster@含糊地念着奇怪的词句。\n\n@The_monster@嚎叫着念出咒语。\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_fake_spell_effect_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ shimmers violently.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ glows brightly for a moment.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ @hands@ start to glow.\n\nVISUAL:You feel disoriented. @player_only@\n\nVISUAL:You feel troubled. @player_only@\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@剧烈地闪烁着。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@短暂地发出明亮的光芒。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@@hands@开始发光。\n\nVISUAL:你感到晕头转向。@player_only@\n\nVISUAL:你感到不安。@player_only@\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_wizard_medium_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ becomes larger for a moment.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ eyes start to glow.\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"You can't withstand my power!\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"You are history!\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@短暂地变大了。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@眼睛开始发光。\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@喊道：“你抵挡不了我的力量！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@喊道：“你完蛋了！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_wizard_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Argatax netranoch dertex.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Dogrw nutew berg.\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"Entram moth deg ulag!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“Argatax netranoch dertex。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“Dogrw nutew berg。”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@喊道：“Entram moth deg ulag！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_friendly_imp_"
msgid "@_friendly_imp_common_@\n\nw:6\n@_friendly_imp_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_friendly_imp_common_@\n\nw:6\n@_friendly_imp_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_friendly_imp_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ jumps up and down with excitement.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ grins impishly at you.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ picks up some beetles from the @surface@ and offers them to you.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ blows smoke rings.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"OK, boss!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"The Orb is all yours.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Isn't this more fun with friends?\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@兴奋得上蹿下跳。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@朝你顽皮地咧嘴一笑。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@从@surface@捡起几只甲虫，递给了你。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@吐着烟圈。\n\n@The_monster@说：“好嘞，老大！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“宝珠归你了。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“有朋友一起，不是更好玩吗？”\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_friendly_imp_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Uh-oh! Wait. OK.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You're so much nicer than my last boss.\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts, \"Stay back! It could be a [ploy|trick|gambit|trap]!\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts, \"Over here! I found it!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Just tell me who NOT to kill.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“呃哦！等等。好了。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你比我上一个老大好多了。”\n\n@The_monster@喊道：“退后！这可能是[阴谋|诡计|圈套|陷阱]！”\n\n@The_monster@喊道：“在这边！我找到了！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“只管告诉我哪些人不能杀。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_friendly_imp_greeting"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"I'm here!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You called?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Let's @_cause_or_spread_@ @_mayhem_@!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I @_truckle_@ to your @_vassalage_@, @_suck_up_address_@ @_suck_up_adj1_@ and @_suck_up_adj2_@ @_suck_up_noun_@!\"\n\nw:300\n__NONE\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“我来了！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你叫我？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“让我们@_cause_or_spread_@@_mayhem_@吧！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“@_suck_up_address_@@_suck_up_adj1_@又@_suck_up_adj2_@的@_suck_up_noun_@，我@_truckle_@@_vassalage_@！”\n\nw:300\n__NONE\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_cause_or_spread_"
msgid "cause\n\nspread\n\nsow\n\nraise\n"
msgstr "制造\n\n散播\n\n播撒\n\n掀起\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_mayhem_"
msgid "mayhem\n\ndestruction\n\nhavoc\n\ndisruption\n"
msgstr "混乱\n\n毁灭\n\n浩劫\n\n纷扰\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_truckle_"
msgid "truckle\n\ncommit\n\ngive in\n\nbow\n\nyield\n"
msgstr "卑躬屈膝地\n\n全心全意地\n\n甘愿\n\n俯首\n\n屈从地\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_vassalage_"
msgid "vassalage\n\nservice\n\nservitude\n\nfealty\n"
msgstr "做您的附庸\n\n为您效力\n\n做您的仆从\n\n向您效忠\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_suck_up_address_"
msgid "O\n\nmy\n"
msgstr "啊，\n\n我的\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_suck_up_adj1_"
msgid "grandiloquent\n\nillustrious\n\nmagnificent\n"
msgstr "辞藻华丽\n\n声名显赫\n\n威仪堂堂\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_suck_up_adj2_"
msgid "{{\nif you.race() == \"Mummy\" then\n    return \"velvet-covered\"\nelseif you.mutation('beak') > 0 then\n    return \"pearl-beaked\"\nelseif you.transform() == \"death\" then\n    return \"well-preserved\"\nelseif you.transform() == \"statue\" then\n    return \"marble-toed\"\nelseif you.transform() == \"dragon\" then\n    return \"opal-scaled\"\nelseif you.race() == \"Felid\" then\n    return \"pillow-pawed\"\nelseif you.race() == \"Octopode\" then\n    return \"soft-tentacled\"\nelseif you.race() == \"Formicid\" then\n    return \"massive-mandibled\"\nelseif you.race() == \"Poltergeist\" then\n    return \"high-spirited\"\nelseif you.race() == \"Revenant\" then\n    return \"ivory-boned\"\nelse\n    return \"rosy-lipped\"\nend\n}}\n\nawesome\n\ngreatest\n\ngod-like\n"
msgstr "{{\nif you.race() == \"Mummy\" then\n    return \"velvet-covered\"\nelseif you.mutation('beak') > 0 then\n    return \"pearl-beaked\"\nelseif you.transform() == \"death\" then\n    return \"well-preserved\"\nelseif you.transform() == \"statue\" then\n    return \"marble-toed\"\nelseif you.transform() == \"dragon\" then\n    return \"opal-scaled\"\nelseif you.race() == \"Felid\" then\n    return \"pillow-pawed\"\nelseif you.race() == \"Octopode\" then\n    return \"soft-tentacled\"\nelseif you.race() == \"Formicid\" then\n    return \"massive-mandibled\"\nelseif you.race() == \"Poltergeist\" then\n    return \"high-spirited\"\nelseif you.race() == \"Revenant\" then\n    return \"ivory-boned\"\nelse\n    return \"rosy-lipped\"\nend\n}}\n\n令人敬畏\n\n至高无上\n\n神一般\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_suck_up_noun_"
msgid "voivode\n\nmaster\n\nruler\n\nban\n\nmagnate\n\ngentle{{ return you.genus() }}\n"
msgstr "总督\n\n主人\n\n统治者\n\n领主\n\n权贵\n\n{{ return you.genus() }}绅士\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_hostile_imp_"
msgid "@_hostile_imp_common_@\n\nw:7\n@_hostile_imp_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_hostile_imp_common_@\n\nw:7\n@_hostile_imp_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_hostile_imp_common_"
msgid "@The_monster@ laughs crazily.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ grins evilly.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ lashes @possessive@ tail.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ grinds @possessive@ teeth.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ puffs mist at @foe@.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@疯狂地大笑。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@邪恶地咧嘴一笑。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@抽打着@possessive@尾巴。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@磨着@possessive@牙齿。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@朝@foe@喷出雾气。\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_hostile_imp_rare_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ spits at @foe@.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ picks up a beetle and eats it.\n\n@The_monster@ sputters.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ disappears for a moment.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ summons a swarm of flies.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@朝@foe@吐了口唾沫。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@捡起一只甲虫吃了下去。\n\n@The_monster@气急败坏地结巴起来。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@短暂地消失了。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@召来一群苍蝇。\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_hell_lord_taunt_"
msgid "@The_monster@ @says@ @to_foe@, \"@demon_taunt@\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@@says@：“@demon_taunt@”\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_demon_taunt_"
msgid "@The_monster@ @says@ @to_foe@, \"@demon_taunt@\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@@says@：“@demon_taunt@”\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_says_imp_taunt_"
msgid "@The_monster@ @says@ @to_foe@, \"@imp_taunt@\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@@says@：“@imp_taunt@”\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:default stupid friendly humanoid"
msgid "__NONE\n"
msgstr "__NONE\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:default stupid fleeing humanoid"
msgid "__NONE\n"
msgstr "__NONE\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:default stupid silenced humanoid"
msgid "__NONE\n"
msgstr "__NONE\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:default stupid confused humanoid"
msgid "__NONE\n"
msgstr "__NONE\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:default silenced confused humanoid"
msgid "w:40\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ gestures wildly.\n\nw:20\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ says something but you don't hear anything.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ looks confused.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ grins evilly.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ smiles happily.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ cries.\n"
msgstr "w:40\nVISUAL:@The_monster@疯狂地比划着。\n\nw:20\nVISUAL:@The_monster@说了些什么，但你什么也听不见。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@看起来很困惑。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@邪恶地咧嘴一笑。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@开心地微笑着。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@哭了。\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:default fleeing silenced humanoid"
msgid "@_fleeing_silenced_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_fleeing_silenced_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_fleeing_silenced_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_fleeing_silenced_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_fleeing_silenced_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ glances furtively about.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ seems to say something.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@偷偷地四下张望。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@似乎在说些什么。\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_fleeing_silenced_rare_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ opens @possessive@ mouth, as if shouting.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ frantically looks around.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ ponders the situation.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@张开@possessive@嘴，仿佛在喊叫。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@惊慌地环顾四周。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@思索着眼下的处境。\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:default friendly silenced humanoid"
msgid "w:6\n@_friendly_silenced_common_@\n\nw:4\n@_friendly_silenced_rare_@\n"
msgstr "w:6\n@_friendly_silenced_common_@\n\nw:4\n@_friendly_silenced_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_friendly_silenced_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ gives you the thumbs up.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ says something you can't hear.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@朝你竖起大拇指。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@说了些什么，你却听不见。\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_friendly_silenced_rare_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ looks at you.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ waves at you.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ smiles happily.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ jumps up and down, looking for your attention.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ winks at you.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@看着你。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@朝你挥手。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@开心地微笑着。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@上蹿下跳，想引起你的注意。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@朝你眨了眨眼。\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:default silenced humanoid"
msgid "w:6\n@_silenced_humanoid_common_@\n\nw:4\n@_silenced_humanoid_rare_@\n\n@The_monster@ stomps in frustration.\n"
msgstr "w:6\n@_silenced_humanoid_common_@\n\nw:4\n@_silenced_humanoid_rare_@\n\n@The_monster@沮丧地跺着脚。\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_silenced_humanoid_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ says something but you don't hear anything.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ gestures.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@说了些什么，但你什么也听不见。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@比划着。\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_silenced_humanoid_rare_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ gestures obscenely.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ grins.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ looks angry.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ seems to be listening.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@做了个下流的手势。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@咧嘴一笑。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@看起来很愤怒。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@似乎在倾听。\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:default friendly confused humanoid"
msgid "@_friendly_confused_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_friendly_confused_medium_@\n\nw:1\n@_friendly_confused_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_friendly_confused_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_friendly_confused_medium_@\n\nw:1\n@_friendly_confused_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_friendly_confused_common_"
msgid "@The_monster@ screams, \"Help!\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts, \"What's happening?!\"\n\n@The_monster@ mumbles something.\n\n@The_monster@ laughs crazily.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ cries.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ looks very confused.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@尖叫道：“救命！”\n\n@The_monster@喊道：“发生什么事了？！”\n\n@The_monster@含糊地嘟囔着什么。\n\n@The_monster@疯狂地大笑。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@哭了。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@看起来很困惑。\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_friendly_confused_medium_"
msgid "@The_monster@ giggles crazily.\n\n@The_monster@ screams, \"@player_name@! What's going on?!\"\n\n@The_monster@ prays for help.\n\n@The_monster@ smirks at the air and says, \"Can't catch me!\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ grins madly.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ ponders the situation.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ stomps to and fro.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@疯狂地咯咯笑着。\n\n@The_monster@尖叫道：“@player_name@！怎么回事？！”\n\n@The_monster@祈求援助。\n\n@The_monster@对着空气得意地笑道：“抓不到我！”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@疯狂地咧嘴笑着。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@思索着眼下的处境。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@来回跺着脚。\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_friendly_confused_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ shouts, \"I'm losing control!\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts, \"Yeah!\"\n\n@The_monster@ sings.\n\n@The_monster@ screams, \"@player_name@! Help!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"@player_name@, I'm a little confused!\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ seems enamored of @foe@.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@喊道：“我要失控了！”\n\n@The_monster@喊道：“耶！”\n\n@The_monster@唱起歌来。\n\n@The_monster@尖叫道：“@player_name@！救命！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“@player_name@，我有点糊涂了！”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@似乎迷上了@foe@。\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:default confused humanoid"
msgid "@_confused_humanoid_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_confused_humanoid_medium_@\n\nw:1\n@_confused_humanoid_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_confused_humanoid_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_confused_humanoid_medium_@\n\nw:1\n@_confused_humanoid_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_confused_humanoid_common_"
msgid "w:20\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ gestures wildly.\n\n@The_monster@ shouts, \"What's happening?!\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ cries.\n\n@The_monster@ laughs crazily.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ grins madly.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ laughs at nothing.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ chortles and stares into space.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ looks very confused.\n\n@The_monster@ mumbles something.\n"
msgstr "w:20\nVISUAL:@The_monster@疯狂地比划着。\n\n@The_monster@喊道：“发生什么事了？！”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@哭了。\n\n@The_monster@疯狂地大笑。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@疯狂地咧嘴笑着。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@莫名其妙地笑着。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@一边咯咯笑，一边盯着虚空。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@看起来很困惑。\n\n@The_monster@含糊地嘟囔着什么。\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_confused_humanoid_medium_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ ponders the situation.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I'm a little confused.\"\n\n@The_monster@ asks, \"Where am I?\"\n\n@The_monster@ wonders, \"What am I doing in here?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Why is everything spinning?\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams, \"I'll kill you anyway!\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@思索着眼下的处境。\n\n@The_monster@说：“我有点糊涂了。”\n\n@The_monster@问道：“我在哪儿？”\n\n@The_monster@纳闷道：“我在这里干什么？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“为什么一切都在转？”\n\n@The_monster@尖叫道：“反正我就是要杀了你！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_confused_humanoid_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ yells, \"Get them off me!\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts, \"NO!\"\n\n@The_monster@ howls, \"My nostrils!\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts, \"YES!\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ shakes.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ suddenly looks very angry at the Dungeon.\n\n@The_monster@ asks @foe,@ \"Who are you?\"\n\n@The_monster@ asks @foe,@ \"What the hell are we doing here? Hmm, I see...\"\n\n@The_monster@ cries, \"My head! MY HEAD!!!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams, \"NO! I can't bear this much noise.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@高喊：“把它们从我身上弄走！”\n\n@The_monster@喊道：“不！”\n\n@The_monster@嚎叫道：“我的鼻孔！”\n\n@The_monster@喊道：“对！”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@颤抖着。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@突然显得对地下城十分愤怒。\n\n@The_monster@问@foe,@：“你是谁？”\n\n@The_monster@问@foe,@：“我们到底在这里干什么？嗯，我明白了……”\n\n@The_monster@哭喊：“我的头！我的头啊！！！”\n\n@The_monster@尖叫道：“不！这么吵，我受不了了。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:default friendly fleeing humanoid"
msgid "@_friendly_fleeing_common_@\n\nw:1\n@_friendly_fleeing_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_friendly_fleeing_common_@\n\nw:1\n@_friendly_fleeing_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_friendly_fleeing_common_"
msgid "w:20\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ tries to hide somewhere.\n\n@The_monster@ screams, \"Help!\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts, \"Cover me!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams, \"@player_name@! Help me!\"\n\n@The_monster@ prays for help.\n"
msgstr "w:20\nVISUAL:@The_monster@试图找个地方躲起来。\n\n@The_monster@尖叫道：“救命！”\n\n@The_monster@喊道：“掩护我！”\n\n@The_monster@尖叫道：“@player_name@！救救我！”\n\n@The_monster@祈求援助。\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_friendly_fleeing_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ @_shouts_@, \"Wait for me, @player_name@! Could you help me?\"\n\n@The_monster@ cries, \"Don't forget your friends!\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts, \"Please protect me!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@@_shouts_@：“等等我，@player_name@！能帮帮我吗？”\n\n@The_monster@哭喊：“别忘了你的朋友！”\n\n@The_monster@喊道：“请保护我！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:default fleeing humanoid"
msgid "@_fleeing_humanoid_common_@\n\nw:3\n@_fleeing_humanoid_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_fleeing_humanoid_common_@\n\nw:3\n@_fleeing_humanoid_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_fleeing_humanoid_common_"
msgid "w:20\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ gives up.\n\nw:20\n@The_monster@ @_yells_@, \"Help!\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ [almost|nearly] stumbles in trying to escape.\n\n@The_monster@ prays for help.\n\n@The_monster@ cowers, then darts away.\n\n@The_monster@ starts to cry.\n\n@The_monster@ yells at you, \"GO AWAY!\"\n\n@The_monster@ gibbers meaninglessly.\n\n@The_monster@ howls in fear.\n\n@The_monster@ [moans|wails|cries], \"Oh dear! Oh dear!\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_begs_@ @to_foe@, \"Please don't kill me!\"\n\n@The_monster@ begs for mercy.\n\n@The_monster@ cries @to_foe@, \"Mercy!\"\n"
msgstr "w:20\nVISUAL:@The_monster@放弃了。\n\nw:20\n@The_monster@@_yells_@：“救命！”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@逃跑时[差点|险些]摔了一跤。\n\n@The_monster@祈求援助。\n\n@The_monster@畏缩了一下，随即窜走。\n\n@The_monster@开始哭泣。\n\n@The_monster@朝你高喊：“走开！”\n\n@The_monster@不知所云地胡言乱语。\n\n@The_monster@恐惧地嚎叫着。\n\n@The_monster@[呻吟|哀号|哭喊]：“天哪！天哪！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@@_begs_@：“请别杀我！”\n\n@The_monster@乞求饶命。\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@哭喊：“饶命！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_fleeing_humanoid_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ @_begs_@ @to_foe@, \"Why can't we all just get along?\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_mutters_@, \"Damn and blast!\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"No! I'll never do that again!\"\n\n@The_monster@ [blubbers|cries], \"[Mummeee|Daddeee|Meeeeep|Help meeeeeeee|Eeeeekkkk|Oh nooooooo|Waaaaaa]!\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_begs_@ @to_foe@, \"Please! I have a lot of children!\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ looks [rattled|scared stiff|petrified].\n\n@The_monster@ weeps quietly.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ looks desperately for an escape route.\n\n@The_monster@ hums to @reflexive@ desperately, trying to keep calm.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ attempts to regain @possessive@ composure.\n\n@The_monster@ @_mutters_@, \"Of all the rotten luck!\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ tries to recover @possessive@ lost courage.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@@_begs_@：“为什么大家不能好好相处呢？”\n\n@The_monster@@_mutters_@：“该死，见鬼！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@喊道：“不！我再也不那样做了！”\n\n@The_monster@[抽泣|哭喊]：“[妈妈呀|爸爸呀|呜呜呜|救命啊啊啊|咿呀呀呀|不不不不|哇啊啊啊]！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@@_begs_@：“求求你！我还有好多孩子！”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@看起来[惊慌失措|吓僵了|吓呆了]。\n\n@The_monster@低声啜泣着。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@拼命寻找逃生的路。\n\n@The_monster@绝望地哼着歌安抚@reflexive@，试图保持冷静。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@试图恢复@possessive@镇定。\n\n@The_monster@@_mutters_@：“真是倒了血霉！”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@试图找回@possessive@失去的勇气。\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_friendly_family_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"I like you, cousin!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Family always sticks together, @player_name@!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"@player_genus@kind's got to stick together!\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts, \"@player_genus_plural@ are the best!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says happily, \"You and me, we're family.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“我喜欢你，表亲！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“一家人就该团结，@player_name@！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“@player_genus@一族必须团结起来！”\n\n@The_monster@喊道：“@player_genus_plural@最棒了！”\n\n@The_monster@开心地说：“你和我，咱们是一家人。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:default friendly related humanoid"
msgid "w:2\n@_friendly_family_@\n\n@default friendly humanoid@\n"
msgstr "w:2\n@_friendly_family_@\n\n@default friendly humanoid@\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:default friendly humanoid"
msgid "w:4\n__NONE\n\n@_friendly_humanoid_common_@\n\nw:4\n@_friendly_humanoid_medium_@\n\nw:1\n@_friendly_humanoid_rare_@\n"
msgstr "w:4\n__NONE\n\n@_friendly_humanoid_common_@\n\nw:4\n@_friendly_humanoid_medium_@\n\nw:1\n@_friendly_humanoid_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_friendly_humanoid_common_"
msgid "@The_monster@ yells, \"Run! I'll cover you!\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"Die, monster!\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ looks at you.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ smiles at you.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"@player_name@, I like you.\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ waves at you.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Be careful!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I'll never leave you.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@高喊：“快跑！我来掩护！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@喊道：“受死吧，怪物！”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@看着你。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@朝你微笑。\n\n@The_monster@说：“@player_name@，我喜欢你。”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@朝你挥手。\n\n@The_monster@说：“小心！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我绝不会离开你。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_friendly_humanoid_medium_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"It's nice to have friends.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"@player_name@, you are my only friend.\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts, \"No mercy! Kill them all!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Don't worry. I'm here with you.\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ smiles happily.\n\n@The_monster@ shouts, \"Beware of monsters!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“有朋友真好。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“@player_name@，你是我唯一的朋友。”\n\n@The_monster@喊道：“别留情！杀光他们！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“别担心。我陪着你呢。”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@开心地微笑着。\n\n@The_monster@喊道：“当心怪物！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_friendly_humanoid_rare_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ looks friendly.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@看起来很友善。\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:hound"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ [pauses|stops] to sniff the @surface@.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@[暂停下来|停下来]嗅了嗅@surface@。\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:friendly hound"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ wags @possessive@ tail.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ barks [happily|excitedly]!\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ runs in silly circles!\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ looks {{\n  if you.race() == \"Felid\" then\n      return \"down\"\n  else\n     return \"up\"\n  end\n}} at you expectantly.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ scratches @possessive@ ear.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ cocks @possessive@ head sideways at you.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ scratches at a flea.\n\nw:1\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ gnaws at a bone — where's that from?\n\n@hound@\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@摇着@possessive@尾巴。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@[开心|兴奋]地吠叫！\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@傻乎乎地绕着圈跑！\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ looks {{\n  if you.race() == \"Felid\" then\n      return \"down\"\n  else\n     return \"up\"\n  end\n}} at you expectantly.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@挠着@possessive@耳朵。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@歪着@possessive@脑袋看你。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@抓挠着一只跳蚤。\n\nw:1\nVISUAL:@The_monster@啃着一根骨头——哪儿来的？\n\n@hound@\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:friendly shoals hound"
msgid "w:50\n@friendly hound@\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ [plays|frolics] in the surf!\n\n{{\nif you.can_smell() then\n    return \"VISUAL:A distinct wet dog smell emanates from @the_monster@.\"\nelse\n    return \"VISUAL:@The_monster@ motions as if to dry @reflexive@ off on you.\"\nend\n}}\n\nw:1\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ hopefully picks up a piece of driftwood and looks at you.\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@friendly hound@\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@在浪花中[玩耍|嬉戏]！\n\n{{\nif you.can_smell() then\n    return \"VISUAL:A distinct wet dog smell emanates from @the_monster@.\"\nelse\n    return \"VISUAL:@The_monster@ motions as if to dry @reflexive@ off on you.\"\nend\n}}\n\nw:1\nVISUAL:@The_monster@满怀期待地捡起一块浮木，望着你。\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:default insect"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ waves @possessive@ antennae.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@摆动着@possessive@触角。\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:default confused insect"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ wildly waves @possessive@ antennae.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ seems to be having trouble coordinating all six of @possessive@ legs.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@疯狂地摆动着@possessive@触角。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@似乎难以协调@possessive@六条腿。\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:default confused winged insect"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ flutters around in erratic circles.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ wildly waves @possessive@ antennae.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ wobbles in @possessive@ flight.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@胡乱地绕圈扑腾。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@疯狂地摆动着@possessive@触角。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@在@possessive@飞行途中摇摇晃晃。\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:default confused arachnid"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ seems to be having trouble coordinating all eight of @possessive@ legs.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@似乎难以协调@possessive@八条腿。\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:centipede"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ waves @possessive@ antennae.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@摆动着@possessive@触角。\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:default confused centipede"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ seems to be having trouble coordinating @possessive@ many legs.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ wildly waves @possessive@ antennae.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@似乎难以协调@possessive@多条腿。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@疯狂地摆动着@possessive@触角。\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:default confused 'b'"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ flutters around in erratic circles.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@胡乱地绕圈扑腾。\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:default 'cap-g'"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ pulsates ominously.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@不祥地搏动着。\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:default 'cap-j'"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ jiggles.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@晃动着。\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:'l'"
msgid "@The_monster@ hisses menacingly.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@威吓般地嘶嘶作响。\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:'r'"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ twitches @possessive@ whiskers.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@抽动着@possessive@胡须。\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:default confused 'r'"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ runs around in a circle.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@绕着圈乱跑。\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:default confused 'y'"
msgid "SOUND:@The_monster@ buzzes around in tight circles.\n"
msgstr "SOUND:@The_monster@嗡嗡作响，绕着小圈飞。\n"

#. Reviewed database-18; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:default silenced confused 'y'"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ flies around in tight circles.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@绕着小圈飞。\n"

