#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:silenced player ghost"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ stares at @foe@.\n\nw:5\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ points at @foe@ threateningly.\n\nw:5\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ stares at @foe@ while slowly dragging a finger across @possessive@ throat.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@盯着@foe@。\n\nw:5\nVISUAL:@The_monster@威胁地指着@foe@。\n\nw:5\nVISUAL:@The_monster@盯着@foe@，同时用手指缓缓划过@possessive@喉咙。\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:fighting player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ boasts, \"I have defeated monsters you have never seen.\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ takes a fighting stance.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"My insurmountable tactics guarantee your defeat.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Are you willing to die fighting? I was!\"\n\n@The_monster@ sneers, \"Do you call that fighting?\"\n\n@The_monster@ laughs, \"And you think you're capable of finding the ORB? I had it, you know. Then I gave it away so I could steal it AGAIN.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@夸口道：“我打败过你从未见过的怪物。”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@摆出战斗架势。\n\n@The_monster@说：“我无懈可击的战术注定了你的败局。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你愿意战死吗？我当年可是愿意的！”\n\n@The_monster@冷笑道：“这也叫战斗？”\n\n@The_monster@笑道：“你还觉得自己能找到宝珠？告诉你，我拿到过。后来我又把它送人了，好再偷一次。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:short blades player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"It's not the size of the blade that matters, it's how you use it.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You sneer at my short blade, I will sneer at your cold corpse.\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ flicks @possessive@ blade from hand to hand, faster than the eye can follow.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“刀刃长短不重要，怎么用才重要。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“你嘲笑我的短刃，我会嘲笑你冰冷的尸体。”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@将@possessive@刀刃在双手间翻转，快得令人目不暇接。\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:long blades player ghost"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ holds @possessive@ blade at the ready.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Live by the sword, die by the sword.\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@握紧@possessive@刀剑，严阵以待。\n\n@The_monster@说：“以剑为生，死于剑下。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:axes player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"I'll split you in two!\"\n\n@The_monster@ mumbles, \"They all look like pillowcases to me...\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Try not to bleed too much.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“我要把你劈成两半！”\n\n@The_monster@嘟囔道：“在我看来，全都像枕头套……”\n\n@The_monster@说：“尽量别流太多血。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:maces & flails player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"They'll have to sweep you off the floor after I'm finished with you!\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ crushes a nearby insect and laughs.\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Crushing you to a pulp will hurt a lot. After that? Painless! I promise!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“等我收拾完你，就得有人把你从地面上扫走了！”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@碾死附近的一只虫子，大笑起来。\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“把你砸成肉泥时会很痛。之后嘛？就不痛了！我保证！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:polearms player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"One skewered @foe_genus@, coming right up.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Your head on a pike would complement this floor nicely.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Your head would complement my pike nicely.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“一串@foe_genus@，马上就好。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“把你的头挑在长矛上，正好装点这层楼。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“你的头跟我的长矛倒是很配。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:staves player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"I excel at staving off weak adventurers.\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ twirls @possessive@ quarterstaff.\n\n@The_monster@ threatens to break your skull. @player_only@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“我最擅长用棍杖打发弱小的冒险者。”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@转动着@possessive@长棍。\n\n@The_monster@威胁要敲碎你的头骨。@player_only@\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:slings player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"The bigger they are, the harder they fall!\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ whirls a spectral sling over @possessive@ head.\n\n@_generic_ranged_@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“个头越大，摔得越惨！”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@在@possessive@头顶挥舞着一把幽灵般的投石索。\n\n@_generic_ranged_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:ranged weapons player ghost"
msgid "@_generic_ranged_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Do you have an apple? I have a shot I want to try.\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ whirls a spectral sling over @possessive@ head.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ [struggles to reload|effortlessly reloads] @possessive@ weapon.\n"
msgstr "@_generic_ranged_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“你有苹果吗？我有一箭想试试。”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@在@possessive@头顶挥舞着一把幽灵般的投石索。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@[费力地重新装填|轻松地重新装填]@possessive@武器。\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:crossbows player ghost"
msgid "@_generic_ranged_@\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ [struggles to reload|effortlessly reloads] @possessive@ weapon.\n"
msgstr "@_generic_ranged_@\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@[费力地重新装填|轻松地重新装填]@possessive@武器。\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:throwing player ghost"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ glances around for something to throw.\n\n@The_monster@ deftly throws insults at you. @player_only@\n\n@_generic_ranged_@\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@四处张望，寻找可以投掷的东西。\n\n@The_monster@巧妙地向你抛出一串辱骂。@player_only@\n\n@_generic_ranged_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:armour player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"You cannot hurt me!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I am invincible!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I am made of steel!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“你伤不了我！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我是无敌的！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我是钢铁铸成的！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:dodging player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Missed me!\"\n\n@The_monster@ ducks and says, \"Too high!\"\n\n@The_monster@ dodges and says, \"Too slow!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“没打中！”\n\n@The_monster@低头一躲，说：“太高了！”\n\n@The_monster@闪开后说：“太慢了！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:stealth player ghost"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ tries to sneak away.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ tries to blend into @possessive@ surroundings.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ whispers something so quietly that you cannot hear @objective@.\n\nVISUAL:For a moment, you lose track of @the_monster@.\n\n@The_monster@ whispers, \"Be very very quiet, I'm hunting @player_genus_plural@.\" @player_only@\n\nVISUAL:For a moment, @the_monster@ blends into the shadows.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@试图悄悄溜走。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@试图融入@possessive@周围环境。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@低语了些什么，声音轻得让你听不清@objective@。\n\nVISUAL:有那么一瞬间，你找不到@the_monster@的踪影。\n\n@The_monster@低声说：“安静，安静，我正在猎捕@player_genus_plural@。”@player_only@\n\nVISUAL:有那么一瞬间，@the_monster@融入了阴影。\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:shields player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"You can hit me, but you can't hurt me.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“你打得到我，却伤不了我。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:unarmed combat player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ sneers, \"Only the weak need weapons.\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ feints to the [left|right].\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ assumes a wrestling stance.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I break bones and crack skulls... with my bare hands.\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ swings @possessive@ fists at you. @player_only@\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ flexes @possessive@ fingers.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@冷笑道：“只有弱者才需要武器。”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@向[左|右]虚晃一招。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@摆出摔跤的架势。\n\n@The_monster@说：“我能折断骨头、敲碎头颅……就靠这双空手。”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@向你挥舞@possessive@拳头。@player_only@\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@活动着@possessive@手指。\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:spellcasting player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"I have spells for any situation.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I am proof that knowledge is power.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Watch and be amazed!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I practised a lot since I died.\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ fingertips begin to glow.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ frowns in concentration.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I am smarter than you!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“不管什么情况，我都有应对的法术。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我就是知识即力量的证明。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“看好了，惊叹吧！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“死后我可是练习了不少。”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@指尖开始发光。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@凝神皱眉。\n\n@The_monster@说：“我比你聪明！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:conjurations player ghost"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ takes aim.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I will blast you to bits.\"\n\n@The_monster@ [adeptly chants|mispronounces] a nearly unspeakable incantation.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ is bathed in the radiant lights of Iskenderun.\n\nVISUAL:Energy condenses in front of @the_monster@, but quickly dissipates.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@开始瞄准。\n\n@The_monster@说：“我要把你轰成碎片。”\n\n@The_monster@[熟练地吟诵|念错了]一段几乎无法念出的咒文。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@沐浴在伊斯肯德伦灿烂的光辉中。\n\nVISUAL:能量在@the_monster@面前凝聚，又迅速消散。\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:hexes player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You will soon be helpless to avoid my power.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"When I snap my fingers, you will think you are a chicken.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“很快，你就无力躲避我的力量了。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“我一打响指，你就会以为自己是只鸡。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:summonings player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"It's dangerous to adventure alone.\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ pulls a quokka out of @possessive@ cap.\n\n@The_monster@ points @at_foe@ and yells, \"Attack!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"It's nice to have friends.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“独自冒险很危险。”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@从@possessive@帽子里掏出一只短尾矮袋鼠。\n\n@The_monster@指着@at_foe@高喊：“进攻！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“有朋友真好。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:necromancy player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Death will end your pain.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Don't worry, I won't let your corpse go to waste.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"After I kill you, I will kill you again.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I need your bones for a spell of mine.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“死亡会结束你的痛苦。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“别担心，我不会浪费你的尸体。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“杀了你之后，我还要再杀你一次。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“我有个法术需要你的骨头。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:translocations player ghost"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ flickers in and out of reality.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ is wreathed in a cloud of translocational energy.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ blinks @at_foe@.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@在现实中忽隐忽现。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@笼罩在一团位移能量中。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@朝@at_foe@眨了眨眼。\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:fire magic player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"I love the smell of burning flesh.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Would you like to be cremated?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Don't worry, you'll be warm in a moment.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“我喜欢血肉燃烧的气味。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“想被火化吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“别担心，你马上就暖和了。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:ice magic player ghost"
msgid "VISUAL:A chill runs down your spine. @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I hope the next monster to meet you likes frozen food!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"An ice sculpture of you would look very nice here.\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:一股寒意掠过你的脊背。@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“希望下一个遇见你的怪物喜欢冷冻食品！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“在这里摆一尊你的冰雕，肯定很好看。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:air magic player ghost"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ is surrounded by a shower of sparks.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I'm really charged up about this fight.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Resistance is futile!\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:一阵电火花环绕着@The_monster@。\n\n@The_monster@说：“一想到这场战斗，我就浑身来电。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“抵抗是徒劳的！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:earth magic player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"A rolling stone gathers plenty of @foe_name@.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"All of the earth is under my command.\"\n\nVISUAL:The earth trembles for a moment.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“滚石不生苔，却能碾上一堆@foe_name@。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“整片大地都听我号令。”\n\nVISUAL:大地短暂地颤动了一下。\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:alchemy player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"A minor scratch like that one is certainly harmless.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Go ahead. Run away.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"It doesn't matter if you kill me. You'll still die.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Don't move, or the poison will kill you faster.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I don't need to breathe anymore, but you do!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“这点小划伤，当然无伤大雅。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“去吧，尽管逃。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“你杀不杀我都无所谓。反正你还是会死。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“别动，不然毒会让你死得更快。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“我已经不用呼吸了，可你还得呼吸！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:invocations player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ curses the gods.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"This is what relying on the gods got me.\"\n\n@The_monster@ sneers @at_foe@, \"Where's your god now?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Bah, the gods are useless!\"\n\n@The_monster@ mutters, \"So much for the promised afterlife.\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ prays.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@咒骂着众神。\n\n@The_monster@说：“这就是依赖众神的下场。”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@冷笑道：“你的神现在在哪儿？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“呸，众神根本没用！”\n\n@The_monster@嘟囔道：“这就是承诺过的来世啊。”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@祈祷着。\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:evocations player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Are you sure you're pointing that wand in the right direction?\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“你确定那根魔杖没指错方向？”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:shapeshifting player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Form is emptiness; emptiness is form.\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ briefly looks inexplicably like a @_form_@.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ briefly turns into a @_form_@ and back.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“色即是空，空即是色。”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@短暂地变得莫名像@_form_@。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@短暂地变成@_form_@，又变了回来。\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:forgecraft player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Look on my works and despair!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"My constructs will outlast you.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“看看我的造物，绝望吧！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“我的构装体会比你活得久。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:ashenzari player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Life is a curse, you will soon understand.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Your future is not even bleak.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You will be nailed to the ground forevermore.\"\n\n@The_monster@ whispers: \"Through my death, I saw my mistakes, and the mistakes of many more...\"\n\n@The_monster@ says with laughter: \"And yet I knew I would end up like that...\"\n\n@The_monster@ promises, \"I will read your future in your entrails.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“生命是一种诅咒，你很快就会明白。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“你的未来连惨淡都谈不上。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“你会被永远钉在地上。”\n\n@The_monster@低语道：“透过自己的死亡，我看到了自己的错误，也看到了许多人的错误……”\n\n@The_monster@笑着说：“可我早知道自己会落得这个下场……”\n\n@The_monster@保证道：“我要从你的内脏中读出你的未来。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:beogh player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Nobody wants to follow a dead messiah!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I used to walk on water. Now I just fly over it.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I don't need an army to kill you!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“没人愿意追随一个死去的救世主！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我以前能在水上行走。现在只是从水面飘过去。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“杀你根本用不着军队！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:cheibriados player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"What's the hurry? You'll die anyway.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You can run, but you can't hide!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“急什么？反正你总会死。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“你逃得了，却躲不了！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:dithmenos player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I shall send you to the shadows!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Just let the darkness consume you.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I walk in shadow, and soon so shall you.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“我要把你送入阴影！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“就让黑暗吞没你吧。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“我行于阴影之中，你也很快就会如此。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:elyvilon player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"In life, I might have healed you instead.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I thought violence couldn't solve anything, but it solved me.\"\n\n@The_monster@ muses, \"Killing is much more fun than I thought it would be.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“活着的时候，我或许会选择医治你。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我以为暴力解决不了任何事，结果它把我解决了。”\n\n@The_monster@沉思道：“杀戮比我想的有趣多了。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:fedhas player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ moans, \"Why did I trust plants to save my life?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I can no longer spread life, but I can still bring your death!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You will make such fine fertiliser.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Life goes in cycles. In a little while, you'll be reborn as a tapeworm.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@呻吟道：“我为什么会指望植物救命？”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“我虽已无法播撒生命，却仍能带来你的死亡！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你会成为很好的肥料。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“生命周而复始。再过一会儿，你就会投胎成一条绦虫。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:gozag player ghost"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ waves a bulging coin purse at you.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You're as good as gold.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I guess you can't buy your way into a good afterlife.\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@朝你晃着一个鼓鼓的钱袋。\n\n@The_monster@说：“你简直就是一堆金币。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“看来，有钱也买不到好的来世。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:hepliaklqana player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"If I can't kill you now, I'll help my descendant do it later.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I'll give you a battle you'll never forget!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I'm committing your attacks to memory.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“要是现在杀不了你，以后我就帮我的后代来杀。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“我要给你一场永生难忘的战斗！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“你的招式，我都记下了。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:ignis player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"I burned twice as bright, and look where it got me...\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ droops like a melted candle.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Ashes to ashes... so for me, and next for you!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“我曾燃烧得加倍明亮，瞧瞧落得什么下场……”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@像融化的蜡烛一样垂了下去。\n\n@The_monster@说：“尘归尘，灰归灰……我已如此，下一个就是你！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:jiyva player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Still so attached to shiny items?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Foolish people, craving for loot.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I didn't need trinkets in life, I don't need them now.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“还这么舍不得那些闪闪发亮的物品？”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“愚蠢的家伙，只想着战利品。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“生前我就不需要那些小饰物，现在更不需要。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:kikubaaqudgha player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"I was going to become a lich, but this is almost as good.\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams at @foe@, \"You cannot imagine the pain and torment in store for you!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams at @foe@, \"You haven't seen true ruin and despair yet!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Death will always conquer life.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You would make a fine zombie.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“我本来打算变成巫妖，不过现在这样也差不多好。”\n\n@The_monster@朝@foe@尖叫道：“你根本想象不到等待你的痛苦和折磨！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@foe@尖叫道：“你还没见识过真正的毁灭与绝望！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“死亡终将战胜生命。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“你会是个不错的丧尸。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:lugonu player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says regretfully, \"I wish I had corrupted all of this!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What a barren place. A pity you won't get a chance to visit the Abyss!\"\n\n@The_monster@ proudly claims, \"A renegade god deserves renegade ghosts.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@遗憾地说：“真希望我当初把这里全腐化了！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“真是个荒凉的地方。可惜你没机会去深渊看看了！”\n\n@The_monster@骄傲地宣称：“叛逆之神就该有叛逆的鬼魂。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:makhleb player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"I won't need demonic support against you.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I died to destroy people like you for fun.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Destruction is an occupation beyond life.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"First you will suffer, then you will die.\"\n\n@The_monster@ boasts, \"I survived the Crucible of Flesh! I fear nothing now!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“对付你，用不着恶魔助阵。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我死，就是为了以毁灭你这种人为乐。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“毁灭这份事业，死后也能继续。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“你会先受苦，然后死去。”\n\n@The_monster@夸口道：“我在血肉熔炉中活了下来！现在我无所畏惧！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:nemelex xobeh player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ tells you, \"The cards don't hold a good future for you.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I will deal out your death!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@告诉你：“牌面上可没有你的好未来。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“我要发出你的死牌！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:okawaru player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"I was once a great warrior, and I still am!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Ah, a second chance to prove myself in battle!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“我曾是一位伟大的勇士，现在依然如此！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“啊，又有一次在战斗中证明自己的机会了！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:pakellas player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"You're just another problem to be solved.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You're really going to get a charge out of this one.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Spells? Hah! My gadgets will show what real magic is!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“你不过是又一个待解决的问题。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“这一下，保证让你来电。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“法术？哈！我的小装置会让你见识什么才是真正的魔法！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:qazlal player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"A storm is coming...\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Let nature run its course against you!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"The earth shall destroy you!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“风暴将至……”\n\n@The_monster@说：“让自然之力在你身上尽情施展吧！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“大地将毁灭你！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:ru player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"I sacrificed my body for ultimate power!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I'll show you the great annihilating truth!\"\n\n@The_monster@ tells you, \"None of this matters. None of this is real!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"First you will suffer, then you will die.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“我献祭肉体，换来了终极力量！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我要让你见识那毁灭一切的伟大真理！”\n\n@The_monster@告诉你：“这一切都无关紧要。这一切都不是真的！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“你会先受苦，然后死去。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:sif muna player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Death is but another step down the path of knowledge.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I have plenty of time to study, now.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“死亡不过是求知之路上的又一步。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“现在，我有的是时间钻研。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:the shining one player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"I was promised divine protection. So much for that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"In life I battled great evil. Now I just battle.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"They say chivalry is dead. Well, so am I.\"\n\n@The_monster@ whispers, \"I have become one of them.\"\n\n@The_monster@ mumbles, \"We raided the strongholds of evil. Now I walk alone.\"\n\n@The_monster@ utters, \"No lamp to guide me anymore...\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“他们曾承诺神明会保护我。结果也就这样。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“生前我对抗强大的邪恶。现在，我只是战斗。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“人们说骑士精神死了。巧了，我也死了。”\n\n@The_monster@低语道：“我成了它们的一员。”\n\n@The_monster@嘟囔道：“我们曾攻打邪恶的堡垒。如今我却独自徘徊。”\n\n@The_monster@喃喃道：“再也没有明灯为我引路……”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:trog player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ yells, \"Who would have thought, even in death it is a pleasure to sever!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams in joy, \"As in life, so in death: Kill! Kill!! Kill!!!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@高喊：“谁能想到，死后斩断肢体仍是如此快事！”\n\n@The_monster@欣喜地尖叫：“生前如此，死后亦然：杀！杀！！杀！！！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:uskayaw player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"It's your last dance!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Let me show you true rhythm.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You either stomp with the beat or get stomped.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I used to wander and follow the dancing life. Look where it got me.\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts, \"Finally, a proper audience!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“这是你的最后一支舞！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“让我教你什么才是真正的节奏。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“要么踩着拍子跺脚，要么被踩在脚下。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我曾四处漫游，追随舞动的人生。瞧瞧落得什么下场。”\n\n@The_monster@喊道：“终于来了一位像样的观众！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:vehumet player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ threatens, \"I'm fresh out of hellfire, but you will end anyway.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"The agents of utter destruction are not stopped by death.\"\n\n@The_monster@ boasts, \"After taking care of you, I will research a spell that consumes the world.\"\n\n@The_monster@ threatens, \"Do not fail me, O fires of Iskenderun!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@威胁道：“我的地狱之火刚用完，但你照样得完蛋。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“死亡挡不住彻底毁灭的使者。”\n\n@The_monster@夸口道：“收拾完你，我就要研究吞噬世界的法术。”\n\n@The_monster@威胁道：“伊斯肯德伦的烈焰啊，别让我失望！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:wu jian player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You lack the discipline to defeat me.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Let's see how well you move.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I'm much more flexible now that I'm not limited by flesh.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“你缺乏击败我的修为。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“让我看看你的身法如何。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“不再受血肉束缚，我可灵活多了。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:xom player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ @_laughs_@, \"I laugh when killing. So smile when dying. SMILE!\"\n\n@The_monster@ complains, \"You're an easy kill, but not a fun one.\"\n\n@The_monster@ reminisces, \"I miss the gifts and the pranks.\"\n\n@The_monster@ twaddles, \"I had a jolly good time in life, and I have a jolly good time now!\"\n\n@The_monster@ giggles, \"Hey deadhead, what fun to see your head drop dead!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I need scissors! I think I chipped a nail somewhere...\"\n\n@The_monster@ tries to make a funny facial expression.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@@_laughs_@：“我杀人时会笑，你死的时候也该笑。笑啊！”\n\n@The_monster@抱怨道：“杀你倒容易，可惜没什么乐趣。”\n\n@The_monster@追忆道：“我怀念那些礼物和恶作剧。”\n\n@The_monster@胡扯道：“我生前过得痛快，如今也照样痛快！”\n\n@The_monster@咯咯笑道：“嘿，死脑筋，看到你的脑袋死翘翘一定很有趣！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我需要剪刀！我好像在哪儿崩掉了一片指甲……”\n\n@The_monster@试图做出一个滑稽的表情。\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:yredelemnul player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Your soul may be of use to me.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"First you will die, then you will suffer.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“你的灵魂或许对我有用。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“你会先死去，然后受苦。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:zin player ghost"
msgid "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I died poor and in vain, but not as a freak.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"For all the tithing, I expected a more glorious afterlife than this.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“我虽死得贫穷又徒劳，但至少没变成怪胎。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“交了那么多什一税，我还以为来世会比这光荣得多。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_generic_ranged_"
msgid "@The_monster@ takes aim @at_foe@.\n\nYou feel something passing dangerously close to your head. @player_only@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@瞄准了@at_foe@。\n\n你感觉有什么东西危险地擦着你的脑袋飞过。@player_only@\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_form_"
msgid "spider\n\nstone statue\n\nw:5\ndragon\n"
msgstr "蜘蛛\n\n石像\n\nw:5\n龙\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_laughs_"
msgid "cackles madly\n\nchuckles harshly\n\nw:6\ngibbers darkly\n"
msgstr "疯狂地咯咯笑着\n\n刺耳地干笑着\n\nw:6\n阴森地胡言乱语\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:player ghost"
msgid "@_player_ghost_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_player_ghost_medium_@\n\nw:2\n@_player_ghost_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_player_ghost_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_player_ghost_medium_@\n\nw:2\n@_player_ghost_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_player_ghost_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ stares at @foe@.\n\n@The_monster@ lets out a mournful wail.\n\n@The_monster@ keens inconsolably.\n\n@The_monster@ wails.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ ripples.\n\n@The_monster@ @_wails_@, \"What do you have that I didn't have?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says very slowly, \"There's no hope.\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_wails_@, \"You will never get the ORB!\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ whispers, \"The ORB doesn't exist.\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ @_wails_@, \"They lied to you. The Dungeon just goes down and down forever.\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_wails_@, \"You will join me soon!\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_wails_@, \"You must not succeed where I failed!\"\n\n@The_monster@ whispers @to_foe@, \"There is no future for you.\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@盯着@foe@。\n\n@The_monster@发出一声悲凉的哀号。\n\n@The_monster@悲恸欲绝地恸哭。\n\n@The_monster@哀号着。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@泛起涟漪。\n\n@The_monster@@_wails_@：“你有什么是我当年没有的？”\n\n@The_monster@一字一顿地说：“没有希望了。”\n\n@The_monster@@_wails_@：“你永远也得不到宝珠！”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@低语道：“宝珠根本不存在。”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@@_wails_@：“他们骗了你。地下城只会一层又一层，永无尽头。”\n\n@The_monster@@_wails_@：“你很快就会来陪我！”\n\n@The_monster@@_wails_@：“我失败的地方，你也休想成功！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@低语道：“你没有未来。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_player_ghost_medium_"
msgid "@The_monster@ laughs crazily.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ grins evilly.\n\n@The_monster@ makes a sound of rattling chains.\n\n@The_monster@ @_wails_@, \"I was like you once.\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_wails_@, \"Very impressive. But it won't help. Nothing will.\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_wails_@, \"I have seen your future, and it is all used up.\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_wails_@, \"Do you think the gods will protect you?\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams, \"I'll kill anyone who wants the ORB!\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Don't try to defend! You have no chance!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams, \"Zot is a myth, the ORB is a fable, you'll soon be a tale!\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ whispers, \"Death is liberation.\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_wails_@, \"Death is your only future!\"\n\n@The_monster@ whispers, \"Meet the emptiness of death!\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_wails_@, \"There is no future for me!\"\n\n@The_monster@ whispers, \"They're coming for you...\"\n\n@The_monster@ whispers, \"Trust me. Just give in.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@疯狂地大笑。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@邪恶地咧嘴一笑。\n\n@The_monster@发出锁链碰撞的声音。\n\n@The_monster@@_wails_@：“我也曾和你一样。”\n\n@The_monster@@_wails_@：“真了不起。可那也没用。什么都没用。”\n\n@The_monster@@_wails_@：“我见过你的未来，已经一点都不剩了。”\n\n@The_monster@@_wails_@：“你以为众神会保护你？”\n\n@The_monster@尖叫道：“谁想要宝珠，我就杀了谁！”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“别想抵抗！你毫无胜算！”\n\n@The_monster@尖叫道：“佐特是神话，宝珠是传说，你很快也会变成故事！”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@低语道：“死亡即是解脱。”\n\n@The_monster@@_wails_@：“死亡就是你唯一的未来！”\n\n@The_monster@低语道：“迎接死亡的虚无吧！”\n\n@The_monster@@_wails_@：“我没有未来！”\n\n@The_monster@低语道：“它们来找你了……”\n\n@The_monster@低语道：“相信我，放弃吧。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_player_ghost_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ @_wails_@, \"To die, to sleep, no more.\"\n\n@The_monster@ whispers, \"Everlasting silence awaits you...\"\n\n@The_monster@ whispers, \"Death doesn't hurt. What you feel is life.\"\n\n@The_monster@ whispers, \"You will understand me better in a moment.\"\n\n@The_monster@ whispers, \"It is all a dream - a grotesque and foolish dream.\"\n\n@The_monster@ whispers, \"Soon you will have time, lots of time...\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_wails_@, \"You must not fail where I succeeded!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@@_wails_@：“死去，睡去，不过如此。”\n\n@The_monster@低语道：“永恒的寂静在等着你……”\n\n@The_monster@低语道：“死亡并不痛。你感觉到的，是生命。”\n\n@The_monster@低语道：“再过片刻，你就会更理解我了。”\n\n@The_monster@低语道：“这一切只是个梦——荒诞而愚蠢的梦。”\n\n@The_monster@低语道：“很快，你就有时间了，多得是时间……”\n\n@The_monster@@_wails_@：“我成功的地方，你可不许失败！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:aizul"
msgid "@_Aizul_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Aizul_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Aizul_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Aizul_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_aizul_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ yawns, and then pretends @subjective@ didn't.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Feeling sleepy?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I wasn't actually sleeping!\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ hisses menacingly.\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"I'll haunt your nightmares!\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@打了个哈欠，又装作@subjective@没打过。\n\n@The_monster@说：“困了吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我其实没在睡觉！”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@威吓般地嘶嘶作响。\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“我要缠上你的噩梦！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_aizul_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Sweet dreams!\"\n\n@The_monster@ hums a lullaby.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ coils and then uncoils.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Everybody has to sleep sometimes.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Fancy a snooze?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"They said they'd gotten someone better!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Replaced! How does it feel to be replaced?\"\n\n@The_monster@ moans, \"No job prospects! Who wants sleepy Aizul to guard their treasure?\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ winks several times @at_foe@.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“做个好梦！”\n\n@The_monster@哼起摇篮曲。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@盘起身子，又舒展开来。\n\n@The_monster@说：“谁都有需要睡觉的时候。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“想打个盹吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“他们说已经找到了比我更好的！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“被替代了！被替代是什么滋味？”\n\n@The_monster@呻吟道：“毫无工作前景！谁会要贪睡的艾祖尔来看守财宝？”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@朝@at_foe@连眨了几次眼。\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:agnes"
msgid "@_Agnes_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Agnes_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Agnes_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Agnes_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_agnes_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ bows.\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You dishonour your ancestors.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I despise a dishonourable opponent.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"It is my duty to kill you, but also my pleasure.\"\n\n@The_monster@ mutters, \"I never trained for this.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You will find the Path of Peace easy to follow, in death.\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@鞠了一躬。\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“你让先祖蒙羞。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“我鄙视不讲荣誉的对手。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“杀你是我的职责，也是我的乐趣。”\n\n@The_monster@嘟囔道：“我可没为这个受过训练。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“死后，你就会发现和平之道很好走。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_agnes_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"The ORB is mine by right.\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"I will kick you around like a rattan ball!\"\n\n@The_monster@ asks, \"Have you seen my kris anywhere?\"\n\n@The_monster@ mutters, \"I could really go for a good breadfruit right now.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“宝珠理应归我所有。”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@喊道：“我要把你当藤球踢来踢去！”\n\n@The_monster@问道：“你见过我的波状匕首吗？”\n\n@The_monster@嘟囔道：“现在真想吃个好面包果。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:agnes triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"May you follow the Path of Peace in your next life.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“愿你来世能踏上和平之道。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:antaeus"
msgid "@_hell_lord_taunt_@\n"
msgstr "@_hell_lord_taunt_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:antaeus triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Your soul will be trapped in ice for ten thousand years.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“你的灵魂将在冰中困上一万年。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:amaemon"
msgid "@_Amaemon_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Amaemon_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Amaemon_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Amaemon_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_amaemon_common_"
msgid "@The_monster@ hisses.\n\nVISUAL:Something foul drips from @the_monster_possessive@ claws.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ eyes glow red.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ tail lashes.\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"You think you're better than me?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Afraid of a little sting?\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@嘶嘶作响。\n\nVISUAL:污浊的液体从@the_monster_possessive@利爪上滴落。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@双眼泛起红光。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@尾巴抽打着。\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@喊道：“你觉得自己比我强？”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“怕这点小小的蛰刺吗？”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_amaemon_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ whines, \"They said I was special. Look at me now!\"\n\n@The_monster@ sighs, \"Demons are the only companions you can really rely on.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Need some antivenom? Don't worry, you can trust me.\"\n\n@The_monster@ whispers, \"Once I find the ORB, I'll be cured. I'll be normal again!\"\n\n@The_monster@ sings, \"Eyes close, heart stop, nighty-night for you...\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@哀声道：“他们说我与众不同。看看我现在这副样子！”\n\n@The_monster@叹道：“真正靠得住的同伴，只有恶魔。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“需要解毒剂吗？别担心，你可以相信我。”\n\n@The_monster@低语道：“只要找到宝珠，我就能治好。我又能恢复正常了！”\n\n@The_monster@唱道：“闭上眼，心停跳，乖乖睡去好宝宝……”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:arachne"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Follow my lead, little ones.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I resented this body once, but could any human make what I've made?\"\n\n@The_monster@ snarls, \"I will not be driven out again.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Come closer, little fly.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I'm done suffering for art; you can suffer instead.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"My silk is a match for both steel and spell.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I will spin a new home for us all.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“跟着我，小家伙们。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我曾怨恨这副躯体，可哪个人类能造出我的杰作？”\n\n@The_monster@咆哮道：“我不会再被赶走。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“靠近些，小苍蝇。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“我不再为艺术受苦了；换你来受吧。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“我的丝足以匹敌钢铁与法术。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“我要为我们所有人织一个新家。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:arachne triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ shouts, \"This is my domain now; anyone trespasses at their own peril!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@喊道：“如今这里是我的领地；擅闯者后果自负！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:asterion"
msgid "@_Asterion_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Asterion_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Asterion_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Asterion_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_asterion_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ snorts and paws the ground.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ slowly taps @possessive@ weapon in @possessive@ hand.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Soon your soul will belong to Makhleb.\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Makhleb has given me powers of destruction.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Your corpse will decorate my castle walls.\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"In my kingdom, weaklings like you are put to the sword.\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"No maze can contain me.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Enter my house and I will deliver you from evil.\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"My mother, she was a queen.\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ screams, \"Stop staring at me!\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ bellows, \"My home has fourteen doors!\"\n\n@The_monster@ chants a prayer to Makhleb.\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Your valuables will do nicely in my coffers.\" @player_only@\n\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@打着响鼻，用蹄子刨着地。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@用@possessive@武器缓缓敲着@possessive@手掌。\n\n@The_monster@说：“你的灵魂很快就将归于马科列布。”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@说：“马科列布赐予了我毁灭之力。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你的尸体将装点我城堡的墙壁。”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@说：“在我的王国里，你这样的弱者会被斩于剑下。”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@说：“没有迷宫能困住我。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“走进我的家，我便救你脱离邪恶。”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@说：“我的母亲，她曾是一位王后。”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@尖叫道：“别再盯着我看！”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@吼道：“我的家有十四扇门！”\n\n@The_monster@吟诵着献给马科列布的祷文。\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“你的财宝正好能充实我的金库。”@player_only@\n\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_asterion_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ unleashes a bloodcurdling roar.\n\n@The_monster@ chants and is briefly shrouded in fire.\n\n@The_monster_possessive@ eyes glow.\nYou hear demonic laughter.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"{{\n    if you.skill(\"Spellcasting\") >= 5 then\n      return \"Ah, a wizard! I'll enjoy hearing you beg for your life.\"\n    else\n      return \"You're no warrior. You fight like a peasant!\"\n    end }}\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"{{\n    if you.god() == \"Makhleb\" then\n      return \"In the name of our god, lay down your life!\"\n    else\n      return \"Kneel before Makhleb, unbeliever!\"\n    end }}\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"What ORB?! I have an entire kingdom!\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Bow down before your king! Bow! Bow!!\" @player_only@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@发出令人毛骨悚然的怒吼。\n\n@The_monster@吟唱着，短暂地笼罩在火焰中。\n\n@The_monster_possessive@双眼发光。\n你听见恶魔的笑声。\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"{{\n    if you.skill(\"Spellcasting\") >= 5 then\n      return \"Ah, a wizard! I'll enjoy hearing you beg for your life.\"\n    else\n      return \"You're no warrior. You fight like a peasant!\"\n    end }}\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"{{\n    if you.god() == \"Makhleb\" then\n      return \"In the name of our god, lay down your life!\"\n    else\n      return \"Kneel before Makhleb, unbeliever!\"\n    end }}\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“什么宝珠？！我有整整一个王国！”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“跪在你的国王面前！跪下！跪下！！”@player_only@\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:asterion triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ screams, \"The power of Makhleb!\"\n\n@The_monster@ bellows, \"I am king! All will kneel!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@尖叫道：“马科列布的力量！”\n\n@The_monster@吼道：“我是国王！所有人都得跪下！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:azrael"
msgid "@_Azrael_common_@\n\nw:2\n@_Azrael_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Azrael_common_@\n\nw:2\n@_Azrael_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_azrael_common_"
msgid "@The_monster@ laughs insanely.\n\n@The_monster@ howls in rage.\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Burn! Burn! All of it must BURN!\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ blows smoke rings.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ eyes look fiery.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ is momentarily hidden by a cloud of flames.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@疯狂地大笑。\n\n@The_monster@愤怒地嚎叫。\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“烧！烧！把一切都烧光！”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@吐着烟圈。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@双眼仿佛燃着火。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@短暂地隐没在一团烈焰中。\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_azrael_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ grins and asks @foe,@ \"Are you [flammable|inflammable|feeling hot]?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"We're having tasty @foe_genus@ kabobs tonight!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"No! No! YES! No!\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ whirls about in circles.\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"May the fleas of a thousand camels infest your armpits.\"\n\n@The_monster@ wonders @at_foe@, \"Do you still suffer from delusions of adequacy?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"May your bottom itch incessantly and may your @_player_arms_@ be too short to scratch it.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You child of a motherless goat.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You child of a rabid dog! Grandchild of a stinking jackal! Great-grandchild of a plucked vulture!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"May a porcupine live in your trousers for a thousand days and die there for a thousand and one.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@咧嘴笑着问@foe,@：“你[易燃吗|可燃吗|觉得热吗]？”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“今晚有美味的@foe_genus@烤肉串！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“不！不！对！不！”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@转着圈打旋。\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“愿一千头骆驼的跳蚤钻进你的腋窝。”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@纳闷道：“你还妄想着自己有点本事？”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“愿你的屁股奇痒无比，而@_player_arms_@又太短，怎么也挠不到。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“你这没娘山羊的崽子。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“你这疯狗的孩子！臭豺的孙子！秃毛兀鹫的曾孙！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“愿一只豪猪在你裤裆里活上一千天，再死在里面待上一千零一天。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_player_arms_"
msgid "{{\nif you.race() == \"Felid\" then\n    return \"paws\"\nelseif you.race() == \"Octopode\" then\n    return \"tentacles\"\nelseif you.race() == \"Formicid\" then\n    return \"limbs\"\nelse\n    return \"arms\"\nend\n}}\n"
msgstr "{{\nif you.race() == \"Felid\" then\n    return \"paws\"\nelseif you.race() == \"Octopode\" then\n    return \"tentacles\"\nelseif you.race() == \"Formicid\" then\n    return \"limbs\"\nelse\n    return \"arms\"\nend\n}}\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:bai suzhen"
msgid "@_Bai_Suzhen_common_@\n\nw:6\n@_Bai_Suzhen_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Bai_Suzhen_common_@\n\nw:6\n@_Bai_Suzhen_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_bai_suzhen_common_"
msgid "@The_monster@ grumbles, \"Damn that jealous turtle monk.\"\n\n@The_monster@ pines for @possessive@ lost husband.\n\n@The_monster@ roars, \"Even the heavens can't separate us forever!\"\n\n@The_monster@ inspects @possessive@ gathered herbal reagents.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ twists and twirls @possessive@ body through the storm.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@抱怨道：“该死的龟和尚，妒忌成性。”\n\n@The_monster@思念着@possessive@失散的丈夫。\n\n@The_monster@咆哮道：“就连上天也休想永远拆散我们！”\n\n@The_monster@检查着@possessive@收集的草药材料。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@在风暴中扭转盘旋着@possessive@身躯。\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_bai_suzhen_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ grouses about [the pranks of immortal alchemists|immature sisters].\n\n@The_monster@ hisses, \"Days like this make me miss drinking.\"\n\n@The_monster@ affirms to @reflexive@, \"Our love will make it through this.\"\n\n@The_monster@ wonders wistfully, \"Should I have meditated another thousand years?\"\n\nw:5\n@The_monster@ whispers to @reflexive@, \"Everyone I saved... Everyone I doomed...\"\n\nw:5\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ form shimmers in the rain.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@埋怨着[炼丹仙人的恶作剧|不懂事的妹妹]。\n\n@The_monster@嘶声道：“这样的日子，让我又想喝酒了。”\n\n@The_monster@向@reflexive@保证：“我们的爱一定能挺过去。”\n\n@The_monster@惆怅地想道：“我是不是该再修行一千年？”\n\nw:5\n@The_monster@向@reflexive@低语道：“那些我救过的人……那些被我害了的人……”\n\nw:5\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@身形在雨中闪烁。\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:blorkula the orcula"
msgid "@_Blorkula_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Blorkula_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Blorkula_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Blorkula_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:blorkula the orcula triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ shouts, \"I believe in me!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@喊道：“我相信自己！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_blorkula_colour_"
msgid "w:20\n@rainbow_colour@\n\nw:10\n@misc_colour@\n"
msgstr "w:20\n@rainbow_colour@\n\nw:10\n@misc_colour@\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_blorkula_common_"
msgid "w:20\n@_generic_orc_speech_@\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ grins serenely.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ is briefly surrounded by a halo of @_blorkula_colour_@ light.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ eyes glow @_blorkula_colour_@.\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You need a new perspective.\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Let me show you how many colours things can be!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Beogh has given me so many different colours to drink.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I was weak before I became an orc, but now I'm strong. And I'll get stronger.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Everything's been so different since that missionary gave me these suspenders.\"\n\n@The_monster@ mutters, \"Such pretty colours everywhere...\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"My favourite colour of blood is @_blorkula_colour_@. Wait, no, @_blorkula_colour_@.\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams, \"What are you staring at, @player_name@? I'm stylish!\" @player_only@\n"
msgstr "w:20\n@_generic_orc_speech_@\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@安详地咧嘴一笑。\n\nVISUAL:一圈@_blorkula_colour_@的光晕短暂地环绕着@The_monster@。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@双眼泛起@_blorkula_colour_@的光。\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“你需要换个角度看世界。”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“让我告诉你，事物能有多少种颜色！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“比欧弗赐予我这么多种颜色来畅饮。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“变成兽人前我很弱，现在我很强。而且还会更强。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“自从那个传教士给了我这副吊裤带，一切都变得不同了。”\n\n@The_monster@嘟囔道：“到处都是这么漂亮的颜色……”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我最喜欢的血液颜色是@_blorkula_colour_@。等等，不，是@_blorkula_colour_@。”\n\n@The_monster@尖叫道：“你盯着什么看，@player_name@？我可时髦了！”@player_only@\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_blorkula_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"What are you like inside? I'll break you open and find out!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"It's all true! You just have to believe!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Look beyond the surface! Nothing is what it seems!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"I'll make you see things how they really are!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"There's so much colour in the world. Let me show it to you.\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ contemplates whether Beogh's temples would look better painted @_blorkula_colour_@.\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"The problem is, you see everything in terms of black and white.\"\n\n@The_monster@ mutters, \"Why is everything @_blorkula_colour_@ all of a sudden?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Things are no longer grey! Not since my great insight!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“你里面是什么样？我要把你砸开看看！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“全是真的！你只需要相信！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“别只看表面！眼见未必为实！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“我要让你看清事物的真面目！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“世界有这么多颜色。让我带你见识见识。”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@思索着，比欧弗的神庙要是漆成@_blorkula_colour_@会不会更好看。\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“问题在于，你看什么都是非黑即白。”\n\n@The_monster@嘟囔道：“怎么突然什么都变成@_blorkula_colour_@了？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“一切再也不是灰色的了！自从我大彻大悟之后就不是了！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:blorkula the orcula killed"
msgid "A faint prismatic mist rises from Blorkula's broken form and then dissipates.\n"
msgstr "一缕淡淡的虹彩薄雾从布洛库拉破碎的身躯上升起，随即消散。\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:boris"
msgid "w:8\n@_Boris_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Boris_medium_@\n\nw:2\n@_Boris_rare_@\n"
msgstr "w:8\n@_Boris_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Boris_medium_@\n\nw:2\n@_Boris_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_boris_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ stares @at_foe@.\n\n@_wizard_common_spell_@\n@_fake_spell_effect_@\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@盯着@at_foe@。\n\n@_wizard_common_spell_@\n@_fake_spell_effect_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_boris_medium_"
msgid "@The_monster@ laughs.\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You can't imagine my power.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You want the ORB? You'll never get it.\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ boasts with wailing echoes, \"My power is unlimited.\"\n\n@The_monster@ claims, \"You mortals are all unique only in the ways you'll break.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You can't kill me in a way that matters.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I know the secret of eternal life. Do you?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I know your future. Your future is death.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Who wants to live forever? Me.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"There's only one solution for all of you. To die.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You can never win.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@笑了。\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“你无法想象我的力量。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你想要宝珠？你永远也得不到。”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@夸口，声音哀号般回荡：“我的力量没有极限。”\n\n@The_monster@宣称：“你们凡人唯一的不同，就是破碎的方式。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“你杀不了真正意义上的我。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“我知道永生的秘密。你知道吗？”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“我知道你的未来。你的未来就是死亡。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“谁想永生？我。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“你们所有人都只有一个归宿：死。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“你永远也赢不了。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_boris_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I didn't invite you.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"The world, the flesh, and the devil.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"There's no good or evil. Just power and will.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You have all forgotten the taste of death.\"\n\n@The_monster@ claims, \"I care not for such insignificant forces as time or death.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Magic. You know nothing about it.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Join my legions of the broken and the beaten.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“我没邀请你。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“尘世、肉欲，还有魔鬼。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“没有善恶，只有力量与意志。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你们全都忘记了死亡的滋味。”\n\n@The_monster@宣称：“时间或死亡这种微不足道的力量，我根本不在乎。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“魔法。你对它一无所知。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“加入我麾下那些支离破碎、被打败者的大军吧。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:boris killed"
msgid "@_Boris_return_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Boris_return_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Boris_return_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Boris_return_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_boris_return_common_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You haven't seen the last of me!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I'll get you next time!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"This isn't over yet!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I'll be back!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"This isn't the end, it's only just beginning!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“你还没见到我的最后一面！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“下次我会收拾你！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“还没完呢！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我会回来的！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“这不是结束，只是刚刚开始！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_boris_return_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Kill me? I think not!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You cannot defeat me so easily!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"We will meet again!\"\n\nw:5\n@The_monster@ asks, \"Do I look like the kind of man who dies?\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“杀我？我可不这么想！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“你没那么容易打败我！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“我们还会再见！”\n\nw:5\n@The_monster@问道：“我看起来像是会死的人吗？”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:boris timeout"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"You can't fire me, I quit!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“你开除不了我，我辞职！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:friendly boris timeout"
msgid "@Boris timeout@\n"
msgstr "@Boris timeout@\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:boris triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"And that's the last I'll see of you.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I'd like to see you come back from this one.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I'll treasure this one.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“这下再也不用见到你了。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我倒要看看，你这次怎么活过来。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“这次我会好好珍藏。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:boris riddle"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"You would ask such trivialities of one who has solved death itself?\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“我连死亡都解开了，你却拿这种琐事来问我？”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:cassandra"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"A terrible fate awaits all who seek the ORB - and yours worst of all.\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ beseeches you, \"Abandon your quest, lest a terrible end find us all.\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ shouts, \"Turn back while you still can!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"The road you walk has only one end and you would not wish it even upon your enemies.\"\n\n@The_monster@ cries, \"You know not what is at stake here!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You never know good fortune from ill. It is because you cannot see into the future.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Heed my words or we all shall suffer their consequence.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I have seen things no one ever should.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Knowledge is its own curse.\"\n\nw:5\n@The_monster@ says, \"Should we be naught but slaves of fate, I will still speak truth to my dying breath.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“追寻宝珠的人都将遭遇可怕的命运——你的尤其悲惨。”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@恳求你：“放弃你的追寻吧，免得我们全都迎来可怕的结局。”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@喊道：“趁还来得及，回头吧！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你走的路只有一个尽头，那是你连敌人都不愿遭遇的结局。”\n\n@The_monster@哭喊：“你根本不知道这里事关什么！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你从来分不清祸福，因为你看不见未来。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“听我的话，否则我们都将承受我所说的后果。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我看见了任何人都不该看见的事。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“知识本身就是诅咒。”\n\nw:5\n@The_monster@说：“即便我们只是命运的奴隶，我也会说出真相，直到咽下最后一口气。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:cassandra triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ gasps, \"Did I... did I finally change the future?\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@喘息道：“我……我终于改变未来了吗？”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:cassandra killed"
msgid "@The_monster@ gasps with @possessive@ dying breath, \"I... tried to warn you...\"\n\n@The_monster@ gasps with @possessive@ dying breath, \"No one... ever listens...\"\n\n@The_monster@ gasps with @possessive@ dying breath, \"Your fate... be upon your own head...\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@用@possessive@最后一口气喘息道：“我……试着警告过你……”\n\n@The_monster@用@possessive@最后一口气喘息道：“从来……没人肯听……”\n\n@The_monster@用@possessive@最后一口气喘息道：“你的命运……你自己承担吧……”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:friendly cassandra"
msgid "@The_monster@ begs you to reconsider your quest.\n\n@The_monster@ pleads, \"Will you not heed even the word of a friend and end this?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Even I cannot save you if you persist in this.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@恳求你重新考虑这场追寻。\n\n@The_monster@哀求道：“难道连朋友的话，你也不肯听，不肯让这一切结束吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“如果你一意孤行，连我也救不了你。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:chuck"
msgid "@_chuck_generic_@\n\nw:2\n@_chuck_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_chuck_generic_@\n\nw:2\n@_chuck_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_chuck_generic_"
msgid "@The_monster@ grunts.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Me like rocks.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Me has lots rocks.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Want to see my rocks?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You look bit like rock.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Big rocks, small rocks, huge rocks! Magic rocks!\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ drools a little bit.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@哼了一声。\n\n@The_monster@说：“俺喜欢石头。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“俺有好多石头。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“想看俺的石头吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你看着有点像石头。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“大石头，小石头，巨石头！魔法石头！”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@流了点口水。\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_chuck_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Me has best rocks.\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ inspects you suspiciously.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"No steal rocks!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams, \"THIEF!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You took it. Me saw.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Best rocks! Rocks!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"ROCKS!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"ME ROCKS!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“俺有最好的石头。”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@疑心重重地打量着你。\n\n@The_monster@说：“不许偷石头！”\n\n@The_monster@尖叫道：“小偷！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你拿走了。俺看见了。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“最好的石头！石头！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“石头！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“俺的石头！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:crazy yiuf"
msgid "@_crazy_yiuf_speech_@\n"
msgstr "@_crazy_yiuf_speech_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_orc_shouts_"
msgid "grunts\n\n@_shouts_@\n\ncomplains\n\ncheers\n\njeers\n\ncurses\n"
msgstr "哼叫\n\n@_shouts_@\n\n抱怨\n\n欢呼\n\n嘲笑\n\n咒骂\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_loudly_or_repeatedly_"
msgid "loudly\n\nw:5\nnoisily\n\nw:5\nrepeatedly\n"
msgstr "大声地\n\nw:5\n吵闹地\n\nw:5\n反复地\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_orc_modifier_"
msgid ".\n\nw:3\n, as Orcs often do.\n\nw:1\n, in orcish tradition.\n"
msgstr "。\n\nw:3\n，兽人常常如此。\n\nw:1\n，这符合兽人的传统。\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_generic_orc_speech_"
msgid "w:50\n@The_monster@ @_orc_shouts_@ @_loudly_or_repeatedly_@@_orc_modifier_@\n\nw:20\n@The_monster@ suddenly @_orc_shouts_@@_orc_modifier_@\n\nw:5\n@The_monster@ @_orc_shouts_@ to no one in particular.\n\nw:2\n@The_monster@ @_loudly_or_repeatedly_@ @_shouts_@ encouragement to no one in particular.\n\n@The_monster@ sings a few bars from the Orcish anthem.\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@The_monster@@_loudly_or_repeatedly_@@_orc_shouts_@@_orc_modifier_@\n\nw:20\n@The_monster@突然@_orc_shouts_@@_orc_modifier_@\n\nw:5\n@The_monster@@_orc_shouts_@，也不知道在对谁发泄。\n\nw:2\n@The_monster@@_loudly_or_repeatedly_@@_shouts_@着鼓励的话，也不知道在鼓励谁。\n\n@The_monster@唱了几句兽人颂歌。\n"

#. Reviewed database-19; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_crazy_yiuf_speech_"
msgid "w:300\n@The_monster@ @_crazy_yiuf_speech_verbs_@, \"@_crazy_yiuf_sentence_@\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ waves @possessive@ quarterstaff at you. @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ cries, \"You leg down broken song, no?\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ glowers.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ twirls on the spot.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ flaps @possessive@ cloak.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Crazy? Crazy!? PORCUPINE!\"\n\n@The_monster@ sings, \"Trees, trees, trees, circus!\"\n\nw:2\n@The_monster@ says, \"I'm not crazy!\"\n\nw:2\n@The_monster@ says, \"What sane person could live in this world and not be crazy?\"\n"
msgstr "w:300\n@The_monster@@_crazy_yiuf_speech_verbs_@：“@_crazy_yiuf_sentence_@”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@朝你挥舞@possessive@长棍。@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@哭喊：“你腿往下破歌，不是？”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@怒目而视。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@原地打转。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@抖动着@possessive@披风。\n\n@The_monster@说：“疯了？疯了！？豪猪！”\n\n@The_monster@唱道：“树，树，树，马戏团！”\n\nw:2\n@The_monster@说：“我没疯！”\n\nw:2\n@The_monster@说：“哪个清醒的人能活在这世界上而不发疯？”\n"

