#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:xom crazy yiuf"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"The life which is unexamined is not worth living.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"My goal is simple. It is a complete understanding of the universe, why it is as it is and why it exists at all.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"One may say the eternal mystery of the world is its comprehensibility.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Which is more difficult, to awaken one who sleeps or to awaken one who, awake, dreams that he is awake?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Everyone has the same god; only people differ.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Against boredom even gods struggle in vain.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"No facts are to me sacred; none are profane; I simply experiment, an endless seeker, with no past at my back.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"The present is the child, and the necessary child, of all the past, and the mother of all the future.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Reason is nothing but a wonderful and unintelligible instinct in our souls.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"It is extremely absurd to expect to be enlightened by reason, and yet to prescribe to it beforehand on which side it must incline.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"The real reality is there, but everything you KNOW about 'it' is in your mind and yours to do with as you like.\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ considers dialectic materialism.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ ponders an existential dilemma.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ shuffles @possessive@ notes under @possessive@ cloak.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ heaves a sigh in contemplation.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“未经审视的人生不值得过。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我的目标很简单，就是彻底理解宇宙：它为何如此，又为何存在。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“可以说，世界永恒的奥秘就在于它竟然能够被理解。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“唤醒一个沉睡的人，与唤醒一个醒着却梦见自己醒着的人，哪个更难？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“所有人都信奉同一位神；不同的只是人。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“面对无聊，就连众神也徒劳无功。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“在我看来，没有神圣的事实，也没有亵渎的事实；我只是不停实验，永远求索，身后没有过去。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“现在是全部过去的孩子，是必然的孩子，也是全部未来的母亲。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“理性不过是灵魂中一种奇妙而难以理解的本能。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“既期望理性启迪自己，又预先规定理性必须偏向哪一方，实在荒谬至极。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“真正的现实就在那里，可你对“它”的一切认识都在你的脑中，任你随意摆布。”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@思考着辩证唯物主义。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@思索着存在的困境。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@把@possessive@笔记翻整到@possessive@披风下面。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@沉思着，长叹了一声。\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:orb crazy yiuf"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Wait for me!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You found it!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Get me out of this place.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You came back for me.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“等等我！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你找到了！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“带我离开这个地方。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你回来找我了。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:confused crazy yiuf"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"This beard itches something crazy!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I wonder if I left the window open.\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ scratches @possessive@ head thoughtfully.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Have you seen my glasses?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Perhaps I shall have lamb for dinner.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Oh, this is rather nice.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Have you seen my cloak?\"\n\n@The_monster@ laughs.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ counts something out on @possessive@ fingers.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"My, my head's in a spin!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I feel rather peculiar.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“这胡子痒得要命！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我是不是忘了关窗？”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@若有所思地挠着@possessive@头。\n\n@The_monster@说：“你看见我的眼镜了吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“晚饭也许该吃羊肉。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“哦，这倒挺不错。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你看见我的披风了吗？”\n\n@The_monster@笑了。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@掰着@possessive@手指数着什么。\n\n@The_monster@说：“哎呀，我的头在打转！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我觉得很不对劲。”\n"

