msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_dissolution_common_"
msgid "@The_monster@ gurgles.\n\n@The_monster@ gurgles loudly.\n\n@The_monster@ emits a sizzling noise.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ jiggles.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ wobbles.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@咕噜作响。\n\n@The_monster@大声咕噜着。\n\n@The_monster@发出滋滋声。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@晃动着。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@摇摆着。\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_dissolution_speech_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Join with me for eternity!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Become one with my sorrow!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Slime for the Slime God!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Acid is thicker than water.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Acid to acid, slime to slime.\"\n\nw:5\n@_dissolution_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“与我永远融为一体吧！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“与我的悲伤合而为一吧！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“黏液献给黏液之神！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“酸浓于水。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“酸归酸，黏液归黏液。”\n\nw:5\n@_dissolution_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_dissolution_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"We come from slime, we turn to slime.\"\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@ says, \"From Slime we come, to Slime we go.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Resolve to dissolve!\"\n\n@The_monster@ presages, \"An acid flood will etch off all the scum!\"\n\nw:2\n@The_monster@ says, \"There is a problem solver and @possessive@ name is Dissolver!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“我们来自黏液，也将变成黏液。”\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@说：“我们从黏液中来，到黏液中去。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“下定决心，溶解自身！”\n\n@The_monster@预言道：“酸液的洪流会蚀去所有渣滓！”\n\nw:2\n@The_monster@说：“世上有个解决问题的高手，@possessive@名字叫溶解者！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:temple donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I can never find the altar I want in here.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"There are too many gods demanding my worship. I hate that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Why did you bring me all the way here just to see the Temple?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"There's not enough treasure in here.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You've already taken the rune from here, haven't you?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"The so-called 'good' gods are just as evil as the rest. I hate hypocrisy.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate temples.\"\n\nw:5\n@The_monster@ says, \"What about an ecumenical tavern?\"\n\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“我在这里从来找不到想找的祭坛。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“要求我信奉的神也太多了。真讨厌。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你大老远带我来，就为了看众神殿？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“这里的财宝不够多。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你已经拿走这里的符文了，对吧？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“所谓的“善神”和其他神一样邪恶。我讨厌虚伪。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌神庙。”\n\nw:5\n@The_monster@说：“不如建个众神酒馆？”\n\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:orc donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Orcs complain a lot, don't they? I hate it.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Orcs smell really bad. Yuck.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"At least there's gold. That doesn't make up for it.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I'll never be able to carry all this gold! I hate that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What do they mine anyway? I've never seen them mine anything.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Have you ever seen an orcish miner? Me neither.\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ kicks a rock and scowls.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Why is it so dark? Have they never heard of torches?\"\n\n@The_monster@ ponders, \"They're ugly as hell, too!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I ran into an orc. He called himself a warlord, and I asked what war?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"These orcs are so stupid, they must've eaten the rune.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I asked for directions to the rune, but they belched at me.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I prefer the Lair of the Beasts, to be honest. At least animals don't complain.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate complainers so much.\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“兽人很爱抱怨，对吧？真讨厌。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“兽人真臭。呸。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“至少有金币。可这也弥补不了。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“这么多金币我怎么可能全带走！真讨厌。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“他们到底挖什么矿？我从没见他们挖出过东西。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你见过兽人矿工吗？我也没见过。”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@踢开一块石头，皱起眉头。\n\n@The_monster@说：“怎么这么黑？他们没听说过火把吗？”\n\n@The_monster@思忖道：“而且还丑得要命！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我碰见一个兽人，自称军阀。我就问他，哪场战争？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“这些兽人蠢成这样，肯定把符文吃了。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我问符文在哪里，他们却朝我打嗝。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“说实话，我更喜欢野兽巢穴。至少动物不会抱怨。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我真是讨厌死那些爱抱怨的家伙了。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:elf donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Why would you have your front door in a mine? Stupid.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hope this rune is worth it!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I thought elves might be good for a party. Nope.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Really pretty, but really, really boring. I hate that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What's with all the gesturing? I hate that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"None of these elves know how to fight. I hate that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What's the point of a Hall of Blades anyway?\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“谁会把自家大门开在矿坑里？蠢死了。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“但愿这枚符文值得！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我还以为跟精灵能好好聚会呢。想多了。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“漂亮倒是漂亮，可也实在太无聊了。真讨厌。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“怎么老是比比划划的？真讨厌。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“这些精灵一个都不会打架。真讨厌。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“刀刃大厅到底有什么意义？”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:swamp donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What's that horrible smell? It's like... yuck.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"If there's anything I hate more than water, it's brackish swamp water.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate trees. I hate swamp water. I hate this place.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"That buzzing noise? I hate that the most.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What could mosquitoes possibly want with my blood?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hope these swamp worms drown.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Damn it, I left my flaming sword at home.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Don't you hate leeches? I know I do.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate mosquitoes. Almost as much as I hate swamp water.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"At least there's some dry land. I hate getting wet.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Is there a plague of frogs happening, or something? At least it's not locusts.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"The more heads they grow, the more I hate hydras.\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“什么味这么难闻？就像……呕。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“要说有什么比水更让我讨厌，那就是又咸又臭的沼泽水。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌树。我讨厌沼泽水。我讨厌这个地方。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“那种嗡嗡声？那个最讨厌了。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“蚊子到底想拿我的血干什么？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“真希望这些沼泽蠕虫全淹死。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“该死，我把火焰剑忘在家里了。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你不讨厌水蛭吗？反正我讨厌。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌蚊子，快赶上我讨厌沼泽水了。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“至少还有些干地。我讨厌弄湿自己。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“这是闹蛙灾了还是怎么的？至少不是蝗灾。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“海德拉的头长得越多，我就越讨厌。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:shoals donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Tides? I despise tides. No, wait, I hate tides!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I like turtle soup. I hate turtles.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I haven't seen any pirates yet. I hate pirates.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"At least this place doesn't smell as bad as the Swamp.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"The sirens are starting to hurt my ears.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Are sirens supposed to sound like that? I can sing better than that!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Where'd the sea come from? I thought this place was underground.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I like the beach, but I hate the sea.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"These tides are fast. That can't be natural!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"At least there aren't any ducks around. I hate ducks.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I'm soaked through. I hate being wet!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Those krakens don't even look real.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I'm looking for Ms. Medusa. Have you seen her?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I don't understand half of what these people say. It's all Greek to me.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"And I thought they were famous for their poetry.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I slipped earlier. I hate that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I wish these tides would just make up their mind. In and out, in and out...\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"A turtle bit me. I hate turtles.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"This tentacle just came out of nowhere and touched me. I hate tentacles!\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“潮汐？我鄙视潮汐。不，等等，我讨厌潮汐！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我喜欢海龟汤。我讨厌海龟。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“还没见过海盗。我讨厌海盗。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“至少这里没沼泽那么臭。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“塞壬的歌声开始让我耳朵疼了。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“塞壬就该唱成这样？我都唱得比这好！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“海是从哪儿来的？我还以为这里在地下呢。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我喜欢沙滩，可我讨厌大海。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“这潮水涨落得真快。这肯定不正常！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“至少附近没有鸭子。我讨厌鸭子。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我全身都湿透了。我讨厌湿漉漉的！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“那些海妖看着一点也不真实。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我在找美杜莎小姐。你见过她吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“这些人说的话，我有一半都听不懂。简直像在说希腊语。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我还以为他们的诗歌很出名呢。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我刚才滑了一跤。真讨厌。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“这些潮水能不能拿定主意？进进出出，进进出出……”\n\n@The_monster@说：“有只海龟咬了我。我讨厌海龟。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“有根触手不知从哪儿冒出来碰了我。我讨厌触手！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:spider donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"There's a spider on your neck!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate crawling things.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Someone should clean these parts. I hate webs.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"My uncle had bigger webs in his attic. I hated that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate getting stuck.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Dancing spiders? With no cane or a top hat?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Something's up my trousers! Aieee!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate venom. I hate getting bitten.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Arachnophobia is no disease, it's common sense.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"There, on the ceiling! And on that wall!\"\n\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“你脖子上有只蜘蛛！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌爬来爬去的东西。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“该有人清理清理这里。我讨厌蛛网。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我叔叔阁楼里的蛛网比这还大。我讨厌那个。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌被黏住。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“跳舞的蜘蛛？连手杖和高礼帽都没有？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“有东西钻进我裤子了！哎呀！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌毒液。我讨厌被咬。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“怕蜘蛛可不是病，是常识。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“那儿，天花板上！那面墙上也有！”\n\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:slime donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Where's all the loot?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I feel like a jelly sandwich, now.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"This place is the Pits.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate the colour green.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I can't smell anything here. I hate that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I can't get this icky slime off my feet.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I keep getting this feeling like someone's watching me. Creepy.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I always freeze up when I think I'm being watched.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Acid blobs make me think of reflux. I hate reflux.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What's up with all this goo? It's like a world of goo. I hate goo.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Someone said I could use acid to solve all my problems. It just made them worse.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hope the rune isn't sticky.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"A rock stubbed itself on my toe. I hate that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What's so magical about quicksilver, anyway?\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“战利品都去哪儿了？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我现在觉得自己像个胶怪三明治。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“这个坑真是烂透了。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌绿色。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我在这里什么也闻不到。真讨厌。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“这恶心的黏液黏在脚上，怎么也弄不掉。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“总觉得有人盯着我。瘆得慌。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“一觉得被人盯着，我就僵住了。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“酸液团让我想起胃酸反流。我讨厌胃酸反流。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“怎么到处都是黏糊糊的？简直是个黏糊世界。我讨厌黏糊糊。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“有人说酸能解决我的一切问题，结果只是越弄越糟。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“希望符文别黏糊糊的。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“有块石头在我的脚趾上撞了一下。真讨厌。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“水银到底有什么魔法？”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:snake donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You know that hissing noise? I hate that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You know that slithering noise? I hate that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I'd like to make these snakes into gloves, but I hate gloves.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"This place is the Pits.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What do naga need barding for?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What's a barding, anyway? Does it sing for its supper?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Robes are for wimps. Real warriors wear heavy armour!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Nagas are pretty ugly. I hate nagas.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Did all the warriors here go to shield school or something?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"So, why is that serpent talking?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What sort of name is 'naga' anyway? They're not even good at nagging.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"At least there aren't any garudas. I hate garudas.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You'd think there'd be more pits. I haven't seen any.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I'm sick of this place. Or maybe that's poison...\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate mutated serpents.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"So, nagas are stealthy? Don't make me laugh.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I wish they'd hurry up and stop blocking the corridors.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Man, snails must be faster than these guys.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"How does a snake shoot lightning, anyway?\"\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@ says, \"First nagas, now salamanders. What's next, crocodiles with mirrors on their heads?\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“那种嘶嘶声，你知道吧？我讨厌那个。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“那种爬行时窸窸窣窣的声音，你知道吧？我讨厌那个。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我倒想把这些蛇做成手套，可我又讨厌手套。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“这个坑真是烂透了。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“娜迦要身甲干什么？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“身甲到底是什么？难道还能当吟游诗人唱歌讨饭？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“长袍是懦夫穿的。真正的勇士就该穿重甲！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“娜迦真丑。我讨厌娜迦。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“这里的勇士都上过什么盾牌学校吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“那么，那条蛇为什么会说话？”\n\n@The_monster@说：““娜迦”算什么名字？连唠叨都不擅长。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“至少没有迦楼罗。我讨厌迦楼罗。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“按理说这里该有更多坑才对。我一个也没见着。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我烦透这里了。又或者是中毒了……”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌变异的蛇。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“所以，娜迦擅长潜行？别逗我笑了。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“他们能不能走快点，别堵着走廊？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“天哪，蜗牛都比这些家伙快吧。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“蛇到底是怎么射出闪电的？”\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@说：“先是娜迦，现在又是沙罗曼蛇。接下来呢，头顶镜子的鳄鱼？”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:vaults donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"The Vaults? They should've called it the Dumps.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Don't bother, there's only junk at the bottom.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I asked the warden where the rune was. She slammed the door in my face.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I don't remember getting an invitation to a convocation.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Who designed this place? It's just a bunch of weird little rooms stuck together.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"This is an awful lot of space just to hold some junk.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I saw some yaktaurs earlier, but I bolted.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I saw a dragon earlier, but I didn't get too close - it seemed pretty mercurial.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Why are there poltergeists guarding this place, but not the Crypt?\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“宝库？不如叫垃圾库。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“别费事了，最底下只有垃圾。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我问守卫符文在哪儿，她却当着我的面摔上了门。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我可不记得受邀参加什么集会。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“谁设计的这里？就是一堆古怪小房间拼在一起。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“就为了放点垃圾，居然占这么大地方。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我刚才见到几头半人牛，赶紧撒腿就跑。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我刚才见到一条龙，不过没敢靠近——看着挺喜怒无常，像水银一样。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“怎么是骚灵在守这里，却不是守墓室？”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:crypt donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Zombies are pretty boring.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Man, I can't wait until I find the rune.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"They must've been making zombies for centuries to fill this place.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"My neck hurts.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Is it cursed, or does it curse? I can never tell.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Curse skulls, curse toes... What next?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"This isn't even all that spooky.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"This place is pretty cryptic.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Skeletons give me the creeps.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate skeletons.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate draugr.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate zombies.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate vampires.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"That ghoul gave me heartburn.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What sort of name is 'necrophage', anyway?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Where are all the doors?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You know, I thought there'd be more coffins in a crypt...\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Have you seen a sarcophagus full of treasure around? Me neither.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I just hope the loot isn't guarded by liches. I hate liches.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"That mummy wasn't so great.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"This place has the same junk as everywhere else. I hate that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Why is it so quiet?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"So much for the uneasy undead.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"They don't shamble much, do they? I hate that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"They don't even play music.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Some mausoleum.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I saw a sphinx earlier. I hate that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"The Crypt, the Tomb, what's next? The Coffin?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"All these vampires have me hopping mad!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate revenants, but I forget why! And I hate that, too!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I got a splinter from a draugr. I hate that.\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“丧尸真无聊。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“天哪，真想快点找到符文。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“想塞满这里，恐怕得造上几百年丧尸。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我的脖子疼。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“到底是被诅咒的，还是会诅咒人的？我总分不清。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“诅咒头骨，诅咒脚趾……接下来呢？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“这也没多吓人嘛。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“这墓室倒真够莫名其妙的。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“骷髅让我浑身发毛。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌骷髅。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌尸鬼。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌丧尸。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌吸血鬼。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“那个食尸鬼让我烧心。”\n\n@The_monster@说：““食腐尸”到底算什么名字？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“门都去哪儿了？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我还以为墓室里会有更多棺材……”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你见过装满财宝的石棺吗？我也没有。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“只希望战利品别由巫妖看守。我讨厌巫妖。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“那个木乃伊也没多了不起。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“这里的垃圾跟别处都一样。真讨厌。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“怎么这么安静？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“还说什么不得安宁的亡灵呢。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“他们也不怎么蹒跚嘛？真讨厌。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“他们连音乐都不放。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“还算什么陵墓。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我刚才见到一只斯芬克斯。真讨厌。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“墓室、灵庙，下一个是什么？棺材？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“这些吸血鬼快把我气得跳脚了！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌还魂者，可我忘了为什么！这也很讨厌！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我被尸鬼身上的一根碎刺扎了。真讨厌。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:abyss donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"But I don't want to have to go deeper!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What does 'eldritch' mean, anyway?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I keep hearing this weird shrieking in my head. I hate that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I've never heard of a star cursing anything.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I've never heard of a star spawning anything.\"\n\n@The_monster@ throws up @possessive@ hands and says, \"Alright, I admit it, I'm lost!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate wrenching sensations.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What's so abyssal about tentacles and stars?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Screaming refractions? What's next, yodelling boulders?\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“可我不想再往深处走了！”\n\n@The_monster@说：““诡异”到底是什么意思？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我脑子里总响着怪异的尖叫声。真讨厌。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我从没听说过星星还会诅咒谁。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我从没听说过星星还能生出什么。”\n\n@The_monster@举起@possessive@双手，说：“好吧，我承认，我迷路了！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌被猛地扭拽的感觉。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“触手和星星到底哪里深渊了？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“尖啸折光体？下一个呢，会唱约德尔的巨石？”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:zot donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I saw a draconian who kept changing colours. Some people are so indecisive.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"How come everyone is wearing a cloak down here?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I offered a draconian some spare armour, but he said it didn't fit.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I keep feeling something staring at me. Is it you?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"How do you make a golem out of electricity?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What's an 'Orb Guardian', anyway?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Orbs of fire, orbs of destruction, the Orb of Zot... what's with all the orbs?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate orbs.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate clowns.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate draconians.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate purple.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Are they setting up a circus down here?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"This place probably doesn't see many tourists.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Oh, so that's what those runes are for!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Why do the walls change colour every floor? Did they keep running out of paint?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What's stopping the guards from just stealing the Orb themselves?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hope I don't run into any orbs of ice down here!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Did you bring your rings of ice?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"The Orb of Power is here? Where are the others, then?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I saw some tasty-looking maize earlier, but it tried to eat me. I hate that.\"\n\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“我见到一个不停变颜色的龙人。有些人真是优柔寡断。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“这里的人怎么都穿披风？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我想送一个龙人一件备用防具，可他说不合身。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“总感觉有什么盯着我。是你吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“怎么用电做出魔像？”\n\n@The_monster@说：““宝珠守卫”到底是什么？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“火焰之球、毁灭之球、佐特宝珠……怎么全是球？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌宝珠。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌小丑。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌龙人。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌紫色。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“他们要在这下面开马戏团吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“这里大概没几个游客。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“哦，原来那些符文是干这个的！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“为什么每层墙的颜色都不一样？他们老是用完一种颜料吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“到底是什么让守卫不干脆自己偷走宝珠？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“希望别在这下面碰见什么冰霜之球！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你带寒冰戒指了吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“力量宝珠就在这里？那其他宝珠在哪儿？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我刚才看见几株看着挺好吃的玉米，结果它们想吃我。真讨厌。”\n\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:orb donald"
msgid "w:25\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Thanks for carrying the Orb of Power for me.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Isn't that thing heavy? I could take a turn.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Aren't you worried about radiation? You should put that down.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What are you going to do with that Orb?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Don't you think the Orb of Power was down there for a reason?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I heard that the world ends if you bring it to the surface.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Someone is going to come looking for that Orb.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Are you sure that's the real Orb, and not some cheap imitation?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You have the Orb. Was it worth it?\"\n\n"
msgstr "w:25\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“多谢你替我搬着力量宝珠。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“那东西不重吗？我可以换你搬一会儿。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你不怕辐射吗？还是把它放下吧。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你打算拿那颗宝珠干什么？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“力量宝珠被放在地下，难道不是有原因的吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我听说，把它带到地表，世界就会毁灭。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“会有人来找这颗宝珠的。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你确定这是真宝珠，不是什么廉价仿品？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你拿到宝珠了。值得吗？”\n\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:zin donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"So much for spreading the word; you get punched in the face instead.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"This pamphlet doesn't say what the point to Recitation is.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I wanna be an adventurer, not a preacher!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What does Zin need our gold for, anyway?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Something seems a little bit odd about a God who wants to be paid.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I've got two hundred gold pieces. Is that enough to cure these mutations?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Didn't you like your horns?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"If I give you twenty gold pieces, can you get rid of this nasty case of scales I've got?\"\n\n@The_monster@ covers @possessive@ ears. \"Shut up!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Wouldn't you get more for your money with Gozag?\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“还说什么传播教义，结果挨了一拳。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“这小册子没说诵经到底有什么用。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我想当冒险者，不想当传教士！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“辛到底要我们的金币干什么？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“一个要收钱的神，总让人觉得哪里不对劲。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我有两百枚金币。够治好这些变异吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你不喜欢自己的犄角吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“给你二十枚金币，能帮我把这身讨厌的鳞片弄掉吗？”\n\n@The_monster@捂住@possessive@耳朵。“闭嘴！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“把钱给哥萨戈，不是更划算吗？”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:the shining one donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What's the point of being chivalric if nobody's going to be chivalric back?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I open the door for a goblin; he punches me in the face. I hate chivalry.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Hah! I saw you coming a mile away.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You stick out like a sore thumb. Or at least, a shining one.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Won't need this ring of positive energy, then, will I?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Can you turn the glow down a bit? I can't see you to hit you.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Cleansing flame? What's it supposed to be cleansing? The floor?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate haloes.\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“没人肯以骑士之礼相待，自己讲骑士精神有什么用？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我替一个地精开门，他却给我一拳。我讨厌骑士精神。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“哈！隔着一里地我就看见你过来了。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你也太显眼了，简直像根扎眼的大拇指。还是根发光的。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“那这枚正能量戒指，我也用不着了吧？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“能不能把光调暗点？我都看不清你，怎么打？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“净化之焰？到底净化什么？地面吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌光环。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:kikubaaqudgha donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Kikubaa-what? How do you even say that?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Sorry, didn't catch that. You worship who? How do you spell it?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Can you spell it for me - slowly?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"How do you pronounce that?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate zombies.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Yuck, you smell of miasma!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate wretches.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"How deep do you have to dig to get a never-ending supply of wretches?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You must really love pain. I hate it.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Do you just use necromancy for everything, then?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Why a 'Demon-God'? Wouldn't a 'Zombie-God' be more appropriate?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate ruin.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate despair.\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“奇库巴……什么？这到底怎么念？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“抱歉，没听清。你信奉谁？那名字怎么拼？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你能给我拼一遍吗——慢点？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“那名字怎么发音？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌丧尸。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“呕，你一身瘴气味！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌苦役。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“究竟得挖多深，才能有源源不绝的苦役？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你一定特别喜欢痛苦。我讨厌痛苦。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“所以，你什么事都用死灵系魔法来办？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“为什么叫“恶魔之神”？叫“丧尸之神”不是更合适吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌毁灭。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌绝望。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:friendly yredelemnul donald"
msgid "@_yredelemnul_Donald_@\n\n__NEXT\n"
msgstr "@_yredelemnul_Donald_@\n\n__NEXT\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:yredelemnul donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@_yredelemnul_Donald_@\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@_yredelemnul_Donald_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_yredelemnul_donald_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"How does a bone dragon fly, anyway?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"How do you flay a ghost, anyway?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Pah! You're not even a real necromancer.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Did you drop out of Necromancy School?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Ah. You're responsible for all those zombies.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate zombies.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Zombies? Spectres? Don't you get bored without any real company?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Angels painted black are so last century.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"If you wanted the light to be dimmer, you could have said so.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What kind of torch can only be lit once per level?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"How does that torch stay lit when you throw its fire all over?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate being shackled.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“骨龙到底怎么飞起来的？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“鬼魂到底怎么剥皮？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“呸！你根本不算真正的死灵法师。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你是从死灵魔法学校退学的吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“啊，原来那些丧尸全是你弄出来的。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌丧尸。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“丧尸？幽魂？没有真正的伙伴，你不觉得无聊吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“把天使漆成黑色？那是上个世纪的时尚了。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“想把灯光弄暗点，你早说不就好了。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“什么火炬每层只能点一次？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你把火扔得到处都是，那火炬怎么还燃着？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌被枷锁束缚。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:okawaru donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Okawaru always makes me think of chokos.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Oh, hey! I could use a new shield. Have you got any spares?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Nice kit.\"\n\n@The_monster@ asks, \"How many innocent creatures did you kill for those shoes?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Okawaru's gifts are murder.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You can only wear one cloak at a time, you know?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Do you think you're a hero? I hate that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"How much finesse does it take to swing your arms real fast, anyway?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I could take you in a fair duel. No cheating!\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“奥格瓦如总让我想起佛手瓜。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“哦，嘿！我正缺一面新盾牌。你有多余的吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“装备不错。”\n\n@The_monster@问：“为了那双鞋，你杀了多少无辜生灵？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“奥格瓦如的礼物可真要命。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你知道吧，一次只能穿一件披风。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你觉得自己是英雄？真讨厌。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“把胳膊抡快一点，到底需要多精湛的技艺？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“公平决斗的话，我能打败你。不许耍赖！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:makhleb donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"At least you've got demons for company.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Are you sure that summoning demons is a good idea?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Hey, watch where you throw those bolts!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What will you do after everything's destroyed?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate demons.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate blood.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate suffering.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate branding.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate pacts.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate the Hells.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I just stubbed my toe. Does that mean I'm cleansed?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"If I carve 'Go Away' into myself, will Makhleb do that?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What's the Crucible of Flesh? Some kind of fancy barbecue place?\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“至少你还有恶魔作伴。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你确定召唤恶魔是个好主意？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“嘿，扔那些能量束时看着点！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“一切都毁灭之后，你打算做什么？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌恶魔。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌血。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌苦难。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌烙印。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌契约。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌诸地狱。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我刚踢到脚趾了。这算被净化了吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“要是我往自己身上刻个“滚开”，马科列布会照做吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“血肉熔炉是什么？高档烧烤店吗？”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:sif muna donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Don't you wish for a portable bookcase?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Imagine how many trees were cut down to fuel your hobby.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Man, that must be some big library.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Found the spell you wanted yet?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"If you wanted to read so much, why didn't you become a librarian?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Did you remember that thing that you forgot? I hate that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"It's like an all you can read... something.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate books.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Surely there's a limit to the number of books you can carry. Right?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"It's good how you can learn magic as if by magic.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate spells.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Don't you just hate miscasts?\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“你不想要个随身书柜吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“想想为了你这爱好，砍掉了多少树。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“天哪，那图书馆一定大得很。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“找到你想要的法术了吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“这么喜欢读书，为什么不去当图书管理员？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你想起刚才忘了什么吗？我讨厌那种感觉。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“就像个随便读到饱的……什么东西。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌书。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“能带的书总该有个上限吧。对不对？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“学魔法竟能像变魔法一样，真不错。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌法术。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你不觉得施法失误很讨厌吗？”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:trog donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"So, are you allowed to read books?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You troglodyte!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I heard Trog has abandonment issues.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I bet Trog's next axe will take you to the Abyss.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I considered Trog, but the aftereffects of berserk scare me.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I bet you wish you could cast spells now, right?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Are you sure you're allowed to read scrolls?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Hey, I thought wands weren't allowed!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"If I tell you I hate magic, will you worship me?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate ogres.\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“那么，你还准读书吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你这穴居蛮人！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我听说特洛戈特别怕被抛弃。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我打赌，特洛戈下一把斧头会把你送进深渊。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我考虑过特洛戈，可狂暴后的副作用太吓人。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我打赌，你现在很想能施法，对吧？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你确定还准读卷轴？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“嘿，我还以为魔杖也不准用！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“要是我说自己讨厌魔法，你会信奉我吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌食人魔。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:nemelex xobeh donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What's all in the cards? Your future?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I bet you're feeling stupid now, huh?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"If I draw a card, can you tell me which one it is?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Where do you keep all those decks?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I'm sure I saw a card fall out of that deck.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I've seen this trick before. You've got the ace up your sleeve, right?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You need to come to terms with your gambling problem.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"How about a game of 52 card pickup?\"\n\n@The_monster@ laughs, \"An explosive gambit... I hate that.\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“到底什么都在牌里？你的未来吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我打赌，你现在觉得自己挺傻的，对吧？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“要是我抽张牌，你能猜出是哪张吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“那么多套牌，你全放哪儿了？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我肯定看见那副牌里掉出了一张。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“这把戏我见过。你袖子里藏着王牌，对吧？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你该正视自己的赌博问题。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“玩一局“把五十二张牌捡起来”怎么样？”\n\n@The_monster@笑道：“爆炸性的妙计……真讨厌。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:elyvilon donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Whatever happened to, 'First, do no harm'?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Doesn't healing your enemies sound rather pointless?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Maybe you should start praying.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"If I give you my weapon, will you leave me alone?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Come on. Make me an offer of peace that I can't refuse!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"For every monster you don't kill, I'll kill three.\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：““首先，不伤害他人”这话哪儿去了？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“给敌人治疗，听着不是很没意义吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“也许你该开始祈祷了。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“把武器给你，你就肯放过我吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“来吧，提个让我无法拒绝的和平条件！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你每放过一个怪物，我就杀三个。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:lugonu donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Why would you want to visit the Abyss? For a holiday?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Nothing ever attacks me when I'm in the Abyss.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Are you going to banish me, too?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"The world's bad enough without you corrupting it.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You must really love eldritch horrors. I hate them.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"How can a god be banished to the Abyss?\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“你为什么想去深渊？度假吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我在深渊时，从来没有东西攻击我。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你也要把我放逐吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“这世界本来就够糟了，用不着你再腐化。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你一定特别喜欢那些诡异恐怖的东西。我讨厌它们。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“神怎么还会被放逐到深渊？”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:beogh donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Beogh must be pretty vain, having all those worshippers get remade in Beogh's image.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"One of the priests looked like she was going to ask me to join... I guess she changed her mind.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You think walking on water is cool? I can swim.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Isn't it annoying when people just start challenging you, and you can't get away from them?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I'd get sick of only having three followers at most.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"How do you find enough ash and charcoal to anoint them all?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You'll need more than orcs to take me on.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Do you like preaching on mountaintops?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What is divine providence, anyway? I hate that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You'd better watch out. The one on the left looks like he gets lost easily.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You think you're the Messiah? I met another orc who thought that, too.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Messiah? I hate messiahs.\"\n\n@The_monster@ bows and submits to you. \"Nah, just kidding.\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“比欧弗一定很虚荣，非要把那么多信徒都重塑成自己的模样。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“有个祭司看着像想拉我入教……我猜她改主意了。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你觉得水上行走很酷？我会游泳。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“人家莫名其妙就开始挑战你，想甩也甩不掉，不烦吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“最多只能有三个追随者，换我早就烦了。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你上哪儿找那么多灰和木炭，给他们全涂一遍？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“光靠兽人，可对付不了我。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你喜欢站在山顶布道吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“神意到底是什么？真讨厌。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你最好当心点，左边那个看着很容易迷路。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你觉得自己是救世主？我还见过另一个兽人，也这么想。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“救世主？我讨厌救世主。”\n\n@The_monster@向你鞠躬臣服。“才怪，开个玩笑。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:ignis donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Don't fight so hard! You'll just burn out.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Huh, so Ignis will die when you do... how's that make you feel?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You'd think a god of fire would be a bit brighter.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Feel like your fire's burning out? I hate that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You know a god's a real winner when you're their only follower, right?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Oh, I wondered where that burning smell was coming from.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Why not join one of those new, up-and-coming flame gods instead?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Doesn't it hurt to go crashing headfirst through the ceiling?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Wow, you can rise to a higher floor... isn't that called 'climbing stairs'?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Wow, fire everywhere! I hate that.\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“别拼得那么猛！小心把自己烧干了。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“哦，所以你死了，伊格尼斯也会死……你什么感想？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“火神按理说该更明亮些，也该更聪明些吧。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“感觉自己的火快烧尽了吗？真讨厌。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你是某位神唯一的信徒，这可真说明他是个大赢家，对吧？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“哦，我刚还在想那股焦味从哪儿来的。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“干吗不去信个新兴的、有前途的火神？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“一头撞破天花板往上冲，不疼吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“哇，你能升到上一层……那不就叫“爬楼梯”吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“哇，到处都是火！真讨厌。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:jiyva donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Come slime with me!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You look a bit slimy.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Ah. That explains where all the items went.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Are you going to open a jelly farm when you find the Orb?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate it when jellies take over a level.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Your jellies ate my lunch. I hate that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate slime.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You must hate doors a lot.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"If I pretend to be a jelly, can I have your stuff?\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“来和我一起黏糊糊吧！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你看着有点黏。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“啊，原来所有物品都这么没的。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“找到宝珠后，你打算开胶怪养殖场吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌胶怪占领整层楼。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你的胶怪吃了我的午饭。真讨厌。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌黏液。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你一定很讨厌门。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“要是我假装自己是胶怪，能拿你的东西吗？”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:fedhas donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What's with all that fungus?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate [trees|plants|fungi].\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Do you like gardening? I hate gardening.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"So, how do you deal with the weeds?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"A plant spat acid at me. I hate that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Better hope you don't develop allergies.\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“怎么这么多真菌？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌[树|植物|真菌]。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你喜欢园艺吗？我讨厌园艺。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“那么，杂草怎么处理？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“有株植物朝我吐酸。真讨厌。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“最好祈祷自己不会过敏。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:cheibriados donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Slow down!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You're not very quick on the uptake, are you?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You know, if you want, I know a very good posture trainer.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Am I talking too fast for you?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Look at me! I'm running, I'm running!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Quick, run away!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"How about we settle this with a race?\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“慢点！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你反应不太快，对吧？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你要是愿意，我认识一位很不错的体态教练。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“对你来说，我说话太快了吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“看我！我在跑，我在跑！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“快，逃跑啊！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“不如赛跑决定胜负？”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:xom donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Xom? Are you insane?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I don't get Xom.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate Xom.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate maniacal laughter.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate divine lightning.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"If it's mutations you're wanting, wouldn't Jiyva be a better deal?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hope you love dancing weapons. I hate them.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Been surrounded by packs of demons recently? I hate that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Xom just doesn't make any sense. I hate that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What kind of name is 'Xom', anyway?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What is a 'random number god' anyway?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I had a teddy bear once. I hated it.\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“佐姆？你疯了吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我搞不懂佐姆。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌佐姆。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌疯狂的大笑。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌神圣闪电。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“要是想变异，吉瓦不是更划算吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“希望你喜欢舞动武器。我可讨厌它们。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“最近被成群恶魔包围过吗？真讨厌。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“佐姆完全不讲道理。真讨厌。”\n\n@The_monster@说：““佐姆”到底算什么名字？”\n\n@The_monster@说：““随机数之神”到底是什么？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我以前也有只玩具熊。我讨厌它。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:vehumet donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What kind of god gives you spells but not spellbooks?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Let it end in hellfire? Why is there only one hellfire spell?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate Vehumet.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate hellfire.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What's the point of conjuring, anyway?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Do you find it easier to cast spells, now?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate explosions.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You're supposed to blow everything up for a god who barely gives you powers?\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“什么神只给法术，不给法术书？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“让一切在地狱之火中终结？可怎么只有一个地狱之火法术？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌维胡梅特。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌地狱之火。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“塑能到底有什么意义？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你现在施法更轻松了吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌爆炸。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“为了一个几乎不给你神力的神，你却得把一切炸上天？”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:ashenzari donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You seem like a real know-it-all. I hate that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What's the point of being all-knowing if you can't do anything?\"\n\n@The_monster@ makes a face at you and exclaims, \"Curses!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I got nailed to the sky once. No big deal, really.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate voyeurs.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What does a god have to do to get cursed, anyway?\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“你看着真像个万事通。真讨厌。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“什么也做不了的话，全知有什么用？”\n\n@The_monster@朝你做了个鬼脸，叫道：“诅咒啊！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我有一次也被钉在天上过。真没什么大不了。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌偷窥狂。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“神到底要做什么才会被诅咒？”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:dithmenos donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Sounds like you're dealing with a pretty shady god there.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I'll bet you have a pretty dark future.\"\n\n@The_monster@ squints around. \"I can't see a thing. I hate that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate shadows.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate starless nights.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Are you still afraid of the dark?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Careful; you might trip over your own shadow.\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“听起来，你信的神挺阴暗，也挺可疑的。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我打赌，你的未来一定很黑暗。”\n\n@The_monster@眯眼环顾四周。“什么也看不见。真讨厌。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌阴影。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌无星的夜晚。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你还怕黑吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“小心，别被自己的影子绊倒。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:gozag donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Spare some coin?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate the rich.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I bet you have to pay people to get friends.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Couldn't find enough potions?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"So the shops here weren't enough for you?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I saw some gold over there. Quick, better go get it!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What do potions have to do with a god of gold, anyway?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"If you give me all your gold, I promise I'll be your friend too.\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“能分点钱吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌有钱人。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我打赌，你得花钱才能交到朋友。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“找不到足够的药水？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“所以，这里的商店还不够你逛？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我看见那边有些金币。快，赶紧去拿！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“药水跟金币之神到底有什么关系？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“把你的金币全给我，我保证也当你的朋友。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:qazlal donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"How do you sleep at night with all those storm clouds?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Must be pretty hard to see through all that dust.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate storms.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate disasters.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate elementals.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What was that? Sorry, I couldn't hear you over all this noise.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Well, at least you're never short of company.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Great. Now my shield is all dirty.\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“顶着那么多风暴云，你晚上怎么睡觉？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“那么多尘土，想看清东西一定挺难吧。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌风暴。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌灾难。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌元素生物。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你说什么？抱歉，太吵了，我听不清。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“好吧，至少你从不缺同伴。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“真好，现在我的盾牌全脏了。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:ru donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Missing something?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate sacrifices.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate sacrificants.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Once, I gave up eating meat for a week. I hated that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Once, I gave up drinking for a week. I hated that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate hidden layers of reality.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate existential doubt.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"The great annihilating truth is that I hate you.\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“少了点什么？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌献祭。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌献祭的人。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“有一次，我戒了一星期肉。我讨厌那个。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“有一次，我戒了一星期酒。我讨厌那个。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌现实背后的隐藏层次。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌对存在本身的怀疑。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“毁灭一切的伟大真理就是：我讨厌你。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:pakellas donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate inventors.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What are you with all those gadgets, some kind of pawn shop?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What would you do with the Orb, anyway? Experiment on it?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Bet you can't [analyse|invent] your way out of this one.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Can I borrow that [wand|lamp|fan] for a second? You must have some to spare.\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌发明家。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“带着那么多小玩意儿，你是开什么当铺的吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你到底打算拿宝珠干什么？做实验？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我打赌，这次你靠[分析|发明]也脱不了身。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“那件[魔杖|灯|扇子]能借我用一下吗？你肯定有多余的。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:hepliaklqana donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I went to a family reunion once. I hated it.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Who would want to remember their ancestors? They're dead.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"If your ancestor was so tough and powerful, how come they're dead?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Would you happen to remember where the Orb is?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Ghost stories? Ooh, I'm so scared!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Isn't it convenient that your ancestor always knows how to fight?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I forgot what I was going to say. I hate that.\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“我去过一次家族聚会。我讨厌那个。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“谁会想记住先祖？他们都死了。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你的先祖要是那么厉害、那么强大，怎么还死了？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你会不会刚好记得宝珠在哪儿？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“鬼故事？哦，我好害怕啊！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你的先祖总是会打架，这可真方便，对吧？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我忘了刚才要说什么。真讨厌。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:uskayaw donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Dance? No thanks, I don't dance.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate drums.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate chants.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Poetry of the foot? All you're doing is stomping around.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You look ridiculous with all that flailing around.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"That's not dancing; that's just a fancy way of killing things.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What kind of dance blows up spectators?\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“跳舞？谢了，我不跳舞。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌鼓。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌吟唱。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“足下的诗歌？你就是在到处跺脚。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你那样乱挥乱舞，看着真可笑。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“那不是跳舞，只是花样杀戮。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“什么舞还能把观众炸飞？”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:wu jian donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Path? I don't see a path anywhere.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You're jumping off the walls? I hate that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Watching you spin around is making me dizzy. I hate that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Why not just HIT them without all this spinning and flipping nonsense?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Don't you get tired of all these old geezers telling you what to do?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"No way as a way? Sounds like nonsense.\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“道？我怎么哪儿都看不见路？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你蹬着墙跳来跳去？真讨厌。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“看你转来转去，我都头晕了。真讨厌。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“何必又转又翻，搞那么多花样？直接打不行吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“那群老家伙不停指使你干这干那，你不烦吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“以无法为有法？听着就是胡说八道。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:no god donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Don't you get lonely without a god?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate the gods.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate atheists.\"\n\nw:5\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate the gods, and the gods hate me.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You must run out of gods to curse by.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Did you miss the Ecumenical Temple?\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@说：“没有神，你不觉得孤单吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌众神。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌无神论者。”\n\nw:5\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌众神，众神也讨厌我。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你拿来赌咒发誓的神，总有用完的时候吧。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你错过众神殿了吗？”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_generic_donald_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"You're really ugly. Did you know that?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"This is such a pointless quest.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"They wouldn't let me join their adventuring club without the Orb.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate this place.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hate you, too.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"My feet hurt.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"My hands hurt, too.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I think I'm starting to get a cough. I hate that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I've got a headache. I hate that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"That colour you're wearing? I hate that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Like I always say, the jar is half empty.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"And you think you've got it bad...\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I wonder if there's an end to this place.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Is it turtles all the way down?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"The people that built this place? They must be crazy.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"The air in here stinks. I hate that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I bet the Orb isn't even all that great.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"So, what is this Orb thing, anyway?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hope I haven't come all this way for a glorified paperweight.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I don't get what's so special about the number twenty-seven.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"The other people here are really rude.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Maybe I'll visit Hell next.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"The Vaults look kind of boring.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I can never work out what any of these scrolls mean.\"\n\n@The_monster@ sighs.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ winces.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ makes a rude gesture at you.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ shakes @possessive@ head.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What lunatic would build a room out of doors?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Why would someone put a sword in a little box?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I think I hate rivers, but I can't remember why.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"That guy with the scythe is really mean.\"\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@ says, \"What kind of a name is Fauntleroy?\"\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@ says, \"What's the big idea?!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“你真丑，你知道吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“这场追寻真是毫无意义。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“没有宝珠，他们就不让我加入冒险者俱乐部。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我讨厌这个地方。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我也讨厌你。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我的脚疼。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我的手也疼。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我好像开始咳嗽了。真讨厌。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我头疼。真讨厌。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你穿的那种颜色？我讨厌那个。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“就像我常说的，罐子是半空的。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“你还觉得自己够惨了……”\n\n@The_monster@说：“这地方到底有没有尽头？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“难道下面一直都是乌龟？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“建这里的那些人？他们一定疯了。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“这里的空气真臭。真讨厌。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我打赌，宝珠也没多了不起。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“所以，宝珠到底是什么东西？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“但愿我大老远跑来，不是为了个吹得天花乱坠的镇纸。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我就不懂，二十七这个数字有什么特别。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“这里的其他人真没礼貌。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“也许接下来我会去地狱看看。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“宝库看着有点无聊。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“这些卷轴到底什么意思，我从来搞不懂。”\n\n@The_monster@叹了口气。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@痛苦地皱了皱脸。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@朝你做了个粗鲁的手势。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@摇着@possessive@头。\n\n@The_monster@说：“什么疯子会拿门来造房间？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“谁会把一把剑放进小盒子里？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“我想我讨厌河流，可记不起为什么。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“那个拿镰刀的家伙真刻薄。”\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@说：““方特勒罗伊”算什么名字？”\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@说：“这到底什么意思？！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:friendly donald"
msgid "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@ sings, \"Roses are red / violets are blue / I hate many things / But most of all you!\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_generic_Donald_@\n\n@The_monster@唱道：“玫瑰红／堇花蓝／万般皆可厌／最恨还是你！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:default hostile confused donald"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"I suppose everything's okay, then?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Actually, I like you.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Oh boy, oh boy, oh boy!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Aw, phooey!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"But I've got a wife! And kids! Have I?\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams.\n\n@The_monster@ makes quacking noises.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"My legs! My legs! What happened to my legs?\"\n\n@The_monster@ sings badly, off-key.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ does a happy little dance.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ sticks a finger up @possessive@ nose.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ tugs at @possessive@ hair.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ twirls gently on the spot.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“那么，我想一切都还好？”\n\n@The_monster@说：“其实，我挺喜欢你。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“哦天哪，哦天哪，哦天哪！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“啊，呸！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“可我还有老婆！还有孩子！我有吗？”\n\n@The_monster@尖叫起来。\n\n@The_monster@发出鸭子般的嘎嘎声。\n\n@The_monster@说：“我的腿！我的腿！我的腿怎么了？”\n\n@The_monster@五音不全地唱着走调的歌。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@开心地跳了一小段舞。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@把手指伸进@possessive@鼻孔。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@扯着@possessive@头发。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@轻轻地原地打转。\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:donald marionette"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Don't use me like a cheap sock puppet. I hate that.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“别把我当廉价的袜子木偶使唤。真讨厌。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:donald riddle"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Everybody knows that one already. Try something more original.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“那个谁不知道。来点有新意的。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:donald killed"
msgid "w:100\n__NONE\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@ says, \"I'm dying. I hate that.\"\n"
msgstr "w:100\n__NONE\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@说：“我快死了。真讨厌。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:donald banished"
msgid "w:100\n__NONE\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@ says, \"Banished to the Abyss. I hate that.\"\n"
msgstr "w:100\n__NONE\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@说：“被放逐到深渊。真讨厌。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-20; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:donald triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"I won. I... don't hate that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Well, maybe you weren't so bad after all.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说：“我赢了。我……倒不讨厌这个。”\n\n@The_monster@说：“好吧，也许你其实没那么糟。”\n"


#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:twin_died dowan"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ shakes with grief.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Magic will overcome all!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Her death will not be in vain!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"How can I live without her?\"\n\n@The_monster@ breathes, \"And she was my only...\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@悲痛得浑身颤抖。\n\n@The_monster@说道：“魔法终将战胜一切！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“她不会白白死去！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“没有她，我怎么活下去？”\n\n@The_monster@轻声说道：“而她是我唯一的……”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:twin_banished dowan"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ shakes with grief.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I will find her! I will get her back!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"She won't be lost forever!\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@悲痛得浑身颤抖。\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我会找到她！我会把她带回来！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“她不会永远迷失在那里！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:twin_slimified dowan"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ shakes with grief.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I will find a way to undo this!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Turn her back! At once!\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@悲痛得浑身颤抖。\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我会想办法恢复她的！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“把她变回来！马上！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:dowan"
msgid "@_Dowan_common_@\n\nw:2\n@_Dowan_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Dowan_common_@\n\nw:2\n@_Dowan_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:fleeing dowan"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ cries in horror.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@惊恐地哭喊起来。\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_dowan_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ smirks and points a slender finger @at_foe@.\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"My weaknesses are her strengths!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Stay away from my face!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Magic and the sword, together, will defeat you.\" @player_only@\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@得意地笑着，伸出纤细的手指指向@at_foe@。\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“我的弱点正是她的强项！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“离我的脸远点！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“魔法与剑术联手，定能打败你。”@player_only@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_dowan_rare_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ throws and catches a handful of magical flame, then smirks.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ robes are whipped around by a magical breeze.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ feet meld with the ground, briefly.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ generates a fountain of clear water, and laughs cruelly.\n\n@The_monster@ whispers @to_foe@, \"It won't be long now.\"\n\n@The_monster@ hisses @to_foe@, \"Insulting my beauty only makes me fight harder!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Where the sword fails, magic succeeds!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"There's a certain beauty in death, don't you think?\"\n\n@The_monster@ laughs at you. \"Don't get delusional, you can't win!\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@将一团魔法火焰抛起又接住，随即得意地笑了。\n\nVISUAL:一阵魔法微风吹得@The_monster_possessive@长袍翻飞。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@双脚短暂地融入地面。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@变出一道清水喷泉，残忍地笑起来。\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@低语道：“用不了多久了。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@嘶声道：“侮辱我的美貌只会让我越战越勇！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“剑术办不到的，魔法能办到！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“死亡也有一种独特的美，你不觉得吗？”\n\n@The_monster@嘲笑着你，说道：“别痴心妄想了，你赢不了！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:dowan_duvessa_dies"
msgid "@The_monster@ screams, \"No! No!\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ seems overcome with grief.\n\n@The_monster@ screams, \"No! Oh no!\"\n\n@The_monster_possessive@ eyes darken. \"You have made a grave mistake.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@尖叫道：“不！不！”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@似乎悲痛欲绝。\n\n@The_monster@尖叫道：“不！哦，不！”\n\n@The_monster_possessive@眼神阴沉下来，说道：“你犯下了大错。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:dowan_duvessa_dies_invisible"
msgid "@The_monster@ screams, \"No! No! NO!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@尖叫道：“不！不！不——！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:dowan_duvessa_dies_distance"
msgid "You hear a distant wail of despair.\n"
msgstr "你听见远处传来绝望的哀号。\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:dowan_duvessa_dies_bytwin"
msgid "@Duvessa_Dowan_dies_bytwin@\n"
msgstr "@Duvessa_Dowan_dies_bytwin@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:dowan_duvessa_dies_invisible_bytwin"
msgid "@Dowan_Duvessa_dies_bytwin@\n"
msgstr "@Dowan_Duvessa_dies_bytwin@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:dowan_duvessa_dies_distance_bytwin"
msgid "@Dowan_Duvessa_dies_distance@\n"
msgstr "@Dowan_Duvessa_dies_distance@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:twin_died duvessa"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ shakes in a combination of rage and grief.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ grits @possessive@ teeth and focuses.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"The sword shall overcome grief!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"His death shall not be in vain!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I will avenge him!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I will journey to Hell to retrieve him!\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ weeps.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@在愤怒与悲痛中颤抖。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@咬紧@possessive@牙关，集中精神。\n\n@The_monster@说道：“剑将斩断悲伤！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“他不会白白死去！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我会为他报仇！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我会去地狱把他带回来！”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@哭泣起来。\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:twin_ikilled duvessa"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ shakes in grief and horror.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What have I done? What have I done?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"How can I live after this?\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@悲痛又惊恐地颤抖着。\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我做了什么？我做了什么？”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“出了这种事，我还怎么活下去？”\n\n@The_monster@尖叫起来。\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:twin_banished duvessa"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ shakes in a combination of rage and grief.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ grits @possessive@ teeth and focuses.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I will get him back!\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@在愤怒与悲痛中颤抖。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@咬紧@possessive@牙关，集中精神。\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我会把他带回来！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:twin_ikilled dowan"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ is wide-eyed with horror.\n\n@The_monster@ screams.\n\n@The_monster@ shakes @possessive@ head, saying, \"No, no, no!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams, \"No! What have I done?\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@惊恐地睁大双眼。\n\n@The_monster@尖叫起来。\n\n@The_monster@摇着@possessive@头，说道：“不，不，不！”\n\n@The_monster@尖叫道：“不！我做了什么？”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:duvessa"
msgid "@_Duvessa_common_@\n\nw:2\n@_Duvessa_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Duvessa_common_@\n\nw:2\n@_Duvessa_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_duvessa_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ gestures with @possessive@ weapon @at_foe@.\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"My weaknesses are his strengths!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Where magic fails, the sword succeeds!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"When magic and the sword combine, nothing stands against them.\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@用@possessive@武器指向@at_foe@。\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“我的弱点正是他的强项！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“魔法办不到的，剑术能办到！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“魔法与剑术联手，便势不可挡。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_duvessa_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ @_shouts_@ @to_foe@, \"You can run, but you cannot escape us forever!\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I don't care about looks, I care about technique!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Did you see that move? Perfect!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Beauty is only skin deep, and my weapons penetrate much further than that.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Practise, practise, practise! One day you'll be as good as me.\" @player_only@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@@_shouts_@道：“你尽管跑，却永远逃不出我们的手掌心！”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“我不在乎长相，我在乎技巧！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“看见那一招了吗？完美！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“美貌不过是一层皮，而我的武器能刺得深得多。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“练习，练习，再练习！总有一天你会和我一样厉害。”@player_only@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:duvessa_dowan_dies"
msgid "@The_monster@ screams in rage.\n\n@The_monster@ screams, \"No! How DARE you!\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ weeps, and shakes @possessive@ weapon @at_foe@.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@愤怒地尖叫起来。\n\n@The_monster@尖叫道：“不！你好大的胆子！”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@一边哭泣，一边朝@at_foe@挥舞@possessive@武器。\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:duvessa_dowan_dies_invisible"
msgid "@The_monster@ screams in rage.\n\n@The_monster@ screams in a voice full of rage, \"No, no!\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts wrathfully, \"No!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@愤怒地尖叫起来。\n\n@The_monster@满腔怒火地尖叫道：“不，不！”\n\n@The_monster@怒吼道：“不！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:duvessa_dowan_dies_distance"
msgid "You hear a distant scream of rage.\n"
msgstr "你听见远处传来愤怒的尖叫。\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:duvessa_dowan_dies_bytwin"
msgid "@The_monster@ screams in horror.\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@ screams, \"NO! What have I done?\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@惊恐地尖叫起来。\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@尖叫道：“不！我做了什么？”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:duvessa_dowan_dies_invisible_bytwin"
msgid "@Duvessa_Dowan_dies_bytwin@\n"
msgstr "@Duvessa_Dowan_dies_bytwin@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:duvessa_dowan_dies_distance_bytwin"
msgid "@Duvessa_Dowan_dies_distance@\n"
msgstr "@Duvessa_Dowan_dies_distance@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:edmund"
msgid "@_Edmund_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Edmund_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Edmund_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Edmund_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_edmund_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ gestures @at_foe@ with @possessive@ flail.\n\n@The_monster@ clears @possessive@ throat.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You wouldn't believe how much I paid for this flail.\"\n\n@The_monster@ asks @foe,@ \"Have you met my wondrous brother?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I might not be good at magic, but I can still kill you!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"People think my brother is the best. I think he's crazy.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I'm quite good with sums, too.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"People accused me of being a cutpurse!\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@用@possessive@连枷朝@at_foe@比划。\n\n@The_monster@清了清@possessive@嗓子。\n\n@The_monster@说道：“你绝对想不到这把连枷花了我多少钱。”\n\n@The_monster@问@foe,@：“你见过我那了不起的哥哥吗？”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“我也许不擅长魔法，但照样能杀了你！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“人人都觉得我哥哥最厉害。我看他就是个疯子。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我算术也挺在行的。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“居然有人说我是扒手！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_edmund_rare_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ grinds @possessive@ teeth, and then sighs.\n\nw:1\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ looks rather jealous.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"A flail is better than a scythe, any day of the week!\"\n\nw:5\n@The_monster@ says, \"What use are spells, anyway?\"\n\nw:5\n@The_monster@ mutters, \"Who needs spells, anyway?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Everyone always remembers my brother. 'Who's Edmund?' they ask!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"People will remember me! They'll remember me and die!\"\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@ says, \"Maybe I'll buy a title. How does Count Edmund sound?\"\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@ whines, \"My parents never had time for me!\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@咬了咬@possessive@牙，随后叹了口气。\n\nw:1\nVISUAL:@The_monster@显得颇为嫉妒。\n\n@The_monster@说道：“连枷怎么都比镰刀强！”\n\nw:5\n@The_monster@说道：“法术到底有什么用？”\n\nw:5\n@The_monster@嘟囔道：“到底谁需要法术啊？”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“大家总记得我哥哥，却都问：“埃德蒙是谁？””\n\n@The_monster@说道：“人们会记住我的！他们会记着我死去！”\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@说道：“也许我该买个爵位。“埃德蒙伯爵”听着怎么样？”\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@哀怨地说道：“我父母从来没空管我！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:edmund triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"That'll show my brother!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I'd like to see a scythe do that!\"\n\n@The_monster@ whines, \"They better pay attention to me now!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“这下我哥哥该瞧瞧了！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我倒想看看镰刀能不能办到！”\n\n@The_monster@哀怨地说道：“现在他们总该注意到我了吧！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:erica"
msgid "@_Erica_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Erica_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Erica_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Erica_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_erica_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ writhes her tentacles angrily.\n\n@The_monster@ burbles wildly.\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I'm so much better than you.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I love to horrify, but killing's even better.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Fast and perfect. Such is my way of killing.\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Your blood will spurt and your skin will burst!\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@愤怒地扭动着触手。\n\n@The_monster@狂乱地咕噜作响。\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“我可比你强多了。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“我喜欢吓人，不过杀人更痛快。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“迅捷而完美。这就是我的杀戮之道。”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“你的鲜血将喷涌而出，皮肤将爆裂开来！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_erica_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Hurry, death AWAITS you!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"I'll never tell where it is!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"You'll never get it!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"The claw is nothing compared to the sucker!\"\n\n@The_monster@ boasts @to_foe@, \"If terror be the object, I am a masterpiece!\"\n\n@The_monster@ boasts @to_foe@, \"Reason would be justified, if not for me!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“快点，死亡正等着你！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“我绝不会告诉你它在哪儿！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“你永远也拿不到它！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“利爪怎能与吸盘相提并论！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@夸口道：“若以恐怖为目标，我便是杰作！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@夸口道：“若非有我存在，理性倒还说得过去！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:erica triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ begins burbling mirthfully and uncontrollably.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@开始快活地咕噜作响，怎么也停不下来。\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:erolcha"
msgid "@_Erolcha_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Erolcha_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Erolcha_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Erolcha_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_erolcha_common_"
msgid "@The_monster@ roars.\n\n@The_monster@ growls.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ tries to grin evilly.\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"DIE!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Lunch!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Erolcha kill you!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@咆哮起来。\n\n@The_monster@低吼起来。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@试着露出邪恶的笑容。\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“死！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“午饭！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“埃罗尔查杀你！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_erolcha_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Eat!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Stand! Erolcha hit you!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Blood!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Erolcha crush your head!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Erolcha happy to kill you!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Erolcha angry!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“吃！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“站住！埃罗尔查打你！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“血！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“埃罗尔查砸碎你脑袋！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“埃罗尔查高兴杀你！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“埃罗尔查生气了！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:erolcha banished"
msgid "__NONE\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@ screams, \"Wait! Erolcha supposed to do that!\"\n\n"
msgstr "__NONE\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@尖叫道：“等等！那该是埃罗尔查干的！”\n\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:eustachio"
msgid "@_Eustachio_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Eustachio_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Eustachio_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Eustachio_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_eustachio_common_"
msgid "@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"At last I'll have my revenge!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Hey, you killed my favourite bat!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Summoning is fun!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"My allies will avenge me.\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams, \"This atrocity can only be purified with blood!\"\n\n@The_monster@ utters an oath, \"I will die for my friends!\"\n\n@The_monster@ growls, \"To hell with you, honourless miscreant!\"\n\n@The_monster@ asks, \"How can you live without manners, virtues and honour?\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“我终于能报仇了！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“喂，你杀了我最喜欢的蝙蝠！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“召唤真有趣！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“我的盟友会为我报仇。”\n\n@The_monster@尖叫道：“这等暴行只能用鲜血洗清！”\n\n@The_monster@发誓道：“我愿为朋友而死！”\n\n@The_monster@低吼道：“下地狱去吧，你这不知荣誉的恶徒！”\n\n@The_monster@问道：“没有礼仪、美德和荣誉，你怎么活得下去？”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_eustachio_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ yells @at_foe@, \"Perjured traitor, DIE!\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ twirls @possessive@ moustache.\n\n@The_monster@ calls on the powers of shadow!\n\n@The_monster@ brags, \"I can call spirits from the vasty deep.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@朝@at_foe@叫喊道：“背弃誓言的叛徒，受死吧！”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@捻着@possessive@胡须。\n\n@The_monster@呼唤暗影的力量！\n\n@The_monster@吹嘘道：“我能从无底深渊召来幽魂。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:eustachio triumphant"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ twirls @possessive@ moustache.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Such is the fate of all honourless rascals.\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@捻着@possessive@胡须。\n\n@The_monster@说道：“这就是所有无耻恶徒的下场。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:frances"
msgid "@_Frances_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Frances_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Frances_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Frances_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_frances_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ sneers @at_foe@.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ runs a finger over @possessive@ scar.\n\n@The_monster@ speaks in an indecipherable language.\n\n@The_monster@ mutters a nigh-unspeakable word.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Show me proof of your conquests, and I will call you a great adventurer.\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I command an army of devils. What do you command?\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I value strength and power. I see none of this in you.\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I speak the language of demons!\"\n\n@The_monster@ howls an indescribable curse.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I have seen worlds and universes beyond all imagining.\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@朝@at_foe@冷笑。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@用手指抚过@possessive@伤疤。\n\n@The_monster@说着一种无法理解的语言。\n\n@The_monster@低声念出一个几乎无法发音的词。\n\n@The_monster@说道：“向我证明你的战绩，我才会承认你是个伟大的冒险者。”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我统领着恶魔大军。你统领着什么？”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我看重力量与权势。可你一样也没有。”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我会说恶魔的语言！”\n\n@The_monster@嚎出一句难以形容的诅咒。\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我见过超乎一切想象的世界与宇宙。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_frances_rare_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ takes a defensive stance.\n\n@The_monster@ growls a series of guttural syllables.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"There is a strange beauty in the demonic, don't you think?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Would you challenge me, knowing my power?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I am undefeated in single-handed combat.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Warriors are made for war and combat. Do you call yourself a warrior?\"\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@ says, \"Even the Halls of Hell could not contain me.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I will defeat you, of this I have no doubt!\" @player_only@\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@摆出防御架势。\n\n@The_monster@从喉咙深处吼出一连串音节。\n\n@The_monster@说道：“恶魔之物也有种奇异的美，你不觉得吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“知道了我的力量，你还敢挑战我吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我单打独斗从未败过。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“勇士生来便是为了战争与厮杀。你也配自称勇士？”\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@说道：“就连地狱殿堂也困不住我。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我会打败你，对此我毫不怀疑！”@player_only@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:frederick"
msgid "@_Frederick_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Frederick_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Frederick_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Frederick_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:beogh frederick"
msgid "w:2\n@The_monster@ says, \"You didn't bring enough reinforcements. Come back later!\"\n\nw:30\n@Frederick@\n"
msgstr "w:2\n@The_monster@说道：“你带的援军还不够。改天再来吧！”\n\nw:30\n@Frederick@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:okawaru frederick"
msgid "w:2\n@The_monster@ says, \"Pah! Those who rely on gods for strength get nowhere in life.\"\n\nw:30\n@Frederick@\n"
msgstr "w:2\n@The_monster@说道：“呸！靠神赐予力量的人，一辈子都没出息。”\n\nw:30\n@Frederick@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_frederick_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ pines for a worthy opponent.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ yawns in an exaggerated manner.\n\n@The_monster@ offers a few words of tactical advice.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Adventurers these days do not know how to walk, let alone fight.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"In my day, to be a hero meant something. Now, it just means you die quicker.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You call yourself an adventurer? Hah!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I've killed five 'adventurers' today. Will you be the sixth?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Challenge me? You, and whose army?\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Why should I even bother fighting the likes of you?\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@渴望遇到一位像样的对手。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@夸张地打了个哈欠。\n\n@The_monster@给出了几句战术建议。\n\n@The_monster@说道：“如今的冒险者连路都不会走，更别提打架了。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“在我那个年代，英雄这称号可有分量。如今，它只意味着死得更快。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“你也配自称冒险者？哈！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“今天我已经杀了五个“冒险者”。你会是第六个吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“挑战我？就凭你，还有哪路大军？”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“你这种货色，值得我动手吗？”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_frederick_rare_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ polishes @possessive@ monocle.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ looks bored.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ sighs.\n\n@The_monster@ rants about the fall of honour.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"All of you adventurers look the same to me! Bumbling weaklings, the lot!\" @player_only@\n\nw:5\n@The_monster@ says, \"For you, today is the most challenging fight of your life. For me... well, I will have lunch shortly.\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Perhaps I should have been a lumberjack. The trees might put up more of a fight.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Killing you would be a chore, not a joy.\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ eyes @foe@ carefully. \"They told me only worthy opponents would get this far.\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@擦拭着@possessive@单片眼镜。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@显得很无聊。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@叹了口气。\n\n@The_monster@痛斥荣誉的沦丧。\n\n@The_monster@说道：“在我眼里，你们这些冒险者都一个样！全是一群笨手笨脚的弱者！”@player_only@\n\nw:5\n@The_monster@说道：“对你来说，今天是你一生中最艰难的一战。对我来说……嗯，一会儿该吃午饭了。”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@说道：“也许我该去当伐木工。树说不定还更能打些。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“杀你只是苦差事，毫无乐趣。”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@仔细打量着@foe@，说道：“他们明明说，只有像样的对手才能走到这里。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:frederick triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ scoffs, \"You didn't have a chance.\"\n\n@The_monster@ sighs, \"Someday I'll have a real challenge.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What a chore.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You don't even know how to die right.\"\n\n@The_monster@ sighs, \"Killing weak @player_genus_plural@ does nothing to prove my superiority.\"\n\n@The_monster@ sighs, \"Another waste of time.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@讥笑道：“你根本没有胜算。”\n\n@The_monster@叹息道：“总有一天，我会遇上真正的挑战。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“真是苦差事。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“你连怎么死都不知道。”\n\n@The_monster@叹息道：“杀死弱小的@player_genus_plural@，根本证明不了我的强大。”\n\n@The_monster@叹息道：“又浪费了时间。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:frederick riddle"
msgid "@The_monster@ sighs, \"Your wits are somehow even duller than your claws.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@叹息道：“你的脑子居然比你的爪子还钝。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:ashenzari frederick triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ shakes @possessive@ head sadly, \"Willingly donning a god's shackles... pitiful.\"\n\n@Frederick@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@悲伤地摇了摇@possessive@头，说道：“心甘情愿戴上神的枷锁……可悲。”\n\n@Frederick@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:beogh frederick triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ sighs, \"Your brethren were only holding you back, @player_genus@.\"\n\n@Frederick@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@叹息道：“你的同胞只会拖累你，@player_genus@。”\n\n@Frederick@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:cheibriados frederick triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Be happy - you can't get any slower than dead.\"\n\n@Frederick@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“高兴点吧——死了就不可能更慢了。”\n\n@Frederick@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:dithmenos frederick triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Time for you to vanish into the darkness.\"\n\n@Frederick@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“该让你消失在黑暗里了。”\n\n@Frederick@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:elyvilon frederick triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Healer, heal thyself.\"\n\n@Frederick@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“医者，先治好你自己吧。”\n\n@Frederick@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:fedhas frederick triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"You're grass, mortal.\"\n\n@Frederick@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“你死定了，凡人。”\n\n@Frederick@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:gozag frederick triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Your greed held you back.\"\n\n@Frederick@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“你的贪婪拖累了你。”\n\n@Frederick@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:hepliaklqana frederick triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Relying on the deeds of your ancestors brought you no glory.\"\n\n@Frederick@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“依赖先祖的功业，并没有给你带来荣耀。”\n\n@Frederick@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:ignis frederick triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Foolish to worship a god whose flame is even dimmer than you.\"\n\n@Frederick@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“竟然崇拜一个火光比你还黯淡的神，真蠢。”\n\n@Frederick@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:jivya frederick triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Our battle was as dull and shapeless as your god.\"\n\n@Frederick@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“我们这场战斗和你的神一样，无趣又毫无章法。”\n\n@Frederick@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:kikubaaqudgha frederick triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ sighs, \"Join the corpses you idolise, mortal.\"\n\n@Frederick@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@叹息道：“去和你崇拜的尸体作伴吧，凡人。”\n\n@Frederick@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:lugonu frederick triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"A more permanent form of banishment for you, mortal.\"\n\n@Frederick@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“赐你一种更永恒的放逐，凡人。”\n\n@Frederick@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:makhleb frederick triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"And take your demons with you.\"\n\n@Frederick@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“把你的恶魔也一起带走。”\n\n@Frederick@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:nemelex xobeh frederick triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Looks like you fold, gambler.\"\n\n@Frederick@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“看来你得弃牌了，赌徒。”\n\n@Frederick@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:okawaru frederick triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Now do you deem me a worthy opponent?\"\n\n@Frederick@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“现在你觉得我配当你的对手了吗？”\n\n@Frederick@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:qazlal frederick triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Finally, I'll be able to get some peace and quiet.\"\n\n@Frederick@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“终于能清静一会儿了。”\n\n@Frederick@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:ru frederick triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"You gave up too much of yourself.\"\n\n@Frederick@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“你把自己舍弃得太多了。”\n\n@Frederick@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:sif muna frederick triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ sighs, \"Relying on the knowledge of others got you nowhere, mortal.\"\n\n@Frederick@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@叹息道：“依靠别人的知识，你终究一事无成，凡人。”\n\n@Frederick@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:trog frederick triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"I'm sure you'll make a fine angry ghost.\"\n\n@Frederick@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“我相信你会成为一个愤怒的好鬼魂。”\n\n@Frederick@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:uskayaw frederick triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"You've danced your last steps.\"\n\n@Frederick@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“你的最后一支舞跳完了。”\n\n@Frederick@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:vehumet frederick triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"A mage should rely only on their own abilities.\"\n\n@Frederick@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“法师应该只依靠自己的本领。”\n\n@Frederick@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:wu jian frederick triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"You should only rely on techniques you've developed yourself.\"\n\n@Frederick@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“你只该依靠自己悟出的招式。”\n\n@Frederick@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:xom frederick triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ frowns, \"Willingly giving yourself over as a plaything to Xom... strange behaviour.\"\n\n@Frederick@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@皱眉道：“心甘情愿把自己交给佐姆当玩物……真古怪。”\n\n@Frederick@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:yredelemnul frederick triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Find comfort in joining the legions you worship.\"\n\n@Frederick@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“去加入你崇拜的大军，寻求慰藉吧。”\n\n@Frederick@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:zin frederick triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"The only thing more annoying than a worshipper is a proselytiser.\"\n\n@Frederick@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“比信徒更烦人的，只有传教的人。”\n\n@Frederick@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:the shining one frederick triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"The adventurer who shines twice as bright burns out twice as fast.\"\n\n@Frederick@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“冒险者光芒强上一倍，燃尽也快上一倍。”\n\n@Frederick@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:fannar"
msgid "@_Fannar_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Fannar_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Fannar_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Fannar_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_fannar_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ glares icily @at_foe@.\n\nVISUAL:Some snowflakes condense on @the_monster@.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ brushes some snowflakes from @possessive@ robe.\n\n@The_monster@ murmurs some mystic words to @reflexive@.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@冷冰冰地瞪着@at_foe@。\n\nVISUAL:几片雪花在@the_monster@身上凝结。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@拂去@possessive@长袍上的几片雪花。\n\n@The_monster@对@reflexive@低声念着神秘的话语。\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_fannar_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Freeze!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I shall freeze you to your soul!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"An icy embrace awaits you...\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You will make a fine ice sculpture.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Does this not give you the chills?\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“冻住！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“我会将你冻彻灵魂！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“冰冷的拥抱正等着你……”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“你会成为一尊精美的冰雕。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“这还不让你不寒而栗吗？”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:gastronok"
msgid "@_Gastronok_common_@\n\nw:4\n@_Gastronok_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Gastronok_common_@\n\nw:4\n@_Gastronok_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_gastronok_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ sloshes about.\n\n@The_monster@ gurgles, \"I'll eat you, I will!\"\n\n@The_monster@ gurgles, \"A snack! A snack!\"\n\n@The_monster@ gurgles.\n\n@The_monster@ makes a strange noise.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@湿淋淋地蠕动着。\n\n@The_monster@咕噜着说道：“我要吃了你，我一定会的！”\n\n@The_monster@咕噜着说道：“点心！点心！”\n\n@The_monster@咕噜作响。\n\n@The_monster@发出奇怪的声音。\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_gastronok_rare_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ mouth opens, radula flailing wildly.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ is buffeted by a sudden breeze.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ eyestalks wobble, almost dislodging @possessive@ wizard hat.\n\n@The_monster@ gurgles, \"You're how I like my food. Fast!\"\n\n@The_monster@ gurgles, \"Slow down, so I can eat you.\"\n\n@The_monster@ gurgles, \"Are you a wizard? Wizards taste nice...\"\n\n@The_monster@ gurgles, \"Huuuuuuuuuuungry!\"\n\n@The_monster@ gurgles, \"It's true, you are what you eat.\"\n\n@The_monster@ gurgles, \"I bet you'll be tasty.\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@嘴张开了，齿舌疯狂地挥动。\n\nVISUAL:一阵突如其来的微风吹打着@The_monster@。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@眼柄晃来晃去，差点弄掉@possessive@巫师帽。\n\n@The_monster@咕噜着说道：“你正是我喜欢的那种食物。快餐！”\n\n@The_monster@咕噜着说道：“慢点，好让我吃了你。”\n\n@The_monster@咕噜着说道：“你是巫师吗？巫师的味道不错……”\n\n@The_monster@咕噜着说道：“饿——死——了！”\n\n@The_monster@咕噜着说道：“吃什么就变成什么，这话还真没错。”\n\n@The_monster@咕噜着说道：“我敢说你一定很好吃。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:gastronok triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ gurgles, \"Time to dig in!\"\n\n@The_monster@ gurgles, \"About time. I'm starving!\"\n\n@The_monster@ gurgles, \"Let's see if you taste as good as that wizard did.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@咕噜着说道：“开饭了！”\n\n@The_monster@咕噜着说道：“总算好了。我快饿死了！”\n\n@The_monster@咕噜着说道：“让我尝尝，你有没有那个巫师好吃。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:grinder"
msgid "@_Grinder_common_@\n\nw:2\n@_Grinder_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Grinder_common_@\n\nw:2\n@_Grinder_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_grinder_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ grins, showing sharp teeth.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You look like you could use a good racking.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I used to sell toenails on the black market.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"There's only one good use for a tongue: cutting it out.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Mostly I couldn't keep them alive.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"DUCK!\"\n\n@The_monster@ sighs, \"No one appreciates my work.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Wait up.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Just stop there for a second...\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Don't move a muscle.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Tell me all your secrets, or I'll kill you.\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@咧嘴一笑，露出尖牙。\n\n@The_monster@说道：“看起来你该上刑架好好拉一拉。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我以前在黑市卖脚趾甲。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“舌头只有一个用处：割下来。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“大多数时候，我都没能让他们活下来。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“趴下！”\n\n@The_monster@叹息道：“没人欣赏我的工作。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“等一下。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“就在那里停一下……”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“一动也别动。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“把你的秘密全告诉我，不然我就杀了你。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_grinder_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Are you a fish?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What is the universe for?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"My boss said I was rubbish. His entrails said otherwise.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"At least @my_God@ appreciates what I'm doing.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Make like a tree!\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ rolls @possessive@ eyes.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“你是鱼吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“宇宙是用来干什么的？”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“老板说我一无是处。他的肠子可不这么说。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“至少@my_God@欣赏我的所作所为。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“学棵树，滚到一边去！”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@翻了翻@possessive@白眼。\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:grinder triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Now the real fun starts!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Hey, I wasn't done torturing you yet!\"\n\n@The_monster@ sighs, \"Dead already? I want a refund.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“现在才真正好玩起来！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“喂，我还没折磨完你呢！”\n\n@The_monster@叹息道：“这就死了？我要退钱。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:grum"
msgid "@_Grum_common_@\n\nw:2\n@_Grum_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Grum_common_@\n\nw:2\n@_Grum_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_grum_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ bares @possessive@ teeth.\n\n@The_monster@ @_Grum_verb_@.\n\n@The_monster@ stares @at_foe@ intently and @_Grum_verb_@.\n\n@The_monster@ lets out an intimidating howl.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ sniffs the air and quickly glances around.\n\n@The_monster@ points @possessive@ finger @at_foe@ and @_Grum_verb_@, \"Attack!\"\n\n@The_monster@ points @possessive@ finger @at_foe@ and shouts, \"@_Grum_dog_name_@! Sic 'em!\"\n\n@The_monster@ glances around and shouts, \"@_Grum_dog_name_@! Here boy!\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts, \"@_Grum_dog_name_@! Good boy!\"\n\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@龇出@possessive@牙齿。\n\n@The_monster@@_Grum_verb_@。\n\n@The_monster@紧盯着@at_foe@，@_Grum_verb_@。\n\n@The_monster@发出一声骇人的长嚎。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@嗅了嗅空气，迅速扫视四周。\n\n@The_monster@伸出@possessive@手指指向@at_foe@，@_Grum_verb_@道：“进攻！”\n\n@The_monster@伸出@possessive@手指指向@at_foe@，大喊道：“@_Grum_dog_name_@！咬他们！”\n\n@The_monster@扫视四周，大喊道：“@_Grum_dog_name_@！过来，好孩子！”\n\n@The_monster@大喊道：“@_Grum_dog_name_@！好孩子！”\n\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_grum_rare_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ is momentarily distracted by a flea in @possessive@ coat.\n\n@The_monster@ @_Grum_verb_@ @at_foe@, \"I'll hound you night and day!\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_Grum_verb_@ @at_foe@, \"My dogs and I will have a feast tonight...\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_Grum_verb_@ @at_foe@, \"You look like good eating.\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_Grum_verb_@ @at_foe@, \"I'll squash you like a puppy.\"\n\n@The_monster@ looks @at_foe@ in disgust and @_Grum_verb_@, \"You ain't no friend of mine.\"\n\n@The_monster@ cheerfully says, \"No dog meat for Grum tonight!\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_Grum_verb_@, \"You're dog chow, @player_name@!\"\n\n@The_monster@ asks, \"What kind of bones do @player_genus_plural@ have? My dogs are dying to find out.\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"What's my secret? I feed my dogs @player_genus_plural@. It makes their fur nice and shiny.\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ looks @at_foe@ and @_Grum_verb_@, \"Time to put down the runt of the litter.\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_Grum_verb_@ @at_foe@, \"Me and @_Grum_dog_name_@ will play fetch with your bones!\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_Grum_verb_@, \"Who's a good boy? That's right, @_Grum_dog_name_@... you are!\"\n\n\n@The_monster@ @_Grum_verb_@ @at_foe@, \"You will fight me? This will be... rough!\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts, \"Release the hounds!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I'm selling these fine leather pelts.\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts, \"Faster, @_Grum_dog_name_@! Kill! Kill!\"\n\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@一时被@possessive@毛皮里的一只跳蚤分了心。\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@@_Grum_verb_@道：“我会日夜追着你不放！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@@_Grum_verb_@道：“今晚，我和我的狗要大吃一顿……”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@@_Grum_verb_@道：“你看起来很好吃。”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@@_Grum_verb_@道：“我要像碾小狗一样碾死你。”\n\n@The_monster@厌恶地看着@at_foe@，@_Grum_verb_@道：“你可不是我的朋友。”\n\n@The_monster@兴高采烈地说道：“格鲁姆今晚不用吃狗肉了！”\n\n@The_monster@@_Grum_verb_@道：“你就是狗粮，@player_name@！”\n\n@The_monster@问道：“@player_genus_plural@的骨头长什么样？我的狗都迫不及待想知道了。”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“我的秘诀是什么？我喂狗吃@player_genus_plural@。这样它们的毛又漂亮又亮。”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@看着@at_foe@，@_Grum_verb_@道：“该处死这窝里最弱的崽子了。”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@@_Grum_verb_@道：“我要和@_Grum_dog_name_@拿你的骨头玩接物游戏！”\n\n@The_monster@@_Grum_verb_@道：“谁是好孩子？没错，@_Grum_dog_name_@……就是你！”\n\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@@_Grum_verb_@道：“你要跟我打？这可会很……凶！”\n\n@The_monster@大喊道：“放狗！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“我在卖这些上好的皮毛。”\n\n@The_monster@大喊道：“快点，@_Grum_dog_name_@！咬死他！咬死他！”\n\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_grum_verb_"
msgid "snarls\n\ngrowls\n\ngrunts\n\nbarks\n"
msgstr "龇牙低吼\n\n低吼\n\n哼哼\n\n吠叫\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_grum_dog_name_"
msgid "Bowser\n\nCujo\n\nDuke\n\nFido\n\nFluffy\n\nJunior\n\nKing\n\nLady\n\nPluto\n\nRex\n\nRover\n\nSparky\n\nSpot\n\nSpike\n\n\n\n\n\n"
msgstr "鲍泽\n\n库乔\n\n公爵\n\n菲多\n\n绒绒\n\n小家伙\n\n国王\n\n淑女\n\n普鲁托\n\n雷克斯\n\n浪子\n\n火花\n\n斑点\n\n尖刺\n\n\n\n\n\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:grunn"
msgid "@_Grunn_common_@\n\nw:2\n@_Grunn_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Grunn_common_@\n\nw:2\n@_Grunn_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_grunn_common_"
msgid "@_Grum_common_@\n"
msgstr "@_Grum_common_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_grunn_rare_"
msgid "VISUAL:One of @the_monster_possessive@ claws falls out.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ pats at a spot of missing fur and sighs.\n\n@The_monster@ @_Grum_verb_@ @at_foe@, \"My dogs and I will have a feast tonight...\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_Grum_verb_@ @at_foe@, \"I don't need to eat anymore, but I'll make an exception for you.\"\n\n@The_monster@ asks, \"What kind of bones do @player_genus_plural@ have? My dogs are dying to find out.\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ looks @at_foe@ and @_Grum_verb_@, \"Time to put down the runt of the litter.\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_Grum_verb_@ @at_foe@, \"Me and @_Grum_dog_name_@ will play fetch with your bones!\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts, \"Faster, @_Grum_dog_name_@! Kill! Kill!\"\n\n@The_monster@ lets out a long, sad whine.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Selling your soul isn't that bad. What the hell, right?\"\n\n@The_monster@ moans, \"It's cold... so cold.\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@the_monster_possessive@一根爪子掉了下来。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@拍了拍一块掉毛的地方，叹了口气。\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@@_Grum_verb_@道：“今晚，我和我的狗要大吃一顿……”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@@_Grum_verb_@道：“我已经不用吃东西了，不过可以为你破个例。”\n\n@The_monster@问道：“@player_genus_plural@的骨头长什么样？我的狗都迫不及待想知道了。”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@看着@at_foe@，@_Grum_verb_@道：“该处死这窝里最弱的崽子了。”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@@_Grum_verb_@道：“我要和@_Grum_dog_name_@拿你的骨头玩接物游戏！”\n\n@The_monster@大喊道：“快点，@_Grum_dog_name_@！咬死他！咬死他！”\n\n@The_monster@发出一声悠长而悲伤的呜咽。\n\n@The_monster@说道：“出卖灵魂也没那么糟。管他呢，对吧？”\n\n@The_monster@哀吟道：“好冷……好冷啊。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:harold"
msgid "@_Harold_common_@\n\nw:6\n@_Harold_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Harold_common_@\n\nw:6\n@_Harold_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_harold_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ looks eager to get this over with.\n\n@The_monster@ yells @at_foe@, \"I don't have all day!\"\n\n@The_monster@ grumbles @at_foe@, \"Just give up already, I want to go home!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I was hoping my final job would be more of a challenge, but money is money.\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"Can you die now? I had plans for the rest of the day!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Do you have any idea what people are willing to pay to have you killed, @player_name@?\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Let's make it quick, okay? I've got mouths to feed.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Listen, it's nothing personal. It's just a job.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"This is so exciting! What a great way to end my career!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Ah, this is what I got into this business for!\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@显得急于了结此事。\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@叫喊道：“我可没空陪你耗一整天！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@抱怨道：“赶紧投降吧，我想回家了！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“本来还盼着最后一单能更有挑战性，不过钱就是钱。”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@大喊道：“你现在能死了吗？我今天还有别的安排！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“@player_name@，你知道别人愿意花多少钱买你的命吗？”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“咱们速战速决，好吗？我还有家要养。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“听着，我跟你无冤无仇。这只是工作。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“真刺激！这可是结束职业生涯的好方式！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“啊，这才是我入这一行的原因！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_harold_rare_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ pauses a moment, imagining something with a smile on @possessive@ face.\n\n@The_monster@ considers, \"I think I'll use your bounty to get a @_Harold_retirement_plan_@...\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ asks, \"Do you mind if I name my boat the '@player_name@'? Your head will be paying for it, after all.\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ says happily, \"The price on your head will fill my nest egg nicely!\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ thinks, and says @to_foe@, \"Perhaps I'll take up @_Harold_ret_hobby_@ after I'm done here...\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Try to look on the bright side. Your death will help put my children through school.\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Bounty hunting has been great, but I can't wait to retire.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"My wife will appreciate not having to wash blood out of my clothes anymore.\"\n\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@停了一会儿，想象着什么，@possessive@脸上露出微笑。\n\n@The_monster@盘算道：“我想，用你的赏金置办@_Harold_retirement_plan_@吧……”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@问道：“你介意我把船命名为“@player_name@”号吗？毕竟是用你的人头买的。”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@高兴地说道：“你的人头赏金能让我的养老钱充裕不少！”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@想了想，对@to_foe@说道：“也许忙完这里，我就去学@_Harold_ret_hobby_@……”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“往好处想想。你的死能帮我的孩子读完书。”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“赏金猎人的日子不错，可我已经等不及退休了。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“以后不用再洗掉我衣服上的血迹，我妻子会很高兴的。”\n\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:fleeing harold"
msgid "__NEXT\n\nw:5\n@The_monster@ @_yells_@, \"I'm getting too old for this!\"\n"
msgstr "__NEXT\n\nw:5\n@The_monster@@_yells_@道：“我这把年纪，已经干不动这个了！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:harold killed"
msgid "__NONE\n\nw:4\n@The_monster@ groans, \"My... family...\" and then collapses, dead.\n\nw:3\n@The_monster@ looks down at @possessive@ mortal wounds and cries, \"But... this was my last day before retirement...\"\n\nw:2\n@The_monster@ gasps with @possessive@ last breath, \"I wish I had worked less...\"\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@ falls down, and clutches @possessive@ wounds. \"But I was going to get a @_Harold_retirement_plan_@...\"\n"
msgstr "__NONE\n\nw:4\n@The_monster@呻吟道：“我的……家人……”随后倒地死去。\n\nw:3\n@The_monster@低头看着@possessive@致命伤，哭喊道：“可……今天是我退休前的最后一天啊……”\n\nw:2\n@The_monster@用@possessive@最后一口气喘息道：“真希望我当初少干点活……”\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@倒下了，捂着@possessive@伤口，说道：“可我还打算置办@_Harold_retirement_plan_@……”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:harold triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Can't wait to tell my little ones about this.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Time to retire.\"\n\n@The_monster@ sighs, \"Finally, I can get that @_Harold_retirement_plan_@ and settle down.\"\n\n@The_monster@ sighs, \"Nothing for old @the_monster@ but @_Harold_ret_hobby_@ after this.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“等不及要跟孩子们讲讲这件事了。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“该退休了。”\n\n@The_monster@叹息道：“终于能置办@_Harold_retirement_plan_@，安顿下来了。”\n\n@The_monster@叹息道：“往后，老@the_monster@就只管@_Harold_ret_hobby_@了。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_harold_retirement_plan_"
msgid "@_Harold_ret_house_@ @_Harold_ret_place_@\n\nfishing boat\n\nhorse ranch\n\ncattle farm\n\nnice plot of land\n"
msgstr "@_Harold_ret_place_@@_Harold_ret_house_@\n\n渔船\n\n养马场\n\n养牛场\n\n好地\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_harold_ret_house_"
msgid "villa\n\nmansion\n\nhouse\n\ncottage\n\nplace\n"
msgstr "别墅\n\n豪宅\n\n房子\n\n小屋\n\n住处\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_harold_ret_place_"
msgid "in the mountains\n\nby the lake\n\nnear the shore\n\nin the country\n\nin the woods\n"
msgstr "山里的\n\n湖边的\n\n海岸附近的\n\n乡下的\n\n林中的\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_harold_ret_hobby_"
msgid "fishing\n\nhiking\n\ncarpentry\n\nmodel-building\n\nwriting\n\npainting\n"
msgstr "钓鱼\n\n徒步\n\n木工\n\n制作模型\n\n写作\n\n绘画\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:ignacio"
msgid "@_Ignacio_common_@\n\nw:3\n@_Ignacio_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Ignacio_common_@\n\nw:3\n@_Ignacio_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_ignacio_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ looks at @possessive@ axe, then at @foe@, then at @possessive@ axe, then at @foe@...\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ grins with joy.\n\n@The_monster@ exclaims, \"Oh yes! We are going to have fun!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Pain is my business; you will see!\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @to_foe@, \"Off with your head!\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@看看@possessive@斧头，又看看@foe@，再看看@possessive@斧头，又看看@foe@……\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@开心地咧嘴笑了。\n\n@The_monster@大叫道：“哦，太好了！咱们会玩得很开心！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“痛苦就是我的行当，你会明白的！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@大喊道：“砍掉你的脑袋！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_ignacio_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"I enjoy death. I like the smell. I like the greasy feel of cooling blood.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I have to say that I admire beauty and perfection. I like to watch it die. The contrast as it decays is exquisite.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says in a calm gravelly voice, \"173 down. One million more to go.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"The death blow is fun, but the real pleasure is in torturing beforehand.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"No gallows around, so decapitation it is.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“我享受死亡。我喜欢那气味，喜欢血液冷却时油腻的触感。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“不得不说，我欣赏美与完美。我喜欢看着它们死去。它们腐朽时的反差，实在精妙。”\n\n@The_monster@用平静而沙哑的声音说道：“已经解决一百七十三个。还差一百万。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“致命一击很有趣，不过真正的乐趣在于之前的折磨。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“这里没有绞刑架，那就砍头吧。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:ijyb"
msgid "@_Ijyb_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Ijyb_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Ijyb_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Ijyb_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_ijyb_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ grins evilly.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ stops to [study|check on] @possessive@ wand.\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Time for continue experiment!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Me wand stronger than you!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"It's all mine!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Level is mine! All mine!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"{{\n    if you.skill(\"Evocations\") >= 2 then\n      return \"Me learn from your wands next!\"\n    else\n      return \"You look like good test subject!\"\n    end }}\" @player_only@\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@邪恶地咧嘴笑了。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@停下来[研究|检查]@possessive@魔杖。\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“该继续实验了！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“俺的魔杖比你强！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“全是俺的！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“这层是俺的！全是俺的！”\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"{{\n    if you.skill(\"Evocations\") >= 2 then\n      return \"Me learn from your wands next!\"\n    else\n      return \"You look like good test subject!\"\n    end }}\" @player_only@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_ijyb_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Don't stand in way of progress!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Me am play god!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams, \"They call me mad!\"\n\nw:5\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Me yet to meet anyone who can outsmart wand!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"I no like you!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“别挡着进步的路！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“俺要当神！”\n\n@The_monster@尖叫道：“他们说俺疯了！”\n\nw:5\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“俺还没见过谁能比魔杖聪明！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“俺不喜欢你！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:confused ijyb"
msgid "@The_monster@ cowers and screams, \"Me head! Aaaah! Get out now!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Me give you whole level! Then you leave me be!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Wand still stronger! You very nasty!\"\n\nw:5\n@The_monster@ screams, \"Science deserve better than this!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Me be nice to you! Me promise!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams, \"Me go back to drawing board!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"No nasty magic on me!\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ clutches @possessive@ head and gibbers rapidly, swaying.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@畏缩着尖叫道：“俺的头！啊啊啊！快出去！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“俺把整层都给你！你就别烦俺了！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“魔杖还是更强！你真坏！”\n\nw:5\n@The_monster@尖叫道：“科学值得更好的待遇！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“俺会对你好的！俺保证！”\n\n@The_monster@尖叫道：“俺回去重画设计图！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“别对俺用讨厌的魔法！”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@抱住@possessive@头，飞快地胡言乱语着，身体摇摇晃晃。\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:ijyb triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ screams, \"Time for next experiment!\"\n\n@The_monster@ moans, \"Good help so hard to find!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@尖叫道：“该做下一个实验了！”\n\n@The_monster@哀吟道：“好帮手可真难找！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:ilsuiw"
msgid "@_Ilsuiw_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Ilsuiw_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Ilsuiw_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Ilsuiw_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_ilsuiw_common_"
msgid "@The_monster@ asks @foe,@ \"Won't you come swim with me?\"\n\n@The_monster@ whispers @to_foe@, \"Come on in, the water's fine.\"\n\n@The_monster@ sings a [strange|haunting] [sea-chanty|melody].\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ runs @possessive@ fingers through @possessive@ long green hair.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@问@foe,@：“不来陪我游泳吗？”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@低语道：“进来吧，水很舒服。”\n\n@The_monster@唱起一首[奇异|萦绕心头]的[水手歌|曲调]。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@用@possessive@手指梳过@possessive@绿色长发。\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_ilsuiw_rare_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ gazes at @foe@ [hypnotically|seductively].\n\n@The_monster@ sings, \"To sleep, to sleep... mayhap to drown.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"It's lovely beneath the waves - you'll see!\"\n\n@The_monster@ asks @foe,@ \"Do you dare to walk upon the beach?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Catch me, touch me, love me, feed me!\"\n\n@The_monster@ innocently whispers @to_foe@, \"Don't trust the tales, trust me!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"There's nothing like you and me, on the beach...\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@[摄人心魄|含情脉脉]地凝视着@foe@。\n\n@The_monster@唱道：“睡去，睡去……也许就此溺亡。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“波涛之下美极了——你会看见的！”\n\n@The_monster@问@foe,@：“你敢踏上海滩吗？”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“抓住我，触碰我，爱我，喂饱我！”\n\n@The_monster@天真地对@to_foe@低语道：“别信那些传说，相信我！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“你我相伴，在海滩上……还有什么比这更好？”\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:jessica"
msgid "@_Jessica_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Jessica_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Jessica_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Jessica_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_jessica_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ grins evilly.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ looks very angry.\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"You're disturbing me! I'll have to kill you!\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ gestures wildly.\n\n@The_monster@ mumbles something strange.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@邪恶地咧嘴笑了。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@显得非常愤怒。\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@大喊道：“你打扰到我了！我只好杀了你！”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@疯狂地比划着。\n\n@The_monster@含糊地念叨着奇怪的话。\n"

#. Reviewed database-21; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_jessica_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Why did you come here?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I'm really upset.\"\n\n@The_monster@ very coldly says @to_foe@, \"I hate your company.\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"I don't like beings like you!\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"Stop bothering me, or I'll kill you!\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"You are a ghastly nuisance!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“你来这里干什么？”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“我真的很不高兴。”\n\n@The_monster@极其冷淡地对@to_foe@说道：“我讨厌你待在这里。”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@大喊道：“我不喜欢你这种东西！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@大喊道：“别烦我，不然我就杀了你！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@大喊道：“你真是个讨厌至极的麻烦！”\n"


#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:jeremiah"
msgid "@_Jeremiah_common_@\n\nw:3\n@_Jeremiah_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Jeremiah_common_@\n\nw:3\n@_Jeremiah_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_jeremiah_common_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Oh, this is an awfully strange dream.\"\n\n@The_monster@ asks, \"Am I dreaming? Is this real?\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts, \"Stop it! Stop making me do this!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I don't want to hurt you. Just - go! Run!\"\n\n@The_monster@ asks, \"Where am I? Why are you fighting me?\"\n\n@The_monster@ whispers, \"I obey. I obey. I obey.\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ eyes close briefly, then snap open.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ eyes momentarily flash bright red.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ yawns.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ trails rainbows from @possessive@ fingertips.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ gazes at @possessive@ orb, transfixed.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ looks at @possessive@ weapon with confusion.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“哦，这个梦实在太奇怪了。”\n\n@The_monster@问道：“我在做梦吗？这是真的吗？”\n\n@The_monster@大喊道：“住手！别再逼我这么做了！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“我不想伤害你。快——走！快跑！”\n\n@The_monster@问道：“我在哪里？你为什么要和我打？”\n\n@The_monster@低语：“我服从。我服从。我服从。”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@双眼短暂闭上，随即猛然睁开。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@双眼刹那间闪过鲜红的光。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@打了个哈欠。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@从@possessive@指尖拖曳出道道彩虹。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@出神地凝视着@possessive@圆球。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@困惑地看着@possessive@武器。\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_jeremiah_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ howls, \"Why can't I wake up?\"\n\n@The_monster@ wails, \"Just end it! Let me go!\"\n\n@The_monster@ sobs, \"I don't want it. Make it stop! Make it stop!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Oh, this must be a dream. This is totally unrealistic.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Oh, what beautiful sparkles and rainbows everywhere!\"\n\n@The_monster@ asks @foe@, \"Have you seen the dreamshard? I... I need it...\"\n\n@The_monster@ whispers, \"Once you die, everything will be fine. It promises.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Time for a nap after this, I think.\"\n\n@The_monster@ asks @foe@, \"Would you mind waking me up? Thanks muchly.\"\n\n@The_monster@ wails, \"It wants to be free! It wants to enslave everyone!\"\n\n@The_monster@ asks @foe@, \"Where did this trident come from? Is it yours?\"\n\n@The_monster@ giggles, \"Dreams, dreams, come out to play!\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ pinches @reflexive@.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@嚎叫：“我为什么醒不过来？”\n\n@The_monster@哀号：“快结束这一切！放我走！”\n\n@The_monster@啜泣：“我不要。让它停下来！让它停下来！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“哦，这一定是梦。这太不真实了。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“哦，到处都是多么美丽的闪光和彩虹！”\n\n@The_monster@问@foe@道：“你见到梦晶了吗？我……我需要它……”\n\n@The_monster@低语：“等你死了，一切就会好起来。它保证过。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我想，忙完这事该睡个午觉了。”\n\n@The_monster@问@foe@道：“能麻烦你叫醒我吗？万分感谢。”\n\n@The_monster@哀号：“它想自由！它想奴役所有人！”\n\n@The_monster@问@foe@道：“这把三叉戟从哪儿来的？是你的吗？”\n\n@The_monster@咯咯笑：“梦啊，梦啊，出来玩吧！”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@掐了@reflexive@一下。\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:jeremiah triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ asks, \"What happened? Did... did you die?\"\n\n@The_monster@ wails, \"I didn't mean to kill anyone! I'm not a murderer!\"\n\n@The_monster@ asks, \"Is it over? Can I wake up now?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"O terrible one, your will is done.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@问道：“怎么了？你……你死了吗？”\n\n@The_monster@哀号：“我没想杀任何人！我不是凶手！”\n\n@The_monster@问道：“结束了吗？我现在能醒来了吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“可怖的存在啊，你的意志已然实现。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:jorgrun"
msgid "@_Jorgrun_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Jorgrun_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Jorgrun_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Jorgrun_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_jorgrun_common_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"May tha earth consume ye!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"'tis place shall be yer tomb!\"\n\n@The_monster@ mutters some incantations to @reflexive@.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“让大地吞了恁！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“这儿就是恁的坟！”\n\n@The_monster@对@reflexive@低声念起咒语。\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_jorgrun_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Tha earth be me home, an' ye be trespassing!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Yer just na down-ta-earth enough.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I've ne'er se'n tha particular type o' rock formation 'fore.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"A few more walls knocked out 'ere an' thar an' 'tis whole place will come crashin' down.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“大地是俺的家，恁擅闯进来了！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“恁就是不够脚踏实地。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“俺以前从没见过那种岩层。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“这儿那儿再敲掉几面墙，整个地方就全塌喽。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:silenced jory"
msgid "@_Jory_silent_@\n"
msgstr "@_Jory_silent_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:jory"
msgid "@_Jory_common_@\n"
msgstr "@_Jory_common_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_jory_common_"
msgid "w:50\n@_Jory_silent_@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Leave me alone!\"\n\n@The_monster@ hisses in an unknowable language.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Hawthorn can't hurt me.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Priests don't scare me.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Get out, get out, get out!\"\n\nw:2\n@The_monster@ says, \"My wife rejected me, but I had my revenge.\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_Jory_silent_@\n\n@The_monster@说道：“别烦我！”\n\n@The_monster@用一种无法理解的语言嘶声说着什么。\n\n@The_monster@说道：“山楂木伤不了我。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“祭司吓不倒我。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“滚出去，滚出去，滚出去！”\n\nw:2\n@The_monster@说道：“我妻子抛弃了我，不过我报了仇。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_jory_silent_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ gestures wildly at you. @player_only@\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ mockingly mimes being beheaded.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ stares carefully at you. @player_only@\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ swishes @possessive@ cloak stereotypically.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ frowns.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ is momentarily overtaken with rage!\n\nw:5\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ sheds a single tear.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ gestures rudely at you. @player_only@\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ smirks, showing shining fangs.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ demonstrates baring @possessive@ neck.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ hisses silently.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@朝你疯狂地比划。@player_only@\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@嘲弄地模仿着被砍头的样子。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@仔细地盯着你。@player_only@\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@摆出老套的姿势，甩动@possessive@披风。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@皱起眉头。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@一时怒不可遏！\n\nw:5\nVISUAL:@The_monster@落下一滴泪。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@朝你做了个粗鲁的手势。@player_only@\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@得意地笑着，露出闪亮的獠牙。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@示范着如何露出@possessive@脖子。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@无声地嘶叫。\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:jory killed"
msgid "@The_monster@ screams, \"No, no!\" before exploding into a cloud of blood!\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@尖叫道：“不，不！”随后炸成一团血雾！\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:silent jory killed"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ momentarily stares at you in horror, before exploding into a cloud of blood!\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@惊恐地盯了你一瞬，随后炸成一团血雾！\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:jory triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ screams, \"Yes, yes!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@尖叫道：“好，好！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:joseph"
msgid "@_Joseph_common_@\n\nw:2\n@_Joseph_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Joseph_common_@\n\nw:2\n@_Joseph_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_joseph_common_"
msgid "w:20\n@_mercenary_guard_@\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ smiles happily.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ tries to grin evilly.\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I'm happy to see you. And I'll be happy to kill you.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I've waited for this moment for such a long time.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"It's nothing personal, but I have to kill you.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You will never get the ORB, sorry.\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"I love to fight! I love killing!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I'm here to kill trespassers. I like my job.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You must be punished! Or... I want to punish you!\"\n"
msgstr "w:20\n@_mercenary_guard_@\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@开心地笑了。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@试着露出邪恶的笑容。\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“见到你很高兴。杀了你，我也会很高兴。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“这一刻，我已经等了很久。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“我跟你无冤无仇，可我得杀了你。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“抱歉，你永远也拿不到宝珠。”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@大喊道：“我爱打架！我爱杀戮！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“我在这里杀擅闯者。我喜欢这份工作。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“你必须受罚！或者说……我想惩罚你！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_joseph_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"At last, some action!\"\n\n@The_monster@ sighs @at_foe@, \"Being a guard is usually so boring...\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"Wow!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@朝@at_foe@大喊道：“终于能活动活动了！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@叹息道：“当守卫通常实在无聊……”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@大喊道：“哇！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:josephina"
msgid "@_Josephina_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Josephina_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Josephina_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Josephina_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_josephina_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ grins evilly.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ grins malevolently.\n\n@The_monster@ laughs insanely.\n\n@The_monster@ lets out a long cackle.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ glitters frostily.\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Die!\"\n\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@邪恶地咧嘴笑了。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@恶毒地咧嘴笑了。\n\n@The_monster@疯狂地大笑。\n\n@The_monster@发出一阵悠长的怪笑。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@闪着冰霜般的光。\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“死吧！”\n\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_josephina_rare_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ grinds @possessive@ teeth.\n\nVISUAL:One of @the_monster_possessive@ icy fingers falls off.\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I'll make a rug of your skin.\"\n\n@The_monster@ howls, \"Hell holds no secrets from me!\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"You can't hurt me! Ice reforms...\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams, \"I will never die! I am immortal!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"I'll use your head as a decoration in Hell!\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@咬得@possessive@牙齿咯咯作响。\n\nVISUAL:@the_monster_possessive@一根冰手指掉了下来。\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“我要用你的皮做地毯。”\n\n@The_monster@嚎叫：“地狱对我而言毫无秘密！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@大喊道：“你伤不了我！寒冰会重塑……”\n\n@The_monster@尖叫道：“我永远不会死！我是不朽的！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“我要拿你的脑袋装点地狱！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:josephine"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ grins evilly.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ grins malevolently.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ grinds @possessive@ teeth.\n\n@The_monster@ laughs insanely.\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I'll make a rug of your skin.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"How about some decapitation?\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Die!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"I have something special for you.\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"I'll use your head as a decoration in my hut!\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@邪恶地咧嘴笑了。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@恶毒地咧嘴笑了。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@咬得@possessive@牙齿咯咯作响。\n\n@The_monster@疯狂地大笑。\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“我要用你的皮做地毯。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“砍个头怎么样？”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“死吧！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“我为你准备了特别的东西。”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“我要拿你的脑袋装点我的小屋！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:khufu"
msgid "@The_monster@ booms, \"Everyone will worship Khufu but you!\"\n\n@The_monster@ declares, \"When I'm finished with you, I will take on the gods!\"\n\n@The_monster@ queries, \"My people built me a pyramid - what did your people build for you?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"This hit and run is way beneath me.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I am transcendence, you are transpiration.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Your corpse would blemish any mausoleum.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You'll be the most ugly mummy ever seen.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I follow the Polar star.\"\n\n@The_monster@ yells @to_foe@, \"Into the Nile with you!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@洪声说道：“除了你，所有人都会崇拜胡夫！”\n\n@The_monster@宣告：“收拾完你，我就去挑战众神！”\n\n@The_monster@问道：“我的子民为我建了金字塔——你的子民为你建了什么？”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“这种打了就跑的把戏，实在有失我的身份。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我超凡入圣，你汗流浃背。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“你的尸体放进哪座陵墓都是污点。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“你会成为有史以来最丑的木乃伊。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我追随北极星。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@大喊道：“给我滚进尼罗河！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:kirke"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ splashes a potion @at_foe@.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ throws some [strange|weird|mysterious] powder @at_foe@.\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Odis was a nice man; you're awful.\"\n\n@The_monster@ holds @possessive@ sides and says @to_foe@, \"You'll eat dirt beneath my feet.\"\n\n@The_monster@ whispers @to_foe@, \"Not even holy moly will save you.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Can we stop fighting? I have some good wine for you...\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"You pig! I'll make you look the way you deserve.\"\n\n@The_monster@ whispers @to_foe@, \"You'd look cute with a curly little tail.\"\n\n@The_monster@ whispers @to_foe@, \"No @player_genus@ can resist me...\"\n\n@_wizard_common_spell_@\n\n@_fake_spell_effect_@\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@朝@at_foe@泼洒药水。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@朝@at_foe@撒出一些[古怪|奇异|神秘]的粉末。\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“奥迪斯是个好男人；你可糟透了。”\n\n@The_monster@捂着@possessive@两肋，对@to_foe@说道：“你会啃食我脚下的泥土。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@低语道：“就连神草也救不了你。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“能别打了吗？我这里有好酒给你……”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@大喊道：“你这头猪！我要把你变成你该有的样子。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@低语道：“你要是长条卷卷的小尾巴，一定很可爱。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@低语道：“没有@player_genus@能抗拒我……”\n\n@_wizard_common_spell_@\n\n@_fake_spell_effect_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:lodul"
msgid "@_Lodul_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Lodul_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Lodul_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Lodul_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_lodul_common_"
msgid "@The_monster@ lets out a whooping war cry.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ jingles a heavy purse and winks.\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"Intruder!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I guard Vaults good! You no get in!\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ stamps @possessive@ feet.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@发出一声激昂的战吼。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@晃得沉甸甸的钱袋叮当作响，眨了眨眼。\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@大喊道：“入侵者！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“俺把宝库守得好！你进不去！”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@跺了跺@possessive@脚。\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_lodul_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Work for me? I pay good.\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"Taste the thunder!\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ adjusts @possessive@ apparatus.\n\n@The_monster@ shouts, \"Zap! Ha ha ha, made you jump.\"\n\n@The_monster@ roars, \"I Iron Bound! You Brass... Trash!\"\n\n@The_monster@ grins wickedly and says, \"Money make world go round.\"\n\n@The_monster@ winks @at_foe@ and says, \"Everything have price.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"All wealth is product of labour.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Productive ogre is happy ogre.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I proud of my employees.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Lodul motto: Secure Vault? My fault!\"\n\n@The_monster@ frowns @at_foe@ and says, \"You violating area security.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“给俺干活？俺出价高。”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@大喊道：“尝尝雷霆！”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@调整着@possessive@装置。\n\n@The_monster@大喊道：“电！哈哈哈，吓得你蹦起来了。”\n\n@The_monster@咆哮：“俺是铁缚！你是黄铜……废铜！”\n\n@The_monster@邪恶地咧嘴笑道：“钱能使世界转。”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@眨眨眼，说道：“万物都有价。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“一切财富都是劳动的产物。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“爱干活的食人魔才是快乐的食人魔。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“俺为俺的雇员骄傲。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“洛杜尔的口号：宝库守得牢，功劳少不了！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@皱眉说道：“你违反区域安全规定了。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:louise"
msgid "@_Louise_common_@\n\nw:2\n@_Louise_rare_@\n\n"
msgstr "@_Louise_common_@\n\nw:2\n@_Louise_rare_@\n\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_louise_common_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Want to take a trip?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Even the Abyss couldn't kill me! What makes you think you can?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Powers from beyond reality are at my beck and call!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Need a shortcut to the ORB? Here, let me help!\"\n\n@The_monster@ gibbers incoherently.\n\n@The_monster@ screams!\n\n@The_monster@ laughs uncontrollably.\n\n@The_monster@ begins to sob.\n\n@The_monster@ asks, \"Why won't you be my friend?\"\n\n@_wizard_common_spell_@\n@_fake_spell_effect_@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“想出去玩一趟吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“连深渊都杀不了我！你凭什么觉得你能？”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“现实之外的力量都听我号令！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“想抄近路去拿宝珠？来，让我帮你！”\n\n@The_monster@语无伦次地胡言乱语。\n\n@The_monster@尖叫起来！\n\n@The_monster@笑得停不下来。\n\n@The_monster@开始啜泣。\n\n@The_monster@问道：“你为什么不肯做我的朋友？”\n\n@_wizard_common_spell_@\n@_fake_spell_effect_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_louise_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"I'm not feeling very well...\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Who do you take me for, some common mercenary?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"It's the perfect time of year for a holiday!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“我感觉不太舒服……”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“你把我当什么人，普通佣兵吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“这个时节最适合度假了！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:louise banished"
msgid "__NONE\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@ says, \"I've come back once... I'll do it again!\"\n"
msgstr "__NONE\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@说道：“我已经回来过一次……我还会回来的！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:maggie"
msgid "@_Maggie_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Maggie_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Maggie_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Maggie_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_maggie_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ practices a pose.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ smiles, but it's obviously fake.\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Leave now, and tell all of Maggie's mercy!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Fear not. I will immortalise you in the tale of my first kill.\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ gives @reflexive@ a magical halo, but it quickly sputters out.\n\n@The_monster@ mumbles the words to a spell, but in the wrong order.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@练习着一个姿势。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@笑了，可那笑容明显是装的。\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“现在就走，把玛姬的仁慈告诉所有人！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“别怕。我会在首次杀敌的故事中，让你名垂不朽。”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@给@reflexive@变出一道魔法光环，可光环很快就闪烁着熄灭了。\n\n@The_monster@含糊地念着咒语，却把顺序念错了。\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_maggie_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"If you die in the Dungeon, but nobody's around to see it, does it really matter?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Did Master Lance send you?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Have you seen any dragons?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"How do the people who live here stand the isolation?\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"Leave me alone!\"\n\n@The_monster@ mutters to @reflexive@, \"Master Lance won't take me back. This is the way forward.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“死在地下城里，却没人看见，这死还有意义吗？”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“是兰斯师父派你来的吗？”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“你见到过龙吗？”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“住在这里的人，怎么受得了与世隔绝？”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@大喊道：“别烦我！”\n\n@The_monster@对@reflexive@嘟囔道：“兰斯师父不会再收留我了。我只能继续往前走。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:mara"
msgid "@_Mara_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Mara_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Mara_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Mara_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_mara_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ face changes twice.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I mislead the hearts of men!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"What good are steel and magic against my illusions?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Entranced by some poetic flight, are you?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Bound art thou by all the snares!\"\n\n@The_monster@ growls.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ gestures.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ points ostentatiously.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ weaves an illusion.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@面孔变换了两次。\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我迷惑世人的心！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“面对我的幻象，刀剑与魔法又有何用？”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“你也沉醉在诗意的幻想里了吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“你已被重重罗网缚住！”\n\n@The_monster@低吼起来。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@做了个手势。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@煞有介事地伸手指点。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@编织出一个幻象。\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_mara_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ screams, \"Tenfold be your damnation!\"\n\n@The_monster_possessive@ features momentarily become yours. \"Wouldst slay thyself?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I stand as high above you as a star above the ocean's bottom.\"\n\n@The_monster@ smirks. \"I am one who seeks the Path and the Right.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Thou art lean, ill-favoured, death is in thy neighbourhood!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Difficult is the way of exertion, difficult to pass, difficult to enter upon.\"\n\n@The_monster@ calls, \"Stop! In seven days from now the wheel of empire will appear!\"\n\n@The_monster@ boasts, \"I am lord over the four continents and the two thousand adjacent isles.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@尖叫道：“愿你承受十倍的诅咒！”\n\n@The_monster_possessive@面容短暂地变成了你的模样，说道：“你要杀死自己吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我凌驾于你之上，如星辰高悬于海底。”\n\n@The_monster@得意地笑道：“我是求道求正之人。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“你形容枯槁，面容憔悴，死神已在近旁！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“精进之道艰难，难以越过，亦难以踏入。”\n\n@The_monster@呼喊：“且慢！七日之后，帝王之轮便会显现！”\n\n@The_monster@夸口说道：“我是四大洲及两千附属岛屿的主宰。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:mara riddle"
msgid "@The_monster@ smirks. \"I shall give thine eyesight a greater riddle by far.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@得意地笑道：“我会让你的双眼面对远为难解的谜题。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:margery"
msgid "@_Margery_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Margery_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Margery_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Margery_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_spell_colour_"
msgid "red\n\nblue\n\ngreen\n"
msgstr "红\n\n蓝\n\n绿\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_margery_spell_results_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ is surrounded with an aura of power.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ becomes transparent for a moment.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ hands start to glow.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:一道力量的光环笼罩着@The_monster@。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@短暂地变得透明。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@双手开始发光。\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_margery_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ gestures.\n@_Margery_spell_results_@\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ eyes start to glow with a @_spell_colour_@ light.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ gestures.\nVISUAL:You feel [cursed|doomed].\n\nw:5\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ throws some purple powder towards you.\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Die!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"You must be punished!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"You can't withstand my power!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"All trespassers must die!\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@做了个手势。\n@_Margery_spell_results_@\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@双眼开始泛起@_spell_colour_@光。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@做了个手势。\nVISUAL:你感到[遭了诅咒|在劫难逃]。\n\nw:5\nVISUAL:@The_monster@朝你撒出一些紫色粉末。\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“死吧！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“你必须受罚！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“你抵挡不了我的力量！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“擅闯者都得死！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_margery_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Ergichanteg reztahaw!\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ looks very self-confident.\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You are dead.\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"You'll have to get past me!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"You are doomed!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Nothing can help you.\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Death is my middle name!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"I've slain countless dragons!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams, \"The ORB is only a tale, but I will kill you anyway!\" @player_only@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“厄吉坎特格，雷兹塔豪！”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@显得极其自信。\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“你死定了。”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“你得先过我这一关！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“你在劫难逃！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“什么也救不了你。”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“死亡就是我的代名词！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“我杀过无数条龙！”\n\n@The_monster@尖叫道：“宝珠不过是个传说，但我照样会杀了你！”@player_only@\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:maurice"
msgid "@_Maurice_common_@\n\nw:6\n@_Maurice_medium_@\n\nw:2\n@_Maurice_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Maurice_common_@\n\nw:6\n@_Maurice_medium_@\n\nw:2\n@_Maurice_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_maurice_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ tries to stalk through the shadows.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ lashes his vines and gnashes his teeth.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Nice gear. Can I borrow some?\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts, \"Mine, all mine!\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@试图潜行于阴影之中。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@甩动藤蔓，咬牙切齿。\n\n@The_monster@说道：“装备不错。能借我点吗？”\n\n@The_monster@大喊道：“我的，全是我的！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_maurice_medium_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ looks lost in thought, consulting taken memories.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Lost something?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Very interesting.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Have you got some gold to spare?\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@翻查窃来的记忆，仿佛陷入沉思。\n\n@The_monster@说道：“丢了什么东西吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“真有趣。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“有多余的金币吗？”\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_maurice_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Betcha didn't see that coming, eh?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says to @foe@, \"Money or life? Never mind, I think I'll take both.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Killing adventurers, taking their stuff. It's what he did, it's what I do.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“没料到吧，嗯？”\n\n@The_monster@对@foe@说道：“要钱还是要命？算了，我想两样都要。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“杀冒险者，拿走他们的东西。他以前这么干，我现在也这么干。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:maurice nonstealing"
msgid "@The_monster@ grunts, \"Curses!\"\n\n@The_monster@ mutters, \"Now where did you hide it?\"\n\n@The_monster@ groans, \"What are you, a monk?\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@哼道：“该死！”\n\n@The_monster@嘟囔道：“你到底把它藏哪儿了？”\n\n@The_monster@呻吟道：“你是什么人，武僧吗？”\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:maurice confused nonstealing"
msgid "w:70\n__NONE\n\n@The_monster@ clumsily fails to latch onto your valuables.\n\n@The_monster@ fumbles for your pockets and misses.\n\n@The_monster@ lunges for your pockets and trips.\n\nw:5\n@The_monster@ sings off-key, \"You got some money for me?\"\n"
msgstr "w:70\n__NONE\n\n@The_monster@笨手笨脚地试图攀住你的财物，却失败了。\n\n@The_monster@摸索着伸向你的口袋，却扑了个空。\n\n@The_monster@猛扑向你的口袋，却绊了一跤。\n\nw:5\n@The_monster@走调地唱道：“你有钱给我吗？”\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:menkaure"
msgid "@_Menkaure_common_@\n\nw:2\n@_Menkaure_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Menkaure_common_@\n\nw:2\n@_Menkaure_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_menkaure_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ bandages flutter.\n\n@The_monster@ @_Menkaure_verb_@ in an indecipherable tongue.\n\n@The_monster@ @_wails_@, \"Why can't you leave me to my rest?\"\n\n@The_monster@ giggles, \"These cerements are ticklish...\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_Menkaure_verb_@, \"Let me perform the rites...\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ breathes soot at you.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ blazes with dark energy!\n\n@The_monster@ @_Menkaure_verb_@ a few words.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ @_Menkaure_verb_@ drily.\n\n@The_monster@ @_Menkaure_verb_@, \"It doesn't hurt if you pull your brain out of your nose yourself.\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ grins.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@绷带飘动起来。\n\n@The_monster@用一种无法辨认的语言@_Menkaure_verb_@。\n\n@The_monster@@_wails_@道：“为什么就不能让我安息？”\n\n@The_monster@咯咯笑：“这身裹尸布弄得我好痒……”\n\n@The_monster@@_Menkaure_verb_@道：“让我举行仪式……”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@朝你吐出烟灰。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@迸发出黑暗能量！\n\n@The_monster@@_Menkaure_verb_@了几句话。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@干巴巴地@_Menkaure_verb_@。\n\n@The_monster@@_Menkaure_verb_@道：“要是自己把脑子从鼻孔里掏出来，就不会疼。”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@咧嘴一笑。\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_menkaure_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster_possessive@ ankle releases a plume of dust as @subjective@ confides, \"I'm not really a mummy, you know.\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ forgets how to speak, silenced by the ages.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ gestures ominously @at_foe@.\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"You disturbed my rest! Die!\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_Menkaure_verb_@ @to_foe@, \"From dust you came, to dust you will return.\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"The sands of time shall wipe you from history!\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"The curse of the Pharaohs be upon you!\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ draws the symbol \"Udjat\" in the dust.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster_possessive@脚踝扬起一缕尘土，@subjective@悄声说道：“其实我不是木乃伊，你知道吗？”\n\nVISUAL:漫长岁月让@The_monster@忘了如何说话，陷入沉默。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@朝@at_foe@做出不祥的手势。\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@大喊道：“你打扰了我的安眠！死吧！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@@_Menkaure_verb_@道：“你从尘土而来，也将归于尘土。”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@大喊道：“时间之沙将把你从历史中抹去！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@大喊道：“愿法老的诅咒降临你身！”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@在尘土中画出“荷鲁斯之眼”的符号。\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_menkaure_verb_"
msgid "hums\n\nmurmurs\n\nsighs\n\nmumbles\n\nrustles\n\nwhispers\n"
msgstr "哼唱\n\n低吟\n\n叹息\n\n嘟囔\n\n窸窣作声\n\n低语\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:default mennas"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ gestures at you. @player_only@\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ looks to the heavens.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ shakes @possessive@ head sadly.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ is caught in a moment of prayer.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@朝你做了个手势。@player_only@\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@仰望天空。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@悲伤地摇了摇@possessive@头。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@一时沉浸在祈祷中。\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:murray"
msgid "@_Murray_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Murray_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Murray_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Murray_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_murray_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ rolls in a circle.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ rolls around.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ spins like a top.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ grins evilly.\n\n@The_monster@ laughs evilly.\n\n@The_monster_possessive@ teeth chatter loudly.\n\n@The_monster@ cackles @at_foe@, \"I will rule the world!\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@滚了一圈。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@四处滚动。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@像陀螺一样旋转。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@邪恶地咧嘴笑了。\n\n@The_monster@邪恶地大笑。\n\n@The_monster_possessive@牙齿大声打战。\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@怪笑道：“我将统治世界！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_murray_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You're the second biggest fool I've ever met!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"If I had legs, you would be dead twenty times over!\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"Give me your head, so I can impale it on a pike!\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"Let the forces of evil and voodoo overcome you!\"\n\n@The_monster@ yells @at_foe@, \"I'm a mighty demonic power!\"\n\n@The_monster@ yells @at_foe@, \"My visage is famous all over the dungeon!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“你是我见过第二蠢的家伙！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“要是我有腿，你早死二十回了！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@大喊道：“把脑袋给我，好让我插到长矛上！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@大喊道：“让邪恶与巫毒的力量吞没你！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@叫喊道：“我是强大的恶魔之力！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@叫喊道：“我的面容在整个地下城都很有名！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-22; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:silenced murray"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ rolls in a circle.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ rolls around.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ spins like a top.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ grins evilly.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ seems to say something.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ says something you can't hear. It was probably not a compliment. @player_only@\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@滚了一圈。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@四处滚动。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@像陀螺一样旋转。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@邪恶地咧嘴笑了。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@似乎说了什么。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@说了些什么，你听不见。大概不是什么好话。@player_only@\n"


#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:natasha"
msgid "@_Natasha_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Natasha_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Natasha_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Natasha_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_natasha_common_"
msgid "@_wizard_common_spell_@\n@_fake_spell_effect_@\n"
msgstr "@_wizard_common_spell_@\n@_fake_spell_effect_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_natasha_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ hisses @at_foe@.\n\n@The_monster@ growls @at_foe@.\n\n@The_monster@ mewls in sadness.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ extends @possessive@ claws.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@朝@at_foe@嘶叫。\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@低吼。\n\n@The_monster@悲伤地呜咽。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@伸出@possessive@利爪。\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:friendly natasha"
msgid "@The_monster@ meows.\n\n@The_monster@ purrs.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@喵喵叫。\n\n@The_monster@发出呼噜声。\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:natasha killed"
msgid "@_Natasha_death_common_@\n\nw:1\n@_Natasha_death_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Natasha_death_common_@\n\nw:1\n@_Natasha_death_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_natasha_death_common_"
msgid "@The_monster@ yowls pathetically as @subjective@ dies!\n\n@The_monster@ screams in fury as @subjective@ dies!\n\n@The_monster@ screams in pain as @subjective@ dies!\n\n@The_monster@ growls in agony!\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@可怜地哀叫着，@subjective@死去了！\n\n@The_monster@临死时，@subjective@愤怒地尖叫着！\n\n@The_monster@临死时，@subjective@痛苦地尖叫着！\n\n@The_monster@在剧痛中低吼！\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_natasha_death_rare_"
msgid "Suddenly @the_monster_possessive@ spirit rises from @possessive@ lifeless body.\n\nMoaning pathetically, @the_monster_possessive@ spirit plunges into the ground.\n\nYou hear a faint echoing roar filled with hate and sorrow!\n"
msgstr "突然，@the_monster_possessive@灵魂从@possessive@毫无生气的躯体中升起。\n\n@the_monster_possessive@灵魂可怜地哀吟着，钻入地下。\n\n你听见一声微弱而回荡的咆哮，充满仇恨与悲伤！\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:natasha permanently killed"
msgid "You feel @the_monster_possessive@ spirit has finally been put to rest.\n"
msgstr "你感到@the_monster_possessive@灵魂终于得到了安息。\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:confused natasha killed"
msgid "@Natasha killed@\n"
msgstr "@Natasha killed@\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:confused natasha permanently killed"
msgid "@Natasha permanently killed@\n"
msgstr "@Natasha permanently killed@\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:natasha triumphant"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ curls up and begins to purr.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ begins licking @possessive@ fur clean.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@蜷起身子，开始发出呼噜声。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@开始舔净@possessive@毛。\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:robin"
msgid "@_Robin_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Robin_rare_@\n\n"
msgstr "@_Robin_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Robin_rare_@\n\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_robin_common_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Kneel, worm!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"My army is invincible!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Feeling lonely?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Duck!\"\n\n@The_monster@ laughs in a distinctly smug fashion.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ bangles clink loudly.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ horned helmet rattles.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ flexes a bicep menacingly.\n\n@The_monster@ points @at_foe@. \"Kill!\"\n\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“跪下，虫子！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我的大军天下无敌！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“觉得孤单吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“趴下！”\n\n@The_monster@笑得格外得意。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@手镯叮当作响。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@角盔咔嗒作响。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@威胁地鼓起二头肌。\n\n@The_monster@指着@at_foe@说道：“杀！”\n\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_robin_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"A pitiful @player_genus@ like you will never find the ORB!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Bow before me, strongest of all the hobgoblins!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"My goblins will feast on your bones.\"\n\nw:2\n@The_monster@ says, \"We wiped out the hill dwarves - you're next!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“就凭你这种可怜的@player_genus@，永远也找不到宝珠！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“在我面前低头吧，我是最强壮的大地精！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我的地精会啃着你的骨头饱餐一顿。”\n\nw:2\n@The_monster@说道：“我们灭了丘陵矮人——下一个就是你！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:robin triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ lets out a smug laugh.\n\n@The_monster@ calls out, \"Let's celebrate! Time for a feast!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"And that's why I'm the boss.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@得意地笑出声来。\n\n@The_monster@高声喊道：“庆祝吧！开宴了！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“所以我才是老大。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:nellie"
msgid "@_Nellie_common_@\n\nw:2\n@_Nellie_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Nellie_common_@\n\nw:2\n@_Nellie_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_nellie_common_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Can you balance on a beach ball? I can!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Circuses are really nothing more than prisons.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I won't go back, never!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I'll never walk a tight-rope again!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Don't worry about being fed to the lions. Worry about being fed to me.\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ stomps the ground.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ stares at you suspiciously.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ flaps @possessive@ ears in an attempt at flight.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“你能站在沙滩球上保持平衡吗？我能！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“马戏团说到底不过是监狱。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我不会回去，永远不会！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我再也不走钢丝了！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“别担心被喂给狮子。担心被喂给我吧。”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@重重地跺着地面。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@疑心重重地盯着你。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@扇动@possessive@耳朵，试图飞起来。\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_nellie_rare_"
msgid "w:2\n@The_monster@ says, \"Do you know Lommy? A good friend!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I trampled a caravan once.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"No, I don't have a problem with mice.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I think I remember you...\"\n"
msgstr "w:2\n@The_monster@说道：“你认识洛米吗？是个好朋友！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我曾踩平过一支商队。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“不，我不怕老鼠。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我想，我还记得你……”\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:nergalle"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"You have no idea what it means to truly have nothing. We will teach you.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I've lived long enough to see a hundred people like you fail.\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ consults an enormous parchment and nods.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ engages in an animated conversation with the air beside @objective@.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Orcish loyalty transcends such trifles as death.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Take it from an old woman: your time is up.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You'll be just another bloodstain on the stones of this place.\"\n\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“你根本不知道什么叫真正的一无所有。我们会教你。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我活得够久了，见过上百个你这样的家伙失败。”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@查阅着一张巨大的羊皮纸，点了点头。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@与@objective@身旁的空气热烈交谈。\n\n@The_monster@说道：“兽人的忠诚超越死亡这等小事。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“听我这老太婆一句：你的时辰到了。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“你只会成为这里石头上的又一片血迹。”\n\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:confused nergalle"
msgid "@The_monster@ mutters, \"Now, where did I put that quill...\"\n\n@The_monster@ mumbles, \"Leave me be, @orc name@. I told you I'm busy...\"\n\n@The_monster@ mumbles, \"Stop that blasted singing, @orc name@. You were always terrible.\"\n\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@嘟囔道：“我把那支羽毛笔放哪儿了……”\n\n@The_monster@含糊地说道：“别烦我，@orc name@。我说了我很忙……”\n\n@The_monster@含糊地说道：“别唱那该死的歌了，@orc name@。你从来就唱得很糟。”\n\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:nessos"
msgid "@_Nessos_common_@\n\nw:3\n@_Nessos_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Nessos_common_@\n\nw:3\n@_Nessos_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_nessos_common_"
msgid "@The_monster@ pounds the earth with @possessive@ hooves.\n\n@The_monster@ intently looks at @foe@, slowly moving @possessive@ tail.\n\n@The_monster@ stands on @possessive@ hind legs for a moment.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@用@possessive@蹄足重重地踏着大地。\n\n@The_monster@专注地看着@foe@，缓缓摆动@possessive@尾巴。\n\n@The_monster@用@possessive@后腿短暂地站立起来。\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_nessos_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Study your classics!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I'll learn you. I'll learn you yet!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Even if you were a mare, I'd kill you!\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts, \"I'm half human! Half horse! And all stone-cold KILLER!\"\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@ says, \"Hold still for a moment, will you? I've got a trick shot I want to try here.\"\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@ says, \"I schooled the Big Guy. You'll be no problem.\"\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@ tries to tell @foe@ a complicated story about hydras, @possessive@ blood, and marriage.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“好好读读你的古典名著！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我来教训你。我会好好教训你！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“就算你是匹母马，我也照杀！”\n\n@The_monster@大喊道：“我一半是人！一半是马！却是十足的冷血杀手！”\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@说道：“能站着别动一会儿吗？我想试试一手花式射击。”\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@说道：“大英雄都被我收拾了。你不成问题。”\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@试图给@foe@讲一个关于海德拉、@possessive@鲜血与婚姻的复杂故事。\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:nikola"
msgid "@The_monster@ yells, \"Danger! Danger! High voltage!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"There's a spark of magic in your eyes.\"\n\n@The_monster@ raves, \"Can you feel it? Can you feel it? CAN YOU FEEL IT?\"\n\n@The_monster@ warns, \"If you see one of my golems, approach with caution, they bite.\"\n\n@The_monster@ asks, \"Are you insulated?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You don't look like a good insulator.\"\n\n@The_monster@ mumbles, \"Hm, I wonder if you're conductive.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@大喊：“危险！危险！高压电！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“你的眼里闪着魔法的电火花。”\n\n@The_monster@狂叫：“感觉到了吗？感觉到了吗？你感觉到了吗？”\n\n@The_monster@警告：“要是看见我的魔像，靠近时小心点，它们会咬人。”\n\n@The_monster@问道：“你绝缘吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“你看着不像什么好绝缘体。”\n\n@The_monster@含糊地说道：“嗯，不知道你导不导电。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:nobody"
msgid "@The_monster@ rasps, \"Tell us... who... we are....\"\n\n@The_monster@ growls, \"Give us... back... our names!\"\n\n@The_monster@ rasps, \"We... will be... remembered!\"\n\n@The_monster@ mutters, \"Why... can't we remember...?\"\n\n@The_monster@ rasps, \"We were once... so many....\"\n\n@The_monster@ rasps, \"The flames... keep going out....\"\n\nw:50\n__NONE\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@嘶哑地说道：“告诉我们……我们……是谁……”\n\n@The_monster@低吼道：“把我们的……名字……还回来！”\n\n@The_monster@嘶哑地说道：“我们……会被……铭记！”\n\n@The_monster@嘟囔道：“为什么……我们想不起来……？”\n\n@The_monster@嘶哑地说道：“我们曾经……有那么多人……”\n\n@The_monster@嘶哑地说道：“火焰……总是在熄灭……”\n\nw:50\n__NONE\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:nobody triumph"
msgid "@The_monster@ rasps, \"Now... you are also... Nobody.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@嘶哑地说道：“如今……你也成了……无名氏。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:nobody killed"
msgid "As they crumble to ash, @The_monster@ whispers, \"You will also be forgotten....\"\n"
msgstr "化为灰烬之际，@The_monster@低语道：“你也会被遗忘……”\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:nobody_recollection fire"
msgid "a terrible drought\n\ndying of thirst\n\nfields ablaze\n\nsmoke... everywhere\n"
msgstr "可怕的旱灾\n\n渴死\n\n燃烧的田野\n\n烟……无处不在\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:nobody_recollection cold"
msgid "a winter without end\n\nshivering with cold\n\nour fingers... freezing\n\nice in our veins\n"
msgstr "没有尽头的冬天\n\n冻得发抖\n\n我们的手指……冻僵了\n\n血管里的冰\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:nobody_recollection xxx"
msgid "our flesh being taken\n\na horrific experiment\n\na terrible sin\n"
msgstr "我们的血肉被夺走\n\n可怕的实验\n\n滔天罪孽\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:nobody_recollection undead"
msgid "the grave\n\nhands dragging us downward\n\nthe wailing of the dead\n"
msgstr "坟墓\n\n把我们拖向下方的双手\n\n亡者的哀号\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:nobody_recollection soldiers"
msgid "steel... clashing\n\nan army like a tide\n\niron and smoke\n\nblood and fire\n"
msgstr "钢铁……交击\n\n潮水般的大军\n\n钢铁与硝烟\n\n鲜血与烈火\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:nobody_recollection rockslide"
msgid "the weight of a mountain atop us\n\na rockslide like thunder\n\nbones breaking beneath stone\n"
msgstr "一座山压在我们身上的重量\n\n雷鸣般的山崩\n\n岩石下断裂的骨头\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:nobody_recollection electricity"
msgid "a terrible numbness\n\nour heart stopping\n\nthe sky cracking open\n"
msgstr "可怕的麻木感\n\n我们的心脏停止跳动\n\n天空骤然裂开\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:nobody_recollection poison"
msgid "our flesh... melting\n\nrivers of blight\n\na well... tainted with poison\n"
msgstr "我们的血肉……融化了\n\n灾疫之河\n\n一口井……被毒污染\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:nobody_recollection fear"
msgid "running... falling\n\ncowering in terror\n"
msgstr "奔跑……跌倒\n\n惊恐地蜷缩\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:nobody_recollection vermin"
msgid "plague and pestilence\n\nbeing eaten by rats\n\nfamine\n"
msgstr "瘟疫与疫病\n\n被老鼠啃食\n\n饥荒\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:nobody_recollection demons"
msgid "dark magic\n\ndemonic laughter\n\ntorment and damnation\n"
msgstr "黑暗魔法\n\n恶魔的笑声\n\n折磨与诅咒\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:norris"
msgid "@_Norris_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Norris_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Norris_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Norris_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_norris_common_"
msgid "@The_monster@ mumbles some mantras.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ is surrounded with an aura of peace.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ smiles @at_foe@.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ looks relaxed.\n\n@The_monster@ sings, \"Peace now, freedom now! Peace now, freedom now!\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_Norris_verb_@ @to_foe@, \"Life is just suffering. I'll help you.\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_Norris_verb_@ @to_foe@, \"Rejoin the cosmic current!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Sometimes it's better to sink than to swim.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Breathe deeply.\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_Norris_verb_@ @to_foe@, \"Peace! I bring you eternal peace!\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_Norris_verb_@ @to_foe@, \"Let the waves take you.\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_Norris_verb_@ @to_foe@, \"Just go with the flow.\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_Norris_verb_@ @to_foe@, \"Why delay the inevitable?\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_Norris_verb_@ @to_foe@, \"Catch the small wave before chasing the big one.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@低声念诵着真言。\n\nVISUAL:一道祥和的光环笼罩着@The_monster@。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@朝@at_foe@微笑。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@显得很放松。\n\n@The_monster@唱道：“此刻和平，此刻自由！此刻和平，此刻自由！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@@_Norris_verb_@道：“人生皆苦。我来帮你。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@@_Norris_verb_@道：“重归宇宙的洪流吧！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“有时，沉下去比游起来更好。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“深呼吸。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@@_Norris_verb_@道：“安宁！我带给你永恒的安宁！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@@_Norris_verb_@道：“让波涛带走你。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@@_Norris_verb_@道：“随波逐流就好。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@@_Norris_verb_@道：“何必拖延必然之事？”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@@_Norris_verb_@道：“先追上小浪，再去追逐大浪。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_norris_rare_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ looks very balanced.\n\n@The_monster@ asks, \"Have you seen my surfboard?\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_Norris_verb_@, \"I think I should really try dying once.\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_Norris_verb_@ @to_foe@, \"Aren't you the least bit curious about what happens next?\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_Norris_verb_@ @to_foe@, \"The universe is like a big fish.\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_Norris_verb_@, \"Wisdom is knowing when to give up.\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_Norris_verb_@ @to_foe@, \"Only fools fear death. I embrace it.\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_Norris_verb_@ @to_foe@, \"After death you'll find inner peace.\"\n\n@The_monster@ wonders, \"Can you step in the same river twice?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Everything is water in the end.\"\n\n@The_monster@ sighs @at_foe@, \"Enlightenment is such responsibility.\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_Norris_verb_@ @to_foe@, \"Let's feed the skysharks together.\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_Norris_verb_@ @to_foe@, \"We're all made of gods.\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@显得十分平和。\n\n@The_monster@问道：“你见到我的冲浪板了吗？”\n\n@The_monster@@_Norris_verb_@道：“我想，我真该试着死一回。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@@_Norris_verb_@道：“你对接下来会发生什么，一点也不好奇吗？”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@@_Norris_verb_@道：“宇宙就像一条大鱼。”\n\n@The_monster@@_Norris_verb_@道：“智慧就是知道何时放弃。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@@_Norris_verb_@道：“只有傻瓜才怕死。我拥抱死亡。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@@_Norris_verb_@道：“死后，你会找到内心的平静。”\n\n@The_monster@疑惑地说道：“人能两次踏进同一条河吗？”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“万物最终都是水。”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@叹息道：“开悟意味着如此重大的责任。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@@_Norris_verb_@道：“让我们一起去喂天空鲨鱼吧。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@@_Norris_verb_@道：“我们都是由神组成的。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_norris_verb_"
msgid "hums\n\nlaughs\n\nmurmurs\n\nsoftly says\n\nsighs\n\nmumbles\n\nabsently says\n\nwhispers\n\n"
msgstr "哼唱\n\n笑着说\n\n低吟\n\n轻声说\n\n叹息\n\n嘟囔\n\n漫不经心地说\n\n低语\n\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:norris triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Ooh, I'm jealous!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Enjoy eternity.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I'll see you on the other side, friend.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“哦，我真嫉妒你！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“好好享受永恒吧。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“另一边再见，朋友。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:pikel"
msgid "@_Pikel_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Pikel_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Pikel_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Pikel_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_pikel_common_"
msgid "@The_monster@ cracks @possessive@ whip.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Hell isn't that bad.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You'll make a fine lemure.\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You'll feel the lick of my whip!\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ waves @possessive@ whip at you.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@甩响@possessive@鞭子。\n\n@The_monster@说道：“地狱也没那么糟。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“你会成为一只不错的勒穆尔。”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“你会尝到我的鞭子的滋味！”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@朝你挥舞@possessive@鞭子。\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_pikel_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"You'll rot in Tartarus!\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You'll burn in Gehenna!\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You'll freeze in Cocytus!\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"You'll rust in Dis!\" @player_only@\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ checks @possessive@ coin pouch and frowns.\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Time is money, and you're costing me too much!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"It's all about the gold, really.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I just want to get paid!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I'm sure they'll be treated well, anyway.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I'm sure the Orcish Mines are around here somewhere...\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I knew I should've brought a map.\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ scowls and wipes @possessive@ hands on @possessive@ robe.\n\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"All the lords of Hell know my name!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"All the demons know me. They respect me.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Asmodeus and me are pals. He gave me this whip.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Don't tell anyone, but I think Ereshkigal likes me.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Antaeus said I was his favorite kobold. Me!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Dispater doesn't talk much, but I know they dig me.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I touched Geryon's horn once.\"\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@ says, \"Word to the wise: Murray's a real chatterbox.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“你会在塔尔塔罗斯腐烂！”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@说道：“你会在欣嫩谷燃烧！”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@说道：“你会在悲叹河冻僵！”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@说道：“你会在冥府锈蚀！”@player_only@\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@查看@possessive@钱袋，皱起眉头。\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“时间就是金钱，而你浪费我太多钱了！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“说到底，全是为了金币。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我只是想拿到钱！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“反正我相信他们会受到善待的。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“兽人矿井肯定就在这附近……”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我就知道该带张地图。”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@阴沉着脸，在@possessive@长袍上擦了擦@possessive@双手。\n\n\n@The_monster@说道：“地狱的领主都知道我的名字！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“所有恶魔都认识我。它们尊重我。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我和阿斯蒙蒂斯是哥们。这条鞭子就是他送的。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“别告诉别人，不过我觉得埃列什基伽勒喜欢我。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“安泰俄斯说我是他最喜欢的狗头人。就是我！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“迪斯帕特话不多，不过我知道人家挺欣赏我。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我有一回摸过革律翁的角。”\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@说道：“给你提个醒：莫瑞可真是个话痨。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:pikel triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Another soul for the market.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"See you in Hell!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“市场上又多了一个灵魂。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“地狱见！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:polyphemus"
msgid "@_Polyphemus_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Polyphemus_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Polyphemus_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Polyphemus_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_polyphemus_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ glares at @foe@ with @possessive@ lone eye.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ wildly rolls @possessive@ eye at @foe@.\n\n@The_monster@ @_shouts_@ loudly for @possessive@ pets to attack!\n\n@The_monster@ @_shouts_@ @at_foe@, \"You will make a great snack!\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_shouts_@, \"Attack, my pets! Attack!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Trying to escape from me is @_pointless_@!\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@用@possessive@独眼瞪着@foe@。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@朝@foe@疯狂地转动@possessive@独眼。\n\n@The_monster@@_shouts_@着，命令@possessive@宠物进攻！\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@@_shouts_@道：“你会是一份不错的点心！”\n\n@The_monster@@_shouts_@道：“进攻，我的宠物们！进攻！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“想逃出我的手掌心，简直@_pointless_@！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_polyphemus_rare_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ seems to be sizing @foe@ up for @possessive@ next meal.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ stomps at the @surface@ furiously.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ looks around for something heavy to throw at @foe@.\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Do you like to play 'catch'?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"@Foe_genus@ for dinner? Sounds delicious!\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@似乎正打量着@foe@，盘算@possessive@下一顿饭。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@愤怒地跺着@surface@。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@四处寻找重物，好砸向@foe@。\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“你喜欢玩“接球”吗？”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“晚饭吃@Foe_genus@？听起来很美味！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:polyphemus killed"
msgid "w:50\n__NONE\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@ bellows, \"You've tricked me!\"\n"
msgstr "w:50\n__NONE\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@怒号：“你骗了我！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:polyphemus triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"You're nobody.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“你什么都不是。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:prince ribbit"
msgid "@_Prince_Ribbit_common_@\n\nw:2\n@_Prince_Ribbit_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Prince_Ribbit_common_@\n\nw:2\n@_Prince_Ribbit_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_prince_ribbit_common_"
msgid "@The_monster@ croaks regally.\n\n@The_monster@ lets out a mournful croak.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ hops awkwardly around.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ catches a @_frog_food_@ with @possessive@ tongue.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@威严地呱叫。\n\n@The_monster@发出一声哀伤的呱叫。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@笨拙地跳来跳去。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@用@possessive@舌头捉住一只@_frog_food_@。\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_prince_ribbit_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ asks @foe,@ \"Just a little smooch?\"\n\n@The_monster@ sighs @at_foe@, \"It's not easy being green!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You're just another fly to me.\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ winks @at_foe@ and puckers @possessive@ lips.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@问@foe,@：“就轻轻亲一下？”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@叹息道：“浑身绿油油的可不容易！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“对我来说，你不过是另一只苍蝇。”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@朝@at_foe@眨了眨眼，噘起@possessive@嘴。\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_frog_food_"
msgid "fly\n\nw:5\nbutterfly\n\nmoth\n\nmosquito\n\nw:2\nspider\n\ncentipede\n\nmillipede\n\nw:1\nhornet\n\nsmall bird\n\nmouse\n\nbaby bat\n\nblue-tailed skink\n"
msgstr "苍蝇\n\nw:5\n蝴蝶\n\n蛾\n\n蚊子\n\nw:2\n蜘蛛\n\n蜈蚣\n\n马陆\n\nw:1\n大黄蜂\n\n小鸟\n\n老鼠\n\n小蝙蝠\n\n蓝尾石龙子\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:pargi"
msgid "@_Pargi_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Pargi_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Pargi_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Pargi_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_pargi_common_"
msgid "@The_monster@ snarls @at_foe@, \"Go! Away!\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ looks around nervously.\n\n@The_monster@ hisses menacingly.\n\n@The_monster@ snarls @at_foe@, \"My home! Leave!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@朝@at_foe@龇牙低吼道：“走！开！”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@紧张地四下张望。\n\n@The_monster@威胁地嘶叫。\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@龇牙低吼道：“俺的家！滚！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_pargi_rare_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ clenches @possessive@ teeth.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ clenches @possessive@ claws.\n\n@The_monster@ hisses @at_foe@, \"I bite!\"\n\n@The_monster@ pleads @to_foe@, \"Don't hit me!\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ looks very sad for a moment.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@咬紧@possessive@牙关。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@攥紧@possessive@爪子。\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@嘶声说道：“俺会咬人！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@恳求道：“别打俺！”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@一时显得十分难过。\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:parghit"
msgid "@_Parghit_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Parghit_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Parghit_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Parghit_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_parghit_common_"
msgid "@The_monster@ snarls @at_foe@, \"Go! Away!\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ looks around cautiously.\n\n@The_monster@ hisses menacingly.\n\n@The_monster@ snarls @at_foe@, \"My dungeon! Leave!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@朝@at_foe@龇牙低吼道：“走！开！”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@谨慎地四下张望。\n\n@The_monster@威胁地嘶叫。\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@龇牙低吼道：“俺的地下城！滚！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-23; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_parghit_rare_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ clenches @possessive@ teeth.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ clenches @possessive@ claws.\n\n@The_monster@ hisses @at_foe@, \"I bite!\"\n\n@The_monster@ snarls, \"Me hang you on necklace!\"\n\n@The_monster@ warns @foe@, \"Me EAT bullies!\"\n\n@The_monster@ growls, \"You tougher than dragon?\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@咬紧@possessive@牙关。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@攥紧@possessive@爪子。\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@嘶声说道：“俺会咬人！”\n\n@The_monster@龇牙低吼：“俺把你挂在项链上！”\n\n@The_monster@警告@foe@道：“俺吃欺负人的家伙！”\n\n@The_monster@低吼道：“你比龙还硬？”\n"


#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:roxanne"
msgid "@_Roxanne_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Roxanne_medium_@\n\nw:1\n@_Roxanne_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Roxanne_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Roxanne_medium_@\n\nw:1\n@_Roxanne_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_roxanne_common_"
msgid "@The_monster@ mutters, \"When I said I wanted to live forever... this was not what I had in mind.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"At least I didn't end up somewhere with nobody to talk to.\"\n\n@The_monster@ wails, \"NOOOO!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Come nearer, honey, I don't have a heart of stone.\"\n\nw:20\n__NONE\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@嘟囔道：“我说想永远活下去时……想的可不是这样。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“至少我没落在一个连说话的人都没有的地方。”\n\n@The_monster@哀号：“不——！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“靠近点，亲爱的，我可没有铁石心肠。”\n\nw:20\n__NONE\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_roxanne_medium_"
msgid "@The_monster@ asks @foe,@ \"Could you be a darling and pick up this talisman for me?\"\n\n@The_monster@ asks @foe,@ \"Say, could you scratch my back for me?\"\n\n@The_monster@ sighs and says, \"It wouldn't be so bad were it not for the bird droppings.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@问@foe,@：“能行行好，帮我捡起这枚变形护符吗？”\n\n@The_monster@问@foe,@：“那个，能帮我挠挠背吗？”\n\n@The_monster@叹了口气，说道：“要不是那些鸟粪，也不至于这么糟。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_roxanne_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"I'd kick your ass right now if I could just get over there!\"\n\n@The_monster@ prays for a Stone to Flesh spell.\n\n@The_monster@ wonders, \"Maybe oil would work? Probably not.\"\n\n@The_monster@ states @to_foe@, \"You'll be worm food in some minutes, I'll endure [millennia|aeons].\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"A mighty warrior you might be, a mason you are not!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"They said I was crazy for my new talisman... Turns out they were right.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@朝@at_foe@大喊道：“只要能过去，我现在就踢烂你的屁股！”\n\n@The_monster@祈求能有个化石为肉的法术。\n\n@The_monster@疑惑地说道：“也许涂点油有用？多半没用。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“你几分钟后就会喂虫子，我却能熬过[千年|万古]。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“你也许是个强大的勇士，可你不是石匠！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“他们说我为这枚新变形护符疯了……结果他们说对了。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:roxanne blink_other_closer"
msgid "w:20\n__NONE\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Come a little closer, will you?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I keep my friends close, but my enemies closer.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Please, won't you take my hand.\"\n\nw:5\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Don't just stand there! You can move, can't you?\"\n"
msgstr "w:20\n__NONE\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“再靠近一点，好吗？”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我让朋友靠近，让敌人靠得更近。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“求你了，握住我的手吧。”\n\nw:5\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“别光站着！你能动，不是吗？”\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:rupert"
msgid "@_Rupert_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Rupert_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Rupert_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Rupert_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_rupert_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ flexes.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ pounds @possessive@ chest with @possessive@ fists.\n\nVISUAL:Sweat drips down @the_monster_possessive@ chest.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Strength rules this world!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You are weak.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I crush you like a bug!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I tear you limb from limb!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Killing you is giving me appetite.\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@鼓起肌肉。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@用@possessive@双拳捶打@possessive@胸膛。\n\nVISUAL:汗水顺着@the_monster_possessive@胸膛滴落。\n\n@The_monster@说道：“力量统治世界！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“你很弱。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我像碾虫子一样碾死你！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我把你四肢撕下来！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“杀你杀得我有点饿了。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_rupert_rare_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ does some quick breathing exercises.\n\n@The_monster@ asks, \"Why wear clothes with body like mine?\"\n\n@The_monster@ lets out a booming laugh, sending rocks and debris crashing down.\n\nw:3\n@The_monster@ flexes and says, \"Free ticket to bow show!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I stay hydrated... with blood of my enemies!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You look like me... when I was tiny, weak little boy.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Your skull will make great drinking cup.\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@做了几下快速的呼吸练习。\n\n@The_monster@问道：“有我这样的身材，还穿什么衣服？”\n\n@The_monster@放声大笑，震得碎石杂物纷纷坠落。\n\nw:3\n@The_monster@鼓起肌肉，说道：“免费来看肌肉秀！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我用敌人的血……补水！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“你看着像我……还是个弱小毛孩的时候。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“你的头骨会是个好酒杯。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:rupert triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ roars with triumph.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@得意地咆哮。\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:saint roka"
msgid "w:7\n@_Saint Roka generic_@\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Down here, you're an orc or you're nobody.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"In the orcish mines, orcs kill the likes of YOU!\"\n"
msgstr "w:7\n@_Saint Roka generic_@\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“在这里，不是兽人就什么也不是。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“在兽人矿井，兽人专杀你这样的家伙！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_saint roka generic_"
msgid "w:2\n@_generic_orc_speech_@\n\n@The_monster@ calls out, \"Orcs! Behind me!\"\n\n@The_monster@ calls out, \"Only Beogh rules here!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I shall smite you and smash you.\"\n\n@The_monster@ lets out a mighty war cry!\n\n@The_monster@ cries, \"Beogh give me strength!\"\n\n@The_monster@ cries, \"In the name of Beogh, DIE!\"\n"
msgstr "w:2\n@_generic_orc_speech_@\n\n@The_monster@高声喊道：“兽人们！站到我身后！”\n\n@The_monster@高声喊道：“这里唯有比欧弗为尊！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“我要神罚你，粉碎你。”\n\n@The_monster@发出一声雄壮的战吼！\n\n@The_monster@哭喊：“比欧弗赐我力量！”\n\n@The_monster@哭喊：“以比欧弗之名，受死！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:related saint roka"
msgid "@_Saint Roka generic_@\n\nw:2\n@The_monster@ calls out, \"Join me or die!\"\n"
msgstr "@_Saint Roka generic_@\n\nw:2\n@The_monster@高声喊道：“加入我，否则就死！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_saint roka rival_"
msgid "@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"You dare challenge my right as the Messiah?\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"There can only be one messiah: ME!\"\n\n@The_monster@ despairs @at_foe@, \"False prophets abound here!\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts, \"Orcs, take notice: this deceiver is a mere {{ return you.race() }}!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@朝@at_foe@大喊道：“你竟敢挑战我作为救世主的地位？”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@大喊道：“救世主只能有一个：就是我！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@绝望地喊道：“这里到处都是假先知！”\n\n@The_monster@喊道：“兽人们，看清楚了：这个骗子不过是个{{ return you.race() }}！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:related beogh saint roka"
msgid "w:20\n@related Saint Roka@\n\n@_hostile_orc_beogh_believer_speech_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_hostile_orc_beogh_believer_speech_rare_@\n\nw:5\n@_Saint Roka rival_@\n"
msgstr "w:20\n@related Saint Roka@\n\n@_hostile_orc_beogh_believer_speech_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_hostile_orc_beogh_believer_speech_rare_@\n\nw:5\n@_Saint Roka rival_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:saint roka triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ roars, \"Praise to Beogh!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@咆哮：“赞美比欧弗！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:sigmund"
msgid "@_Sigmund_common_@\n\nw:2\n@_Sigmund_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Sigmund_common_@\n\nw:2\n@_Sigmund_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_sigmund_common_"
msgid "w:20\n@The_monster@ laughs darkly.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ looks at you with fury.\n\n@The_monster@ flickers, as though insubstantial.\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Your kind have come here before. I understand now why. You desire death...\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Now you see me, now you don't...\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Don't worry, I'll kill you fast.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You will soon forget everything.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Look into my eyes.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I'm your fate.\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Die, monster!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Don't try to resist!\"\n\n@The_monster@ giggles. \"Time to reap what you sow.\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ eyes start glowing with a red light.\n\n@The_monster@ breathes a few words.\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ hands start flickering wildly.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ is suddenly surrounded by pale @_spell_colour_@ light.\n"
msgstr "w:20\n@The_monster@阴恻恻地笑了。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@愤怒地看着你。\n\n@The_monster@身形闪烁，仿佛没有实体。\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“以前也有你这样的人来过。我现在明白为什么了。你渴望死亡……”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“一会儿你看得见我，一会儿又看不见……”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“别担心，我会让你死得很快。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“你很快就会忘记一切。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“看着我的眼睛。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“我就是你的命运。”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“受死吧，怪物！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“别想抵抗！”\n\n@The_monster@咯咯笑道：“该自食其果了。”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@双眼开始泛起红光。\n\n@The_monster@轻声念了几句话。\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@双手开始疯狂地闪烁。\n\nVISUAL:淡淡的@_spell_colour_@光突然笼罩着@The_monster@。\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_sigmund_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ asks @foe,@ \"Do you like me?\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"You will never... NEVER!!!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"I am the angel of ZOT!!!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Only death can liberate you!\"\n\n@The_monster@ whispers @to_foe@, \"You'll know eternity soon.\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ smiles chillingly.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@问@foe,@：“你喜欢我吗？”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“你永远也不会……永远不会！！！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“我是佐特的天使！！！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“唯有死亡能解脱你！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@低语道：“你很快就会懂得永恒。”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@露出令人心寒的微笑。\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:sigmund triumphant"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ begins carving another notch in @possessive@ scythe.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@开始在@possessive@镰刀上再刻一道记号。\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:snorg"
msgid "@_Snorg_common_@\n\nw:2\n@_Snorg_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Snorg_common_@\n\nw:2\n@_Snorg_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_snorg_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ pats @possessive@ sizable gut.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ beckons gently.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ smiles kindly.\n\nVISUAL:A flash of anger passes briefly over @the_monster_possessive@ face.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ draws @possessive@ long claws delicately across @possessive@ gut.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@拍了拍@possessive@大肚子。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@温柔地招手。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@和善地微笑。\n\nVISUAL:@the_monster_possessive@脸上一闪而过一丝怒意。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@小心地用@possessive@长爪划过@possessive@肚皮。\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_snorg_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ remarks @to_foe@, \"Ah, I'm absolutely famished!\"\n\n@The_monster@ remarks @to_foe@, \"Ah, I could eat a centaur!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“啊，我真是饿坏了！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“啊，我能吃下一整只半人马！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:sojobo"
msgid "@_Sojobo_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Sojobo_rare_@\n\nw:2\n@_Sojobo_advice_@\n\n"
msgstr "@_Sojobo_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Sojobo_rare_@\n\nw:2\n@_Sojobo_advice_@\n\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_sojobo_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ strikes a fencing pose.\n\n@The_monster@ barks orders to @possessive@ subordinates.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ grins devilishly.\n\nThe air crackles briefly around @the_monster@.\n\nVISUAL:A brief shower of sparks shoots from @the_monster_possessive@ claws.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@摆出击剑的架势。\n\n@The_monster@向@possessive@部下厉声发号施令。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@露出邪气的笑容。\n\n@the_monster@周围的空气短暂地噼啪作响。\n\nVISUAL:@the_monster_possessive@利爪迸出一阵短促的电火花。\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_sojobo_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"This battle is not even a challenge!\"\n\n@The_monster@ barks @at_foe@, \"Your form is terrible!\"\n\n@The_monster@ sneers @at_foe@, \"There are one thousand and one flaws in your strategy!\"\n\nw:2\n@The_monster@ says, \"Like a bolt from the blue, I'll bring death to you.\"\n\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“这一战根本算不上挑战！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@厉声喝道：“你的架势糟透了！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@冷笑道：“你的战术有一千零一个破绽！”\n\nw:2\n@The_monster@说道：“如晴空霹雳，我将带给你死亡。”\n\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_sojobo_advice_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Appear weak when you are strong, and strong when you are weak.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Know thy enemy, and know thyself.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Let your plans be as dark and impenetrable as the night.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"All warfare is based on deception.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"The wise warrior avoids unnecessary battles.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"The whole secret lies in confusing the enemy.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Avoid what is strong, and strike at what is weak.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Attack is the secret of defence.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"The expert in battle moves the enemy, and is not moved by them.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Appear where you are not expected.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Ponder and deliberate before you make a move.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“能而示之不能，不能而示之能。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“知彼知己。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“谋略当如夜色，幽深莫测。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“兵者，诡道也。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“明智的勇士避免不必要的战斗。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“秘诀全在于迷惑敌人。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“避实而击虚。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“进攻乃防守之要。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“善战者，致人而不致于人。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“出其不意。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“动手之前，先深思熟虑。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:sojobo triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"The outcome was never in doubt.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Just as planned.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“胜负从来没有悬念。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“一切尽在计划之中。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:sonja"
msgid "@_Sonja_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Sonja_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Sonja_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Sonja_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_sonja_common_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I'm academy-trained, you know.\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"Too slow!\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ twirls @possessive@ cape.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ bows elegantly.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ plants @possessive@ feet in a plie.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Join me in the dance of death.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“我可是受过学院训练的。”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@大喊道：“太慢了！”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@旋动@possessive@披风。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@优雅地鞠躬。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@站稳@possessive@双脚，屈膝下蹲。\n\n@The_monster@说道：“与我共舞死亡之舞吧。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_sonja_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"Hah! Missed me again!\"\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"The Royal Ballet doesn't accept kobolds. That's why I went into killing people.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"If only old Madame Brzewit could see me now!\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"Some dancing partner you are!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Someone hired me to kill you, but I'm not supposed to say who.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@朝@at_foe@大喊道：“哈！你又没打中我！”\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“皇家芭蕾舞团不收狗头人。所以我才改行杀人。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“要是布热维特老夫人能看见现在的我就好了！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@大喊道：“你这舞伴可真不怎么样！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“有人雇我来杀你，不过我不能说是谁。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:sonja triumphant"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ takes a bow.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ applauds @reflexive@.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Show's over.\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@鞠躬谢幕。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@为@reflexive@鼓掌。\n\n@The_monster@说道：“演出结束。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:sprozz"
msgid "{{\n  if spells.memorised(\"launch clockwork bee\") then\n    return '@_Sprozz_thief_@'\n  else\n    return '@_Sprozz_common_@'\n  end\n}} @player_only@\n"
msgstr "{{\n  if spells.memorised(\"launch clockwork bee\") then\n    return '@_Sprozz_thief_@'\n  else\n    return '@_Sprozz_common_@'\n  end\n}} @player_only@\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_sprozz_thief_"
msgid "@The_monster@ shouts, \"Patent thief! You won\\'t get away with this!\"\n\n@The_monster@ yells, \"I thought of it first! Give it back!\"\n\n@The_monster@ grumbles, \"I\\'ll bet your bee is still using copper gearwork!\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts, \"Who\\'s been selling my blueprints? Tell me!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@大喊道：“专利窃贼！你别想逍遥法外！”\n\n@The_monster@大喊：“是我先想到的！还给我！”\n\n@The_monster@抱怨：“我敢打赌，你的蜜蜂还在用铜制齿轮！”\n\n@The_monster@大喊道：“谁在卖我的蓝图？告诉我！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_sprozz_common_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Allow me to demonstrate the bee of the future!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"It makes honey *and* kills pests. Ingenious!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Clockwork honey contains at least 35% more iron! Nutritious.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Chitin is about to be a thing of the past!\"\n\n@The_monster@ grins. \"Soon, every apiary\\'s gonna want a piece of Sprozz!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I need a test subject for my new stingers. I volunteer you.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Tell me how much this hurts, okay? I need more data.\"\n\n@The_monster@ mumbles, \"Perhaps it could use a bit more zinc in the wings....\"\n\n@The_monster@ mutters, \"Next time I\\'m using spur gears. Less buzzing.\"\n\n@The_monster@ mumbles, \"Pollen collection still 41% less efficient. Must improve.\"\n\n@The_monster@ mumbles, \"Nectar collection still 37% less efficient. Must improve.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“请容我展示未来的蜜蜂！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“既能产蜜，又能杀虫。真是天才之作！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“发条蜂蜜的含铁量至少高出35%！营养丰富。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“甲壳就要成为历史了！”\n\n@The_monster@咧嘴笑道：“很快，每家养蜂场都会争着找斯普罗兹合作！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我的新蜂刺需要一个实验对象。我替你报名了。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“告诉我有多疼，好吗？我还需要更多数据。”\n\n@The_monster@含糊地说道：“也许翅膀里还能多加点锌……”\n\n@The_monster@嘟囔道：“下次我要用直齿轮。嗡嗡声会小些。”\n\n@The_monster@含糊地说道：“采粉效率仍低了41%。必须改进。”\n\n@The_monster@含糊地说道：“采蜜效率仍低了37%。必须改进。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:sprozz triumphant"
msgid "{{\n  if spells.memorised(\"launch clockwork bee\") then\n    return '@The_monster@ shouts, \"I *knew* mine was better!\"'\n  else\n    return '@The_monster@ says, \"Progress like this can\\'t be stopped by anyone!\"'\n  end\n}}\n"
msgstr "{{\n  if spells.memorised(\"launch clockwork bee\") then\n    return '@The_monster@ shouts, \"I *knew* mine was better!\"'\n  else\n    return '@The_monster@ says, \"Progress like this can\\'t be stopped by anyone!\"'\n  end\n}}\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:terence"
msgid "@_Terence_common_@\n\nw:4\n@_Terence_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Terence_common_@\n\nw:4\n@_Terence_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_terence_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ looks scornfully at @foe@.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ bares @possessive@ teeth.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ looks irritated.\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"I fought strong elephant-riders! You're not strong!\"\n\n@The_monster@ looks @foe@ up and down. \"You're not a real warrior! I'll show you a warrior!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I've sent legions of armataurs to their deaths. With their elephants.\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"I hate armataurs! They have no honour!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I retired to this dungeon. Do you want to retire to the afterlife?\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"I'm retired! Go away!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"I want to be left alone!\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@轻蔑地看着@foe@。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@龇出@possessive@牙齿。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@显得很恼火。\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“我跟强悍的象骑兵交过手！你可不强！”\n\n@The_monster@上下打量着@foe@，说道：“你算不上真正的勇士！让你看看什么叫勇士！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“我送过一整支又一整支犰狳人大军去死。连同他们的大象。”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“我恨犰狳人！他们毫无荣誉！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“我退休后来到这座地下城。你也想到来世退休吗？”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“我退休了！滚开！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“我只想一个人清静！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_terence_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Your {{\nif you.race() == \"Armataur\" then\n    return \"tough hide\"\nelse\n    return \"supposed skill\"\nend\n}} won't protect you!\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Where's your {{\nif you.race() == \"Armataur\" then\n    return \"elephant\"\nelse\n    return \"power\"\nend\n}} now?!\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Stand, coward! You want a fight, show some honour!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I'm tired of war. But if you want blood, you'll get blood!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Get out, before I make you get out!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"I hate trespassers!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"I put up a 'Do Not Disturb' sign! Can't you read?!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Your {{\nif you.race() == \"Armataur\" then\n    return \"tough hide\"\nelse\n    return \"supposed skill\"\nend\n}} won't protect you!\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Where's your {{\nif you.race() == \"Armataur\" then\n    return \"elephant\"\nelse\n    return \"power\"\nend\n}} now?!\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“站住，懦夫！想打就拿出点荣誉来！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“我厌倦了战争。不过你要见血，那就让你见血！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“趁我还没赶你，快滚！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“我恨擅闯者！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“我挂了“请勿打扰”的牌子！你不识字吗？！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:terence triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Finally, peace and quiet.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"And stay out!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Win and live. Lose and die. It's the rule of life.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Honour does not prevent me from taking a tactical advantage.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“总算清静了。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“别再回来！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“赢了就活，输了就死。这就是生存法则。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“讲荣誉不妨碍我利用战术优势。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:urug"
msgid "@_Urug_common_@\n\nw:2\n@_Urug_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Urug_common_@\n\nw:2\n@_Urug_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_urug_common_"
msgid "@_generic_orc_speech_@\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ grins evilly.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ adjusts @possessive@ eyepatch.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ stares @at_foe@ with @possessive@ one eyeball.\n\n@The_monster@ roars.\n\n@The_monster@ howls with blood-lust.\n\n@The_monster@ squints and says @to_foe@, \"You're the ugliest harpy I ever saw.\"\n\n@The_monster@ squints and says @to_foe@, \"My one eye mightn't be all that good, but I can see you just fine with it, harpy.\"\n\n@The_monster@ squints and screams @at_foe@, \"A harpy? Time to die, you blasted buzzard!\"\n\n@The_monster@ squints and screams @at_foe@, \"I know a harpy when I see one!\"\n\n@The_monster@ squints, then shrugs and mutters, \"Close enough.\"\n\n@The_monster@ grins and says, \"Time to carve some turkeys.\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Bird-brain!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Prepare for a defeathering!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Revenge!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Die, harpy!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"All you harpies will die!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Payback for my eye!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Damn your eyes!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"I'm goin' to kill you! Now!\"\n"
msgstr "@_generic_orc_speech_@\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@邪恶地咧嘴笑了。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@调整着@possessive@眼罩。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@用@possessive@独眼盯着@at_foe@。\n\n@The_monster@咆哮起来。\n\n@The_monster@嗜血地嚎叫。\n\n@The_monster@眯起眼，对@to_foe@说道：“你是我见过最丑的哈耳庇厄。”\n\n@The_monster@眯起眼，对@to_foe@说道：“我这只独眼也许不太好使，可看清你还是绰绰有余，哈耳庇厄。”\n\n@The_monster@眯起眼，朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“哈耳庇厄？受死吧，你这该死的秃鹫！”\n\n@The_monster@眯起眼，朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“哈耳庇厄我一眼就认得出来！”\n\n@The_monster@眯起眼，随后耸耸肩，嘟囔道：“差不多就行。”\n\n@The_monster@咧嘴笑道：“该切火鸡了。”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“鸟脑袋！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“等着被拔光毛吧！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“报仇！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“受死吧，哈耳庇厄！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“你们这些哈耳庇厄都得死！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“还我那只眼睛的债！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“诅咒你的眼睛！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“我要杀了你！现在！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_urug_rare_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ winks @at_foe@... or blinks.\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"Your bloody kin took my one good eye. Now you die, harpy!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"They call me one-eyed Urug. When I'm done with you they'll have to call you no-head @player_name@.\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"You are already dead.\"\n\n@The_monster@ mutters, \"Sometimes I wonder if they all really are harpies.\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@朝@at_foe@使了个眼色……也可能只是眨了下眼。\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“你那该死的同类夺走了我唯一的好眼睛。现在你得死，哈耳庇厄！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“他们叫我独眼乌鲁格。收拾完你，就得叫你无头@player_name@了。”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫道：“你已经死了。”\n\n@The_monster@嘟囔道：“有时我也怀疑，他们到底是不是真的全是哈耳庇厄。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:urug triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ screams, \"Revenge at last!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"One more harpy dead.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@尖叫道：“终于报仇了！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“又死了一只哈耳庇厄。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:vashnia"
msgid "@_Vashnia_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Vashnia_rare_@\n\nw:5\n@_Vashnia_nonnaga_@\n"
msgstr "@_Vashnia_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Vashnia_rare_@\n\nw:5\n@_Vashnia_nonnaga_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:related vashnia"
msgid "@_Vashnia_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Vashnia_rare_@\n\nw:5\n@_Vashnia_naga_@\n"
msgstr "@_Vashnia_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Vashnia_rare_@\n\nw:5\n@_Vashnia_naga_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_vashnia_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ makes some cryptic hand gestures, then points @at_foe@.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ takes aim @at_foe@.\n\nVISUAL:Space seems to twist oddly around @the_monster@.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ looks @foe@ over, as though planning @possessive@ next attack.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ glares at @possessive@ squad, motioning for silence.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@做了几个隐晦的手势，随后指向@at_foe@。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@瞄准了@at_foe@。\n\nVISUAL:@the_monster@周围的空间似乎在奇异地扭曲。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@打量着@foe@，仿佛在筹划@possessive@下一次攻击。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@瞪着@possessive@小队，示意保持沉默。\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_vashnia_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ mutters @at_foe@, \"Right between the eyes...\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You'll make a fine pincushion.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Hold still for a moment. You're making this shot difficult.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@朝@at_foe@嘟囔道：“正中双眼之间……”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“你会成为一个不错的针垫。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“站着别动一会儿。你让这一箭很难射。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_vashnia_naga_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You are a traitor to our kind!\"\n\n@The_monster@ sneers @at_foe@, \"Heretic!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Swear allegiance to our queen and you may yet be spared!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“你背叛了我们的族类！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@冷笑道：“异端！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“向我们的女王宣誓效忠，也许还能饶你一命！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_vashnia_nonnaga_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Slay the @foe_genus@ at once!\" @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"We do not look kindly on intruders!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says to @possessive@ squad, \"Do not let the @foe_genus@ escape!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“立刻杀死那个@foe_genus@！”@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“我们可不欢迎入侵者！”\n\n@The_monster@对@possessive@小队说道：“别让那个@foe_genus@逃了！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:vashnia triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Headshot.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Intruder eliminated.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"All clear. Let's check for more.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“爆头。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“入侵者已清除。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“一切正常。再检查一下。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:wiglaf"
msgid "@_Wiglaf_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Wiglaf_rare_@\n\n@_Wiglaf_nondwarf_@\n"
msgstr "@_Wiglaf_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Wiglaf_rare_@\n\n@_Wiglaf_nondwarf_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:related wiglaf"
msgid "@_Wiglaf_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Wiglaf_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Wiglaf_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Wiglaf_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_wiglaf_common_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I'll gie ye a proper bath in magma.\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"By thae beards o' ma forefathars, ye wilnae live tae see tha morn'!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I got whit I came for, but wha passes up a proper rammy?\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Ye nae take from a dwarf whit's his!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Hit me lik' ye mean it, ye dafty glaikit!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Och, ye'r asking fur it now.\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ straightens out a crease in @possessive@ hat.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“俺给恁好好洗个岩浆澡。”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@大喊道：“以俺祖宗的胡子发誓，恁活不到明早！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“俺要的东西拿到了，可谁会放过好好干一架的机会？”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“恁休想从矮人手里抢他的东西！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“使劲打俺啊，恁这蠢货！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“哎，恁这是自找的。”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@抚平@possessive@帽子上的一道褶子。\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_wiglaf_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ mutters, \"Wee kobolds think thay ken whit a cannon is.\"\n\n@The_monster@ growls, \"I'll break a bone for every stich ye rip.\"\n\n@The_monster@ mumbles, \"If ye must ken, mah gran stiched it fur me.\"\n\n@The_monster@ sings a few bars of a dwarven mine shanty. Very poorly.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I havnae been down this way for yonks. They've redecorated.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I hear the Orcs make a nippy scran these days.\"\n\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@嘟囔道：“小狗头人还以为自个儿懂什么叫大炮。”\n\n@The_monster@低吼道：“恁扯坏一针，俺就打断恁一根骨头。”\n\n@The_monster@含糊地说道：“非要问的话，这是俺奶奶给俺缝的。”\n\n@The_monster@唱了几句矮人矿工号子。唱得糟透了。\n\n@The_monster@说道：“俺好久没来这边了。他们重新装修过。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“听说如今兽人做的饭挺辣。”\n\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_wiglaf_nondwarf_"
msgid "w:5\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Ye cannae match dwarven artillery.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Have ye nae fought a dwarf before?\"\n"
msgstr "w:5\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“恁比不过矮人的火炮。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说道：“恁以前没跟矮人打过？”\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:xak'krixis"
msgid "@The_monster@ ponders what role @player_genus_plural@ play in the local ecosystem.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I'll be sure to include this battle in my report!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"We all must contribute to the advancement of science.\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @to_foe@, \"You're giving me such wonderful data!\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ furiously scribbles notes with a free limb.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ mandibles click thoughtfully.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"{{\n    if you.skill(\"Alchemy\") >= 10 then\n      return \"Ah, a fellow alchemist! Surely you'll appreciate what I've learned here.\"\n    else\n      return \"Allow me to demonstrate my discoveries.\"\n    end }}\" @player_only@\n\nw:20\n@_Xak'krixis_monster_thoughts_@\n\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@思考着@player_genus_plural@在当地生态系统中扮演什么角色。\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我一定会把这场战斗写进报告！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我们都必须为科学进步作贡献。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@大喊道：“你给了我多么出色的数据！”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@用空着的肢体飞快地记着笔记。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@颚部若有所思地咔嗒作响。\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"{{\n    if you.skill(\"Alchemy\") >= 10 then\n      return \"Ah, a fellow alchemist! Surely you'll appreciate what I've learned here.\"\n    else\n      return \"Allow me to demonstrate my discoveries.\"\n    end }}\" @player_only@\n\nw:20\n@_Xak'krixis_monster_thoughts_@\n\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_xak'krixis_monster_thoughts_"
msgid "@The_monster@ muses, \"Oh, to leap as freely as a jumping spider...\"\n\n@The_monster@ muses, \"Oh, to fly as furtive as a ghost moth...\"\n\n@The_monster@ muses, \"Oh, to shine as brightly as a sun moth...\"\n\n@The_monster@ muses, \"Oh, to be as impervious as an emperor scorpion...\"\n\n@The_monster@ muses, \"Oh, to inspire such passion as a moth of wrath...\"\n\n@The_monster@ grumbles, \"Oh, to ruin all my specimens like a blasted pharaoh ant...\"\n\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@沉吟：“啊，要是能像跳蛛那样自由跳跃……”\n\n@The_monster@沉吟：“啊，要是能像幽灵蛾那样悄然飞行……”\n\n@The_monster@沉吟：“啊，要是能像太阳蛾那样明亮闪耀……”\n\n@The_monster@沉吟：“啊，要是能像帝王蝎那样刀枪不入……”\n\n@The_monster@沉吟：“啊，要是能像愤怒之蛾那样激起热情……”\n\n@The_monster@抱怨：“啊，要是能像该死的法老蚁那样毁掉我的全部标本……”\n\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:xak'krixis triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"I'll be sure to list you as a co-author when my work is published!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“等我的研究发表，一定把你列为合著者！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:xtahua"
msgid "@_Xtahua_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Xtahua_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Xtahua_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Xtahua_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_xtahua_common_"
msgid "@The_monster@ roars horribly.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ glares at @foe@.\n\n@The_monster@ growls @at_foe@, \"YOU BORE ME SO.\"\n\n@The_monster@ roars @at_foe@, \"DIE, PUNY ONE!\"\n\n@The_monster@ roars @at_foe@, \"FACE MY WRATH!\"\n\n@The_monster@ roars @at_foe@, \"COMING HERE WAS YOUR LAST MISTAKE!\"\n\n@The_monster@ roars, \"I'VE KILLED HUNDREDS OF ADVENTURERS!\" @player_only@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@发出骇人的咆哮。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@瞪着@foe@。\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@低吼道：“你真让我无聊透顶。”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@咆哮道：“受死吧，渺小的家伙！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@咆哮道：“承受我的怒火！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@咆哮道：“来这里是你最后一次犯错！”\n\n@The_monster@咆哮：“我杀过成百上千的冒险者！”@player_only@\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_xtahua_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ rumbles @at_foe@, \"YOU'RE BARELY A SNACK.\"\n\n@The_monster@ rumbles @at_foe@, \"YOU LOOK DELICIOUS.\"\n\n@The_monster@ roars @at_foe@, \"I HATE BEING BOTHERED!\"\n\n@The_monster@ roars @at_foe@, \"I HOPE YOU'RE TASTY!\"\n\n@The_monster@ roars, \"BAH! BLOODY ADVENTURERS.\" @player_only@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@朝@at_foe@隆隆低吼道：“你连份点心都算不上。”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@隆隆低吼道：“你看起来很美味。”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@咆哮道：“我讨厌被打扰！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@咆哮道：“希望你足够好吃！”\n\n@The_monster@咆哮：“呸！该死的冒险者。”@player_only@\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:xtahua triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ roars in triumph.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ belches a long, triumphant arc of flame.\n\n@The_monster@ growls, \"COMING HERE WAS YOUR LAST MISTAKE.\"\n\n@The_monster@ rumbles, \"TIME FOR A NIBBLE.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@胜利地咆哮。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@得意地喷出一道长长的弧形火焰。\n\n@The_monster@低吼道：“来这里是你最后一次犯错。”\n\n@The_monster@隆隆低吼：“该吃点心了。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:xtahua riddle"
msgid "@The_monster@ roars at you, \"BIG WORDS FOR SUCH A SMALL MORSEL!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@朝你咆哮道：“这么小一口食物，口气倒不小！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:zenata"
msgid "@_Zenata_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Zenata_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Zenata_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Zenata_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_zenata_common_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ polishes a blade.\n\nStrange mechanisms whir as @the_monster@ focuses on @foe@.\n\nVISUAL:A stray blade cuts @the_monster_possessive@ own flesh. @Subjective@ ignores it.\n\n@The_monster@ howls @at_foe@, \"I'll flense you until there's nothing left!\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"I'll hammer you into slag!\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams, \"I nearly understand... Get out of my way!\"\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@擦亮一片刀刃。\n\n@the_monster@凝神看着@foe@，奇异的机械嗡嗡作响。\n\nVISUAL:一片游离的刀刃割伤了@the_monster_possessive@血肉。@Subjective@毫不在意。\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@嚎叫道：“我要剥光你的皮肉，直到什么也不剩！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@大喊道：“我要把你锤成炉渣！”\n\n@The_monster@尖叫道：“我快明白了……别挡我的路！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_zenata_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Look what I've done to myself! Think you can do worse?\"\n\n@The_monster@ laughs @at_foe@, \"Think you're sharper than me?\"\n\n@The_monster@ scoffs, \"How can you challenge a perfect, immortal machine?\"\n\n@The_monster@ wonders, \"When I cut you open, what secrets will I find?\"\n\n@The_monster@ mutters, \"I can hear her whispering... but she's dead. She's dead!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"I'll bring them back. Then they'll show me... everything...\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“看看我把自己变成了什么样！你觉得你能更狠吗？”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@笑道：“你以为自己比我更锋利？”\n\n@The_monster@讥笑道：“你凭什么挑战一台完美、不朽的机器？”\n\n@The_monster@疑惑地说道：“把你切开之后，我会发现什么秘密？”\n\n@The_monster@嘟囔道：“我能听见她的低语……可她死了。她死了！”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“我会让他们回来。然后他们会向我展示……一切……”\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:zenata triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ says, \"Just more dross for the fire.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Let's see what's inside you.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@说道：“不过是些投进火里的渣滓。”\n\n@The_monster@说道：“看看你里面有什么。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_hostile_orc_beogh_believer_speech_common_"
msgid "@The_monster@ mutters @at_foe@, \"You're NOT the saviour of the Orcs.\"\n\n@The_monster@ grumbles @at_foe@, \"You're not even a proper Orc...\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_orc_says_to_foe_@, \"How could Beogh possibly choose you?\"\n\n@The_monster@ mutters something uncomplimentary.\n\n@The_monster@ @_orc_says_to_foe_@, \"Beogh will surely punish you for your arrogance!\"\n\n@The_monster@ grunts @at_foe@, \"You, the messiah? You don't even look the part!\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_orc_says_to_foe_@, \"The messiah will not be a {{ return you.race() }}!\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_orc_says_to_foe_@, \"The messiah will be a true Orc!\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_shouts_@ @at_foe@, \"Die, @_orc_heathen_@!\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_shouts_@, \"Die, @foe_name@, for besmirching Beogh's name!\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ grimaces.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@朝@at_foe@嘟囔道：“你不是兽人的救世主。”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@抱怨道：“你连个正经兽人都算不上……”\n\n@The_monster@@_orc_says_to_foe_@道：“比欧弗怎么可能选中你？”\n\n@The_monster@嘟囔着不太好听的话。\n\n@The_monster@@_orc_says_to_foe_@道：“比欧弗一定会惩罚你的傲慢！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@哼道：“你，救世主？你看着就不像！”\n\n@The_monster@@_orc_says_to_foe_@道：“救世主绝不会是个{{ return you.race() }}！”\n\n@The_monster@@_orc_says_to_foe_@道：“救世主一定会是真正的兽人！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@@_shouts_@道：“受死吧，@_orc_heathen_@！”\n\n@The_monster@@_shouts_@道：“@foe_name@，你玷污了比欧弗之名，受死吧！”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@做了个鬼脸。\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_hostile_orc_beogh_believer_speech_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ laughs @at_foe@, \"You, our saviour!?\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_shouts_@ @at_foe@, \"Orcs! @foe_name@ is lying!\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_orc_says_to_foe_@, \"For a messiah, you look rather [sorry|pathetic|miserable].\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_orc_says_to_foe_@, \"Your [costumes|disguise|tricks] cannot [fool|deceive] me.\"\n\n@The_monster@ @_orc_says_to_foe_@, \"I wonder, will Beogh raise you from the dead?\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ shakes @possessive@ head.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ stares at you quizzically. @player_only@\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@朝@at_foe@笑道：“你，我们的救主！？”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@@_shouts_@道：“兽人们！@foe_name@在撒谎！”\n\n@The_monster@@_orc_says_to_foe_@道：“身为救世主，你看着未免太[寒酸|可悲|凄惨]了。”\n\n@The_monster@@_orc_says_to_foe_@道：“你的[装束|伪装|把戏]休想[愚弄|欺骗]我。”\n\n@The_monster@@_orc_says_to_foe_@道：“不知道比欧弗会不会让你死而复生？”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@摇了摇@possessive@头。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@疑惑地盯着你。@player_only@\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_orc_says_to_foe_"
msgid "shouts @at_foe@\n\nsays @to_foe@\n\ngrunts @at_foe@\n\nw:5\nsneers @at_foe@\n"
msgstr "朝@at_foe@大喊\n\n对@to_foe@说\n\n朝@at_foe@哼声\n\nw:5\n朝@at_foe@冷笑\n"

#. Reviewed database-24; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_orc_heathen_"
msgid "heathen\n\ninfidel\n\nunbeliever\n\nheretic\n\napostate\n"
msgstr "异教徒\n\n异教徒\n\n不信者\n\n异端\n\n叛教者\n"


#. Single TextDB source; migrated reviewed runtime translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:orb spider charge"
msgid "@The_monster@ spins a strand of pure energy.\n\n@The_monster@ pulsates with a strange energy.\n\n@The_monster@ begins to weave its threads into a brightly glowing ball.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@纺出一缕纯粹的能量。\n\n@The_monster@涌动着奇异的能量。\n\n@The_monster@开始将丝线编织成一个明亮发光的球体。\n"

#. Single TextDB source; migrated reviewed runtime translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_important_subject_"
msgid "w:50\n@_axioms_of_law_@\n\nthe eternal Law.\n\nobedience to the Law.\n\nthe one true way.\n\npurity of body and mind.\n\npreserving your bodily integrity.\n\nkeeping your body clean and pure.\n\nproper care of body and soul.\n\navoiding mutations.\n\njust saying no to mutations.\n\nproper burial practice.\n\nnot dealing with demons.\n\nrejecting the service of demons.\n\nnot transforming your body with [talismans|baubles].\n\nshunning all [talismans|baubles].\n"
msgstr "w:50\n@_axioms_of_law_@\n\n永恒的律法\n\n服从律法\n\n唯一的正道\n\n身心纯洁\n\n保持身体完整\n\n保持身体洁净纯粹\n\n妥善照料身心\n\n避免变异\n\n坚决拒绝变异\n\n正确的安葬仪式\n\n不与恶魔交易\n\n拒绝恶魔的侍奉\n\n不用[护符|小饰物]改变身体\n\n远离一切[护符|小饰物]\n"

#. Single TextDB source; migrated reviewed runtime translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_axioms_of_law_"
msgid "Zin's Axioms of Law.\n\nthe Axioms of Law.\n\nthe books of the Law.\n\nthe sacred Law of Zin.\n"
msgstr "辛的法则公理\n\n法则公理\n\n律法典籍\n\n辛的神圣律法\n"

