#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:alderking"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ beckons and sways in an unseen wind.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ foilage glows and foams.\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"If you're unwilling to [dance|bow], then I'll see you out.\" @player_only@\n\nw:20\n__NONE\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@招手示意，在无形的风中摇曳。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@枝叶泛着光，如泡沫般翻涌。\n\n@The_monster@说：“既然你不愿[起舞|鞠躬]，那就请回吧。”@player_only@\n\nw:20\n__NONE\n"

#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:alderking triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ vanishes in a satisfied sigh of withering leaves.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@在枯叶发出的满足叹息中消失。\n"

#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:bennu"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ plumage briefly flares with an otherworldly flame.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ jubilantly flits about.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@羽毛上短暂地燃起异界火焰。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@欢快地飞来飞去。\n"

#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:bennu killed"
msgid "@_Bennu_death_@\n"
msgstr "@_Bennu_death_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_bennu_death_"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ renews @reflexive@ in a burst of flame!\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@在骤然腾起的火焰中让@reflexive@重获新生！\n"

#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:bennu permanently killed"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@, emptied of spiritual energy, fades out from this realm.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@耗尽了灵魂能量，逐渐从这个世界消逝。\n"

#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:confused bennu killed"
msgid "@Bennu killed@\n"
msgstr "@Bennu killed@\n"

#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:confused bennu permanently killed"
msgid "@Bennu permanently killed@\n"
msgstr "@Bennu permanently killed@\n"

#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:brain worm"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ drips [complex|unknown] stolen formulae onto the @surface@.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ is briefly caught in foreign memories of distant [stars|lands|kingdoms].\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ twitches its length with the pilfered instincts of [wings|pincers|fins].\n\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@将窃取的[复杂|未知]公式滴落在@surface@上。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@短暂地陷入了有关遥远[星辰|土地|王国]的陌生记忆。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@凭借偷来的[翅膀|螯钳|鱼鳍]本能，扭动着长长的身躯。\n\n"

#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:sewer brain worm"
msgid "w:30\n@brain worm@\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ stares [perplexed|with bemusement] at its reflection in a puddle.\n"
msgstr "w:30\n@brain worm@\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@[困惑|茫然]地盯着水洼中自己的倒影。\n"

#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:bullfrog"
msgid "@The_monster@ swells and bulges.\n\n@The_monster@ releases a deep croak.\n\n@The_monster@ snags a nearby @_frog_food_@ with @possessive@ tongue.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@鼓起身体，胀得滚圆。\n\n@The_monster@发出低沉的蛙鸣。\n\n@The_monster@用@possessive@舌头卷住了附近的一只@_frog_food_@。\n"

#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:chaos spawn"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ grows dozens of eye stalks in order to get a better look at @foe@.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ splatters into many small globs of multi-coloured light, then recombines.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ briefly grows a face disturbingly similar to your own.\n\n@The_monster@ ululates chillingly with @possessive@ many mouths.\n\n@The_monster@ gibbers incoherently in a cacophony of voices.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@长出数十根眼柄，以便更清楚地观察@foe@。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@迸散成许多五彩斑斓的小光团，随后重新聚合。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@短暂地长出一张与你极其相似的脸，令人不安。\n\n@The_monster@用@possessive@众多嘴巴发出令人胆寒的长嚎。\n\n@The_monster@用杂乱的声音含糊地胡言乱语。\n"

#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:catoblepas"
msgid "@The_monster@ roars fiercely, eyes lowered.\n\n@The_monster@ stomps with a crash on the @surface@.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ smashes @possessive@ foot into the @surface@.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ rams the @surface@ with @possessive@ head heavily.\n\n@The_monster@ breathes in.\n\n@The_monster@ snuffles in challenge.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@垂着双眼，凶猛地咆哮。\n\n@The_monster@重重地踩踏@surface@，发出一声巨响。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@将@possessive@脚猛砸向@surface@。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@用@possessive@头重重撞击@surface@。\n\n@The_monster@吸了一口气。\n\n@The_monster@喷着鼻息，发出挑衅。\n"

#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:cognitogaunt"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ shines with the incandescence of long-dead nights.\n\nw:20\n@The_monster@ grumbles constantly over the stars not yet being right.\n\n@The_monster@ mumbles about the follies of mortal constellations.\n\n@The_monster@ mutters ill rumours of the current state of the heavens.\n\n@The_monster@ muses over how flesh is wasted on mortals.\n\n@The_monster@ marvels to itself over the thinness of mortal minds.\n\n@The_monster@ mocks the topics of the next astral concord.\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@ writhes with frustration over not yet finding solutions for supernovas.\n\n@The_monster@ growls that the stars belong to nobody but the stars.\n\n@The_monster@ gripes about being made of rot and starlight.\n\n@The_monster@ grouses that life is wasted on the living.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@闪耀着早已消逝的夜晚留下的炽光。\n\nw:20\n@The_monster@不停地抱怨星辰尚未归位。\n\n@The_monster@嘟囔着凡人划分星座的愚蠢之处。\n\n@The_monster@低声散播有关天界现状的不祥传闻。\n\n@The_monster@沉思着，觉得肉体长在凡人身上实在浪费。\n\n@The_monster@暗自惊叹于凡人心智的浅薄。\n\n@The_monster@嘲弄着下一次星界会议的议题。\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@因尚未找到超新星问题的解法而懊恼地扭动。\n\n@The_monster@低吼着说，星辰只属于星辰自身。\n\n@The_monster@抱怨自己由腐烂之物和星光构成。\n\n@The_monster@牢骚满腹，觉得生命赋予活物实在浪费。\n"

#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:silenced cognitogaunt"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ shines with the incandescence of long-dead nights.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@闪耀着早已消逝的夜晚留下的炽光。\n"

#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:friendly cognitogaunt"
msgid "@cognitogaunt@\n"
msgstr "@cognitogaunt@\n"

#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:crystal guardian"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ glitters, immutable and inevitable, in the dim dungeon light.\n\nw:5\nVISUAL:You see your fractured reflection in @the_monster@ contort and writhe. @player_only@\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@在地下城昏暗的光线中闪闪发亮，亘古不变，无可阻挡。\n\nw:5\nVISUAL:你看到自己映在@the_monster@中的破碎倒影扭曲蠕动。@player_only@\n"

#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:death cob"
msgid "w:1\nThe death cob makes a corny joke.\n\nw:1999\n__NONE\n"
msgstr "w:1\n死亡玉米棒讲了个老掉牙的玉米笑话。\n\nw:1999\n__NONE\n"

