#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:default ice statue"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ glitters chillingly in the dim dungeon light.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@在地下城昏暗的光线中闪耀着森冷的光。\n"

#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:kobold blastminer"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ bats away at the thin smoke enveloping @possessive@ cannon.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ cannon shakes and flares with a red glow.\n\nw:20\n__NONE\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@挥手驱散笼罩着@possessive@火炮的薄烟。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@火炮震颤着，迸发出红光。\n\nw:20\n__NONE\n"

#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:killer klown"
msgid "@_Killer_Klown_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Killer_Klown_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_Killer_Klown_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_Killer_Klown_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_killer_klown_common_"
msgid "@The_monster@ giggles crazily.\n\n@The_monster@ laughs merrily.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ beckons to @foe@.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ does a flip.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ does a somersault.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ smiles at @foe@.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ grins with merry abandon.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ pulls ten torches off @possessive@ hat and starts juggling.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ sprays water @at_foe@.\n\n@The_monster@ howls with blood-lust!\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@疯狂地咯咯笑。\n\n@The_monster@开怀大笑。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@朝@foe@招手。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@翻了个跟头。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@翻了个筋斗。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@朝@foe@微笑。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@无拘无束地开心咧笑。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@从@possessive@帽子上取下十支火把，开始耍杂技。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@朝@at_foe@喷水。\n\n@The_monster@嗜血地嚎叫！\n"

#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_killer_klown_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ honks.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ pantomimes @foe_possessive@ execution.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ pokes out @possessive@ tongue.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ grows four more heads, takes them off and juggles!\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ skips for a moment.\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Come and play with me!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says, \"Trust me, I'm a doctor.\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@发出喇叭声。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@用哑剧表演了@foe_possessive@处决过程。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@伸出@possessive@舌头。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@又长出四个脑袋，摘下来抛接杂耍！\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@蹦跳了一会儿。\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“来和我玩吧！”\n\n@The_monster@说：“相信我，我是医生。”\n"

#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:killer klown triumphant"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ begins to take a bow, but slips on a banana peel.\n\n@The_monster@ honks, delighted.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ begins to tie you into a balloon animal.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@正要鞠躬谢幕，却踩着香蕉皮滑了一跤。\n\n@The_monster@欣喜地发出喇叭声。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@开始把你扭成一只气球动物。\n"

#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:laughing skull"
msgid "@The_monster@ @_laughs_@ at the inevitable fate of oblivion.\n\n@The_monster@ @_laughs_@ at how history will forget everyone present.\n\n@The_monster@ @_laughs_@ at the Dungeon's lack of mercy or dignity.\n\n@The_monster@ @_laughs_@ at the inescapable nature of violence.\n\n__NONE\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@为无可避免的湮灭命运而@_laughs_@。\n\n@The_monster@为历史终将遗忘在场的每一个人而@_laughs_@。\n\n@The_monster@为地下城毫无仁慈或尊严而@_laughs_@。\n\n@The_monster@为暴力无处可逃的本质而@_laughs_@。\n\n__NONE\n"

#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:friendly laughing skull"
msgid "@laughing skull@\n\n__NONE\n"
msgstr "@laughing skull@\n\n__NONE\n"

#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:laughing skull triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ crumbles to pieces from sheer joy.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@欣喜若狂，碎成了一地残片。\n"

#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:moth of wrath"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ angrily waves @possessive@ antennae.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@愤怒地挥动@possessive@触角。\n"

#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:obsidian bat"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ flits into the dungeon's darkness for a moment.\n\nw:40\n__NONE\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@短暂地飞入地下城的黑暗之中。\n\nw:40\n__NONE\n"

#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:default obsidian statue"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ slips into the dungeon's darkness for a moment.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@短暂地隐入地下城的黑暗之中。\n"

#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:default orange crystal statue"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ glitters topaz in the dim dungeon light.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@在地下城昏暗的光线中闪耀着黄玉般的光泽。\n"

#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:default hoarfrost cannon"
msgid "VISUAL:Water drips from @the_monster_possessive@ barrel.\n\nVISUAL:A cold fog rises from @the_monster@.\n\n@The_monster@ makes a faint grinding noise.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:水从@the_monster_possessive@炮管上滴落。\n\nVISUAL:一股寒雾从@the_monster@中升起。\n\n@The_monster@发出轻微的研磨声。\n"

#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:protean progenitor"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ form [briefly |][ripples|wavers] with deep exhaustion.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@ [three nested|six fanged|nine smoking] eyes blink slowly.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ [glitters|crackles], [sighs|grumbles], and [beckons|stomps].\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ unfurls and squashes hidden [antennae|spinnerets|pseudopods].\n\nw:20\n__NONE\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@身形因极度疲惫而[短暂地|][泛起波纹|摇晃不定]。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster_possessive@[三只层层嵌套的|六只长着獠牙的|九只冒着烟的]眼睛缓缓眨动。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@[闪闪发光|噼啪作响]，[叹着气|抱怨着]，又[招手示意|跺着脚]。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@伸展又压扁了隐藏的[触角|吐丝器|伪足]。\n\nw:20\n__NONE\n"

#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:friendly protean progenitor"
msgid "@protean progenitor@\n\nw:30\n__NONE\n"
msgstr "@protean progenitor@\n\nw:30\n__NONE\n"

#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:raven"
msgid "w:100\n__NONE\n\nw:2\n@The_monster@ caws, \"Nevermore!\"\n"
msgstr "w:100\n__NONE\n\nw:2\n@The_monster@哑声叫道：“永不复焉！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:reaper"
msgid "@The_monster@ whispers, \"Time's up, @foe_name@!\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ beckons to @foe@.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ smiles without lips.\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"I have come for you, @foe_name@!\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"Death awaits you!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Everyone has to die sometime, and your time is now.\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ draws a finger across @possessive@ throat.\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"You must die NOW!\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"Die, @foe_name@!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@低语道：“时间到了，@foe_name@！”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@朝@foe@招手。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@用没有嘴唇的嘴露出微笑。\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@喊道：“我来找你了，@foe_name@！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@喊道：“死亡在等着你！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“每个人终有一死，而你就在此刻。”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@用一根手指划过@possessive@喉咙。\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@喊道：“你现在就得死！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@喊道：“去死吧，@foe_name@！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-25–27; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:silenced silent spectre"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ gestures at you to be quiet.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ flutters as if in a wind.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ stares at you with @possessive@ ghostly eyes.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ fades in and out of visibility.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ flickers into the darkness.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ grins at you slowly.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@向你打手势，示意你安静。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@飘动着，仿佛有风吹拂。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@用@possessive@幽灵般的双眼盯着你。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@时隐时现。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@闪身隐入黑暗。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@缓缓向你咧嘴一笑。\n"

#. Reviewed database-28–30; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:thermic dynamo"
msgid "VISUAL:@The_monster@ revs up and whimsically whirls.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ hisses and glimmers.\n"
msgstr "VISUAL:@The_monster@加速运转，随性地旋转起来。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@嘶嘶作响，闪烁着微光。\n"

#. Reviewed database-28–30; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:tormentor"
msgid "w:1\n@_demon_taunt_@\n\nw:9\n@_tormentor_@\n"
msgstr "w:1\n@_demon_taunt_@\n\nw:9\n@_tormentor_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-28–30; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_tormentor_"
msgid "@_tormentor_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_tormentor_rare_@\n"
msgstr "@_tormentor_common_@\n\nw:5\n@_tormentor_rare_@\n"

#. Reviewed database-28–30; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_tormentor_common_"
msgid "w:15\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I'll crush your bones, one by one.\"\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ grins evilly.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ grins madly.\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@ grins malevolently.\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I will show you what pain is.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"You will wish to die when I get to you.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I know your fate. It's pain.\"\n\n@The_monster@ screams @at_foe@, \"You will die horribly!\"\n"
msgstr "w:15\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“我要一根一根地碾碎你的骨头。”\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@邪恶地咧嘴一笑。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@疯狂地咧嘴一笑。\n\nVISUAL:@The_monster@恶毒地咧嘴一笑。\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“我会让你见识什么叫痛苦。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“等我抓到你，你就会求死了。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“我知道你的命运。那就是痛苦。”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@尖叫：“你会死得很惨！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-28–30; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_tormentor_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ laughs crazily.\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I am all your nightmares come true.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I will drown you in your own blood.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I will eat your liver.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I know a thousand and one ways to kill you.\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"I'll show you my torture chamber!\"\n\n@The_monster@ says @to_foe@, \"Get ready! Throes of agony await you.\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"Prepare for my thousand needles of pain!\"\n\n@The_monster@ shouts @at_foe@, \"I'll tear you apart!\"\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@疯狂地大笑。\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“我就是你所有噩梦的化身。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“我要让你溺死在自己的鲜血中。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“我要吃掉你的肝脏。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“我知道一千零一种杀死你的方法。”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“我要带你参观我的刑讯室！”\n\n@The_monster@对@to_foe@说：“准备好吧！痛苦的煎熬在等着你。”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@喊道：“准备尝尝我的千针酷刑吧！”\n\n@The_monster@朝@at_foe@喊道：“我要把你撕成碎片！”\n"

#. Reviewed database-28–30; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:weeping skull"
msgid "w:7\n@_weeping_skull_common_@\n\nw:1\n@_weeping_skull_rare_@\n\nw:3\n__NONE\n"
msgstr "w:7\n@_weeping_skull_common_@\n\nw:1\n@_weeping_skull_rare_@\n\nw:3\n__NONE\n"

#. Reviewed database-28–30; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_weeping_skull_common_"
msgid "@The_monster@ @_weeps_@ for your inevitable fate. @player_only@\n\n@The_monster@ @_weeps_@ at its own [deplorable|decrepit] state.\n\n@The_monster@ grieves for the multitudes of fallen [empires|civilisations].\n\n@The_monster@ begs for proper burials for the Dungeon's restless dead.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@为你无可避免的命运而@_weeps_@。@player_only@\n\n@The_monster@为自己[可悲|衰朽]的处境而@_weeps_@。\n\n@The_monster@为无数覆灭的[帝国|文明]哀悼。\n\n@The_monster@恳求有人妥善安葬地下城中不得安息的死者。\n"

#. Reviewed database-28–30; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_weeping_skull_rare_"
msgid "@The_monster@ @_weeps_@ over the unstoppable march of time and entropy.\n\n@The_monster@ asks how much longer can this world bear the weight of past lives.\n\nw:5\n@The_monster@ mourns the many lost in the orcish exodus to the Dungeon.\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@ weeps.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@为时间与熵不可阻挡的前进而@_weeps_@。\n\n@The_monster@问道，这个世界还能承受过往生命的重负多久。\n\nw:5\n@The_monster@哀悼兽人迁往地下城途中丧生的众多同胞。\n\nw:1\n@The_monster@哭泣。\n"

#. Reviewed database-28–30; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:weeping skull triumphant"
msgid "@The_monster@ crumbles to pieces from sheer guilt.\n"
msgstr "@The_monster@因极度内疚而碎成了一地残片。\n"

#. Reviewed database-28–30; glossary checked before translation.
msgctxt "textdb:database/monspeak.txt:_weeps_"
msgid "moans\n\nwails\n\nsobs\n"
msgstr "呻吟\n\n哀号\n\n啜泣\n"

